"   <td></td>\r\n"
"   <td></td>\r\n"
"   <td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.StateGraph.Interfaces\">Modelica.StateGraph.Interfaces</a>\r\n"
"     <br>Step_in, Step_out, Transition_in, Transition_out</td>\r\n"
"   <td><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/StateGraphPorts.png\"></td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在所有领域中，通常定义2个连接器。\r\n"
"变量声明是<strong>相同的</strong>，只是图标不同，以便于区分附加在同一组件上的属于同一领域的连接器。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>分层连接器</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Modelica还支持分层连接器，类似于分层模型。因此，用户可以将基础连接器组合在一起。\r\n"
"例如，一个由两个电气引脚组成的电气插头可以定义为：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>connector</strong> Plug\r\n"
"   <strong>import</strong> Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces;\r\n"
"   Interfaces.PositivePin phase;\r\n"
"   Interfaces.NegativePin ground;\r\n"
"<strong>end</strong> Plug;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过一个方程connect(..)方程，可以连接两个插头(因此隐式地连接了相位和接地引脚)，\r\n"
"或者可以将一个引脚连接器直接连接到插头连接器的相位和接地，例如：\"connect(resistor.p, plug.phase)\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4 id=\"ConnectorEquations\">连接器方程</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"上述列出的连接器变量基本上是通过以下策略来确定的：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> 陈述特定物理领域中体积的相关平衡方程和边界条件。</li>\r\n"
"<li> \r\n"
"     Simplify the balance equations and boundary conditions\r\n"
"     of (1) by taking the\r\n"
"     limit of an infinitesimal small volume\r\n"
"     (e.g., thermal domain:\r\n"
"      temperatures are identical and heat flow rates\r\n"
"      sum up to zero).\r\n"
"</li>\r\n"
"<li> Use the variables needed for the balance equations\r\n"
"     and boundary conditions of (2)\r\n"
"     in the connector and select appropriate Modelica\r\n"
"     <strong>prefixes</strong>, so that these equations\r\n"
"     are generated by the Modelica connection semantics.\r\n"
"</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"以下是一个例子，说明Modelica连接语义的生成过程：\r\n"
"三个连接器c1, c2, c3定义如下：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>connector</strong> Demo\r\n"
"  Real        p;  // potential variable\r\n"
"  <strong>flow</strong>   Real f;  // flow variable\r\n"
"  <strong>stream</strong> Real s;  // stream variable\r\n"
"<strong>end</strong> Demo;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"将它们连接在一起\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>connect</strong>(c1,c2);\r\n"
"<strong>connect</strong>(c1,c3);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这将生成以下方程：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// Potential variables are identical\r\n"
"c1.p = c2.p;\r\n"
"c1.p = c3.p;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"// The sum of the flow variables is zero\r\n"
"0 = c1.f + c2.f + c3.f;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"/* The sum of the product of flow variables and upstream stream variables is zero\r\n"
"   (this implicit set of equations is explicitly solved when generating code;\r\n"
"   the \"&lt;undefined&gt;\" parts are defined in such a way that\r\n"
"   inStream(..) is continuous).\r\n"
"*/\r\n"
"0 = c1.f*(<strong>if</strong> c1.f > 0 <strong>then</strong> s_mix <strong>else</strong> c1.s) +\r\n"
"    c2.f*(<strong>if</strong> c2.f > 0 <strong>then</strong> s_mix <strong>else</strong> c2.s) +\r\n"
"    c3.f*(<strong>if</strong> c3.f > 0 <strong>then</strong> s_mix <strong>else</strong> c3.s);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<strong>inStream</strong>(c1.s) = <strong>if</strong> c1.f > 0 <strong>then</strong> s_mix <strong>else</strong> &lt;undefined&gt;;\r\n"
"<strong>inStream</strong>(c2.s) = <strong>if</strong> c2.f > 0 <strong>then</strong> s_mix <strong>else</strong> &lt;undefined&gt;;\r\n"
"<strong>inStream</strong>(c3.s) = <strong>if</strong> c3.f > 0 <strong>then</strong> s_mix <strong>else</strong> &lt;undefined&gt;;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions"
msgid "Conventions"
msgstr "约定"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>A Modelica main package should be compliant with the UsersGuide stated in this documentation:</p>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> Conventions of the <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.ModelicaCode\">Modelica code</a></li>\r\n"
"<li> Consistent <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation\">HTML documentation</a></li>\r\n"
"<li> Structure to be provided by a main package\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"     <li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.UsersGuide\">User's Guide</a></li>\r\n"
"     <li> <strong>Examples</strong> containing models demonstrating the usage of the library.</li>\r\n"
"     <li> <strong>Components</strong> -- in case of a complex library a more detailed structure can be established.</li>\r\n"
"     <li> <strong>Sensors</strong></li>\r\n"
"     <li> <strong>Sources</strong></li>\r\n"
"     <li> <strong>Interfaces</strong> containing connectors and simple partial interface models.</li>\r\n"
"     <li> <strong>BaseClasses</strong> containing partial models with physical equations other than trivial and balance equations.</li>\r\n"
"     <li> <strong>Types</strong> containing type, enumeration and choice definitions.</li>\r\n"
"</ul></li>\r\n"
"<li> These packages should appear in the listed order.</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Modelica 主软件包应符合本文档的用户指南：</p>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.ModelicaCode\">Modelica code</a>的约定</li>\r\n"
"<li> 一致的<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation\">HTML documentation</a></li>\r\n"
"<li> 主包采用的结构\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.UsersGuide\">用户指南</a></li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>示例</strong>包含演示库用法的模型。</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>组件</strong> -- 如果是复杂的库，可以建立更详细的结构。</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>传感器</strong></li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>源</strong></li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>接口</strong>包含连接器和简单的部分接口模型。</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>基础类</strong>包含除微分方程和平衡方程之外的物理方程的局部模型。</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>类型</strong>包含类型、枚举和选择定义。</li>\r\n"
"</ul></li>\r\n"
"<li> 这些软件包应按所列顺序排列。</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation"
msgid "HTML documentation"
msgstr "HTML文档"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://www.w3c.org/\">HTML</a> documentation of Modelica classes.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"  <p>\r\n"
"Modelica类的 <a href=\"http://www.w3c.org/\">HTML</a> 文档。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format"
msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In this section the format UsersGuide of the HTML documentation are specified.\r\n"
"The <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Structure\">structure</a> of the documentation is specified separately.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Paragraphs</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> In each section the paragraphs should start with <code>&lt;p&gt;</code>\r\n"
"     and terminate with <code>&lt;/p&gt;</code>.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Do not write plain text without putting it in a paragraph.</li>\r\n"
"<li> No artificial line breaks <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> should be added within text paragraphs if possible.\r\n"
"     Use separate paragraphs instead.</li>\r\n"
"<li> After a colon (:) continue with capital letter if new sentence starts;\r\n"
"     for text fragments continue with lower case letter</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Emphasis</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> For setting text in <strong>strong font</strong> (normally interpreted as <strong>boldface</strong>) the tags <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code> have to be used.</li>\r\n"
"<li> For <em>emphasizing</em> text fragments <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code> has to be used.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Modelica terms such as expandable bus, array, etc. should not be emphasized anyhow.</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Capitalization of Text</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> Table headers and entries should start with capital letters</li>\r\n"
"<li> Table entries should start with lower case letter if only text fragments are used.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Table and figure captions start with a capital letter</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"本节规定了HTML文档的用户指南格式。\r\n"
"文档的<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Structure\">结构</a>是单独指定的。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>段落</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> 在每个部分中，段落应该以<code>&lt;p&gt;</code>开头，\r\n"
"     并以<code>&lt;/p&gt;</code>结束。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 不要写纯文本而不放在段落中。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 不要在文本段落中添加人为的换行<code>&lt;br&gt;</code>。\r\n"
"     请使用单独的段落。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 冒号(:)之后，如果新句子开始，则用大写字母；\r\n"
"     对于文本片段，用小写字母继续。</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>强调</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> 要将文本设置为<strong>加强字体</strong>(通常被解释为<strong>粗体</strong>)，必须使用标签<code>&lt;strong&gt;</code>和<code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 对于<em>强调</em>文本片段，必须使用<code>&lt;em&gt;</code>和<code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>。</li>\r\n"
"<li> Modelica术语，如可扩展总线、数组等，无论如何都不应该强调。</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>文本的大写</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> 表头和表项应以大写字母开头。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 如果只使用文本片段，则表项应以小写字母开头。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 表格和图表的标题以大写字母开头。</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.Cases"
msgid "Cases"
msgstr "案例"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.Cases"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>In the Modelica documentation sometimes different cases have to be distinguished. If the case distinction refers to Modelica parameters or variables (Boolean expressions) the comparisons should be written in the style of Modelica code within <code>&lt;code&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/code&gt;</code>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Examples</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 1</h5>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<code>&lt;p&gt;If &lt;code&gt;useCage == true&lt;/code&gt;, a damper cage is considered in the model...&lt;/p&gt;</code>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>appears as</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>If <code>useCage == true</code>, a damper cage is considered in the model...</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For more complex case scenarios, an unordered list should be used. In this case only Modelica specific code segments and Boolean expressions.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 2</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;ul&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;li&gt; If &lt;code&gt;useCage == true&lt;/code&gt;, a damper cage is considered in the model.\r\n"
"       Cage parameters must be specified in this case.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;li&gt; If &lt;code&gt;useCage == false&lt;/code&gt;, the damper cage is omitted.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>appears as</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"  <li> If <code>useCage == true</code>, a damper cage is considered in the model.\r\n"
"       Cage parameters must be specified in this case.</li>\r\n"
"  <li> If <code>useCage == false</code>, the damper cage is omitted.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In a more equation oriented case, additional equations or code segments can be added.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 3</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;ul&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;li&gt;if &lt;code&gt;usePolar == true&lt;/code&gt;, assign magnitude and angle to output &lt;br&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;!-- insert graphical representation of equations --&gt;\r\n"
"  y[i,1] = sqrt( a[i]^2 + b[i]^2 ) &lt;br&gt;\r\n"
"  y[i,2] = atan2( b[i], a[i] )\r\n"
"  &lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;li&gt;if &lt;code&gt;usePolar == false&lt;/code&gt;, assign cosine and sine to output &lt;br&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;!-- insert graphical representation of equations --&gt;\r\n"
"  y[i,1] = a[i] &lt;br&gt;\r\n"
"  y[i,2] = b[i]\r\n"
"  &lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>appears as</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"  <li>if <code>usePolar == true</code>, assign magnitude and angle to output<br>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"  <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Cases/y_i1_polar.png\"\r\n"
"       alt=\"y[i,1] = sqrt( a[i]^2 + b[i]^2 )\"><br>\r\n"
"  <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Cases/y_i2_polar.png\"\r\n"
"       alt=\"y[i,2] = atan2( b[i], a[i] )\">\r\n"
"  </li>\r\n"
"  <li>if <code>usePolar == false</code>, assign cosine and sine to output<br>\r\n"
"  <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Cases/y_i1_rect.png\"\r\n"
"       alt=\"y[i,1] = a[i]\"><br>\r\n"
"  <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Cases/y_i2_rect.png\"\r\n"
"       alt=\" y[i,2] = b[i]\">\r\n"
"  </li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"在Modelica文档中，有时必须区分不同的情况。如果大小写区分涉及Modelica参数或变量(布尔表达式)，则应在<code>&lt;code&gt;</code>和<code>&lt;/code&gt;内按照Modelica代码的风格进行比较;</code>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4><h5>示例 1</h5><p>\r\n"
"<code>&lt;p&gt;If &lt;code&gt;useCage == true&lt;/code&gt;, a damper cage is considered in the model...&lt;/p&gt;</code>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"显示为\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">如果 </span><code>useCage == true</code><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">，则模型中考虑了阻尼笼。在这种情况下，必须指定笼的参数。</span>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"对于更复杂的情况，应该使用无序列表。在这种情况下，只有Modelica特定的代码段和布尔表达式.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h5>示例 2</h5><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >&lt;ul&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;li&gt; If &lt;code&gt;useCage == true&lt;/code&gt;, a damper cage is considered in the model.\r\n"
"Cage parameters must be specified in this case.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;li&gt; If &lt;code&gt;useCage == false&lt;/code&gt;, the damper cage is omitted.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"显示为\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"如果<code>useCage == true</code>，则在模型中考虑阻尼笼。 在这种情况下，必须指定保持架参数.</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"如果<code>useCage == false</code>，则省略阻尼笼.</li>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在更面向方程的情况下，可以添加额外的方程或代码段.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h5>示例 3</h5><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >&lt;ul&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;li&gt;if &lt;code&gt;usePolar == true&lt;/code&gt;, assign magnitude and angle to output &lt;br&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;!-- insert graphical representation of equations --&gt;\r\n"
"y[i,1] = sqrt( a[i]^2 + b[i]^2 ) &lt;br&gt;\r\n"
"y[i,2] = atan2( b[i], a[i] )\r\n"
"&lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;li&gt;if &lt;code&gt;usePolar == false&lt;/code&gt;, assign cosine and sine to output &lt;br&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;!-- insert graphical representation of equations --&gt;\r\n"
"y[i,1] = a[i] &lt;br&gt;\r\n"
"y[i,2] = b[i]\r\n"
"&lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"显示为\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"如果<code>usePolar == true</code>，则指定输出的幅度和角度<br> <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Cases/y_i1_polar.png\" alt=\"y[i,1] = sqrt( a[i]^2 + b[i]^2 )\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><br> <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Cases/y_i2_polar.png\" alt=\"y[i,2] = atan2( b[i], a[i] )\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"如果<code>usePolar == false</code>，将余弦和正弦赋值到输出<br> <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Cases/y_i1_rect.png\" alt=\"y[i,1] = a[i]\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><br> <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Cases/y_i2_rect.png\" alt=\" y[i,2] = b[i]\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></li>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.Code"
msgid "Code"
msgstr "代码"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.Code"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.ModelicaCode\">Modelica code</a> conventions of class and instance names,\r\n"
"parameters and variables are specified separately. In this section it is summarized how to refer to\r\n"
"Modelica code in the HTML documentation.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> For constants, parameters and variables in code segments <code>&lt;code&gt;</code>\r\n"
"     and <code>&lt;/code&gt;</code> should to be used, e.g.,<br>\r\n"
"     <code><strong>parameter</strong> Modelica.Units.SI.Time tStart &quot;Start time&quot;</code></li>\r\n"
"<li> Write multi or single line code segments as quoted preformatted text, i.e., embedded within\r\n"
"     <code>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;pre&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</code> tags.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Multi line or single line code shall not be additionally indented.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Inline code segments may be typeset with <code>&lt;code&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/code&gt;</code>.</li>\r\n"
"<li> In code segments use bold to emphasize Modelica keywords.</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Examples</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 1</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;pre&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;strong&gt;connector&lt;/strong&gt; Frame\r\n"
"   ...\r\n"
"   &lt;strong&gt;flow&lt;/strong&gt; SI.Force f[3] &lt;strong&gt;annotation&lt;/strong&gt;(unassignedMessage=&quot;...&quot;);\r\n"
"&lt;strong&gt;end&lt;/strong&gt; Frame;\r\n"
"&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>appears as</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>connector</strong> Frame\r\n"
"   ...\r\n"
"   <strong>flow</strong> SI.Force f[3] <strong>annotation</strong>(unassignedMessage=&quot;...&quot;);\r\n"
"<strong>end</strong> Frame;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 2</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;pre&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;strong&gt;parameter&lt;/strong&gt; Modelica.Units.SI.Conductance G=1 &quot;Conductance&quot;;\r\n"
"&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>appears as</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>parameter</strong> Modelica.Units.SI.Conductance G=1 &quot;Conductance&quot;;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.ModelicaCode\">Modelica code</a> 类和实例名的约定；\r\n"
"参数和变量是分开指定的。在本节中总结了如何参考\r\n"
"HTML文档中的Modelica代码。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> 对于代码段中的常量、参数和变量<code>&lt;code&gt;</code>\r\n"
"和<code>&lt;/code&gt;</code>应该使用，例如，<br>\r\n"
"<code><strong>parameter</strong> Modelica.Units.SI.Time tStart &quot;Start time&quot;</code></li>\r\n"
"<li> 编写多行或单行代码段作为引用的预格式化文本，即嵌入在\r\n"
"<code>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;pre&gt;</code>和<code>&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</code>标签。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 多行或单行代码不得额外缩进。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 内联代码段可以用<code>&lt;code&gt;</code>和<code>&lt;/code&gt;</code>进行排版。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 在代码段中，使用粗体强调Modelica关键字。</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>示例 1</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;pre&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;strong&gt;connector&lt;/strong&gt; Frame\r\n"
"...\r\n"
"&lt;strong&gt;flow&lt;/strong&gt; SI.Force f[3] &lt;strong&gt;annotation&lt;/strong&gt;(unassignedMessage=&quot;...&quot;);\r\n"
"&lt;strong&gt;end&lt;/strong&gt; Frame;\r\n"
"&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>显示为</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>connector</strong> Frame\r\n"
"...\r\n"
"<strong>flow</strong> SI.Force f[3] <strong>annotation</strong>(unassignedMessage=&quot;...&quot;);\r\n"
"<strong>end</strong> Frame;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>示例 2</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;pre&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;strong&gt;parameter&lt;/strong&gt; Modelica.Units.SI.Conductance G=1 &quot;Conductance&quot;;\r\n"
"&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>显示为</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>parameter</strong> Modelica.Units.SI.Conductance G=1 &quot;Conductance&quot;;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.Equations"
msgid "Equations"
msgstr "方程"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.Equations"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In the context of <a href=\"http://www.w3c.org/\">HTML</a> documentation\r\n"
"equations should have a graphical representation in PNG format. For that purpose tool\r\n"
"specific math typing capabilities can be used. Alternatively the LaTeX to HTML translator\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://www.latex2html.org\">LaTeX2HTML</a>, or the\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://www.homeschoolmath.net/worksheets/equation_editor.php\">Online Equation Editor</a>\r\n"
"or <a href=\"http://www.codecogs.com/latex/eqneditor.php\">codecogs</a> can be used.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A typical equation, e.g., of a Fourier synthesis, could look like<br>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Equations/fourier.png\"><br>\r\n"
"or<br>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Equations/sample.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"y=a_1+a_2\"><br>\r\n"
"In an <code>alt</code> tag the original equation should be stored, e.g.,</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;img\r\n"
"&nbsp;src=&quot;modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Equations/sample.png&quot;\r\n"
"&nbsp;alt=&quot;y=a_1+a_2&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If one wants to refer to particular variables and parameters in the documentation text, either a\r\n"
"graphical representation (PNG file) or italic fonts for regular physical symbols and lower case\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/sgml/entities.html\">Greek letters</a>\r\n"
"should be used. Full word variables and full word indices should be spelled within\r\n"
"<code>&lt;code&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/code&gt;</code>.\r\n"
"Vector and array indices should be typeset as subscripts using the\r\n"
"<code>&lt;sub&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/sub&gt;</code> tags.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p> Examples for such variables and parameters are:\r\n"
"<em>&phi;</em>, <em>&phi;</em><sub>ref</sub>, <em>v<sub>2</sub></em>, <code>useDamperCage</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Numbered equations</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>For numbering equations a one row table with two columns should be used. The equation number should be placed in the right column:</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;10&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;td&gt;&lt;img\r\n"
"    src=&quot;modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Equations/sample.png&quot;\r\n"
"    alt=&quot;y=a_1+a_2&quot;&gt; &lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;td&gt;(1)&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>appears as:</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td><img\r\n"
"         src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Equations/sample.png\"\r\n"
"         alt=\"y=a_1+a_2\"></td>\r\n"
"    <td>(1)</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在<a href=\"http://www.w3c.org/\">HTML</a>文档的上下文中\r\n"
"方程式应该有PNG格式的图形表示。为了这个目的，工具\r\n"
"可以使用特定的数学类型功能。或者是LaTeX到HTML的转换器\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://www.latex2html.org\">LaTeX2HTML</a>，或\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://www.homeschoolmath.net/worksheets/equation_editor.php\">Online Equation Editor</a>\r\n"
"或者可以使用<a href=\"http://www.codecogs.com/latex/eqneditor.php\">codecogs</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一个典型的方程，例如，傅里叶合成，可能是这样的<br>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
"src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Equations/fourier.png\"><br>\r\n"
"或<br>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
"src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Equations/sample.png\"\r\n"
"alt=\"y=a_1+a_2\"><br>\r\n"
"在<code>alt</code>标签中，应该存储原始方程，例如:,</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;img\r\n"
"&nbsp;src=&quot;modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Equations/sample.png&quot;\r\n"
"&nbsp;alt=&quot;y=a_1+a_2&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果要在文档文本中引用特定的变量和参数，可以使用\r\n"
"图形表示(PNG文件)或斜体字体用于常规物理符号和小写字母\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/sgml/entities.html\">Greek letters</a>\r\n"
"应该使用。完整的单词变量和完整的单词索引应该在里面拼写\r\n"
"<code>&lt;code&gt;</code>和<code>&lt;/code&gt;</code>。\r\n"
"类型将向量和数组下标设置为下标\r\n"
"<code>&lt;sub&gt;</code>和<code>&lt;/sub&gt;</code>标记。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p> 这些变量和参数的例子如下:\r\n"
"<em>&phi;</em>, <em>&phi;</em><sub>ref</sub>, <em>v<sub>2</sub></em>, <code>useDamperCage</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>编号的方程</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>对于编号方程，应该使用带有两列的单行表。方程号应放在右边一栏:</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;10&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;td&gt;&lt;img\r\n"
"src=&quot;modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Equations/sample.png&quot;\r\n"
"alt=&quot;y=a_1+a_2&quot;&gt; &lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;td&gt;(1)&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>显示为:</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><img\r\n"
"src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Conventions/Documentation/Format/Equations/sample.png\"\r\n"
"alt=\"y=a_1+a_2\"></td>\r\n"
"<td>(1)</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.Figures"
msgid "Figures"
msgstr "图片"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.Figures"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Figures should in particular be included to examples to discuss the problems and results of the respective model. The library developers are yet encouraged to add figures to the documentation of other components to support the understanding of the users of the library.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> Figures have to be placed <strong>outside</strong> of paragraphs to be HTML compliant.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Figures need to have <strong>at least</strong> a <code>src</code> and an <code>alt</code> attribute defined to be HTML compliant.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Technical figures should be placed within a table environment. Each technical figure should then also have a caption. The figure caption starts with a capital letter.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Illustration can be embedded without table environment.</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Location of files</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The <code>PNG</code> files should be placed in a folder which exactly represents the package structure.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Examples</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 1</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>This example shows how an illustration should be embedded in the Example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.PID_Controller\">PID_Controller</a> of the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks\">Blocks</a> package.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;img src=&quot;modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/PID_controller.png&quot;\r\n"
"     alt=&quot;PID_controller.png&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 2</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>This is a simple example of a technical figure with caption.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;caption align=&quot;bottom&quot;&gt;Caption starts with a capital letter&lt;/caption&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;td&gt;\r\n"
"      &lt;img src=&quot;modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/PID_controller.png&quot;\r\n"
"           alt=&quot;PID_controller.png&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 3</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>To refer to a certain figure, a figure number may be added. In such case the figure name (Fig.) including the figure enumeration (1,2,...) have to be displayed bold using <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p>\r\n"
"<p>The figure name and enumeration should look like this: <strong>Fig. 1:</strong></p>\r\n"
"<p>Figures have to be enumerated manually.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;caption align=&quot;bottom&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fig. 2:&lt;/strong&gt; Caption starts with a capital letter&lt;/caption&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;td&gt;\r\n"
"      &lt;img src=&quot;modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/PID_controller.png&quot;\r\n"
"           alt=&quot;PID_controller.png&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"图形应特别用于示例，以讨论各自模型的问题和结果。库的开发者仍然鼓励在其他组件的文档中添加图形，以帮助用户理解该库。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> 图形必须放置在段落<strong>之外</strong>，以符合HTML规范。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 图形必须<strong>至少</strong>定义<code>src</code>和<code>alt</code>属性，以符合HTML规范。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 技术图形应放置在表格环境中。每个技术图形还应有一个标题。图形标题应以大写字母开头。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 插图可以在没有表格环境的情况下嵌入。</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>文件的位置</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<code>PNG</code>文件应该放置在一个文件夹中，该文件夹的结构应与包结构完全一致。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>示例1</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>这个示例展示了如何将插图嵌入到\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks\">Blocks</a> 包的示例<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.PID_Controller\">PID_Controller</a>中。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;img src=&quot;modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/PID_controller.png&quot;\r\n"
"     alt=&quot;PID_controller.png&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>示例2</h5>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个带有图注的技术图形的简单示例。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;caption align=&quot;bottom&quot;&gt;Caption starts with a capital letter&lt;/caption&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;td&gt;\r\n"
"      &lt;img src=&quot;modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/PID_controller.png&quot;\r\n"
"           alt=&quot;PID_controller.png&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>示例3</h5>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"要引用某个图形时，可以添加图形编号。\r\n"
"在这种情况下，图形名称(Fig.)以及图形编号(1, 2, ...)必须使用<code>&lt;strong&gt;</code>和<code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>标签加粗显示。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"图形名称和编号应如下所示：<strong>Fig. 1:</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"图形编号需要手动编号。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;caption align=&quot;bottom&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fig. 2:&lt;/strong&gt; Caption starts with a capital letter&lt;/caption&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;td&gt;\r\n"
"      &lt;img src=&quot;modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/PID_controller.png&quot;\r\n"
"           alt=&quot;PID_controller.png&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.Hyperlinks"
msgid "Hyperlinks"
msgstr "超链接"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.Hyperlinks"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> Hyperlinks should always be made when referring to a component or package.</li>\r\n"
"<li> The hyperlink text in between <code>&lt;a href=&quot;...&quot;&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code> should include the full main package name.</li>\r\n"
"<li> A link to an external component should include the full name of the package that it is referred to.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Modelica hyperlinks have to use the scheme <code>&quot;modelica://...&quot;</code></li>\r\n"
"<li> For hyperlinks referring to a Modelica component, see Example 1 and 2.</li>\r\n"
"<li> No links to commercial web sites are allowed.</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Examples</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 1</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;a href=&quot;modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.UsersGuide.Tutorial.LoopStructures.PlanarLoops&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"         Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.UsersGuide.Tutorial.LoopStructures.PlanarLoops&lt;/a&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>appears as</p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.UsersGuide.Tutorial.LoopStructures.PlanarLoops\">\r\n"
"         Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.UsersGuide.Tutorial.LoopStructures.PlanarLoops</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 2</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;p&gt;\r\n"
"  The feeder cables are connected to an\r\n"
"  &lt;a href=&quot;modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.InductionMachines.IM_SquirrelCage&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"  induction machine&lt;/a&gt;.\r\n"
"&lt;/p&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>appears as</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"  The feeder cables are connected to an\r\n"
"  <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.InductionMachines.IM_SquirrelCage\">\r\n"
"  induction machine</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><ol><li>\r\n"
"在引用组件或包时，应始终使用超链接.</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"在<code>&lt;a href=\"…\"&gt;</code>和<code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>之间的超链接文本应该包含完整的主包名称.</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"指向外部组件的链接应该包含它所引用的包的全名.</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"Modelica超链接必须使用该方案 <code>\"modelica://...\"</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"有关引用Modelica组件的超链接，请参见示例1和2.</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"不允许链接到商业网站.</li>\r\n"
"</ol><h4>示例</h4><h5>示例1</h5><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >&lt;a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.UsersGuide.Tutorial.LoopStructures.PlanarLoops\"&gt;\r\n"
"Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.UsersGuide.Tutorial.LoopStructures.PlanarLoops&lt;/a&gt;\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"显示为<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.UsersGuide.Tutorial.LoopStructures.PlanarLoops\" target=\"\"><br>Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.UsersGuide.Tutorial.LoopStructures.PlanarLoops</a>&nbsp;\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h5>示例2</h5><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >&lt;p&gt;\r\n"
"The feeder cables are connected to an\r\n"
"&lt;a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.InductionMachines.IM_SquirrelCage\"&gt;\r\n"
"induction machine&lt;/a&gt;.\r\n"
"&lt;/p&gt;\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"显示为\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(245, 246, 248);\">供电电缆连接</span>到一个 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.InductionMachines.IM_SquirrelCage\" target=\"\"> induction machine</a>&nbsp;.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.Lists"
msgid "Lists"
msgstr "列表"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.Lists"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> Lists have to be placed <strong>outside</strong> of paragraphs to be HTML compliant.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Items of a list shall start with\r\n"
"     <ol>\r\n"
"     <li> a capital letter if each item is a full sentence</li>\r\n"
"     <li> a small letter, if only text fragments are used or the list is fragment of a sentence</li>\r\n"
"     </ol></li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Examples</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 1</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>This is a simple example of an enumerated (ordered) list</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;ol&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;li&gt;item 1&lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;li&gt;item 2&lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>appears as</p>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"  <li>item 1</li>\r\n"
"  <li>item 2</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 2</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>This is a simple example of an unnumbered list.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;ul&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;li&gt;item 1&lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;li&gt;item 2&lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>appears as</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"  <li>item 1</li>\r\n"
"  <li>item 2</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><ol><li>\r\n"
"列表必须放在<strong>段落的</strong>之外以符合HTML标准.</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">列表中的项目应以……开始</span></li>\r\n"
"</ol><h4>示例</h4><h5>示例1</h5><p>\r\n"
"这是一个简单的枚举(有序)列表示例\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >&lt;ol&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;li&gt;item 1&lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;li&gt;item 2&lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"显示为\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ol><li>\r\n"
"项目1</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"项目2</li>\r\n"
"</ol><h5>示例2</h5><p>\r\n"
"这是一个简单的无编号列表的例子。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >&lt;ul&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;li&gt;item 1&lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;li&gt;item 2&lt;/li&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"显示为\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"项目1</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"项目2</li>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.References"
msgid "References"
msgstr "参考资料"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.References"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> Refer to references by [1], [Andronov1973], etc. by hyperlink and summarize literature in the references subsection of\r\n"
"     <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.UsersGuide.References\">Conventions.UsersGuide.References</a>.</li>\r\n"
"<li> There has to be made at least one citation to each reference.</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Examples</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 1</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;p&gt;\r\n"
"More details about electric machine modeling\r\n"
"can be found in [&lt;a href=&quot;modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.UsersGuide.References&quot;&gt;Gao2008&lt;/a&gt;]\r\n"
"and\r\n"
"[&lt;a href=&quot;modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.UsersGuide.References&quot;&gt;Kral2018&lt;/a&gt;, p. 149].\r\n"
"&lt;/p&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>appears as</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"More details about electric machine modeling\r\n"
"can be found in [<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.UsersGuide.References\">Gao2008</a>]\r\n"
"and\r\n"
"[<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.UsersGuide.References\">Kral2018</a>, p. 149].\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> 通过超链接查阅文献[1]，[androov1973]等，并在参考文献小节中总结文献\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.UsersGuide.References\">Conventions.UsersGuide.References</a>.</li>\r\n"
"<li> 每个参考文献必须至少有一次引用.</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>示例1</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;p&gt;\r\n"
"More details about electric machine modeling\r\n"
"can be found in [&lt;a href=&quot;modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.UsersGuide.References&quot;&gt;Gao2008&lt;/a&gt;]\r\n"
"and\r\n"
"[&lt;a href=&quot;modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.UsersGuide.References&quot;&gt;Kral2018&lt;/a&gt;, p. 149].\r\n"
"&lt;/p&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>显示为</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"更多关于电机建模的细节可以在 [<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.UsersGuide.References\">Gao2008</a>]\r\n"
"和[<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.UsersGuide.References\">Kral2018</a>, p. 149]中查找。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.Tables"
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表格"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Format.Tables"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> Tables should always be typeset with <code>&lt;table&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/table&gt;</code>,\r\n"
"     not with <code>&lt;pre&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/pre&gt;</code>.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Tables have to be placed <strong>outside</strong> of paragraphs to be HTML compliant.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Each table must have a table caption.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Table headers and entries start with capital letters.</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Examples</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 1</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>This is a simple example of a table.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;caption align=&quot;bottom&quot;&gt;Caption starts with a capital letter&lt;/caption&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;th&gt;Head 1&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;th&gt;Head 2&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;td&gt;Entry 1&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;td&gt;Entry 2&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;td&gt;Entry 3&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;td&gt;Entry 4&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>appears as</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <caption align=\"bottom\">Caption starts with a capital letter</caption>\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <th><strong>Head 1</strong></th>\r\n"
"    <th><strong>Head 2</strong></th>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>Entry 1</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Entry 2</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>Entry 3</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Entry 4</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 2</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>In this case of table captions, the table name (Tab.) including the table enumeration (1,2,...)\r\n"
"has to be displayed bold using <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>. The table name\r\n"
"and enumeration should look like this: <strong>Tab. 1:</strong> Tables have to be enumerated manually.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;caption align=&quot;bottom&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tab 2:&lt;/strong&gt; Caption starts with a capital letter&lt;/caption&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;th&gt;Head 1&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;th&gt;Head 2&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;td&gt;Entry 1&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;td&gt;Entry 2&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;td&gt;Entry 3&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"    &lt;td&gt;Entry 4&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"  &lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>appears as</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <caption align=\"bottom\"><strong>Tab. 2:</strong> Caption starts with a capital letter</caption>\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <th>Head 1</th>\r\n"
"    <th>Head 2</th>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>Entry 1</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Entry 2</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>Entry 3</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Entry 4</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> 表应该总是用<code>&lt;table&gt;</code>和<code>&lt;/table&gt;</code>来排版。\r\n"
"而不是<code>&lt;pre&gt;</code>和<code>&lt;/pre&gt;</code>.</li>\r\n"
"<li> 表格必须放在<strong>段落的</strong>之外，以符合HTML标准.</li>\r\n"
"<li> 每个表必须有一个表标题.</li>\r\n"
"<li> 表头和条目以大写字母开头.</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>示例1</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>这是一个简单的表示例。</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;caption align=&quot;bottom&quot;&gt;Caption starts with a capital letter&lt;/caption&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;th&gt;Head 1&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;th&gt;Head 2&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;td&gt;Entry 1&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;td&gt;Entry 2&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;td&gt;Entry 3&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;td&gt;Entry 4&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>显示为</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<caption align=\"bottom\">Caption starts with a capital letter</caption>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<th><strong>Head 1</strong></th>\r\n"
"<th><strong>Head 2</strong></th>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>Entry 1</td>\r\n"
"<td>Entry 2</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>Entry 3</td>\r\n"
"<td>Entry 4</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>示例2</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>在本例的表标题中，表名(Tab.)包括表枚举(1,2，…)\r\n"
"必须使用<code>&lt;strong&gt;</code>和<code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>粗体显示。表名\r\n"
"和枚举应该像这样:<strong>Tab. 1:</strong>表必须手动枚举.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;caption align=&quot;bottom&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tab 2:&lt;/strong&gt; Caption starts with a capital letter&lt;/caption&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;th&gt;Head 1&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;th&gt;Head 2&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;td&gt;Entry 1&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;td&gt;Entry 2&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;td&gt;Entry 3&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;td&gt;Entry 4&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>显示为</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<caption align=\"bottom\"><strong>Tab. 2:</strong> Caption starts with a capital letter</caption>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<th>Head 1</th>\r\n"
"<th>Head 2</th>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>Entry 1</td>\r\n"
"<td>Entry 2</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>Entry 3</td>\r\n"
"<td>Entry 4</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Structure"
msgid "Structure"
msgstr "结构"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.Conventions.Documentation.Structure"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> In the HTML documentation of any Modelica library, the headings <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>,\r\n"
"     <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;h3&gt;</code> should not be used, because they are utilized by\r\n"
"     the automatically generated documentation.</li>\r\n"
"<li> The utilized heading format starts with <code>&lt;h4&gt;</code> and terminates with <code>&lt;/h4&gt;</code>, e.g.,\r\n"
"     <code>&lt;h4&gt;Description&lt;/h4&gt;</code></li>\r\n"
"<li> The  <code>&lt;h4&gt;</code> and  <code>&lt;h5&gt;</code> headings must not be terminated by a colon (:).</li>\r\n"
"<li> For additional structuring <code>&lt;h5&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/h5&gt;</code> may be used as demonstrated below.</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Structure</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The following parts should be added to the documentation of each component:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> General information without additional subsection explains how the class works</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>Syntax</strong> (for functions only): shows syntax of function call with minimum and full input parameters</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>Implementation</strong> (optional): explains how the implementation is made</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>Limitations</strong> (optional): explains the limitations of the component</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>Notes</strong> (optional): if required/useful</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>Examples</strong> (optional): if required/useful</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>Acknowledgments</strong> (optional): if required</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>See also</strong>: shows hyperlinks to related models</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>Revision history</strong> (optional): if required/intended for a package/model, the revision history\r\n"
"        should be placed in <code>annotation(Documentation(revisions=&quot;...&quot;));</code></li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"These sections should appear in the listed order. The only exceptions are hierarchically structured notes and examples as explained in the following.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Additional notes and examples</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Some additional notes or examples may require additional <code>&lt;h5&gt;</code> headings. For either notes or examples the following cases may be applied:</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 1</h5>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is an example of a single note.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;h5&gt;Note&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;p&gt;This is the note.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 2</h5>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is an example of a very simple structure.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;h5&gt;Notes&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;p&gt;This is the first note.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;p&gt;This is the second note.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Example 3</h5>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This example shows a more complex structure with enumeration.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;h5&gt;Note 1&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n"
"...\r\n"
"&lt;h5&gt;Note 2&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n"
"...\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Automatically created documentation</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For parameters, connectors, as well as inputs and outputs of function automatic documentation is generated by the tool from the quoted comments.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> 在任何Modelica库的HTML文档中，标题中不应该使用标签<code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>、\r\n"
"<code>&lt;h2&gt;</code>和<code>&lt;h3&gt;</code>，因为它们已经被自动生成的文档所使用。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 所使用的标题格式以<code>&lt;h4&gt;</code>开始，以<code>&lt;/h4&gt;</code>结束，例如：\r\n"
"<code>&lt;h4&gt;Description&lt;/h4&gt;</code>。</li>\r\n"
"<li> <code>&lt;h4&gt;</code>和<code>&lt;h5&gt;</code>标题不能以冒号(:)结尾。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 对于额外的结构，<code>&lt;h5&gt;</code>和<code>&lt;/h5&gt;</code>可以如下所示使用。</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>结构</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"应在每个组件的文件中添加以下部分:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> 无附加小节的一般信息，说明类的工作原理</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>语法</strong>(仅适用于函数)：显示带有最小和完整输入参数的函数调用语法</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>实施</strong>(可选)：解释如何实施</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>局限性</strong>(可选)：解释组件的局限性</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>注释</strong>(可选)：如果需要/有用</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>示例</strong>(可选)：如果需要/有用</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>致谢</strong>(可选)：如果需要</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>另见</strong>：显示相关模型的超链接</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>修订历史</strong>(可选)：如果需要/打算为一个包/模型提供修订历史，\r\n"
"则应将修订历史放在<code>annotation(Documentation(revisions=&quot;...&quot;));</code>中</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这些部分应按所列顺序排列。唯一的例外是分层结构的注释和示例，解释如下。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>补充说明和示例</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>某些附加注释或示例可能需要额外的 <code>&lt;h5&gt;</code> 标题。对于注意或示例，可采用以下情况：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>示例1</h5>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是单个注意的示例。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;h5&gt;Note&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;p&gt;This is the note.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>示例2</h5>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个非常简单的结构示例。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;h5&gt;Notes&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;p&gt;This is the first note.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;p&gt;This is the second note.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>示例3</h5>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该示例展示了一个更复杂的枚举结构。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"&lt;h5&gt;Note 1&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n"
"...\r\n"
"&lt;h5&gt;Note 2&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n"
"...\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>自动创建文档</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"对于参数、连接器以及函数的输入和输出，工具会根据引用的注释自动生成文档。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

