msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.ReleaseNotes.VersionManagement"
msgid "Version Management"
msgstr "版本管理"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.ReleaseNotes.VersionManagement"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Development branches</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Further development and maintenance of the Modelica Standard Library is performed with\r\n"
"two branches on the public <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary.git\">GitHub repository</a> of the Modelica Association.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Since version 4.0.0 the Modelica Standard Library uses semantic versioning following the\r\n"
"convention:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
" <blockquote><strong><code>MAJOR.MINOR.BUGFIX</code></strong></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This provides a mechanism for maintaining releases and bug-fixes in a well defined way and is inspired\r\n"
"by (but not identical to) <a href=\"https://semver.org\">https://semver.org</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Main development branch</h5>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Name: \"master\"\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This branch contains the actual development version, i.e., all bug-fixes\r\n"
"and new features.\r\n"
"New features must have been tested before including them.\r\n"
"However, the exhaustive tests for a new version are (usually) not performed.\r\n"
"This version is usually only be used by the developers of the\r\n"
"Modelica Standard Library and is not utilized by Modelica users.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Maintenance branch</h5>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Name: \"maint/4.0.x\"\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This branch contains the released Modelica Standard Library version (e.g., v4.0.0)\r\n"
"where all bug-fixes since this release date are included\r\n"
"(also consecutive <code>BUGFIX</code> versions 4.0.1, 4.0.2, etc.,\r\n"
"up to when a new <code>MINOR</code> or <code>MAJOR</code>  release becomes available;\r\n"
"i.e., there will not be any further <code>BUGFIX</code> versions (i.e., 4.0.x) of a previous release).\r\n"
"These bug-fixes might not yet be tested with all test cases or with\r\n"
"other Modelica libraries. The goal is that a vendor may take this version at\r\n"
"any time for a new release of its software, in order to incorporate the latest\r\n"
"bug fixes.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Contribution workflow</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The general <a href=\"https://guides.github.com/activities/forking/\">contribution workflow</a> is usually as follows:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li>Fork the repository to your account by\r\n"
"   <a href=\"https://help.github.com/articles/fork-a-repo/\">using the Fork button</a> of the GitHub repository site.</li>\r\n"
"<li>Clone the forked repository to your computer. Make sure to checkout the maintenance branch if the bug fix is going to get merged to the maintenance branch.</li>\r\n"
"<li>Create a new topic branch and give it a meaningful name, like, e.g., \"issue2161-fix-formula\".</li>\r\n"
"<li>Do your code changes and commit them, one change per commit.<br>\r\n"
"   Single commits can be copied to other branches.<br>\r\n"
"   Multiple commits can be squashed into one, but splitting is difficult.</li>\r\n"
"<li>Once you are done, push your topic branch to your forked repository.</li>\r\n"
"<li>Go to the upstream <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary.git\">https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary.git</a> repository and submit a <a href=\"https://help.github.com/articles/about-pull-requests/\">Pull Request</a> (PR).\r\n"
"   <ul>\r\n"
"   <li>If the PR is related to a certain issue, reference it by its number like this: #2161.</li>\r\n"
"   <li>Once a pull request is opened, you can discuss and <a href=\"https://help.github.com/articles/about-pull-request-reviews/\">review</a> the potential changes with collaborators and add follow-up commits before the changes are merged into the repository.</li>\r\n"
"   <li>If you have not already signed the Modelica Association Contributor License Agreement (CLA) you need to do so one-time.<br>\r\n"
"   You can sign the CLA electronically using the CLA Assistant service and your GitHub account. There is no need to scan and send any documents by mail.</li>\r\n"
"   </ul></li>\r\n"
"<li>Update your branch with the requested changes. If necessary, merge the latest\r\n"
"   \"master\" branch into your topic branch and solve all merge conflicts in your topic branch.</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"There are some special guidelines for changes to the maintenance branch.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> Every change to the maintenance branch has to get cherry-picked at the \"master\"\r\n"
"         branch (see above), too.</li>\r\n"
"<li> When a new <code>BUGFIX</code> release is due the annotations\r\n"
"     \"version\" and \"versionDate\" need to be updated.<br>\r\n"
"     Example:\r\n"
"         <blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"annotation(version      = \"4.0.1\",\r\n"
"           versionDate  = \"2020-09-29\",\r\n"
"           dateModified = \"2020-09-29 07:40:19Z\",\r\n"
"           revisionId   = \"$F&#8203;ormat:%h %ci$\")\r\n"
"         </pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"     The \"dateModfied\" is optional but might help identify the exact creation time of a release.\r\n"
"     The \"revisionId\" field is a special annotation to identify the exact commit that the released\r\n"
"     version represents.<br>\r\n"
"     Example:\r\n"
"     <blockquote>\r\n"
"        Running the export command \"<code>git archive -o msl.zip v4.0.0</code>\" will\r\n"
"        expand the above \"revisionId\" place holder to something like:\r\n"
"        <blockquote><pre>revisionId = \"c04e23a0d 2020-04-01 12:00:00 +0200$\"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"     </blockquote>\r\n"
"     </li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"As a recommendation, a valid bug-fix to the maintenance branch may contain one or\r\n"
"more of the following changes.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> Correcting an equation.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Correcting attributes quantity/unit/defaultUnit in a declaration.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Improving/fixing the documentation.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Introducing a new name in the public section of a class\r\n"
"         (model, package, ...) or in any section of a partial class is <strong>not</strong> allowed.\r\n"
"         Since otherwise, a user might use this new name and when storing its model\r\n"
"         and loading it with an older bug-fix version, an error would occur.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Introducing a new name in the protected section of a non-partial\r\n"
"         class should only be done if absolutely necessary to fix a bug.\r\n"
"         The problem is that this might be non-backward compatible,\r\n"
"         because a user might already extend from this class and already using the same name.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>开发分支</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Modelica标准库的进一步开发和维护通过Modelica协会的公共<a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary.git\">GitHub repository</a>仓库中的两个分支进行。\r\n"
"自4.0.0版本起，Modelica标准库采用语义化版本控制(semantic versioning)，遵循以下约定：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
" <blockquote><strong><code>MAJOR.MINOR.BUGFIX</code></strong></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这种版本管理机制提供了一种清晰的方式来维护发布和修复bug，灵感来自于(但不完全相同于)<a href=\"https://semver.org\">https://semver.org</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>主开发分支</h5>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"名称：\"master\"\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该分支包含当前的开发版本，即所有的bug修复和新特性。\r\n"
"在包含新特性之前，这些特性必须经过测试。\r\n"
"然而，通常不会对新版本执行全面的测试。\r\n"
"这个版本通常只由Modelica标准库的开发者使用，Modelica用户一般不会使用该版本。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>维护分支</h5>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"名称：\"maint/4.0.x\"\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该分支包含已发布的Modelica标准库版本(例如v4.0.0)，并包括自发布日期以来的所有bug修复(包括连续的<code>BUGFIX</code>版本4.0.1、4.0.2等，直到发布新的<code>MINOR</code>或<code>MAJOR</code>版本为止；\r\n"
"也就是说，原版本不会再发布进一步的<code>BUGFIX</code>版本(例如4.0.x))。\r\n"
"这些bug修复可能尚未使用所有测试用例或与其他Modelica库进行充分测试。\r\n"
"目标是，任何供应商都可以随时使用此版本来发布其软件的新版本，以便将最新的bug修复纳入其中。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>贡献工作流程</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一般的<a href=\"https://guides.github.com/activities/forking/\">贡献工作流程</a>通常如下:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li>使用GitHub仓库页面上的<a href=\"https://help.github.com/articles/fork-a-repo/\">Fork按钮</a>，将仓库fork到你的账户。</li>\r\n"
"<li>将fork的仓库克隆到你的本地计算机。如果bug修复需要合并到维护分支，确保切换到维护分支。</li>\r\n"
"<li>创建一个新的主题分支，并给它起一个有意义的名字，例如：\"issue2161-fix-formula\"。</li>\r\n"
"<li>进行代码修改并提交，每次提交一个修改。<br>\r\n"
"   单个提交可以复制到其他分支。<br>\r\n"
"   多个提交可以合并成一个，但拆分提交是困难的。</li>\r\n"
"<li>完成后，将你的主题分支推送到你的fork仓库。</li>\r\n"
"<li>前往上游仓库<a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary.git\">https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary.git</a>并提交一个<a href=\"https://help.github.com/articles/about-pull-requests/\">Pull Request</a>(PR)。\r\n"
"   <ul>\r\n"
"   <li>如果PR与某个问题相关，请通过问题编号引用，例如：#2161。</li>\r\n"
"   <li>一旦提交了Pull Request，你可以与合作者讨论并<a href=\"https://help.github.com/articles/about-pull-request-reviews/\">审查</a>潜在的更改，并在更改合并到仓库之前添加后续的提交。</li>\r\n"
"   <li>如果你还没有签署Modelica协会的贡献者许可协议(CLA)，你需要一次性完成签署。<br>\r\n"
"       你可以通过CLA Assistant服务和你的GitHub账户电子签署CLA，无需扫描和邮寄任何文件。</li>\r\n"
"   </ul></li>\r\n"
"<li>根据要求更新你的分支。如果有必要，将最新的\"master\"分支合并到你的主题分支，并解决所有合并冲突。</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"对于维护分支的更改，有一些特殊的指南。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>对维护分支的每个更改，必须同时在\"master\"分支中进行cherry-pick操作(见上文)。\r\n"
"</li>\r\n"
"<li>当需要发布新的<code>BUGFIX</code>版本时，需要更新\"version\"和\"versionDate\"注释。</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>示例：\r\n"
"         <blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"annotation(version      = \"4.0.1\",\r\n"
"           versionDate  = \"2020-09-29\",\r\n"
"           dateModified = \"2020-09-29 07:40:19Z\",\r\n"
"           revisionId   = \"$F&#8203;ormat:%h %ci$\")\r\n"
"         </pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"\"dateModfied\"是可选的，但可能有助于确定发布的确切创建时间。\r\n"
"\"revisionId\"字段是一个特殊的注释，用于标识所发布的确切提交版本。\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"     示例:\r\n"
"     <blockquote>\r\n"
"     运行导出命令\"<code>git archive -o msl.zip v4.0.0</code>\"将把上述的\"revisionId\"占位符展开为类似以下内容：\r\n"
"        <blockquote><pre>revisionId = \"c04e23a0d 2020-04-01 12:00:00 +0200$\"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"     </blockquote>\r\n"
"     </li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"作为建议，对维护分支的有效bug修复可能包括以下一种或多种更改：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> 修正方程式。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 修正声明中的quantity/unit/defaultUnit属性。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 改进/修复文档。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 不允许在类(模型、包等)的公共部分或任何部分类的部分中引入新名称。否则，用户可能会使用这个新名称，并在存储其模型并使用旧的bug修复版本加载时，发生错误。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 只有在绝对必要修复bug时，才能在非部分类的保护部分引入新名称。这样做可能会导致向后不兼容，因为用户可能已经从这个类继承，并且已经使用了相同的名称。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.ReleaseNotes.Version_4_0_0_TY_1_build_11"
msgid "Version 4.0.0.TY.1 build 11 (September 30, 2026)"
msgstr "版本4.0.0.TY.1 build 11(2026年09月30日)"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.ReleaseNotes.Version_4_0_0_TY_1_build_11"
msgid "<html><p>\n"
"<span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><strong>Version Description</strong></span>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"><strong>Version 4.0.0.TY.1 build 11，2026.09.30</strong></span>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<br>1. Added 2 Blocks models, ExternalInput and ExternalOutpu. They can be used as top-level input/output connectors inside models and automatically inherit the type of the connected port. Details are listed in the table below:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"100\">Model Name</th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"293.36\">Model Path</th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">Description</th></tr><tr><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">ExternalInput</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.ExternalInput</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">Can be used as a top-level input connector inside a model and automatically inherit the type of the connected port</td></tr><tr><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">ExternalOutput</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.ExternalOutput</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">Can be used as a top-level output connector inside a model and automatically inherit the type of the connected port</td></tr></tbody></table><p>\n"
"2. Optimized one Blocks model CombiTimeTable. Added vectorization parameter to improve the calculation efficiency of multi-column data interpolation. Details are shown in the table below:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"100\">Model Name</th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"293.36\">Model Path</th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">Description</th></tr><tr><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">CombiTimeTable</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources.CombiTimeTable</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">Table look-up with respect to time and linear/periodic extrapolation methods (data from matrix/file)</td></tr></tbody></table><p>\n"
"3. Fixed display errors in the documentation browser for all functions under the path: <span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Modelica.Math.Matrices.LAPACK.</span>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"4. Revised the description shown in the documentation browser for model: <span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.Components.PartialAirGapDC.</span>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\n"
"<span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><strong>版本说明</strong></span>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"><strong>Version 4.0.0.TY.1 build 11，2026.09.30</strong></span>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<br>1. 新增2个Blocks模型ExternalInput、ExternalOutput，支持在模型内部作为顶层输入/输出连接器使用，并自动继承相连端口类型，具体信息如下表所示：\n"
"</p>\n"
"<table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"100\">模型名称</th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"293.36\">模型路径</th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">描述</th></tr><tr><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">ExternalInput</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.ExternalInput</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">可在模型内部作为顶层输入连接器使用，并自动继承相连端口类型</td></tr><tr><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">ExternalOutput</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.ExternalOutput</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">可在模型内部作为顶层输出连接器使用，并自动继承相连端口类型</td></tr></tbody></table><p>\n"
"2. 优化1个Blocks模型CombiTimeTable，增加向量化参数，提高多列数据插值计算效率，具体的信息如下表所示：\n"
"</p>\n"
"<table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"100\">模型名称</th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"293.36\">模型路径</th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">描述</th></tr><tr><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">CombiTimeTable</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources.CombiTimeTable</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">与时间和线性/周期外推法有关的表格查询(数据来自矩阵/文件)</td></tr></tbody></table><p>\n"
"3. 修改Modelica.Math.Matrices.LAPACK路径下所有函数文档浏览器显示出错。\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"4. 修改Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.Components.PartialAirGapDC模型文档浏览器的描述。\n"
"</p>\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.ReleaseNotes.Version_4_0_0_TY_1_build_10"
msgid "Version 4.0.0.TY.1 build 10 (May 30, 2026)"
msgstr "版本4.0.0.TY.1 build 10(2026年05月30日)"

msgctxt "Modelica.UsersGuide.ReleaseNotes.Version_4_0_0_TY_1_build_10"
msgid "<html><p>\n"
"<span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><strong>Version Description</strong></span>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"><strong>Version 4.0.0.TY.1 build 10，2026.05.30</strong></span>\n"
