msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Continuous.Derivative"
msgid "Initial or guess value of state"
msgstr "状态的初始值或猜测值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Continuous.Derivative"
msgid "Initial value of output (= state)"
msgstr "输出初始值(=state)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Continuous.Derivative"
msgid "State of block"
msgstr "模块状态"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Continuous.Derivative"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks defines the transfer function between the\r\n"
"input u and the output y\r\n"
"as <em>approximated derivative</em>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"        k * s\r\n"
"y = ------------ * u\r\n"
"       T * s + 1\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If you would like to be able to change easily between different\r\n"
"transfer functions (FirstOrder, SecondOrder, ... ) by changing\r\n"
"parameters, use the general block <strong>TransferFunction</strong> instead\r\n"
"and model a derivative block with parameters<br>\r\n"
"b = {k,0}, a = {T, 1}.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If k=0, the block reduces to y=0.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将输入u和输出y之间的传递函数定义为 <em>近似导数 </em>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >k * s\r\n"
"y = ------------ * u\r\n"
"T * s + 1</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"如果您希望通过更改参数在不同传递函数(一阶、二阶......) 之间轻松切换， 请使用通用模块<strong>TransferFunction</strong>代替， 并使用参数对导数模块进行建模<br> b = {k,0}, a = {T, 1}。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"当k=0,该模块简化为y=0。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

