msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Discrete.StateSpace"
msgid "Discrete State Space block"
msgstr "离散状态空间模块"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Discrete.StateSpace"
msgid "Matrix A of state space model"
msgstr "状态空间模型的矩阵A"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Discrete.StateSpace"
msgid "Matrix B of state space model"
msgstr "状态空间模型的矩阵B"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Discrete.StateSpace"
msgid "Matrix C of state space model"
msgstr "状态空间模型的矩阵C"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Discrete.StateSpace"
msgid "Matrix D of state space model"
msgstr "状态空间模型的矩阵D"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Discrete.StateSpace"
msgid "State vector"
msgstr "状态向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Discrete.StateSpace"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The <strong>discrete state space</strong> block defines the relation\r\n"
"between the input u and the output y in state space form:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"x = A * pre(x) + B * u\r\n"
"y = C * pre(x) + D * u\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where pre(x) is the value of the discrete state x at\r\n"
"the previous sample time instant.\r\n"
"The input is a vector of length nu, the output is a vector\r\n"
"of length ny and nx is the number of states. Accordingly\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A has the dimension: A(nx,nx),\r\n"
"B has the dimension: B(nx,nu),\r\n"
"C has the dimension: C(ny,nx),\r\n"
"D has the dimension: D(ny,nu)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Example:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"parameter: A = [0.12, 2;3, 1.5]\r\n"
"parameter: B = [2, 7;3, 1]\r\n"
"parameter: C = [0.1, 2]\r\n"
"parameter: D = zeros(ny,nu)\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in the following equations:\r\n"
"  [x[1]]   [0.12  2.00] [pre(x[1])]   [2.0  7.0] [u[1]]\r\n"
"  [    ] = [          ]*[         ] + [        ]*[    ]\r\n"
"  [x[2]]   [3.00  1.50] [pre(x[2])]   [0.1  2.0] [u[2]]\r\n"
"                             [pre(x[1])]            [u[1]]\r\n"
"       y[1]   = [0.1  2.0] * [         ] + [0  0] * [    ]\r\n"
"                             [pre(x[2])]            [u[2]]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"<strong>离散状态空间</strong>模块以状态空间形式定义了输入u和输出y之间的关系：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >x = A * pre(x) + B * u\r\n"
"y = C * pre(x) + D * u</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"其中，pre(x)是离散状态x在上一个采样时间瞬间的值。 输入是长度为nu的矢量， 输出是长度为ny的矢量， nx是状态数。因此\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >A has the dimension: A(nx,nx),\r\n"
"B has the dimension: B(nx,nu),\r\n"
"C has the dimension: C(ny,nx),\r\n"
"D has the dimension: D(ny,nu)</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"示例:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >parameter: A = [0.12, 2;3, 1.5]\r\n"
"parameter: B = [2, 7;3, 1]\r\n"
"parameter: C = [0.1, 2]\r\n"
"parameter: D = zeros(ny,nu)\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in the following equations:\r\n"
"[x[1]]   [0.12  2.00] [pre(x[1])]   [2.0  7.0] [u[1]]\r\n"
"[    ] = [          ]*[         ] + [        ]*[    ]\r\n"
"[x[2]]   [3.00  1.50] [pre(x[2])]   [0.1  2.0] [u[2]]\r\n"
"[pre(x[1])]            [u[1]]\r\n"
"y[1]   = [0.1  2.0] * [         ] + [0  0] * [    ]\r\n"
"[pre(x[2])]            [u[2]]</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

