msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Discrete.SlidingModeController"
msgid "<html><p style=\"text-align: start;\">The Sliding Mode Controller block implements hysteresis-based sliding mode control (SMC).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The sliding mode controller has this structure:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: start;\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: start;\">In this controller, lambda is the value of the Sliding factor parameter. To change the convergence speed of the error to zero, specify a value greater than 0 for the Sliding factor parameter.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The Discrete Transferfunction in thiss controller has such form:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >Y(s)    K(z-1)\r\n"
"---- = --------\r\n"
"U(s)     Ts z</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"Note:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: start;\">The Sliding Mode Controller block is a Discrete Block.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p style=\"text-align: start;\">滑模控制器块实现基于迟滞的滑模控制（SMC）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: start;\">滑模控制器的结构如下：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: start;\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">在该控制器中，lambda 是滑模因子参数的值。为了改变误差趋近于零的收敛速度，可以为滑模因子参数指定一个大于 0 的值</span>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >Y(s)    K(z-1)\r\n"
"---- = --------\r\n"
"U(s)     Ts z</code></pre><p style=\"text-align: start;\">注意:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: start;\">滑模控制器块是一个离散模块。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction"
msgid "Library of user interaction blocks to input and to show variables in a diagram animation"
msgstr "用户交互模块库，用于在图表动画中输入和显示变量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show"
msgid "Library of blocks to show variables in a diagram animation"
msgstr "在图示动画中显示变量的模块库"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.RealValue"
msgid "Show Real value from numberPort or from number input field in diagram layer dynamically"
msgstr "在图表层动态显示来自numberPort或数字输入栏的实数值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.RealValue"
msgid "= true, if numberPort enabled"
msgstr "= true，当启用了numberPort"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.RealValue"
msgid "Number to visualize if use_numberPort=false (time varying)"
msgstr "当use_numberPort=false，则数字是可视化的(随时间变化)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.RealValue"
msgid "Number of significant digits to be shown"
msgstr "显示的有效数字个数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.RealValue"
msgid "Number to be shown in diagram layer if use_numberPort = true"
msgstr "当use_numberPort=true，图表层中要显示编号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.RealValue"
msgid "%number"
msgstr "%number"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.RealValue"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block visualizes a Real number in a diagram animation.\r\n"
"The number to be visualized can be defined in the following ways:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> If useNumberPort = <strong>true</strong> (which is the default), a Real\r\n"
"     input is present and this input variable is shown.</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> If useNumberPort = <strong>false</strong> no input connector is present.\r\n"
"     Instead, a Real input field is activated in the parameter menu\r\n"
"     and the Real expression from this input menu is shown.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The two versions of the block are shown in the following image (in the right variant, the\r\n"
"name of the variable value that is displayed is also shown below the icon):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Interaction/Show/RealValue.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"RealValue.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"本模块通过图表动画将实数可视化。 可通过以下方式定义要可视化的数字：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul><li>\r\n"
"当useNumberPort=true(默认值)，则会出现一个实数输入值， 并显示该输入变量。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"如果useNumberPort=<strong>false</strong>， 则不会出现输入连接器，而是在参数菜单中激活一个实数输入栏， 并显示该输入菜单中的实数表达式。</li>\r\n"
"</ul><p>\r\n"
"本模块的两个版本如下图所示 (在右边的变体中，变量值名称也显示在图标下方)：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Interaction/Show/RealValue.png\" alt=\"RealValue.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"演示用法，例如示例 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.IntegerValue"
msgid "Show Integer value from numberPort or from number input field in diagram layer dynamically"
msgstr "在图表层中动态显示来自numberPort或数字输入字段的整数值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.IntegerValue"
msgid "= true, if numberPort enabled"
msgstr "=true，当启用了numberPort"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.IntegerValue"
msgid "Number to visualize if use_numberPort=false (time varying)"
msgstr "如果use_numberPort=false，则数字是可视化的(随时间变化)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.IntegerValue"
msgid "Number to be shown in diagram layer if use_numberPort = true"
msgstr "如果use_numberPort=true，则图表层中要显示编号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.IntegerValue"
msgid "%number"
msgstr "%number"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.IntegerValue"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block visualizes an Integer number in a diagram animation.\r\n"
"The number to be visualized can be defined in the following ways:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> If useNumberPort = <strong>true</strong> (which is the default), an Integer\r\n"
"     input is present and this input variable is shown.</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> If useNumberPort = <strong>false</strong> no input connector is present.\r\n"
"     Instead, an Integer input field is activated in the parameter menu\r\n"
"     and the Integer expression from this input menu is shown.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The two versions of the block are shown in the following image (in the right variant, the\r\n"
"name of the variable value that is displayed is also shown below the icon):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Interaction/Show/IntegerValue.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"IntegerValue.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"本模块在图表动画中将整数可视化。 可通过以下方式定义要可视化的数字：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul><li>\r\n"
"当useNumberPort=true(默认值)，则会出现整数输入值，并显示该输入变量。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"当useNumberPort=false，则不会出现输入连接器。 取而代之的是在参数菜单中激活一个整数输入域， 并显示该输入菜单中的整数表达式。</li>\r\n"
"</ul><p>\r\n"
"本模块的两个版本如下图所示 (在右边的变体中，变量值名称也显示在图标下方)：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Interaction/Show/IntegerValue.png\" alt=\"IntegerValue.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"演示用法，例如示例 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.BooleanValue"
msgid "Show Boolean value from numberPort or from number input field in diagram layer dynamically"
msgstr "在图表层动态显示来自numberPort或数字输入框的布尔值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.BooleanValue"
msgid "= true, if activePort enabled"
msgstr "=true，当activePort已启用"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.BooleanValue"
msgid "Boolean variable to visualize if use_activePort=false (time varying)"
msgstr "布尔变量显示use_activePort=false(随时间变化)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.BooleanValue"
msgid "Boolean variable to be shown in diagram layer if use_activePort = true"
msgstr "当use_activePort=true，图层中将显示布尔变量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.BooleanValue"
msgid "%active"
msgstr "%active"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interaction.Show.BooleanValue"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block visualizes a Boolean variable in a diagram animation.\r\n"
"The Boolean variable to be visualized can be defined in the following ways:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> If useActivePort = <strong>true</strong> (which is the default), a Boolean\r\n"
"     input is present and this input variable is shown.</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> If useActivePort = <strong>false</strong> no input connector is present.\r\n"
"     Instead, a Boolean input field is activated in the parameter menu\r\n"
"     and the Boolean expression from this input menu is shown.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If the Boolean variable is <strong>false</strong> the block is \"grey\", otherwise, it is \"green\".\r\n"
"The two versions of the block are shown in the following image (in the right variant, the\r\n"
"name of the variable value that is displayed is also shown below the icon):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Interaction/Show/BooleanValue.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"BooleanValue.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"本模块在图表动画中显示一个布尔变量。 要可视化的布尔变量可以通过以下方式定义:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"当useActivePort = true(这是默认值)，则会显示一个布尔输入并显示这个输入变量。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"如果useActivePort=false，则没有输入连接器存在。 相反，参数菜单中会激活一个布尔输入字段 ，并显示该输入菜单中的布尔表达式。</li>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果布尔变量为<strong>false</strong>， 则模块为\"灰\"，否则为\"绿\"。 本模块的两个版本如下图所示(在右边的变体中，变量值名称也显示在图标下方)：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Interaction/Show/BooleanValue.png\" alt=\"BooleanValue.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"演示用法，例如示例 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>&nbsp;。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

