"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces"
msgid "Integer output connector used for vector of connectors"
msgstr "用于连接向量的整型输出接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Integer output connector that is used for a vector of connectors,\r\n"
"for example <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Routing.DeMultiplex\">DeMultiplex</a>,\r\n"
"and has therefore a different icon as IntegerOutput connector.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"整数输出连接器，用于向量连接，例如<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Routing.DeMultiplex\" target=\"\">DeMultiplex</a>&nbsp;，因此具有与整数输出接口不同的图标。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces"
msgid "Boolean output connector used for vector of connectors"
msgstr "用于连接向量的布尔型输出接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces"
