"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">注意，输入信号必须彼此一致（fder = der(f)，fder2 = der(fder)）。</span>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

