msgid "Library of components with Boolean input and output signals"
msgstr "具有布尔输入和输出信号的元件库"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package provides blocks with Boolean input and output signals\r\n"
"to describe logical networks. A typical example for a logical\r\n"
"network built with package Logical is shown in the next figure:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Logical/LogicalNetwork1.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"LogicalNetwork1.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The actual value of Boolean input and/or output signals is displayed\r\n"
"in the respective block icon as \"circle\", where \"white\" color means\r\n"
"value <strong>false</strong> and \"green\" color means value <strong>true</strong>. These\r\n"
"values are visualized in a diagram animation.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该软件包提供布尔输入和输出信号块，用于描述逻辑网络。\r\n"
"下图是使用逻辑软件包构建逻辑网络的典型示例：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Logical/LogicalNetwork1.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"LogicalNetwork1.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"布尔输入和/或输出信号的实际值以 “圆圈” 形式显示在相应的程序块图标中，\r\n"
"其中 “白色” 表示值为<strong>false</strong>，“绿色” 表示值为<strong>true</strong>。\r\n"
"这些值在图表动画中可视化。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.And"
msgid "Logical 'and': y = u1 and u2"
msgstr "逻辑'and'：y=u1和u2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.And"
msgid "and"
msgstr "and"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.And"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if all inputs are <strong>true</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"如果所有输入均为<strong>true</strong>，则输出为<strong>true，</strong>否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Or"
msgid "Logical 'or': y = u1 or u2"
msgstr "逻辑'or'：y=u1或u2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Or"
msgid "or"
msgstr "or"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Or"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if at least one input is <strong>true</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果至少有一个输入为<strong>true</strong>，则输出为<strong>true</strong>，否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Xor"
msgid "Logical 'xor': y = u1 xor u2"
msgstr "逻辑'xor'：y=u1异或u2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Xor"
msgid "xor"
msgstr "xor"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Xor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if exactly one input is <strong>true</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果正好有一个输入为<strong>true</strong>，则输出为<strong>true</strong>，否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Nor"
msgid "Logical 'nor': y = not (u1 or u2)"
msgstr "逻辑'nor'：y=非(u1或u2)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Nor"
msgid "nor"
msgstr "nor"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Nor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if none of the inputs is <strong>true</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果输入都不为<strong>true</strong>，则输出为<strong>true</strong>，否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Nand"
msgid "Logical 'nand': y = not (u1 and u2)"
msgstr "逻辑'nand'：y=非(u1和u2)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Nand"
msgid "nand"
msgstr "nand"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Nand"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if at least one input is <strong>false</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果至少有一个输入为<strong>false</strong>，则输出为<strong>true</strong>，否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Not"
msgid "Logical 'not': y = not u"
msgstr "逻辑'not'：y=非u"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Not"
msgid "not"
msgstr "not"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Not"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if the input is <strong>false</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果输入为<strong>false</strong>，则输出为<strong>true</strong>，否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Pre"
msgid "Breaks algebraic loops by an infinitesimal small time delay (y = pre(u): event iteration continues until u = pre(u))"
msgstr "通过无限小的时间延迟打破代数循环(y=pre(u)：事件迭代持续到u=pre(u))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Pre"
msgid "Start value of pre(u) at initial time"
msgstr "初始时pre(u)的初始值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Pre"
msgid "pre"
msgstr "pre"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Pre"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block delays the Boolean input by an infinitesimal small time delay and\r\n"
"therefore breaks algebraic loops. In a network of logical blocks, in every\r\n"
"\"closed connection loop\" at least one logical block must have a delay,\r\n"
"since algebraic systems of Boolean equations are not solvable.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The \"Pre\" block returns the value of the \"input\" signal from the\r\n"
"last \"event iteration\". The \"event iteration\" stops, once both\r\n"
"values are identical (u = pre(u)).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"这个逻辑模块以无限小的时间延迟来延迟布尔输入，从而打破代数循环。 在逻辑块网络中，每个“闭合连接回路”中至少有一个逻辑块必须有延迟，因为布尔方程的代数系统是不可解的。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">“Pre”块返回“输入”信号在上一次“事件迭代”中的值。一旦两个值相同（u = pre(u)），“事件迭代”停止。</span>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Edge"
msgid "Output y is true, if the input u has a rising edge (y = edge(u))"
msgstr "如果输入u具有上升沿，则输出y为真(y=edge(u))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Edge"
msgid "Start value of pre(u) at initial time"
msgstr "初始时pre(u)的初始值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Edge"
msgid "edge"
msgstr "edge"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Edge"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if the Boolean input has a rising edge\r\n"
"from <strong>false</strong> to <strong>true</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果布尔输入有一个从<strong>false</strong>到<strong>true</strong>的上升沿，\r\n"
"则输出为<strong>true</strong>，否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.FallingEdge"
msgid "Output y is true, if the input u has a falling edge (y = edge(not u))"
msgstr "如果输入u为下降沿，则输出y为真(=edge(not u))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.FallingEdge"
msgid "Start value of pre(u) at initial time"
msgstr "初始时pre(u)的初始值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.FallingEdge"
msgid "falling"
msgstr "falling"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.FallingEdge"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if the Boolean input has a falling edge\r\n"
"from <strong>true</strong> to <strong>false</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果布尔输入有一个从<strong>true</strong>到<strong>false</strong>的下降沿，\r\n"
"则输出为<strong>true</strong>，否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Change"
msgid "Output y is true, if the input u has a rising or falling edge (y = change(u))"
msgstr "如果输入u出现上升沿或下降沿，则输出y为真(y = change(u))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Change"
msgid "Start value of pre(u) at initial time"
msgstr "初始时pre(u)的初始值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Change"
msgid "change"
msgstr "change"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Change"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if the Boolean input has either a rising edge\r\n"
"from <strong>false</strong> to <strong>true</strong> or a falling edge from\r\n"
"<strong>true</strong> to <strong>false</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果布尔输入有一个从<strong>false</strong>到<strong>true</strong>的上升沿\r\n"
"或一个从<strong>true</strong>到<strong>false</strong>的下降沿，\r\n"
"则输出为<strong>true</strong>，否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.GreaterThreshold"
msgid "Output y is true, if input u is greater than threshold"
msgstr "如果输入u大于阈值，则输出y为真"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.GreaterThreshold"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if the Real input is greater than\r\n"
"parameter <strong>threshold</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"如果实型输入值大于参数<strong>threshold</strong>， 则输出为<strong>true</strong>，否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.GreaterEqualThreshold"
msgid "Output y is true, if input u is greater or equal than threshold"
msgstr "如果输入u大于或等于阈值，则输出y为真"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.GreaterEqualThreshold"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if the Real input is greater than or equal to\r\n"
"parameter <strong>threshold</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"如果实型输入值大于或等于参数<strong>threshold</strong>， 则输出为<strong>true</strong>，否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.LessThreshold"
msgid "Output y is true, if input u is less than threshold"
msgstr "如果输入u小于阈值，则输出y为真"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.LessThreshold"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if the Real input is less than\r\n"
"parameter <strong>threshold</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"如果实型输入值小于参数<strong>threshold</strong>， 则输出为<strong>true</strong>，否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.LessEqualThreshold"
msgid "Output y is true, if input u is less or equal than threshold"
msgstr "如果输入u小于或等于阈值，则输出y为真"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.LessEqualThreshold"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if the Real input is less than or equal to\r\n"
"parameter <strong>threshold</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"如果实型输入值小于或等于参数<strong>threshold</strong>， 则输出为<strong>true</strong>，否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Greater"
msgid "Output y is true, if input u1 is greater than input u2"
msgstr "如果输入u1大于输入 u2，则输出y为真"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Greater"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if Real input u1 is greater than\r\n"
"Real input u2, otherwise the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"如果实数输入 u1 大于实数输入 u2，则输出为<strong>true</strong>， 否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.IntegerGreater"
msgid "Output y is true, if input u1 is greater than input u2"
msgstr "如果输入u1大于输入 u2，则输出y为真"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.IntegerGreater"
msgid "<html><p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if Integer input u1 is greater than Integer input u2, otherwise the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"如果整型输入 u1 大于整型输入 u2，则输出为<strong>true</strong>， 否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.GreaterEqual"
msgid "Output y is true, if input u1 is greater or equal than input u2"
msgstr "如果输入 u1大于或等于输入u2，则输出y为真"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.GreaterEqual"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if Real input u1 is greater than or equal to\r\n"
"Real input u2, otherwise the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果实数输入 u1 大于或等于实数输入 u2，则输出为<strong>true</strong>，\r\n"
"否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Less"
msgid "Output y is true, if input u1 is less than input u2"
msgstr "如果输入u1小于输入u2，则输出y为真"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Less"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if Real input u1 is less than\r\n"
"Real input u2, otherwise the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果实数输入 u1 小于实数输入 u2，则输出为<strong>true</strong>，\r\n"
"否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.LessEqual"
msgid "Output y is true, if input u1 is less or equal than input u2"
msgstr "如果输入u1小于或等于输入u2，则输出y为真"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.LessEqual"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if Real input u1 is less than or equal to\r\n"
"Real input u2, otherwise the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果实数输入 u1 小于或等于实数输入 u2，则输出为<strong>true</strong>，\r\n"
"否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Equality"
msgid "Output y is true, if input u1 is equal to input u2"
msgstr "如果输入u1等于输入 u2，则输出y为真"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Equality"
msgid "Connector of first Real input signal"
msgstr "第一个实数输入信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Equality"
msgid "Connector of second Real input signal"
msgstr "第二个实数输入信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Equality"
msgid "Connector of Boolean output signal"
msgstr "实数输出信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Equality"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Equality"
msgid "<html><p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if Real input u1 is equal to Real input u2, otherwise the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"如果输入实数u1等于输入实数u2，则输出为<strong>true</strong>，否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.IntegerEquality"
msgid "Output y is true, if input u1 is equal to input u2"
msgstr "如果输入u1等于输入 u2，则输出y为真"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.IntegerEquality"
msgid "Connector of first Real input signal"
msgstr "第一个实数输入信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.IntegerEquality"
msgid "Connector of second Real input signal"
msgstr "第二个实数输入信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.IntegerEquality"
msgid "Connector of Boolean output signal"
msgstr "实数输出信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.IntegerEquality"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.IntegerEquality"
msgid "<html><p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if Integer input u1 is equal to Integer input u2, otherwise the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"如果整型输入 u1 等于整型输入 u2，则输出为<strong>true</strong>， 否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.ZeroCrossing"
msgid "Trigger zero crossing of input u"
msgstr "触发输入u的过零"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.ZeroCrossing"
msgid "Zero input crossing is triggered if the enable input signal is true"
msgstr "如果启用输入信号为真，则触发过零输入"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.ZeroCrossing"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output \"y\" is <strong>true</strong> at the\r\n"
"time instant when the input \"u\" becomes\r\n"
"zero, provided the input \"enable\" is\r\n"
"<strong>true</strong>. At all other time instants, the output \"y\" is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"If the input \"u\" is zero at a time instant when the \"enable\"\r\n"
"input changes its value, then the output y is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, that in the plot window of a Modelica simulator, the output of\r\n"
"this block is usually identically to <strong>false</strong>, because the output\r\n"
"may only be <strong>true</strong> at an event instant, but not during\r\n"
"continuous integration. In order to check that this component is\r\n"
"actually working as expected, one should connect its output to, e.g.,\r\n"
"component <em><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Discrete.TriggeredSampler\">Modelica.Blocks.Discrete.TriggeredSampler</a></em>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">当输入 \"u\" 变为零且输入 \"enable\" 为</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>true</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">时，输出 \"y\" 在该时刻为</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>true</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">。在所有其他时刻，输出 \"y\" 为</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>false</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">。如果输入 \"u\" 在 \"enable\" 输入值发生变化的时刻为零，则输出 \"y\" 为</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>false</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">。</span>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请注意，在 Modelica 模拟器的绘图窗口中，该模块的输出通常与<strong>false</strong>相同， 因为输出可能只在事件发生时为<strong>true</strong>，而在持续集成过程中并非如此。 为了检查该组件是否按预期运行，应将其输出连接到组件，例如 <em>Modelica.Blocks.Discrete.TriggeredSampler</em>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.LogicalSwitch"
msgid "Logical Switch"
msgstr "逻辑开关"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.LogicalSwitch"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The LogicalSwitch switches, depending on the\r\n"
"Boolean u2 connector (the middle connector),\r\n"
"between the two possible input signals\r\n"
"u1 (upper connector) and u3 (lower connector).</p>\r\n"
"<p>If u2 is true, connector y is set equal to\r\n"
"u1, else it is set equal to u3.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"逻辑开关根据布尔值 u2 连接器（中间连接器）在两个可能的输入信号 u1（上连接器）和 u3（下连接器）之间进行切换。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果 u2 为真，连接器 y 设为等于 u1，否则设为等于 u3。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Switch"
msgid "Switch between two Real signals"
msgstr "在两个实数信号之间切换"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Switch"
msgid "Connector of first Real input signal"
msgstr "第一个实数输入信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Switch"
msgid "Connector of Boolean input signal"
msgstr "布尔输入信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Switch"
msgid "Connector of second Real input signal"
msgstr "第二个实数输入信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Switch"
msgid "Connector of Real output signal"
msgstr "实数输出信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Switch"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The Logical.Switch switches, depending on the\r\n"
"logical connector u2 (the middle connector)\r\n"
"between the two possible input signals\r\n"
"u1 (upper connector) and u3 (lower connector).</p>\r\n"
"<p>If u2 is <strong>true</strong>, the output signal y is set equal to\r\n"
"u1, else it is set equal to u3.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"Logical.Switch 根据逻辑连接器 u2（中间连接器）在两个可能的输入信号 u1（上连接器）和 u3（下连接器）之间进行切换。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果 u2 为<strong>true</strong>，输出信号 y 设置为等于 u1，否则设置为等于 u3。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.IntegerSwitch"
msgid "Switch between two Integer signals"
msgstr "在两个整型信号之间切换"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.IntegerSwitch"
msgid "Connector of first integer input signal"
msgstr "第一个整型输入信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.IntegerSwitch"
msgid "Connector of Boolean input signal"
msgstr "布尔输入信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.IntegerSwitch"
msgid "Connector of second integer input signal"
msgstr "第二个整型输入信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.IntegerSwitch"
msgid "Connector of integer output signal"
msgstr "实数输出信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.IntegerSwitch"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The Logical.Switch switches, depending on the\r\n"
"logical connector u2 (the middle connector)\r\n"
"between the two possible input signals\r\n"
"u1 (upper connector) and u3 (lower connector).</p>\r\n"
"<p>If u2 is <strong>true</strong>, the output signal y is set equal to\r\n"
"u1, else it is set equal to u3.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"Logical.IntegerSwitch 根据逻辑连接器 u2（中间连接器）在两个可能的输入信号 u1（上连接器）和 u3（下连接器）之间进行切换。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果 u2 为<strong>true</strong>，输出信号 y 设置为等于 u1，否则设置为等于 u3。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Hysteresis"
msgid "Transform Real to Boolean signal with Hysteresis"
msgstr "将实数信号转换为带滞后的布尔信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Hysteresis"
msgid "If y=true and u<uLow, switch to y=false"
msgstr "如果y=true且u<uLow，则切换为y=false"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Hysteresis"
msgid "If y=false and u>uHigh, switch to y=true"
msgstr "如果y=false且u>uHigh，则切换为y=true"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Hysteresis"
msgid "Value of pre(y) at initial time"
msgstr "初始时的pre(y)值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Hysteresis"
msgid "%uLow"
msgstr "%uLow"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Hysteresis"
msgid "%uHigh"
msgstr "%uHigh"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Hysteresis"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block transforms a <strong>Real</strong> input signal <strong>u</strong> into a <strong>Boolean</strong>\r\n"
"output signal <strong>y</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Logical/Hysteresis.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"Hysteresis.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> When the output was <strong>false</strong> and the input becomes\r\n"
"     <strong>greater</strong> than parameter <strong>uHigh</strong>, the output\r\n"
"     switches to <strong>true</strong>.</li>\r\n"
"<li> When the output was <strong>true</strong> and the input becomes\r\n"
"     <strong>less</strong> than parameter <strong>uLow</strong>, the output\r\n"
"     switches to <strong>false</strong>.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The start value of the output is defined via parameter\r\n"
"<strong>pre_y_start</strong> (= value of pre(y) at initial time).\r\n"
"The default value of this parameter is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将<strong>Real</strong>输入信号<strong>u</strong>转换为<strong>Boolean</strong>输出信号<strong>y</strong>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Logical/Hysteresis.png\" alt=\"Hysteresis.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul><li>\r\n"
"当输出为<strong>false</strong>且输入<strong>greater</strong>参数<strong>uHigh</strong>时， 输出切换为<strong>true</strong>。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"当输出为<strong>true</strong>且输入<strong>less</strong>参数<strong>uLow</strong>时， 输出切换为<strong>false</strong>。</li>\r\n"
"</ul><p>\r\n"
"输出的起始值通过参数<strong>pre_y_start</strong>（= 初始时的 pre(y) 值）定义。 该参数的默认值为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.OnOffController"
msgid "On-off controller"
msgstr "开/关控制器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.OnOffController"
msgid "Connector of Real input signal used as reference signal"
msgstr "用作参考信号的实数输入信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.OnOffController"
msgid "Connector of Real input signal used as measurement signal"
msgstr "用作测量信号的实数输入信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.OnOffController"
msgid "Connector of Real output signal used as actuator signal"
msgstr "用作制动信号的实数输出信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.OnOffController"
msgid "Bandwidth around reference signal"
msgstr "参考信号周围的带宽"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.OnOffController"
msgid "Value of pre(y) at initial time"
msgstr "初始时的pre(y)值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.OnOffController"
msgid "reference"
msgstr "reference"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.OnOffController"
msgid "u"
msgstr "u"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.OnOffController"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The block OnOffController sets the output signal <strong>y</strong> to <strong>true</strong> when\r\n"
"the input signal <strong>u</strong> falls below the <strong>reference</strong> signal minus half of\r\n"
"the bandwidth and sets the output signal <strong>y</strong> to <strong>false</strong> when the input\r\n"
"signal <strong>u</strong> exceeds the <strong>reference</strong> signal plus half of the bandwidth.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>当输入信号 <strong>u</strong>低于<strong>reference</strong>信号带宽的一半时，\r\n"
"OnOffController 模块将输出信号<strong>y</strong>设为<strong>true</strong>；\r\n"
"当输入信号<strong>u</strong>超过<strong>reference</strong>信号带宽的一半时，\r\n"
"OnOffController 模块将输出信号<strong>y</strong>设为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TriggeredTrapezoid"
msgid "Triggered trapezoid generator"
msgstr "触发式梯形信号发生器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TriggeredTrapezoid"
msgid "Amplitude of trapezoid"
msgstr "梯形振幅"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TriggeredTrapezoid"
msgid "Rising duration of trapezoid"
msgstr "梯形上升持续时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TriggeredTrapezoid"
msgid "Falling duration of trapezoid"
msgstr "梯形下降持续时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TriggeredTrapezoid"
msgid "Offset of output signal"
msgstr "输出信号偏移"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TriggeredTrapezoid"
msgid "Connector of Boolean input signal"
msgstr "布尔输入信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TriggeredTrapezoid"
msgid "Connector of Real output signal"
msgstr "实数输出信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TriggeredTrapezoid"
msgid "Value of y at time of recent edge"
msgstr "最近边缘时刻y的值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TriggeredTrapezoid"
msgid "Current rising/falling rate"
msgstr "当前上升/下降率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TriggeredTrapezoid"
msgid "Predicted time of output reaching endValue"
msgstr "输出达到终值的预测时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TriggeredTrapezoid"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The block TriggeredTrapezoid has a Boolean input and a real\r\n"
"output signal and requires the parameters <em>amplitude</em>,\r\n"
"<em>rising</em>, <em>falling</em> and <em>offset</em>. The\r\n"
"output signal <strong>y</strong> represents a trapezoidal signal dependent on the\r\n"
"input signal <strong>u</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Logical/TriggeredTrapezoid.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"TriggeredTrapezoid.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>The behaviour is as follows: Assume the initial input to be false. In this\r\n"
"case, the output will be <em>offset</em>. After a rising edge (i.e., the input\r\n"
"changes from false to true), the output is rising during <em>rising</em> to the\r\n"
"sum of <em>offset</em> and <em>amplitude</em>. In contrast, after a falling\r\n"
"edge (i.e., the input changes from true to false), the output is falling\r\n"
"during <em>falling</em> to a value of <em>offset</em>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>Note, that the case of edges before expiration of rising or falling is\r\n"
"handled properly.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"TriggeredTrapezoid 模块有一个布尔输入和一个实数输出信号， 需要<em>amplitude</em>、<em>rising</em>、<em>falling</em>和<em>offset</em>参数。 输出信号<strong>y</strong>代表一个梯形信号，取决于输入信号<strong>u</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Logical/TriggeredTrapezoid.png\" alt=\"TriggeredTrapezoid.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其行为如下：假设初始输入为false。 在这种情况下，输出将是<em>offset</em>的。 在上升沿后（即输入由false变true），输出在<em>rising</em>期间上升，达到<em>offset</em>和<em>amplitude</em>之和。 相反，在下降沿后（即输入由true变false），输出在<em>falling</em>期间下降到<em>offset</em>值。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请注意，在上升或下降沿到终点前边缘情况已经得到妥善处理。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Timer"
msgid "Timer measuring the time from the time instant where the Boolean input became true"
msgstr "计时器测量从布尔输入变为真的时间瞬间开始的时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Timer"
msgid "Connector of Boolean input signal"
msgstr "布尔输入信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Timer"
msgid "Connector of Real output signal"
msgstr "实数输出信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Timer"
msgid "Time instant when u became true"
msgstr "u变为真的时间瞬间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Timer"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>When the Boolean input <strong>u</strong> becomes <strong>true</strong>, the timer starts\r\n"
"and the output <strong>y</strong> is the time that has elapsed since <strong>u</strong> became <strong>true</strong>.\r\n"
"When the input becomes <strong>false</strong>, the timer stops and the output is reset to zero.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Logical/Timer.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"Timer.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"当布尔输入<strong>u</strong>为<strong>true</strong>时，计时器开始计时， 输出<strong>y</strong>是<strong>u</strong>为 <strong>true</strong>后经过的时间。 当输入变为<strong>false</strong>时，计时器停止，输出重置为零。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Logical/Timer.png\" alt=\"Timer.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.LogicalDelay"
msgid "Delay boolean signal"
msgstr "延迟布尔信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.LogicalDelay"
msgid "Time delay"
msgstr "时间延迟"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.LogicalDelay"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"When input <code>u</code> gets true, output <code>y1</code> gets immediately true, whereas output <code>y2</code> gets true after <code>delayTime</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"When input <code>u</code> gets false, output <code>y1</code> gets false after <code>delayTime</code>, whereas output <code>y2</code> gets immediately false.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"当输入<code>u</code>为真时，输出<code>y1</code>立即为真，\r\n"
"输出<code>y2</code>则在<code>delayTime</code>后为真。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"当输入<code>u</code>变为假时，输出<code>y1</code>在<code>delayTime</code>后变为假，\r\n"
"而输出<code>y2</code>则立即变为假。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.RSFlipFlop"
msgid "A basic RS Flip Flop"
msgstr "基本RS触发器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.RSFlipFlop"
msgid "Start value of Q at initial time"
msgstr "初始时Q的起始值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.RSFlipFlop"
msgid "R"
msgstr "R"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.RSFlipFlop"
msgid "S"
msgstr "S"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.RSFlipFlop"
msgid "Q"
msgstr "Q"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.RSFlipFlop"
msgid "Q!"
msgstr "Q!"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.RSFlipFlop"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output <code>Q</code> is set by the input <code>S</code>, is reset by the input <code>R</code>, and keeps its value in between. <code>QI</code> is the inverse of <code>Q</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"输出<code>Q</code>由输入<code>S</code>设置，\r\n"
"由输入<code>R</code>复位，并在两者之间保持其值。\r\n"
"<code>QI</code>是<code>Q</code>的倒数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TerminateSimulation"
msgid "Terminate simulation if condition is fulfilled"
msgstr "如果条件满足，则终止模拟"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TerminateSimulation"
msgid "Terminate simulation when condition becomes true"
msgstr "条件为真时终止模拟"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TerminateSimulation"
msgid "Text that will be displayed when simulation is terminated"
msgstr "模拟终止时将显示的文本"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TerminateSimulation"
msgid "%condition"
msgstr "%condition"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TerminateSimulation"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TerminateSimulation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In the parameter menu, a <strong>time varying</strong> expression can be defined\r\n"
"via variable <strong>condition</strong>, for example \"condition = x &lt; 0\",\r\n"
"where \"x\" is a variable that is declared in the model in which the\r\n"
"\"TerminateSimulation\" block is present.\r\n"
"If this expression becomes <strong>true</strong>,\r\n"
"the simulation is (successfully) terminated. A termination message\r\n"
"explaining the reason for the termination can be given via\r\n"
"parameter \"terminationText\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在参数菜单中，可以通过变量<strong>condition</strong>定义<strong>time varying</strong>表达式，\r\n"
"例如 condition = x &lt; 0，其中 x 是在模型中声明的变量，TerminateSimulation 模块就在模型中。\r\n"
"如果该表达式为<strong>true</strong>，则模拟（成功）终止。\r\n"
"可以通过参数 termininationText 给出终止信息，解释终止的原因。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math"
msgid "Library of Real mathematical functions as input/output blocks"
msgstr "作为输入/输出块的实数函数库"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains basic <strong>mathematical operations</strong>,\r\n"
"such as summation and multiplication, and basic <strong>mathematical\r\n"
"functions</strong>, such as <strong>sqrt</strong> and <strong>sin</strong>, as\r\n"
"input/output blocks. All blocks of this library can be either\r\n"
"connected with continuous blocks or with sampled-data blocks.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">此包包含基本的</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>数学运算</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">，如加法和乘法，以及基本的</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>数学函数</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">，如平方根（sqrt）和正弦（sin），作为输入/输出块。该库中的所有块既可以与连续块连接，也可以与采样数据块连接。</span>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

