msgstr "Output signal 2 (y1 = y2)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.InverseBlockConstraints"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Exchange input and output signals of a block, i.e., the previous\r\n"
"block inputs become block outputs and the previous block outputs become\r\n"
"block inputs. This block is used to construct inverse models.\r\n"
"Its usage is demonstrated in example:\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.InverseModel\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.InverseModel</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, if a block shall be inverted that has several input and output blocks,\r\n"
"then this can be easily achieved by using a vector of InverseBlockConstraints\r\n"
"instances:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"InverseBlockConstraint invert[3];  // Block to be inverted has 3 input signals\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"交换模块的输入和输出信号，即之前的模块输入变为模块输出，之前的模块输出变为模块输入。\r\n"
"该模块用于构建反演模型。示例演示了其用法：\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.InverseModel\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.InverseModel</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请注意，如果需要反转的模块有多个输入和输出模块，\r\n"
"则可以通过使用 InverseBlockConstraints 实例矢量来轻松实现：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"InverseBlockConstraint invert[3];  // Block to be inverted has 3 input signals\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Gain"
msgid "Output the product of a gain value with the input signal"
msgstr "输出增益值与输入信号的乘积"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Gain"
msgid "Gain value multiplied with input signal"
msgstr "与输入信号相乘的增益值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Gain"
msgid "Input signal connector"
msgstr "输入信号接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Gain"
msgid "Output signal connector"
msgstr "输出信号接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Gain"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block computes output <em>y</em> as\r\n"
"<em>product</em> of gain <em>k</em> with the\r\n"
"input <em>u</em>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = k * u;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块计算的输出<em>y</em>是增益<em>k</em>与输入<em>u &nbsp;</em>的<em>乘积</em>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = k * u;</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Gain"
msgid "k=%k"
msgstr "k=%k"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Gain"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MatrixGain"
msgid "Output the product of a gain matrix with the input signal vector"
msgstr "输出增益矩阵与输入信号矢量的乘积"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MatrixGain"
msgid "Gain matrix which is multiplied with the input"
msgstr "与输入相乘的增益矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MatrixGain"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes output vector <strong>y</strong> as <em>product</em> of the\r\n"
"gain matrix <strong>K</strong> with the input signal vector <strong>u</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>y</strong> = <strong>K</strong> * <strong>u</strong>;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Example:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"parameter: <strong>K</strong> = [0.12 2; 3 1.5]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in the following equations:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"  | y[1] |     | 0.12  2.00 |   | u[1] |\r\n"
"  |      |  =  |            | * |      |\r\n"
"  | y[2] |     | 3.00  1.50 |   | u[2] |\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块计算的输出向量<strong>y</strong>是增益矩阵<strong>K</strong> 与输入信号向量<strong>u</strong>的<em>乘积</em>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = K * u;\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"例如:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >parameter: K = [0.12 2; 3 1.5]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in the following equations:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"| y[1] |     | 0.12  2.00 |   | u[1] |\r\n"
"|      |  =  |            | * |      |\r\n"
"| y[2] |     | 3.00  1.50 |   | u[2] |\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MatrixGain"
msgid "*K"
msgstr "*K"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSum"
msgid "Sum of Reals: y = k[1]*u[1] + k[2]*u[2] + ... + k[n]*u[n]"
msgstr "实数之和：y=k[1]*u[1]+k[2]*u[2]+...+k[n]*u[n]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSum"
msgid "Input gains"
msgstr "输入增益"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSum"
msgid "%k"
msgstr "%k"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSum"
msgid "+"
msgstr "+"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSum"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes the scalar Real output \"y\" as sum of the elements of the\r\n"
"Real input signal vector u:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = k[1]*u[1] + k[2]*u[2] + ... k[N]*u[N];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input connector is a vector of Real input signals.\r\n"
"When a connection line is drawn, the dimension of the input\r\n"
"vector is enlarged by one and the connection is automatically\r\n"
"connected to this new free index (thanks to the\r\n"
"connectorSizing annotation).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If no connection to the input connector \"u\" is present,\r\n"
"the output is set to zero: y=0.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模块计算的标量实数输出 y 是实数输入信号向量 u 的元素之和：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = k[1]*u[1] + k[2]*u[2] + ... k[N]*u[N];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"输入接口是一个实数输入信号的向量。\r\n"
"绘制连接线时，输入矢量的尺寸会放大一个，\r\n"
"连接线会自动连接到这个新的自由索引（这要归功于 connectorSizing 注解）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法 \r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果输入接口 u 没有连接，则输出设置为零：y=0。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiProduct"
msgid "Product of Reals: y = u[1]*u[2]* ... *u[n]"
msgstr "实数相乘：y=u[1]*u[2]*...*u[n]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiProduct"
msgid "*"
msgstr "*"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiProduct"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes the scalar Real output \"y\" as product of the elements of the\r\n"
"Real input signal vector u:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = u[1]*u[2]* ... *u[N];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input connector is a vector of Real input signals.\r\n"
"When a connection line is drawn, the dimension of the input\r\n"
"vector is enlarged by one and the connection is automatically\r\n"
"connected to this new free index (thanks to the\r\n"
"connectorSizing annotation).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If no connection to the input connector \"u\" is present,\r\n"
"the output is set to zero: y=0.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块计算的是实数输出标量 y 与实数输入信号向量 u 的乘积：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = u[1]*u[2]* ... *u[N];</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"输入接口是一个实数输入信号的向量。 绘制连接线时，输入矢量的尺寸会放大一个， 连接线会自动连接到这个新的自由索引（这要归功于 connectorSizing 注解）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果输入接口 u 没有连接，则输出设置为零：y=0。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Set Real expression that is associated with the first active input signal"
msgstr "设置与第一个有效输入信号相关联的实数表达式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSwitch"
msgid "y = if u[i] then expr[i] else y_default (time varying)"
msgstr "y=如果u[i]为真，那么expr[i]，否则为y_default(随时间变化)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Default value of output y if all u[i] = false"
msgstr "如果所有u[i]=false，输出y的默认值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Number of input connections"
msgstr "输入接口数量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Number of significant digits to be shown in dynamic diagram layer for y"
msgstr "y的动态图表层中显示的有效数字位数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Set y = expr[i], if u[i] = true"
msgstr "设置y=expr[i]，如果u[i]=true"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Output depending on expression"
msgstr "输出取决于表达式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSwitch"
msgid "%expr"
msgstr "%expr"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSwitch"
msgid "else: %y_default"
msgstr "else: %y_default"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSwitch"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MultiSwitch"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block has a vector of Boolean input signals u[nu] and a vector of\r\n"
"(time varying) Real expressions expr[nu]. The output signal y is\r\n"
"set to expr[i], if i is the first element in the input vector u that is true. If all input signals are\r\n"
"false, y is set to parameter \"y_default\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// Conceptual equation (not valid Modelica)\r\n"
"i = 'first element of u[:] that is true';\r\n"
"y = <strong>if</strong> i==0 <strong>then</strong> y_default <strong>else</strong> expr[i];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input connector is a vector of Boolean input signals.\r\n"
"When a connection line is drawn, the dimension of the input\r\n"
"vector is enlarged by one and the connection is automatically\r\n"
"connected to this new free index (thanks to the\r\n"
"connectorSizing annotation).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块有一个布尔输入信号向量 u[nu] 和一个（随时间变化的）实数表达式向量 expr[nu]。 如果 i 是输入向量 u 中第一个为真的元素，则输出信号 y 设置为 expr[i]。 如果所有输入信号都为假，则 y 设置为参数 y_default。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >// Conceptual equation (not valid Modelica)\r\n"
"i = \\'first element of u[:] that is true\\';\r\n"
"y = if i==0 then y_default else expr[i];</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"输入接口是布尔输入信号的向量。 在绘制连接线时，输入向量的尺寸会放大一个， 连接线会自动连接到这个新的空闲索引（这要归功于 connectorSizing 注解）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.RealNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Sum"
msgid "Output the sum of the elements of the input vector"
msgstr "输出输入向量元素之和"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Sum"
msgid "Optional: sum coefficients"
msgstr "可选：系数总和"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Sum"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes output <strong>y</strong> as\r\n"
"<em>sum</em> of the elements of the input signal vector\r\n"
"<strong>u</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>y</strong> = <strong>u</strong>[1] + <strong>u</strong>[2] + ...;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Example:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"   parameter:   nin = 3;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in the following equations:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"   y = u[1] + u[2] + u[3];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将输出<strong>y</strong>计算为输入信号向量<strong>u</strong>的元素之<em>和</em>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = u[1] + u[2] + ...;</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"例如:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >parameter:   nin = 3;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in the following equations:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"y = u[1] + u[2] + u[3];</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Feedback"
msgid "Output difference between commanded and feedback input"
msgstr "指令和反馈输入之间的差"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Feedback"
msgid "Commanded input"
msgstr "指令输入"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Feedback"
msgid "Feedback input"
msgstr "反馈输入"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Feedback"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes output <strong>y</strong> as <em>difference</em> of the\r\n"
"commanded input <strong>u1</strong> and the feedback\r\n"
"input <strong>u2</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>y</strong> = <strong>u1</strong> - <strong>u2</strong>;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Example:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"   parameter:   n = 2\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in the following equations:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"   y = u1 - u2\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将指令输入<strong>u1</strong>和反馈输入<strong>u2</strong> 的<em>差值 </em>作为输出<strong>y</strong>计算：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = u1 - u2;</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"例如:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >parameter:   n = 2\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in the following equations:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"y = u1 - u2</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Feedback"
msgid "-"
msgstr "-"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Feedback"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Add"
msgid "Output the sum of the two inputs"
msgstr "输出两个输入的总和"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Add"
msgid "Gain of input signal 1"
msgstr "输入信号增益1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Add"
msgid "Gain of input signal 2"
msgstr "输入信号增益2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Add"
msgid "Interface data type"
msgstr "接口数据类型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Add"
msgid "Connector of Real input signal 1"
msgstr "实型输入信号1接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Add"
msgid "Connector of Real input signal 2"
msgstr "实型输入信号2接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Add"
msgid "Connector of Integer input signal 1"
msgstr "整型输入信号1接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Add"
msgid "Connector of Integer input signal 2"
msgstr "整型输入信号2接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Add"
msgid "Connector of Boolean input signal 1"
msgstr "布尔型输入信号1接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Add"
msgid "Connector of Boolean input signal 2"
msgstr "布尔型输入信号2接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Add"
msgid "Connector of Real output signal"
msgstr "实型输出信号接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Add"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes output <strong>y</strong> as <em>sum</em> of the\r\n"
"two input signals <strong>u1</strong> and <strong>u2</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>y</strong> = k1*<strong>u1</strong> + k2*<strong>u2</strong>;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Example:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"   parameter:   k1= +2, k2= -3\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in the following equations:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"   y = 2 * u1 - 3 * u2\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将输出<strong>y</strong>计算为两个输入信号 <strong>u1</strong>和<strong>u2</strong>之<em>和</em>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = k1*u1 + k2*u2;</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"例如:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >parameter:   k1= +2, k2= -3\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in the following equations:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"y = 2 * u1 - 3 * u2</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

