msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Product"
msgid "Connector of Boolean input signal 2"
msgstr "布尔型输入信号2接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Product"
msgid "Connector of Real output signal"
msgstr "实型输出信号接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Product"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes the output <strong>y</strong>\r\n"
"as <em>product</em> of the two inputs <strong>u1</strong> and <strong>u2</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = u1 * u2;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将输出<strong>y</strong>计算为两个输入 <strong>u1</strong>和<strong>u2</strong>的<em>乘积 </em>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = u1 * u2;</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Division"
msgid "Output first input divided by second input"
msgstr "输出第一个输入除以第二个输入"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Division"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block computes the output (quotient) <strong>y</strong>\r\n"
"by <em>dividing</em> the two inputs <strong>u1</strong> (dividend) and <strong>u2</strong> (divisor):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = u1 / u2;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块通过两个输入 <strong>u1</strong>（被除数）和<strong>u2</strong>（除数） 相除来计算输出（商）<strong>y</strong>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = u1 / u2;</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

