"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果u是pi的倍数，y = cot(u)为正负无穷大。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Asin"
msgid "Output the arc sine of the input"
msgstr "输出输入的反正弦值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Asin"
msgid "asin"
msgstr "asin"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Asin"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes the output <strong>y</strong> as the\r\n"
"<em>sine-inverse</em> of the input <strong>u</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = <strong>asin</strong>( u );\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The absolute value of the input <strong>u</strong> need to\r\n"
"be less or equal to one (<strong>abs</strong>( u ) <= 1).\r\n"
"Otherwise an error occurs.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/asin.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"atan.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将输出<strong>y</strong> 计算为输入<strong>u</strong>的<em>反正弦值</em>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = asin( u );</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"输入<strong>u</strong>的绝对值必须小于或等于 1（<strong>abs</strong>( u ) &lt;= 1）。 否则会出错。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/asin.png\" alt=\"atan.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Acos"
msgid "Output the arc cosine of the input"
msgstr "输出输入值的反余弦值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Acos"
msgid "acos"
msgstr "acos"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Acos"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes the output <strong>y</strong> as the\r\n"
"<em>cosine-inverse</em> of the input <strong>u</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = <strong>acos</strong>( u );\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The absolute value of the input <strong>u</strong> need to\r\n"
"be less or equal to one (<strong>abs</strong>( u ) <= 1).\r\n"
"Otherwise an error occurs.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/acos.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"acos.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将输出<strong>y</strong>计算为输入<strong>u</strong>的<em>反余弦值</em>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = acos( u );</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"输入<strong>u</strong>的绝对值必须小于或等于 1（<strong>abs</strong>( u ) &lt;= 1）。 否则会出错。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/acos.png\" alt=\"acos.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Atan"
msgid "Output the arc tangent of the input"
msgstr "输出输入的反正切值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Atan"
msgid "atan"
msgstr "atan"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Atan"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes the output <strong>y</strong> as the\r\n"
"<em>tangent-inverse</em> of the input <strong>u</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y= <strong>atan</strong>( u );\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/atan.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"atan.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将输出<strong>y</strong> 计算为输入<strong>u</strong>的<em>反正切值</em>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y= <strong>atan</strong>( u );\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/atan.png\"\r\n"
"   alt=\"atan.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Atan2"
msgid "Output atan(u1/u2) of the inputs u1 and u2"
msgstr "输出为输入u1和u2的atan(u1/u2)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Atan2"
msgid "atan2"
msgstr "atan2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Atan2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes the output <strong>y</strong> as the\r\n"
"<em>tangent-inverse</em> of the input <strong>u1</strong> divided by\r\n"
"input <strong>u2</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = <strong>atan2</strong>( u1, u2 );\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"u1 and u2 shall not be zero at the same time instant.\r\n"
"<strong>Atan2</strong> uses the sign of u1 and u2 in order to construct\r\n"
"the solution in the range -180 deg &le; y &le; 180 deg, whereas\r\n"
"block <strong>Atan</strong> gives a solution in the range\r\n"
"-90 deg &le; y &le; 90 deg.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/atan2.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"atan2.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将输出<strong>y</strong>计算为输入 <strong>u1</strong>除以输入<strong>u2</strong>的<em>反正切值</em>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = atan2( u1, u2 );</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"u1 和 u2 在同一时刻不得为零。 <strong>Atan2</strong>使用 u1 和 u2 的符号来构建 -180 deg ≤ y ≤ 180 度范围内的解， 而模块<strong>Atan</strong>则给出 -90 deg ≤ y ≤ 90 度范围内的解。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/atan2.png\" alt=\"atan2.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

