"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将输出<strong>y</strong>计算为 输入<strong>u</strong>的<em>双曲正切值</em>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = <strong>tanh</strong>( u );\r\n"
