msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RectangularToPolar"
msgid "Convert rectangular coordinates to polar coordinates"
msgstr "将直角坐标转换为极坐标"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RectangularToPolar"
msgid "Real part of rectangular representation"
msgstr "直角坐标的实部"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RectangularToPolar"
msgid "Imaginary part of rectangular representation"
msgstr "直角坐标的虚部"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RectangularToPolar"
msgid "Length of polar representation"
msgstr "极坐标长度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RectangularToPolar"
msgid "Angle of polar representation"
msgstr "极坐标角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RectangularToPolar"
msgid "re"
msgstr "re"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RectangularToPolar"
msgid "im"
msgstr "im"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RectangularToPolar"
msgid "abs"
msgstr "abs"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RectangularToPolar"
msgid "arg"
msgstr "arg"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RectangularToPolar"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input values of this block are the rectangular components\r\n"
"<code>u_re</code> and <code>u_im</code> of a phasor in two dimensions.\r\n"
"This block calculates the length <code>y_abs</code> and\r\n"
"the angle <code>y_arg</code> of the polar representation of this phasor.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y_abs = abs(u_re + j*u_im) = sqrt( u_re<sup>2</sup> + u_im<sup>2</sup> )\r\n"
"y_arg = arg(u_re + j*u_im) = atan2(u_im, u_re)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块的输入值是二维相量的直角分量<code>u_re</code>和<code>u_im</code>。 该模块计算了该相量的极坐标表示的长度<code>y_abs</code>和角度<code>y_arg</code>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y_abs = abs(u_re + j*u_im) = sqrt( u_re2 + u_im2 )\r\n"
"y_arg = arg(u_re + j*u_im) = atan2(u_im, u_re)</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.PolarToRectangular"
msgid "Convert polar coordinates to rectangular coordinates"
msgstr "将极坐标转换为直角坐标"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.PolarToRectangular"
msgid "Length of polar representation"
msgstr "极坐标长度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.PolarToRectangular"
msgid "Angle of polar representation"
msgstr "极坐标角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.PolarToRectangular"
msgid "Real part of rectangular representation"
msgstr "直角坐标的实部"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.PolarToRectangular"
msgid "Imaginary part of rectangular representation"
msgstr "直角坐标的虚部"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.PolarToRectangular"
msgid "abs"
msgstr "abs"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.PolarToRectangular"
msgid "arg"
msgstr "arg"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.PolarToRectangular"
msgid "re"
msgstr "re"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.PolarToRectangular"
msgid "im"
msgstr "im"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.PolarToRectangular"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input values of this block are the polar components <code>uabs</code> and <code>uarg</code> of a phasor.\r\n"
"This block calculates the components <code>y_re</code> and <code>y_im</code> of the rectangular representation of this phasor.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y_re = u_abs * cos( u_arg )\r\n"
"y_im = u_abs * sin( u_arg )\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块的输入值是相量的极坐标分量<code>uabs</code>和<code>uarg</code>。 该模块计算了该相量的直角表示的分量<code>y_re</code>和<code>y_im</code>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y_re = u_abs * cos( u_arg )\r\n"
"y_im = u_abs * sin( u_arg )</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Mean"
msgid "Calculate mean over period 1/f"
msgstr "计算1/f期间的平均值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Mean"
msgid "Base frequency"
msgstr "基础频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Mean"
msgid "Start value of integrator state"
msgstr "积分器状态的起始值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Mean"
msgid "= true, if output y is guaranteed to be >= 0 for the exact solution"
msgstr "=true，如果精确解的输出y保证>=0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Mean"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Mean"
msgid "Start time of simulation"
msgstr "仿真开始时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Mean"
msgid "Integrator state"
msgstr "积分器状态"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Mean"
msgid "Last sampled mean value"
msgstr "上次采样的平均值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Mean"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block calculates the mean of the input signal u over the given period 1/f:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"1 T\r\n"
"- &int; u(t) dt\r\n"
"T 0\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note: The output is updated after each period defined by 1/f.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If parameter <strong>yGreaterOrEqualZero</strong> in the Advanced tab is <strong>true</strong> (default = <strong>false</strong>),\r\n"
"then the modeller provides the information that the mean of the input signal is guaranteed\r\n"
"to be &ge; 0 for the exact solution. However, due to inaccuracies in the numerical integration scheme,\r\n"
"the output might be slightly negative. If this parameter is set to true, then the output is\r\n"
"explicitly set to 0.0, if the mean value results in a negative value.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块计算输入信号 u 在给定周期 1/f 内的平均值：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >1 T\r\n"
"- ∫ u(t) dt\r\n"
"T 0</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"注：每隔 1/f 定义的周期后，输出会更新。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">如果“高级”选项卡中的参数 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>yGreaterOrEqualZero </strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">为 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>true</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">（默认 = </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>false</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">），则模型提供信息，表示输入信号的均值对于精确解来说保证大于或等于 0。然而，由于数值积分方案中的不准确性，输出可能略微为负。如果此参数设置为 true，则如果均值结果为负值，输出将明确设置为 0.0。</span>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

