msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RootMeanSquare"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block calculates the root mean square of the input signal u over the given period 1/f, using the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Math.Mean\">mean block</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note: The output is updated after each period defined by 1/f.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块利用<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Math.Mean\" target=\"\">mean block</a>计算输入信号 u 在给定周期 1/f 内的均方根。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注：输出在 1/f 所定义的每个周期后更新。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

