msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.TotalHarmonicDistortion"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This block determines the total harmonic distortion (THD) over the given period <code>1/f</code>.\r\n"
"Consider that the input <code>u</code> consists of harmonic RMS components\r\n"
"<code>U<sub>1</sub></code>, <code>U<sub>2</sub></code>, <code>U<sub>3</sub></code>, etc.\r\n"
"The total RMS component is then determined by:</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Math/Urms.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The calculation of the total harmonic distortion is based on the parameter <code>useFirstHarmonic</code>.\r\n"
"The default value <code>useFirstHarmonic = true</code> represents the <strong>standard</strong> THD calculation used in\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://www.electropedia.org/iev/iev.nsf/display?openform&amp;ievref=551-20-13\">electrical engineering</a>.\r\n"
"The non-default value <code>useFirstHarmonic = false</code>\r\n"
"calculates the THD typically used for the assessment of audio signals.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If <code>useFirstHarmonic = true</code>, the total higher harmonic content (harmonic order numbers &gt; 1)\r\n"
"refers to the RMS value of the fundamental wave:<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Math/THD1.png\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If <code>useFirstHarmonic = false</code>, the total higher harmonic content (harmonic order numbers &gt; 1)\r\n"
"refers to the total RMS:<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Math/THDrms.png\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In case of a zero input signal or within the first period of calculation, the boolean output signal\r\n"
"<code>valid</code> becomes <code>false</code> to indicate that the calculation result is not valid. Valid\r\n"
"calculations are indicated by <code>valid = true</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块确定给定周期 <code>1/f</code> 内的总谐波失真（THD）。 考虑到输入 <code>u</code> 包含谐波 RMS 分量 <sub><code>U1</code></sub>, <sub><code>U2</code></sub>, <sub><code>U3</code></sub> 等等。 总 RMS 分量然后由以下公式确定：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Math/Urms.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"总谐波失真的计算基于参数 <code>useFirstHarmonic</code>。 默认值 <code>useFirstHarmonic = true</code> 表示在 <a href=\"http://www.electropedia.org/iev/iev.nsf/display?openform&ievref=551-20-13\" target=\"\">electrical engineering</a>&nbsp; 中使用的<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>标准</strong></span>THD 计算。 非默认值 <code>useFirstHarmonic = false</code> 计算通常用于评估音频信号的 THD。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果 <code>useFirstHarmonic = true</code>，总高谐波内容（谐波阶数 &gt; 1）指的是基波的 RMS 值：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br> <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Math/THD1.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果 <code>useFirstHarmonic = false</code>，总高谐波内容（谐波阶数 &gt; 1）指的是总 RMS：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br> <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Math/THDrms.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果输入信号为零或在计算的第一周期内，布尔输出信号<code>valid</code>变为<code>false</code>， 表示计算结果无效。有效的计算用<code>valid = true 。</code>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.FFT"
