"<p>\n"
"This model defines a Fast Fourier Transform (FFT) model, which takes an input signal x[n] of length n and\n"
"produces the transformed real and imaginary parts as output.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个模型定义了一个快速傅里叶变换(Fast Fourier Transform, FFT)模型，接受长度为n的输入信号x[n]，\r\n"
"并生成转换后的实部和虚部作为输出。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

