msgstr "FFT相位"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RealFFT"
msgid "Sample ticks"
msgstr "采样时刻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RealFFT"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block samples the input signal, calculates the Fast Fourier Transform by function <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.FastFourierTransform.realFFT\">Math.realFFT</a>,\r\n"
"and (when simulation terminates) writes the output to result file resultFileName by function <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.FastFourierTransform.realFFTwriteToFile\">Math.realFFTwriteToFile</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The number of sampling points as well as the samplePeriod is calculated from desired maximum frequency f_max and frequency resolution f_res.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Note</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The user has to take care that enough points can be sampled before the simulation ends: startTime + (ns - 1)*samplePeriod <= stopTime.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The result file is written as mat, first column = frequency, second column = amplitudes, third column = phases. The frequency points are separated by rows with amplitude and phase = 0,\r\n"
"so one can plot the result directly as frequency lines.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模块对输入信号进行采样，\r\n"
"通过函数<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.FastFourierTransform.realFFT\">Math.realFFT</a>计算快速傅立叶变换，\r\n"
"并(在仿真结束时)通过函数<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.FastFourierTransform.realFFTwriteToFile\">Math.realFFTwriteToFile</a>将输出写入结果文件resultFileName。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"采样点数和采样周期根据所需的最大频率f_max和频率分辨率f_res计算得出。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>注意</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"用户必须确保在模拟结束前采样到足够的点：startTime + (ns - 1)*samplePeriod <= stopTime。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"结果文件以mat格式写入，第一列为频率，第二列为幅值，第三列为相位。\r\n"
"频率点由幅度和相位均为0的行分隔，因此可以直接将结果绘制为频率线。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RealFFTWithOutput"
msgid "Sampling and FFT of input u, with output of amplitudes and phases"
msgstr "对输入u进行采样和FFT，输出幅值和相位"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RealFFTWithOutput"
msgid "Maximum frequency of interest"
msgstr "关注的最大频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RealFFTWithOutput"
msgid "Frequency resolution"
msgstr "频率分辨率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RealFFTWithOutput"
msgid "Number of samples"
msgstr "采样点数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RealFFTWithOutput"
msgid "Number of frequency points"
msgstr "频率点数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RealFFTWithOutput"
msgid "Result file: f, y_amplitudes, y_phases"
msgstr "结果文件：f，y_amplitudes，y_phases"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RealFFTWithOutput"
msgid "Information flag from FFT computation"
msgstr "FFT计算的状态标志"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RealFFTWithOutput"
msgid "Input buffer"
msgstr "输入缓冲区"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RealFFTWithOutput"
msgid "Sample ticks"
msgstr "采样时钟"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RealFFTWithOutput"
msgid "FFT amplitudes"
msgstr "FFT幅值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RealFFTWithOutput"
msgid "FFT phases"
msgstr "FFT相位"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.RealFFTWithOutput"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block samples the input signal, calculates the Fast Fourier Transform by function <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.FastFourierTransform.realFFT\">Math.realFFT</a>,\r\n"
"and (when simulation terminates) writes the output to result file resultFileName by function <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.FastFourierTransform.realFFTwriteToFile\">Math.realFFTwriteToFile</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The number of sampling points as well as the samplePeriod is calculated from desired maximum frequency f_max and frequency resolution f_res.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Note</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The user has to take care that enough points can be sampled before the simulation ends: startTime + (ns - 1)*samplePeriod <= stopTime.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The result file is written as mat, first column = frequency, second column = amplitudes, third column = phases. The frequency points are separated by rows with amplitude and phase = 0,\r\n"
"so one can plot the result directly as frequency lines.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模块对输入信号进行采样，\r\n"
"通过函数<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.FastFourierTransform.realFFT\">Math.realFFT</a>计算快速傅立叶变换，\r\n"
"并(在仿真结束时)通过函数<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.FastFourierTransform.realFFTwriteToFile\">Math.realFFTwriteToFile</a>将输出写入结果文件resultFileName。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"采样点数和采样周期根据所需的最大频率f_max和频率分辨率f_res计算得出。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>注意</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"用户必须确保在模拟结束前采样到足够的点：startTime + (ns - 1)*samplePeriod <= stopTime。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"结果文件以mat格式写入，第一列为频率，第二列为幅值，第三列为相位。\r\n"
"频率点由幅度和相位均为0的行分隔，因此可以直接将结果绘制为频率线。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Pythagoras"
msgid "Determine the hypotenuse or leg of a right triangle"
msgstr "确定直角三角形的斜边或边长"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Pythagoras"
msgid "= true, if u1 is the hypotenuse and y is one leg"
msgstr "=为真，如果u1是斜边，y是一条边"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Pythagoras"
msgid "= true, if y is a valid result"
msgstr "=真，如果y是有效结果"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Pythagoras"
msgid "Square of y"
msgstr "y 的平方"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Pythagoras"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This block determines the hypotenuse <code>y = sqrt(u1^2 + u2^2)</code>\r\n"
"if the boolean parameter <code>u1IsHyotenuse = false</code>.\r\n"
"In this case the two inputs <code>u1</code> and\r\n"
"<code>u2</code> are interpreted as the legs of a right triangle\r\n"
"and the boolean output <code>valid</code> is always equal to\r\n"
"<code>true</code>.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>If <code>u1IsHyotenuse = true</code>, input <code>u1</code> is interpreted as hypotenuse and <code>u2</code>\r\n"
"is one of the two legs of a right triangle.\r\n"
"Then, the other of the two legs of the right triangle is the output, determined by\r\n"
"<code>y = sqrt(u1^2 - u2^2)</code>, if <code>u1^2 - u2^2 &ge; 0</code>; in this case the\r\n"
"boolean output <code>valid</code> is equal to <code>true</code>. In case of <code>u1^2 - u2^2 &lt; 0</code>, the\r\n"
"output <code>y = 0</code> and <code>valid</code> is set to <code>false</code>.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>如果布尔参数<code>u1IsHyotenuse = false</code>，\r\n"
"则该代码块将确定斜边<code>y = sqrt(u1^2 + u2^2)</code>。\r\n"
"在这种情况下，两个输入<code>u1</code>和<code>u2</code>被解释为直角三角形的两边，\r\n"
"布尔输出<code>valid</code>始终等于<code>true</code>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>如果<code>u1IsHyotenuse = true</code>，则输入的<code>u1</code>被解释为斜边，\r\n"
"而<code>u2</code>是直角三角形的两条边之一。\r\n"
"然后，如果<code>u1^2 - u2^2 &ge; 0</code>，直角三角形两条边中的另一条边就是输出，\r\n"
"由<code>y = sqrt(u1^2 - u2^2)</code>决定；在这种情况下，布尔输出<code>valid</code>等于<code>true</code>。\r\n"
"如果<code>u1^2 - u2^2 &lt; 0</code>，输出<code>y = 0</code>，<code>valid</code>设为<code>false</code>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Max"
msgid "Pass through the largest signal"
msgstr "传递最大信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Max"
msgid "max()"
msgstr "max()"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Max"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block computes the output <strong>y</strong> as <em>maximum</em>\r\n"
"of the two Real inputs <strong>u1</strong> and <strong>u2</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = <strong>max</strong> ( u1 , u2 );\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将输出<strong>y</strong>计算为两个实数输入<strong>u1</strong>和<strong>u2</strong>的<em>最大值</em>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = max ( u1 , u2 );</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Min"
msgid "Pass through the smallest signal"
msgstr "传递最小信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Min"
msgid "min()"
msgstr "min()"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Min"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block computes the output <strong>y</strong> as <em>minimum</em> of\r\n"
"the two Real inputs <strong>u1</strong> and <strong>u2</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = <strong>min</strong> ( u1 , u2 );\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将输出<strong>y</strong>计算为两个实数输入<strong>u1</strong>和<strong>u2</strong>的<em>最小值</em>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = min ( u1 , u2 );</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MinMax"
msgid "Output the minimum and the maximum element of the input vector"
msgstr "输出输入向量的最小和最大元素"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MinMax"
msgid "Number of input connections"
msgstr "输入接口数量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MinMax"
msgid "yMax"
msgstr "yMax"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MinMax"
msgid "yMin"
msgstr "yMin"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.MinMax"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Determines the minimum and maximum element of the input vector and\r\n"
"provide both values as output.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"确定输入向量的最小和最大元素，并将这两个值作为输出。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.LinearDependency"
msgid "Output a linear combination of the two inputs"
msgstr "输出两个输入的线性组合"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.LinearDependency"
msgid "Initial value"
msgstr "初始值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.LinearDependency"
msgid "Gain of u1"
msgstr "增益u1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.LinearDependency"
msgid "Gain of u2"
msgstr "增益u2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.LinearDependency"
msgid "%k1"
msgstr "%k1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.LinearDependency"
msgid "%k2"
msgstr "%k2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.LinearDependency"
msgid "%y0"
msgstr "%y0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.LinearDependency"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Determine the linear combination of the two inputs: <code>y = y0 + k1*u1 + k2*u2</code></p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>确定两个输入的线性组合： <code>y = y0 + k1*u1 + k2*u2</code></p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Edge"
msgid "Indicates rising edge of Boolean signal"
msgstr "表示布尔信号的上升沿"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Edge"
msgid "edge()"
msgstr "edge()"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Edge"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block sets the Boolean output <strong>y</strong> to true,\r\n"
"when the Boolean input <strong>u</strong> shows a <em>rising edge</em>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = <strong>edge</strong>( u );\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"当布尔输入<strong>u</strong>显示<em>上升沿</em>时，该模块将布尔输出<strong>y</strong>设为真：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = edge( u );</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.BooleanChange"
msgid "Indicates Boolean signal changing"
msgstr "表示布尔信号变化"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.BooleanChange"
msgid "change()"
msgstr "change()"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.BooleanChange"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block sets the Boolean output <strong>y</strong> to true, when the\r\n"
"Boolean input <strong>u</strong> shows a <em>rising or falling edge</em>,\r\n"
"i.e., when the signal changes:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = <strong>change</strong>( u );\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"当布尔输入 <strong>u</strong>出现<em>上升或下降沿</em>时， 即信号发生变化时，该模块将布尔输出<strong>y</strong>设为真：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = change( u );</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.IntegerChange"
msgid "Indicates integer signal changing"
msgstr "表示整数信号发生变化"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.IntegerChange"
msgid "change()"
msgstr "change()"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.IntegerChange"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block sets the Boolean output <strong>y</strong> to true, when the\r\n"
"Integer input <strong>u</strong> changes:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = <strong>change</strong>( u );\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"当整数输入<strong>u</strong>发生变化时，该模块将布尔输出<strong>y</strong>设为真：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = change( u );</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger"
msgid "Library of Integer mathematical functions as input/output blocks"
msgstr "作为输入/输出模块的整型数学函数库"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains basic <strong>mathematical operations</strong>\r\n"
"on <strong>Integer</strong> signals.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该程序包包含<strong>Integer</strong>信号的基本<strong>mathematical operations</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Set Integer expression that is associated with the first active input signal"
msgstr "设置与第一个有效输入信号相关联的整数表达式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.MultiSwitch"
msgid "y = if u[i] then expr[i] elseif use_pre_as_default then pre(y) else y_default"
msgstr "y=如果u[i]为真，那么为expr[i]，否则如果use_pre_as_default为真，那么为pre(y)，否则为y_default"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Default value of output y if use_pre_as_default=false, as well as pre(y) at initial time"
msgstr "如果use_pre_as_default=false则输出y的默认值，以及初始时的pre(y)值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.MultiSwitch"
msgid "= true, y holds its last value if all u[i]=false, otherwise y=y_default"
msgstr "=true，如果所有u[i]=false则y保留最后的值，否则y=y_default"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Number of input connections"
msgstr "输入接口数量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Set y = expr[i], if u[i] = true"
msgstr "设置y=expr[i]，如果u[i]=true"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Output depending on expression"
msgstr "根据表达式输出"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.MultiSwitch"
msgid "else: %y_default"
msgstr "else: %y_default"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.MultiSwitch"
msgid "else: pre(y)"
msgstr "else: pre(y)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.MultiSwitch"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.MultiSwitch"
msgid "%expr"
msgstr "%expr"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.MultiSwitch"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block has a vector of Boolean input signals u[nu] and a vector of\r\n"
"(time varying) Integer expressions expr[nu]. The output signal y is\r\n"
"set to expr[i], if i is the first element in the input vector u that is true. If all input signals are\r\n"
"false, y is set to parameter \"y_default\" or the last value is kept, if use_pre_as_default = <strong>true</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// Conceptual equation (not valid Modelica)\r\n"
"i = 'first element of u[:] that is true';\r\n"
"y = <strong>if</strong> i==0 <strong>then</strong> (<strong>if</strong> use_pre_as_default <strong>then</strong> pre(y)\r\n"
"                                        <strong>else</strong> y_default)\r\n"
"    <strong>else</strong> expr[i];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input connector is a vector of Boolean input signals.\r\n"
"When a connection line is drawn, the dimension of the input\r\n"
"vector is enlarged by one and the connection is automatically\r\n"
"connected to this new free index (thanks to the\r\n"
"connectorSizing annotation).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模块有一个布尔输入信号 u[nu] 矢量和一个（随时间变化的）整数表达式 expr[nu] 矢量。\r\n"
"如果 i 是输入向量 u 中第一个为真的元素，则输出信号 y 设为 expr[i]。\r\n"
"如果所有输入信号都为假，则 y 设置为参数 “y_default”；如果 use_pre_as_default = <strong>true</strong>，则保留最后一个值。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// Conceptual equation (not valid Modelica)\r\n"
"i = 'first element of u[:] that is true';\r\n"
"y = <strong>if</strong> i==0 <strong>then</strong> (<strong>if</strong> use_pre_as_default <strong>then</strong> pre(y)\r\n"
"                                        <strong>else</strong> y_default)\r\n"
"    <strong>else</strong> expr[i];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"输入连接器是布尔输入信号的向量。\r\n"
"在绘制连接线时，输入向量的尺寸会放大一个，\r\n"
"连接线会自动连接到这个新的空白索引\r\n"
"（这要归功于 connectorSizing 注解）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法 \r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.Sum"
msgid "Sum of Integers: y = k[1]*u[1] + k[2]*u[2] + ... + k[n]*u[n]"
msgstr "整数之和： y=k[1]*u[1]+k[2]*u[2]+...+k[n]*u[n]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.Sum"
msgid "Input gains"
msgstr "输入增益"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.Sum"
msgid "%k"
msgstr "%k"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.Sum"
msgid "+"
msgstr "+"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.Sum"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes the scalar Integer output \"y\" as sum of the elements of the\r\n"
"Integer input signal vector u:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = k[1]*u[1] + k[2]*u[2] + ... k[N]*u[N];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input connector is a vector of Integer input signals.\r\n"
"When a connection line is drawn, the dimension of the input\r\n"
"vector is enlarged by one and the connection is automatically\r\n"
"connected to this new free index (thanks to the\r\n"
"connectorSizing annotation).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If no connection to the input connector \"u\" is present,\r\n"
"the output is set to zero: y=0.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将整数输入信号向量 u 的元素之和作为标量整数输出 “y” 进行计算：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = k[1]*u[1] + k[2]*u[2] + ... k[N]*u[N];</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"输入连接器是一个整数输入信号向量。 绘制连接线时，输入矢量的尺寸会放大一个， 连接线会自动连接到这个新的空白索引 （这要归功于 connectorSizing 注解）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果输入接口 “u” 没有连接，则输出设置为零：y=0。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.Product"
msgid "Product of Integer: y = u[1]*u[2]* ... *u[n]"
msgstr "整数的乘积：y=u[1]*u[2]*...*u[n]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.Product"
msgid "*"
msgstr "*"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.Product"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes the scalar Integer output \"y\" as product of the elements of the\r\n"
"Integer input signal vector u:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = u[1]*u[2]* ... *u[N];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input connector is a vector of Integer input signals.\r\n"
"When a connection line is drawn, the dimension of the input\r\n"
"vector is enlarged by one and the connection is automatically\r\n"
"connected to this new free index (thanks to the\r\n"
"connectorSizing annotation).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If no connection to the input connector \"u\" is present,\r\n"
"the output is set to zero: y=0.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将整数输入信号向量 u 的元素乘积作为标量整数输出 “y”：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = u[1]*u[2]* ... *u[N];</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"输入连接器是一个整数输入信号向量。 绘制连接线时，输入矢量的尺寸会放大一个， 连接线会自动连接到这个新的空白索引 （这要归功于 connectorSizing 注解）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果输入连接器 “u” 没有连接，则输出设置为零：y=0。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.TriggeredAdd"
msgid "Add input to previous value of output, if rising edge of trigger port"
msgstr "如果触发端口处于上升沿，则将输入值加到输出值的前一个值上"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.TriggeredAdd"
msgid "= true, if reset port enabled"
msgstr "=true，如果重置端口已启用"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.TriggeredAdd"
msgid "= true, if set port enabled and used as default value when reset"
msgstr "=true，如果设置端口已启用，则重置时用作默认值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.TriggeredAdd"
msgid "Initial and reset value of y if set port is not used"
msgstr "如果不使用设置的端口，y的初始值和重置值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.TriggeredAdd"
msgid "reset"
msgstr "reset"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathInteger.TriggeredAdd"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Add input to previous value of output, if rising edge of trigger port\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block has one Integer input \"u\", one Boolean input \"trigger\",\r\n"
"an optional Boolean input \"reset\", an optional Integer input \"set\", and\r\n"
"an Integer output \"y\".\r\n"
"The optional inputs can be activated with the \"use_reset\" and\r\n"
"\"use_set\" flags, respectively.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input \"u\" is added to the previous value of the\r\n"
"output \"y\" if the \"trigger\" port has a rising edge. At the start of the\r\n"
"simulation \"y = y_start\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If the \"reset\" port is enabled, then the output \"y\" is reset to \"set\"\r\n"
"or to \"y_start\" (if the \"set\" port is not enabled), whenever the \"reset\"\r\n"
"port has a rising edge.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果触发端口处于上升沿，则将输入值加到输出值的前一个值上\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模块有一个整数输入端 “u”、一个布尔输入端 “触发”、\r\n"
"一个可选的布尔输入端 “重置”、一个可选的整数输入端 “设置” 和一个整数输出端 “y”。\r\n"
"可选输入可分别使用 “use_reset” 和 “use_set” 标志激活。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果 “触发” 端口有一个上升沿，则输入 “u” 与输出 “y” 的前一个值相加。模拟开始时为 “y = y_start”。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果启用了 “复位” 端口，那么只要 “复位” 端口出现上升沿，\r\n"
"输出 “y” 就会复位为 “set” 或 “y_start”（如果未启用 “set” 端口）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法 \r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.IntegerNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean"
msgid "Library of Boolean mathematical functions as input/output blocks"
msgstr "作为输入/输出模块的布尔数学函数库"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains basic <strong>mathematical operations</strong>\r\n"
"on <strong>Boolean</strong> signals.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The new features are:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> If useful, blocks may have an arbitrary number of inputs (e.g., \"And\" block with 2,3,4,...\r\n"
"     Boolean inputs). This is based on the \"connectorSizing\" annotation which\r\n"
"     allows a tool to conveniently handle vectors of connectors.</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> The blocks are smaller in size, so that the diagram area is better\r\n"
"     utilized for trivial blocks such as \"And\" or \"Or\".</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">该包包含对</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>布尔信号</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">的基本</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>数学运算</strong></span>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"新特性包括：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">如果需要，模块可以具有任意数量的输入（例如，具有 2、3、4 等布尔输入的“与”模块）。这基于“connectorSizing”注释，它允许工具方便地处理连接器的向量</span>。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">这些模块的尺寸较小，以便图表区域能更好地用于处理像“与”或“或”这样的小型模块。</span></li>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Set Boolean expression that is associated with the first active input signal"
msgstr "设置与第一个活动输入信号相关联的布尔表达式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Sets y = if u[i] then expr[i] else y_default (time varying)"
msgstr "设置y=如果u[i]那么expr[i]否则y_default(随时间变化)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Set true to hold last value as default (y_default = pre(y))"
msgstr "设置为真，将最后一个值保留为默认值(y_default=pre(y))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Default value of output y if all u[i] = false"
msgstr "如果所有u[i]=false，输出y的默认值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Number of input connections"
msgstr "输入接口数量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Set y = expr[i], if u[i] = true"
msgstr "设置y=expr[i]，如果u[i]=true"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.MultiSwitch"
msgid "Output depending on expression"
msgstr "根据表达式输出"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.MultiSwitch"
msgid "else: %y_default"
msgstr "else: %y_default"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.MultiSwitch"
msgid "else: pre(y)"
msgstr "else: pre(y)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.MultiSwitch"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.MultiSwitch"
msgid "%expr"
msgstr "%expr"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.MultiSwitch"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The block has a vector of Boolean input signals u[nu] and a vector of\r\n"
"(time varying) Boolean expressions expr[:]. The output signal y is\r\n"
"set to expr[i], if i is the first element in the input vector u that is true.\r\n"
"If all input signals are false, y is set to parameter \"y_default\" or the\r\n"
"previous value of y is kept if parameter use_pre_as_default = <strong>true</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// Conceptual equation (not valid Modelica)\r\n"
"i = 'first element of u[:] that is true';\r\n"
"y = <strong>if</strong> i==0 <strong>then</strong> (<strong>if</strong> use_pre_as_default <strong>then</strong> pre(y)\r\n"
"                                        <strong>else</strong> y_default)\r\n"
"    <strong>else</strong> expr[i];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块有一个布尔输入信号向量 u[nu] 和一个（随时间变化的）布尔表达式向量 expr[:]。 如果 i 是输入向量 u 中第一个为真的元素，则输出信号 y 设置为 expr[i]。 如果所有输入信号都为假，则 y 设置为参数 “y_default”； 如果参数 use_pre_as_default = <strong>true</strong>，则保留 y 之前的值：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >// Conceptual equation (not valid Modelica)\r\n"
"i = \\\\'first element of u[:] that is true\\\\';\r\n"
"y = if i==0 then (if use_pre_as_default then pre(y)\r\n"
"else y_default)\r\n"
"else expr[i];</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.And"
msgid "Logical 'and': y = u[1] and u[2] and ... and u[nu]"
msgstr "逻辑'and'：y=u[1]和u[2]和...和u[nu]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.And"
msgid "and"
msgstr "and"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.And"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if all inputs are <strong>true</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input connector is a vector of Boolean input signals.\r\n"
"When a connection line is drawn, the dimension of the input\r\n"
"vector is enlarged by one and the connection is automatically\r\n"
"connected to this new free index (thanks to the\r\n"
"connectorSizing annotation).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If no connection to the input connector \"u\" is present,\r\n"
"the output is set to <strong>true</strong>: y=true.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">如果所有输入都为真，则输出为真；否则，输出为假。</span>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"输入连接器是布尔输入信号的向量。 绘制连接线时，输入矢量的尺寸会放大一个， 连接线会自动连接到这个新的自由索引上（这要归功于连接器尺寸注释）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>&nbsp;.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果输入接口 “u” 没有连接，则输出设置为 <strong>true</strong>：y=true。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.Or"
msgid "Logical 'or': y = u[1] or u[2] or ... or u[nu]"
msgstr "逻辑'or'：y =u[1]或u[2]或...或u[nu]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.Or"
msgid "or"
msgstr "or"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.Or"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if at least one input is <strong>true</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input connector is a vector of Boolean input signals.\r\n"
"When a connection line is drawn, the dimension of the input\r\n"
"vector is enlarged by one and the connection is automatically\r\n"
"connected to this new free index (thanks to the\r\n"
"connectorSizing annotation).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If no connection to the input connector \"u\" is present,\r\n"
"the output is set to <strong>false</strong>: y=false.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果至少有一个输入为<strong>true</strong>，则输出为<strong>true</strong>，否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"输入连接器是布尔输入信号的向量。\r\n"
"绘制连接线时，输入矢量的尺寸会放大一个，\r\n"
"连接线会自动连接到这个新的自由索引上（这要归功于连接器尺寸注释）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果输入接口 “u” 没有连接，则输出设置为 <strong>false</strong>：y=true。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.Xor"
msgid "Logical 'xor': y = oneTrue(u)  (y is true, if exactly one element of u is true, otherwise it is false)"
msgstr "逻辑'xor'：y=oneTrue(u)(如果u中正好有一个元素为真，则y为真；否则为假）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.Xor"
msgid "xor"
msgstr "xor"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.Xor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if exactly one input is <strong>true</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input connector is a vector of Boolean input signals.\r\n"
"When a connection line is drawn, the dimension of the input\r\n"
"vector is enlarged by one and the connection is automatically\r\n"
"connected to this new free index (thanks to the\r\n"
"connectorSizing annotation).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If no connection to the input connector \"u\" is present,\r\n"
"the output is set to <strong>false</strong>: y=false.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果正好有一个输入为<strong>true</strong>，则输出为<strong>true</strong>，\r\n"
"否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"输入连接器是布尔输入信号的向量。\r\n"
"绘制连接线时，输入矢量的尺寸会放大一个，\r\n"
"连接线会自动连接到这个新的自由索引上（这要归功于连接器尺寸注释）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果输入连接器 “u” 没有连接，则输出设置为 <strong>false</strong>：y=false。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.Nand"
msgid "Logical 'nand': y = not ( u[1] and u[2] and ... and u[nu] )"
msgstr "逻辑'nand'：y=非(u[1]和u[2]和...和u[nu])"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.Nand"
msgid "nand"
msgstr "nand"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.Nand"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>true</strong> if at least one input is <strong>false</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input connector is a vector of Boolean input signals.\r\n"
"When a connection line is drawn, the dimension of the input\r\n"
"vector is enlarged by one and the connection is automatically\r\n"
"connected to this new free index (thanks to the\r\n"
"connectorSizing annotation).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If no connection to the input connector \"u\" is present,\r\n"
"the output is set to <strong>false</strong>: y=false.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"如果至少有一个输入为<strong>false</strong>，则输出为<strong>true</strong>，否则输出为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"输入连接器是布尔输入信号的向量。 绘制连接线时，输入矢量的尺寸会放大一个， 连接线会自动连接到这个新的自由索引上（这要归功于连接器尺寸注释）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果输入连接器 “u” 没有连接，则输出设置为 <strong>false</strong>：y=false。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.Nor"
msgid "Logical 'nor': y = not ( u[1] or u[2] or ... or u[nu] )"
msgstr "逻辑'nor'：y=非(u[1]或u[2]或...或u[nu])"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.Nor"
msgid "nor"
msgstr "nor"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.Nor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>false</strong> if at least one input is <strong>true</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>true</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input connector is a vector of Boolean input signals.\r\n"
"When a connection line is drawn, the dimension of the input\r\n"
"vector is enlarged by one and the connection is automatically\r\n"
"connected to this new free index (thanks to the\r\n"
"connectorSizing annotation).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If no connection to the input connector \"u\" is present,\r\n"
"the output is set to <strong>false</strong>: y=false.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"如果至少有一个输入为<strong>true</strong>，则输出为<strong>false</strong>，否则输出为<strong>true</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"输入连接器是布尔输入信号的向量。 绘制连接线时，输入矢量的尺寸会放大一个， 连接线会自动连接到这个新的自由索引上（这要归功于连接器尺寸注释）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果输入连接器 “u” 没有连接，则输出设置为 <strong>false</strong>：y=false。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.Not"
msgid "Logical 'not': y = not u"
msgstr "逻辑'not'：y=非u"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.Not"
msgid "not"
msgstr "not"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.Not"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The output is <strong>false</strong> if at least one input is <strong>true</strong>, otherwise\r\n"
"the output is <strong>true</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input connector is a vector of Boolean input signals.\r\n"
"When a connection line is drawn, the dimension of the input\r\n"
"vector is enlarged by one and the connection is automatically\r\n"
"connected to this new free index (thanks to the\r\n"
"connectorSizing annotation).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"如果输入为<strong>true</strong>，则输出为<strong>false</strong>，否则输出为<strong>true</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"输入连接器是布尔输入信号的向量。 绘制连接线时，输入矢量的尺寸会放大一个， 连接线会自动连接到这个新的自由索引上（这要归功于连接器尺寸注释）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>&nbsp;.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.RisingEdge"
msgid "Output y is true, if the input u has a rising edge, otherwise it is false (y = edge(u))"
msgstr "如果输入u为上升沿，则输出y为真；否则为假(y=edge(u))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.RisingEdge"
msgid "Value of pre(u) at initial time"
msgstr "初始时的pre(u)值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.RisingEdge"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A rising edge of the Boolean input u results in y = <strong>true</strong> at this\r\n"
"time instant. At all other time instants, y = <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"布尔输入 u 的上升沿导致该时刻 y = <strong>true</strong>。在所有其他时间瞬间，y = <strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.FallingEdge"
msgid "Output y is true, if the input u has a falling edge, otherwise it is false (y = edge(not u))"
msgstr "如果输入u为下降沿，则输出y为真；否则为假(y=edge(notu)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.FallingEdge"
msgid "Value of pre(u) at initial time"
msgstr "初始时的pre(u)值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.FallingEdge"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A falling edge of the Boolean input u results in y = <strong>true</strong> at this\r\n"
"time instant. At all other time instants, y = <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"布尔输入 u 的下降沿导致该时刻 y = <strong>true</strong>。\r\n"
"在所有其他时间瞬间，y =  <strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.ChangingEdge"
msgid "Output y is true, if the input u has either a rising or a falling edge and otherwise it is false (y=change(u))"
msgstr "如果输入u出现上升沿或下降沿，则输出y为真；否则为假(y=change(u))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.ChangingEdge"
msgid "Value of pre(u) at initial time"
msgstr "初始时的pre(u)值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.ChangingEdge"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A changing edge, i.e., either rising or falling,\r\n"
"of the Boolean input u results in y = <strong>true</strong> at this\r\n"
"time instant. At all other time instants, y = <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"布尔输入 u 的变化沿（即上升沿或下降沿）会导致该时刻的 y = <strong>true</strong>。\r\n"
"在所有其他时间瞬间，y = <strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.OnDelay"
msgid "Delay a rising edge of the input, but do not delay a falling edge."
msgstr "延迟输入的上升沿，但不延迟下降沿。"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.OnDelay"
msgid "Delay time"
msgstr "延迟时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.OnDelay"
msgid "%delayTime s"
msgstr "%delayTime s"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.MathBoolean.OnDelay"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A rising edge of the Boolean input u gives a delayed output.\r\n"
"A falling edge of the input is immediately given to the output.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Simulation results of a typical example with a delay time of 0.1 s\r\n"
"is shown in the next figure.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/MathBoolean/OnDelay1.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"OnDelay1.png\">\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/MathBoolean/OnDelay2.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"OnDelay2.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated, e.g., in example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"布尔输入 u 的上升沿给出延迟输出。 输入的下降沿则立即输出。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"下图显示了一个延迟时间为 0.1 秒的典型例子的模拟结果。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/MathBoolean/OnDelay1.png\" alt=\"OnDelay1.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><br><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/MathBoolean/OnDelay2.png\" alt=\"OnDelay2.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"举例说明其用法 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Examples.BooleanNetwork1</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear"
msgid "Library of discontinuous or non-differentiable algebraic control blocks"
msgstr "不连续或不可微分代数控制模块库"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains <strong>discontinuous</strong> and\r\n"
"<strong>non-differentiable, algebraic</strong> input/output blocks.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">此软件包包含不连续和不可微分的代数输入/输出模块。</span>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>October 21, 2002</em>\r\n"
"       by Christian Schweiger:<br>\r\n"
"       New block VariableLimiter added.</li>\r\n"
"<li><em>August 22, 1999</em>\r\n"
"       by <a href=\"http://www.robotic.dlr.de/Martin.Otter/\">Martin Otter</a>:<br>\r\n"
"       Realized, based on an existing Dymola library\r\n"
"       of Dieter Moormann and Hilding Elmqvist.\r\n"
"</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>October 21, 2002</em>\r\n"
"       by Christian Schweiger:<br>\r\n"
"       新增模块VariableLimiter。</li>\r\n"
"<li><em>August 22, 1999</em>\r\n"
"       by <a href=\"http://www.robotic.dlr.de/Martin.Otter/\">Martin Otter</a>:<br>\r\n"
"       该模块是基于现有的Dymola库，由Dieter Moormann和Hilding Elmqvist提供实现。\r\n"
"</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.Limiter"
msgid "Limit the range of a signal"
msgstr "限制信号范围"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.Limiter"
msgid "Upper limits of input signals"
msgstr "输入信号的上限"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.Limiter"
msgid "Lower limits of input signals"
msgstr "输入信号的下限"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.Limiter"
msgid "= true, if strict limits with noEvent(..)"
msgstr "=true，如果使用noEvent(...)进行严格限制"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.Limiter"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.Limiter"
msgid "Simplified model for homotopy-based initialization"
msgstr "基于同构初始化的简化模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.Limiter"
msgid "Initialization"
msgstr "初始化"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.Limiter"
msgid "Simplified expression for homotopy-based initialization"
msgstr "基于同伦初始化的简化表达式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.Limiter"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The Limiter block passes its input signal as output signal\r\n"
"as long as the input is within the specified upper and lower\r\n"
"limits. If this is not the case, the corresponding limits are passed\r\n"
"as output.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The parameter <code>homotopyType</code> in the Advanced tab specifies the\r\n"
"simplified behaviour if homotopy-based initialization is used:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>NoHomotopy</code>: the actual expression with limits is used</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>Linear</code>: a linear behaviour y = u is assumed (default option)</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>UpperLimit</code>: it is assumed that the output is stuck at the upper limit u = uMax</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>LowerLimit</code>: it is assumed that the output is stuck at the lower limit u = uMin</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If it is known a priori in which region the input signal will be located, this option can help\r\n"
"a lot by removing one strong nonlinearity from the initialization problem.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"只要输入信号在指定的上限和下限范围内，Limiter 模块就会将其输入信号作为输出信号。 否则，相应的限值将作为输出信号传递。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在高级选项卡中的参数 <code>homotopyType</code> 指定了如果使用基于同伦的初始化，则简化行为：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<code>NoHomotopy</code>: 使用带限制的实际表达式</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<code>Linear</code>: 假设线性行为 y = u &nbsp;(默认选项)</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<code>UpperLimit</code>: 假设输出卡在上限 u = uMax</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<code>LowerLimit</code>: 假设输出卡在下限 u = uMin</li>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果事先知道输入信号将位于哪个区域，那么这个选项可以从初始化问题中去除一个强非线性因素，从而起到很大作用。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.Limiter"
msgid "uMax=%uMax"
msgstr "uMax=%uMax"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.VariableLimiter"
msgid "Limit the range of a signal with variable limits"
msgstr "用可变限值限制信号范围"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.VariableLimiter"
msgid "= true, if strict limits with noEvent(..)"
msgstr "=true，如果使用noEvent(...)进行严格限制"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.VariableLimiter"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.VariableLimiter"
msgid "Simplified model for homotopy-based initialization"
msgstr "基于同伦的初始化简化模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.VariableLimiter"
msgid "Initialization"
msgstr "初始化"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.VariableLimiter"
msgid "Fixed value of output in simplified model"
msgstr "简化模型中的固定输出值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.VariableLimiter"
msgid "Connector of Real input signal used as maximum of input u"
msgstr "作为最大输入信号的实数输入信号接口u"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.VariableLimiter"
msgid "Connector of Real input signal used as minimum of input u"
msgstr "作为最小输入信号的实数输入信号连口u"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.VariableLimiter"
msgid "Simplified expression for homotopy-based initialization"
msgstr "基于同伦初始化的简化表达式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.VariableLimiter"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The Limiter block passes its input signal as output signal\r\n"
"as long as the input is within the upper and lower\r\n"
"limits specified by the two additional inputs limit1 and\r\n"
"limit2. If this is not the case, the corresponding limit\r\n"
"is passed as output.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The parameter <code>homotopyType</code> in the Advanced tab specifies the\r\n"
"simplified behaviour if homotopy-based initialization is used:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>NoHomotopy</code>: the actual expression with limits is used</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>Linear</code>: a linear behaviour y = u is assumed (default option)</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>Fixed</code>: it is assumed that the output is fixed at the value <code>ySimplified</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If it is known a priori in which region the input signal will be located, this option can help\r\n"
"a lot by removing one strong nonlinearity from the initialization problem.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"只要输入信号在两个附加输入limit1和limit2指定的上限和下限范围内，限幅块就会将其输入信号作为输出信号。\r\n"
"否则，相应的限值将作为输出信号传递。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在高级选项卡中的参数 <code>homotopyType</code> 指定了如果使用基于同伦的初始化，则简化行为：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<code>NoHomotopy</code>: 使用带限制的实际表达式</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<code>Linear</code>: 假设线性行为(默认选项)</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<code>Fixed</code>：假设输出固定在值<code>ySimplified</code></li>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果事先知道输入信号将位于哪个区域，那么这个选项可以从初始化问题中去除一个强非线性因素，从而起到很大作用。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.SlewRateLimiter"
msgid "Limits the slew rate of a signal"
msgstr "限制信号的斜率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.SlewRateLimiter"
msgid "Maximum rising slew rate [+small..+inf) [1/s]"
msgstr "最大上升斜率[+small..+inf)[1/s]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.SlewRateLimiter"
msgid "Maximum falling slew rate (-inf..-small] [1/s]"
msgstr "最大下降斜率(-inf..-small][1/s]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.SlewRateLimiter"
msgid "Derivative time constant"
msgstr "导数时间常数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.SlewRateLimiter"
msgid "Type of initialization (SteadyState implies y = u)"
msgstr "初始化类型(SteadyState表示y=u）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.SlewRateLimiter"
msgid "Initialization"
msgstr "初始化"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.SlewRateLimiter"
msgid "Initial or guess value of output (= state)"
msgstr "输出的初始值或猜测值(=state)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.SlewRateLimiter"
msgid "= true, if strict limits with noEvent(..)"
msgstr "=true，如果使用noEvent(...)进行严格限制"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.SlewRateLimiter"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.SlewRateLimiter"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The <code>SlewRateLimiter</code> block limits the slew rate of its input signal in the range of <code>[Falling, Rising]</code>.</p>\r\n"
"<p>To ensure this for arbitrary inputs and in order to produce a differential output, the input is numerically differentiated\r\n"
"with derivative time constant <code>Td</code>. Smaller time constant <code>Td</code> means nearer ideal derivative.</p>\r\n"
"<p><em>Note: The user has to choose the derivative time constant according to the nature of the input signal.</em></p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<code>SlewRateLimiter</code> 模块将其输入信号的斜率限制在<code>[Falling, Rising]</code>范围内。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"为了确保对任意输入进行微分，并产生微分输出，\r\n"
"输入要通过导数时间常数<code>Td</code> 进行数值微分。\r\n"
"时间常数<code>Td</code>越小，表示导数越接近理想导数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p><em>注：用户必须根据输入信号的性质选择导数时间常数。</em></p>\r\n"
"</html>"

