msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.RealExpression"
msgid "Set output signal to a time varying Real expression"
msgstr "将输出信号设置为随时间变化的实数表达式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.RealExpression"
msgid "Value of Real output"
msgstr "实数输出值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.RealExpression"
msgid "Time varying output signal"
msgstr "时变输出信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.RealExpression"
msgid "%y"
msgstr "%y"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.RealExpression"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.RealExpression"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The (time varying) Real output signal of this block can be defined in its\r\n"
"parameter menu via variable <strong>y</strong>. The purpose is to support the\r\n"
"easy definition of Real expressions in a block diagram. For example,\r\n"
"in the y-menu the definition \"if time &lt; 1 then 0 else 1\" can be given in order\r\n"
"to define that the output signal is one, if time &ge; 1 and otherwise\r\n"
"it is zero. Note, that \"time\" is a built-in variable that is always\r\n"
"accessible and represents the \"model time\" and that\r\n"
"variable <strong>y</strong> is both a variable and a connector.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块的(随时间变化)实数输出信号可在其参数菜单中通过变量<strong> y </strong>进行定义。\r\n"
"其目的是支持在框图中轻松定义实数表达式。\r\n"
"例如，在y菜单中，可以给出\"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">if time &lt; 1 then 0 else 1</span>\"的定义，以确定如果time ≥ 1，输出信号为1，否则为0。\r\n"
"请注意，\"time\"是一个内置变量，可以随时访问，代表\"模型时间\"，而变量<strong> y </strong>既是一个变量，也是一个连接器。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.IntegerExpression"
msgid "Set output signal to a time varying Integer expression"
msgstr "将输出信号设置为随时间变化的整数表达式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.IntegerExpression"
msgid "Value of Integer output"
msgstr "整数输出值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.IntegerExpression"
msgid "Time varying output signal"
msgstr "时变输出信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.IntegerExpression"
msgid "%y"
msgstr "%y"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.IntegerExpression"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.IntegerExpression"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The (time varying) Integer output signal of this block can be defined in its\r\n"
"parameter menu via variable <strong>y</strong>. The purpose is to support the\r\n"
"easy definition of Integer expressions in a block diagram. For example,\r\n"
"in the y-menu the definition \"if time &lt; 1 then 0 else 1\" can be given in order\r\n"
"to define that the output signal is one, if time &ge; 1 and otherwise\r\n"
"it is zero. Note, that \"time\" is a built-in variable that is always\r\n"
"accessible and represents the \"model time\" and that\r\n"
"variable <strong>y</strong> is both a variable and a connector.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块的整数输出信号(随时间变化)可通过变量<strong> y </strong>在参数菜单中定义。\r\n"
"其目的是支持在框图中简单定义整数表达式。\r\n"
"例如，在y菜单中，可以给出\"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">if time &lt; 1 then 0 else 1</span>\"的定义，以确定如果time ≥ 1，输出信号为 1，否则为 0。\r\n"
"请注意，\"time\"是一个内置变量，可以随时访问，代表\"模型时间\"，而变量<strong> y </strong>既是一个变量，也是一个连接器。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanExpression"
msgid "Set output signal to a time varying Boolean expression"
msgstr "将输出信号设置为随时间变化的布尔表达式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanExpression"
msgid "Value of Boolean output"
msgstr "布尔输出值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanExpression"
msgid "Time varying output signal"
msgstr "时变输出信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanExpression"
msgid "%y"
msgstr "%y"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanExpression"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanExpression"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The (time varying) Boolean output signal of this block can be defined in its\r\n"
"parameter menu via variable <strong>y</strong>. The purpose is to support the\r\n"
"easy definition of Boolean expressions in a block diagram. For example,\r\n"
"in the y-menu the definition \"time &gt;= 1 and time &lt;= 2\" can be given in order\r\n"
"to define that the output signal is <strong>true</strong> in the time interval\r\n"
"1 &le; time &le; 2 and otherwise it is <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"Note, that \"time\" is a built-in variable that is always\r\n"
"accessible and represents the \"model time\" and that\r\n"
"variable <strong>y</strong> is both a variable and a connector.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块布尔输出信号(随时间变化)可通过变量<strong> y </strong>在参数菜单中定义。\r\n"
"其目的是支持在框图中简单定义布尔表达式。\r\n"
"例如，在y菜单中，可以给出\"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">time &gt;= 1 and time &lt;= 2</span>\"的定义， 以确定输出信号在时间间隔 1 ≤ 时间 ≤ 2 时为<strong>true</strong>，否则为<strong>false</strong>。\r\n"
"请注意，\"time\"是一个内置变量，可以随时访问，代表\"模型时间\"，而变量<strong> y </strong>既是一个变量，也是一个连接器。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

