msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.LogFrequencySweep"
msgid "Duration of ramp (= 0.0 gives a Step)"
msgstr "斜坡持续时间(=0.0为一个台阶)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.LogFrequencySweep"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The output <code>y</code> performs a logarithmic frequency sweep.\r\n"
"The logarithm of frequency <code>w</code> performs a linear ramp from <code>log10(wMin)</code> to <code>log10(wMax)</code>.\r\n"
"The output is the decimal power of this logarithmic ramp.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>For <code>time &lt; startTime</code> the output is equal to <code>wMin</code>.</p>\r\n"
"<p>For <code>time &gt; startTime+duration</code> the output is equal to <code>wMax</code>.</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Sources/LogFrequencySweep.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"LogFrequencySweep.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"输出<code>y</code>执行对数频率扫描。 频率<code>w</code>的对数执行从<code>log10(wMin)</code>到<code>log10(wMax)</code>的线性斜坡。 输出为该对数斜坡的十进制幂。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<code>time &lt; startTime</code>时，输出等于<code>wMin</code>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<code>time &gt; startTime+duration</code>时，输出等于<code>wMax</code>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Sources/LogFrequencySweep.png\" alt=\"LogFrequencySweep.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.KinematicPTP"
msgid "Move as fast as possible along a distance within given kinematic constraints"
msgstr "在给定的运动学约束条件下，尽可能快地沿一定距离移动"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.KinematicPTP"
msgid "Distance to move"
msgstr "移动距离"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.KinematicPTP"
msgid "Maximum velocities der(q)"
msgstr "最大速度der(q)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.KinematicPTP"
msgid "Maximum accelerations der(qd)"
msgstr "最大加速度der(qd)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.KinematicPTP"
msgid "Time instant at which movement starts"
msgstr "运动开始的时间瞬间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.KinematicPTP"
msgid "acc"
msgstr "acc"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.KinematicPTP"
msgid "deltaq=%deltaq"
msgstr "deltaq=%deltaq"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.KinematicPTP"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The goal is to move as <strong>fast</strong> as possible along a distance\r\n"
"<strong>deltaq</strong>\r\n"
"under given <strong>kinematical constraints</strong>. The distance can be a positional or\r\n"
"angular range. In robotics such a movement is called <strong>PTP</strong> (Point-To-Point).\r\n"
"This source block generates the <strong>acceleration</strong> qdd of this signal\r\n"
"as output:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Sources/KinematicPTP.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"KinematicPTP.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"After integrating the output two times, the position q is\r\n"
"obtained. The signal is constructed in such a way that it is not possible\r\n"
"to move faster, given the <strong>maximally</strong> allowed <strong>velocity</strong> qd_max and\r\n"
"the <strong>maximally</strong> allowed <strong>acceleration</strong> qdd_max.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If several distances are given (vector deltaq has more than 1 element),\r\n"
"an acceleration output vector is constructed such that all signals\r\n"
"are in the same periods in the acceleration, constant velocity\r\n"
"and deceleration phase. This means that only one of the signals\r\n"
"is at its limits whereas the others are synchronized in such a way\r\n"
"that the end point is reached at the same time instant.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This element is useful to generate a reference signal for a controller\r\n"
"which controls a drive train or in combination with model\r\n"
"Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.<strong>Accelerate</strong> to drive\r\n"
"a flange according to a given acceleration.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"目标是在给定的<strong>运动学约束</strong>条件下， 以尽可能<strong>快</strong>的速度沿距离<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(245, 246, 248); font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Δq</strong></span>移动。 距离可以是位置或角度范围。 在机器人技术中，这种运动被称为<strong>PTP</strong>(点对点)。 该信号源模块将该信号的<strong>加速度</strong> qdd 作为输出：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Sources/KinematicPTP.png\" alt=\"KinematicPTP.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: start;\">在对输出信号进行两次积分后，得到位置q。该信号的构造方式确保在给定的<strong>最大允许速度</strong>qd_max和<strong>最大允许加速度</strong>qdd_max下，不可能以更快的速度移动。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: start;\">如果给定多个距离(向量q包含多个元素)，则构造一个加速度输出向量，使得所有信号在加速、恒速和减速阶段处于相同的周期中。这意味着，只有一个信号达到其限制，而其他信号则以同步的方式进行调整，以确保所有信号在同一时刻到达终点。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: start;\">该元素对于生成控制器的参考信号非常有用，控制器可以用来控制驱动系统，或与模型Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Accelerate结合使用，以根据给定的加速度驱动法兰。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.KinematicPTP"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p><strong>Release Notes:</strong></p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>June 27, 2001</em>\r\n"
"       by Bernhard Bachmann.<br>\r\n"
"       Bug fixed that element is also correct if startTime is not zero.</li>\r\n"
"<li><em>Nov. 3, 1999</em>\r\n"
"       by <a href=\"http://www.robotic.dlr.de/Martin.Otter/\">Martin Otter</a>:<br>\r\n"
"       Vectorized and moved from Rotational to Blocks.Sources.</li>\r\n"
"<li><em>June 29, 1999</em>\r\n"
"       by <a href=\"http://www.robotic.dlr.de/Martin.Otter/\">Martin Otter</a>:<br>\r\n"
"       realized.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p><strong>Release Notes:</strong></p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>June 27, 2001</em>\r\n"
