"       Used CombiTableTime as a basis and added the\r\n"
"       arguments <strong>extrapolation, columns, startTime</strong>.\r\n"
"       This allows periodic function definitions.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.CombiTimeTableT"
msgid "Parameter tunable. Table look-up with respect to time and linear/periodic extrapolation methods (data from matrix/file)"
