msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanTable"
msgid "Generate a Boolean output signal based on a vector of time instants"
msgstr "根据时间瞬时矢量生成布尔输出信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanTable"
msgid "Vector of time points. At every time point, the output y gets its opposite value (e.g., table={0,1})"
msgstr "时间点向量。在每个时间点，输出 y 都会得到相反的值(例如，table={0,1})"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanTable"
msgid "Table data definition"
msgstr "表格数据定义"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanTable"
msgid "Start value of y. At time = table[1], y changes to 'not startValue'"
msgstr "y的起始值。在时间=table[1]时，y变为‘无初始值’"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanTable"
msgid "Table data interpretation"
msgstr "表格数据解释"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanTable"
msgid "Extrapolation of data outside the definition range"
msgstr "超出定义范围的数据外推法"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanTable"
msgid "Output = false for time < startTime"
msgstr "当time<startTime时，输出=false"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanTable"
msgid "Shift time of table"
msgstr "表格的移位时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanTable"
msgid "Number of table points"
msgstr "表格中数据点数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanTable"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The Boolean output y is a signal defined by parameter vector <strong>table</strong>.\r\n"
"In the vector time points are stored.\r\n"
"The table interpolation has the following properties:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>At every time point, the output y\r\n"
"    changes its value to the negated value of the previous one.</li>\r\n"
"<li>Values <strong>outside</strong> of the table range, are computed by\r\n"
"    extrapolation according to the setting of parameter <strong>extrapolation</strong>:\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"extrapolation = 1: Hold the <strong>startValue</strong> or last value of the table,\r\n"
"                   if outside of the table scope.\r\n"
"              = 2: Extrapolate by using the derivative at the first/last table\r\n"
"                   points if outside of the table scope.\r\n"
"                   (This setting is not suitable and triggers an assert.)\r\n"
"              = 3: Periodically repeat the table data (periodical function).\r\n"
"              = 4: No extrapolation, i.e. extrapolation triggers an error\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote></li>\r\n"
"<li>Via parameter <strong>shiftTime</strong> the curve defined by the table can be shifted\r\n"
"    in time.\r\n"
"    The time instants stored in the table are therefore <strong>relative</strong>\r\n"
"    to <strong>shiftTime</strong>.</li>\r\n"
"<li>If time &lt; startTime, no interpolation is performed and <strong>false</strong>\r\n"
"    is used as ordinate value for the output.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Sources/BooleanTable.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"BooleanTable.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The precise semantics is:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>if</strong> size(table,1) == 0 <strong>then</strong>\r\n"
"   y = startValue;\r\n"
"<strong>else</strong>\r\n"
"   //            time &lt; table[1]: y = startValue\r\n"
"   // table[1] &le; time &lt; table[2]: y = not startValue\r\n"
"   // table[2] &le; time &lt; table[3]: y = startValue\r\n"
"   // table[3] &le; time &lt; table[4]: y = not startValue\r\n"
"   // ...\r\n"
"<strong>end if</strong>;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"布尔输出 y 是由参数向量<strong>table</strong>定义的信号。 矢量中存储了时间点。表格插值具有以下特性：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul><li>\r\n"
"在每个时间点，输出 y 的值都会变为前一个时间点的负值；</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"表格范围之<strong>外</strong>的数值将根据参数<strong>extrapolation</strong>的设置通过外推法计算；</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"通过参数<strong>shiftTime</strong>，可以对表格中定义的曲线进行时间移动。 因此，<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">表格中存储的时间点是</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>相对</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">于移位时间</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>shiftTime</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">的；</span></li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"如果 time &lt; startTime，则不执行插值，并使用<strong>false</strong>作为输出的纵坐标值。</li>\r\n"
"<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Sources/BooleanTable.png\" alt=\"BooleanTable.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"></li>\r\n"
"</ul><p>\r\n"
"准确的语义是：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >if size(table,1) == 0 then\r\n"
"y = startValue;\r\n"
"else\r\n"
"//            time &lt; table[1]: y = startValue\r\n"
"// table[1] ≤ time &lt; table[2]: y = not startValue\r\n"
"// table[2] ≤ time &lt; table[3]: y = startValue\r\n"
"// table[3] ≤ time &lt; table[4]: y = not startValue\r\n"
"// ...\r\n"
"end if;\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

