msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Examples"
msgid "Library of examples to demonstrate the usage of package Blocks"
msgstr "示例库，用于演示ComplexBlocks包的使用方法"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Examples"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This library demonstrates the usage of Complex blocks.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该库演示了复数模块的用法。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Examples.TestConversionBlock"
msgid "Test the conversion blocks"
msgstr "测试转换模块"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Examples.TestConversionBlock"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>A Complex signal is defined by its length and angle, both linearly rising with time.\r\n"
"Plotting the imaginary part versus the real part, you will see an Archimedean spiral.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"复数信号由其长度和角度定义，都随时间线性增加。将虚部与实部绘制在一起，你会看到一个阿基米德螺旋。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Examples.ShowTransferFunction"
msgid "Test Complex Transfer Function Block"
msgstr "测试复数传递函数模块"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Examples.ShowTransferFunction"
msgid "Damping coefficient"
msgstr "阻尼系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Examples.ShowTransferFunction"
msgid "Numerator polynomial coefficients of the transfer function"
msgstr "传递函数的分子多项式系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Examples.ShowTransferFunction"
msgid "Denominator polynomial coefficients of the transfer function"
msgstr "传递函数的分母多项式系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Examples.ShowTransferFunction"
msgid "Lower bound for frequency sweep"
msgstr "频率扫描下限"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Examples.ShowTransferFunction"
msgid "Upper bound for frequency sweep"
msgstr "频率扫描上限"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Examples.ShowTransferFunction"
msgid "Logarithm of frequency"
msgstr "频率对数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Examples.ShowTransferFunction"
msgid "Magnitude of the transfer function in decibel"
msgstr "以分贝为单位的传递函数幅度"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Examples.ShowTransferFunction"
msgid "Argument of the transfer function"
msgstr "传递函数参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Examples.ShowTransferFunction"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This example shows the response of a PT2 defined by its transfer function</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"            1\r\n"
"H(jw)=-------------------\r\n"
"      1 + 2 d jw + (jw)^2\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>Frequency performs a logarithmic ramp from 0.01 to 100 s^-1.</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Plot the magnitude locus (in dB) dB versus lg_w and the phase locus versus lg_w.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>这个例子展示了由其传递函数定义的PT2的响应</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"            1\r\n"
"H(jw)=-------------------\r\n"
"      1 + 2 d jw + (jw)^2\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>频率执行从0.01到100s⁻¹的对数扫描。</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"绘制幅度轨迹(以dB为单位)dB对数频率(lg_w)以及相位轨迹对数频率(lg_w)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Interfaces"
