"Basic block for Complex sources.\r\n"
"This component has one continuous Complex output signal y\r\n"
"and two parameters (offset, startTime) to shift the\r\n"
"generated signal.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"复数类型信号源的基本模块。\r\n"
"该组件具有一个连续复数类型的输出信号y，\r\n"
"以及两个参数(偏移量offset和起始时间startTime)用于调整生成的信号。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath"
msgid "Library of mathematical functions as input/output blocks"
msgstr "作为输入/输出模块的数学函数库"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains basic <strong>mathematical operations</strong>,\r\n"
"such as summation and multiplication, and basic <strong>mathematical\r\n"
"functions</strong>, such as <strong>sqrt</strong> and <strong>sin</strong>, as\r\n"
"input/output blocks. All blocks of this library can be either\r\n"
"connected with continuous blocks or with sampled-data blocks.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个包包含基本<strong>数学运算</strong>，如求和和乘法，以及基本的<strong>数学函数</strong>，\r\n"
"如<strong>sqrt</strong>和<strong>sin</strong>，作为输入/输出模块。\r\n"
"本库的所有模块可以与连续模块或采样数据模块连接。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Conj"
msgid "Output is equal to the conjugate complex input signal"
msgstr "输出等于输入信号的共轭复数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Conj"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block computes output <code>y</code> as\r\n"
"<em>conjugate complex</em> input <code>u</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模块将输入信号<code>u</code>的<em>共轭复数</em>作为输出信号<code>y</code>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Gain"
msgid "Output the product of a gain value with the input signal"
msgstr "输出增益值与输入信号的乘积"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Gain"
msgid "Gain value multiplied with input signal"
msgstr "与输入信号相乘的增益值"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Gain"
msgid "If true, input is processed conjugate complex"
msgstr "如果为真，则处理输入的共轭复数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Gain"
msgid "Input signal connector"
msgstr "输入信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Gain"
msgid "Output signal connector"
msgstr "输入出信号连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Gain"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block computes output <code>y</code> as\r\n"
"<em>product</em> of gain <code>k</code> with the\r\n"
"input <code>u</code>. Optionally, the input <code>u</code> can be processed conjugate complex, when parameter <code>useConjugateInput</code> is <code>true</code>. Depending on <code>useConjugateInput</code> either the original or the conjugate complex input signal are processed.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = k * (if useConjugateInput then Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u) else u);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p><strong>Example:</strong> If <code>useConjugateInput = true</code> and <code>k = 2</code> the output signal <code>y = 2 * Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u)</code>.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"这个模块根据增益<code>k</code>与输入信号<code>u</code>的<em>乘积</em>计算输出信号<code>y</code>。 可选地，如果参数<code>useConjugateInput</code>设置为<code>true</code>， <span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">输入 </span><code>u</code><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"> 可以被处理为共轭复数</span>。 <span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">根据</span><code>useConjugateInput</code><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"> 的值，处理的是原始输入信号还是共轭复数输入信号。</span>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = k * (if useConjugateInput then Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u) else u);\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>示例：</strong> 如果<code>useConjugateInput = true</code> 和 <code>k = 2</code>，输出信号<code>y = 2 * Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u)</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Gain"
msgid "k=%k"
msgstr "k=%k"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Gain"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Sum"
msgid "Output the sum of the elements of the input vector"
msgstr "输出输入向量元素之和"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Sum"
msgid "Optional: sum coefficients"
msgstr "可选：系数总和"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Sum"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes output <code>y</code> as\r\n"
"<em>sum</em> of the elements of the input signal vector\r\n"
"<code>u</code>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = u[1] + u[2] + ...;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Example:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  parameter:   nin = 3;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in the following equations:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"  y = u[1] + u[2] + u[3];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个模块计算输出信号 <code>y</code>，其值为输入信号向量 <code>u</code> 中所有元素的 <em>sum</em>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = u[1] + u[2] + ...;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"示例:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  parameter:   nin = 3;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in the following equations:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"  y = u[1] + u[2] + u[3];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Feedback"
msgid "Output difference between commanded input 1 and feedback input 2"
msgstr "输出指令输入1和反馈输入2之间的差值"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Feedback"
msgid "If true, input 1 is processed conjugate complex"
msgstr "如果为真，则处理输入1的共轭复数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Feedback"
msgid "If true, input 2 is processed conjugate complex"
msgstr "如果为真，则处理输入2的共轭复数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Feedback"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes output <code>y</code> as <em>difference</em> of the\r\n"
"commanded input <code>u1</code> and the feedback\r\n"
"input <code>u2</code>. Optionally, either input <code>u1</code> or <code>u2</code> or both inputs can be processed conjugate complex, when parameters <code>useConjugateInput1</code> and <code>useConjugateInput2</code> are <code>true</code>, respectively.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = (if useConjugateInput1 then Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u1) else u1)\r\n"
"  - (if useConjugateInput1 then Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u2) else u2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Example</strong> parameters:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>useConjugateInput1 = true</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>useConjugateInput2 = false</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"result in the following equation:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u1) - u2\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"这个模块计算输出信号 <code>y</code>， 其值为指令输入 <code>u1</code> 和反馈输入 <code>u2</code> 之间的 <em>差异</em>。 可选地，当参数 <code>useConjugateInput1</code> 和 <code>useConjugateInput2</code> 分别为 <code>true</code> 时， 可以处理输入 <code>u1</code> 和 <code>u2</code> 的复共轭。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = (if useConjugateInput1 then Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u1) else u1)\r\n"
"  - (if useConjugateInput1 then Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u2) else u2);\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>示例</strong>参数:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<code>useConjugateInput1 = true</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<code>useConjugateInput2 = false</code></li>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"导致下面的方程式：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u1) - u2\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Feedback"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Feedback"
msgid "-"
msgstr "-"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add"
msgid "Output the sum of the two inputs"
msgstr "输出两个输入的总和"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add"
msgid "Gain of input 1"
msgstr "输入1的增益"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add"
msgid "Gain of input 2"
msgstr "输入2的增益"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes output <code>y</code> as <em>sum</em> of the\r\n"
"two input signals <code>u1</code> and <code>u2</code>. Optionally, either input <code>u1</code> or <code>u2</code> or both inputs can be processed conjugate complex, when parameters <code>useConjugateInput1</code> and <code>useConjugateInput2</code> are <code>true</code>, respectively.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = k1*u1Internal + k2*u2Internal;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Example</strong> parameters:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>k1 = +2</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>k2 = -3</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>useConjugateInput1 = true</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>useConjugateInput2 = false</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"result in the following equation:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = 2 * Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u1) - 3 * u2\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个模块将输出 <code>y</code> 计算为输入信号 <code>u1</code> 和 <code>u2</code> 的和。\r\n"
"可选地，当参数 <code>useConjugateInput1</code> 和 \r\n"
"<code>useConjugateInput2</code> 分别为 <code>true</code> 时，\r\n"
"可以处理输入 <code>u1</code> 或 <code>u2</code> 或两者都是共轭复数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = k1*u1Internal + k2*u2Internal;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>示例</strong>参数:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>k1 = +2</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>k2 = -3</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>useConjugateInput1 = true</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>useConjugateInput2 = false</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"导致下面的方程式：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = 2 * Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u1) - 3 * u2\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add"
msgid "%k2"
msgstr "%k2"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add"
msgid "%k1"
msgstr "%k1"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add"
msgid "+"
msgstr "+"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "Output the sum of the three inputs"
msgstr "输出三个输入的总和"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "Gain of upper input"
msgstr "上输入增益"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "If true, input 1 is processed conjugate complex"
msgstr "如果为真，则处理输入1的共轭复数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "Gain of middle input"
msgstr "中间输入增益"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "If true, input 2 is processed conjugate complex"
msgstr "如果为真，则处理输入2的共轭复数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "Gain of lower input"
msgstr "下输入增益"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "If true, input 3 is processed conjugate complex"
msgstr "如果为真，则处理输入3的共轭复数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "Connector 1 of Complex input signals"
msgstr "复数输入信号的连接器1"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "Connector 2 of Complex input signals"
msgstr "复数输入信号的连接器2"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "Connector 3 of Complex input signals"
msgstr "复数输入信号的连接器3"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "Connector of Complex output signals"
msgstr "复数输出信号的连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes output <code>y</code> as <em>sum</em> of the\r\n"
"three input signals <code>u1</code>, <code>u2</code> and <code>u3</code>. Optionally, inputs <code>u1</code> and <code>u2</code> and <code>u3</code> can be processed conjugate complex, when parameters <code>useConjugateInput1</code> and <code>useConjugateInput2</code> and <code>useConjugateInput3</code> are <code>true</code>, respectively.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = k1*(if useConjugateInput1 then Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u1) else u1)\r\n"
"  + k2*(if useConjugateInput2 then Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u2) else u2)\r\n"
"  + k3*(if useConjugateInput3 then Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u3) else u3);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Example</strong> parameters:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>k1 = +2</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>k2 = -3</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>k3 = +1</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>useConjugateInput1 = true</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>useConjugateInput2 = false</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>useConjugateInput3 = false</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"result in the following equation:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = 2 * Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u1) - 3 * u2 + u3;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个模块计算输出信号 <code>y</code>，为输入信号 <code>u1</code>、<code>u2</code> \r\n"
"和 <code>u3</code> 的 <em>求和</em>。\r\n"
"可选地，当参数 <code>useConjugateInput1</code>、<code>useConjugateInput2</code> 和\r\n"
"<code>useConjugateInput3</code> 分别为 <code>true</code> 时，\r\n"
"输入 <code>u1</code>、<code>u2</code> 和 <code>u3</code> 可以被处理为共轭复数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = k1*(if useConjugateInput1 then Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u1) else u1)\r\n"
"  + k2*(if useConjugateInput2 then Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u2) else u2)\r\n"
"  + k3*(if useConjugateInput3 then Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u3) else u3);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>示例</strong>参数:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>k1 = +2</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>k2 = -3</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>k3 = +1</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>useConjugateInput1 = true</code>,</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>useConjugateInput2 = false</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>useConjugateInput3 = false</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"导致下面的方程式：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = 2 * Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u1) - 3 * u2 + u3;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "%k1"
msgstr "%k1"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "%k2"
msgstr "%k2"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "%k3"
msgstr "%k3"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Add3"
msgid "+"
msgstr "+"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Product"
msgid "Output product of the two inputs"
msgstr "输出两个输入的乘积"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Product"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This blocks computes the output <code>y</code> (element-wise)\r\n"
"as <em>product</em> of the corresponding elements of\r\n"
"the two inputs <code>u1</code> and <code>u2</code>. Optionally, either input <code>u1</code> or <code>u2</code> or both inputs can be processed conjugate complex, when parameters <code>useConjugateInput1</code> and <code>useConjugateInput2</code> are <code>true</code>, respectively. Depending on <code>useConjugateInput1</code> and <code>useConjugateInput2</code> the internal signals represent either the original or the conjugate complex input signal.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = u1Inernal * u2Internal;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p><strong>Example:</strong> If <code>useConjugateInput1 = true</code> and <code>useConjugateInput2 = false</code> the output signal <code>y = Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u1) * u2</code>.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"这个模块按元素计算输出 <code>y</code>， 即两个输入信号 <code>u1</code> 和 <code>u2</code> 对应元素的 <em>乘积</em>。 可选地，当参数 <code>useConjugateInput1</code> 和 <code>useConjugateInput2</code> 分别为 <code>true</code> 时， 输入 <code>u1</code> 或 <code>u2</code> 或两者都可以被处理为共轭复数。 根据 <code>useConjugateInput1</code> 和 <code>useConjugateInput2</code> 的设置， 内部信号可以表示原始的输入信号或其共轭复数形式。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = u1Inernal * u2Internal;\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>示例：</strong> 如果 <code>useConjugateInput1 = true</code> 和 <code>useConjugateInput2 = false</code> 输出信号 <code>y = Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u1) * u2</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Division"
msgid "Output first input divided by second input"
msgstr "输出第一个输入除以第二个输入"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Division"
msgid "If true, input 1 is processed conjugate complex"
msgstr "如果为真，则处理输入1的共轭复数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Division"
msgid "If true, input 2 is processed conjugate complex"
msgstr "如果为真，则处理输入2的共轭复数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Division"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block computes the output <code>y</code> (element-wise)\r\n"
"by <em>dividing</em> the corresponding elements of\r\n"
"the two inputs <code>u1</code> and <code>u2</code>. Optionally, either input <code>u1</code> or <code>u2</code> or both inputs can be processed conjugate complex, when parameters <code>useConjugateInput1</code> and <code>useConjugateInput2</code> are <code>true</code>, respectively. Depending on <code>useConjugateInput1</code> and <code>useConjugateInput2</code> the internal signals represent either the original or the conjugate complex input signal.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = u1Internal / u2Internal;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p><strong>Example:</strong> If <code>useConjugateInput1 = true</code> and <code>useConjugateInput2 = false</code> the output signal <code>y = Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u1) / u2</code>.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"这个模块按逐元素将两个输入信号 <code>u1</code> 和 <code>u2</code> 对应元素 <em>相除</em>，计算输出信号 <code>y</code>。 可选地，当参数 <code>useConjugateInput1</code> 和 <code>useConjugateInput2</code> 分别为 <code>true</code> 时， 输入 <code>u1</code> 或 <code>u2</code> 或两者都可以被处理为共轭复数。 根据 <code>useConjugateInput1</code> 和 <code>useConjugateInput2</code> 的设定， 内部信号可以表示原始的输入信号或其共轭复数形式。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = u1Internal / u2Internal;\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>示例：</strong> 如果 <code>useConjugateInput1 = true</code> 和 <code>useConjugateInput2 = false</code> 输出信号 <code>y = Modelica.ComplexMath.conj(u1) / u2</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

