"<p>将实部 <em>re</em> 和虚部 <em>im</em> 的实数输入转换为复数输出 <em>y</em>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.PolarToComplex"
msgid "Converts polar representation to complex"
msgstr "将极性表示转换为复数"

