msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>将复数输入 <em>u</em> 转换为实数输出 <em>len</em>（长度，绝对值）和 <em>phi</em>（角度，幅角）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "Calculate quantities to plot Bode diagram"
msgstr "计算绘制Bode图所需的量"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "Use divisor input, if true"
msgstr "如果为真，使用除数输入"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "Amplitude level difference"
msgstr "振幅级差"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "Dividend if useDivisor == true"
msgstr "如果useDivisor == true，则使用被除数。"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "Divisor"
msgstr "被除数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "Absolute value of ratio u / divisor"
msgstr "u与被除数的比值的绝对值"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "Angle of ratio u / divisor"
msgstr "u/被除数的比值的角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "Quotient y = u / divisor"
msgstr "商y = u / divisor"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "Complex(1,0)"
msgstr "复数(1,0)"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "Log10 of absolute value of ratio u / divisor in dB"
msgstr "在dB中，u与divisor比值的绝对值的以10为底的对数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "|y|"
msgstr "|y|"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "dB"
msgstr "dB"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "∠"
msgstr "∠"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "u / divisor"
msgstr "u / divisor"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.Bode"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This complex block is used to determine variables of a Bode diagram for the output <code>y</code>.\r\n"
"The output <code>y</code> is calculated by <code>u / divisor</code> if <code>useDivisor == true</code>.\r\n"
"Otherwise the output <code>y = u</code>.</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>abs_y</code> Absolute value of <code>y</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>arg_y</code> Angle of <code>y</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>dB_y</code> Logarithm to the base 10 of the absolute value of <code>y</code> in dB</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"这个复数的模块用于确定输出 <code>y</code> 的<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 243, 243);\">Bode图</span>变量。 如果 <code>useDivisor == true</code>，则输出 <code>y</code> 被计算为 <code>u / divisor</code>。 否则，输出 <code>y = u</code>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<code>abs_y</code> <code>y</code>的绝对值</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<code>arg_y</code> <code>y</code>的角度</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<code>dB_y</code> 以10为底的<code>y</code>的绝对值的对数，单位为分贝(dB)</li>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.TransferFunction"
msgid "Complex Transfer Function"
msgstr "复数传递函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.TransferFunction"
msgid "Numerator coefficients of transfer function (e.g., 2*s+3 is specified as {2,3})"
msgstr "传递函数的分母系数（例如，2*s+3 指定为 {2,3})"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.TransferFunction"
msgid "Denominator coefficients of transfer function (e.g., 5*s+6 is specified as {5,6})"
msgstr "传递函数的分母系数（例如，5*s+6 指定为 {5,6})"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.TransferFunction"
msgid "Angular frequency input"
msgstr "角频率输入"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.TransferFunction"
msgid "b(jw)"
msgstr "b(jw)"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.TransferFunction"
msgid "a(jw)"
msgstr "a(jw)"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.TransferFunction"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The complex input u is multiplied by the complex transfer function (depending on the angular frequency input w) to obtain the complex output y (nb = dimension of b, na = dimension of a):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"        b[1]*(jw)^[nb-1] + b[2]*(jw)^[nb-2] + ... + b[nb]\r\n"
"y(jw) = ------------------------------------------------- * u(jw)\r\n"
"        a[1]*(jw)^[na-1] + a[2]*(jw)^[na-2] + ... + a[na]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"复数输入u与复数传递函数(取决于角频率输入ω)相乘，得到复数输出 y (nb 是 b 的维度，na 是 a 的维度):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"        b[1]*(jw)^[nb-1] + b[2]*(jw)^[nb-2] + ... + b[nb]\r\n"
"y(jw) = ------------------------------------------------- * u(jw)\r\n"
"        a[1]*(jw)^[na-1] + a[2]*(jw)^[na-2] + ... + a[na]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Routing"
msgid "Library of blocks to combine and extract signals"
msgstr "用于组合和提取信号的模块库"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Routing"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains blocks to combine and extract signals.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该软件包包含用于组合和提取信号的模块。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Routing.Replicator"
msgid "Signal replicator"
msgstr "信号复制器"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Routing.Replicator"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block replicates the input signal to an array of <code>nout</code> identical output signals.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个模块将输入信号复制成一个包含 <code>nout</code> 个相同输出信号的数组。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Routing.ExtractSignal"
msgid "Extract signals from an input signal vector"
msgstr "从输入信号矢量中提取信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Routing.ExtractSignal"
msgid "Extracting vector"
msgstr "提取矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Routing.ExtractSignal"
msgid "extract=%extract"
msgstr "extract=%extract"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Routing.ExtractSignal"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Extract signals from the input connector and transfer them\r\n"
"to the output connector.</p>\r\n"
"<p>The extracting scheme is given by the integer vector 'extract'.\r\n"
"This vector specifies, which input signals are taken and in which\r\n"
"order they are transferred to the output vector. Note, that the\r\n"
"dimension of 'extract' has to match the number of outputs.\r\n"
"Additionally, the dimensions of the input connector signals and\r\n"
"the output connector signals have to be explicitly defined via the\r\n"
"parameters 'nin' and 'nout'.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Example:</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"nin  = 7 \"Number of inputs\";\r\n"
"nout = 4 \"Number of outputs\";\r\n"
"extract[nout] = {6,3,3,2} \"Extracting vector\";\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>extracts four output signals (nout=4) from the seven elements of the\r\n"
"input vector (nin=7):</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"output no. 1 is set equal to input no. 6\r\n"
"output no. 2 is set equal to input no. 3\r\n"
"output no. 3 is set equal to input no. 3\r\n"
"output no. 4 is set equal to input no. 2\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"从输入连接器提取信号并传输到输出连接器。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"提取方案由整数向量 'extract' 给出。该向量指定了要提取哪些输入信号，\r\n"
"并按照什么顺序将它们传输到输出向量中。请注意，'extract' 的维度必须与输出的数量匹配。\r\n"
"此外，输入连接器信号和输出连接器信号的维度必须通过参数 'nin' 和 'nout' 明确定义。</p>\r\n"
"<p>例如:</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"nin  = 7 \"Number of inputs\";\r\n"
"nout = 4 \"Number of outputs\";\r\n"
"extract[nout] = {6,3,3,2} \"Extracting vector\";\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>从长度为7的输入向量(nin=7)中提取四个输出信号（nout=4）：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"output no. 1 is set equal to input no. 6\r\n"
"output no. 2 is set equal to input no. 3\r\n"
"output no. 3 is set equal to input no. 3\r\n"
"output no. 4 is set equal to input no. 2\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Routing.Extractor"
msgid "Extract scalar signal out of signal vector dependent on IntegerRealInput index"
msgstr "根据整数实数输入索引，从信号向量中提取标量信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Routing.Extractor"
msgid "Index may be out of range"
msgstr "指数可能超出范围"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Routing.Extractor"
msgid "Output signal if index is out of range"
msgstr "指数超出范围时输出信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Routing.Extractor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This block extracts a scalar output signal out the\r\n"
"vector of input signals dependent on the Integer\r\n"
"value of the additional u index:</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = u [ index ] ;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>where index is an additional Integer input signal.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"这个模块根据额外的整数索引 u 的值，从输入信号向量中提取一个标量输出信号。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = u [ index ] ;\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中，指数是一个额外的整数输入信号。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Routing.ComplexPassThrough"
msgid "Pass a Complex signal through without modification"
msgstr "无需修改即可通过复数信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Routing.ComplexPassThrough"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Passes a Complex signal through without modification. Enables signals to be read out of one bus, have their name changed and be sent back to a bus.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"将一个复数信号不经修改地传递。使得可以从一个总线读取信号，更改它们的名称并发送回总线。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Sources"
msgid "Library of signal source blocks generating Complex signals"
msgstr "生成复数信号的信号源模块库"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Sources.ComplexExpression"
msgid "Set output signal to a time varying Complex expression"
msgstr "将输出信号设置为随时间变化的复数表达式"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Sources.ComplexExpression"
msgid "Value of Complex output"
msgstr "复数输出值"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Sources.ComplexExpression"
msgid "Time varying output signal"
msgstr "时变输出信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Sources.ComplexExpression"
msgid "%y"
msgstr "%y"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Sources.ComplexExpression"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Sources.ComplexExpression"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The (time varying) Complex output signal of this block can be defined in its\r\n"
"parameter menu via variable <strong>y</strong>. The purpose is to support the\r\n"
"easy definition of Complex expressions in a block diagram.\r\n"
"Note, that \"time\" is a built-in variable that is always\r\n"
"accessible and represents the \"model time\" and that\r\n"
"Variable <strong>y</strong> is both a variable and a connector.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模块的(时间变化的)复数输出信号可以通过其参数菜单中的变量 <strong>y</strong> 来定义。\r\n"
"其目的是支持在模块图中轻松定义复杂表达式。\r\n"
"请注意，“time”是一个内置变量，始终可访问，代表“model time”，\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Sources.ComplexConstant"
msgid "Generate constant signal of type Complex"
msgstr "生成复数类型的常量信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Sources.ComplexConstant"
msgid "Constant output value"
msgstr "恒定输出值"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Sources.ComplexConstant"
msgid "k=%k"
msgstr "k=%k"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Sources.ComplexConstant"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The Complex output y is a constant signal:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Sources/Constant.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"Constant.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"复数输出信号 y 是一个常数信号：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Sources/Constant.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"Constant.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Sources.ComplexStep"
msgid "Generate step signal of type Complex"
msgstr "生成复数类型的阶跃信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Sources.ComplexStep"
