msgstr "生成周期时钟的模块图标、连接器和求解方法"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.ClockSignals.Interfaces.ClockedBlockIcon"
msgid "Basic graphical layout of block where at least one input or output is a clocked variable"
msgstr "至少一个输入或输出为时钟变量的程序模块的基本图形布局"

