msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic"
msgid "Library of blocks that operate on periodically and non-periodically clocked signals"
msgstr "对周期性和非周期性时钟信号进行操作的模块库"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains blocks that can be utilized for periodic and non-periodic\r\n"
"clocks. These blocks usually utilize the duration of the last interval for the computation of the\r\n"
"output signal. For example, the coefficients of the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.PI\">PI</a>\r\n"
"block are computed from the coefficients of a continuous-time PI block\r\n"
"and from the duration of the last interval.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个软件包包含可以用于周期性和非周期性时钟的模块。\r\n"
"这些模块通常利用上一个时间间隔的持续时间来计算输出信号。\r\n"
"例如，<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.PI\">PI</a>\r\n"
"模块的系数是从连续时间PI块的系数和上一个时间间隔的持续时间计算得出的。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.PI"
msgid "Discrete-time PI controller with clocked input and output signals (for periodic and aperiodic systems using the parameterization of the continuous PI controller)"
msgstr "带时钟输入和输出信号的离散时间 PI 控制器(用于周期性和非周期性系统，使用连续 PI 控制器的参数化方法)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.PI"
msgid "Gain of continuous PI controller"
msgstr "连续 PI 控制器的增益"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.PI"
msgid "Time constant of continuous PI controller"
msgstr "连续 PI 控制器的时间常数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.PI"
msgid "Discrete PI state"
msgstr "离散 PI 状态"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.PI"
msgid "Sample time (periodic or non-periodic)"
msgstr "采样时间（周期性或非周期性）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.PI"
msgid "PI"
msgstr "PI"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.PI"
msgid "T=%T"
msgstr "T=%T"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.PI"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Discrete-time PI controller that has been derived from the continuous-time\r\n"
"PI controller\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"              1\r\n"
"y = k * (1 + ---) * u\r\n"
"             T*s\r\n"
"        T*s + 1\r\n"
"  = k * ------- * u\r\n"
"          T*s\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"by using the implicit Euler discretization formula. The block is\r\n"
"parametrized with the gain k and the time constant T of the continuous\r\n"
"PI block. As a result, the discrete-time form of the PI controller depends\r\n"
"explicitly on the sample time of the controller and changing this sample time,\r\n"
"will give still a similar performance.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"由连续时间 PI 控制器衍生出的离散时间 PI 控制器\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"              1\r\n"
"y = k * (1 + ---) * u\r\n"
"             T*s\r\n"
"        T*s + 1\r\n"
"  = k * ------- * u\r\n"
"          T*s\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"使用隐式欧拉离散化公式。\r\n"
"该模块的参数是连续 PI 模块的增益 k 和时间常数 T。\r\n"
"因此，PI 控制器的离散时间形式明确取决于控制器的采样时间，\r\n"
"改变采样时间仍可获得相似的性能。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.UnitDelay"
msgid "Delay the clocked input signal for one sample period"
msgstr "将时钟输入信号延迟一个采样周期"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.UnitDelay"
msgid "Value of output signal at first clock tick"
msgstr "第一个时钟周期的输出信号值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.UnitDelay"
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.UnitDelay"
msgid "z"
msgstr "z"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.UnitDelay"
msgid "y_start=%y_start"
msgstr "y_start=%y_start"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.UnitDelay"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block describes a unit delay:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// Time domain description\r\n"
"   y(ti) = previous(u(ti))\r\n"
"\r\n"
"// Discrete transfer function\r\n"
"           1\r\n"
"   y(z) = --- * u(z)\r\n"
"           z\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"that is, the output signal y is the input signal u at the\r\n"
"previous clock tick. At the first clock tick, the output\r\n"
"y is set to parameter y_start.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模块描述了单位延迟：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// Time domain description\r\n"
"   y(ti) = previous(u(ti))\r\n"
"\r\n"
"// Discrete transfer function\r\n"
"           1\r\n"
"   y(z) = --- * u(z)\r\n"
"           z\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"也就是说，输出信号 y 就是前一个时钟周期的输入信号 u。\r\n"
"在第一个时钟周期，输出 y 被设置为参数 y_start。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.FractionalDelay"
msgid "Delay the clocked input signal for a fractional multiple of the sample period"
msgstr "将时钟输入信号延迟至采样周期的整数倍"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.FractionalDelay"
msgid "Delay = interval() * shift/resolution"
msgstr "延迟 = 间隔() * 移位/分辨率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.FractionalDelay"
msgid "Time quantization resolution of sample interval"
msgstr "采样间隔的时间量化分辨率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.FractionalDelay"
msgid "The previous values of the inputs; u_last[1] = u, u_last[2] = previous(u_last[1]); u_last[3] = previous(u_last[2])"
msgstr "输入值的前一个值；u_last[1] = u, u_last[2] = previous(u_last[1]); u_last[3] = previous(u_last[2])"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.FractionalDelay"
msgid "Used to identify the first clock tick"
msgstr "用于识别第一个时钟刻度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.FractionalDelay"
msgid "%shift/%resolution"
msgstr "%shift/%resolution"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.NonPeriodic.FractionalDelay"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block delays a signal. Similar to the <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Sampler.ShiftSample\">ShiftSample</a> block the first activation of the clock of the output y is delayed by <strong>shiftCounter</strong>/<strong>resolution</strong>*interval(u) relative to the input u (interval(u) is the sample period of the clock associated to input u). However, in contrast to ShiftSample, the block provides a buffer for the input values and truly delays the input signal.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The following\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Clocked.Examples.Elementary.RealSignals.FractionalDelay\">example</a>\r\n"
"shows how a sample sine signal is delayed.\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><td width=\"50\"></td>\r\n"
"    <td valign=\"bottom\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Clocked/RealSignals/FractionalDelay_Model.png\" alt=\"FractionalDelay_Model.png\"></td>\r\n"
"    <td valign=\"bottom\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n"
"                        <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Clocked/RealSignals/FractionalDelay_Result.png\" alt=\"FractionalDelay_Result.png\"></td>\r\n"
"    </tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td></td>\r\n"
"    <td align=\"center\">model</td>\r\n"
"    <td align=\"center\">simulation result</td>\r\n"
"   </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The parameter values <strong>shiftCounter</strong>=3 and <strong>resolution</strong>=2 are visible at the bottom of the fractionalDelay block.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个模块延迟一个信号。\r\n"
"与 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Sampler.ShiftSample\">ShiftSample</a> \r\n"
"模块类似，输出信号 y 的时钟第一次激活相对于输入信号 u 延迟了\r\n"
"<strong>shiftCounter</strong>/<strong>resolution</strong>*interval(u)的时间（这里interval(u)是与输入u关联的时钟的采样周期）。\r\n"
"然而，与ShiftSample不同的是，该模块为输入值提供了一个缓冲区，并真正延迟了输入信号。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"下面的<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Clocked.Examples.Elementary.RealSignals.FractionalDelay\">example</a>\r\n"
"显示了正弦信号样本的延迟方式。\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><td width=\"50\"></td>\r\n"
"    <td valign=\"bottom\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Clocked/RealSignals/FractionalDelay_Model.png\" alt=\"FractionalDelay_Model.png\"></td>\r\n"
"    <td valign=\"bottom\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n"
"                        <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Clocked/RealSignals/FractionalDelay_Result.png\" alt=\"FractionalDelay_Result.png\"></td>\r\n"
"    </tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td></td>\r\n"
"    <td align=\"center\">model</td>\r\n"
"    <td align=\"center\">simulation result</td>\r\n"
"   </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"参数值 <strong>shiftCounter</strong>=3 和 <strong>resolution</strong>=2 可见于分数延迟模块的底部。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic"
msgid "Library of blocks that are designed to operate only on periodically clocked signals (mainly described by z transforms)"
msgstr "只对周期性时钟信号(主要由Z变换描述)进行操作的模块库"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains blocks that are designed for periodically clocked\r\n"
"system. Changing the sample rate (without changing at the same time the\r\n"
"parameters of the block), or using the blocks on non-periodically\r\n"
"clocked signals, will usually result in non-expected behavior.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个软件包包含专为周期性时钟系统设计的模块。\r\n"
"如果更改采样率（而不同时更改模块的参数），\r\n"
"或者在非周期性时钟信号上使用这些模块，通常会导致意料之外的行为。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.StateSpace"
msgid "Discrete-time State Space block"
msgstr "离散时间状态空间模块"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.StateSpace"
msgid "Matrix A of state space model"
msgstr "状态空间模型矩阵 A"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.StateSpace"
msgid "Matrix B of state space model"
msgstr "状态空间模型矩阵 B"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.StateSpace"
msgid "Matrix C of state space model"
msgstr "状态空间模型矩阵 C"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.StateSpace"
msgid "Matrix D of state space model"
msgstr "状态空间模型矩阵 D"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.StateSpace"
msgid "State vector"
msgstr "状态矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.StateSpace"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block defines the state space representation of a discrete-time block\r\n"
"with input vector u, output vector y and state vector x:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"x = A * previous(x) + B * u\r\n"
"y = C * previous(x) + D * u\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where previous(x) is the value of the clocked state x at\r\n"
"the previous clock tick.\r\n"
"The input is a vector of length nu, the output is a vector\r\n"
"of length ny and nx is the number of states. Accordingly\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A has the dimension: A(nx,nx),\r\n"
"B has the dimension: B(nx,nu),\r\n"
"C has the dimension: C(ny,nx),\r\n"
"D has the dimension: D(ny,nu)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Example:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  parameter: A = [0.12, 2;3, 1.5]\r\n"
"  parameter: B = [2, 7;3, 1]\r\n"
"  parameter: C = [0.1, 2]\r\n"
"  parameter: D = zeros(ny,nu)\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in the following equations:\r\n"
"  [x[1]]   [0.12  2.00] [previous(x[1])]   [2.0  7.0] [u[1]]\r\n"
"  [    ] = [          ]*[              ] + [        ]*[    ]\r\n"
"  [x[2]]   [3.00  1.50] [previous(x[2])]   [0.1  2.0] [u[2]]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"                        [previous(x[1])]            [u[1]]\r\n"
"  y[1]   = [0.1  2.0] * [              ] + [0  0] * [    ]\r\n"
"                        [previous(x[2])]            [u[2]]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块定义了离散时间模块的状态空间表示法，其中包含输入向量 u、输出向量 y 和状态向量 x：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >x = A * previous(x) + B * u\r\n"
"y = C * previous(x) + D * u\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中，previous(x) 是上一个时钟刻度处的时钟状态 x 的值。 输入是 nu 的矢量的长度，输出是 ny 的矢量的长度和 nx 是状态数。 因此\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >A has the dimension: A(nx,nx),\r\n"
"B has the dimension: B(nx,nu),\r\n"
"C has the dimension: C(ny,nx),\r\n"
"D has the dimension: D(ny,nu)\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"例如:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >  parameter: A = [0.12, 2;3, 1.5]\r\n"
"  parameter: B = [2, 7;3, 1]\r\n"
"  parameter: C = [0.1, 2]\r\n"
"  parameter: D = zeros(ny,nu)\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in the following equations:\r\n"
"  [x[1]]   [0.12  2.00] [previous(x[1])]   [2.0  7.0] [u[1]]\r\n"
"  [    ] = [          ]*[              ] + [        ]*[    ]\r\n"
"  [x[2]]   [3.00  1.50] [previous(x[2])]   [0.1  2.0] [u[2]]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"                        [previous(x[1])]            [u[1]]\r\n"
"  y[1]   = [0.1  2.0] * [              ] + [0  0] * [    ]\r\n"
"                        [previous(x[2])]            [u[2]]\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

