msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.TransferFunction"
msgid "Discrete-time Transfer Function block"
msgstr "离散时间传递函数模块"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.TransferFunction"
msgid "Numerator coefficients of transfer function."
msgstr "传递函数的分子系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.TransferFunction"
msgid "Denominator coefficients of transfer function."
msgstr "传递函数的分母系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.TransferFunction"
msgid "State vector of controller canonical form"
msgstr "控制器规范形式的状态矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.TransferFunction"
msgid "Size of Numerator of transfer function"
msgstr "传递函数分子的大小"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.TransferFunction"
msgid "Size of Denominator of transfer function"
msgstr "传递函数分母的大小"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.TransferFunction"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The <strong>discrete transfer function</strong> block defines the\r\n"
"transfer function between the input signal u and the output\r\n"
"signal y. The numerator has the order nb-1, the denominator\r\n"
"has the order na-1.</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"       b(1)*z^(nb-1) + b(2)*z^(nb-2) + &hellip; + b(nb)\r\n"
"y(z) = -------------------------------------------- * u(z)\r\n"
"       a(1)*z^(na-1) + a(2)*z^(na-2) + &hellip; + a(na)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>State variables <strong>x</strong> are defined according to\r\n"
"<strong>controller canonical</strong> form. Initial values of the\r\n"
"states can be set as start values of <strong>x</strong>.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Example:</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"TransferFunction g(b = {2,4}, a = {1,3});\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>results in the following transfer function:</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"     2*z + 4\r\n"
"y = --------- * u\r\n"
"      z + 3\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>离散传递函数</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">模块定义了输入信号 u 和输出信号 y 之间的传递函数。分子为 nb-1 次，分母为 na-1 次。</span>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >       b(1)*z^(nb-1) + b(2)*z^(nb-2) + … + b(nb)\r\n"
"y(z) = -------------------------------------------- * u(z)\r\n"
"       a(1)*z^(na-1) + a(2)*z^(na-2) + … + a(na)\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">状态变量 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>x </strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">按照</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>控制器标准形</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">定义。状态的初始值可以设置为 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>x</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"> 的起始值。</span>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"例如:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >TransferFunction g(b = {2,4}, a = {1,3});\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"results in the following transfer function:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >     2*z + 4\r\n"
"y = --------- * u\r\n"
"      z + 3\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.TransferFunction"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
