msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.PI"
msgid "Discrete-time PI controller"
msgstr "离散时间 PI 控制器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.PI"
msgid "Gain of discrete PI controller"
msgstr "离散PI控制器的增益"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.PI"
msgid "Time constant of discrete PI controller"
msgstr "离散 PI 控制器的时间常数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.PI"
msgid "Discrete PI state"
msgstr "离散 PI 状态"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.PI"
msgid "PI"
msgstr "PI"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.PI"
msgid "Td=%Td"
msgstr "Td=%Td"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.PI"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block defines a discrete-time PI controller by the formula:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// State space form:\r\n"
"   x(ti) = previous(x(ti)) + u(ti)/Td;\r\n"
"   y(ti) = kd*(x(ti) + u(ti));\r\n"
"\r\n"
"// Transfer function form:\r\n"
"   y(z) = kd*(c*z-1)/(z-1)*u(z);\r\n"
"          c = 1 + 1/Td\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where kd is the gain, Td is the time constant, ti is the time instant\r\n"
"of the i-th clock tick and z is the inverse shift operator.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This discrete-time form has been derived from the continuous-time\r\n"
"form of a PI controller by using the implicit Euler discretization formula.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模块通过公式定义离散时间 PI 控制器：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// State space form:This block defines a discrete-time PI controller by the formula:\r\n"
"   x(ti) = previous(x(ti)) + u(ti)/Td;\r\n"
"   y(ti) = kd*(x(ti) + u(ti));\r\n"
"\r\n"
"// Transfer function form:\r\n"
"   y(z) = kd*(c*z-1)/(z-1)*u(z);\r\n"
"          c = 1 + 1/Td\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中，kd 是增益，Td 是时间常数，ti 是第 i 个时钟周期的时间瞬间，z 是反移位算子。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这离散时间形式是通过使用隐式 Euler 离散化公式，从PI控制器的连续时间形式推导而来的。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.MovingAverage"
msgid "Moving average filter (= FIR filter with coefficients a = fill(1/n,n), but implemented recursively)"
msgstr "移动平均滤波器(= FIR滤波器，系数a = fill(1/n,n)，但以递归方式实现)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.MovingAverage"
msgid "Number of points that are averaged (= number of coefficients of corresponding FIR filter)"
msgstr "取平均值的点数(= 相应FIR滤波器的系数数)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.MovingAverage"
msgid "The previous values of the inputs; u_buffer[1] = u, u_buffer[2] = previous(u_buffer[1]); u_buffer[3] = previous(u_buffer[2])"
msgstr "以前的输入值; u_buffer[1] = u, u_buffer[2] = previous(u_buffer[1]); u_buffer[3] = previous(u_buffer[2])"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.MovingAverage"
msgid "Used to identify the first clock tick"
msgstr "用于识别第一个时钟滴答"

