msgstr "滤波器的阶数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.FIRbyCoefficients"
msgid "The previous values of the inputs; u_buffer[1] = u, u_buffer[2] = previous(u_buffer[1]); u_buffer[3] = previous(u_buffer[2])"
msgstr "以前的输入值; u_buffer[1] = u, u_buffer[2] = previous(u_buffer[1]); u_buffer[3] = previous(u_buffer[2])"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.FIRbyCoefficients"
msgid "Used to identify the first clock tick"
msgstr "用于识别第一个时钟刻度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.FIRbyCoefficients"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block computes the output y as a linear combination of the input u\r\n"
"and of its past values (= FIR filter):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y(i) = a[1]*u(i) + a[2]*u(i-1) + a[3]*u(i-2) + &hellip;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where y(i) and u(i) are the values of y and u at clock tick i and\r\n"
"a[:] are the filter coefficients.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"At the first clock tick i=1 the past values are filled with u at this clock tick (= steady state initialization).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块将输出 y 计算为输入 u 及其过去值的线性组合（= FIR 滤波器）：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y(i) = a[1]*u(i) + a[2]*u(i-1) + a[3]*u(i-2) + …\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中，y(i) 和 u(i) 是时钟刻度 i 时的 y 值和 u 值，a[:] 是滤波器系数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">在第一个时钟周期 i=1 时，过去的值被当前时刻的 u 填充（= 稳态初始化）。</span>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.FIRbyCoefficients"
msgid "FIR"
msgstr "FIR"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.Periodic.FIRbyCoefficients"
msgid "a=%a"
msgstr "a=%a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.TimeBasedSources"
msgid "Package of signal source blocks generating clocked simulation time based Real signals"
msgstr "生成基于时钟模拟时间的实信号的信号源模块包"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.RealSignals.TimeBasedSources"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package provides <strong>source</strong> components akin to the blocks provided in\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources</a>, but with the difference\r\n"
"that they provide a <strong>clocked</strong> output signal.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"As an effect it is not necessary to use an intermediate Sample block if the output signal\r\n"
"is connected to a system that requires a clocked input signal. Therefore, it it can be slightly more convenient\r\n"
"to use the blocks provided in this package than to use the blocks offered by <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources</a>\r\n"
"(since one does not need to add an additional Sample block for the transition from a continuous time signal to a clocked signal).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p style=\"text-align: start;\">该包提供的源组件类似于 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources</a>&nbsp; 中的模块，不同之处在于它们提供的是<strong>时钟驱动</strong>的输出信号。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: start;\">因此，当输出信号连接到需要时钟输入信号的系统时，无需使用额外的采样模块。因此，使用此包中的模块比使用 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources</a>&nbsp; 中的模块更为方便，因为无需为从连续时间信号转换到时钟信号添加额外的采样模块。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

