msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.NonPeriodic.UnitDelay"
msgid "y_start=%y_start"
msgstr "y_start=%y_start"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.NonPeriodic.UnitDelay"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block describes a unit delay:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// Time domain description\r\n"
"   y(ti) = previous(u(ti))\r\n"
"\r\n"
"// Discrete transfer function\r\n"
"           1\r\n"
"   y(z) = --- * u(z)\r\n"
"           z\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"that is, the output signal y is the input signal u at the\r\n"
"previous clock tick. At the first clock tick, the output\r\n"
"y is set to parameter y_start.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模块描述了单位延迟：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >// Time domain description\r\n"
"   y(ti) = previous(u(ti))\r\n"
"\r\n"
"// Discrete transfer function\r\n"
"           1\r\n"
"   y(z) = --- * u(z)\r\n"
"           z\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">也就是说，输出信号 y 是前一个时钟周期的输入信号 u。在第一个时钟周期，输出 y 被设置为参数 y_start。</span>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.NonPeriodic.FractionalDelay"
msgid "Delay the clocked input signal for a fractional multiple of the sample period"
msgstr "将时钟输入信号延迟至采样周期的整数倍"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.NonPeriodic.FractionalDelay"
msgid "Delay = interval() * shift/resolution"
msgstr "延迟 = 间隔() * 移位/分辨率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.NonPeriodic.FractionalDelay"
msgid "Time quantization resolution of sample interval"
msgstr "采样间隔的时间量化分辨率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.NonPeriodic.FractionalDelay"
msgid "The previous values of the inputs; u_last[1] = u, u_last[2] = previous(u_last[1]); u_last[3] = previous(u_last[2])"
msgstr "输入值的前一个值；u_last[1] = u, u_last[2] = previous(u_last[1]); u_last[3] = previous(u_last[2])"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.NonPeriodic.FractionalDelay"
msgid "Used to identify the first clock tick"
msgstr "用于识别第一个时钟刻度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.NonPeriodic.FractionalDelay"
msgid "%shift/%resolution"
msgstr "%shift/%resolution"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TimeBasedSources"
msgid "Package of signal source blocks generating clocked simulation time based Integer signals"
msgstr "生成基于时钟模拟时间的整数信号的信号源模块包"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TimeBasedSources"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package provides <strong>source</strong> components akin to the blocks provided in\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources</a>, but with the difference\r\n"
"that they provide a <strong>clocked</strong> output signal.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"As an effect it is not necessary to use an intermediate Sample block if the output signal\r\n"
"is connected to a system that requires a clocked input signal. Therefore, it it can be slightly more convenient\r\n"
"to use the blocks provided in this package than to use the blocks offered by <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources</a>\r\n"
"(since one does not need to add an additional Sample block for the transition from a continuous time signal to a clocked signal).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该软件包提供的 <strong>源</strong> 组件类似于 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources</a>&nbsp; 中提供的模块， 但不同之处在于它们提供<strong> 时钟驱动 </strong>输出信号。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"因此，如果输出信号连接到需要时钟输入信号的系统， 就不必使用中间的采模样块。 因此，使用这个包提供的模块可能比使用 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources</a>&nbsp; 提供的模块稍微方便一些 （因为不需要为从连续时间信号到时钟信号的过渡添加额外的采样模块）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TimeBasedSources.Step"
msgid "Generate step signal of type Integer"
msgstr "生成整数类型的阶跃信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TimeBasedSources.Step"
msgid "Height of step"
msgstr "阶梯高度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TimeBasedSources.Step"
msgid "Offset of output signal y"
msgstr "输出信号的偏移 y"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TimeBasedSources.Step"
msgid "Output y = offset for time < startTime"
msgstr "输出 y = 时间 < 起始时间的偏移量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TimeBasedSources.Step"
msgid "startTime=%startTime"
msgstr "startTime=%startTime"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TimeBasedSources.Step"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The block is similar to the block in <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources.IntegerStep\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources.IntegerStep</a>, but adapted to work in clocked partitions (by internal sampling of the continuous <strong>time</strong> variable).</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The Integer output y is a step signal:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Sources/IntegerStep.png\" alt=\"IntegerStep.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"See model <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Clocked.Examples.Elementary.IntegerSignals.TimeBasedStep\">Modelica.Clocked.Examples.Elementary.IntgerSignals.TimeBasedStep</a>.\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该模块类似于<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources.IntegerStep\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources.IntegerStep</a>，\r\n"
"但经调整后可在时钟分区中工作（通过对连续 <strong>time</strong> 变量进行内部采样）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"整数输出 y 是阶跃信号：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Blocks/Sources/IntegerStep.png\" alt=\"IntegerStep.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"见模型 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Clocked.Examples.Elementary.IntegerSignals.TimeBasedStep\">Modelica.Clocked.Examples.Elementary.IntgerSignals.TimeBasedStep</a>.\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TickBasedSources"
msgid "Package of signal source blocks generating clocked tick/sample based Integer signals"
msgstr "生成基于时钟滴答/采样整数信号的信号源模块包"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TickBasedSources"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This package provides <strong>source</strong> components akin to the blocks provided in <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources</a>, but with the difference that they provide </p>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li>a <strong>clocked</strong> output signal and</li>\r\n"
"<li>are parametrized in terms of <strong>clock ticks</strong> rather than simulation time.</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该软件包提供的 <strong>源</strong> 组件类似于 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources\" target=\"\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources</a>&nbsp; 中提供的模块， 但不同之处在于它们提供了\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ol><li>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">一个</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>时钟驱动</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">的输出信号</span></li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">以</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>时钟周期</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">而不是仿真时间为参数进行参数化</span></li>\r\n"
"</ol></html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TickBasedSources.Step"
msgid "Generate step signal of type Integer"
msgstr "生成整数类型的阶跃信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TickBasedSources.Step"
msgid "Height of step"
msgstr "阶梯高度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TickBasedSources.Step"
msgid "Offset of output signal y"
msgstr "输出信号的偏移 y"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TickBasedSources.Step"
msgid "Output y = offset for clock tick < startTick"
msgstr "输出 y = 时钟刻度 < 起始刻度的偏移量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TickBasedSources.Step"
msgid "startTick=%startTick"
msgstr "startTick=%startTick"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.TickBasedSources.Step"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The Integer output y is a step signal. The signal is defined in terms of clock ticks instead of simulation time:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Clocked/IntegerSignals/TickBasedSources_Step.png\" alt=\"TickBasedSources_Step.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"See model <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Clocked.Examples.Elementary.IntegerSignals.TickBasedStep\">Modelica.Clocked.Examples.Elementary.IntgerSignals.TickBasedStep</a>.\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"整数输出 y 是阶跃信号。该信号以时钟刻度而非模拟时间定义：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Clocked/IntegerSignals/TickBasedSources_Step.png\" alt=\"TickBasedSources_Step.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"见模型 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Clocked.Examples.Elementary.IntegerSignals.TickBasedStep\">Modelica.Clocked.Examples.Elementary.IntgerSignals.TickBasedStep</a>.\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.Interfaces"
msgid "Library of partial blocks for components with clocked Integer signals"
msgstr "带有时钟整数信号的元件基础模块库"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.Interfaces"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains partial blocks that are used to\r\n"
"construct blocks operating on clocked Integer signals.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该软件包包含部分模块，用于构建在时钟整数信号上运行的模块。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.Interfaces.SamplerIcon"
msgid "Basic graphical layout of block used for of Integer signals"
msgstr "整数信号模块的基本图形布局"

msgctxt "Modelica.Clocked.IntegerSignals.Interfaces.PartialSISOSampler"
