msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.CauerLowPassSC"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The example CauerLowPassSC is a low-pass-filter of the fifth order. It is realized using an switched-capacitor network with operational amplifiers. The voltage source V is the input voltage (step), and the OP5.out.v is the filter output voltage. The pulse response is calculated.</p>\r\n"
"<p>This model is identical to the CauerLowPassAnalog example, but inverting. To get the same response as that of the CauerLowPassAnalog example, a negative voltage step is used as input.</p>\r\n"
"<p>This model is identical to the CauerLowPassOPV example. But the resistors are realized by switched capacitors (see <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.Utilities.SwitchedCapacitor\">SwitchedCapacitor</a>). There are two different types of instances, one with a value of <code>R=1</code> and one with a value of <code>R=-1</code>.</p>\r\n"
"<p>The simulation end time should be 60. Please plot both V.v (which is the inverted input voltage) and OP5.out.v (output voltage). Compare this result with the CauerLowPassAnalog result.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Due to the recharging of the capacitances after switching the performance of simulation is not as good as in the CauerLowPassOPV example.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>CauerLowPassSC是一个五阶低通滤波器。它采用带运算放大器的开关电容网络实现。电压源是滤波器的输入电压(阶跃)，OP5.out.v 是滤波器输出电压。 该滤波器已计算脉冲响应。</p>\r\n"
"<p>该模型与CauerLowPassAnalog示例类似，但是是反向的(两者的输出电压变化趋势相反)。为了获得与CauerLowPassAnalog示例相同的响应，使用负电压(步进)作为输入。</p>\r\n"
"<p>该模型与CauerLowPassOPV示例类似，但是电阻由开关电容实现(详见<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.Utilities.SwitchedCapacitor\">SwitchedCapacitor</a>)。滤波器电阻值有两种,一种值为<code>R=1</code>，另一个值为<code>R=-1</code>。</p>\r\n"
"<p>CauerLowPassSC示例的仿真结束时间为60秒。用户可在“仿真--仿真浏览器”中勾选相应的“仿真结果变量”查看示例的输入电压和输出电压。用户可以将此结果与CauerLowPassAnalog的运行结果进行比较。</p>\r\n"
"<p>由于电容的充电现象，该滤波器示例的仿真性能会不如CauerLowPassOPV示例。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.CharacteristicIdealDiodes"
msgid "Characteristic of ideal diodes"
msgstr "理想二极管的特性"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.CharacteristicIdealDiodes"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Three examples of ideal diodes are shown:\r\n"
"<br>the <strong>totally ideal diode</strong> (Ideal) with all parameters to be zero,\r\n"
"the <strong>nearly ideal diode</strong> with <em>Ron=0.1</em> and <em>Goff=0.1</em>\r\n"
" and the nearly ideal but <strong>displaced diode</strong> with <em>Vknee=5</em> and <em>Ron=0.1</em> and <em>Goff=0.1</em>.\r\n"
"The resistance and conductance are chosen untypically high since the slopes should be seen in the graphics.\r\n"
"</p><p>Simulate until T=1 s.\r\n"
"Plot in separate windows:\r\n"
"Ideal.i versus Ideal.v, With_Ron_Goff.i versus With_Ron_Goff.v, With_Ron_Goff_Vknee.i versus With_Ron_Goff_Vknee.v\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"展示了三个理想二极管的示例: <br>所有参数为零的完全理想二极管；参数<em>Ron=0.1</em>，<em>Goff=0.1</em>的近似理想二极管； 参数<em>Vknee=5</em>，<em>Ron=0.1</em>，<em>Goff=0.1</em>的近似理想但偏移的二极管。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"示例仿真时长为1秒。用户可在“仿真--仿真浏览器”中勾选相应的“仿真结果变量”查看示例的参数变化情况。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

