msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.HeatingMOSInverter"
msgid "Heating MOS Inverter"
msgstr "考虑热特性的MOS逆变器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.HeatingMOSInverter"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The heating MOS inverter shows a heat flow always if a transistor is leading.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Simulate until T=5 s. Plot in separate windows:<br> Sin.p.v and Capacitor1.p.v<br>HeatCapacitor1.port.T and H_PMOS.heatPort.T and H_NMOS.heatPort.T<br>H_PMOS.heatPort.Q_flow and H_NMOS.heatPort.Q_flow</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>加热型MOS逆变器示例显示了当一个晶体管是导通时始终有热流的过程。</p>\r\n"
"<p>该示例的仿真时长为5秒。用户可在“仿真--仿真浏览器”中勾选相应的“仿真结果变量”查看示例Sin.p.v、Capacitor1.p.v、HeatCapacitor1.port.T、H_PMOS.heatPort.T、H_NMOS.heatPort.T、H_PMOS.heatPort.Q_flow和H_NMOS.heatPort.Q_flow等结果变量的图像。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

