msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.HeatingNPN_NORGate"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The heating &quot;NPN NOR&quot; gate shows a heat flow always if a transistor is leading.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Simulate until T=200 s. Plot in separate windows:\r\n"
"<br>V1.v and V2.v and C2.v\r\n"
"<br>HeatCapacitor1.port.T and T1.heatPort.T and T2.heatPort.T\r\n"
"<br>T1.heatPort.Q_flow and T2.heatPort.Q_flow</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该示例显示了如果一个晶体管处于导通状态，就会一直有热量流动。</p>\r\n"
"<p>示例的仿真时长为200秒。用户可在“仿真--仿真浏览器”中勾选相应的“仿真结果变量”查看V1.v、V2.v、C2.v、HeatCapacitor1.port.T、T1.heatPort.T、T2.heatPort.T\r\n"
"、T1.heatPort.Q_flow、T2.heatPort.Q_flow等结果变量的图像。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

