msgid "Value for capacitances"
msgstr "电容值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.HeatingPNP_NORGate"
msgid "Value for ideal forward and reverse transit time of semiconductors"
msgstr "半导体理想正向和反向过渡时间的值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.HeatingPNP_NORGate"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The heating &quot;PNP NOR&quot; gate shows a heat flow always if a transistor is conducting.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Simulate until T=200 s. Plot V1.v and V2.v and C2.v to see the NOR-functionality. High potential is -6V which means logic &quot;true&quot;. Low potential is 0V which means logic &quot;false&quot;.</p>\r\n"
"<p>To see which transistor is conducting one can have a look at the temperatures T1.heatPort.T and T2.heatPort.T and the heat flows T1.heatPort.Q_flow and T2.heatPort.Q_flow of the heatports of the transistors T1 and T2.</p>\r\n"
"<p>They are different from zero if the transistor is conducting.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该示例展示了如果一个晶体管处于导通状态，就会一直有热量流动。</p>\r\n"
"<p>示例的仿真时间为200秒。用户可在“仿真--仿真浏览器”中勾选相应的“仿真结果变量”查看\r\n"
"V1.v、V2.v和C2.v等结果变量的数值(这些变量数值的变化可以显现出异或门的工作情况)。当高电位为-6V时表示异或门逻辑为true；当低电位为0V时，表示异或门逻辑为flase。</p>\r\n"
"<p>如果用户想要查看哪个晶体管正在导通，可在“仿真--仿真浏览器”中通过勾选“仿真结果变量”查看对应的温度结果变量和热流结果变量数值进行判断。</p>\r\n"
"<p>当晶体管导通时，温度结果变量和热流结果变量的数值将不为0。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

