msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.ShowSaturatingInductor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This simple circuit uses the saturating inductor which has a changing inductance.</p>\r\n"
"<p>This circuit should be simulated until 1 s. Compare <code>SaturatingInductance1.p.i</code> with <code>Inductance1.p.i</code> to see the difference between saturating and ideal inductor.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>这个简单的回路使用了电感值会变化的饱和电感。</p>\r\n"
"<p>这个回路的仿真时间为1秒。用户可以通过比较<code>SaturatingInductance1.p.i</code>和<code>Inductance1.p.i</code>的数值查看饱和电感与理想电感之间的差异。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.ShowVariableResistor"
msgid "Simple demo of a VariableResistor model"
msgstr "简单演示可变电阻模型"

