msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.SwitchWithArc"
msgid "Comparison of switch models both with and without arc"
msgstr "比较产生与不产生电弧效应的开关模型之间的差异"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.SwitchWithArc"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This example is to compare the behaviour of switch models with and without an electric arc taking into consideration.</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Simulate until T=2 s.</li>\r\n"
"<li>Plot in one window:  <code>switch1.i</code> and <code>switch2.i</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>The difference in the closing area shows that the simple arc model avoids the suddenly switching.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>这个示例比较了产生与不产生电弧效应的开关模型之间的行为差异。</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>该示例的仿真时间为2秒。</li>\r\n"
"<li>用户可在“仿真--仿真浏览器”中勾选相应的“仿真结果变量”查看以下变量的图像:<code>switch1.i</code>和<code>switch2.i</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>通过比较两种开关模型，可以发现使用简单的电弧模型能够避免开关在闭合时突然变化(指断开行为)。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.SwitchWithArc"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
