msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.ThyristorBehaviourTest"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This is a simple test circuit, to test the behavior of the thyristor model.</p><p>Interesting values to plot are Cathode.v, Gate.v and sineVoltage.p.v. and in another plot window pulseCurrent.p.i</p><p>The simulation time should be from 0 seconds to 2e-4 seconds.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
