msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.IdealTriacCircuit"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The simple ideal TRIAC example shows how a triac is used within an alternating current circuit.</p>\r\n"
"<p>The TRIAC is not conducting until the Boolean input becomes true (internally coded by 1, therefore the input is called fire<strong>1</strong>). Then it becomes &quot;conducting&quot;, the knee voltage is reached. If the TRIAC voltage falls below the knee voltage, the TRIAC becomes blocking. Due to the antiparallel connection of the internal two thyristors the same behavior is repeated in the negative half-wave.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Simulate until 2 seconds. Display V.p.v (input voltage), booleanPulse.y (fire1 input), and both idealTriac.n.v and idealTriac.n.i, which demonstrate the TRIAC behavior.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>这个示例展示了TRIAC在交流电路中的应用。</p>\r\n"
"<p>当布尔输入变为真时(内部编码为1，因此称为fire1)，TRIAC才开始导通。一旦导通，就会达到“膝压”电压。如果TRIAC的电压低于膝压电压，TRIAC将停止导通。由于内部两个晶闸管的反并联连接，相同的行为在负半波中重复出现。</p>\r\n"
"<p>该示例的仿真时长为2秒。用户可以在“仿真--仿真浏览器”中勾选相应的“仿真结果变量”查看以下变量的数值：V.p.v(输入电压)、booleanPulse.y(触发输入)、idealTriac.n.v、idealTriac.n.i</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.AD_DA_conversion"
msgid "Conversion circuit"
msgstr "转换电路"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.AD_DA_conversion"
msgid "Digital signal width"
msgstr "数字信号位宽"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.AD_DA_conversion"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The simple converter circuit converts an analog sine signal into a N-bit (by default a 4 bit) logic signal, which is converted backward into an analog signal.</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Simulate for 0.2 s.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>Compare the input voltage (aD_Converter.p.v) with the output voltage (dA_Converter.p.v). By changing N the influence of the digital signal width can be studied. Otherwise the trigger frequency pulse.period can be changed to see its influence.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该简易转换器电路将一个模拟正弦信号转换成一个N位的逻辑信号(默认情况下为4位)，然后再将其反向转换回模拟信号。</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>示例的仿真</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>用户可在“仿真--仿真浏览器”中勾选相应的“仿真结果变量”查看示例的输入电压(aD_Converter.p.v)和输出电压(dA_Converter.p.v)。当修改“组件参数窗口”的参数N后，用户可通过仿真观察到数字信号宽度的变化。或者换一种方法，在“仿真--仿真结果变量”窗口处修改pulse.period的数值后，用户也可以通过这样的修改观察到数字信号宽度的变化。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

