msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.SeriesResonance"
msgid "Series resonance circuit"
msgstr "串联共振电路"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.SeriesResonance"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model demonstrates the transient behaviour of a series resonant circuit:\r\n"
"A sine or cosine voltage with variable frequency and constant amplitude is applied to a series connection of L, C and R.\r\n"
"The parameter values result in a resonance frequency of 100 Hz.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>这个模型演示了串联电路的瞬态行为。在这个模型中，一个具有可变频率和恒定幅值的正弦(/余弦)电压被应用到串联的电感(L)、电容(C)和电阻(R)上。即在这个电路中，有一个电感、一个电容和一个电阻依次串联。参数值被设置为使得电路的共振频率为100Hz。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

