msgstr "参考电压"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.OpAmps.Comparator"
msgid "Calculated potentiometer ratio to reach Vref"
msgstr "计算达到参考电压所需的电位器比率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.OpAmps.Comparator"
msgid "Resistance of potentiometer"
msgstr "电位器的电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.OpAmps.Comparator"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This is a comparator. Resistance R1 can be chosen, resistance R2 is defined by the desired reference voltage Vref (between Vn and Vp). The output switches between Vn for input voltage &lt; Vref and Vp for input voltage &gt; Vref.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>这是一个比较器。用户可在结果窗口勾选R1后查看仿真结果。R2由所需参考电压Vref决定。输出在输入电压小于Vref时切换到Vn，在输入电压大于Vref时切换到Vp。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.OpAmps.InvertingSchmittTrigger"
msgid "Inverting Schmitt trigger with hysteresis"
msgstr "(反相)滞回触发器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.OpAmps.InvertingSchmittTrigger"
msgid "Positive supply"
msgstr "正电压"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.OpAmps.InvertingSchmittTrigger"
