msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.Utilities.NonlinearResistor"
msgid "Chua's resistor"
msgstr "Chua电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.Utilities.NonlinearResistor"
msgid "Conductance in inner voltage range"
msgstr "内电压范围内的导纳"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.Utilities.NonlinearResistor"
msgid "Conductance in outer voltage range"
msgstr "外电压范围内的导纳"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.Utilities.NonlinearResistor"
msgid "Inner voltage range limit"
msgstr "内部电压范围限制"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.Utilities.NonlinearResistor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.Utilities.NonlinearResistor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This is the only nonlinear component for Chua&#39;s circuit. It is a piecewise linear resistor with both an inner and an outer range, which includes the inner one. The slopes of both ranges are given by parameters. The resistance characteristic is continuous. For Chua&#39;s circuit both slopes have to be chosen to be negative.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>这是Chua电路中唯一的非线性元件。该非线性电阻器具有分段线性特性。其特性基于两个电压范围，分别是内部电压范围和外部电压范围。其电导率在内部和外部范围内由参数所决定，保证了电阻特性的连续性。在Chua电路中，这两个范围的电导率均需为负值以确保电路的正常运行。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.Utilities.RealSwitch"
msgid "Ideal switch with resistance"
msgstr "带有电阻的理想开关"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.Utilities.RealSwitch"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This component is a special kind of a commuting switch which possesses an additional constant resistance. This resistance was necessary in an example. It is not designed for common use.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个组件是一种特殊的交换开关，它拥有额外的恒定电阻。它只能在某个例子中使用，因为它并不是为常规使用设计的。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.Utilities.Transistor"
msgid "Transistor with resistance an capacitance"
msgstr "有电阻和电容的晶体管"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.Utilities.Transistor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Examples.Utilities.Transistor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Since the simple bipolar transistor model does not have base or collector resistances both are added in this component. Additionally, a capacity is added to the base pin. See the schematic for more details.  In such a way the transistor model can be enhanced to become more common.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>由于简单的双极型晶体管模型没有基极或集电器电阻，因此这个组件中添加了这两个电阻。另外，在基极引脚上添加了一个电容。有关详细信息，请参见电路图。这样，晶体管模型可以被增强，以实现更常见的功能。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

