msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic"
msgid "Basic electrical components"
msgstr "基础电气元件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This package contains very basic analog electrical components such as resistor, conductor, capacitor, inductor, and the ground (which is needed in each electrical circuit description. Furthermore, controlled sources, coupling components, and some improved (but nevertheless basic) are in this package.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>这个库含了很基本的模拟电气元件，例如电阻器、导电体、电容器、电感器，以及接地组件(电路描述中需要的电路的组成部分)。此外，库还包括受控源、耦合元件以及一些改进但仍然基本的元件。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

