msgid "Primary inductance"
msgstr "主电感"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Transformer"
msgid "Secondary inductance"
msgstr "次电感"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Transformer"
msgid "Coupling inductance"
msgstr "耦合电感"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Transformer"
msgid "Difference between voltage drop over primary inductor and voltage drop over secondary inductor"
msgstr "Difference between voltage drop over primary inductor and voltage drop over secondary inductor"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Transformer"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The transformer is a two port. The left port voltage <em>v1</em>, left port current <em>i1</em>, right port voltage <em>v2</em> and right port current <em>i2</em> are connected by the following relation:</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"| v1 |         | L1   M  |  | i1&#39; |\r\n"
"|    |    =    |         |  |     |\r\n"
"| v2 |         | M    L2 |  | i2&#39; |\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p><em>L1</em>, <em>L2</em>, and <em>M</em> are the primary, secondary, and coupling inductances respectively.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>变压器是一个双端口设备。左端口的电压为<em>v1</em>，左端口的电流为<em>i1</em>，右端口的电压为<em>v2</em>，右端口的电流为<em>i2</em>，它们之间的关系如下：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"| v1 |         | L1   M  |  | i1&#39; |\r\n"
"|    |    =    |         |  |     |\r\n"
"| v2 |         | M    L2 |  | i2&#39; |\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p><em>L1</em>、<em>L2</em>和<em>M</em>分别是初级、次级和耦合电感。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

