msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Gyrator"
msgid "Secondary gyration conductance"
msgstr "副端口旋转导纳"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Gyrator"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>A gyrator is a two-port element defined by the following equations:</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"i1 =  G2 * v2\r\n"
"i2 = -G1 * v1\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>where the constants <em>G1</em>, <em>G2</em> are called the gyration conductance.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>回转器是一个两端口元件，它的相关定义如下方程式：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"i1 =  G2 * v2\r\n"
"i2 = -G1 * v1\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p><em>G1</em>, <em>G2</em>是回转器的导纳。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

