msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.VCV"
msgid "Linear voltage-controlled voltage source"
msgstr "线性电压控制电压源"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.VCV"
msgid "Voltage gain"
msgstr "电压增益"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.VCV"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The linear voltage-controlled voltage source is a TwoPort. The right port voltage v2 is controlled by the left port voltage v1 via</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = v1 * gain.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>The left port current is zero. Any voltage gain can be chosen.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>线性电压控制电压源是一个双端口器件。右端口电压v2通过以下方式由左端口电压v1控制：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2=v1*gain.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>左侧端口的电流为零。可以选择任何电压增益。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

