msgstr "理想运算放大器(无源元件-零元件对)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Ideal.IdealOpAmp"
msgid "Voltage drop over the left port"
msgstr "左端口电压降"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Ideal.IdealOpAmp"
msgid "Voltage drop over the right port"
msgstr "右端口电压降"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Ideal.IdealOpAmp"
msgid "Current flowing from pos. to neg. pin of the left port"
msgstr "从左端口正极引脚流向负极引脚的电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Ideal.IdealOpAmp"
msgid "Current flowing from pos. to neg. pin of the right port"
msgstr "从右端口正极引脚流向负极引脚的电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Ideal.IdealOpAmp"
msgid "Positive pin of the left port"
msgstr "左端口的正极"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Ideal.IdealOpAmp"
msgid "Negative pin of the left port"
msgstr "左端口的负极"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Ideal.IdealOpAmp"
msgid "Positive pin of the right port"
msgstr "右端口的正极"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Ideal.IdealOpAmp"
msgid "Negative pin of the right port"
msgstr "右端口的负极"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Ideal.IdealOpAmp"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The ideal OpAmp is a two-port. The left port is fixed to <em>v1=0</em> and <em>i1=0</em>\r\n"
"(nullator). At the right port both any voltage <em>v2</em> and any current <em>i2</em>\r\n"
"are possible (norator).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>理想运算放大器是一个双端口设备。左端口被固定为<em>v1=0</em>且<em>i1=0</em>(这种状态被称为“虚地”)。右端口极为灵活，任何电压<em>v2</em>和任何电流<em>i2</em>都是可以被接受的。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

