msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Ideal.IdealGyrator"
msgid "Ideal gyrator"
msgstr "理想回转器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Ideal.IdealGyrator"
msgid "Gyration conductance"
msgstr "回转导纳"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Ideal.IdealGyrator"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A gyrator is an ideal two-port element defined by the following equations:\r\n"
"<br><br>\r\n"
"<code>\r\n"
"  i1 =  G * v2<br>\r\n"
"  i2 = -G * v1<br>\r\n"
"</code>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"where the constant <em>G</em> is called the gyration conductance.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"回转器是一个理想的双端元件，定义如下两个方程：\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<br><br>\r\n"
"<code>\r\n"
"  i1 =  G * v2<br>\r\n"
"  i2 = -G * v1<br>\r\n"
"</code>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"其中<em>G</em>为回转电导。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

