msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.IdealSemiconductor"
msgid "Ideal semiconductor"
msgstr "理想半导体"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.IdealSemiconductor"
msgid "Forward state-on differential resistance (closed resistance)"
msgstr "正向导通状态下的微分电阻(闭合电阻)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.IdealSemiconductor"
msgid "Backward state-off conductance (opened conductance)"
msgstr "反向关态导纳(导通导纳)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.IdealSemiconductor"
msgid "Forward threshold voltage"
msgstr "正向阈值电压"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.IdealSemiconductor"
msgid "Switching state"
msgstr "开关状态"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.IdealSemiconductor"
msgid "Auxiliary variable for actual position on the ideal diode characteristic"
msgstr "辅助变量(用于描述理想二极管的实际状态特性)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.IdealSemiconductor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is an ideal semiconductor which is<br><br>\r\n"
"<strong>open </strong>(off), if it is reversed biased (voltage drop less than 0)<br>\r\n"
"<strong>closed</strong> (on), if it is conducting (current > 0).<br>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"This is the behaviour if all parameters are exactly zero.<br><br>\r\n"
"Note, there are circuits, where this ideal description\r\n"
"with zero resistance and zero conductance is not possible.\r\n"
"In order to prevent singularities during switching, the opened\r\n"
"semiconductor has a small conductance <em>Gon</em>\r\n"
"and the closed semiconductor has a low resistance <em>Roff</em> which is default.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The parameter <em>Vknee</em> which is the forward threshold voltage, allows to displace\r\n"
"the knee point<br> along  the <em>Gon</em>-characteristic until <em>v = Vknee</em>.\r\n"
"<br><br>\r\n"
"<strong>Please note:</strong>\r\n"
"In case of useHeatPort=true the temperature dependence of the electrical\r\n"
"behavior is <strong>not</strong> modelled.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>这是一个理想半导体:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>如果半导体处于反向偏置状态(电压降小于0)，则为<strong>关闭</strong>(打开)状态；如果处于传导状态(电流大于0)，则为<strong>打开</strong>(关闭)状态。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<br>这样的工作性能需满足其他参数都为0时的条件。<br><br>\r\n"
"请注意，有些电路中，理想描述(零电阻和零导电性)是无法实现的。为了在开关过程中避免出现奇点，当半导体开路时会有一个很小的导电性<em>Gon</em>，而当半导体闭合时，会有一个较低的电阻<em>Roff</em>，这是默认设置。这样的设计考虑到了实际器件的非理想特性，以确保电路行为的连续性和稳定性。</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"正向阈值电压Vknee，允许沿<em>Gon</em>特性(导电特性)平移，直到<em>v=Vknee</em>。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<br><br>\r\n"
"<strong>请注意：</strong>\r\n"
"当useHeatPort设置为true时，电学行为的温度依赖性未被建模。这意味着，尽管热端口被启用，但该模型并<strong>未</strong>考虑温度变化对电气特性的影响。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

