msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Semiconductors.Diode"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The simple diode is an electrical one port, where a heat port is added, which is\r\n"
"defined in the Modelica.Thermal library. It consists of the diode itself and a parallel ohmic\r\n"
"resistance <em>R</em>. If <em>useTemperatureDependency</em> is set to <em>true</em>, the diode formula is:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"           v/N/vt_t\r\n"
"i = Ids (e          - 1)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"where <em>vt_t</em> depends on the temperature of the heat port:\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"vt_t = k*temp/q\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If <em>useTemperatureDependency</em> is set to <em>false</em>, the diode formula utilizes the voltage equivalent of the temperature, i.e.,\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"           v/Vt\r\n"
"i = Ids (e      - 1).\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If the exponent <em>v/N/vt_t</em> or <em>v/Vt</em>, respectively, reaches the limit <em>Maxexp</em>, the diode characteristic is linearly continued to avoid overflow.<br>\r\n"
"The thermal power is calculated by <em>i*v</em>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>简单二极管是一个电气一端口模型，该模型有一个热端口(热端口定义在Modelica.Thermal库中)。该模型二极管本身和并联电阻<em>R</em>组成。如果<em>useTemperatureDependency</em>设置为true，则二极管公式为：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"           v/N/vt_t\r\n"
"i = Ids (e          - 1)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"其中<em>vt_t</em>随热端口温度的变化而变化：\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"vt_t = k*temp/q\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果<em>useTemperatureDependency</em>被设置为<em>false</em>，二极管的电压与温度有关，例如，\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"           v/Vt\r\n"
"i = Ids (e      - 1).\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"当电压<em>v</em>的指数表达超出其理论<em>最大值</em>时，计算会采用一种线性近似方法，将超出部分的指数部分替换为一个线性关系，这样可以保持输出在可处理的范围内，同时保持二极管特性的连续性。\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"模型中热能=<em>i*v</em>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

