msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Sensors.PotentialSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The potential sensor converts the voltage of a node (with respect to the ground node) into a real valued signal. It does not influence the current sum at the node which voltage is measured, therefore, the electrical behavior is not influenced by the sensor.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>电位传感器将一个节点(相对于地节点)的电压转换为一个实值信号。它不会影响被测量电压节点的电流总和，因此，传感器不会影响电气行为。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

