msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Sensors.VoltageSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The voltage sensor converts the voltage between the two connectors into a real valued signal. It does not influence the current sum at the nodes in between the voltage is measured, therefore, the electrical behavior is not influenced by the sensor.</p>\r\n"
