msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Examples.Utilities.Counter"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The Counter is a generic component, which counts the high-low slopes of the count signal, if the enable signal is set to be true. It is composed by  n JK flipflops. q is the resulting number, where q[0] is the lowest, and q[n] the highest bit.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>计数器是一个通用组件，如果使能信号被设置为真，则计数信号的高低电平将被计数。它由n个JK触发器组成。q是结果数字，其中q[0]是最低位，q[n]是最高位。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

