msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay"
msgid "Delay blocks"
msgstr "延迟模块"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The Delay package collects the delay blocks which are used in many components. Both transport and inertial delay are offered for scalar connectors. The most advanced component is the sensitive inertial delay the delay time of which is chosen in dependency of the signal values. This component is also available for vector valued input.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Delay库收集了许多组件中使用的延迟块。标量连接器提供了传输和惯性延迟。最先进的组件是敏感惯性延迟，其延迟时间根据信号值的依赖性选择。该组件还适用于向量输入。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.DelayParams"
msgid "Definition of delay parameters"
msgstr "延迟参数的定义"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.DelayParams"
msgid "Rise inertial delay"
msgstr "上升惯性延迟"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.DelayParams"
msgid "Fall inertial delay"
msgstr "下降惯性延迟"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.DelayParams"
msgid "Initial value of output"
msgstr "输出的初始值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.DelayParams"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>DelayParams is a partial model for providing delay times and inertial values. It is used in components of the package Gates which need the same parameters. The partial model does not have any behavior or equations.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>DelayParams是一个提供延迟时间和惯性值的部分模型。它用于需要相同参数的Gates库的组件中。部分模型没有任何工作输出或方程。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.TransportDelay"
msgid "Transport delay with initial parameter"
msgstr "具有初始参数的传输延迟"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.TransportDelay"
msgid "Delay time"
msgstr "延迟时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.TransportDelay"
msgid "Initial value of output"
msgstr "输出的初始值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.TransportDelay"
msgid "Auxiliary variable of type Real to use in delay()"
msgstr "在 delay() 中使用的实型辅助变量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.TransportDelay"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Provide the input as output exactly delayed by <em>Tdel</em>.\r\n"
"If time less than <em>Tdel</em> the initial value <em>initout</em> holds.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"提供输入作为延迟了<em>Tdel</em>的输出。\r\n"
"如果时间小于<em>Tdel</em>，则保持初始值 <em>initout</em>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.TransportDelay"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<dl>\r\n"
"<dt><em>August 11, 2003</em></dt>\r\n"
"<dd>by Christoph Clauss initially modelled.</dd>\r\n"
"</dl>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<dl>\r\n"
"<dt><em>2003年8月11日</em></dt>\r\n"
"<dd>由Christoph Clauss最初建模。</dd>\r\n"
