"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.InertialDelay"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.InertialDelay"
msgid "Inertial"
msgstr "惯性"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.InertialDelay"
msgid "Delay"
msgstr "延迟"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.InertialDelaySensitive"
msgid "Provide the input as output if it holds its value for a specific amount of time"
msgstr "如果输入保持其值一定时间，则提供输入作为输出"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.InertialDelaySensitive"
msgid "Rise inertial delay"
msgstr "上升惯性延迟"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.InertialDelaySensitive"
msgid "Fall inertial delay"
msgstr "下降惯性延迟"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.InertialDelaySensitive"
msgid "Initial value of output"
msgstr "输出的初始值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.InertialDelaySensitive"
msgid "Specification of delay according to signal change"
msgstr "根据信号变化规定的延迟表"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.InertialDelaySensitive"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Provides the input as output delayed by <em>Tdel</em> if the input holds its value for a longer time than <em>Tdel</em>.\r\n"
"If the time is less than <em>Tdel</em> the initial value <em>y0</em> holds.<br>\r\n"
"The delay <em>Tdel</em> depends on the values of the signal change. To calculate <em>Tdel</em>, the DelayTable specified in\r\n"
"Digital.Tables is used. If the corresponding value is 1, then <em>tLH</em> is used, if it is -1, then <em>tHL</em>\r\n"
"is used, if it is zero, the input is not delayed.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果输入保持其值的时间超过<em>Tdel</em>，则提供输入作为延迟了<em>Tdel</em>的输出。\r\n"
"如果时间小于<em>Tdel</em>，则保持初始值<em>y0</em>。<br>\r\n"
"延迟<em>Tdel</em>取决于信号变化的值。要计算<em>Tdel</em>，使用 Digital.Tables中指定的DelayTable。\r\n"
"如果对应的值为1，则使用<em>tLH</em>，如果为-1，则使用<em>tHL</em>，如果为零，则输入不延迟。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Delay.InertialDelaySensitive"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>January 24, 2013</em> Initial value for y set to y0\r\n"
"       by Kristin Majetta and Christoph Clauss<br>\r\n"
"       </li>\r\n"
