msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Basic"
msgid "Basic logic blocks without delays"
msgstr "不带延迟的基本逻辑块"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Basic"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Basic contains the basic gates according to standard logic. The components of Basic calculate their results using the corresponding truth tables. They do not contain any delay components.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Basic库含了标准逻辑中的基本门。Basic中的组件使用相应的真值表计算结果。它们不包含任何延迟组件。</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Basic.Not"
msgid "Not logic component without delay"
msgstr "不带延迟的非逻辑组件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Basic.Not"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Not component with 1 input value, without delay.</p>\r\n"
"<p>According to the standard logic not table (Tables.NotTable) the output value is calculated.</p>\r\n"
"<p>To avoid loops in the numerical treatment, the pre operator is applied to the output.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>带有一个输入值的非逻辑组件，无延迟。</p>\r\n"
"<p>根据标准逻辑非真值表(Tables.NotTable)计算输出值。</p>\r\n"
"<p>为避免在数值处理中出现循环，对输出应用预操作符。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

