"'1'  (coded by 4)     val_1\r\n"
"'Z'  (coded by 5)     val_Z\r\n"
"'W'  (coded by 6)     val_W\r\n"
"'L'  (coded by 7)     val_L\r\n"
"'H'  (coded by 8)     val_H\r\n"
"'-'  (coded by 9)     val_m\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The values val... are given by parameters.</p>\r\n"
"<p>If the signal width is greater than 1 this conversion is done for each signal.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"将数字输入无延迟地转换为实数输出：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"input                 output\r\n"
"'U'  (coded by 1)     val_U\r\n"
"'X'  (coded by 2)     val_X\r\n"
"'0'  (coded by 3)     val_0\r\n"
"'1'  (coded by 4)     val_1\r\n"
"'Z'  (coded by 5)     val_Z\r\n"
"'W'  (coded by 6)     val_W\r\n"
"'L'  (coded by 7)     val_L\r\n"
"'H'  (coded by 8)     val_H\r\n"
"'-'  (coded by 9)     val_m\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"val......的值由参数给出。</p>\r\n"
"<p>如果信号宽度大于 1，则对每个信号进行转换。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

