msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Registers"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Registers is a collection of flipflops and latches. In the opposite to the Examples.Utilities models the Register models are a series of assignments in the algorithm part of the model. The model text is taken nearly identical from the standard logic text.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
