msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Multiplexers.MUX2x1"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Description in VHDL is given by <a href=\"http://www.cs.sfu.ca/~ggbaker/reference/std_logic/src/std_logic_entities.vhd\">http://www.cs.sfu.ca/~ggbaker/reference/std_logic/src/std_logic_entities.vhd</a></p>\r\n"
"<p>and for Multiplexer table <a href=\"http://www.cs.sfu.ca/~ggbaker/reference/std_logic/src/std_logic_misc.vhd\">http://www.cs.sfu.ca/~ggbaker/reference/std_logic/src/std_logic_misc.vhd</a></p>\r\n"
"<h4>Truth Table</h4>\r\n"
"<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" border=\"1\"><tr>\r\n"
"<td><h4>DataIn</h4></td>\r\n"
"<td><h4>Select</h4></td>\r\n"
"<td><h4>DataOut</h4></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>*</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>0</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>Input0</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>*</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>1</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>Input1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>Inputs equal</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>U</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>Input</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>Inputs not equal</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>U</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>U</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>U in Input</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>X</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>U</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>Inputs equal</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>X</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>Input</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>no U in Input and Inputs not equal</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>X</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>X</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"*  = don&#39;t care\r\n"
"0  = L.&#39;0&#39; or L.&#39;L&#39;\r\n"
"1  = L.&#39;1&#39; or L.&#39;H&#39;\r\n"
"X  = L.&#39;X&#39; or L.&#39;W&#39; or L.&#39;Z&#39; or L.&#39;-&#39;\r\n"
"U  = L.&#39;U&#39;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>在VHDL中的描述请参考 <a href=\"http://www.cs.sfu.ca/~ggbaker/reference/std_logic/src/std_logic_entities.vhd\">http://www.cs.sfu.ca/~ggbaker/reference/std_logic/src/std_logic_entities.vhd</a></p>\r\n"
"<p>以及多路选择器表的描述请参考 <a href=\"http://www.cs.sfu.ca/~ggbaker/reference/std_logic/src/std_logic_misc.vhd\">http://www.cs.sfu.ca/~ggbaker/reference/std_logic/src/std_logic_misc.vhd</a></p>\r\n"
"<h4>真值表</h4>\r\n"
"<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" border=\"1\"><tr>\r\n"
"<td><h4>DataIn</h4></td>\r\n"
"<td><h4>Select</h4></td>\r\n"
"<td><h4>DataOut</h4></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>*</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>0</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>输入 0</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>*</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>1</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>输入 1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>输入相等</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>U</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>输入</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>输入不相等</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>U</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>U</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>输入中有 U</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>X</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>U</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>输入相等</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>X</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>输入</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>输入中没有 U 且输入不相等</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>X</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>X</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"*  = 不关心\r\n"
"0  = L.&#39;0&#39; 或 L.&#39;L&#39;\r\n"
"1  = L.&#39;1&#39; 或 L.&#39;H&#39;\r\n"
"X  = L.&#39;X&#39; 或 L.&#39;W&#39; 或 L.&#39;Z&#39; 或 L.&#39;-&#39;\r\n"
"U  = L.&#39;U&#39;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

