msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Collection of examples demonstrating the usage of the <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks\">battery models without</a>\r\n"
"and <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacksWithSensors\">with sensors</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"展示<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks\">不带</a>和<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacksWithSensors\">带传感器</a>的电池模型的使用示例集合。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.BatteryDischargeCharge"
msgid "Discharge and charge idealized battery"
msgstr "放电和充电理想化电池"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.BatteryDischargeCharge"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Two batteries with a nominal charge of 10 A.h starting with an initial SOC = 95 % are compared:</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>battery1</code> is a battery OCV linearly dependent on SOC, without self-discharge and not comprising RC-elements.</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>battery2</code> is a battery OCV dependency on SOC is specified by a table, with self-discharge and including RC-elements.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Two <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.ParameterRecords.CellData\">parameter records</a> <code>cellData1</code> and <code>cellData2</code> are used to parameterize the battery models.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"First the batteries are discharged with 7 current pulses of 50 A for 1 minute, and breaks between the pulses of 1 minute, ending at SOC = 5 %.<br>\r\n"
"Subsequently, the batteries are charged again with 7 current pulses of 50 A for 1 minute, and breaks between the pulses of 1 minute, ending at SOC = 95 % again.<br>\r\n"
"In the end, the batteries are in no-load condition to reveal self-discharge effects.\r\n"
"Note that self-discharge of <code>battery2</code> is set to an unrealistic high value, to show self-discharge within a rather short time span.<br>\r\n"
"The parameters of the RC-elements of <code>battery2</code> are set to estimated values, just to demonstrate the effects.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>Simulate and plot terminal voltage <code>battery1.v</code> and <code>battery2.v</code> as well as state of charge <code>battery1.SOC</code> and <code>battery2.SOC</code>.</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Plotting <code>energy1.y</code> and <code>energy2.y</code>, it is remarkable that first energy is delivered by the battery,\r\n"
"but then due to the losses more energy is consumed to recharge the battery.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>比较两个带有10 A.h标称电荷且初始SOC=95％的电池：</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>battery1</code>是一个SOC线性依赖的电池，没有自放电，并且不包含RC元件。</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>battery2</code>是一个SOC依赖于表格的电池，具有自放电并包括RC元件。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"使用两个<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.ParameterRecords.CellData\">参数记录</a><code>cellData1</code>和<code>cellData2</code>来参数化电池模型。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"首先，电池通过7个50 A电流脉冲进行放电，每个持续1分钟，脉冲之间间隔1分钟，直到SOC=5％为止。<br>\r\n"
"随后，电池再次通过7个50 A电流脉冲进行充电，每个持续1分钟，脉冲之间间隔1分钟，直到SOC=95％为止。<br>\r\n"
"最后，电池处于空载状态以显示自放电效应。\r\n"
"请注意，为了在相当短的时间内显示自放电，<code>battery2</code>的自放电设置为不现实的高值，以显示相对较短时间内的自放电。<br>\r\n"
"<code>battery2</code>的RC元件的参数设置为估计值，仅用于演示效果。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>模拟并绘制端电压<code>battery1.v</code>和<code>battery2.v</code>以及充放电状态<code>battery1.SOC</code>和<code>battery2.SOC</code>。</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"绘制<code>energy1.y</code>和<code>energy2.y</code>，值得注意的是，首先电池释放能量，\r\n"
"但随后由于损耗，更多能量被消耗来充电电池。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.SuperCapDischargeCharge"
msgid "Discharge and charge idealized supercap"
msgstr "放电和充电理想化超级电容"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.SuperCapDischargeCharge"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>A supercap with a capacitance of 500 F, starting initially at nominal voltage 48 V,\r\n"
"is discharged with 5 current pulses of 240 A for 10 seconds, and breaks between the pulses of 10 seconds.\r\n"
"Subsequently, the supercap is charged again with 5 current pulses of 240 A for 10 seconds, and breaks between the pulses of 10 seconds.\r\n"
"In the end, the supercap is in no-load condition to reveal self-discharge effects.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note that self-discharge is set to an unrealistic high value, to show self-discharge within a rather short time span.<br>\r\n"
"The other parameters of the supercap is set to estimated but realistic values:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>C = 500 F</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>Vnom = 48 V</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>Qnom = C*Vnom = 24,000 As</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>Ri = 2 m&Omega;</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>Simulate and plot terminal voltage <code>supercap.v</code>.</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Plotting <code>energy.y</code>, it is remarkable that first energy is delivered by the supercap,\r\n"
"but then due to the losses more energy is consumed to recharge the supercap.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>一个电容为500F的超级电容，初始电压为48V，\r\n"
"通过5个持续10秒的240A电流脉冲进行放电，脉冲之间间隔10秒。\r\n"
"随后，超级电容通过5个持续10秒的240A电流脉冲进行充电，脉冲之间间隔10秒。\r\n"
"最后，超级电容处于空载状态以显示自放电效应。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请注意，自放电设置为不现实的高值，以显示相对较短时间内的自放电。<br>\r\n"
"超级电容的其他参数设置为估计但现实的值：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>C = 500 F</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>Vnom = 48 V</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>Qnom = C*Vnom = 24,000 As</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>Ri = 2 m&Omega;</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>用户可以在特定窗口模拟并绘制端电压<code>supercap.v</code>曲线。</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"用户可以在特定窗口绘制<code>energy.y</code>曲线，值得注意的是，首先超级电容释放能量，\r\n"
"但随后由于损耗，更多能量被消耗来充电超级电容。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCVcharging"
msgid "Charge a battery with constant current - constant voltage characteristic"
msgstr "使用恒流-恒压特性充电电池"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCVcharging"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A battery depleted to <code>SOC = 0.1</code> is recharged with a CC-CV charger.\r\n"
"Charging current in CC mode is 5C which means the battery is theoretically nearly fulled charged after <code>0.9*3600 s/5 = 648 s</code> and the charger switches to CV mode.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一个放电到<code>SOC=0.1</code>的电池正在使用CC-CV充电器充电。\r\n"
"在CC模式下的充电电流为5C，这意味着电池理论上在<code>0.9*3600s/5=648s</code>后几乎充满，并且充电器切换到CV模式。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_Cell"
msgid "Charge a cell with constant current - constant voltage characteristic"
msgstr "使用恒流-恒压特性充电电池"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_Cell"
msgid "Cell data"
msgstr "电池数据"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_Cell"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A single cell depleted to <code>SOC = 0.1</code> is recharged with a CC-CV charger.\r\n"
"Charging current in CC mode is 5C which means the battery is theoretically nearly fulled charged after <code>0.9*3600 s/5 = 648 s</code> and the charger switches to CV mode.\r\n"
"Simulate for 1200 s and plot <code>cell.cellBus.soc</code> versus <code>time</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一个放电到<code>SOC=0.1</code>的单个电池正在使用CC-CV充电器充电。\r\n"
"在CC模式下的充电电流为5C，这意味着电池理论上在<code>0.9*3600 s/5=648s</code>后几乎充满，并且充电器切换到CV模式。\r\n"
"示例仿真将持续1200秒。用户可以在特定窗口绘制<code>cell.cellBus.soc</code>与<code>time</code>的图。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_CellRC"
msgid "Charge a transient cell with constant current - constant voltage characteristic"
msgstr "使用恒流-恒压特性充电瞬态电池"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_CellRC"
msgid "Cell data"
msgstr "电池数据"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_CellRC"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A single transient cell depleted to <code>SOC = 0.1</code> is recharged with a CC-CV charger.\r\n"
"Charging current in CC mode is 5C which means the battery is theoretically nearly fulled charged after <code>0.9*3600 s/5 = 648 s</code> and the charger switches to CV mode.\r\n"
"Simulate for 1200 s and plot <code>cell.cellBus.soc</code> versus <code>time</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一个放电到<code>SOC=0.1</code>的单个瞬态电池正在使用CC-CV充电器充电。\r\n"
"在CC模式下的充电电流为5C，这意味着电池理论上在<code>0.9*3600s/5=648s</code>后几乎充满，并且充电器切换到CV模式。\r\n"
"模拟1200秒，用户可以在特定界面绘制<code>cell.cellBus.soc</code>与<code>time</code>的图。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_Stack"
msgid "Charge a stack with constant current - constant voltage characteristic"
msgstr "使用恒定电流-恒定电压特性为电池组充电"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_Stack"
msgid "Original cell data"
msgstr "原始电池数据"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_Stack"
msgid "Degraded cell data"
msgstr "退化电池数据"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_Stack"
msgid "Stack data"
msgstr "电池组数据"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_Stack"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A stack of cells with one degraded cell (with indices <code>[1,1]</code>, with double inner resistance), all cells depleted to <code>SOC = 0.1</code>, is recharged with a CC-CV charger.\r\n"
"Simulate for 1200 s and plot versus <code>time</code>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>stack.batteryBus.soc</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>busTransription.stackBusArrays.soc[1,1]</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>busTransription.stackBusArrays.soc[1,2]</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一个电池组中有一个退化电池(索引为<code>[1,1]</code>，内阻翻倍)，所有电池都放电到<code>SOC=0.1</code>，使用CC-CV充电器充电。\r\n"
"示例仿真的时间为1200秒，用户可以在特定界面绘制<code>time</code>有关的图像：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>stack.batteryBus.soc</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>busTransription.stackBusArrays.soc[1,1]</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>busTransription.stackBusArrays.soc[1,2]</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_StackRC"
msgid "Charge a transient stack with constant current - constant voltage characteristic"
msgstr "使用恒定电流-恒定电压特性为瞬态电池组充电"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_StackRC"
msgid "Original cell data"
msgstr "原始电池数据"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_StackRC"
msgid "Degraded cell data"
msgstr "退化电池数据"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_StackRC"
msgid "Stack data"
msgstr "电池组数据"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.CCCV_StackRC"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A stack of transient cells with one degraded cell (with indices <code>[1,1]</code>, with double inner resistance), all cells depleted to <code>SOC = 0.1</code>, is recharged with a CC-CV charger.\r\n"
"Simulate for 1200 s and plot versus <code>time</code>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>stack.batteryBus.soc</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>busTransription.stackBusArrays.soc[1,1]</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>busTransription.stackBusArrays.soc[1,2]</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一个具有瞬态特性的电池组，其中有一个退化电池(索引为<code>[1,1]</code>，内阻翻倍)，所有电池都放电到<code>SOC = 0.1</code>，使用CC-CV充电器充电。\r\n"
"示例仿真时间为1200秒，用户可以在特定界面绘制与<code>time</code>相关的图像：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>stack.batteryBus.soc</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>busTransription.stackBusArrays.soc[1,1]</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>busTransription.stackBusArrays.soc[1,2]</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.ShowImpedance"
msgid "Show complex cell impedance"
msgstr "显示复杂电池阻抗"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.Examples.ShowImpedance"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Plot <code>impedance.z.im</code> versus <code>impedance.z.re</code>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"绘制<code>impedance.z.im</code>关于<code>impedance.z.re</code>的图像\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks"
msgid "Battery stacks built from cells"
msgstr "由电池构建的电池组"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Battery models, either used for single cells or for stacks built from identical cells</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>电池模型，用于单个电池或由相同电池构建的电池组</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.CellStack"
msgid "Battery with open-circuit voltage dependent on state of charge, self-discharge and inner resistance"
msgstr "电池，其开路电压取决于电荷状态、自放电和内阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.CellStack"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The battery is modeled by open-circuit voltage (OCV) dependent on state of charge (SOC), self-discharge and inner resistance,\r\n"
"as implemented in partial <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BaseClasses.BaseCellStack\">BaseCellStack</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model can be used for a single cell <code>Ns = Np = 1</code> as well as a stack built from identical cells.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For details, see <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.UsersGuide.Concept\">concept</a> and <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.UsersGuide.Parameterization\">parameterization</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Note</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Parameter record array <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.ParameterRecords.TransientData.RCData\">rcData</a> contained in\r\n"
"parameter record <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.ParameterRecords.CellData\">cellData</a> is neglected.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该电池模型的开路电压(OCV)取决于电荷状态(SOC)、自放电和内阻，这是在部分<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BaseClasses.BaseCellStack\">BaseCellStack</a> 中实现的。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此模型既可用于单个电池<code>Ns=Np=1</code>，也可用于由相同电池构建的电池组。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"有关详细信息，请参阅<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.UsersGuide.Concept\">概念</a>和<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.UsersGuide.Parameterization\">参数化</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>注意</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在参数记录<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.ParameterRecords.CellData\">cellData</a>中包含的参数记录数组<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.ParameterRecords.TransientData.RCData\">rcData</a>被忽略。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.CellRCStack"
msgid "Battery with open-circuit voltage dependent on state of charge, self-discharge, inner resistance and a series of RC-elements"
msgstr "电池，其开路电压取决于电荷状态、自放电、内阻和一系列RC元件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.CellRCStack"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Extends the model <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.CellStack\">CellStack</a> by a series of RC-elements, describing the transient behaviour of the battery.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model can be used for a single cell <code>Ns = Np = 1</code> as well as a stack built from identical cells.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For details, see <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.UsersGuide.Concept\">concept</a> and <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.UsersGuide.Parameterization\">parameterization</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Note</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Parameter record array <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.ParameterRecords.TransientData.RCData\">rcData</a> contained in\r\n"
"parameter record <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.ParameterRecords.TransientData.CellData\">cellData</a> has to be specified.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The total inner resistance is the sum of the resistance of resistor <code>r0</code> and the sum of the resistances of the resistors of the RC-elements.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过一系列RC元件扩展模型<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.CellStack\">CellStack</a>，描述电池的瞬态行为。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此模型既可用于单个电池 <code>Ns=Np=1</code>，也可用于由相同电池构建的电池组。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"有关详细信息，请参阅<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.UsersGuide.Concept\">概念</a>和<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.UsersGuide.Parameterization\">参数化</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>注意</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"参数记录数组<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.ParameterRecords.TransientData.RCData\">rcData</a>包含在\r\n"
"参数记录<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.ParameterRecords.TransientData.CellData\">cellData</a>中必须指定。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"总内阻是电阻器<code>r0</code>的阻值和RC元件电阻的总和。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.SuperCap"
msgid "Simple model of a supercapacitor"
msgstr "超级电容器的简单模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.SuperCap"
msgid "Current into the supercap"
msgstr "进入超级电容器的电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.SuperCap"
msgid "Nominal voltage"
msgstr "额定电压"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.SuperCap"
msgid "Initial voltage"
msgstr "初始电压"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.SuperCap"
msgid "Capacitance"
msgstr "电容"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.SuperCap"
msgid "Nominal charge"
msgstr "额定电荷"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.SuperCap"
msgid "Series resistance"
msgstr "串联电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.SuperCap"
msgid "Reference temperature"
msgstr "参考温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.SuperCap"
msgid "Temperature coefficient of resistance at T_ref"
msgstr "在 T_ref 温度下的电阻温度系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.SuperCap"
msgid "Self-discharge current at nominal voltage"
msgstr "额定电压下的自放电电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.SuperCap"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.SuperCap"
msgid "C=%C"
msgstr "C=%C"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Batteries.BatteryStacks.SuperCap"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a simple model of a supercapacitor, comprising:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>an ideal capacitance</li>\r\n"
"<li>a series resistance</li>\r\n"
"<li>a self-discharge conductor</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<h4>Note</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"There is no limit included against too high charging and too low discharging or even charging in the opposite direction.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个超级电容器的简单模型，包括：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
