msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.InductionMachines.IMC_DOL"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>At start time tStart three-phase voltage is supplied to the induction machine with squirrel cage;\r\n"
"the machine starts from standstill, accelerating inertias against load torque quadratic dependent on speed,\r\n"
"finally reaching nominal speed.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Simulate for 1.5 seconds and plot (versus time):</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>currentQuasiRMSSensor.I: stator current RMS</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.wMechanical: motor's speed</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.tauElectrical: motor's torque</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>Default machine parameters are used.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"在起始时间tStart时，鼠笼型感应电机的开始供电； 电机从静止开始，对抗负载扭矩，加速惯性，负载扭矩与速度成二次相关， 最终达到额定速度。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"示例仿真时间为1.5秒，用户可以在特定界面通过勾选绘制(随时间变化)的以下变量图像：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"currentQuasiRMSSensor.I：定子电流的有效值</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"aimc.wMechanical：电机速度</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"aimc.tauElectrical：电机扭矩</li>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"使用默认电机参数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

