msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.InductionMachines.IMC_Initialize"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The induction machine with squirrel cage is initialized in steady-state at no-load;\r\n"
"at time tStart a load torque step is applied.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Simulate for 1.5 seconds and plot (versus time):</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>currentQuasiRMSSensor.I: stator current RMS</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.wMechanical: motor's speed</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.tauElectrical: motor's torque</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Default machine parameters are used.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"鼠笼型感应电机在空载时稳态初始化； 在时间 tStart 时施加负载转矩步进。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该示例的仿真时长为1.5秒，用户可以在特定窗口通过勾选绘制以下(与时间相关的)结果变量的图像：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"currentQuasiRMSSensor.I：定子电流 RMS 值</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"aimc.wMechanical：电机速度</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"aimc.tauElectrical：电机转矩</li>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"使用默认的电机参数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

