msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.TransformerTestbench"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Transformer test bench</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"You may choose different connections as well as vary the load (even not symmetrical).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Please pay attention</strong> to proper grounding of the primary and secondary part of the whole circuit.<br>\r\n"
"The primary and secondary starpoint are available as connectors, if the connection is not delta (D or d).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In some cases it may be necessary to ground the transformer's starpoint even though the source's or load's starpoint are grounded:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Yy ... Grounding of transformer's primary or secondary starpoint with reasonable high earthing resistance is necessary.</li>\r\n"
"<li>Yd ... No grounding necessary.</li>\r\n"
"<li>Yz ... Grounding of transformer's primary starpoint with reasonable high earthing resistance is necessary.</li>\r\n"
"<li>Dy ... No grounding necessary.</li>\r\n"
"<li>Dd ... No grounding necessary.</li>\r\n"
"<li>Dz ... No grounding necessary.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>变压器测试台</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"您可以选择不同的连接方式，以及改变负载(即使不对称也可以)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>请注意</strong>正确接地整个电路的主要部分和次要部分。<br>\r\n"
"如果连接不是△(D或d)，则主要和次要星点可用作连接器。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在某些情况下，即使源或负载的星点接地，也有必要接地变压器的星点：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Yy ... 需要用合理高的接地电阻接地变压器的主要或次要星点。</li>\r\n"
"<li>Yd ... 无需接地。</li>\r\n"
"<li>Yz ... 需要用合理高的接地电阻接地变压器的主要星点。</li>\r\n"
"<li>Dy ... 无需接地。</li>\r\n"
"<li>Dd ... 无需接地。</li>\r\n"
"<li>Dz ... 无需接地。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.AsymmetricalLoad"
msgid "Asymmetrical load"
msgstr "非对称负载"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.AsymmetricalLoad"
msgid "Load resistance"
msgstr "负载电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.AsymmetricalLoad"
msgid "Transformer data"
msgstr "变压器数据"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.AsymmetricalLoad"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Asymmetrical (single-phase) load</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"You may choose different connections.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Please pay attention</strong> to proper grounding of the primary and secondary part of the whole circuit.<br>\r\n"
"The primary and secondary starpoint are available as connectors, if the connection is not delta (D or d).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In some cases it may be necessary to ground the transformer's starpoint even though the source's or load's starpoint are grounded:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Yy with primary starpoint connected to source's starpoint: primary current in only one phase</li>\r\n"
"<li>Yy primary starpoint  not connected to source's starpoint: secondary voltage breaks down</li>\r\n"
"<li>Yz ... Grounding of transformer's primary starpoint with reasonable high earthing resistance is necessary.</li>\r\n"
"<li>Dy ... Load current in two   primary phases.</li>\r\n"
"<li>Dz ... Load current in three primary phases.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>非对称(单相)负载</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"您可以选择不同的连接方式。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>请注意</strong>正确接地整个电路的主要部分和次要部分。<br>\r\n"
"如果连接不是△(D或d)，则主要和次要星点可用作连接器。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在某些情况下，即使源或负载的星点接地，也有必要接地变压器的星点：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Yy，主星点连接到源星点：只有一个相的主电流</li>\r\n"
"<li>Yy，主星点未连接到源星点：次电压中断</li>\r\n"
"<li>Yz ... 需要用合理高的接地电阻接地变压器的主要星点。</li>\r\n"
"<li>Dy ... 两个主要相的负载电流。</li>\r\n"
"<li>Dz ... 三个主要相的负载电流。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.Rectifier6pulse"
msgid "6-pulse rectifier with 1 transformer"
msgstr "带1个变压器的6脉冲整流器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.Rectifier6pulse"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.Rectifier6pulse"
msgid "Amplitude of star-voltage"
msgstr "星形电压的幅值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.Rectifier6pulse"
msgid "Frequency"
msgstr "频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.Rectifier6pulse"
msgid "Load resistance"
msgstr "负载电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.Rectifier6pulse"
msgid "Total DC-capacitance"
msgstr "总直流电容"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.Rectifier6pulse"
msgid "Initial voltage of capacitance"
msgstr "电容的初始电压"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.Rectifier6pulse"
msgid "Data of transformer 1"
msgstr "变压器1的数据"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.Rectifier6pulse"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Test example with polyphase components:<br>\r\n"
"Star-connected voltage source feeds via a transformer a diode bridge rectifier with a DC burden.<br>\r\n"
"Using f=50 Hz, simulate for 0.1 seconds (5 periods) and compare voltages and currents of source and DC burden,\r\n"
"neglecting initial transient.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>带多相组件的测试示例：</p>\r\n"
"<p>星形连接的电压源通过一个变压器馈入带有直流负载的二极管桥整流器。</p>\r\n"
"<p>仿真时f=50 Hz，仿真周期为0.1秒(5个周期)，忽略初始瞬态。仿真结束后，用户可以比较源和直流负载的电压和电流。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.Rectifier12pulse"
msgid "12-pulse rectifier with 2 transformers"
msgstr "带2个变压器的12脉冲整流器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.Rectifier12pulse"
msgid "Data of transformer 2"
msgstr "变压器2的数据"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.Rectifier12pulse"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Test example with polyphase components:<br>\r\n"
"Star-connected voltage source feeds via two transformers (Dd0 and Dy1) two diode bridge rectifiers with a single DC burden.<br>\r\n"
"Using f=50 Hz, simulate for 0.1 seconds (5 periods) and compare voltages and currents of source and DC burden,\r\n"
"neglecting initial transient.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>带多相组件的测试示例：</p>\r\n"
"<p>星形连接的电压源通过两个变压器(Dd0和Dy1)馈入两个带有单一直流负载的二极管桥整流器。</p>\r\n"
"<p>仿真时f=50 Hz，仿真周期为0.1秒(5个周期)，忽略初始瞬态。仿真结束后，用户可以比较源和直流负载的电压和电流。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.IMC_Transformer"
msgid "Test example: InductionMachineSquirrelCage transformer starting"
msgstr "测试示例：鼠笼型感应电机-变压器起动"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.Transformers.IMC_Transformer"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<strong>Test example: Induction machine with squirrel cage - transformer starting</strong><br>\r\n"
"At start time tStart1 three-phase voltage is supplied to the induction machine with squirrel cage via the transformer;\r\n"
"the machine starts from standstill, accelerating inertias against load torque quadratic dependent on speed;\r\n"
"at start time tStart2 the machine is fed directly from the voltage source, finally reaching nominal speed.<br>\r\n"
"Simulate for 2.5 seconds and plot (versus time):\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>currentQuasiRMSSensor.I: stator current RMS</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.wMechanical: motor's speed</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.tauElectrical: motor's torque</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"Default machine parameters of model <em>IM_SquirrelCage</em> are used.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在起始时间 tStart1，通过变压器向带有松鼠笼的感应电机供电；\r\n"
"电机从静止开始运行，惯性加速度受速度的二次依赖负载扭矩的影响；\r\n"
"在起始时间 tStart2，电机直接从电压源供电，最终达到额定速度。</p>\r\n"
"模拟2.5秒并绘制(相对于时间)：\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>currentQuasiRMSSensor.I：定子电流有效值</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.wMechanical：电机速度</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.tauElectrical：电机扭矩</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"模型<em>IM_SquirrelCage</em>的默认电机参数被使用。\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines"
msgid "Basic machine models"
msgstr "基本机械模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"This package contains components for modeling electrical machines, specially three-phase induction machines, based on space phasor theory:\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>package InductionMachines: models of three-phase induction machines</li>\r\n"
"<li>package SynchronousMachines: models of three-phase synchronous machines</li>\r\n"
"<li>package DCMachines: models of DC machines with different excitation</li>\r\n"
"<li>package Transformers: Three-phase transformers (see detailed documentation in subpackage)</li>\r\n"
"<li>package Components: components for modeling machines and transformers</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"The induction machine models use package SpacePhasors.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该库含有用于建模电机的组件，特别是基于空间矢量理论的三相感应电机：\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>package InductionMachines: 三相感应电机的模型</li>\r\n"
"<li>package SynchronousMachines: 三相同步电机的模型</li>\r\n"
"<li>package DCMachines: 不同励磁方式的直流电机模型</li>\r\n"
"<li>package Transformers: 三相变压器(详细文档请参见子包)</li>\r\n"
"<li>package Components: 用于建模机械和变压器的组件</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>感应电机模型使用SpacePhasors库。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

