"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>这些值给出以下电感：</td>\r\n"
"<td> </td><td> </td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>定子每相杂散电感</td>\r\n"
"<td>Xs * (1 - sqrt(1-sigma))/(2*pi*fNominal)</td><td> </td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>转子杂散电感</td>\r\n"
"<td>Xr * (1 - sqrt(1-sigma))/(2*pi*fNominal)</td><td> </td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>每相主场电感</td>\r\n"
"<td>sqrt(Xs*Xr * (1-sigma))/(2*pi*f)</td><td> </td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"参数turnsRatio可以从以下关系式中得到，\r\n"
"在静止状态下，开路转子电路，额定电压和额定频率，<br>\r\n"
"使用锁转电压VR，空载定子电流I0和功率因数PF0：<br>\r\n"
"turnsRatio*<u>V</u><sub>R</sub>=<u>V</u><sub>s</sub>-(R<sub>s</sub>+jX<sub>s,sigma</sub>)<u>I</u><sub>0</sub>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.SynchronousMachines"
msgid "Models of synchronous machines"
msgstr "同步电机模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.SynchronousMachines"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"This package contains models of synchronous machines, based on space phasor theory:\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>SM_PermanentMagnet: synchronous machine with permanent magnet excitation, with damper cage</li>\r\n"
"<li>SM_ElectricalExcited: synchronous machine with electrical excitation\r\n"
"    and damper cage</li>\r\n"
"<li>SM_ReluctanceRotor: induction machine with reluctance rotor and damper cage<br>\r\n"
"i.e., a squirrel cage rotor with magnetic poles due to different airgap width</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"These models use package SpacePhasors.\r\n"
"<br><strong>Please keep in mind:</strong><br>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>We keep the same reference system as for motors, i.e.:<br>\r\n"
"    Positive RotorDisplacementAngle means acting as motor,<br>\r\n"
"    with positive electric power consumption and positive mechanical power output.</li>\r\n"
"<li>ElectricalAngle = p * MechanicalAngle</li>\r\n"
"<li>real axis = d-axis<br>\r\n"
"    imaginary= q-axis</li>\r\n"
"<li>Voltage induced by the magnet wheel (d-axis) is located in the q-axis.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"这个库包含了基于空间矢量理论的同步机模型：\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>SM_PermanentMagnet：带有永磁励磁和阻尼笼的同步机</li>\r\n"
"<li>SM_ElectricalExcited：带有电励磁和阻尼笼的同步机</li>\r\n"
"<li>SM_ReluctanceRotor：带有磁阻转子和阻尼笼的感应电机<br>\r\n"
"即，具有不同气隙宽度的松鼠笼转子，其磁极是由于不同气隙宽度而产生的</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"这些模型使用SpacePhasors库。\r\n"
"<br><strong>请记住：</strong><br>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>我们保持与电机相同的参考系统，即：<br>\r\n"
"    正转子位移角表示作为电动机，<br>\r\n"
"    具有正电功率消耗和正机械功率输出。</li>\r\n"
"<li>ElectricalAngle=p*MechanicalAngle</li>\r\n"
"<li>实轴=d轴<br>\r\n"
"    虚轴=q轴</li>\r\n"
"<li>磁轮感应的电压(d轴)位于q轴。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

