msgid "Machine components like AirGaps"
msgstr "机器组件，如气隙"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.Components"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"This package contains components for modeling electrical machines, specially three-phase induction machines, based on space phasor theory.\r\n"
"These models use package SpacePhasors.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该库含有用于建模电气机器的组件，特别是基于空间矢量理论的三相感应电机。\r\n"
"这些模型使用了SpacePhasors库。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

