msgstr "如果为true，则没有电气瞬态"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.Components.InductorDC"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The linear inductor connects the branch voltage <em>v</em> with the branch current <em>i</em> by <em>v = L * di/dt</em>.\r\n"
"If <code>quasiStatic == false</code>, the electrical transients are neglected, i.e., the voltage drop is zero.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>线性电感通过 <em>v=L di/dt</em> 将支路电压<em>v</em>与支路电流<em>i</em>相连。\r\n"
"如果<code>quasiStatic==false</code>，则忽略电气瞬态，即电压降为零。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.Components.InductorDC"
msgid "L=%L"
msgstr "L=%L"

