msgid "A"
msgstr "A"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.Components.PartialAirGapDC"
msgid "<html>\n"
"Linear model of the airgap (without saturation effects) of a DC machine, using only equations.<br>\n"
"Induced excitation voltage is calculated from der(flux), where flux is defined by excitation inductance times excitation current.\n"
"If <code>quasiStatic == true</code>, the electrical transients are neglected, i.e., the induced excitation voltage is zero.<br>\n"
"Induced armature voltage is calculated from flux times angular velocity.\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\n"
"直流电机气隙线性模型，不考虑磁饱和效应，模型完全由方程描述。<br>\n"
"励磁电感的感应电压是从der(flux)计算的，其中磁通由励磁电感乘以励磁电流定义。\n"
"如果<code>quasiStatic == true</code>，则忽略电气瞬态，即感应励磁电压为零。<br>\n"
"感应电枢电压是从磁通乘以角速度计算的。\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.Components.AirGapDC"
msgid "Linear airgap model of a DC machine"
msgstr "直流电机的线性气隙模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.Components.AirGapDC"
msgid "Excitation inductance"
msgstr "励磁电感"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.Components.AirGapDC"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Linear model of the airgap (without saturation effects) of a DC machine, using only equations.<br>\r\n"
"Induced excitation voltage is calculated from der(flux), where flux is defined by excitation inductance times excitation current.<br>\r\n"
"Induced armature voltage is calculated from flux times angular velocity.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\n"
"<p> \r\n"
"直流机空气隙的线性模型(不考虑饱和效应)，仅使用方程。<br>\r\n"
"感应励磁电压是从der(磁通)计算的，其中磁通由励磁电感乘以励磁电流定义。<br>\r\n"
"感应电枢电压是从磁通乘以角速度计算的。\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.Components.CompoundDCExcitation"
