msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.VoltageQuasiRMSSensor"
msgid "Length of space phasor -> RMS voltage"
msgstr "空间矢量长度->有效值电压"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.VoltageQuasiRMSSensor"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.VoltageQuasiRMSSensor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.VoltageQuasiRMSSensor"
msgid "V"
msgstr "V"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.VoltageQuasiRMSSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Measured three-phase instantaneous voltages are transformed to the corresponding space phasor;\r\n"
"output is length of the space phasor divided by sqrt(2), thus giving in sinusoidal stationary state RMS voltage.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"测量的三相瞬时电压被转换为相应的空间矢量；\r\n"
"输出是空间矢量长度除以sqrt(2)，因此在正弦稳态下给出了有效值电压。\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.CurrentQuasiRMSSensor"
msgid "Length of space phasor -> RMS current"
msgstr "空间矢量长度->有效值电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.CurrentQuasiRMSSensor"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.CurrentQuasiRMSSensor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.CurrentQuasiRMSSensor"
msgid "A"
msgstr "A"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.CurrentQuasiRMSSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Measured three-phase instantaneous currents are transformed to the corresponding space phasor;\r\n"
"output is length of the space phasor divided by sqrt(2), thus giving in sinusoidal stationary state RMS current.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"测量的三相瞬时电流被转换为相应的空间矢量；\r\n"
"输出是空间矢量长度除以sqrt(2)，因此在正弦稳态下给出了有效值电流。\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.ElectricalPowerSensor"
msgid "Instantaneous power from space phasors"
msgstr "空间矢量的瞬时功率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.ElectricalPowerSensor"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.ElectricalPowerSensor"
msgid "W"
msgstr "W"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.ElectricalPowerSensor"
msgid "var"
msgstr "var"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.ElectricalPowerSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Three-phase instantaneous voltages (plug_p - plug_nv) and currents (plug_p - plug_ni) are transformed to the corresponding space phasors,<br>\r\n"
"which are used to calculate power quantities:\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>P = instantaneous power, thus giving in stationary state active power.</li>\r\n"
"<li>Q = giving in stationary state reactive power.</li>\r\n"
"</ul></html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"三相瞬时电压(plug_p - plug_nv)和电流(plug_p - plug_ni)被转换为相应的空间矢量，\r\n"
"这些矢量用于计算功率量：\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>P=瞬时功率，因此在稳态下给出有功功率。</li>\r\n"
"<li>Q=在稳态下给出无功功率。</li>\r\n"
"</ul></html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.MechanicalPowerSensor"
msgid "Mechanical power = torque x speed"
msgstr "机械功率=扭矩x转速"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.MechanicalPowerSensor"
msgid "Use support or fixed housing"
msgstr "使用支撑或固定壳体"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.MechanicalPowerSensor"
msgid "Support at which the reaction torque is acting"
msgstr "支撑，反扭矩作用处"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.MechanicalPowerSensor"
msgid "W"
msgstr "W"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.MechanicalPowerSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Calculates (mechanical) power from torque times angular speed.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"从扭矩乘以角速度计算(机械)功率。\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.RotorDisplacementAngle"
msgid "Rotor lagging angle"
msgstr "转子滞后角"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.RotorDisplacementAngle"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.RotorDisplacementAngle"
msgid "Number of pole pairs"
msgstr "极对数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.RotorDisplacementAngle"
msgid "Use only positive output range, if true"
msgstr "如果为真，则仅使用正输出范围"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.RotorDisplacementAngle"
msgid "Below threshold the voltage is considered as zero"
msgstr "低于阈值时，电压被视为零"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.RotorDisplacementAngle"
msgid "Use support or fixed housing"
msgstr "使用支撑或固定壳体"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.RotorDisplacementAngle"
msgid "Support at which the reaction torque is acting"
msgstr "反扭矩作用处的支撑"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.RotorDisplacementAngle"
msgid "rad"
msgstr "rad"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.RotorDisplacementAngle"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Calculates rotor lagging angle by measuring the stator phase voltages, transforming them to the corresponding space phasor in stator-fixed coordinate system,<br>\r\n"
"rotating the space phasor to the rotor-fixed coordinate system and calculating the angle of this space phasor.\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The sensor's housing can be implicitly fixed (useSupport=false).<br>\r\n"
"If the machine's stator also implicitly fixed (useSupport=false), the angle at the flange\r\n"
"is equal to the angle of the machine's rotor against the stator.<br>\r\n"
"Otherwise, the sensor's support has to be connected to the machine's support.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"通过测量定子相电压，将其转换为定子固定坐标系中的相应空间矢量，\r\n"
"将空间矢量旋转到转子固定坐标系并计算此空间矢量的角度来计算转子滞后角。\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"传感器的外壳可以隐式固定(useSupport=false)。\r\n"
"如果机器的定子也隐式固定(useSupport=false)，则法兰处的角度等于定子相对于转子的角度。\r\n"
"否则，传感器的支撑必须连接到机器的支撑。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.HallSensor"
msgid "Hall sensor"
msgstr "霍尔传感器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.HallSensor"
msgid "Number of pole pairs"
msgstr "极对数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.HallSensor"
msgid "Initial mechanical angle"
msgstr "初始机械角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.HallSensor"
msgid "\"Electrical angle\""
msgstr "\"电气角\""

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.HallSensor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.HallSensor"
msgid "rad"
msgstr "rad"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.HallSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Simple model of a hall sensor, i.e. measuring the angle of the flange (w.r.t. the optional support), multiplying by the number of phases p to obtain the electrical angle,\r\n"
"and adding a correction term i.e. the initial angle of the flange phi0.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note that phi0 has to be set that way, that in shaft position phi0 the flux linkage of phase 1 is a maximum.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"简单的霍尔传感器模型，即测量法兰角度(相对于可选支撑)，乘以相数p以获得电气角度，\r\n"
"并添加一个校正项，即法兰的初始角度phi0。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请注意，phi0必须设置为使得在轴位phi0时，相1的磁链是最大的。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.SinCosResolver"
msgid "Sin-Cos-Resolver"
msgstr "正弦-余弦解析器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.SinCosResolver"
msgid "Number of pole pairs"
msgstr "极对数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.SinCosResolver"
msgid "Amplitude of signals"
msgstr "信号幅值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.SinCosResolver"
msgid "Offset of signals"
msgstr "信号偏移"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.SinCosResolver"
msgid "Initial mechanical angle"
msgstr "初始机械角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.SinCosResolver"
msgid "Track signals"
msgstr "跟踪信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.SinCosResolver"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Sensors.SinCosResolver"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Simple model of a sin-cos-resolver, i.e. sensing the angle of the flange <code>phi</code> (w.r.t. the optional support) and multiplied by <code>p</code>, providing 4 signals:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>y[1] = offset + amplitude*cos(p*(phi - phi0))</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>y[2] = offset - amplitude*cos(p*(phi - phi0))</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>y[3] = offset + amplitude*sin(p*(phi - phi0))</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>y[4] = offset - amplitude*sin(p*(phi - phi0))</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Thus the sine and cosine signals have <code>p</code> periods per mechanical revolution.\r\n"
"Adding an <code>offset</code> &gt; <code>amplitude</code>, the loss of one track can be determined.\r\n"
"Subtracting the negated signal from the signal, the offset is removed and a cosine and a sine with doubled amplitude are accessible.\r\n"
"From this signal, the angle within one pole pair of a machine can be determined for field oriented control.\r\n"
"Block <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.SinCosEvaluation\">SinCosEvaluation</a> can be used.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model can be used to export FMUs of drives to develop control strategies in other environments.\r\n"
"When switching to a real drive, the same inputs as from the FMU can be used.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note that <code>phi0</code> has to be set that way, that in shaft position <code>phi0</code> the flux linkage of phase 1 is a maximum.\r\n"
"In order to sense the mechanical angle of the shaft <code>p = 1</code> has to be set.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"简单的正弦-余弦解析器模型，即感知法兰角度<code>phi</code>(相对于可选支撑)，乘以<code>p</code>，提供4个信号：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>y[1] = offset + amplitude*cos(p*(phi - phi0))</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>y[2] = offset - amplitude*cos(p*(phi - phi0))</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>y[3] = offset + amplitude*sin(p*(phi - phi0))</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>y[4] = offset - amplitude*sin(p*(phi - phi0))</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"因此，正弦和余弦信号每个机械转动周期有<code>p</code>个周期。\r\n"
"添加一个<code>offset</code> &gt; <code>amplitude</code>，可以确定一个跟踪信号的丢失。\r\n"
"从信号中减去其负值，可以去除偏移并获得振幅加倍的余弦和正弦信号。\r\n"
"从这个信号中，可以确定机器一个极对内的角度，用于场面定向控制。\r\n"
"可以使用块<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.SinCosEvaluation\">SinCosEvaluation</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此模型可用于导出驱动的FMU以在其他环境中开发控制策略。\r\n"
"切换到真实驱动时，可以使用与FMU相同的输入。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请注意，<code>phi0</code> 必须设置为使得在轴位 <code>phi0</code> 时，相1的磁链是最大的。\r\n"
"为了感知轴的机械角度，必须设置<code>p=1</code>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.SpacePhasors"
msgid "Library with space phasor-models"
msgstr "带有空间矢量模型的库"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.SpacePhasors"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains components, blocks and functions to utilize space phasor theory.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Space phasors are defined as vectors of length = 2,\r\n"
"the first element representing the real part and the second element representing the imaginary part of the space phasor.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"You may have a look at a short summary of space phasor theory at <a href=\"https://www.haumer.at/refimg/SpacePhasors.pdf\">https://www.haumer.at/refimg/SpacePhasors.pdf</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该库包含了利用空间矢量理论的组件、块和函数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"空间矢量被定义为长度为2的向量，第一个元素表示空间矢量的实部，第二个元素表示空间矢量的虚部。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"您可以查看关于空间矢量理论的简要概述：<a href=\"https://www.haumer.at/refimg/SpacePhasors.pdf\">https://www.haumer.at/refimg/SpacePhasors.pdf</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

