msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.StrayLoad"
msgid "Model of stray load losses dependent on current and speed"
msgstr "电流和速度相关的杂散负载损耗模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.StrayLoad"
msgid "Stray load loss parameters"
msgstr "杂散负载损耗参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.StrayLoad"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.StrayLoad"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Stray load losses are modeled similar to standards EN 60034-2 and IEEE 112, i.e., they are dependent on square of current,\r\n"
"but without scaling them to zero at no-load current.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For an estimation of dependency on varying angular velocity see:<br>\r\n"
"W. Lang, &Uuml;ber die Bemessung verlustarmer Asynchronmotoren mit K&auml;figl&auml;ufer f&uuml;r Pulsumrichterspeisung,\r\n"
"Doctoral Thesis, Technical University of Vienna, 1984.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The stray load losses are modeled such way that they do not cause a voltage drop in the electric circuit.\r\n"
"Instead, the dissipated losses are considered through an equivalent braking torque at the shaft.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The stray load loss torque is\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"tau = PRef/wRef * (i/IRef)^2 * (w/wRef)^power_w\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where <code>i</code> is the current of the machine and <code>w</code> is the actual angular velocity.\r\n"
"The dependency of the stray load torque on the angular velocity is modeled by the exponent <code>power_w</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.StrayLoadParameters\">StrayLoad parameters</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If it is desired to neglect stray load losses, set <code>strayLoadParameters.PRef = 0</code> (this is the default).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"杂散负载损耗模型与EN 60034-2和IEEE 112标准类似，即它们依赖于电流的平方，\r\n"
"但没有将它们缩放到无负载电流时。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"关于速度变化的依赖性的估计，请参阅：<br>\r\n"
"W. Lang, Über die Bemessung verlustarmer Asynchronmotoren mit Käfigläufer für Pulsumrichterspeisung, Doctoral Thesis, Technical University of Vienna, 1984。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"杂散负载损耗模型不会导致电路中的电压下降。\r\n"
"相反，通过轴上的等效制动扭矩考虑耗散损耗。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"杂散负载损耗扭矩是\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"tau = PRef/wRef * (i/IRef)^2 * (w/wRef)^power_w\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中<code>i</code>是机器的电流，<code>w</code>是实际的角速度。\r\n"
"杂散负载扭矩对角速度的依赖性由指数<code>power_w</code>建模。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.StrayLoadParameters\">杂散负载参数</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果希望忽略杂散负载损耗，请设置<code>strayLoadParameters.PRef=0</code>(这是默认值)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.PermanentMagnetLosses"
msgid "Model of permanent magnet losses dependent on current and speed"
msgstr "依赖于电流和速度的永磁体损耗模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.PermanentMagnetLosses"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.PermanentMagnetLosses"
msgid "Permanent magnet loss parameters"
msgstr "永磁体损耗参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.PermanentMagnetLosses"
msgid "Instantaneous stator currents"
msgstr "瞬时定子电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.PermanentMagnetLosses"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Permanent magnet losses are modeled dependent on current and speed.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The permanent magnet losses are modeled such way that they do not cause a voltage drop in the electric circuit.\r\n"
"Instead, the dissipated losses are considered through an equivalent braking torque at the shaft.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The permanent magnet loss torque is\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"tau = PRef/wRef * (c + (1 - c) * (i/IRef)^power_I) * (w/wRef)^power_w\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where <code>i</code> is the current of the machine and <code>w</code> is the actual angular velocity.\r\n"
"The parameter <code>c</code> designates the part of the permanent magnet losses that are present even at current = 0, i.e. independent of current.\r\n"
"The dependency of the permanent magnet loss torque on the stator current is modeled by the exponent <code>power_I</code>.\r\n"
"The dependency of the permanent magnet loss torque on the angular velocity is modeled by the exponent <code>power_w</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.PermanentMagnetLossParameters\">Permanent magnet loss parameters</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If it is desired to neglect permanent magnet losses, set <code>strayLoadParameters.PRef = 0</code> (this is the default).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"永磁体损耗模型依赖于电流和速度。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"永磁体损耗模型不会导致电路中的电压下降。\r\n"
"相反，通过轴上的等效制动扭矩考虑耗散损耗。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"永磁体损耗扭矩是\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"tau = PRef/wRef*(c+(1-c)*(i/IRef)^power_I)*(w/wRef)^power_w\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中<code>i</code>是机器的电流， <code>w</code> 是实际的角速度。\r\n"
"参数<code>c</code>指定了即使在电流为0时也存在的永磁体损耗的部分，即与电流无关。\r\n"
"永磁体损耗扭矩对定子电流的依赖性由指数<code>power_I</code>建模。\r\n"
"永磁体损耗扭矩对角速度的依赖性由指数<code>power_w</code>建模。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.PermanentMagnetLossParameters\">永磁体损耗参数</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果希望忽略永磁体损耗，请设置<code>strayLoadParameters.PRef=0</code>(这是默认值)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.Core"
msgid "Model of core losses"
msgstr "铁芯损耗模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.Core"
msgid "Core parameters"
msgstr "铁芯参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.Core"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.Core"
msgid "Effective number of stator turns / effective number of rotor turns (if used as rotor core)"
msgstr "定子有效匝数/转子有效匝数(如果用作转子铁芯)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.Core"
msgid "Remagnetization angular velocity"
msgstr "磁化角速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.Core"
msgid "Losses"
msgstr "Losses"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.Core"
msgid "Variable core loss conductance"
msgstr "变化的铁芯损耗导纳"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.Core"
msgid "Limited angular velocity"
msgstr "限制的角速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.Core"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.InductionMachines.Core"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Core losses can be separated into <strong>eddy current</strong> and <strong>hysteresis</strong> losses. The total core losses\r\n"
"can thus be expressed as\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"P = PRef * (ratioHysteresis * (wRef / w) + 1 - ratioHysteresis) * (V / VRef)^2\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where <code>w</code> is the actual angular remagnetization velocity and <code>V</code> is the actual voltage.\r\n"
"The term <code>ratioHysteresis</code> is the ratio of the hysteresis losses with respect to the total core losses for the reference voltage and frequency.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In the current implementation hysteresis losses are <strong>not considered</strong> since complex numbers are not provided in Modelica.\r\n"
"Therefore, implicitly <code>ratioHysteresis = 0</code> is set. For the voltage and frequency range with respect to Fig.&nbsp;1,\r\n"
"the dependency of total core losses on the parameter <code>ratioHysteresis</code> is depicted in Fig.&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"The current implementation has thus the drawback over a model that considers <code>ratioHysteresis &gt; 0</code>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>underestimation of the losses in the constant field region (<code>w</code> &lt; <code>wRef</code>)</li>\r\n"
"<li>overestimation of the losses in the field weakening region (<code>w</code> &gt; <code>wRef</code>)</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\">\r\n"
"  <tr><td> <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/Machines/corelossesVw.png\"\r\n"
"                alt=\"corelossesVw.png\"> </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td> <strong> Fig. 1: </strong>Voltage versus angular velocity</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\">\r\n"
"  <tr><td> <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/Machines/corelossesPcw.png\"\r\n"
"                alt=\"corelossesPcw.png\"> </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td> <strong> Fig. 2: </strong>Core losses versus angular velocity with parameter <code>ratioHysteresis</code></td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Note</h4>\r\n"
"<p>In the current implementation it is assumed that <code>ratioHysteresis = 0</code>. This parameter cannot be changed due to compatibility reasons.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.CoreParameters\">Core loss parameters</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"铁芯损耗可以分为<strong>涡流</strong>和<strong>滞后</strong>损耗。总铁芯损耗可以表示为\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"P=PRef*(ratioHysteresis*(wRef/w)+1-ratioHysteresis)*(V/VRef)^2\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中<code>w</code>是实际的磁化角速度，<code>V</code>是实际的电压。\r\n"
"术语<code>ratioHysteresis</code>是滞后损耗与参考电压和频率的总铁芯损耗的比率。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在当前实现中，由于Modelica不提供复数，因此未考虑滞后损耗。\r\n"
"因此，隐含地设置<code>ratioHysteresis=0</code>。关于电压和频率范围，请参阅图 1，总铁芯损耗对参数<code>ratioHysteresis</code>的依赖性在图2中显示。\r\n"
"当前实现有以下缺点，相对于考虑<code>ratioHysteresis&gt;0</code>的模型：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>低估了恒定磁场区域的损耗(<code>w</code>&lt;<code>wRef</code>)</li>\r\n"
"<li>高估了磁场削弱区域的损耗(<code>w</code>&gt;<code>wRef</code>)</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\">\r\n"
"  <tr><td> <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/Machines/corelossesVw.png\"\r\n"
"                alt=\"corelossesVw.png\"> </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td> <strong>图 1:</strong>电压与角速度</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\">\r\n"
"  <tr><td> <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/Machines/corelossesPcw.png\"\r\n"
"                alt=\"corelossesPcw.png\"> </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td> <strong>图 2:</strong>铁芯损耗与角速度的关系，参数为<code>ratioHysteresis</code></td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>注意</h4>\r\n"
"<p>在当前实现中，假设<code>ratioHysteresis=0</code>。 由于兼容性原因，无法更改此参数。</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Losses.CoreParameters\">铁芯损耗参数</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

