"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.convertAlpha"
msgid "Converts alpha from temperature 1 (default 20 degC) to temperature 2"
msgstr "将alpha从温度1(默认为20°C)转换为温度2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.convertAlpha"
msgid "Temperature coefficient at temperature 1 (default: 20 degC)"
msgstr "温度1(默认：20°C)处的温度系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.convertAlpha"
msgid "Temperature 2"
msgstr "温度2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.convertAlpha"
msgid "Temperature 1 (default: 20 degC)"
msgstr "温度1(默认20°C)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.convertAlpha"
msgid "Temperature coefficient at TRef"
msgstr "TRef处的温度系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.convertAlpha"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"From the temperature coefficient <code>alpha1</code> at temperature <code>T1</code> (default 20 degC = 293.15 K)\r\n"
"the temperature coefficient <code>alpha2</code> at temperature <code>T2</code> is calculated:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"              alpha1\r\n"
"alpha2 = ------------------------\r\n"
"          1 + alpha1 * (T2 - T1)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"从温度<code>T1</code>(默认20°C=293.15K)处的温度系数<code>alpha1</code>，\r\n"
"计算出温度<code>T2</code>处的温度系数<code>alpha2</code>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"              alpha1\r\n"
"alpha2 = ------------------------\r\n"
"          1 + alpha1 * (T2 - T1)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.convertResistance"
msgid "Converts resistance from reference temperature to an actual temperature"
msgstr "将电阻从参考温度转换为实际温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.convertResistance"
msgid "Resistance at TRef"
msgstr "TRef 处的电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.convertResistance"
msgid "Reference temperature"
msgstr "参考温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.convertResistance"
msgid "Temperature coefficient at 20 degC"
msgstr "20°C 处的温度系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.convertResistance"
msgid "Actual temperature"
msgstr "实际温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.convertResistance"
msgid "Actual resistance at T"
msgstr "T 处的实际电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.convertResistance"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"From the temperature coefficient <code>alpha20</code> at 20 degC (equals to 293.15 K) the parameter <code>alphaRef</code> at <code>TRef</code>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                      alpha20\r\n"
"alphaRef = -------------------------------\r\n"
"            1 + alpha20 * (TRef - 293.15)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"is determined; using this value, actual resistance <code>R</code> with respect to the actual temperature <code>T</code> is calculated by\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  R\r\n"
"------ = 1 + alphaRef * (T - TRef)\r\n"
" RRef\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where <code>RRef</code> is the resistance at the reference temperature <code>TRef</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"从20°C处的温度系数<code>alpha20</code>(等于293.15K)计算参数<code>alphaRef</code>在<code>TRef</code>处：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                      alpha20\r\n"
"alphaRef = -------------------------------\r\n"
"            1 + alpha20 * (TRef - 293.15)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"利用这个值，根据实际温度<code>T</code>，计算实际电阻<code>R</code>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  R\r\n"
"------=1+alphaRef*(T-TRef)\r\n"
"RRef\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中<code>RRef</code>是参考温度<code>TRef</code>处的电阻。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.linearTemperatureDependency"
msgid "Converts a value (e.g. resistance) from reference temperature to an actual temperature"
msgstr "将一个值(例如电阻)从参考温度转换为实际温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.linearTemperatureDependency"
msgid "Value at TRef"
msgstr "TRef处的值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.linearTemperatureDependency"
msgid "Reference temperature"
msgstr "参考温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.linearTemperatureDependency"
msgid "Temperature coefficient at 20 degC"
msgstr "20°C处的温度系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.linearTemperatureDependency"
msgid "Actual temperature"
msgstr "实际温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.linearTemperatureDependency"
msgid "Actual value at T"
msgstr "T处的实际值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.linearTemperatureDependency"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is the same function as Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.convertResistance but without physical units for input RRef and result R.\r\n"
"This avoids problems if the function is used to calculate linear temperature dependency for other values than resistances.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"From the temperature coefficient <code>alpha20</code> at 20 degC (equals to 293.15 K) the parameter <code>alphaRef</code> at <code>TRef</code>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                      alpha20\r\n"
"alphaRef = -------------------------------\r\n"
"            1 + alpha20 * (TRef - 293.15)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"is determined; using this value, actual value (e.g. resistance <code>R</code>) with respect to the actual temperature <code>T</code> is calculated by\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  R\r\n"
"------ = 1 + alphaRef * (T - TRef)\r\n"
" RRef\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where <code>RRef</code> is the value (e.g. resistance) at the reference temperature <code>TRef</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个函数与Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Thermal.convertResistance相同，但是输入的RRef和输出的R没有物理单位。\r\n"
"如果该函数用于计算电阻以外的其他值的线性温度依赖性，则可以避免问题。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"从20°C处的温度系数<code>alpha20</code>(等于293.15K)计算参数 <code>alphaRef</code>在<code>TRef</code>处：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                      alpha20\r\n"
"alphaRef=-------------------------------\r\n"
"            1+alpha20*(TRef-293.15)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"利用这个值，根据实际温度<code>T</code>，计算实际值(例如电阻<code>R</code>)：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  R\r\n"
"------=1+alphaRef*(T-TRef)\r\n"
"RRef\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中<code>RRef</code>是参考温度<code>TRef</code>处的值(例如电阻)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

