msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.VfController"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Simple Voltage-Frequency-Controller.<br>\r\n"
"Amplitude of voltage is linear dependent (VNominal/fNominal) on frequency (input signal \"u\"), but limited by VNominal (nominal RMS voltage per phase).<br>\r\n"
"m sine-waves with amplitudes as described above are provided as output signal \"y\".<br>\r\n"
"By setting parameter EconomyMode=true, Voltage rises quadratically with frequency which means flux,torque and loss reduction for fan and pump drives.<br>\r\n"
"The sine-waves are intended to feed a m-phase SignalVoltage.<br>\r\n"
"Phase shifts between sine-waves may be chosen by the user; default values are <em>(k-1)/m*pi for k in 1:m</em>.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"简单的电压频率控制器。<br>\r\n"
"电压的幅值与频率(输入信号“u”)成线性关系(VNominal/fNominal)，但受到VNominal(每相额定有效值电压)的限制。<br>\r\n"
"作为输出信号“y”，提供描述如上述的振幅的m个正弦波。<br>\r\n"
"通过设置参数EconomyMode=true，电压随频率的增加呈二次方增长，这意味着风扇和泵驱动器的磁通、扭矩和损耗降低。<br>\r\n"
"这些正弦波用于提供m相 SignalVoltage。<br>\r\n"
"用户可以选择正弦波之间的相位差；默认值为<em>(k-1)/m*pi，其中k为1:m</em>。\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.ToDQ"
msgid "Transform instantaneous stator inputs to rotor fixed space phasor"
msgstr "将瞬时定子输入转换为转子固定空间矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.ToDQ"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.ToDQ"
msgid "Number of pole pairs"
msgstr "极对数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.ToDQ"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The polyphase input values <code>u[m]</code> are transformed to the corresponding space phasor which is rotated to the rotor fixed reference system,\r\n"
"using the provided mechanical rotor angle phi. The output are the resulting d and q components of the space phasor arranged in one vector <code>y[2]</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.FromDQ\">FromDQ</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"将多相输入值<code>u[m]</code>转换为相应的空间矢量，然后使用提供的机械转子角度phi将其旋转到转子固定参考系中。输出结果是空间矢量的结果d和q分量，排列在一个向量<code>y[2]</code>中。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.FromDQ\">FromDQ</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.FromDQ"
msgid "Transform rotor fixed space phasor to instantaneous stator quantities"
msgstr "将转子固定空间矢量转换为瞬时定子量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.FromDQ"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.FromDQ"
msgid "Number of pole pairs"
msgstr "极对数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.FromDQ"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The d and q components of a space phasor <code>u[2]</code> are rotated back to the stator fixed reference system,\r\n"
"using the provided mechanical rotor angle phi. The output are the instantaneous polyphase values <code>y[m]</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.ToDQ\">ToDQ</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"将空间矢量的d和q分量<code>u[2]</code>旋转回定子固定参考系，使用提供的机械转子角度phi。输出结果是瞬时的多相值<code>y[m]</code>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.ToDQ\">ToDQ</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.DQToThreePhase"
msgid "Transforms dq to three-phase"
msgstr "将dq转换为三相"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.DQToThreePhase"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.DQToThreePhase"
