msgstr "极对数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.DQToThreePhase"
msgid "If true, inputs dq are multiplied by sqrt(2)"
msgstr "如果为真，则输入的dq乘以sqrt(2)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.DQToThreePhase"
msgid "d-component"
msgstr "d分量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.DQToThreePhase"
msgid "q-component"
msgstr "q分量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.DQToThreePhase"
msgid "Rotor angle"
msgstr "转子角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.DQToThreePhase"
msgid "d"
msgstr "d"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.DQToThreePhase"
msgid "q"
msgstr "q"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.DQToThreePhase"
msgid "phi"
msgstr "phi"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Utilities.DQToThreePhase"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Transforms dq currents or voltages to three-phase currents or voltages.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The desired d- and q-components of the space phasor in rotor fixed coordinate system are given by inputs <code>d</code> and <code>q</code>.\r\n"
"Using the given rotor position (input <code>phi</code>), the correct three-phase values (output <code>y[3]</code>) are calculated.\r\n"
"They can be used to feed a current source which in turn feeds an induction machine.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Inputs <code>d</code> and <code>q</code> can be given either as peak values (<code>useRMS=false</code>) or as RMS (<code>useRMS=true</code>).\r\n"
"The correction by factor &radic;2 is done automatically.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"将dq电流或电压转换为三相电流或电压。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在转子固定坐标系中给出所需的d和q分量的空间矢量，分别由输入<code>d</code>和<code>q</code>给出。\r\n"
"使用给定的转子位置(输入<code>phi</code>)，计算出正确的三相值(输出<code>y[3]</code>)。\r\n"
"它们可以用来馈送电流源，电流源又馈送感应电机。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"输入<code>d</code>和<code>q</code>可以分别以峰值(<code>useRMS=false</code>)或RMS(<code>useRMS=true</code>)给出。\r\n"
"因子&radic;2的校正将自动完成。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

