msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Blocks"
msgid "Blocks for polyphase systems"
msgstr "多相系统的模块"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Blocks.QuasiRMS"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Blocks.QuasiRMS"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block determines the continuous quasi <a href=\"Modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Math.RootMeanSquare\">RMS</a> value of a polyphase system, representing an equivalent RMS vector or phasor. If the waveform of the input deviates from a sine curve, the output of the sensor will not be exactly the average RMS value.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = sqrt(sum(u[k]^2 for k in 1:m)/m)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模块确定多相系统的连续准<a href=\"Modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Math.RootMeanSquare\">均方根</a>值，表示等效的均方根矢量或相量。如果输入波形偏离正弦曲线，传感器的输出将不会完全是平均均方根值。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y=sqrt(sum(u[k]^2 for k in 1:m)/m)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Functions"
msgid "Functions for polyphase systems"
msgstr "多相系统的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Functions.quasiRMS"
msgid "Calculate continuous quasi RMS value of input"
msgstr "计算输入的连续准有效值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Functions.quasiRMS"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function determines the continuous quasi <a href=\"Modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Math.RootMeanSquare\">RMS</a> value of a polyphase system, representing an equivalent RMS vector or phasor. If the waveform of the input deviates from a sine curve, the output of the sensor will not be exactly the average RMS value.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = sqrt(sum(u[k]^2 for k in 1:m)/m)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数确定多相系统的连续准<a href=\"Modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Math.RootMeanSquare\">RMS</a>值，表示等效的RMS向量或矢量。如果输入波形偏离正弦曲线，则传感器的输出将不会完全是平均RMS值。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y=sqrt(sum(u[k]^2 for k in 1:m)/m)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

