msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Functions.activePower"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Calculates instantaneous power from polyphase voltages and currents.\r\n"
"In quasi-static operation, instantaneous power equals active power;\r\n"
