msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Interfaces.Plug"
msgid "Polyphase electrical plug with m pins"
msgstr "具有m个引脚的电气多相插头"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Interfaces.Plug"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Interfaces.Plug"
msgid "Pins of the plug"
msgstr "插头的引脚"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Interfaces.Plug"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Connectors PositivePlug and NegativePlug are nearly identical.\r\n"
"The only difference is that the icons are different in order\r\n"
"to identify more easily the plugs of a component.\r\n"
"Usually, connector PositivePlug is used for the positive and\r\n"
"connector NegativePlug for the negative plug of an electrical component.<br>\r\n"
"Connector Plug is a composite connector containing m Pins (Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.Pin).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"连接器PositivePlug和NegativePlug几乎相同。\r\n"
"唯一的区别在于，图标不同，以便更容易识别组件的插头。\r\n"
"通常情况下，连接器 PositivePlug用于电气组件的正极，连接器NegativePlug用于负极。<br>\r\n"
"连接器Plug是一个复合连接器，包含m个引脚(Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.Pin)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

