msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.PowerConverters.Examples.ACDC.RectifierCenterTap2mPulse.ThyristorCenterTap2mPulse_RLV"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This example shows a controlled <code>2*m</code> pulse center tap rectifier with R-L load including DC voltage source, where <code>m</code> is the number of phases. The additional DC voltage source in this example enables negative average load voltages.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Plot current <code>currentSensor.i</code>, average current <code>meanCurrent.y</code>, voltage <code>voltageSensor.v</code> and average voltage <code>meanVoltage.v</code>.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>此示例展示了一个带有 R-L 负载的受控 <code>2*m</code> 脉冲中心引线整流器，其中包括直流电压源，其中 <code>m</code> 是相数。此示例中的附加直流电压源使得负载平均电压为负。</p>\r\n"
"<p>绘制电流 <code>currentSensor.i</code>，平均电流 <code>meanCurrent.y</code>，电压 <code>voltageSensor.v</code> 和平均电压 <code>meanVoltage.v</code>。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.PowerConverters.Examples.ACDC.RectifierCenterTap2mPulse.ThyristorCenterTap2mPulse_RLV_Characteristic"
