msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.PowerConverters.ACAC.SinglePhaseTriac"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Simplified model of a triode for alternating current, built from two antiparallel thyristors.\r\n"
"<code>thyristor1</code> has to be fired during the positive halfwave of the voltage.\r\n"
"<code>thyristor2</code> has to be fired during the negative halfwave of the voltage.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note: A real triac is fired in positive direction (<code>thyristor1</code>) by a positive gate current and in negative direction (<code>thyristor2</code>) by a negative gate current.\r\n"
"The triac goes in blocking condition when the current falls to zero.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This behaviour is simulated by the two firing gates <code>fire1</code> and <code>fire2</code>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=false</code> and <code>fire2=false</code>: gate current = 0, stay in blocking condition</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=true </code> and <code>fire2=false</code>: gate current &gt; 0, fire <code>thyristor1</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=false</code> and <code>fire2=true </code>: gate current &lt; 0, fire <code>thyristor2</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=true </code> and <code>fire2=true </code>: forbidden</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"简化的交流三极管模型，由两个反并联晶闸管构建。\r\n"
"<code>thyristor1</code> 在电压的正半波期间必须被触发。\r\n"
"<code>thyristor2</code> 在电压的负半波期间必须被触发。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意：真实的三极管通过正向（<code>thyristor1</code>）的正向门电流触发，通过负向（<code>thyristor2</code>）的负向门电流触发。\r\n"
"当电流降至零时，三极管进入阻止状态。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这种行为通过两个触发门 <code>fire1</code> 和 <code>fire2</code> 模拟：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=false</code> 和 <code>fire2=false</code>：门电流 = 0，保持阻止状态</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=true </code> 和 <code>fire2=false</code>：门电流 > 0，触发 <code>thyristor1</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=false</code> 和 <code>fire2=true </code>：门电流 < 0，触发 <code>thyristor2</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=true </code> 和 <code>fire2=true </code>：禁止</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.PowerConverters.ACAC.PolyphaseTriac"
msgid "Triodes for alternating current"
msgstr "交流三极管"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.PowerConverters.ACAC.PolyphaseTriac"
msgid "Forward state-on differential resistance (closed resistance)"
msgstr "正向导通微分电阻（闭合电阻）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.PowerConverters.ACAC.PolyphaseTriac"
msgid "Backward state-off conductance (opened conductance)"
msgstr "反向截止导纳（断开导纳）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.PowerConverters.ACAC.PolyphaseTriac"
msgid "Forward threshold voltage"
msgstr "正向阈值电压"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.PowerConverters.ACAC.PolyphaseTriac"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.PowerConverters.ACAC.PolyphaseTriac"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Simplified model of <code>m</code>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.PowerConverters.ACAC.SinglePhaseTriac\">triodes for alternating current</a>, each built from two antiparallel thyristors.\r\n"
"<code>thyristor1</code> has to be fired during the positive halfwave of the voltage.\r\n"
"<code>thyristor2</code> has to be fired during the negative halfwave of the voltage.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note: A real triac is fired in positive direction (<code>thyristor1</code>) by a positive gate current and in negative direction (<code>thyristor2</code>) by a negative gate current.\r\n"
"The triac goes in blocking condition when the current falls to zero.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This behaviour is simulated by the two firing gates <code>fire1</code> and <code>fire2</code>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=false</code> and <code>fire2=false</code>: gate current = 0, stay in blocking condition</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=true </code> and <code>fire2=false</code>: gate current &gt; 0, fire <code>thyristor1</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=false</code> and <code>fire2=true</code>: gate current &lt; 0, fire <code>thyristor2</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=true </code> and <code>fire2=true</code>: forbidden</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"简化的 <code>m</code>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.PowerConverters.ACAC.SinglePhaseTriac\">交流三极管</a> 模型，每个由两个反并联晶闸管构成。\r\n"
"<code>thyristor1</code> 在电压的正半波期间必须被触发。\r\n"
"<code>thyristor2</code> 在电压的负半波期间必须被触发。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意：真实的三极管通过正向（<code>thyristor1</code>）的正向门电流触发，通过负向（<code>thyristor2</code>）的负向门电流触发。\r\n"
"当电流降至零时，三极管进入阻止状态。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这种行为通过两个触发门 <code>fire1</code> 和 <code>fire2</code> 模拟：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=false</code> 和 <code>fire2=false</code>：门电流 = 0，保持阻止状态</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=true </code> 和 <code>fire2=false</code>：门电流 &gt; 0，触发 <code>thyristor1</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=false</code> 和 <code>fire2=true</code>：门电流 < 0，触发 <code>thyristor2</code></li>\r\n"
"<li><code>fire1=true </code> 和 <code>fire2=true</code>：禁止</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

