msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview"
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic\">Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic</a>\r\n"
"library addresses the analysis of electrical circuits with purely sinusoidal\r\n"
"voltages and currents. The main characteristics of the library are:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"  <li>Only pure sinusoidal voltages and currents are taken into account.\r\n"
"      Higher harmonic voltages and currents are not considered.</li>\r\n"
"  <li>Any electrical transient effects are neglected.</li>\r\n"
"  <li>The electrical components of this library are strictly linear.</li>\r\n"
"  <li>The angular frequency <code>omega</code> of the voltages and currents of\r\n"
"      a circuit are determined from a reference angle <code>gamma</code> by means of\r\n"
"      <code>omega = der(gamma)</code>.</li>\r\n"
"  <li>The reference angle <code>gamma</code> is not a global quantity\r\n"
"      since it propagated through the connector.\r\n"
"      Therefore, independent circuits of different frequencies can be modeled in one model.</li>\r\n"
"  <li>The connectors contain the real and the imaginary part of the voltage and the current\r\n"
"      <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Introduction\">RMS phasors</a></li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The main intention of this library is the modeling of quasi-static behavior\r\n"
"of single-phase and polyphase\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ACCircuit\">AC circuits</a>\r\n"
"with fixed and variable frequency. Quasi-static theory and applications can be\r\n"
"found in\r\n"
"[<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">Dorf1993</a>],\r\n"
"[<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">Burton1994</a>],\r\n"
"[<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">Landolt1936</a>],\r\n"
"[<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">Philippow1967</a>],\r\n"
"[<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">Weyh1967</a>],\r\n"
"[<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">Vaske1973</a>].\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Note</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A general electrical circuit can be a DC circuit, an AC circuit with periodic sinusoidal or non-sinusoidal voltages and currents\r\n"
"or a transient circuit without particular waveform of voltages and currents.\r\n"
"Therefore a coupling model between a quasi-static circuit and a general (transient) electrical circuit\r\n"
"has to be designed carefully taking the specific application into account.\r\n"
"As an example, you may look at the <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Utilities.IdealACDCConverter\">\r\n"
"ideal AC DC converter</a>, which is used in the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.Rectifier\">rectifier example</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic\">Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic</a> 库用于分析仅具有纯正弦电压和电流的电路。该库的主要特点包括：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"  <li>仅考虑纯正弦电压和电流。不考虑更高次谐波电压和电流。</li>\r\n"
"  <li>忽略任何电气瞬态效应。</li>\r\n"
"  <li>该库的电气组件严格为线性。</li>\r\n"
"  <li>电路的电压和电流的角频率 <code>omega</code> 是通过参考角度 <code>gamma</code> 计算得出的，即 <code>omega = der(gamma)</code>。</li>\r\n"
"  <li>参考角度 <code>gamma</code> 不是全局量，因为它通过连接器传播。因此，可以在一个模型中建模不同频率的独立电路。</li>\r\n"
"  <li>连接器包含电压和电流的实部和虚部的<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Introduction\">有效值相量</a>。</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该库的主要目的是对具有固定和可变频率的单相和多相<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ACCircuit\">交流电路</a>的准静态行为进行建模。准静态理论和应用可在 [<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">Dorf1993</a>], [<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">Burton1994</a>], [<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">Landolt1936</a>], [<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">Philippow1967</a>], [<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">Weyh1967</a>], [<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">Vaske1973</a>] 中找到。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>注意</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一般的电气电路可以是直流电路，具有周期正弦或非正弦电压和电流的交流电路，或者没有特定电压和电流波形的瞬态电路。因此，必须谨慎设计准静态电路与一般（瞬态）电路之间的耦合模型，考虑特定的应用。例如，您可以查看<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Utilities.IdealACDCConverter\">理想交直流转换器</a>，该转换器在<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.Rectifier\">整流器示例</a>中使用。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Introduction"
msgid "Introduction to phasors"
msgstr "相量简介"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Introduction"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The purely sinusoidal voltage\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Introduction/img1.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"v=\\sqrt{2}V_{\\mathrm{RMS}}\\cos(\\omega t+\\varphi_{v})\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"in the time domain can be represented by a complex\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Glossar\">rms</a> phasor\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Introduction/img2.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"\\underline{v}=V_{\\mathrm{RMS}}e^{j\\varphi_{v}}.\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>For these quasi-static\r\n"
"phasor the following relationship applies:</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Introduction/img3.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"\\begin{displaymath}\r\n"
"v=\\mathrm{Re}(\\sqrt{2}\\underline{v}e^{j\\omega t})\\end{displaymath}\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This equation is also illustrated in Fig. 1.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Introduction/phasor_voltage.png\"\r\n"
"           alt=\"phasor_voltage.png\">\r\n"
"    </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <caption align=\"bottom\">Fig. 1: Relationship between voltage phasor and time domain voltage</caption>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"From the above equation it is obvious that for <em>t</em> = 0\r\n"
"the time domain voltage is <em>v</em> = cos(<em>&phi;<sub>v</sub></em>).\r\n"
"The complex representation of the phasor corresponds with this instance, too, since\r\n"
"the phasor is leading the real axis by the angle <em>&phi;<sub>v</sub></em>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The explanation given for sinusoidal voltages can certainly also be applied\r\n"
"to sinusoidal currents.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ACCircuit\">\r\n"
"          AC circuit</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Power\">\r\n"
"          Power</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ReferenceSystem\">\r\n"
"          Reference system</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在时间域中，纯正弦电压\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Introduction/img1.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"v=\\sqrt{2}V_{\\mathrm{RMS}}\\cos(\\omega t+\\varphi_{v})\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"可以由复<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Glossar\">有效值</a>相量表示\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Introduction/img2.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"\\underline{v}=V_{\\mathrm{RMS}}e^{j\\varphi_{v}}.\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>对于这些准静态相量，以下关系成立：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Introduction/img3.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"\\begin{displaymath}\r\n"
"v=\\mathrm{Re}(\\sqrt{2}\\underline{v}e^{j\\omega t})\\end{displaymath}\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个方程也在图1中有所说明。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Introduction/phasor_voltage.png\"\r\n"
"           alt=\"phasor_voltage.png\">\r\n"
"    </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <caption align=\"bottom\">图1：电压相量与时间域电压之间的关系</caption>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"从上述方程可以看出，在 <em>t</em> = 0 时，时间域电压为 <em>v</em> = cos(<em>&phi;<sub>v</sub></em>)。\r\n"
"相量的复数表示也与这个实例对应，因为相量领先于实轴 <em>&phi;<sub>v</sub></em> 角度。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"对于正弦电流，给出的解释当然也适用。</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ACCircuit\">\r\n"
"          交流电路</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Power\">\r\n"
"          功率</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ReferenceSystem\">\r\n"
"          参考系统</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ACCircuit"
msgid "AC circuit"
msgstr "交流电路"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ACCircuit"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A simple\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.SeriesResonance\">\r\n"
"          example</a> of a series connection of a resistor, an inductor and a capacitor\r\n"
"as depicted in Fig. 1 should be explained in the following. For various frequencies,\r\n"
"the voltage drops across the resistor, the inductor and the capacitor should be determined.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/ACCircuit/resonance_circuit.png\"\r\n"
"           alt=\"resonance_circuit.png\">\r\n"
"    </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <caption align=\"bottom\">Fig. 1: Series AC circuit of a resistor and an inductor at variable frequency</caption>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The voltage drop across the resistor\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/ACCircuit/img1.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"\r\n"
"\\underline{v}_{r}=R\\underline{i}\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"and the inductor\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/ACCircuit/img2.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"\r\n"
"\\underline{v}_{l}=j\\omega L\\underline{i}\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"and the capacitor\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/ACCircuit/img3.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"\r\n"
"\\underline{v}_{l}=j\\omega L\\underline{i}\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"add up to the total voltage\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/ACCircuit/img4.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"\r\n"
"\\underline{v}=\\underline{v}_{r}+\\underline{v}_{l}\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"as illustrated in the phasor diagram of Fig. 2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/ACCircuit/phasor_diagram.png\"\r\n"
"           alt=\"phasor_diagram.png\">\r\n"
"    </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <caption align=\"bottom\">Fig. 2: Phasor diagram of a resistor and inductance series connection</caption>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Due to the series connection of the resistor, inductor and capacitor, the three currents are all equal:</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/ACCircuit/img5.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"img5.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Introduction\">\r\n"
"          Introduction</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Power\">\r\n"
"          Power</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ReferenceSystem\">\r\n"
"          Reference system</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"下面将解释一个简单的<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.SeriesResonance\">\r\n"
"          串联电阻、电感和电容的示例</a>，如图1所示。对于不同的频率，应确定电阻、电感和电容的电压降。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/ACCircuit/resonance_circuit.png\"\r\n"
"           alt=\"resonance_circuit.png\">\r\n"
"    </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <caption align=\"bottom\">图1：可变频率下串联交流电阻和电感电路</caption>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"电阻上的电压降\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/ACCircuit/img1.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"\r\n"
"\\underline{v}_{r}=R\\underline{i}\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"电感上的电压降\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/ACCircuit/img2.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"\r\n"
"\\underline{v}_{l}=j\\omega L\\underline{i}\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"以及电容上的电压降\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/ACCircuit/img3.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"\r\n"
"\\underline{v}_{l}=j\\omega L\\underline{i}\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"相加得到总电压\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img\r\n"
" border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/ACCircuit/img4.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"\r\n"
"\\underline{v}=\\underline{v}_{r}+\\underline{v}_{l}\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如图2中的相量图所示。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/ACCircuit/phasor_diagram.png\"\r\n"
"           alt=\"phasor_diagram.png\">\r\n"
"    </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <caption align=\"bottom\">图2：电阻和电感串联连接的相量图</caption>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>由于电阻、电感和电容的串联连接，三个电流都相等：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"\r\n"
" src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/ACCircuit/img5.png\"\r\n"
" alt=\"img5.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Introduction\">\r\n"
"          简介</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Power\">\r\n"
"          功率</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ReferenceSystem\">\r\n"
"          参考系统</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Power"
msgid "Real and reactive power"
msgstr "有功和无功功率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Power"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>For periodic waveforms, the average value of the instantaneous power is <strong>real power</strong> <em>P</em>.\r\n"
"<strong>Reactive power</strong> <em>Q</em> is a term\r\n"
"associated with inductors and capacitors. For pure inductors and capacitors, real power is equal to zero.\r\n"
"Yet, there is instantaneous power exchanged with connecting network.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"The\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.SeriesResonance\">\r\n"
"          series resonance circuit</a> which was also addressed in the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ACCircuit\">\r\n"
"          AC circuit</a>\r\n"
"will be investigated.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Power of a resistor</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The instantaneous voltage and current are in phase:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/v_r.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"v_r.png\"><br>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/i_r.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"i_r.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Therefore, the instantaneous power is\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/power_r.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"power_r.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>A graphical representation of these equations is depicted in Fig. 1</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/power_resistor.png\"\r\n"
"           alt=\"power_resistor.png\">\r\n"
"    </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <caption align=\"bottom\">Fig. 1: Instantaneous voltage, current of power of a resistor</caption>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Real power of the resistor is the average of instantaneous power:</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/p_r.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"p_r.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Power of an inductor</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The instantaneous voltage leads the current by a quarter of the period:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/v_l.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"v_l.png\"><br>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/i_l.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"i_l.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Therefore, the instantaneous power is\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/power_l.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"power_l.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>A graphical representation of these equations is depicted in Fig. 2</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/power_inductor.png\"\r\n"
"           alt=\"power_inductor.png\">\r\n"
"    </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <caption align=\"bottom\">Fig. 2: Instantaneous voltage, current of power of an inductor</caption>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Reactive power of the inductor is:</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/q_l.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"q_l.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Power of a capacitor</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The instantaneous voltage lags the current by a quarter of the period:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/v_c.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"v_c.png\"><br>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/i_c.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"i_c.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Therefore, the instantaneous power is\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/power_c.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"power_c.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>A graphical representation of these equations is depicted in Fig. 3</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/power_capacitor.png\"\r\n"
"           alt=\"power_capacitor.png\">\r\n"
"    </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <caption align=\"bottom\">Fig. 3: Instantaneous voltage, current of power of a capacitor</caption>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Reactive power of the capacitor is:</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/q_c.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"q_c.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Complex apparent power</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>For an arbitrary component with two pins, real and reactive power can be determined by the complex phasors:</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/s.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"s.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In this equation <sup>*</sup> represents the conjugate complex operator\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Introduction\">\r\n"
"          Introduction</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ACCircuit\">\r\n"
"          AC circuit</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ReferenceSystem\">\r\n"
"          Reference system</a>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>对于周期波形，瞬时功率的平均值为<strong>有功功率</strong> <em>P</em>。\r\n"
"<strong>无功功率</strong> <em>Q</em> 是与电感和电容相关的术语。对于纯电感和电容，有功功率等于零。\r\n"
"然而，与连接网络交换瞬时功率存在。</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"将研究\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.SeriesResonance\">\r\n"
"          串联谐振电路</a>，该电路也在\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ACCircuit\">\r\n"
"          交流电路</a>\r\n"
"中讨论过。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>电阻的功率</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"瞬时电压和电流是同相的：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/v_r.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"v_r.png\"><br>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/i_r.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"i_r.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"因此，瞬时功率是\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/power_r.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"power_r.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>这些方程的图形表示如图1所示</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/power_resistor.png\"\r\n"
"           alt=\"power_resistor.png\">\r\n"
"    </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <caption align=\"bottom\">图1：电阻的瞬时电压、电流和功率</caption>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>电阻的有功功率是瞬时功率的平均值：</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/p_r.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"p_r.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>电感的功率</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"瞬时电压领先于电流四分之一个周期：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/v_l.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"v_l.png\"><br>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/i_l.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"i_l.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"因此，瞬时功率是\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/power_l.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"power_l.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>这些方程的图形表示如图2所示</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/power_inductor.png\"\r\n"
"           alt=\"power_inductor.png\">\r\n"
"    </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <caption align=\"bottom\">图2：电感的瞬时电压、电流和功率</caption>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>电感的无功功率是：</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/q_l.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"q_l.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>电容的功率</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"瞬时电压落后于电流四分之一个周期：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/v_c.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"v_c.png\"><br>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/i_c.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"i_c.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"因此，瞬时功率是\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/power_c.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"power_c.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>这些方程的图形表示如图3所示</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"    <td>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/power_capacitor.png\"\r\n"
"           alt=\"power_capacitor.png\">\r\n"
"    </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <caption align=\"bottom\">图3：电容的瞬时电压、电流和功率</caption>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>电容的无功功率是：</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/q_c.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"q_c.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>复视在功率</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>对于具有两个引脚的任意组件，可以通过复相量确定有功功率和无功功率：</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img border=\"0\"  src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/UsersGuide/Overview/Power/s.png\"\r\n"
"                   alt=\"s.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在这个方程中 <sup>*</sup> 表示共轭复数运算符\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Introduction\">\r\n"
"          简介</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ACCircuit\">\r\n"
"          交流电路</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ReferenceSystem\">\r\n"
"          参考系统</a>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ReferenceSystem"
msgid "Reference system"
msgstr "参考系统"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ReferenceSystem"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The reference angle <code>gamma</code>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"  <li>defines the angular frequency <code>omega</code> of the voltages and currents\r\n"
"      of a circuit by means of <code>omega = der(gamma)</code>.</li>\r\n"
"  <li>is not a global quantity since it propagated through the connector.\r\n"
"      Therefore, independent circuits of different frequencies can be modeled in one model.</li>\r\n"
"  <li>is present only once in a polyphase connector;\r\n"
"      a polyphase component has only one reference angle common to all phases.</li>\r\n"
"  <li>can be either constant or variable, but it has to be consistent in one contiguous circuit.</li>\r\n"
"  <li>is defined by the sources.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Designing new components, the guidelines of <a href=\"https://specification.modelica.org/v3.4/Ch9.html#overconstrained-equation-operators-for-connection-graphs\">Section 9.4.1 (Overconstrained Equation Operators for Connection Graphs) of the Modelica 3.4 specification</a> have to be taken into account.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Introduction\">\r\n"
"          Introduction</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ACCircuit\">\r\n"
"          AC circuit</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Power\">\r\n"
"          Power</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"参考角度 <code>gamma</code>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"  <li>通过 <code>omega = der(gamma)</code> 的方式定义电路的电压和电流的角频率 <code>omega</code>。</li>\r\n"
"  <li>不是全局量，因为它通过连接器传播。因此，可以在一个模型中对不同频率的独立电路进行建模。</li>\r\n"
"  <li>在多相连接器中仅存在一次；多相组件仅有一个公共的参考角度。</li>\r\n"
"  <li>可以是常数或变量，但在一个连续电路中必须保持一致。</li>\r\n"
"  <li>由源定义。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在设计新组件时，必须考虑 Modelica 3.4 规范的 <a href=\"https://specification.modelica.org/v3.4/Ch9.html#overconstrained-equation-operators-for-connection-graphs\">第9.4.1节（连接图的超约束方程运算符）</a> 指南。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Introduction\">\r\n"
"          简介</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.ACCircuit\">\r\n"
"          交流电路</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.Overview.Power\">\r\n"
"          功率</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.ReleaseNotes"
msgid "Release notes"
msgstr "发布说明"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.ReleaseNotes"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h5>Version 3.2.3, 2019-01-23</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"    <li>Added frequency dependent behavior im impedance and admittance models, see\r\n"
"        <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2451\">#2451</a></li>\r\n"
"    <li>Added frequency sweep voltage and current sources, see\r\n"
"        <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2442\">#2442</a>\r\n"
"    <ul>\r\n"
"        <li>Single-phase <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepVoltageSource\">FrequencySweepVoltageSource</a></li>\r\n"
"        <li>Single-phase <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepCurrentSource\">FrequencySweepCurrentSource</a></li>\r\n"
"        <li>Polyphase <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Sources.FrequencySweepVoltageSource\">FrequencySweepVoltageSource</a></li>\r\n"
"        <li>Polyphase <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Sources.FrequencySweepCurrentSource\">FrequencySweepCurrentSource</a></li>\r\n"
"    </ul></li>\r\n"
"    <li>Shortened default component names, see\r\n"
"      <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2301\">#2301</a></li>\r\n"
"    <li>Fixed missing <code>final useConjugateInput = false</code>, see\r\n"
"    <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2251\">#2251</a>\r\n"
"    <ul>\r\n"
"      <li><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.SymmetricalComponents\">Polyphase.Blocks.SymmetricalComponents</a></li>\r\n"
"      <li><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.FromSymmetricalComponents\">Polyphase.Blocks.FromSymmetricalComponents</a></li>\r\n"
"      <li><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.SingleToPolyphase\">Polyphase.Blocks.SingleToPolyphase</a></li>\r\n"
"    </ul></li>\r\n"
"<li>Updated icons of inductors and transformer models, see <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2210\">#2210</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Added polar and power quantities in ideal quasi-static transformer model, see <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2173\">#2173</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Removed redundant (and not identical) parameter m from\r\n"
"    <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Basic.MutualInductor\">MutualInductor</a>,\r\n"
"    see <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2202\">#2202</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Added linear polyphase mutual inductor model, see <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2200\">#2200</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Added complex impedance and admittance models of single-phase and polyphase package, see ticket\r\n"
"    <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/1870\">#1870</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Added magnitude and argument of complex voltages and currents in interface and sensor models, see ticket\r\n"
"    <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/1405\">#1405</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Added active, reactive and apparent power and power factor in interface models, see ticket\r\n"
"    <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/1405\">#1405</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Added complex single-phase and polyphase impedance and admittance models (ticket\r\n"
"    <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/1367\">#1367</a>)</li>\r\n"
"<li>Updated documentation on temperature dependency of resistance and conductance models</li>\r\n"
"<li>Rewrote source models to simplify initialization (\r\n"
"    <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/commit/861851e3b9628fa483e958a943ab015c15fcb821\">r7031</a>)</li>\r\n"
"<li>Implementation of ideal transformer model</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Version 1.0.0</h5>\r\n"
"<ul><li>First official release</li></ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h5>版本 3.2.3, 2019-01-23</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"    <li>添加了阻抗和导纳模型的频率依赖行为，参见\r\n"
"        <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2451\">#2451</a></li>\r\n"
"    <li>添加了频率扫描电压源和电流源，参见\r\n"
"        <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2442\">#2442</a>\r\n"
"    <ul>\r\n"
"        <li>单相 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepVoltageSource\">FrequencySweepVoltageSource</a></li>\r\n"
"        <li>单相 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepCurrentSource\">FrequencySweepCurrentSource</a></li>\r\n"
"        <li>多相 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Sources.FrequencySweepVoltageSource\">FrequencySweepVoltageSource</a></li>\r\n"
"        <li>多相 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Sources.FrequencySweepCurrentSource\">FrequencySweepCurrentSource</a></li>\r\n"
"    </ul></li>\r\n"
"    <li>缩短了默认组件名称，参见\r\n"
"      <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2301\">#2301</a></li>\r\n"
"    <li>修复了缺失的 <code>final useConjugateInput = false</code>，参见\r\n"
"    <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2251\">#2251</a>\r\n"
"    <ul>\r\n"
"      <li><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.SymmetricalComponents\">Polyphase.Blocks.SymmetricalComponents</a></li>\r\n"
"      <li><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.FromSymmetricalComponents\">Polyphase.Blocks.FromSymmetricalComponents</a></li>\r\n"
"      <li><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.SingleToPolyphase\">Polyphase.Blocks.SingleToPolyphase</a></li>\r\n"
"    </ul></li>\r\n"
"<li>更新了电感和变压器模型的图标，参见 <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2210\">#2210</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>在理想准静态变压器模型中添加了极坐标和功率量，参见 <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2173\">#2173</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>删除了冗余的参数 m，来自于\r\n"
"    <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Basic.MutualInductor\">MutualInductor</a>,\r\n"
"    参见 <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2202\">#2202</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>添加了线性多相互感器模型，参见 <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/2200\">#2200</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>添加了单相和多相包的复阻抗和导纳模型，参见 ticket\r\n"
"    <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/1870\">#1870</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>在接口和传感器模型中添加了复电压和电流的大小和参数，参见 ticket\r\n"
"    <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/1405\">#1405</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>在接口模型中添加了有功、无功和视在功率以及功率因数，参见 ticket\r\n"
"    <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/1405\">#1405</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>添加了单相和多相复阻抗和导纳模型（ticket\r\n"
"    <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/issues/1367\">#1367</a>）</li>\r\n"
"<li>更新了电阻和导纳模型的温度依赖性文档</li>\r\n"
"<li>重写了源模型以简化初始化 (\r\n"
"    <a href=\"https://github.com/modelica/ModelicaStandardLibrary/commit/861851e3b9628fa483e958a943ab015c15fcb821\">r7031</a>)</li>\r\n"
"<li>实现了理想变压器模型</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>版本 1.0.0</h5>\r\n"
"<ul><li>首次正式发布</li></ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

