msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase"
msgid "Single-phase AC components"
msgstr "单相交流组件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This package hosts models for quasi-static single-phase circuits.\r\n"
"Quasi-static theory for single-phase circuits can be found in the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">references</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase\">Polyphase</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该包包含用于准静态单相电路的模型。\r\n"
"单相电路的准静态理论可在<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">参考文献</a>中找到。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase\">多相</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples"
msgid "Test examples"
msgstr "测试示例"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Examples to demonstrate the usage of quasi-static electric components.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"用于演示准静态电气组件使用方法的示例。\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.SeriesBode"
msgid "Series circuit with Bode analysis"
msgstr "具有伯德分析的串联电路"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.SeriesBode"
msgid "Magnitude of voltage ratio"
msgstr "电压比的幅度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.SeriesBode"
msgid "Log10 of magnitude of voltage ratio in dB"
msgstr "以dB为单位的电压比幅度的对数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.SeriesBode"
msgid "Angle of voltage ratio"
msgstr "电压比的角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.SeriesBode"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The frequency of the voltage source is varied by a logarithmic ramp, the supply voltage magnitude is constant.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Plot versus <code>voltageSource.f</code> on a logarithmic scale in order to determine the Bode diagrams of the ratio of\r\n"
"the voltage of the resistor divided by the supply voltage:</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Gain response: <code>dB_y</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>Phase response: <code>arg_y</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过对数斜坡调节电压源的频率，供电电压幅度保持不变。</p>\r\n"
"<p>绘制对数尺度上的 <code>voltageSource.f</code> 对电阻的电压与供电电压的比值的波德图：</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>增益响应： <code>dB_y</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>相位响应： <code>arg_y</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

