msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.Rectifier"
msgid "Rectifier example"
msgstr "整流器示例"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.Rectifier"
msgid "AC rms voltage"
msgstr "交流有效值电压"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.Rectifier"
msgid "Ratio of DC voltage / AC rms voltage"
msgstr "直流电压与交流有效值电压的比值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.Rectifier"
msgid "Transient current"
msgstr "瞬态电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.Rectifier"
msgid "QS current"
msgstr "QS电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.Rectifier"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This example demonstrates coupling a quasi-static circuit with a DC circuit.\r\n"
"The QS voltage is rectified (using an\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Utilities.IdealACDCConverter\">\r\n"
"ideal AC DC converter</a>), loaded by a variable load conductor.\r\n"
"The <em>conversionFactor = DC voltage / AC rms voltage</em> in this case is the root mean square of a rectified sine, i.e., 1.\r\n"
"You may compare the quasi-static results with that of a fully transient model (using a\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Utilities.GraetzRectifier\">\r\n"
"Graetz rectifier</a>), plotting:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>QS: AC rms           current = iQS.len</li>\r\n"
"<li>AC: AC instantaneous current = iAC.u</li>\r\n"
"<li>AC: AC rms           current = iAC.y_rms</li>\r\n"
"<li>QS: DC current               = iDC1.i</li>\r\n"
"<li>AC: DC instantaneous current = iDC2.u</li>\r\n"
"<li>AC: DC rms           current = iDC2.y</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"It can be seen that at the DC side the current is represented by its averaged value, at the AC side by its rms value.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Note</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The quasi-static model needs a grounding at the QS side as well as the DC side,\r\n"
"whereas the transient model may have only one ground since AC side and DC side are connected via the diodes.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个例子演示了将一个准静态电路与一个直流电路耦合。\r\n"
"QS电压被整流（使用\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Utilities.IdealACDCConverter\">\r\n"
"理想的交直流转换器</a>），由可变负载导体负载。\r\n"
"在这种情况下，<em>conversionFactor = 直流电压 / 交流有效值电压</em> 是一个整流正弦的均方根，即为 1。\r\n"
"您可以比较准静态模型的结果与完全瞬态模型的结果（使用\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Utilities.GraetzRectifier\">\r\n"
"格雷茨整流器</a>），绘制：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>QS: 交流有效值电流 = iQS.len</li>\r\n"
"<li>AC: 交流瞬时电流 = iAC.u</li>\r\n"
"<li>AC: 交流有效值电流 = iAC.y_rms</li>\r\n"
"<li>QS: 直流电流 = iDC1.i</li>\r\n"
"<li>AC: 直流瞬时电流 = iDC2.u</li>\r\n"
"<li>AC: 直流有效值电流 = iDC2.y</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"可以看到，在直流侧，电流由其平均值表示，在交流侧，电流由其均方根值表示。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>注意</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"准静态模型需要在QS侧和DC侧都接地，\r\n"
"而瞬态模型可能只有一个地，因为交流侧和直流侧通过二极管连接。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.Transformer"
msgid "Example of transformer with short circuit impedance, transmission resistances and load"
msgstr "具有短路阻抗、传输电阻和负载的变压器示例"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.Transformer"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This examples shows the operational behavior of transformer with short circuit impedance. The transformer is loaded with constant current magnitude of 250A but variable phase angle. The angle varies from 0 to 360 degrees within one second of simulation time.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Transformer data</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Nominal primary voltage <code>V1N = 1000 V</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>Nominal secondary voltage <code>V2N = 200 V</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>Nominal apparent power  <code>SN = 50 kVA</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>Short circuit impedance <code><u>Z</u><sub>k</sub> = 0.72 Ohm + j*0.96 Ohm</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>Magnetizing current and core loss are not taken into account</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Plot the real part of the secondary voltage <code>idealTransformer.v2.re</code> on the x axis and <code>idealTransformer.v2.im</code> on the y axis. The locus of this complex voltage <code><u>v</u><sub>2</sub></code> is a circle. The center of the circle is the primary supply voltage divided by the transformation ratio of <code>n=5</code>. Since in this experiment the load current magnitude is constant, the voltage drop across the short circuit impedance of the transformer is constant, as well. The radius of the circle is equal to the constant magnitude of the voltage drop across the short circuit impedance.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>此示例展示了具有短路阻抗的变压器的运行行为。该变压器以恒定电流幅值250A负载，但相位角可变。相角在一秒的仿真时间内从0变化到360度。</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>变压器数据</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>名义主电压 <code>V1N = 1000 V</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>名义次电压 <code>V2N = 200 V</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>名义视在功率  <code>SN = 50 kVA</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>短路阻抗 <code><u>Z</u><sub>k</sub> = 0.72 Ohm + j*0.96 Ohm</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>未考虑磁化电流和铁芯损耗</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>绘制次电压的实部<code>idealTransformer.v2.re</code>在x轴上，<code>idealTransformer.v2.im</code>在y轴上。这个复电压<code><u>v</u><sub>2</sub></code>的轨迹是一个圆。圆的中心是主供电电压除以变换比<code>n=5</code>。由于在此实验中负载电流幅值是恒定的，变压器短路阻抗的电压降也是恒定的。圆的半径等于变压器短路阻抗的电压降的恒定幅值。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic"
msgid "Basic components for AC single-phase models"
msgstr "AC单相模型的基本组件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This package hosts basic models for quasi-static single-phase circuits.\r\n"
"Quasi-static theory for single-phase circuits can be found in the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">references</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic\">Polyphase.Basic</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>此包托管了准静态单相电路的基本模型。\r\n"
"单相电路的准静态理论可在\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">参考资料</a>\r\n"
"中找到。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic\">Polyphase.Basic</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Ground"
msgid "Electrical ground"
msgstr "电气接地"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Ground"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Ground"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Ground of a single-phase circuit. The potential at the ground node is zero.\r\n"
"Every electrical circuit, e.g., a series resonance\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.SeriesResonance\">\r\n"
"          example</a>, has to contain at least one ground object.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"单相电路的接地。接地节点的电势为零。\r\n"
"每个电气电路，例如，一个串联谐振\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples.SeriesResonance\">\r\n"
"          示例</a>，都必须包含至少一个地对象。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Resistor"
msgid "Single-phase linear resistor"
msgstr "单相线性电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Resistor"
msgid "Reference resistance at T_ref"
msgstr "参考温度下的电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Resistor"
msgid "Reference temperature"
msgstr "参考温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Resistor"
msgid "Temperature coefficient of resistance (R_actual = R_ref*(1 + alpha_ref*(heatPort.T - T_ref))"
msgstr "电阻温度系数 (R_actual = R_ref*(1 + alpha_ref*(heatPort.T - T_ref))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Resistor"
msgid "Resistance = R_ref*(1 + alpha_ref*(heatPort.T - T_ref))"
msgstr "电阻 = R_ref*(1 + alpha_ref*(heatPort.T - T_ref))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Resistor"
msgid "R=%R_ref"
msgstr "R=%R_ref"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Resistor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Resistor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The linear resistor connects the complex voltage <code><u>v</u></code> with the complex\r\n"
"current <code><u>i</u></code> by <code><u>i</u>*R = <u>v</u></code>.\r\n"
"The resistance <code>R</code> is allowed to be positive, zero, or negative.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The resistor model also has an optional\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.ConditionalHeatPort\">conditional heat port</a>.\r\n"
"A linear temperature dependency of the resistance is also taken into account.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Conductor\">Conductor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Capacitor\">Capacitor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Inductor\">Inductor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Impedance\">Impedance</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Admittance\">Admittance</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableResistor\">Variable resistor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableConductor\">Variable conductor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableCapacitor\">Variable capacitor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableInductor\">Variable inductor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableImpedance\">Variable impedance</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableAdmittance\">Variable admittance</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"线性电阻通过复电压<code><u>v</u></code>与复电流<code><u>i</u></code>连接，<code><u>i</u>*R = <u>v</u></code>。\r\n"
"电阻<code>R</code>允许为正、零或负。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"电阻模型还具有可选的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.ConditionalHeatPort\">条件热口</a>。\r\n"
"还考虑了电阻的线性温度依赖性。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Conductor\">Conductor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Capacitor\">Capacitor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Inductor\">Inductor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Impedance\">Impedance</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Admittance\">Admittance</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableResistor\">Variable resistor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableConductor\">Variable conductor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableCapacitor\">Variable capacitor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableInductor\">Variable inductor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableImpedance\">Variable impedance</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableAdmittance\">Variable admittance</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Conductor"
msgid "Single-phase linear conductor"
msgstr "单相线性电导"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Conductor"
msgid "Reference conductance at T_ref"
msgstr "在 T_ref 下的参考导纳"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Conductor"
msgid "Reference temperature"
msgstr "参考温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Conductor"
msgid "Temperature coefficient of conductance (G_actual = G_ref/(1 + alpha_ref*(heatPort.T - T_ref))"
msgstr "导纳的温度系数 (G_actual = G_ref/(1 + alpha_ref*(heatPort.T - T_ref))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Conductor"
msgid "Conductance = G_ref/(1 + alpha_ref*(heatPort.T - T_ref))"
msgstr "导纳 = G_ref/(1 + alpha_ref*(heatPort.T - T_ref))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Conductor"
msgid "G=%G_ref"
msgstr "G=%G_ref"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Conductor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Conductor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The linear conductor connects the voltage <code><u>v</u></code> with the\r\n"
"current <code><u>i</u></code> by <code><u>i</u> = <u>v</u>*G</code>.\r\n"
"The conductance <code>G</code> is allowed to be positive, zero, or negative.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The conductor model also has an optional\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.ConditionalHeatPort\">conditional heat port</a>.\r\n"
"A linear temperature dependency of the conductance is also taken into account.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Resistor\">Resistor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Capacitor\">Capacitor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Inductor\">Inductor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Impedance\">Impedance</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Admittance\">Admittance</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableResistor\">Variable resistor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableConductor\">Variable conductor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableCapacitor\">Variable capacitor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableInductor\">Variable inductor</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableImpedance\">Variable impedance</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableAdmittance\">Variable admittance</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"线性导体通过 <code><u>v</u></code> 连接电压和\r\n"
"电流 <code><u>i</u></code> 由 <code><u>i</u> = <u>v</u>*G</code>确定。\r\n"
"导纳 <code>G</code> 可以是正数、零或负数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"导体模型还有一个可选的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.ConditionalHeatPort\">条件热端口</a>。\r\n"
"导纳的线性温度依赖性也被考虑在内。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Resistor\">电阻</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Capacitor\">电容</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Inductor\">电感</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Impedance\">阻抗</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Admittance\">导纳</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableResistor\">可变电阻</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableConductor\">可变导体</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableCapacitor\">可变电容</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.VariableInductor\">可变电感</a>,\r\n"
