"The capacitance <code>C</code> is given as input signal.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Note</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The abstraction of a variable capacitor at quasi-static operation assumes:\r\n"
