msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealCommutingSwitch"
msgid "Ideal commuting switch"
msgstr "理想切换开关"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealCommutingSwitch"
msgid "Closed switch resistance"
msgstr "闭合状态下的电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealCommutingSwitch"
msgid "Opened switch conductance"
msgstr "断开状态下的导纳"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealCommutingSwitch"
msgid "true => p--n2 connected, false => p--n1 connected"
msgstr "true => p--n2 connected, false => p--n1 connected"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealCommutingSwitch"
msgid "Auxiliary variables"
msgstr "辅助变量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealCommutingSwitch"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The commuting switch has a positive pin p and two negative pins n1 and n2.\r\n"
"The switching behaviour is controlled\r\n"
"by the input signal control. If control is true, the pin p is connected\r\n"
"with the negative pin n2. Otherwise, the pin p is connected to the negative pin n1.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In order to prevent singularities during switching, the opened\r\n"
"switch has a (very low) conductance Goff\r\n"
"and the closed switch has a (very low) resistance Ron.\r\n"
"The limiting case is also allowed, i.e., the resistance Ron of the\r\n"
"closed switch could be exactly zero and the conductance Goff of the\r\n"
"open switch could be also exactly zero. Note, there are circuits,\r\n"
"where a description with zero Ron or zero Goff is not possible.\r\n"
"<br><br>\r\n"
"<strong>Please note:</strong>\r\n"
"In case of useHeatPort=true the temperature dependence of the electrical\r\n"
"behavior is <strong>not</strong> modelled. The parameters are not temperature dependent.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Use with care:</strong>\r\n"
"This switch is only intended to be used for structural changes, not for fast switching sequences, due to the quasi-static formulation.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个换位开关有一个正引脚 p 和两个负引脚 n1 和 n2。\r\n"
"开关行为由输入信号 control 控制。如果 control 为 true，则引脚 p 与负引脚 n2 连接。\r\n"
"否则，引脚 p 与负引脚 n1 连接。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"为了在换位过程中防止奇点，打开的开关具有（非常低的）导纳 Goff，\r\n"
"闭合的开关具有（非常低的）电阻 Ron。\r\n"
"极限情况也是允许的，即，闭合开关的电阻 Ron 可以恰好为零，断开开关的导纳 Goff 也可以恰好为零。\r\n"
"请注意，有些电路不可能用零 Ron 或零 Goff 来描述。\r\n"
"<br><br>\r\n"
"<strong>请注意：</strong>\r\n"
"如果 useHeatPort=true，则不模拟电气行为的温度依赖性。参数不随温度变化。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>谨慎使用：</strong>\r\n"
"此开关仅用于结构更改，不用于快速换位序列，因为其准静态表述。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealCommutingSwitch"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealIntermediateSwitch"
msgid "Ideal intermediate switch"
msgstr "理想中间开关"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealIntermediateSwitch"
msgid "Closed switch resistance"
msgstr "闭合开关电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealIntermediateSwitch"
msgid "Opened switch conductance"
msgstr "打开开关导纳"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealIntermediateSwitch"
msgid "true => p1--n2, p2--n1 connected, otherwise p1--n1, p2--n2  connected"
msgstr "true => p1--n2, p2--n1 连接，否则 p1--n1, p2--n2 连接"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealIntermediateSwitch"
msgid "Auxiliary variables"
msgstr "辅助变量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealIntermediateSwitch"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The intermediate switch has four switching contact pins p1, p2, n1, and n2.\r\n"
"The switching behaviour is controlled by the input signal control. If control\r\n"
"is true, the pin p1 is connected to pin n2, and the pin p2 is\r\n"
"connected to the pin n2. Otherwise, the pin p1 is connected to n1, and\r\n"
"p2 is connected to n2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/SinglePhase/Ideal/IdealIntermediateSwitch1.png\" alt=\"IdealIntermediateSwitch1\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In order to prevent singularities during switching, the opened\r\n"
"switch has a (very low) conductance Goff\r\n"
"and the closed switch has a (very low) resistance Ron.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/SinglePhase/Ideal/IdealIntermediateSwitch2.png\" alt=\"IdealIntermediateSwitch2\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The limiting case is also allowed, i.e., the resistance Ron of the\r\n"
"closed switch could be exactly zero and the conductance Goff of the\r\n"
"open switch could be also exactly zero. Note, there are circuits,\r\n"
"where a description with zero Ron or zero Goff is not possible.\r\n"
"<br><br>\r\n"
"<strong>Please note:</strong>\r\n"
"In case of useHeatPort=true the temperature dependence of the electrical\r\n"
"behavior is <strong>not</strong> modelled. The parameters are not temperature dependent.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Use with care:</strong>\r\n"
"This switch is only intended to be used for structural changes, not for fast switching sequences, due to the quasi-static formulation.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"中间开关具有四个切换接点 p1、p2、n1 和 n2。\r\n"
"切换行为由输入信号 control 控制。如果 control 为 true，则引脚 p1 连接到引脚 n2，并且引脚 p2 连接到引脚 n2。否则，引脚 p1 连接到 n1，引脚 p2 连接到 n2。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/SinglePhase/Ideal/IdealIntermediateSwitch1.png\" alt=\"IdealIntermediateSwitch1\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"为了在切换过程中防止奇点出现，打开的开关具有（非常低的）导纳 Goff，而闭合的开关具有（非常低的）电阻 Ron。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/SinglePhase/Ideal/IdealIntermediateSwitch2.png\" alt=\"IdealIntermediateSwitch2\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"也允许极限情况，即闭合开关的电阻 Ron 可以完全为零，打开开关的导纳 Goff 也可以完全为零。请注意，有些电路无法用零 Ron 或零 Goff 来描述。\r\n"
"<br><br>\r\n"
"<strong>请注意：</strong>\r\n"
"如果 useHeatPort=true，则不会对电气行为进行温度相关的建模。参数不受温度影响。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>谨慎使用：</strong>\r\n"
"由于准静态的制定方式，此开关仅用于结构更改，而不适用于快速切换序列。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealIntermediateSwitch"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealOpeningSwitch"
msgid "Ideal electrical opener"
msgstr "理想电气开关"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealOpeningSwitch"
msgid "Closed switch resistance"
msgstr "闭合开关电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealOpeningSwitch"
msgid "Opened switch conductance"
msgstr "断开开关导纳"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealOpeningSwitch"
msgid "true => switch open, false => p--n connected"
msgstr "true => 开关断开, false => p--n 连接"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealOpeningSwitch"
msgid "Auxiliary variable"
msgstr "辅助变量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealOpeningSwitch"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The ideal opening switch has a positive pin p and a negative pin n.\r\n"
"The switching behaviour is controlled by the input signal control.\r\n"
"If control is true, pin p is not connected\r\n"
"with negative pin n. Otherwise, pin p is connected\r\n"
"with negative pin n.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In order to prevent singularities during switching, the opened\r\n"
"switch has a (very low) conductance Goff\r\n"
"and the closed switch has a (very low) resistance Ron.\r\n"
"The limiting case is also allowed, i.e., the resistance Ron of the\r\n"
"closed switch could be exactly zero and the conductance Goff of the\r\n"
"open switch could be also exactly zero. Note, there are circuits,\r\n"
"where a description with zero Ron or zero Goff is not possible.\r\n"
"<br><br>\r\n"
"<strong>Please note:</strong>\r\n"
"In case of useHeatPort=true the temperature dependence of the electrical\r\n"
"behavior is <strong>not</strong> modelled. The parameters are not temperature dependent.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Use with care:</strong>\r\n"
"This switch is only intended to be used for structural changes, not for fast switching sequences, due to the quasi-static formulation.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"理想断开开关有一个正极 p 和一个负极 n。\r\n"
"开关行为由输入信号 control 控制。\r\n"
"如果 control 为 true，则针脚 p 未连接\r\n"
"负极 n。否则，针脚 p 连接\r\n"
"负极 n。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"为了在开关过程中避免奇异性，打开的\r\n"
"开关具有（非常低的）导纳 Goff\r\n"
"和闭合的开关具有（非常低的）电阻 Ron。\r\n"
"也允许极限情况，即，闭合开关的电阻 Ron\r\n"
"可以完全为零，打开开关的导纳 Goff\r\n"
"也可以完全为零。请注意，有些电路，\r\n"
"描述为零 Ron 或零 Goff 是不可能的。\r\n"
"<br><br>\r\n"
"<strong>请注意：</strong>\r\n"
"如果 useHeatPort=true，则不建模电气行为的温度依赖性。\r\n"
"参数不随温度变化。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>小心使用：</strong>\r\n"
"此开关仅用于结构更改，不适用于快速开关序列，由于准静态公式的形式。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealOpeningSwitch"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealClosingSwitch"
msgid "Ideal electrical closer"
msgstr "理想电气闭合开关"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealClosingSwitch"
msgid "Closed switch resistance"
msgstr "闭合开关电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealClosingSwitch"
msgid "Opened switch conductance"
msgstr "开启开关电导"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealClosingSwitch"
msgid "true => p--n connected, false => switch open"
msgstr "true => p--n 连接，false => 开关开启"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealClosingSwitch"
msgid "Auxiliary variable"
msgstr "辅助变量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealClosingSwitch"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The ideal closing switch has a positive pin p and a negative pin n.\r\n"
"The switching behaviour is controlled by input signal control.\r\n"
"If control is true, pin p is connected\r\n"
"with negative pin n. Otherwise, pin p is not connected\r\n"
"with negative pin n.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In order to prevent singularities during switching, the opened\r\n"
"switch has a (very low) conductance Goff\r\n"
"and the closed switch has a (very low) resistance Ron.\r\n"
"The limiting case is also allowed, i.e., the resistance Ron of the\r\n"
"closed switch could be exactly zero and the conductance Goff of the\r\n"
"open switch could be also exactly zero. Note, there are circuits,\r\n"
"where a description with zero Ron or zero Goff is not possible.\r\n"
"<br><br>\r\n"
"<strong>Please note:</strong>\r\n"
"In case of useHeatPort=true the temperature dependence of the electrical\r\n"
"behavior is <strong>not</strong> modelled. The parameters are not temperature dependent.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Use with care:</strong>\r\n"
"This switch is only intended to be used for structural changes, not for fast switching sequences, due to the quasi-static formulation.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"理想闭合开关有一个正极 p 和一个负极 n。\r\n"
"开关行为由输入信号 control 控制。\r\n"
"如果 control 为 true，则将正极 p 连接到负极 n。\r\n"
"否则，正极 p 将不连接到负极 n。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"为了在开关过程中避免奇点，开启状态的开关具有（非常低的）电导 Goff，\r\n"
"闭合状态的开关具有（非常低的）电阻 Ron。\r\n"
"允许极限情况，即闭合开关的电阻 Ron 可以为零，开启开关的电导 Goff 也可以为零。\r\n"
"请注意，有些电路无法描述为电阻 Ron 或电导 Goff 为零的情况。\r\n"
"<br><br>\r\n"
"<strong>请注意：</strong>\r\n"
"如果 useHeatPort=true，则不会模拟电气行为的温度依赖性。参数不随温度变化。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>慎重使用：</strong>\r\n"
"此开关仅用于结构更改，不适用于由于准静态公式而导致的快速开关序列。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

