msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealTransformer"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The ideal transformer is a two-port circuit element without magnetization. Voltages and currents are ideally transformed:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v1 =  v2*n;\r\n"
"i2 = -i1*n;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where <code>n</code> is a real number called the turns ratio.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"理想变压器是一个没有磁化的两端口电路元件。电压和电流理想地转换：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v1 =  v2*n;\r\n"
"i2 = -i1*n;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中<code>n</code>是一个叫做变比的实数。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Ideal.IdealTransformer"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h5>2014-01-02, Christian Kral</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Initial implementation of ideal transformer model</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h5>2014-01-02, Christian Kral</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>理想变压器模型的初始实现</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sensors"
msgid "AC single-phase sensors"
msgstr "交流单相传感器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sensors"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This package hosts sensors for quasi-static single-phase circuits.\r\n"
"Quasi-static theory for single-phase circuits can be found in the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">references</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Sensors\">Polyphase.Sensors</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该包包含用于准静态单相电路的传感器。\r\n"
"关于单相电路的准静态理论可以在<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">参考文献</a>中找到。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Sensors\">Polyphase.Sensors</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

