msgstr "电压源的相位移"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VoltageSource"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a constant voltage source, specifying the complex voltage by the RMS voltage and the phase shift.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableVoltageSource\">VariableVoltageSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.CurrentSource\">CurrentSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableCurrentSource\">VariableCurrentSource</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个恒定电压源，通过有效值电压和相位移指定复电压。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableVoltageSource\">VariableVoltageSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.CurrentSource\">CurrentSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableCurrentSource\">VariableCurrentSource</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableVoltageSource"
msgid "Variable AC voltage"
msgstr "可变交流电压"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableVoltageSource"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a voltage source with a complex signal input, specifying the complex voltage by the complex RMS voltage components.\r\n"
"Additionally, the frequency of the voltage source is defined by a real signal input.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VoltageSource\">VoltageSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.CurrentSource\">CurrentSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableCurrentSource\">VariableCurrentSource</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个带有复信号输入的电压源，通过复有效值电压分量来指定复电压。\r\n"
"此外，电压源的频率由实信号输入定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VoltageSource\">VoltageSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.CurrentSource\">CurrentSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableCurrentSource\">VariableCurrentSource</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepVoltageSource"
msgid "Voltage source with integrated frequency sweep"
msgstr "集成频率扫描的电压源"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepVoltageSource"
msgid "Start sweep frequency"
msgstr "开始扫描频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepVoltageSource"
msgid "Stop sweep frequency"
msgstr "结束扫描频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepVoltageSource"
msgid "Start time of frequency sweep"
msgstr "频率扫描开始时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepVoltageSource"
msgid "Duration of frequency sweep"
msgstr "频率扫描持续时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepVoltageSource"
msgid "RMS voltage of the source"
msgstr "电压源的有效值电压"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepVoltageSource"
msgid "Phase shift of the source"
msgstr "电压源的相位移"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepVoltageSource"
msgid "Actual frequency"
msgstr "实际频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepVoltageSource"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepVoltageSource"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This source provides a constant RMS phase voltage <code>V</code> and phase angle <code>phi</code>,\r\n"
"whereas the frequency sweeps from\r\n"
"<code>fStart</code> to <code>fStop</code> with <code>duration</code>. The frequency sweeps such\r\n"
"way that on a logarithmic frequency scale, the frequency curve appears linear.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/SinglePhase/Sources/FrequencySweepSource.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"FrequencySweepSource.png\"></div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该源提供恒定有效值相位电压<code>V</code>和相位角<code>phi</code>，\r\n"
"而频率从<code>fStart</code>到<code>fStop</code>在<code>duration</code>时间内扫描。\r\n"
"在对数频率尺度上，频率以线性方式扫描。</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/SinglePhase/Sources/FrequencySweepSource.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"FrequencySweepSource.png\"></div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.CurrentSource"
msgid "Constant AC current"
msgstr "恒定交流电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.CurrentSource"
msgid "Frequency of the source"
msgstr "源的频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.CurrentSource"
msgid "RMS current of the source"
msgstr "源的有效值电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.CurrentSource"
msgid "Phase shift of the source"
msgstr "源的相位偏移"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.CurrentSource"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a constant current source, specifying the complex current by the RMS current and the phase shift.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VoltageSource\">VoltageSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableVoltageSource\">VariableVoltageSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableCurrentSource\">VariableCurrentSource</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个恒定电流源，通过有效值电流和相位偏移指定复电流。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VoltageSource\">VoltageSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableVoltageSource\">VariableVoltageSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableCurrentSource\">VariableCurrentSource</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableCurrentSource"
msgid "Variable AC current"
msgstr "可变交流电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableCurrentSource"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a current source with a complex signal input, specifying the complex current by the complex RMS current components.\r\n"
"Additionally, the frequency of the voltage source is defined by a real signal input.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VoltageSource\">VoltageSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableVoltageSource\">VariableVoltageSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.CurrentSource\">CurrentSource</a>,\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个带有复信号输入的电流源，通过复有效值电流分量指定复电流。\r\n"
"此外，电压源的频率由实信号输入定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VoltageSource\">VoltageSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VariableVoltageSource\">VariableVoltageSource</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.CurrentSource\">CurrentSource</a>,\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepCurrentSource"
msgid "Current source with integrated frequency sweep"
msgstr "带有集成频率扫描的电流源"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepCurrentSource"
msgid "Start sweep frequency"
msgstr "起始扫描频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepCurrentSource"
msgid "Stop sweep frequency"
msgstr "停止扫描频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepCurrentSource"
msgid "Start time of frequency sweep"
msgstr "频率扫描开始时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepCurrentSource"
msgid "Duration of frequency sweep"
msgstr "频率扫描持续时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepCurrentSource"
msgid "RMS current of the source"
msgstr "源的有效值电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepCurrentSource"
msgid "Phase shift of the source"
msgstr "源的相位偏移"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepCurrentSource"
msgid "Actual frequency"
msgstr "实际频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepCurrentSource"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.FrequencySweepCurrentSource"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This source provides a constant RMS phase current <code>I</code> and phase angle <code>phi</code>,\r\n"
"whereas the frequency sweeps from\r\n"
"<code>fStart</code> to <code>fStop</code> with <code>duration</code>. The frequency sweeps such\r\n"
"way that on a logarithmic frequency scale, the frequency curve appears linear.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/SinglePhase/Sources/FrequencySweepSource.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"FrequencySweepSource.png\"></div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该源提供恒定的有效值相位电流 <code>I</code> 和相位角 <code>phi</code>，而频率从\r\n"
"<code>fStart</code> 至 <code>fStop</code> 以 <code>duration</code> 的方式扫描。\r\n"
"频率以对数频率标度的方式扫描，使得频率曲线呈现为线性。</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Electrical/QuasiStatic/SinglePhase/Sources/FrequencySweepSource.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"FrequencySweepSource.png\"></div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces"
msgid "Interfaces for AC single-phase models"
msgstr "AC单相模型的接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This package contains connector specifications and partial models for more complex components.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>此包含连接器规范和更复杂组件的部分模型。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.Pin"
msgid "Quasi-static single-phase pin"
msgstr "准静态单相引脚"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.Pin"
msgid "Complex potential at the quasi-static single-phase pin"
msgstr "准静态单相引脚处的复电位"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.Pin"
msgid "Complex current flowing into the quasi-static single-phase pin"
msgstr "流入准静态单相引脚的复电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.Pin"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The potential of this connector is the complex voltage and the flow variable is the complex current.\r\n"
"The <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.PositivePin\">positive</a> and\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.NegativePin\">negative pin</a> are\r\n"
"derived from this base connector.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.PositivePin\">PositivePin</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.NegativePin\">NegativePin</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.Plug\">Plug</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.PositivePlug\">PositivePlug</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.NegativePlug\">NegativePlug</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此连接器的电位是复电压，流变量是复电流。\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.PositivePin\">正极</a> 和\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.NegativePin\">负极</a> \r\n"
"是从此基础连接器派生出来的。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.PositivePin\">PositivePin</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.NegativePin\">NegativePin</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.Plug\">Plug</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.PositivePlug\">PositivePlug</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.NegativePlug\">NegativePlug</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.PositivePin"
msgid "Positive quasi-static single-phase pin"
msgstr "正交流单相接线针脚"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.PositivePin"
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "参考"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.PositivePin"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The positive pin is based on <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.Pin\">Pin</a>.\r\n"
"Additionally the reference angle is specified in the connector. The time derivative of the reference angle is the actual angular velocity of the quasi-static voltage and current. The symbol is also designed such way to look different than the <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.NegativePin\">negative pin</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.Pin\">Pin</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.NegativePin\">NegativePin</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.Plug\">Plug</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.PositivePlug\">PositivePlug</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.NegativePlug\">NegativePlug</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"正极针脚基于<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.Pin\">Pin</a>。\r\n"
"此外，在连接器中指定了参考角度。参考角度的时间导数即为准静态电压和电流的实际角速度。该符号的设计也与<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.NegativePin\">负极针脚</a>不同。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.Pin\">Pin</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.NegativePin\">NegativePin</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.Plug\">Plug</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.PositivePlug\">PositivePlug</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.NegativePlug\">NegativePlug</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.NegativePin"
msgid "Negative quasi-static single-phase pin"
msgstr "负准静态单相引脚"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.NegativePin"
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "参考角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.NegativePin"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The negative pin is based on <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.Pin\">Pin</a>.\r\n"
"Additionally the reference angle is specified in the connector. The time derivative of the reference angle is the actual angular velocity of the quasi-static voltage and current. The symbol is also designed such way to look different than the <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.PositivePin\">positive pin</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.Pin\">Pin</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.PositivePin\">PositivePin</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.Plug\">Plug</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.PositivePlug\">PositivePlug</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.NegativePlug\">NegativePlug</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"负极是基于<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.Pin\">Pin</a>。\r\n"
"此外，连接器中指定了参考角度。参考角度的时间导数是准静态电压和电流的实际角速度。符号也设计成与<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.PositivePin\">正极引脚</a>不同。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.Pin\">Pin</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.PositivePin\">PositivePin</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.Plug\">Plug</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.PositivePlug\">PositivePlug</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.NegativePlug\">NegativePlug</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.TwoPinElementary"
msgid "Elementary two pins with reference connection, without declaration of voltage and current"
msgstr "两引脚基本模型，带有参考连接，不声明电压和电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.TwoPinElementary"
msgid "Angular velocity of reference frame"
msgstr "参考框架的角速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.TwoPinElementary"
msgid "Positive quasi-static single-phase pin"
msgstr "正向准静态单相引脚"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.TwoPinElementary"
msgid "Negative quasi-static single-phase pin"
msgstr "负向准静态单相引脚"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.TwoPinElementary"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This partial model uses a <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.PositivePin\">positive</a>\r\n"
"and <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.NegativePin\">negative pin</a>,\r\n"
"but no complex voltage, current, power, etc. Additionally, the angular velocity of the quasi-static system\r\n"
"is explicitly defined as variable. This model is mainly intended to be used with graphical representation of user models.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
