msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Utilities"
msgid "Library with auxiliary models for testing"
msgstr "用于测试的辅助模型库"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Utilities"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This package hosts utilities for test examples of quasi-static single-phase circuits.\r\n"
"Quasi-static theory for single-phase circuits can be found in the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">references</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples\">Examples</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该包提供了用于测试准静态单相电路示例的实用工具。\r\n"
"单相电路的准静态理论可以在\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">参考文献</a>\r\n"
"中找到。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Examples\">示例</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

