msgstr "直流电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Utilities.IdealACDCConverter"
msgid "DC power"
msgstr "直流功率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Utilities.IdealACDCConverter"
msgid "DC"
msgstr "直流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Utilities.IdealACDCConverter"
msgid "QS"
msgstr "准静态"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Utilities.IdealACDCConverter"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Utilities.IdealACDCConverter"
msgid "%conversionFactor"
msgstr "%conversionFactor"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Utilities.IdealACDCConverter"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is an ideal AC DC converter, based on a power balance between QS circuit and DC side.\r\n"
"The parameter <em>conversionFactor</em> defines the ratio between averaged DC voltage and QS rms voltage.\r\n"
"Furthermore, reactive power at the QS side is set to 0.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Note</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Of course no voltage or current ripple is present, neither at the QS side nor at the DC side.\r\n"
"At the QS side, only base harmonics of voltage and current are taken into account.\r\n"
"At the DC side, only the mean of voltage and current are taken into account.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个理想的交直流变换器，基于准静态电路和直流侧之间的功率平衡。\r\n"
"参数 <em>conversionFactor</em> 定义了平均直流电压和准静态有效值电压之间的比值。\r\n"
"此外，准静态侧的无功功率被设定为零。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>注意</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"当然，准静态侧和直流侧都没有电压或电流纹波。\r\n"
"在准静态侧，仅考虑了电压和电流的基波。\r\n"
"在直流侧，仅考虑了电压和电流的平均值。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

