"This is a so called Graetz-bridge, a single-phase rectifier built from 4 diodes.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个所谓的格雷茨桥，由4个二极管构成的单相整流器。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Machines"
msgid "Quasi-static machine models"
msgstr "准静态机器模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Machines"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p><strong>For a discrimination of various machine models, see <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.UsersGuide.Discrimination\">discrimination</a></strong>.</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Copyright &copy; 1998-2020, Modelica Association and contributors\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>This package hosts models for quasi-static induction machines and transformers.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Note</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Quasi-static DC machines are still operated with Dc voltage and current, whereas the quasi-static induction machines and transformers\r\n"
"are operated with sinusoidal voltages and currents represented by time phasors. Quasi-static theory can be found in the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">references</a>.\r\n"
"Quasi-static DC machine models therefore are part of the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.QuasiStaticDCMachines\">machines library</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p><strong>要区分各种机器模型，请参见<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.UsersGuide.Discrimination\">区分</a></strong>。</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"版权 &copy; 1998-2020，Modelica Association 和贡献者\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>此包包含准静态感应机和变压器模型。</p>\r\n"
"<h4>注意</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"准静态直流机仍使用直流电压和电流进行操作，而准静态感应机和变压器\r\n"
"使用由时间相量表示的正弦电压和电流进行操作。 准静态理论可以在\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">参考文献</a> 中找到。\r\n"
"因此，准静态直流机模型是\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Machines.BasicMachines.QuasiStaticDCMachines\">机器库</a>\r\n"
"的一部分。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

