msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase"
msgid "Polyphase AC components"
msgstr "多相交流组件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This package hosts models for quasi-static polyphase circuits.\r\n"
"Quasi-static theory can be found in\r\n"
"[<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">Vaske1973</a>]\r\n"
"and other\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">references</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase\">SinglePhase</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该包含了准静态多相电路的模型。\r\n"
"关于准静态理论的信息可以在\r\n"
"[<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">Vaske1973</a>]\r\n"
"以及其他\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.UsersGuide.References\">参考资料</a>\r\n"
"中找到。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase\">SinglePhase</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples"
msgid "Test examples"
msgstr "测试示例"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Examples to demonstrate the usage of quasi-static electric components.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"用于演示准静态电气组件的使用示例。\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingStar"
msgid "Balancing an unsymmetrical star-connected load"
msgstr "平衡非对称星形连接负载"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingStar"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingStar"
msgid "Source Voltage"
msgstr "电源电压"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingStar"
msgid "Source frequency"
msgstr "电源频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingStar"
msgid "Load resistance"
msgstr "负载电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingStar"
msgid "Load inductance"
msgstr "负载电感"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingStar"
msgid "Load capacitance"
msgstr "负载电容"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingStar"
msgid "Phase currents"
msgstr "相电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingStar"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For the unsymmetrical load (resistor, capacitor and inductor) the parameters inductance L and capacitance C\r\n"
"are chosen such way that the neutral current (see currentSensor0) is zero.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"P.Vaske, Berechnung von Drehstromschaltungen (German, Calculation of polyphase circuits), Teubner 1973, page 42, example 18\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"对于非对称负载（电阻、电容和电感），电感L和电容C的参数选择使得中性电流（参见currentSensor0）为零。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"P.Vaske，Berechnung von Drehstromschaltungen（德语，多相电路的计算），Teubner 1973年，第42页，例18\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingDelta"
msgid "Balancing an unsymmetrical delta-connected load"
msgstr "平衡非对称三角形连接负载"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingDelta"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingDelta"
msgid "Source voltage line-to-line"
msgstr "源电压线对线"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingDelta"
msgid "Source frequency"
msgstr "源频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingDelta"
msgid "Load resistance"
msgstr "负载电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingDelta"
msgid "Load inductance"
msgstr "负载电感"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingDelta"
msgid "Load capacitance"
msgstr "负载电容"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingDelta"
msgid "Phase currents"
msgstr "相电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.BalancingDelta"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For the unsymmetrical load (resistor, capacitor and inductor) the parameters inductance L and capacitance C\r\n"
"are chosen such way that the magnitudes of the three-phase currents (see currentSensor12, currentSensor23, currentSensor31) are equal.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"P.Vaske, Berechnung von Drehstromschaltungen (German, Calculation of polyphase circuits), Teubner 1973, page 43, example 23\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"对于非对称负载（电阻、电容和电感），电感L和电容C的参数选择使得三相电流的幅值相等（参见currentSensor12、currentSensor23、currentSensor31）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"P.Vaske，Berechnung von Drehstromschaltungen（德语，多相电路的计算），Teubner 1973年，第43页，例23\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.UnsymmetricalLoad"
