msgid "With neutral, neutral current"
msgstr "带中性，中性电流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.UnsymmetricalLoad"
msgid "Without neutral, direct component"
msgstr "无中性，直流分量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.UnsymmetricalLoad"
msgid "Without neutral, inverse component"
msgstr "无中性，反向分量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.UnsymmetricalLoad"
msgid "Without neutral, zero component"
msgstr "无中性，零分量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.UnsymmetricalLoad"
msgid "Without neutral, neutral voltage"
msgstr "无中性，中性电压"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.UnsymmetricalLoad"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This example shows an unsymmetrical load, in the upper with neutral connection (the single-phase current sensor measures the neutral current) and in the lower without neutral connection (the single-phase voltage sensor measures the neutral displacement).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个例子展示了一个非对称负载，在上面是带中性连接（单相电流传感器测量中性电流），在下面是没有中性连接（单相电压传感器测量中性位移）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

