msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Examples.TestSensors"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Test quasi-static polyphase sensors: A sinusoidal source feeds a load consisting of resistor and inductor.\r\n"
