msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic.MultiStarResistance"
msgid "Resistance connection of star points"
msgstr "星形的电阻连接"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic.MultiStarResistance"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic.MultiStarResistance"
msgid "Number of symmetric base systems"
msgstr "对称基础系统的数量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic.MultiStarResistance"
msgid "Insulation resistance between base systems"
msgstr "基础系统之间的绝缘电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic.MultiStarResistance"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic.MultiStarResistance"
msgid "R=%R"
msgstr "R=%R"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic.MultiStarResistance"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Multi star points are connected by resistors. This model is required to operate polyphase systems with even phase numbers to avoid ideal connections of start points of base systems; see\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FundamentalWave.UsersGuide.Polyphase\">polyphase guidelines</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"星型点通过电阻连接。该模型用于操作偶数相数的多相系统，以避免基础系统星点的理想连接；请参阅<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FundamentalWave.UsersGuide.Polyphase\">多相指南</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

