msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Functions.quasiRMS"
msgid "Overall quasi-RMS value of complex input (current or voltage)"
msgstr "复数输入（电流或电压）的整体准有效值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Functions.quasiRMS"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Functions.quasiRMS"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"  This function determines the continuous quasi <a href=\"Modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Math.RootMeanSquare\">RMS</a> value of a polyphase system,\r\n"
"  represented by m quasi-static time domain phasors.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"  此函数确定多相系统的连续准 <a href=\"Modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Math.RootMeanSquare\">有效值</a>，由 m 个准静态时域相量表示。\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Functions.activePower"
msgid "Calculate active power of complex input voltage and current"
msgstr "计算复数输入电压和电流的有功功率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Functions.activePower"
msgid "QuasiStatic voltage phasors"
msgstr "准静态电压相量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Functions.activePower"
msgid "QuasiStatic current phasors"
msgstr "准静态电流相量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Functions.activePower"
msgid "Active power"
msgstr "有功功率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Functions.activePower"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Calculates instantaneous power from polyphase voltages and currents.\r\n"
"In quasi-static operation, instantaneous power equals active power;\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"从多相电压和电流计算瞬时功率。\r\n"
"在准静态运行中，瞬时功率等于有功功率；\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks"
msgid "Blocks for quasi-static polyphase systems"
msgstr "用于准静态多相系统的模块"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.QuasiRMS"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.QuasiRMS"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This block determines the continuous quasi <a href=\"Modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Math.RootMeanSquare\">RMS</a> value of a polyphase system, representing an equivalent RMS vector or phasor.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = sqrt(sum(u[k]^2 for k in 1:m)/m)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模块确定多相系统的连续准静态 <a href=\"Modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Math.RootMeanSquare\">RMS</a> 值，表示等效的 RMS 矢量或相量。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = sqrt(sum(u[k]^2 for k in 1:m)/m)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.SymmetricalComponents"
msgid "Creates symmetrical components from signals representing quasi-static phasors"
msgstr "从表示准静态相量的信号创建对称分量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.SymmetricalComponents"
msgid "Number of phases"
msgstr "相数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.SymmetricalComponents"
msgid "Absolute of input"
msgstr "输入的绝对值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.SymmetricalComponents"
msgid "Argument of input"
msgstr "输入的参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.SymmetricalComponents"
msgid "Absolute of output"
msgstr "输出的绝对值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.SymmetricalComponents"
msgid "Argument of output"
msgstr "输出的参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.SymmetricalComponents"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Calculates the symmetric components according to Charles L. Fortescue from the time phasors.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.UsersGuide.PhaseOrientation\">User's guide</a> on symmetrical components and orientation.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"根据 Charles L. Fortescue 从时间相量计算对称分量。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.UsersGuide.PhaseOrientation\">用户指南</a> 有关对称分量和方向的信息。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

