"（默认为<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Functions.symmetricOrientation\">-symmetricOrientation</a>）。\r\n"
"使用了 <em>m</em> 个<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sources.VoltageSource\">单相VoltageSources</a>。\r\n"
