msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Examples.Graetz"
msgid "Graetz rectifier circuit"
msgstr "Graetz整流器电路"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Examples.Graetz"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The Graetz rectifier circuit is to show the behaviour of diodes.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Simulator until 0.025 s. Then display the input voltage vsin.p.v. The rout.p.v voltage is the rectified voltage result, which is pulsing mostly in the positive range.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Graetz整流器电路用于展示二极管的工作行为。</p>\r\n"
"<p>该示例的仿真时长为0.025秒。然后在特定界面会显示输入电压vsin.p.v的图像。rout.p.v电压是整流后的结果，大部分情况下处于正范围内脉动。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

