msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Examples.Oscillator"
msgid "Oscillator circuit"
msgstr "振荡器电路"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Examples.Oscillator"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The oscillator circuit demonstrates the usage of BJT transistors.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Simulate until 0.025 s. Display v.p.v, which is rising until 5 V. Furthermore display r4.p.v, which starts oscillating.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>振荡器电路演示了BJT晶体管的使用。</p>\r\n"
"<p>示例的仿真时长为0.025秒。在特定界面用户可以观察到v.p.v的数值上升到5V。此外，用户还能观察到r4.p.v在仿真启动后它开始振荡。</p>\r\n"
