"<p>This Package contains the basic components of the SPICE3 models. The first letter of the name of the component shows the SPICE name, e.g., <strong>R</strong>_Resistor: <strong>R</strong> is the SPICE-name of the component resistor which is used in SPICE-Netlists.</p>\r\n"
