msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.C_Capacitor"
msgid "Ideal linear electrical capacitor"
msgstr "理想线性电容"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.C_Capacitor"
msgid "Capacitance"
msgstr "电容"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.C_Capacitor"
msgid "Initial value of voltage"
msgstr "电压的初始值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.C_Capacitor"
msgid "Use initial conditions: true, if initial condition is used"
msgstr "使用初始条件：如果使用初始条件，则为true"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.C_Capacitor"
msgid "Capacitor voltage"
msgstr "电容器电压"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.C_Capacitor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The linear capacitor connects the branch voltage <em>v</em> with the\r\n"
"branch current <em>i</em> by <em>i = C * dv/dt</em>.\r\n"
"The Capacitance <em>C</em> is allowed to be positive, zero, or negative.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"理想电容器通过<em>i=C*dv/dt</em> 将分支电压<em>v</em>与分支电流<em>i</em>连接起来。\r\n"
"电容<em>C</em>允许为正、零或负。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.C_Capacitor"
msgid "C=%C"
msgstr "C=%C"

