msgstr "使用初始条件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.L_Inductor"
msgid "Pin to couple inductances"
msgstr "用于耦合电感的引脚"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.L_Inductor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The linear inductor connects the branch voltage <em>v</em> with the branch current <em>i</em> by <em>v = L * di/dt</em>. The inductance <em>L</em> is allowed to be positive, zero, or negative.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>理想电感器通过<em>v=L*di/dt</em> 将分支电压<em>v</em>与分支电流<em>i</em>连接起来。电感<em>L</em>允许为正、零或负。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

