msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.K_CoupledInductors"
msgid "k=%k"
msgstr "k=%k"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.K_CoupledInductors"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<code>K_CoupledInductors</code> is a component that allows the coupling of two inductors.\r\n"
"<code>k</code> is the coefficient of coupling which must be in range [0,1].\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The usage is demonstrated in the example <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Examples.CoupledInductors\">CoupledInductors</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<code>K_CoupledInductors</code>是一个允许两个电感进行耦合的组件。<code>k</code>是耦合系数，必须在[0,1]范围内。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该使用方法在示例<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Examples.CoupledInductors\">CoupledInductors</a>中演示。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.E_VCV"
msgid "Linear voltage-controlled voltage source"
msgstr "线性电压控制电压源"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.E_VCV"
msgid "Voltage gain"
msgstr "电压增益"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.E_VCV"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The linear voltage-controlled voltage source is a TwoPort.\r\n"
"The right port voltage at pin p2 (=p2.v) is controlled by the left port voltage at pin p1 (=p1.v)\r\n"
"via\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"p2.v = p1.v * gain.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The left port current is zero. Any voltage gain can be chosen.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The corresponding SPICE description\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Ename N+ N- NC+ NC- VALUE\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>is translated to Modelica:</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Ename -> Spice3.Basic.E_VCV Ename\r\n"
"(Ename is the name of the Modelica instance)\r\n"
"N+ -> p2.v\r\n"
"N- -> n2.v\r\n"
"NC+ -> p1.v\r\n"
"NC- -> n1.v\r\n"
"VALUE -> gain\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"线性电压控制电压源是一个双端口模型。\r\n"
"通过以下公式，端口2(p2.v)的右端口电压由端口1(p1.v)的左端口电压控制：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"p2.v=p1.v*gain。\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"左端口电流为零。可以选择任何电压增益。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"对应的SPICE描述\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Ename N+ N- NC+ NC- VALUE\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>在Modelica中的翻译：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Ename -> Spice3.Basic.E_VCV Ename\r\n"
"(Ename是Modelica实例的名称)\r\n"
"N+ -> p2.v\r\n"
"N- -> n2.v\r\n"
"NC+ -> p1.v\r\n"
"NC- -> n1.v\r\n"
"VALUE -> gain\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.E_VCV"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.G_VCC"
msgid "Linear voltage-controlled current source"
msgstr "线性电压控制电流源"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.G_VCC"
msgid "Transconductance"
msgstr "传导电导"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.G_VCC"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The linear voltage-controlled current source is a TwoPort.\r\n"
"The right port current at pin p2 (=p2.i) is controlled by the left port voltage at pin p1 (p1.v)\r\n"
"via\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"p2.i = p1.v * transConductance.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The left port current is zero. Any transConductance can be chosen.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"The corresponding SPICE description\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Gname N+ N- NC+ NC- VALUE\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>is translated to Modelica:</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Gname -> Spice3.Basic.G_VCC Gname\r\n"
"(Gname is the name of the Modelica instance)\r\n"
"N+ -> p2.i\r\n"
"N- -> n2.i\r\n"
"NC+ -> p1 .v\r\n"
"NC- -> n1.v\r\n"
"VALUE -> transConductance\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>线性电压控制电流源是一个双端口模型。</p>\r\n"
"<p>通过以下公式，端口2(p2.i)的右端口电流由端口1(p1.v)的左端口电压控制：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"p2.i=p1.v*transConductance。\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>左端口电流为零。可以选择任何传导电导。</p>\r\n"
"<p>对应的SPICE描述：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Gname N+ N- NC+ NC- VALUE\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>在Modelica中的翻译：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Gname->Spice3.Basic.G_VCC Gname\r\n"
"(Gname是Modelica实例的名称)\r\n"
"N+ -> p2.i\r\n"
"N- -> n2.i\r\n"
"NC+ -> p1 .v\r\n"
"NC- -> n1.v\r\n"
"VALUE->transConductance\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.G_VCC"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.H_CCV"
msgid "Linear current-controlled voltage source"
msgstr "线性电流控制电压源"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.H_CCV"
msgid "Transresistance"
msgstr "传导电阻"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.H_CCV"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The linear current-controlled voltage source is a TwoPort. The &quot;right&quot; port voltage at pin 2 (=p2.v) is controlled by the &quot;left&quot; port current at pin p1(=p1.i) via</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"p2.v = p1.i * transResistance.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>The controlling port voltage is zero. Any transResistance can be chosen.\r\n"
"The corresponding SPICE description</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Hname N+ N- VNAM VALUE\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>is translated to Modelica:</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Hname -&gt; Spice3.Basic.H_CCV Hname\r\n"
"(Hname is the name of the Modelica instance)\r\n"
"N+ -&gt; p2.v\r\n"
"N- -&gt; n2.v\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>The voltage source VNAM has the two nodes NV+ and NV-:</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"VNAM VN+ VN- VALUE_V\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>The current through VNAM hast to be led through the CCV.\r\n"
"Therefore VNAM has to be disconnected and an additional\r\n"
"node NV_AD has to be added.</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"NV_AD -&gt; p1.i\r\n"
"NV- -&gt; n1.i\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>On this way the current, that flows through the voltage source VNAM, flows through the CCV.</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"VALUE -&gt; transResistance\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>线性电流控制电压源是一个双端口模型。通过以下公式，端口2(p2.v)的电压由端口1(p1.i)的电流控制：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"p2.v=p1.i*transResistance。\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>控制端口的电压为零。可以选择任何传导电阻。</p>\r\n"
"<p>对应的SPICE描述：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Hname N+ N- VNAM VALUE\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>在Modelica中的翻译：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Hname -&gt; Spice3.Basic.H_CCV Hname\r\n"
"(Hname是Modelica实例的名称)\r\n"
"N+-&gt;p2.v\r\n"
"N--&gt;n2.v\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>电压源VNAM有两个节点NV+和NV-：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"VNAM VN+ VN- VALUE_V\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>通过 VNAM的电流必须通过CCV。</p>\r\n"
"<p>因此，必须断开VNAM 并添加一个额外的节点NV_AD。</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"NV_AD-&gt;p1.i\r\n"
"NV--&gt;n1.i\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>通过这种方式，通过电压源VNAM流动的电流通过CCV。</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"VALUE-&gt;transResistance\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

