msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Basic.F_CCC"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The linear current-controlled current source is a TwoPort. The &quot;right&quot; port current at pin 2 (=p2.i) is controlled by the &quot;left&quot; port current at pin p1(=p1.i) via</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"p2.i = p1.i * gain.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>The controlling port voltage is zero. Any current gain can be chosen.</p>\r\n"
"<p>The corresponding SPICE description</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Fname N+ N- VNAM VALUE\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>is translated to Modelica:</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Fname -&gt; Spice3.Basic.F_CCC Fname\r\n"
"(Fname is the name of the Modelica instance)\r\n"
"N+ -&gt; p2.i\r\n"
"N- -&gt; n2.i\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>The voltage source VNAM has the two nodes NV+ and NV-:</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"VNAM NV+ NV- VALUE_V\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>The current through VNAM hast to be led through the CCC.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Therefore VNAM has to be disconnected and an additional</p>\r\n"
"<p>node NV_AD has to be added.</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"NV_AD -&gt; p1.i\r\n"
"NV- -&gt; n1.i\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>On this way the current, that flows through the voltage source VNAM, flows through the CCC.</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"VALUE -&gt; gain\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>线性电流控制电流源是一个双端口模型。通过以下公式，端口2(p2.i)的电流由端口1(p1.i)的电流控制：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"p2.i=p1.i*gain。\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>控制端口的电压为零。可以选择任何电流增益。</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>对应的SPICE 描述：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Fname N+ N- VNAM VALUE\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>在 Modelica中的翻译：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Fname-&gt;Spice3.Basic.F_CCC Fname\r\n"
"(Fname是Modelica实例的名称)\r\n"
"N+ -&gt; p2.i\r\n"
"N- -&gt; n2.i\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>电压源VNAM有两个节点NV+和NV-：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"VNAM NV+ NV- VALUE_V\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>通过VNAM的电流必须通过CCC。</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>因此，必须断开VNAM并添加一个额外的节点NV_AD。</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"NV_AD -&gt; p1.i\r\n"
"NV- -&gt; n1.i\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>通过这种方式，通过电压源VNAM流动的电流通过CCC。</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"VALUE -&gt; gain\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

