msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Sources.I_pulse"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Periodic pulse source with not limited number of periods.</p>\r\n"
"<p>A single pulse is described by the following table:</p>\r\n"
"<table cellspacing=\"2\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\r\n"
"<td><h4>time</h4></td>\r\n"
"<td><h4>value</h4></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>0</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>I1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TD</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>I1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TD+TR</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>I2</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TD+TR+PW</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>I2</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TD+TR+PW+TF</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>I1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TSTOP</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>I1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>Intermediate points are determined by linear interpolation.</p>\r\n"
"<p>A pulse it looks like a saw tooth, use this parameters e.g.:</p>\r\n"
"<table cellspacing=\"2\" cellpadding=\"2\" border=\"1\"><tr>\r\n"
"<td><h4>Parameter</h4></td>\r\n"
"<td><h4>Value</h4></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>I1</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>0</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>I2</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TD</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>0</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TR</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TF</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>PW</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>2</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>PER</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<h4>Note</h4>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>All parameters of sources should be set explicitly.</li>\r\n"
"<li>since TSTEP and TSTOP are not available for modeling in Modelica, differences to SPICE may occur if not all parameters are set.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>具有不受限制的周期数量的周期性脉冲源。</p>\r\n"
"<p>单个脉冲由以下表格描述：</p>\r\n"
"<table cellspacing=\"2\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\r\n"
"<td><h4>时间</h4></td>\r\n"
"<td><h4>值</h4></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>0</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>I1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TD</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>I1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TD+TR</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>I2</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TD+TR+PW</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>I2</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TD+TR+PW+TF</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>I1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TSTOP</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>I1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>中间点由线性插值确定。</p>\r\n"
"<p>脉冲看起来像锯齿，可以使用以下参数：</p>\r\n"
"<table cellspacing=\"2\" cellpadding=\"2\" border=\"1\"><tr>\r\n"
"<td><h4>参数</h4></td>\r\n"
"<td><h4>值</h4></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>I1</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>0</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>I2</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TD</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>0</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TR</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>TF</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>PW</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>2</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><p>PER</p></td>\r\n"
"<td><p>1</p></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<h4>注意</h4>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>所有源的参数都应明确设置。</li>\r\n"
"<li>由于Modelica中没有TSTEP和TSTOP的建模，如果没有设置所有参数，则可能与SPICE有所不同。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Sources.I_pwl"
