msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.ReleaseNotes"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Version 3.2.2, 2014-12-05 (Johannes&nbsp;Ziske, Thomas&nbsp;B&ouml;drich)</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Added package <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Hysteresis\">FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Hysteresis</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Added package <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Examples.Hysteresis\">FluxTubes.Examples.Hysteresis</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Added package <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Shapes.HysteresisAndMagnets\">FluxTubes.Shapes.HysteresisAndMagnets</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Added package <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Material.HysteresisEverettParameter\">FluxTubes.Material.HysteresisEverettParameter</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Added package <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Material.HysteresisTableData\">FluxTubes.Material.HysteresisTableData</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Updated <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.BaseClasses.FixedShape\">FluxTubes.BaseClasses.FixedShape</a> for differentiability</li>\r\n"
"<li>Updated <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Literature\">FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Literature</a></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Version 3.2.2, 2014-01-15 (Christian&nbsp;Kral)</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Added constant\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Basic.ConstantPermeance\">permeance model</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Added\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.GenericFluxTube\">GenericFluxTube</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Added parameter <code>useConductance</code> including alternative parameterization in\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Basic.EddyCurrent\">EddyCurrent</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Added\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Basic.Idle\">Idle</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Added\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Basic.Short\">Short</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>Added\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Basic.Crossing\">Crossing</a></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Version 1.5, 2013-01-04 (Martin&nbsp;Otter, Thomas&nbsp;B&ouml;drich, Johannes&nbsp;Ziske)</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Added missing initial conditions</li>\r\n"
"<li>Fixed initial parameter values</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Version 1.4, 2011-08-01 (Thomas&nbsp;B&ouml;drich)</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>MagneticPort declared with MagneticPotential instead of MagneticPotentialDifference</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Version 1.3, 2010-04-22 (Christian&nbsp;Kral)</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Added conditional heat port to EddyCurrent model</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Version 1.2, 2009-08-11 (Christian&nbsp;Kral, Anton&nbsp;Haumer, Thomas&nbsp;B&ouml;drich, Martin&nbsp;Otter)</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Update and improvement for inclusion in the\r\n"
"    Modelica Standard Library</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Version 1.1, 2009-05-19 (Thomas&nbsp;B&ouml;drich)</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Coupling coefficient in Basic.ElectroMagneticConverter removed</li>\r\n"
"<li>Basic.EddyCurrent added</li>\r\n"
"<li>Example MovingCoilActuator, especially PermeanceModel, completely revised</li>\r\n"
"<li>Leakage coefficient replaced by coupling coefficient in Basic.LeakageWithCoefficient</li>\r\n"
"<li>Utilities.CoilDesign: parameter U renamed to V_op,CoilDesign moved to Utilities.</li>\r\n"
"<li>Reference direction for magnetic flux added in all sources</li>\r\n"
"<li>degC replaced by K for compatibility with Modelica 3.0</li>\r\n"
"<li>redeclare in Sensors for compatibility with Modelica 3.0 removed</li>\r\n"
"<li>Partial flux tube components moved to Interfaces and basic elements moved to new package Basic</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>Version 1,0, 2007-10-11 (Thomas&nbsp;B&ouml;drich)</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Release of version 1.0 of the library</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>2005 (Thomas&nbsp;B&ouml;drich)</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>First release of a Modelica magnetic library</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>版本3.2.2, 2014-12-05 (Johannes&nbsp;Ziske, Thomas&nbsp;B&ouml;drich)</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>添加软件包 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Hysteresis\">FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Hysteresis</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>添加软件包 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Examples.Hysteresis\">FluxTubes.Examples.Hysteresis</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>添加软件包 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Shapes.HysteresisAndMagnets\">FluxTubes.Shapes.HysteresisAndMagnets</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>添加软件包 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Material.HysteresisEverettParameter\">FluxTubes.Material.HysteresisEverettParameter</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>添加软件包 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Material.HysteresisTableData\">FluxTubes.Material.HysteresisTableData</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>更新 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.BaseClasses.FixedShape\">FluxTubes.BaseClasses.FixedShape</a> for differentiability</li>\r\n"
"<li>更新 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Literature\">FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Literature</a></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>版本3.2.2, 2014-01-15 (Christian&nbsp;Kral)</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>添加常数\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Basic.ConstantPermeance\">permeance model</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>添加\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.GenericFluxTube\">GenericFluxTube</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>添加参数 <code>useConductance</code> including alternative parameterization in\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Basic.EddyCurrent\">EddyCurrent</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>添加\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Basic.Idle\">Idle</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>添加\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Basic.Short\">Short</a></li>\r\n"
"<li>添加\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Basic.Crossing\">Crossing</a></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>版本1.5, 2013-01-04 (Martin&nbsp;Otter, Thomas&nbsp;B&ouml;drich, Johannes&nbsp;Ziske)</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>添加了缺失的初始条件</li>\r\n"
"<li>固定初始参数值</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>版本1.4, 2011-08-01 (Thomas&nbsp;B&ouml;drich)</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>用 MagneticPotential 代替 MagneticPotentialDifference 声明的 MagneticPort</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>版本1.3, 2010-04-22 (Christian&nbsp;Kral)</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>为涡流模型添加了条件热端口</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>版本1.2, 2009-08-11 (Christian&nbsp;Kral, Anton&nbsp;Haumer, Thomas&nbsp;B&ouml;drich, Martin&nbsp;Otter)</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>更新和改进，以便纳入\r\n"
"    Modelica模型标准库</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>版本1.1, 2009-05-19 (Thomas&nbsp;B&ouml;drich)</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>移除 Basic.ElectroMagneticConverter 中的耦合系数</li>\r\n"
"<li>添加了 Basic.EddyCurrent</li>\r\n"
"<li>移动线圈执行器示例，特别是 PermeanceModel，全面修订</li>\r\n"
"<li>在 Basic.LeakageWithCoefficient 中用耦合系数代替泄漏系数</li>\r\n"
"<li>实用程序.线圈设计：参数 U 更名为 V_op，线圈设计移至实用程序.</li>\r\n"
"<li>所有信号源中添加的磁通量的参考方向</li>\r\n"
"<li>为与 Modelica 3.0 兼容，用 K 取代 degC</li>\r\n"
"<li>为与 Modelica 3.0 兼容，删除了传感器中的重新声明</li>\r\n"
"<li>部分通量管元件移至接口，基本元件移至新软件包 Basic</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>版本1,0, 2007-10-11 (Thomas&nbsp;B&ouml;drich)</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>发布模型库1.0版本</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h5>2005 (Thomas&nbsp;B&ouml;drich)</h5>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>首次发布Modelica磁性库</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

