"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://www.ifte.de/mitarbeiter/ziske.html\"><strong>Johannes Ziske</strong></a><br>\r\n"
"    Dresden University of Technology<br>\r\n"
"    Institute of Electromechanical and Electronic Design<br>\r\n"
"    01062 Dresden, Germany<br>\r\n"
