msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Material.HysteresisEverettParameter"
msgid "Parameter sets for an analytical description of the Everett function"
msgstr "埃弗雷特函数解析描述的参数集"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Material.HysteresisEverettParameter"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>These parameter records contain the parameters which adapt the analytical Everett function to a specific hysteresis shape (see <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Literature\">[YUY89]</a> for a detailed description of that function). The Everett function is used to define the shape of the ferromagnetic hysteresis of the <code><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Shapes.HysteresisAndMagnets.GenericHystTellinenEverett\">GenericHystTellinenEverett</a></code> and the <code><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Shapes.HysteresisAndMagnets.GenericHystPreisachEverett\">GenericHystPreisachEverett</a></code> flux tube elements.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>这些参数记录包含使分析埃弗雷特函数适应特定迟滞形状的参数\r\n"
"(参见<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Literature\">[YUY89]</a>查看该函数的详细描述)。Everett函数用于定义<code><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Shapes.HysteresisAndMagnets.GenericHystTellinenEverett\">GenericHystTellinenEverett</a></code> 和 <code><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Shapes.HysteresisAndMagnets.GenericHystPreisachEverett\">GenericHystPreisachEverett</a></code>。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

