msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.FundamentalWave.Examples.BasicMachines.InductionMachines.IMC_Steinmetz"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>At start time tStart single-phase voltage is supplied to the induction machine with squirrel cage;\r\n"
"the machine starts from standstill, accelerating inertias against load torque quadratic dependent on speed,\r\n"
"finally reaching nominal speed.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Default machine parameters are used.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>在启动时间tStart，给带鼠笼的感应电机提供单相电压;\r\n"
"机器从静止状态开始，加速惯量对负载转矩的二次依赖于速度，\r\n"
"最终达到公称速度.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>使用默认机器参数。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

