msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.FundamentalWave.Examples.BasicMachines.InductionMachines.IMC_Initialize"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The induction machine with squirrel cage is initialized in steady-state at no-load;\r\n"
"at time tStart a load torque step is applied.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Simulate for 1.5 seconds and plot (versus time):</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>currentQuasiRMSSensor.I: stator current RMS</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.wMechanical: motor's speed</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.tauElectrical: motor's torque</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Default machine parameters are used.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"带鼠笼的感应电机在空载时进行稳态初始化；\r\n"
"在 tStart 时刻施加负载转矩阶跃.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>模拟 1.5 秒并绘制（与时间的关系）曲线:</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>currentQuasiRMSSensor.I: 定子电流有效值</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.wMechanical: 电机转速</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.tauElectrical: 电机扭矩</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>使用默认机器参数.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

