"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortExtended\">TwoPortExtended</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这种磁性双端口元件只由a组成\r\n"
