msgstr "轴向长度(磁通方向)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderAxialFlux"
msgid "Fixed geometry"
msgstr "Fixed geometry"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderAxialFlux"
msgid "Inner radius of hollow cylinder (zero for cylinder)"
msgstr "空心气缸内半径(气缸为零)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderAxialFlux"
msgid "Outer radius of (hollow) cylinder"
msgstr "(空心)圆柱体的外半径"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderAxialFlux"
msgid "Central angle"
msgstr "中央角"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderAxialFlux"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The axial cylinder models is characterized by the outer diameter, <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/r_o.png\"/>, the inner diameter, <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/r_i.png\"/>, length, <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/l.png\"/>. The magnetic reluctance is determined by:</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/R_m_cuboid.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"<p>The area of cross section yields:</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/A_axial.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/HollowCylinderAxialFlux_qs.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"<p>A hollow cylinder is depicted in the above figure left for <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/alpha2pi.png\"/>. A solid cylindric flux tube an be considered by setting the inner radius, <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/r_i.png\"/>, equal to zero.</p>\r\n"
"<p>A circular sector of the area of cross section with central angle <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/alpha.png\"/> is depicted in the above figure right.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>轴向圆柱模型的特征是外径<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/r_o.png\"/>，内径<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/r_i.png\"/>，长度<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/l.png\"/>。磁阻由:</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/R_m_cuboid.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"<p>横截面面积为:</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/A_axial.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/HollowCylinderAxialFlux_qs.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"<p>左图<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/alpha2pi.png\"/>显示了一个空心圆柱体。可以通过设置内半径<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/r_i.png\"/>等于零来考虑固体圆柱形磁通管.</p>\r\n"
"<p>右上图描绘了圆心角<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/alpha.png\"/>的横截面面积的圆形扇形.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderRadialFlux"
msgid "Hollow cylinder with radial flux of fixed shape and linear material characteristics"
msgstr "具有固定形状径向通量和线性材料特性的空心圆筒"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderRadialFlux"
msgid "Width (orthogonal to flux direction)"
msgstr "宽度（与通量方向正交）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderRadialFlux"
msgid "Fixed geometry"
msgstr "Fixed geometry"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderRadialFlux"
msgid "Inner radius of hollow cylinder"
msgstr "空心圆柱体的内半径"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderRadialFlux"
msgid "Outer radius of hollow cylinder"
msgstr "空心圆柱体外半径"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderRadialFlux"
msgid "Central angle"
msgstr "中心角"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderRadialFlux"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The radial cylinder model is characterized by the outer diameter, <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/r_o.png\"/>, the inner diameter, <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/r_i.png\"/>, length, <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/l.png\"/>, and the angle <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/alpha.png\"/>. The magnetic reluctance is determined by:</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/R_m_radial.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"<p>In this model the magnetic flux and the magnetic potential difference, respectively, are radially oriented.</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/HollowCylinderRadialFlux_qs.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"<p>The above figure left shows a radial flux cylinder with <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/alpha2pi.png\"/>. The figure on the right indicates the central angle <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/alpha.png\"/> in case a cylinder section shall be considered.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>径向圆柱体模型的特征是外径<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/r_o.png\"/>，内径<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/r_i.png\"/>，长度<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/l.png\"/>，角度<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/alpha.png\"/>。磁阻由:</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/R_m_radial.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"<p>在该模型中，磁通量和磁位差分别是径向取向的.</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/HollowCylinderRadialFlux_qs.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"<p>左上图显示了一个径向磁通圆柱体，<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/alpha2pi.png\"/>。右图表示在考虑圆柱体截面时的中心角<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/alpha.png\"/>.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderCircumferentialFlux"
msgid "Hollow cylinder with circumferential flux; fixed shape"
msgstr "带有圆周通量的空心圆柱体；固定形状"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderCircumferentialFlux"
msgid "Width (orthogonal to flux direction)"
msgstr "宽度（与通量方向正交）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderCircumferentialFlux"
msgid "Fixed geometry"
msgstr "Fixed geometry"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderCircumferentialFlux"
msgid "Inner radius of hollow cylinder"
msgstr "空心圆柱体的内半径"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderCircumferentialFlux"
msgid "Outer radius of hollow cylinder"
msgstr "空心圆柱体外半径"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderCircumferentialFlux"
msgid "Angle of cylinder section"
msgstr "气缸截面角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.HollowCylinderCircumferentialFlux"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Please refer to the enclosing sub-package <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape\">FixedShape</a> for a description of all elements of this package and to <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Literature\">[Ro41]</a> for derivation and/or coefficients of the equation for permeance <code>G_m</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For hollow cylindrical flux tubes with a circumferential magnetic flux, the flux density is a function of the radius.\r\n"
"For that reason, the characteristic <code>mu_r(B)</code> is evaluated for the flux density at the flux tube's mean radius.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For those flux tube sections of a magnetic device that have a nonlinear material characteristic <code>mu_r(B)</code> and a large aspect ratio of outer to inner radius <code>r_o/r_i</code>, the section can be split up in a series connection of several hollow cylindrical flux tubes with radial flux. This allows for more realistic modelling of the dependence of flux density on the radius compared to modelling with just one flux tube element.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请参阅所附的子包<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape\">FixedShape</a>获取此包的所有元素的描述，并查看<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide. Literature\">[Ro41]</a>为导率<code>G_m</code>方程的导数和/或系数.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"对于具有周向磁通的空心圆柱形磁通管，磁通密度是半径的函数。\r\n"
"因此，对磁通管平均半径处的磁通密度求特征<code>mu_r(B)</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"对于具有非线性材料特性<code>mu_r(B)</code>和内外半径<code>r_o/r_i</code>长径比较大的磁性器件磁通管截面，可将该截面拆分成若干个径向磁通的空心圆柱形磁通管串联连接。与仅使用一个磁通管单元进行建模相比，这样可以更真实地模拟磁通密度对半径的依赖关系.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.Toroid"
msgid "Toroid with circular cross section; fixed shape"
msgstr "具有圆形截面的环面;固定的形状"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.Toroid"
msgid "Radius of toroid (middle)"
msgstr "环面半径(中)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.Toroid"
msgid "Fixed geometry"
msgstr "Fixed geometry"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.Toroid"
msgid "Diameter of cylindrical core"
msgstr "圆柱芯直径"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.Toroid"
msgid "Angle of toroid section"
msgstr "环面截面角"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape.Toroid"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Please refer to the enclosing sub-package <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape\">FixedShape</a> for a description of all elements of this package and to <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Literature\">[Ro41]</a> for derivation and/or coefficients of the equation for permeance G_m.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For toroidal flux tubes with a circumferential magnetic flux, the flux density is a function of the radius.\r\n"
"For that reason, the characteristic <code>mu_r(B)</code> is evaluated for the flux density at the flux tube's mean radius.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For those flux tube sections of a magnetic device that have a nonlinear material characteristic <code>mu_r(B)</code> and a large aspect ratio of outer to inner radius <code>r_o/r_i</code>, the section can be split up in a series connection of several hollow cylindrical flux tubes with radial flux. This allows for more realistic modelling of the dependence of flux density on the radius compared to modelling with just one flux tube element.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请参阅所附的子包<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Shapes.FixedShape\">FixedShape</a>获取此包的所有元素的描述，并查看<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Literature\">[Ro41]</a>为渗透率G_m方程的导数和/或系数.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"对于具有环向磁通的环面磁通管，磁通密度是半径的函数。\r\n"
"因此，对磁通管平均半径处的磁通密度求特征<code>mu_r(B)</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"对于具有非线性材料特性<code>mu_r(B)</code>和内外半径<code>r_o/r_i</code>长径比较大的磁性器件磁通管截面，可将该截面拆分成若干个径向磁通的空心圆柱形磁通管串联连接。与仅使用一个磁通管单元进行建模相比，这样可以更真实地模拟磁通密度对半径的依赖关系.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.Leakage"
msgid "Leakage flux tubes with position-independent permeance and hence no force generation; mu_r=1"
msgstr "泄漏磁通管具有与位置无关的磁通，因此不产生力;mu_r = 1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.Leakage"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The permeances of all elements of this package are calculated from their geometry <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Literature\">[Ro41]</a>. These flux tube elements are intended for modelling of leakage fields through vacuum, air and other media with a relative permeability\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/mu_r-1.png\">.\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Basic.LeakageWithCoefficient\">Basic.LeakageWithCoefficient</a> accounts for leakage not by the geometry of flux tubes, but by a coupling coefficient <code>c_usefulFlux</code>.\r\n"
"</p></html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个包的所有元素的磁导率都是根据它们的几何形状计算的<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Literature\">[Ro41]</a>。这些磁通管元件用于模拟通过真空、空气和其他具有相对磁导率的介质的泄漏场\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/mu_r-1.png\">。\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Basic.LeakageWithCoefficient\">Basic. LeakageWithCoefficient</a>不是通过磁通管的几何形状来解释泄漏，而是通过耦合系数<code>c_usefulFlux</code>.\r\n"
"</p></html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.Leakage.QuarterCylinder"
msgid "Leakage flux from one edge to the opposite plane through a quarter cylinder"
msgstr "通过四分之一圆柱体从一个边缘到另一个平面的泄漏磁通量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.Leakage.QuarterCylinder"
msgid "Axial length orthogonal to flux (=2*pi*r for cylindrical pole and r>>distance between edge and plane)"
msgstr "轴向长度与通量正交(圆柱极=2*pi*r, r>>边与面之间的距离)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.Leakage.QuarterCylinder"
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parameters"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.Leakage.QuarterCylinder"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Literature\">[Ro41]</a>\r\n"
"the equations for determining the reluctance\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/R_m.png\">\r\n"
"are summarized. As an alternative to the geometry based data a\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Basic.LeakageWithCoefficient\">generic leakage</a> model is provided in this library.\r\n"
"</p></html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Literature\">[Ro41]</a>\r\n"
"确定磁阻的方程\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/R_m.png\">\r\n"
"进行了总结。作为基于几何的数据a的替代方案\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Basic. LeakageWithCoefficient\">generic leakage</a> 模型在这个库中提供.\r\n"
"</p></html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.Leakage.QuarterHollowCylinder"
msgid "Leakage flux in circumferential direction through a quarter hollow cylinder"
msgstr "通过四分之一空心圆筒圆周方向的泄漏通量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.Leakage.QuarterHollowCylinder"
msgid "Axial length orthogonal to flux (=2*pi*r for cylindrical pole and r>>r_i)"
msgstr "轴向长度与通量正交(对于圆柱极，r>>r_i =2*pi*r)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.Leakage.QuarterHollowCylinder"
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parameters"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.Leakage.QuarterHollowCylinder"
msgid "Constant ratio t/r_i"
msgstr "常数比t/r_i"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Shapes.Leakage.QuarterHollowCylinder"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Literature\">[Ro41]</a>\r\n"
"the equations for determining the reluctance\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/R_m.png\">\r\n"
"are summarized. As an alternative to the geometry based data a\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Basic.LeakageWithCoefficient\">generic leakage</a> model is provided in this library.\r\n"
"</p></html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.UsersGuide.Literature\">[Ro41]</a>\r\n"
