msgstr "磁位差路径的正极"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.FundamentalWavePermabilitySensor"
msgid "Negative port of magnetic potential difference path"
msgstr "磁位差路径的负端口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.FundamentalWavePermabilitySensor"
msgid "Fundamental wave of magnetic potential difference"
msgstr "Fundamental wave of magnetic potential difference"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.FundamentalWavePermabilitySensor"
msgid "Fundamental wave of magnetic flux"
msgstr "Fundamental wave of magnetic flux"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.FundamentalWavePermabilitySensor"
msgid "Absolute permeability"
msgstr "绝对磁导率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.FundamentalWavePermabilitySensor"
msgid "Relative permeability"
msgstr "相对渗透率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.FundamentalWavePermabilitySensor"
msgid "Determines relative and absolute permeability"
msgstr "确定相对和绝对渗透率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.FundamentalWavePermabilitySensor"
msgid "H/m"
msgstr "H/m"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.FundamentalWavePermabilitySensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This sensor is used to determined the effective fundamental wave permeability of a saturated lumped circuit reluctance. For this purpose the sensor is placed such way that the magnetic flux and the magnetic potential difference of the investigated reluctance are sensed. The area of cross section and the effective length of the investigated magnetic path have to be provided as parameters.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>See example\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Examples.NonLinearInductor\">NonLinearInductor</a>.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该传感器用于测定饱和集总电路磁阻的有效基波磁导率。为此，传感器的放置方式使所研究磁阻的磁通和磁位差被感知。所研究的磁路的截面面积和有效长度必须作为参数提供.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>看例子\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Examples.NonLinearInductor\">NonLinearInductor</a>.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.Permeability"
msgid "Determines permeability from flux and magnetic potential difference"
msgstr "通过磁通和磁位差确定磁导率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.Permeability"
msgid "Area of cross section penetrated by flux"
msgstr "被通量穿透的截面面积"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.Permeability"
msgid "Length associated with magnetic potential difference"
msgstr "与磁电位差有关的长度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.Permeability"
msgid "Magnetic flux"
msgstr "磁通"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.Permeability"
msgid "Magnetic potential difference"
msgstr "磁位差"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.Permeability"
msgid "Absolute permeability"
msgstr "绝对磁导率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.Permeability"
msgid "Relative permeability"
msgstr "相对渗透率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.Permeability"
msgid "μ"
msgstr "μ"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sensors.Transient.Permeability"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This model determines the absolute and relative permeability from two real inputs:</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>RMS magnetic potential difference,\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/realV_m.png\" alt=\"V_m\"></li>\r\n"
"<li>RMS magnetic flux,\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/realPhi.png\" alt=\"Phi\"></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>In order to calculate the permeabilities, the area of cross section,\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/A.png\" alt=\"l\">,\r\n"
"and the geometric length,\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/l.png\" alt=\"l\">,\r\n"
"of the flux path have to be take into account</p>\r\n"
"<dl><dd>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/permeabilities.png\" alt=\"Permeabilities\">\r\n"
"</dd></dl>\r\n"
"<p>In case that the magnetic potential difference is close to zero, permeabilities yield:</p>\r\n"
"<dl><dd>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/permeabilities-0.png\" alt=\"Permeabilities=0\">\r\n"
"</dd></dl>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该模型根据两个实际输入确定绝对渗透率和相对渗透率:</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>均方根磁位差,\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/realV_m.png\" alt=\"V_m\"></li>\r\n"
"<li>均方根磁通量,\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/realPhi.png\" alt=\"Phi\"></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>为了计算渗透率，计算截面面积,\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/A.png\" alt=\"l\">,\r\n"
"几何长度,\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/l.png\" alt=\"l\">,\r\n"
"必须考虑到磁通路径</p>\r\n"
"<dl><dd>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/permeabilities.png\" alt=\"Permeabilities\">\r\n"
"</dd></dl>\r\n"
"<p>在磁位差接近于零的情况下，磁导率产生:</p>\r\n"
"<dl><dd>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/QuasiStatic/FluxTubes/permeabilities-0.png\" alt=\"Permeabilities=0\">\r\n"
"</dd></dl>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources"
msgid "Sources of different complexity of magnetomotive force and magnetic flux"
msgstr "不同复杂程度的磁动势和磁通量的来源"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains sources of a magnetic potential difference or a magnetic flux:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个包包含磁位差或磁通的源:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.ConstantMagneticPotentialDifference"
msgid "Constant magnetomotive force"
msgstr "恒磁动势"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.ConstantMagneticPotentialDifference"
msgid "Frequency of the source"
msgstr "源频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.ConstantMagneticPotentialDifference"
msgid "Magnetic potential difference"
msgstr "磁位差"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.ConstantMagneticPotentialDifference"
msgid "Magnetic flux from port_p to port_n"
msgstr "从port_p到port_n的磁通量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.ConstantMagneticPotentialDifference"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This source provides a constant quasi-static magnetic potential difference <code>V_m</code> (or magnetomotive force, mmf),\r\n"
"at fixed frequency, <code>f</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该源提供恒定的准静态磁位差<code>V_m</code>(或磁动势，mmf)，\r\n"
"在固定频率下, <code>f</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.SignalMagneticPotentialDifference"
msgid "Signal-controlled magnetomotive force"
msgstr "信号控制磁动势"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.SignalMagneticPotentialDifference"
msgid "Magnetic flux from port_p to port_n"
msgstr "从port_p到port_n的磁通量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.SignalMagneticPotentialDifference"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This source provides a quasi-static magnetic potential difference <code>V_m</code> (or magnetomotive force, mmf)\r\n"
"with signal inputs for:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Complex magnetic potential difference, <code>V_m</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>Frequency <code>f</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个源提供了一个准静态磁位差<code>V_m</code>(或磁动势，mmf)\r\n"
"有信号输入:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>复磁位差，<code>V_m</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>频率 <code>f</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.ConstantMagneticFlux"
msgid "Source of constant magnetic flux"
msgstr "恒定磁通的来源"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.ConstantMagneticFlux"
msgid "Frequency of the source"
msgstr "源频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.ConstantMagneticFlux"
msgid "Magnetic potential difference between both ports"
msgstr "两个端口之间的磁电位差"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.ConstantMagneticFlux"
msgid "Magnetic flux"
msgstr "磁通"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.ConstantMagneticFlux"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This source provides a constant quasi-static magnetic flux <code>Phi</code> at fixed frequency, <code>f</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该源在固定频率下提供恒定的准静态磁通量<code>Phi</code>， <code>f</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.SignalMagneticFlux"
msgid "Signal-controlled magnetic flux source"
msgstr "信号控制磁通源"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.SignalMagneticFlux"
msgid "Magnetic potential difference between both ports"
msgstr "两个端口之间的磁电位差"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Sources.SignalMagneticFlux"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This source provides a quasi-static magnetic flux with inputs for:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Complex magnetic flux, <code>Phi</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>Frequency <code>f</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该源提供一个准静态磁通，输入为:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>复磁通量, <code>Phi</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>频率 <code>f</code></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces"
msgid "Interfaces of magnetic network components"
msgstr "磁网组件接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains connectors for the magnetic domain and partial models for lumped magnetic network components.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该包包含磁性域的连接器和集总磁网络组件的部分模型.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort"
msgid "Quasi-static magnetic port"
msgstr "准静磁口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort"
msgid "Complex magnetic potential at the port"
msgstr "端口处的复磁势"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort"
msgid "Complex magnetic flux flowing into the port"
msgstr "复合磁通量流入端口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Base definition of complex quasi-static magnetic port.\r\n"
"The potential variable is the complex magnetic potential difference <code>V_m</code> and the flow variable\r\n"
"is the complex magnetic flux <code>Phi</code>.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort\">PositiveMagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort\">NegativeMagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">Magnetic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>复准静态磁口的基本定义。\r\n"
"势变量为复磁位差<code>V_m</code>与流量变量\r\n"
"为复磁通量<code>Phi</code>.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort\">PositiveMagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort\">NegativeMagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">Magnetic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort"
msgid "Positive quasi-static magnetic port"
msgstr "正准静磁口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort"
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "参考文献"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The positive magnetic port is based on the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">MagneticPort</a>.\r\n"
"Additionally the reference angle is specified in the connector. The time derivative of the\r\n"
"reference angle is the actual angular frequency of the quasi-static magnetic potential and flux.\r\n"
"The symbol is also designed such way to look different than the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort\">NegativeMagneticPort</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">MagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort\">NegativeMagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort\">Magnetic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"正磁端口是基于\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">MagneticPort</a>。\r\n"
"此外，参考角度在连接器中指定。的时间导数\r\n"
"参考角是准静态磁势和磁通的实际角频率。\r\n"
"这个符号也是这样设计的，看起来不同于\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort\">NegativeMagneticPort</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">MagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort\">NegativeMagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort\">Magnetic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort"
msgid "Negative quasi-static magnetic port"
msgstr "负准静态磁口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort"
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "Reference"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The negative magnetic port is based on the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">MagneticPort</a>.\r\n"
"Additionally the reference angle is specified in the connector. The time derivative of the\r\n"
"reference angle is the actual angular frequency of the quasi-static magnetic potential and flux.\r\n"
"The symbol is also designed such way to look different than the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort\">PositiveMagneticPort</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">MagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort\">PositiveMagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort\">Magnetic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"负磁端口是基于\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">MagneticPort</a>。\r\n"
"此外，参考角度在连接器中指定。的时间导数\r\n"
"参考角是准静态磁势和磁通的实际角频率。\r\n"
"这个符号也是这样设计的，看起来不同于\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort\">PositiveMagneticPort</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另外</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">MagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort\">PositiveMagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort\">Magnetic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary"
msgid "Two magnetic ports for graphical modeling"
msgstr "两个磁性端口用于图形化建模"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary"
msgid "Positive quasi-static magnetic port"
msgstr "正准静磁口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary"
msgid "Negative quasi-static magnetic port"
msgstr "负准静态磁口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary"
msgid "Magnetic potential difference of both ports"
msgstr "两个端口的磁电位差"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary"
msgid "Magnitude of complex magnetic potential difference"
msgstr "复磁位差的大小"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary"
msgid "Argument of complex magnetic potential difference"
msgstr "复磁位差的论证"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary"
msgid "Magnetic flux from port_p to port_n"
msgstr "从port_p到port_n的磁通量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary"
msgid "Magnitude of complex magnetic flux"
msgstr "复磁通量的大小"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary"
msgid "Argument of complex magnetic flux"
msgstr "复磁通量的参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Partial model of a flux tube component with two magnetic ports:\r\n"
"the positive port connector <code>port_p</code>, and the negative port\r\n"
"connector <code>port_n</code>. The total magnetic potential difference\r\n"
"<code>V_m</code> and the flux flowing into the positive port,\r\n"
"<code>Phi</code> are also defined in this model.\r\n"
"</p></html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"具有两个磁口的磁通管组件的局部模型:\r\n"
"正极端口连接器<code>port_p</code>，负极端口\r\n"
"连接器<code>port_n</code>。总磁位差\r\n"
"<code>V_m</code>和流入正端口的通量，\r\n"
"<code>Phi</code>也在这个模型中定义.\r\n"
"</p></html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.TwoPort"
msgid "Two magnetic ports for textual modeling"
msgstr "两个用于文本建模的磁性端口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.TwoPort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"It is assumed that the magnetic flux flowing into <code>port_p</code>\r\n"
"is identical to the flux flowing out of <code>port_n</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"假设流入<code>port_p</code>的磁通量\r\n"
"与从<code>port_n</code>流出的通量相同.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.AbsoluteSensor"
msgid "Partial potential sensor"
msgstr "部分电位传感器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.AbsoluteSensor"
msgid "Quasi-static magnetic port"
msgstr "准静磁口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.AbsoluteSensor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.AbsoluteSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The absolute sensor partial model provides a single\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort\">PositiveMagneticPort</a>\r\n"
"to measure the complex magnetic potential. Additionally this model contains a base icon and a definition\r\n"
"of the angular frequency.\r\n"
"</p></html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"传感器的绝对部分模型提供了一个单一的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FluxTubes.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort\">PositiveMagneticPort</a>\r\n"
