msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Examples.BasicMachines.InductionMachines.IMC_DOL"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This example compares a time transient and a quasi-static model of a polyphase induction machine.\r\n"
"At start time <code>tOn</code> a transient and a quasi-static polyphase voltage source are\r\n"
"connected to an induction machine. The machine starts from standstill, accelerating inertias\r\n"
"against load torque quadratic dependent on speed, finally reaching nominal speed.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Simulate for 1 second and plot (versus time):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>currentRMSsensor.I|currentSensorQS.abs_i[1]</code>: (equivalent) RMS stator current</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>imc|imcQS.wMechanical</code>: machine speed</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>imc|imcQS.tauElectrical</code>: machine torque</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"本例比较了多相感应电机的时间暂态模型和准静态模型。\r\n"
"在启动时间<code>tOn</code>为暂态多相电压源和准静态多相电压源\r\n"
"连接到感应电机上。机器从静止开始，加速惯性\r\n"
"抗负载转矩与转速成二次关系，最终达到公称转速.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"模拟1秒并绘制(相对于时间):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><code>currentRMSsensor.I|currentSensorQS.abs_i[1]</code>: (等效)均方根定子电流</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>imc|imcQS.wMechanical</code>: 机速度</li>\r\n"
"<li><code>imc|imcQS.tauElectrical</code>: 机转矩</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

