msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Examples.BasicMachines.InductionMachines.IMC_Initialize"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<strong>Test example: Steady-State Initialization of an induction machine with squirrel cage</strong><br>\r\n"
"The induction machine with squirrel cage is initialized in steady-state at no-load;\r\n"
"at time tStart a load torque step is applied.<br>\r\n"
"Simulate for 1.5 seconds and plot (versus time):\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>currentQuasiRMSSensor.I: stator current RMS</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.wMechanical: motor's speed</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.tauElectrical: motor's torque</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"Default machine parameters of model <em>IM_SquirrelCage</em> are used.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<strong>测试示例:带鼠笼感应电机的稳态初始化</strong><br>\r\n"
"鼠笼式感应电机在空载状态下初始化为稳态;\r\n"
"在tStart时刻，施加负载转矩步骤.<br>\r\n"
"模拟1.5秒并绘制(相对于时间):\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>currentQuasiRMSSensor.I: 定子电流均方根</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.wMechanical: 电机的速度</li>\r\n"
"<li>aimc.tauElectrical: 电动机的转矩</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"使用型号<em>IM_SquirrelCage</em>的默认机器参数.\r\n"
"</html>"

