msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces"
msgid "Interfaces"
msgstr "接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.MagneticPort"
msgid "Quasi-static magnetic port of fundamental wave machines"
msgstr "基波机的准静态磁端口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.MagneticPort"
msgid "Complex magnetic potential at the port"
msgstr "端口处的复磁势"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.MagneticPort"
msgid "Complex magnetic flux flowing into the port"
msgstr "流入端口的复合磁通量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.MagneticPort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Base definition of complex quasi-static magnetic port. The potential variable is the complex magnetic potential\r\n"
"<code>V_m</code> and the flow variable is the complex magnetic flux <code>Phi</code>.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort\">PositiveMagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort\">NegativeMagneticPort</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>复准静态磁口的基本定义。势变量是复磁势\r\n"
"<code>V_m</code>流变量为复磁通量<code>Phi</code>.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort\">PositiveMagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort\">NegativeMagneticPort</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort"
msgid "Positive quasi-static magnetic port of fundamental wave machines"
msgstr "基波机的正准静态磁口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort"
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "参考"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The positive port is based on\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">MagneticPort</a>.\r\n"
"Additionally the reference angle is specified in the connector. The time derivative of the reference angle is the actual angular velocity of the quasi-static voltage and current. The symbol is also designed such way to look different than the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort\">NegativeMagneticPort</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">MagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort\">NegativeMagneticPort</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"正端的端口是基于\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">MagneticPort</a>。\r\n"
"此外，参考角度在连接器中指定。参考角的时间导数是准静态电压和电流的实际角速度。这个符号也是这样设计的，看起来不同于\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort\">NegativeMagneticPort</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">MagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort\">NegativeMagneticPort</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort"
msgid "Negative quasi-static magnetic port of fundamental wave machines"
msgstr "基波机的负准静磁端口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort"
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "参考"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.NegativeMagneticPort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The negative pin is based on <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.Pin\">Pin</a>.\r\n"
"Additionally the reference angle is specified in the connector. The time derivative of the reference angle is the actual angular velocity of the quasi-static voltage and current. The symbol is also designed such way to look different than the <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.PositivePin\">positive pin</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">MagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort\">PositiveMagneticPort</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"负引脚基于<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces.Pin\">Pin</a>。\r\n"
"此外，参考角度在连接器中指定。参考角的时间导数是准静态电压和电流的实际角速度。该符号也被设计成看起来与<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Interfaces. PositivePin\">positive pin</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.MagneticPort\">MagneticPort</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.PositiveMagneticPort\">PositiveMagneticPort</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary"
msgid "Partial two port for graphical programming"
msgstr "部分两个端口用于图形化编程"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary"
msgid "Reference angular velocity (= der(port_p.reference.gamma))"
msgstr "参考角速度 (= der(port_p.reference.gamma))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary"
msgid "Positive quasi-static magnetic port of fundamental wave machines"
msgstr "基波机的正准静态磁口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary"
msgid "Negative quasi-static magnetic port of fundamental wave machines"
msgstr "基波机的负准静态磁口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The partial two port model consists of a positive and a negative magnetic port. The reference angles of the two ports are set equal and connected through <code>Connections.branch</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"部分双端口模型由一个正磁端口和一个负磁端口组成。两个端口的参考角度设置为相等，并通过<code>Connections.branch</code>连接.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortExtended"
msgid "Partial two port for graphical programming with additional variables"
msgstr "部分二端口的图形化编程与附加变量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortExtended"
msgid "Complex magnetic potential difference"
msgstr "复磁位差"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortExtended"
msgid "Magnitude of complex magnetic potential difference"
msgstr "复磁位差的大小"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortExtended"
msgid "Argument of complex magnetic potential difference"
msgstr "复磁位差的论证"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortExtended"
msgid "Complex magnetic flux"
msgstr "复磁通量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortExtended"
msgid "Magnitude of complex magnetic flux"
msgstr "复磁通量的大小"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortExtended"
msgid "Argument of complex magnetic flux"
msgstr "复磁通量的参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortExtended"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The partial two port model consists of a positive and a negative magnetic port. The reference angles of the two ports are set equal and connected through <code>Connections.branch</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This interface model contains an extended set of (output) variables compared to\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary\">TwoPortElementary</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"部分双端口模型由一个正磁端口和一个负磁端口组成。两个端口的参考角度设置为相等，并通过<code>Connections.branch</code>连接.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此接口模型包含一组扩展的(输出)变量\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPortElementary\">TwoPortElementary</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPort"
msgid "Elementary partial two port for textual programming"
msgstr "用于文本编程的初级部分二端口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.Interfaces.TwoPort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The partial two port elementary model extends from the partial two port model and adds one equation considering the balance of flow variables, <code>port_p.Phi + port_n.Phi = Complex(0,0)</code>. Additionally, a variable for magnetic potential difference of the two magnetic ports, <code>V_m</code>, and the flux into the positive port, <code>Phi</code>, are defined.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"偏二端口初等模型在偏二端口模型的基础上进行了扩展，增加了一个考虑流量变量平衡的方程<code>port_p.Phi + port_n.Phi = Complex(0,0)</code>。另外，定义了两个磁口的磁位差变量<code>V_m</code>和进入正极的磁通<code>Phi</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Magnetic.QuasiStatic.FundamentalWave.BaseClasses"
msgid "Base classes of fundamental wave machines"
