msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Examples.Loops"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains different examples to show how\r\n"
"mechanical systems with kinematic loops can be modeled.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
