msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Examples.Systems.RobotR3.Utilities.Controller"
msgid "P-PI cascade controller for one axis"
msgstr "P-PI级联控制器用于单轴控制"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Examples.Systems.RobotR3.Utilities.Controller"
msgid "Gain of position controller"
msgstr "位置控制器的增益"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Examples.Systems.RobotR3.Utilities.Controller"
msgid "Gain of speed controller"
msgstr "速度控制器的增益"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Examples.Systems.RobotR3.Utilities.Controller"
msgid "Time constant of integrator of speed controller"
msgstr "速度控制器中积分器的时间常数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Examples.Systems.RobotR3.Utilities.Controller"
msgid "Gear ratio of gearbox"
msgstr "齿轮箱中的齿数比"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Examples.Systems.RobotR3.Utilities.Controller"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This controller has an inner PI-controller to control the motor speed,\r\n"
"and an outer P-controller to control the motor position of one axis.\r\n"
"The reference signals are with respect to the gear-output, and the\r\n"
"gear ratio is used in the controller to determine the motor\r\n"
"reference signals. All signals are communicated via the\r\n"
"\"axisControlBus\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个控制器包含一个内部的PI控制器用于控制电机速度，以及一个外部的P控制器用于控制单轴电机的位置。\r\n"
"参考信号是根据齿轮输出设定的，控制器使用齿轮比来确定电机的参考信号。\r\n"
"所有的信号都通过\"axisControlBus\"进行通信。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

