msgstr "弹性系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Examples.Systems.RobotR3.Utilities.AxisType1"
msgid "Gear"
msgstr "Gear"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Examples.Systems.RobotR3.Utilities.AxisType1"
msgid "Damper constant"
msgstr "阻尼系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Examples.Systems.RobotR3.Utilities.AxisType1"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Model of axis 1, 2, 3 of the robot r3. An axis consists of a gearbox with modelled gear elasticity and bearing friction,\r\n"
"a model of the electrical motor and a continuous-time cascade controller.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"机器人R3的1、2、3轴模型。一个轴由一个具有模拟齿轮弹性和轴承摩擦的齿轮箱、电动机模型和一个连续时间级联控制器组成。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

