"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameB.frame_resolve, the torque coordinates\r\n"
"are with respect to the frame, that is connected to <strong>frame_resolve</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame is not Types.ResolveInFrameB.frame_resolve, then the position\r\n"
"vector and the orientation object of frame_resolve must be set to constant\r\n"
"values from the outside in order that the model remains balanced\r\n"
"(these constant values are ignored).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"  <strong>力矩</strong>连接器的3个信号被解释为作用在此组件所连接的坐标系上的x、y和z坐标的<strong>力矩</strong>。\r\n"
"  通过参数<strong>resolveInFrame</strong>定义了这些坐标值应该在哪个坐标系中解析：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><th><strong>Types.ResolveInFrameB.</strong></th><th><strong>含义</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"      <td>在world坐标系中解析输入的力矩(默认设置)</td></tr>\r\n"
"  \r\n"
"  <tr><td>frame_b</td>\r\n"
"      <td>在frame_b中解析输入力矩</td></tr>\r\n"
"  \r\n"
"  <tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"      <td>在frame_resolve中解析输入力矩(frame_resolve必须已连接)</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"  如果resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameB.frame_resolve，则力矩坐标是相对于与<strong>frame_resolve</strong>连接的坐标系的。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"  如果resolveInFrame不是Types.ResolveInFrameB.frame_resolve，则必须从外部设置frame_resolve的位置向量和方向对象为常量值，以使模型保持平衡(这些常量值会被忽略)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Forces.Internal.ZeroForceAndTorque"
msgid "Set force and torque to zero"
msgstr "将力和力矩设置为零"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Forces.Internal.ZeroForceAndTorque"
msgid "f = t = 0"
msgstr "f = t = 0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Forces.Internal.ZeroForceAndTorque"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Set force and torque vectors on frame connector frame_a to zero.</p>\r\n"
"<!--a placeholder to fulfill minimum documentation length-->\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>将坐标系连接器frame_a上的力和力矩矢量设置为零</p>\r\n"
"<!--a placeholder to fulfill minimum documentation length-->\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Forces.Internal.standardGravityAcceleration"
msgid "Standard gravity fields (no/parallel/point field)"
msgstr "标准重力场(无/平行/点场)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Forces.Internal.standardGravityAcceleration"
msgid "Type of gravity field"
msgstr "重力场类型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Forces.Internal.standardGravityAcceleration"
msgid "Constant gravity acceleration, resolved in world frame, if gravityType=UniformGravity"
msgstr "如果 gravityType 等于 UniformGravity，则常重力加速度在全局坐标系中分解。"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Forces.Internal.standardGravityAcceleration"
msgid "Field constant of point gravity field, if gravityType=PointGravity"
msgstr "如果 gravityType 等于 PointGravity，则为点重力场的场常数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Forces.Internal.standardGravityAcceleration"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function defines the standard gravity fields for the World object.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><td><strong><em>gravityType</em></strong></td>\r\n"
"    <td><strong><em>gravity [m/s2]</em></strong></td>\r\n"
"    <td><strong><em>description</em></strong></td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>Types.GravityType.NoGravity</td>\r\n"
"    <td>= {0,0,0}</td>\r\n"
"    <td>No gravity</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>Types.GravityType.UniformGravity</td>\r\n"
"    <td>= g</td>\r\n"
"    <td> Constant parallel gravity field</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>Types.GravityType.PointGravity</td>\r\n"
"    <td>= -(mu/(r*r))*r/|r|</td>\r\n"
"    <td> Point gravity field with spherical mass</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个函数定义了World对象的标准重力场。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><td><strong><em>重力类型</em></strong></td>\r\n"
"    <td><strong><em>重力 [m/s2]</em></strong></td>\r\n"
"    <td><strong><em>描述</em></strong></td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>Types.GravityType.NoGravity</td>\r\n"
"    <td>= {0,0,0}</td>\r\n"
"    <td> 无重力</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>Types.GravityType.UniformGravity</td>\r\n"
"    <td>= g</td>\r\n"
"    <td> 恒定平行重力场</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>Types.GravityType.PointGravity</td>\r\n"
"    <td>= -(mu/(r*r))*r/|r|</td>\r\n"
"    <td> 具有球形质量的点重力场</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames"
msgid "Functions to transform rotational frame quantities"
msgstr "用于转换旋转坐标系量的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Package <strong>Frames</strong> contains type definitions and\r\n"
"functions to transform rotational frame quantities. The basic idea is to\r\n"
"hide the actual definition of an <strong>orientation</strong> in this package\r\n"
"by providing essentially type <strong>Orientation</strong> together with\r\n"
"<strong>functions</strong> operating on instances of this type.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Content</h4>\r\n"
"<p>In the table below an example is given for every function definition.\r\n"
"The used variables have the following declaration:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Frames.Orientation R, R1, R2, R_rel, R_inv;\r\n"
"Real[3,3]   T, T_inv;\r\n"
"Real[3]     v1, v2, w1, w2, n_x, n_y, n_z, e, e_x, res_ori, phi;\r\n"
"Real[6]     res_equal;\r\n"
"Real        L, angle;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><th><strong><em>Function/type</em></strong></th><th><strong><em>Description</em></strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>Orientation R;</strong></td>\r\n"
"      <td>New type defining an orientation object that describes<br>\r\n"
"          the rotation of frame 1 into frame 2.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>res_ori = <strong>orientationConstraint</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return the constraints between the variables of an orientation object<br>\r\n"
"      (shall be zero).</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>w1 = <strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return angular velocity resolved in frame 1 from\r\n"
"          orientation object R.\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>w2 = <strong>angularVelocity2</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return angular velocity resolved in frame 2 from\r\n"
"          orientation object R.\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>v1 = <strong>resolve1</strong>(R,v2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Transform vector v2 from frame 2 to frame 1.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>v2 = <strong>resolve2</strong>(R,v1);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Transform vector v1 from frame 1 to frame 2.\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>v2 = <strong>resolveRelative</strong>(v1,R1,R2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Transform vector v1 from frame 1 to frame 2\r\n"
"          using absolute orientation objects R1 of frame 1 and R2 of frame 2.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>D1 = <strong>resolveDyade1</strong>(R,D2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Transform second order tensor D2 from frame 2 to frame 1.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>D2 = <strong>resolveDyade2</strong>(R,D1);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Transform second order tensor D1 from frame 1 to frame 2.\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>nullRotation</strong>()</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object R that does not rotate a frame.\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R_inv = <strong>inverseRotation</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return inverse orientation object.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R_rel = <strong>relativeRotation</strong>(R1,R2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return relative orientation object from two absolute\r\n"
"          orientation objects.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R2 = <strong>absoluteRotation</strong>(R1,R_rel);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return absolute orientation object from another\r\n"
"          absolute<br> and a relative orientation object.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>planarRotation</strong>(e, angle, der_angle);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object of a planar rotation.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>angle = <strong>planarRotationAngle</strong>(e, v1, v2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return angle of a planar rotation, given the rotation axis<br>\r\n"
"        and the representations of a vector in frame 1 and frame 2.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>axisRotation</strong>(axis, angle, der_angle);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object R to rotate around angle along axis of frame 1.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>axesRotations</strong>(sequence, angles, der_angles);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return rotation object to rotate in sequence around 3 axes. Example:<br>\r\n"
"          R = axesRotations({1,2,3},{pi/2,pi/4,-pi}, zeros(3));\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>angles = <strong>axesRotationsAngles</strong>(R, sequence);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return the 3 angles to rotate in sequence around 3 axes to<br>\r\n"
"          construct the given orientation object.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>phi = <strong>smallRotation</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return rotation angles phi valid for a small rotation R.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>from_nxy</strong>(n_x, n_y);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object from n_x and n_y vectors.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>from_nxz</strong>(n_x, n_z);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object from n_x and n_z vectors.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>from_T</strong>(T,w);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object R from transformation matrix T and\r\n"
"          its angular velocity w.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>from_T2</strong>(T,der(T));</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object R from transformation matrix T and\r\n"
"          its derivative der(T).\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>from_T_inv</strong>(T_inv,w);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object R from inverse transformation matrix T_inv and\r\n"
"          its angular velocity w.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>from_Q</strong>(Q,w);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object R from quaternion orientation object Q\r\n"
"          and its angular velocity w.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>to_T</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return transformation matrix T from orientation object R.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T_inv = <strong>to_T_inv</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return inverse transformation matrix T_inv from orientation object R.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q = <strong>to_Q</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return quaternion orientation object Q from orientation object R.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>exy = <strong>to_exy</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return [e_x, e_y] matrix of an orientation object R,<br>\r\n"
"          with e_x and e_y vectors of frame 2, resolved in frame 1.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>L = <strong>length</strong>(n_x);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return length L of a vector n_x.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>e_x = <strong>normalize</strong>(n_x);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return normalized vector e_x of n_x such that length of e_x is one.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>e = <strong>axis</strong>(i);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return unit vector e directed along axis i\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions\">Quaternions</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td><strong>Package</strong> with functions to transform rotational frame quantities based\r\n"
"          on quaternions (also called Euler parameters).\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices\">TransformationMatrices</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td><strong>Package</strong> with functions to transform rotational frame quantities based\r\n"
"          on transformation matrices.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"包<strong>Frames</strong>中包含了类的定义以及用于转换旋转坐标系中量的函数。\r\n"
"基本思想是，通过提供必要的<strong>Orientation</strong>类以及操作该类实例的<strong>functions</strong>，\r\n"
"在这个包中隐藏实际的<strong>orientation</strong>的定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>目录</h4>\r\n"
"<p>在下表中，给出了每个函数定义的示例。其中所使用的变量具有以下声明：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Frames.Orientation R, R1, R2, R_rel, R_inv;\r\n"
"Real[3,3]   T, T_inv;\r\n"
"Real[3]     v1, v2, w1, w2, n_x, n_y, n_z, e, e_x, res_ori, phi;\r\n"
"Real[6]     res_equal;\r\n"
"Real        L, angle;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><th><strong><em>函数/类</em></strong></th><th><strong><em>描述</em></strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>Orientation R;</strong></td>\r\n"
"      <td>定义了一个新类型，用于描述坐标系1到坐标系2的旋转。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>res_ori = <strong>orientationConstraint</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回方向对象的变量之间的约束(应等于零)。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>w1 = <strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从方向对象R解析出的在坐标系1中的角速度。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>w2 = <strong>angularVelocity2</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从方向对象R解析出的在坐标系2中的角速度。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>v1 = <strong>resolve1</strong>(R,v2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>将矢量v2从坐标系2转换到坐标系1。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>v2 = <strong>resolve2</strong>(R,v1);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>将矢量v1从坐标系1转换到坐标系2。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>v2 = <strong>resolveRelative</strong>(v1,R1,R2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>使用坐标系1的绝对方向对象R1和坐标系2的绝对方向对象R2，将矢量v1从坐标系1下表示转换到坐标系2下表示。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"   <tr><td>D1 = <strong>resolveDyade1</strong>(R,D2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>将二阶张量D2从坐标系2转换到坐标系1。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>D2 = <strong>resolveDyade2</strong>(R,D1);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>将二阶张量D1从坐标系1转换到坐标系2。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>nullRotation</strong>()</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回坐标系没有旋转的方向对象R。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R_inv = <strong>inverseRotation</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回方向对象的逆对象。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R_rel = <strong>relativeRotation</strong>(R1,R2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从两个绝对方向对象返回相对方向对象。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R2 = <strong>absoluteRotation</strong>(R1,R_rel);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从另一个绝对方向对象和一个相对方向对象返回绝对方向对象。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>planarRotation</strong>(e, angle, der_angle);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回平面旋转的方向对象。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>angle = <strong>planarRotationAngle</strong>(e, v1, v2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回平面旋转的角度，给定旋转轴和在坐标系1和坐标系2下表示的矢量。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>axisRotation</strong>(axis, angle, der_angle);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回绕坐标系1中的给定轴旋转给定角度的方向对象R。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>axesRotations</strong>(sequence, angles, der_angles);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回一个旋转对象，用于按给定顺序绕三个轴旋转。例如：<br>\r\n"
"          R = axesRotations({1,2,3},{pi/2,pi/4,-pi}, zeros(3));\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>angles = <strong>axesRotationsAngles</strong>(R, sequence);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回绕三个轴按顺序旋转以构造给定方向对象所需的三个角度。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>phi = <strong>smallRotation</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回适用于小幅旋转R的旋转角度phi。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>from_nxy</strong>(n_x, n_y);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从n_x和n_y矢量返回方向对象。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>from_nxz</strong>(n_x, n_z);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从n_x和n_z矢量返回方向对象。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>from_T</strong>(T,w);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从变换矩阵T及其角速度w返回方向对象R。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"   <tr><td>R = <strong>from_T2</strong>(T,der(T));</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从变换矩阵T及其导数der(T)返回方向对象R。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>from_T_inv</strong>(T_inv,w);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从逆变换矩阵T_inv及其角速度w返回方向对象R。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>from_Q</strong>(Q,w);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从四元数方向对象Q及其角速度w返回方向对象R。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>to_T</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从方向对象R返回变换矩阵T。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T_inv = <strong>to_T_inv</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从方向对象R返回逆变换矩阵T_inv。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q = <strong>to_Q</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从方向对象R返回四元数方向对象Q。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>exy = <strong>to_exy</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从方向对象R返回[e_x, e_y]矩阵，其中坐标系2的轴e_x和e_y在坐标系1下表示的矢量。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>L = <strong>length</strong>(n_x);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回矢量n_x的长度L。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>e_x = <strong>normalize</strong>(n_x);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回矢量n_x的单位矢量e_x，使得e_x的长度为一。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>e = <strong>axis</strong>(i);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回沿着轴i方向的单位矢量e。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions\">Quaternions</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>基于四元数(也称为欧拉参数)的旋转坐标系量的转换函数包。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices\">TransformationMatrices</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>基于变换矩阵的旋转坐标系量的转换函数包。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation"
msgid "Orientation object defining rotation from a frame 1 into a frame 2"
msgstr "定义从坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation"
msgid "Transformation matrix from world frame to local frame"
msgstr "从世界坐标系到本地坐标系的转换矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation"
msgid "Absolute angular velocity of local frame, resolved in local frame"
msgstr "本地坐标系的绝对角速度，在本地坐标系下解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This object describes the <strong>rotation</strong> from a <strong>frame&nbsp;1</strong> into a <strong>frame&nbsp;2</strong>.\r\n"
"An instance of this type should never be directly accessed but\r\n"
"only with the access functions provided\r\n"
"in package Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames. As a consequence, it is not necessary to know\r\n"
"the internal representation of this object as described in the next paragraphs.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"\"Orientation\" is defined to be a record consisting of two\r\n"
"elements: \"Real T[3,3]\", the transformation matrix to rotate frame&nbsp;1\r\n"
"into frame&nbsp;2 and \"Real w[3]\", the angular velocity of frame&nbsp;2 with\r\n"
"respect to frame&nbsp;1, resolved in frame&nbsp;2. Element \"T\"\r\n"
"has the following interpretation:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Orientation R;\r\n"
"<strong>R.T</strong> = [<strong>e</strong><sub>x</sub>, <strong>e</strong><sub>y</sub>, <strong>e</strong><sub>z</sub>];\r\n"
"    e.g., <strong>R.T</strong> = [1,0,0; 0,1,0; 0,0,1]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where <strong>e</strong><sub>x</sub>,<strong>e</strong><sub>y</sub>,<strong>e</strong><sub>z</sub>\r\n"
"are unit vectors in the direction of the x-axis, y-axis, and z-axis\r\n"
"of frame&nbsp;1, resolved in frame&nbsp;2, respectively. Therefore, if <strong>v</strong><sub>1</sub>\r\n"
"is vector <strong>v</strong> resolved in frame&nbsp;1 and <strong>v</strong><sub>2</sub> is\r\n"
"vector <strong>v</strong> resolved in frame&nbsp;2, the following relationship holds:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>v</strong><sub>2</sub> = <strong>R.T</strong> * <strong>v</strong><sub>1</sub>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The <strong>inverse</strong> orientation\r\n"
"<strong>R_inv.T</strong> = <strong>R.T</strong><sup>T</sup> describes the rotation\r\n"
"from frame&nbsp;2 into frame&nbsp;1.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Since the orientation is described by 9 variables, there are\r\n"
"6 constraints between these variables. These constraints\r\n"
"are defined in function <strong>Frames.orientationConstraint</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"R.w is the angular velocity of frame&nbsp;2 with respect to frame&nbsp;1, resolved\r\n"
"in frame&nbsp;2. Formally, R.w is defined as:<br>\r\n"
"<strong>skew</strong>(R.w) = R.T*<strong>der</strong>(transpose(R.T))\r\n"
"with\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"          |   0   -w[3]  w[2] |\r\n"
"<strong>skew</strong>(w) = |  w[3]   0   -w[1] |\r\n"
"          | -w[2]  w[1]     0 |\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个对象描述了从<strong>frame 1</strong>(坐标系1)到<strong>frame 2</strong>(坐标系2)的<strong>旋转</strong>。\r\n"
"这种类型的实例不应该直接访问，而应该使用Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames包中提供的访问函数。\r\n"
"因此，不一定需要知道这个对象的内部表示，如下面的段落所述。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"\"Orientation\"被定义为一个记录，由两个元素组成：\"Real T[3,3]\"，将frame 1旋转到frame 2的变换矩阵，以及\"Real w[3]\"，frame 2相对于frame 1的角速度，在frame 2中解析。元素\"T\"有以下解释：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Orientation R;\r\n"
"<strong>R.T</strong> = [<strong>e</strong><sub>x</sub>, <strong>e</strong><sub>y</sub>, <strong>e</strong><sub>z</sub>];\r\n"
"    e.g., <strong>R.T</strong> = [1,0,0; 0,1,0; 0,0,1]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中<strong>e</strong><sub>x</sub>，<strong>e</strong><sub>y</sub>，<strong>e</strong><sub>z</sub>是表示frame 1的x轴、y轴和z轴的单位向量，在frame 2中解析。因此，如果<strong>v</strong><sub>1</sub>是frame 1中解析的向量<strong>v</strong>，而<strong>v</strong><sub>2</sub>是在frame 2中解析的向量<strong>v</strong>，则以下关系成立：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>v</strong><sub>2</sub> = <strong>R.T</strong> * <strong>v</strong><sub>1</sub>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>逆</strong>方向<strong>R_inv.T</strong> = <strong>R.T</strong><sup>T</sup>描述了从frame 2到frame 1的旋转。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"由于方向对象由9个变量描述，因此这些变量之间存在6个约束。这些约束在函数<strong>Frames.orientationConstraint</strong>中定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"R.w是frame 2相对于frame 1的角速度，在frame 2中解析。形式上，R.w定义为：<br>\r\n"
"<strong>skew</strong>(R.w) = R.T*<strong>der</strong>(transpose(R.T))\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                           |   0   -w[3]  w[2] |\r\n"
"<strong>skew</strong>(w) = |  w[3]   0   -w[1] |\r\n"
"                           | -w[2]  w[1]     0 |\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation.equalityConstraint"
msgid "Return the constraint residues to express that two frames have the same orientation"
msgstr "返回表达两个坐标系具有相同方向的约束残差"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation.equalityConstraint"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 1"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系1的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation.equalityConstraint"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation.equalityConstraint"
msgid "The rotation angles around x-, y-, and z-axis of frame 1 to rotate frame 1 into frame 2 for a small rotation (should be zero)"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的绕x、y和z轴的旋转角度(对于小的旋转应为零)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation.equalityConstraint"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"residue = Orientation.<strong>equalityConstraint</strong>(R1, R2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call <code>Orientation.<strong>equalityConstrain</strong>(R1,R2)</code> returns the Real residue vector\r\n"
"with 3 elements. This vector has zero elements if orientation objects R1 and R2 are identical\r\n"
"(= describe the same orientation). The residue vector is determined by computing the relative\r\n"
"orientation object between R1 and R2 and using the outer-diagonal elements of this matrix to\r\n"
"formulate the residue in such a way that only identical orientation objects lead to a zero residue vector.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"residue = Orientation.<strong>equalityConstraint</strong>(R1, R2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用<code>Orientation.<strong>equalityConstrain</strong>(R1,R2)</code>返回一个具有3个元素的Real残差矢量。\r\n"
"如果方向对象R1和R2相同(描述相同方向)，则此矢量的元素等于零。\r\n"
"残差矢量是通过计算R1和R2之间的相对方向对象，并使用该矩阵的外对角线元素来制定残差的方式来确定，\r\n"
"只有相同的方向对象导致零残差矢量。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.orientationConstraint"
msgid "Return residues of orientation constraints (shall be zero)"
msgstr "返回方向约束的残差(应等于零)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.orientationConstraint"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.orientationConstraint"
msgid "Residues of constraints between elements of orientation object (shall be zero)"
msgstr "方向对象元素之间约束的残差(应等于零)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.orientationConstraint"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"residue = Frames.<strong>orientationConstraint</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call <code>Frames.<strong>orientationConstraint</strong>(R)</code> returns the Real residue vector\r\n"
"with&nbsp;6 elements that describes the constraints between the&nbsp;9 elements of the orientation matrix.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.orientationConstraint\">TransformationMatrices.orientationConstraint</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.orientationConstraint\">Quaternions.orientationConstraint</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"residue = Frames.<strong>orientationConstraint</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用<code>Frames.<strong>orientationConstraint</strong>(R)</code>返回一个具有6个元素的Real残差矢量，\r\n"
"描述了方向矩阵的9个元素之间的约束。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.orientationConstraint\">TransformationMatrices.orientationConstraint</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.orientationConstraint\">Quaternions.orientationConstraint</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity1"
msgid "Return angular velocity resolved in frame 1 from orientation object"
msgstr "从方向对象返回在坐标系1中解析的角速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity1"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity1"
msgid "Angular velocity of frame 2 with respect to frame 1 resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "相对于坐标系1解析的坐标系2的角速度，解析在坐标系1中"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity1"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = Frames.<strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call <code>Frames.<strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(R12)</code> returns\r\n"
"the angular velocity&nbsp;w of frame&nbsp;2 with respect to frame&nbsp;1, <strong>resolved in frame&nbsp;1</strong>,\r\n"
"from the orientation object R12 that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity1\">TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity1\">Quaternions.angularVelocity1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = Frames.<strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用<code>Frames.<strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(R12)</code>返回\r\n"
"坐标系2相对于坐标系1的<strong>解析在坐标系1中</strong>角速度，\r\n"
"从描述将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象R12。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity1\">TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity1\">Quaternions.angularVelocity1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity2"
msgid "Return angular velocity resolved in frame 2 from orientation object"
msgstr "从方向对象返回在坐标系2中解析的角速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity2"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity2"
msgid "Angular velocity of frame 2 with respect to frame 1 resolved in frame 2"
msgstr "相对于坐标系1解析的坐标系2的角速度，解析在坐标系2中"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = Frames.<strong>angularVelocity2</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call <code>Frames.<strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(R12)</code> returns\r\n"
"the angular velocity&nbsp;w of frame&nbsp;2 with respect to frame&nbsp;1, <strong>resolved in frame&nbsp;2</strong>,\r\n"
"from the orientation object R12 that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity2\">TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity2\">Quaternions.angularVelocity2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = Frames.<strong>angularVelocity2</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用<code>Frames.<strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(R12)</code>返回\r\n"
"坐标系2相对于坐标系1的角速度<strong>解析在坐标系2中</strong>，\r\n"
"从描述将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象R12。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity2\">TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity2\">Quaternions.angularVelocity2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve1"
msgid "Transform vector from frame 2 to frame 1"
msgstr "将矢量从坐标系2转换到坐标系1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve1"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve1"
msgid "Vector in frame 2"
msgstr "坐标系2中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve1"
msgid "Vector in frame 1"
msgstr "坐标系1中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve1"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v1 = Frames.<strong>resolve1</strong>(R, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call <code>Frames.<strong>resolve1</strong>(R12, v2)</code> returns vector v\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;1 (= v1) from vector v resolved in frame&nbsp;2 (= v2) using the\r\n"
"orientation object R12 that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve2\">resolve2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve1\">TransformationMatrices.resolve1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve1\">Quaternions.resolve1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v1 = Frames.<strong>resolve1</strong>(R, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用<code>Frames.<strong>resolve1</strong>(R12, v2)</code>返回矢量v\r\n"
"在坐标系1中解析(= v1)，从在坐标系2中解析(= v2)的矢量v，使用描述将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象R12。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve2\">resolve2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve1\">TransformationMatrices.resolve1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve1\">Quaternions.resolve1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve2"
msgid "Transform vector from frame 1 to frame 2"
msgstr "将矢量从坐标系1转换到坐标系2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve2"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve2"
msgid "Vector in frame 1"
msgstr "坐标系1中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve2"
msgid "Vector in frame 2"
msgstr "坐标系2中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = Frames.<strong>resolve2</strong>(R, v1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call <code>Frames.<strong>resolve2</strong>(R12, v1)</code> returns vector v\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;2 (= v2) from vector v resolved in frame&nbsp;1 (= v1) using the\r\n"
"orientation object R12 that describes the orientation  to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve1\">resolve1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve2\">TransformationMatrices.resolve2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve2\">Quaternions.resolve2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = Frames.<strong>resolve2</strong>(R, v1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用<code>Frames.<strong>resolve2</strong>(R12, v1)</code>返回矢量v\r\n"
"在坐标系2中解析(= v2)，从在坐标系1中解析(= v1)的矢量v，使用orientation对象将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的R12。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve1\">resolve1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve2\">TransformationMatrices.resolve2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve2\">Quaternions.resolve2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveRelative"
msgid "Transform vector from frame 1 to frame 2 using absolute orientation objects of frame 1 and of frame 2"
msgstr "使用坐标系1和坐标系2的绝对方向对象，将矢量从坐标系1下解析转换到坐标系2下解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveRelative"
msgid "Vector in frame 1"
msgstr "坐标系1中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveRelative"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 1"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系1的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveRelative"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveRelative"
msgid "Vector in frame 2"
msgstr "坐标系2中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveRelative"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = Frames.<strong>resolveRelative</strong>(v1, R1, R2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call <code>Frames.<strong>resolveRelative</strong>(v1,R1,R2)</code> returns vector v\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;2 (= v1) from vector v resolved in frame&nbsp;1 (= v1) given the\r\n"
"orientation object R1 that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;0 into frame&nbsp;1 and\r\n"
"orientation object R2 that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;0 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = Frames.<strong>resolveRelative</strong>(v1, R1, R2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用<code>Frames.<strong>resolveRelative</strong>(v1,R1,R2)</code>从坐标系1(=v1)中解析的向量v返回至坐标系2（=v1)中解析的向量v。给定的方向对象R1描述了将坐标系0转换至坐标系1的方向，方向对象R2描述了将坐标系0旋转到坐标系2的方向。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveDyade1"
msgid "Transform second order tensor from frame 2 to frame 1"
msgstr "将二阶张量从坐标系2变换到坐标系1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveDyade1"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveDyade1"
msgid "Second order tensor resolved in frame 2"
msgstr "在坐标系2中解析的二阶张量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveDyade1"
msgid "Second order tensor resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "在坐标系1中解析的二阶张量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveDyade1"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"D1 = Frames.<strong>resolveDyade1</strong>(R, D2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call <code>Frames.<strong>Dyade1</strong>(R12, D2)</code> returns the second order tensor D\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;1 (= D1) from its representation in frame&nbsp;2 (= D2) using the\r\n"
"orientation object R12 that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade1\">TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"D1 = Frames.<strong>resolveDyade1</strong>(R, D2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用<code>Frames.<strong>resolveDyade1</strong>(R12, D2)</code>使用描述将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象R12,从坐标系2(= D2)中的表示返回在坐标系1（=D1）中解析的二阶张量D。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade1\">TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade1</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveDyade2"
msgid "Transform second order tensor from frame 1 to frame 2"
msgstr "将二阶张量从坐标系1变换到坐标系2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveDyade2"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveDyade2"
msgid "Second order tensor resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "在坐标系1中解析的二阶张量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveDyade2"
msgid "Second order tensor resolved in frame 2"
msgstr "在坐标系2中解析的二阶张量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveDyade2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"D2 = Frames.<strong>resolveDyade2</strong>(R, D1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call <code>Frames.<strong>Dyade2</strong>(R12, D1)</code> returns the second order tensor D\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;2 (= D2) from its representation in frame&nbsp;1 (= D1) using the\r\n"
"orientation object R12 that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade2\">TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"D2 = Frames.<strong>resolveDyade2</strong>(R, D1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用<code>Frames.<strong>resolveDyade2</strong>(R12, D1)</code>使用描述将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象R12。\r\n"
"从坐标系1中解析(= D1)返回二阶张量D在坐标系2中解析(= D2)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade2\">TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade2</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.nullRotation"
msgid "Return orientation object that does not rotate a frame"
msgstr "返回不旋转坐标系的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.nullRotation"
msgid "Orientation object such that frame 1 and frame 2 are identical"
msgstr "方向对象，使得坐标系1和坐标系2相同"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.nullRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>nullRotation</strong>();\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call <code>Frames.<strong>nullRotation</strong>()</code> returns an orientation matrix&nbsp;R\r\n"
"describing the orientation object to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2, if frame&nbsp;1 and frame&nbsp;2 are identical.\r\n"
"(= transformation matrix is identity matrix and angular velocity is zero).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.nullRotation\">TransformationMatrices.nullRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.nullRotation\">Quaternions.nullRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>nullRotation</strong>();\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用<code>Frames.<strong>nullRotation</strong>()</code>返回一个方向矩阵&nbsp;R，\r\n"
"描述将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象，如果坐标系1和坐标系2是相同的。\r\n"
"(= 变换矩阵是单位矩阵，角速度为零)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.nullRotation\">TransformationMatrices.nullRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.nullRotation\">Quaternions.nullRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.inverseRotation"
msgid "Return inverse orientation object"
msgstr "返回逆方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.inverseRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.inverseRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 2 into frame 1"
msgstr "将坐标系2旋转到坐标系1的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.inverseRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R_inv = Frames.<strong>inverseRotation</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call <code>Frames.<strong>inverseRotation</strong>(R)</code> returns\r\n"
"orientation object R_inv that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;2 to frame&nbsp;1\r\n"
"from the orientation object R that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation\">TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.inverseRotation\">Quaternions.inverseRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R_inv = Frames.<strong>inverseRotation</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用<code>Frames.<strong>inverseRotation</strong>(R)</code>描述从坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向的方向对象R返回描述从坐标系2旋转到坐标系1的方向的方向对象R_inv\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation\">TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.inverseRotation\">Quaternions.inverseRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.relativeRotation"
msgid "Return relative orientation object"
msgstr "返回相对方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.relativeRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 1"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系1的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.relativeRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.relativeRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.relativeRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R_rel = Frames.<strong>relativeRotation</strong>(R1,R2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call <code>Frames.<strong>relativeRotation</strong>(R1,R2)</code> returns\r\n"
"orientation object R_rel that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 to frame&nbsp;2\r\n"
"from the orientation object R1 that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;0 to frame&nbsp;1 and\r\n"
"from the orientation object R2 that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;0 to frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.relativeRotation\">TransformationMatrices.relativeRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.relativeRotation\">Quaternions.relativeRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R_rel = Frames.<strong>relativeRotation</strong>(R1,R2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用<code>Frames.<strong>relativeRotation</strong>(R1,R2)</code>返回相对方向对象R_rel，\r\n"
"描述从坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向，\r\n"
"其中方向对象R1描述从坐标系0旋转到坐标系1的方向，\r\n"
"方向对象R2描述从坐标系0旋转到坐标系2的方向。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.relativeRotation\">TransformationMatrices.relativeRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.relativeRotation\">Quaternions.relativeRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.absoluteRotation"
msgid "Return absolute orientation object from another absolute and a relative orientation object"
msgstr "从另一个绝对方向和相对方向对象返回绝对方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.absoluteRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 1"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系1的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.absoluteRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的相对方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.absoluteRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.absoluteRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R2 = Frames.<strong>absoluteRotation</strong>(R1,R_rel);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call <code>Frames.<strong>absoluteRotation</strong>(R1,R_rel)</code> returns\r\n"
"orientation object R2 that describes the orientation frame&nbsp;0 to frame&nbsp;2\r\n"
"from the orientation object R1 that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;0 to frame&nbsp;1 and\r\n"
"from the relative orientation object R_rel that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;1 to frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.absoluteRotation\">TransformationMatrices.absoluteRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.absoluteRotation\">Quaternions.absoluteRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R2 = Frames.<strong>absoluteRotation</strong>(R1,R_rel);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用<code>Frames.<strong>absoluteRotation</strong>(R1,R_rel)</code>返回绝对方向对象R2，\r\n"
"描述从坐标系0旋转到坐标系2的方向，\r\n"
"其中方向对象R1描述从坐标系0旋转到坐标系1的方向，\r\n"
"相对方向对象R_rel描述从坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.absoluteRotation\">TransformationMatrices.absoluteRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.absoluteRotation\">Quaternions.absoluteRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotation"
msgid "Return orientation object of a planar rotation"
msgstr "返回平面旋转的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotation"
msgid "Normalized axis of rotation (must have length=1)"
msgstr "旋转轴的归一化向量(必须长度为1)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotation"
msgid "Rotation angle to rotate frame 1 into frame 2 along axis e"
msgstr "将坐标系1沿轴e旋转到坐标系2的旋转角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotation"
msgid "= der(angle)"
msgstr "= der(angle)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>planarRotation</strong>(e, angle, der_angle);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call <code>Frames.<strong>planarRotation</strong>(e, angle, der_angle)</code> returns\r\n"
"orientation object R that describes the orientation to rotate in the plane along unit\r\n"
"axis <strong>e</strong> from frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2 with angle <strong>angle</strong> and derivative of angle <strong>der_angle</strong>.\r\n"
"Note, \"e\" must be a unit vector. However, this is not checked in this function and the function will\r\n"
"return a wrong result, if length(e) is not one.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotationAngle\">planarRotationAngle</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotation\">TransformationMatrices.planarRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.planarRotation\">Quaternions.planarRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>planarRotation</strong>(e, angle, der_angle);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用<code>Frames.<strong>planarRotation</strong>(e, angle, der_angle)</code>返回\r\n"
"方向对象R，描述沿单位轴<strong>e</strong>在平面内旋转\r\n"
"从坐标系1到坐标系2，旋转角度为<strong>angle</strong>，角度导数为<strong>der_angle</strong>。\r\n"
"注意，“e”必须是单位向量。但在此函数中未进行检查，如果长度(e)不是一，函数将返回错误的结果。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotationAngle\">planarRotationAngle</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotation\">TransformationMatrices.planarRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.planarRotation\">Quaternions.planarRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotationAngle"
msgid "Return angle of a planar rotation, given the rotation axis and the representations of a vector in frame 1 and frame 2"
msgstr "给定旋转轴和其在坐标系1和坐标系2中表示的矢量，返回平面旋转的角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotationAngle"
msgid "Normalized axis of rotation to rotate frame 1 around e into frame 2 (must have length=1)"
msgstr "将第一坐标系绕轴 e 旋转到第二坐标系的归一化旋转轴 (长度必须为 1)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotationAngle"
msgid "A vector v resolved in frame 1 (shall not be parallel to e)"
msgstr "在第一坐标系中表示的矢量 v(不能与 e 平行)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotationAngle"
msgid "Vector v resolved in frame 2, i.e., v2 = resolve2(planarRotation(e,angle),v1)"
msgstr "在第二坐标系中表示的矢量 v，即 v2 = resolve2(planarRotation(e,angle),v1)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotationAngle"
msgid "Rotation angle to rotate frame 1 into frame 2 along axis e in the range: -pi <= angle <= pi"
msgstr "将第一坐标系绕轴 e 旋转到第二坐标系所需的旋转角度，范围为 -π 到 π"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotationAngle"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"angle = Frames.<strong>planarRotationAngle</strong>(e, v1, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A call to this function of the form\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Real[3]                e, v1, v2;\r\n"
"  SI.Angle angle;\r\n"
"<strong>equation</strong>\r\n"
"  angle = <strong>planarRotationAngle</strong>(e, v1, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"computes the rotation angle \"<strong>angle</strong>\" of a planar\r\n"
"rotation along unit vector <strong>e</strong>, rotating frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2, given\r\n"
"the coordinate representations of a vector \"v\" in frame&nbsp;1 (<strong>v1</strong>)\r\n"
"and in frame&nbsp;2 (<strong>v2</strong>). Therefore, the result of this function\r\n"
"fulfills the following equation:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = <strong>resolve2</strong>(<strong>planarRotation</strong>(e,angle), v1)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The rotation angle is returned in the range\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"-&pi; &lt;= angle &lt;= &pi;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function makes the following assumptions on the input arguments\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> Vector <strong>e</strong> has length 1, i.e., length(e) = 1</li>\r\n"
"<li> Vector \"v\" is not parallel to <strong>e</strong>, i.e.,\r\n"
"     length(cross(e,v1)) &ne; 0</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function does not check the above assumptions. If these\r\n"
"assumptions are violated, a wrong result will be returned\r\n"
"and/or a division by zero will occur.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotation\">planarRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotationAngle\">TransformationMatrices.planarRotationAngle</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"angle = Frames.<strong>planarRotationAngle</strong>(e, v1, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"以如下形式调用此函数：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Real[3]                e, v1, v2;\r\n"
"  SI.Angle angle;\r\n"
"<strong>equation</strong>\r\n"
"  angle = <strong>planarRotationAngle</strong>(e, v1, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"计算沿着单位矢量 <strong>e</strong> 进行平面旋转的旋转角度 \"<strong>angle</strong>\", 将第一坐标系旋转到第二坐标系，给定矢量 \"v\" 在第一坐标系 (<strong>v1</strong>) 和第二坐标系 (<strong>v2</strong>) 中的坐标表示。因此，此函数的结果满足以下方程：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = <strong>resolve2</strong>(<strong>planarRotation</strong>(e,angle), v1)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"旋转角度返回在以下范围内\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"-&pi; &lt;= angle &lt;= &pi;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数对输入参数作出以下假设：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> 矢量 <strong>e</strong> 的长度为 1，即，length(e) = 1</li>\r\n"
"<li> 矢量 \"v\" 不与 <strong>e</strong> 平行，即，\r\n"
"     length(cross(e,v1)) &ne; 0</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数不检查上述假设。如果违反这些假设，将返回错误的结果和/或发生除零错误。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotation\">planarRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotationAngle\">TransformationMatrices.planarRotationAngle</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axisRotation"
msgid "Return rotation object to rotate around an angle along one frame axis"
msgstr "返回围绕一个坐标系轴沿角度旋转的旋转对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axisRotation"
msgid "Rotate around 'axis' of frame 1"
msgstr "围绕坐标系1的'axis'旋转"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axisRotation"
msgid "Rotation angle to rotate frame 1 into frame 2 along 'axis' of frame 1"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2沿着坐标系1的'axis'的旋转角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axisRotation"
msgid "= der(angle)"
msgstr "= der(angle)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axisRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axisRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>axisRotation</strong>(axis, angle, der_angle);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call <code>Frames.<strong>axisRotation</strong>(axis, angle, der_angle)</code> returns\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a>&nbsp;R\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate along unit axis <strong>axis</strong>\r\n"
"from frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2 with angle <strong>angle</strong> and derivative of angle <strong>der_angle</strong>.\r\n"
"For example, Frames.axisRotation(2, phi, der_phi) returns the same orientation object as with the call\r\n"
"Frames.planarRotation({0,1,0}, phi, der_phi)\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotation\">planarRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axisRotation\">TransformationMatrices.axisRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>axisRotation</strong>(axis, angle, der_angle);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用<code>Frames.<strong>axisRotation</strong>(axis, angle, der_angle)</code>返回描述沿单位轴<strong>axis</strong>\r\n"
"从坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象&nbsp;R，\r\n"
"角度为<strong>angle</strong>，角度导数为<strong>der_angle</strong>。\r\n"
"例如，Frames.axisRotation(2, phi, der_phi)返回与调用相同的方向对象\r\n"
"Frames.planarRotation({0,1,0}, phi, der_phi)\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotation\">planarRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axisRotation\">TransformationMatrices.axisRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotations"
msgid "Return fixed rotation object to rotate in sequence around fixed angles along 3 axes"
msgstr "返回围绕三个轴按顺序固定旋转角度的旋转对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotations"
msgid "Sequence of rotations from frame 1 to frame 2 along axis sequence[i]"
msgstr "沿轴序列[i]从坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的旋转顺序"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotations"
msgid "Rotation angles around the axes defined in 'sequence'"
msgstr "沿'sequence'定义的轴旋转的角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotations"
msgid "= der(angles)"
msgstr "= der(angles)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotations"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotations"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>axesRotations</strong>(sequence, angles, der_angles);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a>&nbsp;R\r\n"
"that describes the orientation defined by three elementary rotations in\r\n"
"a given <strong>sequence</strong>, each rotated by <strong>angles</strong>.\r\n"
"The angular velocity vector R.w is calculated from the angle derivatives\r\n"
"<strong>der_angles</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotations\">TransformationMatrices.axesRotations</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>axesRotations</strong>(sequence, angles, der_angles);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回描述由三个基本旋转元素定义的方向对象R，\r\n"
"给定的<code>sequence</code>中的每个旋转元素由<code>angles</code>旋转。\r\n"
"角速度矢量R.w从角度导数<code>der_angles</code>计算得到。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotations\">TransformationMatrices.axesRotations</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Return the 3 angles to rotate in sequence around 3 axes to construct the given orientation object"
msgstr "返回绕3个轴依次旋转的3个角度，以构建给定的定向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Sequence of rotations from frame 1 to frame 2 along axis sequence[i]"
msgstr "沿轴序列[i]从坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的旋转顺序"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Select angles[1] such that |angles[1] - guessAngle1| is a minimum"
msgstr "选择angles[1]，使|angles[1] - guessAngle1|最小"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Rotation angles around the axes defined in 'sequence' such that R=Frames.axesRotation(sequence,angles); -pi < angles[i] <= pi"
msgstr "沿'sequence'定义的轴的旋转角度，使R=Frames.axesRotation(sequence,angles); -pi < angles[i] <= pi"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "First rotation axis, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "第一旋转轴，以坐标系1为基准"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Second rotation axis, resolved in frame 1a"
msgstr "第二旋转轴，以坐标系1a为基准"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Third rotation axis, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "第三旋转轴，以坐标系1为基准"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Third rotation axis, resolved in frame 2"
msgstr "第三旋转轴，以坐标系2为基准"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Coefficient A in the equation A*cos(angles[1])+B*sin(angles[1]) = 0"
msgstr "方程A*cos(angles[1])+B*sin(angles[1]) = 0中的系数A"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Coefficient B in the equation A*cos(angles[1])+B*sin(angles[1]) = 0"
msgstr "方程A*cos(angles[1])+B*sin(angles[1]) = 0中的系数B"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Solution 1 for angles[1]"
msgstr "angles[1]的解1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Solution 2 for angles[1]"
msgstr "angles[1]的解2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 1a"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系1a的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"angles = Frames.<strong>axesRotationsAngles</strong>(R, sequence, guessAngle1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A call to this function of the form\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Frames.Orientation R;\r\n"
"  <strong>parameter</strong> Integer sequence[3] = {1,2,3};\r\n"
"  SI.Angle angles[3];\r\n"
"<strong>equation</strong>\r\n"
"  angle = <strong>axesRotationAngles</strong>(R, sequence);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"computes the rotation angles \"<strong>angles</strong>[1:3]\" to rotate frame&nbsp;1\r\n"
"into frame&nbsp;2 along axes <strong>sequence</strong>[1:3], given the orientation\r\n"
"object <strong>R</strong> from frame&nbsp;1 to frame&nbsp;2. Therefore, the result of\r\n"
"this function fulfills the following equation:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = <strong>axesRotation</strong>(sequence, angles)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The rotation angles are returned in the range\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"-&pi; &lt;= angles[i] &lt;= &pi;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"There are <strong>two solutions</strong> for \"angles[1]\" in this range.\r\n"
"Via the third argument <strong>guessAngle1</strong> (default = 0) the\r\n"
"returned solution is selected such that |angles[1] - guessAngle1| is\r\n"
"minimal. The orientation object R may be in a singular configuration, i.e.,\r\n"
"there is an infinite number of angle values leading to the same R. The returned solution is\r\n"
"selected by setting angles[1] = guessAngle1. Then angles[2]\r\n"
"and angles[3] can be uniquely determined in the above range.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, that input argument <strong>sequence</strong> has the restriction that\r\n"
"only values 1,2,3 can be used and that sequence[1] &ne; sequence[2]\r\n"
"and sequence[2] &ne; sequence[3]. Often used values are:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"sequence = <strong>{1,2,3}</strong>  // Cardan angle sequence\r\n"
"         = <strong>{3,1,3}</strong>  // Euler angle sequence\r\n"
"         = <strong>{3,2,1}</strong>  // Tait-Bryan angle sequence\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles\">TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"angles = Frames.<strong>axesRotationsAngles</strong>(R, sequence, guessAngle1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用这个函数的形式如下：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Frames.Orientation R;\r\n"
"  <strong>parameter</strong> Integer sequence[3] = {1,2,3};\r\n"
"  SI.Angle angles[3];\r\n"
"<strong>equation</strong>\r\n"
"  angle = <strong>axesRotationAngles</strong>(R, sequence);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"计算旋转角度 \"<strong>angles</strong>[1:3]\"，将坐标系1沿着轴 <strong>sequence</strong>[1:3]旋转到坐标系 2 的姿态，给定从坐标系1到坐标系2的方向对象 <strong>R</strong>。\r\n"
"因此，这个函数的结果满足以下方程：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = <strong>axesRotation</strong>(sequence, angles)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"旋转角度的范围为\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"-&pi; &lt;= angles[i] &lt;= &pi;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在这个范围内有<strong>两个解</strong>对于 \"angles[1]\"。\r\n"
"通过第三个参数 <strong>guessAngle1</strong> （默认值为 0），选择返回的解，使得 |angles[1] - guessAngle1| 最小。方向对象 R 可能处于奇异配置，即有无穷多个导致相同 R 的角度值。通过设置 angles[1] = guessAngle1 来选择返回的解。然后 angles[2] 和 angles[3] 可以在上述范围内唯一确定。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请注意，输入参数 <strong>sequence</strong> 有一个限制，只能使用值 1、2、3，并且 sequence[1] ≠ sequence[2] 以及 sequence[2] ≠ sequence[3]。通常使用的值包括：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"sequence = <strong>{1,2,3}</strong>  // Cardan angle sequence\r\n"
"         = <strong>{3,1,3}</strong>  // Euler angle sequence\r\n"
"         = <strong>{3,2,1}</strong>  // Tait-Bryan angle sequence\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles\">TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.smallRotation"
msgid "Return rotation angles valid for a small rotation and optionally residues that should be zero"
msgstr "返回对小幅旋转有效的旋转角度，并可选择返回应为零的残差"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.smallRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.smallRotation"
msgid "= false/true, if 'angles'/'angles and residues' are returned in phi"
msgstr "= false/true，如果返回 'angles'/'angles and residues' 中的角度/角度和残留项"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.smallRotation"
msgid "The rotation angles around x-, y-, and z-axis of frame 1 to rotate frame 1 into frame 2 for a small rotation + optionally 3 residues that should be zero"
msgstr "坐标系1绕x轴、y轴和z轴的旋转角度，将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的小角度旋转 + 可选的三个应该为零的残留项"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.smallRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"phi = Frames.<strong>smallRotation</strong>(R, withResidues);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns rotation angles valid for a small rotation of x-y-z sequence (i.e. {1,2,3}).\r\n"
"Optionally, residues are returned as well if <code>withResidues=true</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.smallRotation\">TransformationMatrices.smallRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.smallRotation\">Quaternions.smallRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"phi = Frames.<strong>smallRotation</strong>(R, withResidues);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个函数返回一个小角度旋转的有效旋转角度，顺序为 x-y-z(即 {1,2,3})。\r\n"
"如果 <code>withResidues=true</code>，则还可以返回残留项。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.smallRotation\">TransformationMatrices.smallRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.smallRotation\">Quaternions.smallRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxy"
msgid "Return fixed orientation object from n_x and n_y vectors"
msgstr "返回从n_x和n_y矢量确定的固定方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxy"
msgid "Vector in direction of x-axis of frame 2, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "在坐标系1中解析的指向坐标系2的x轴方向的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxy"
msgid "Vector in direction of y-axis of frame 2, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "在坐标系1中解析的指向坐标系2的y轴方向的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxy"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxy"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>from_nxy</strong>(n_x, n_y);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"It is assumed that the two input vectors n_x and n_y are\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;1 and are directed along the&nbsp;x and y&nbsp;axis\r\n"
"of frame&nbsp;2 (i.e., n_x and n_y are orthogonal to each other).\r\n"
"The function returns the orientation object&nbsp;R to rotate from\r\n"
"frame&nbsp;1 to frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function is robust in the sense that it returns always\r\n"
"an orientation object&nbsp;R, even if n_y is not orthogonal to n_x.\r\n"
"This is performed in the following way:\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"If n_x and n_y are not orthogonal to each other, first a unit\r\n"
"vector e_y is determined that is orthogonal to n_x and is lying\r\n"
"in the plane spanned by n_x and n_y. If n_x and n_y are parallel\r\n"
"or nearly parallel to each other, a vector e_y is selected\r\n"
"arbitrarily such that e_x and e_y are orthogonal to each other.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxy\">TransformationMatrices.from_nxy</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>from_nxy</strong>(n_x, n_y);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"假设两个输入向量n_x和n_y在坐标系1中解析，并沿坐标系2的x轴和y轴定向(即n_x和n_y互为正交)。\r\n"
"函数返回从坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象R。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数具有鲁棒性，即使n_y不正交于n_x，也始终返回方向对象R。\r\n"
"方法如下：\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"如果n_x和n_y不彼此正交，则首先确定一个单位矢量e_y，该矢量与n_x正交并位于由n_x和n_y张成的平面内。\r\n"
"如果n_x和n_y平行或几乎平行，则选择一个矢量e_y，使得e_x和e_y互相正交。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxy\">TransformationMatrices.from_nxy</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxz"
msgid "Return fixed orientation object from n_x and n_z vectors"
msgstr "返回从n_x和n_z矢量确定的固定方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxz"
msgid "Vector in direction of x-axis of frame 2, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "在坐标系1中解析的指向坐标系2的x轴方向的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxz"
msgid "Vector in direction of z-axis of frame 2, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "在坐标系1中解析的指向坐标系2的z轴方向的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxz"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxz"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>from_nxz</strong>(n_x, n_z);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"It is assumed that the two input vectors n_x and n_z are\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;1 and are directed along the&nbsp;x and z&nbsp;axis\r\n"
"of frame&nbsp;2 (i.e., n_x and n_z are orthogonal to each other).\r\n"
"The function returns the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a>&nbsp;R\r\n"
"to rotate from frame&nbsp;1 to frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function is robust in the sense that it always returns\r\n"
"an orientation object&nbsp;R, even if n_z is not orthogonal to n_x.\r\n"
"This is performed in the following way:\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"If n_x and n_z are not orthogonal to each other, first a unit\r\n"
"vector e_z is determined that is orthogonal to n_x and is lying\r\n"
"in the plane spanned by n_x and n_z. If n_x and n_z are parallel\r\n"
"or nearly parallel to each other, a vector e_z is selected\r\n"
"arbitrarily such that n_x and e_z are orthogonal to each other.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxz\">TransformationMatrices.from_nxz</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>from_nxz</strong>(n_x, n_z);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"假定两个输入矢量n_x和n_z在坐标系1中解析，并且沿着坐标系2的x轴和z轴方向(即n_x和n_z是彼此正交的)。\r\n"
"该函数返回将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象R。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数具有鲁棒性，即使n_z不正交于n_x，也始终返回方向对象R。\r\n"
"方法如下：\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"如果n_x和n_z不彼此正交，则首先确定一个单位矢量e_z，该矢量与n_x正交并位于由n_x和n_z张成的平面内。\r\n"
"如果n_x和n_z平行或几乎平行，则选择一个矢量e_z，使得n_x和e_z互相正交。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxz\">TransformationMatrices.from_nxz</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T"
msgid "Return orientation object R from transformation matrix T"
msgstr "返回从变换矩阵 T 和角速度 w 确定的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T"
msgid "Transformation matrix to transform vector from frame 1 to frame 2 (v2=T*v1)"
msgstr "将矢量从坐标系 1 转换到坐标系 2 的变换矩阵 (v2=T*v1)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T"
msgid "Angular velocity from frame 2 with respect to frame 1, resolved in frame 2 (skew(w)=T*der(transpose(T)))"
msgstr "在坐标系 2 中解析的相对于坐标系 1 的角速度，解析在坐标系 2 中 (skew(w)=T*der(transpose(T)))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系 1 旋转到坐标系 2 的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>from_T</strong>(T, w);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns an\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a>&nbsp;R\r\n"
"assembled from a transformation matrix&nbsp;T and an angular velocity vector&nbsp;w.\r\n"
"Generally, the transformation matrix&nbsp;T can be gained using a function from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices\">TransformationMatrices</a>\r\n"
"package.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T\">to_T</a>.\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T_inv\">from_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T\">TransformationMatrices.from_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T\">Quaternions.from_T</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>from_T</strong>(T, w);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数返回由变换矩阵&nbsp;T 和角速度矢量&nbsp;w 组装而成的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a>&nbsp;R。\r\n"
"通常情况下，变换矩阵&nbsp;T 可以通过使用\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices\">TransformationMatrices</a>\r\n"
"包中的函数获得。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T\">to_T</a>、\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T_inv\">from_T_inv</a>、\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T\">TransformationMatrices.from_T</a>、\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T\">Quaternions.from_T</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T2"
msgid "Return orientation object R from transformation matrix T and its derivative der(T)"
msgstr "从变换矩阵T和其导数der(T)返回方向对象R"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T2"
msgid "Transformation matrix to transform vector from frame 1 to frame 2 (v2=T*v1)"
msgstr "将矢量从坐标系 1 转换到坐标系 2 的变换矩阵 (v2=T*v1)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T2"
msgid "= der(T)"
msgstr "= der(T)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T2"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系 1 旋转到坐标系 2 的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>from_T2</strong>(T, der_T);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Computes the orientation object from a transformation matrix T and\r\n"
"the derivative der(T) of the transformation matrix.\r\n"
"Usually, it is more efficient to use function \"from_T\" instead, where\r\n"
"the angular velocity has to be given as input argument. Only if this\r\n"
"is not possible or too difficult to compute, use function from_T2(&hellip;).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T\">from_T</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>from_T2</strong>(T, der_T);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"从变换矩阵 T 和变换矩阵的导数 der(T) 计算方向对象。\r\n"
"通常情况下，更有效的做法是使用函数 \"from_T\"，其中角速度必须作为输入参数给出。\r\n"
"仅当这不可行或者计算过于困难时，才使用函数 from_T2(&hellip;)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T\">from_T</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T_inv"
msgid "Return orientation object R from inverse transformation matrix T_inv"
msgstr "从逆变换矩阵 T_inv 返回方向对象 R"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T_inv"
msgid "Inverse transformation matrix to transform vector from frame 2 to frame 1 (v1=T_inv*v2)"
msgstr "将矢量从坐标系 2 转换到坐标系 1 的逆变换矩阵 (v1=T_inv*v2)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T_inv"
msgid "Angular velocity from frame 1 with respect to frame 2, resolved in frame 1 (skew(w)=T_inv*der(transpose(T_inv)))"
msgstr "坐标系 1 相对于坐标系 2 的角速度，以坐标系 1 为基准 (skew(w)=T_inv*der(transpose(T_inv)))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T_inv"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系 1 旋转到坐标系 2 的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T_inv"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>from_T_inv</strong>(T_inv, w);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns an\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a>&nbsp;R\r\n"
"assembled from an inverse transformation matrix T_inv and a correspondent angular velocity vector&nbsp;w.\r\n"
"Generally, the transformation matrix T_inv can be gained using a function from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices\">TransformationMatrices</a>\r\n"
"package, e.g. using T_inv = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation\">inverseRotation</a>(T).\r\n"
"Note that the velocity vector&nbsp;w has to be calculated accordingly.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T\">from_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv\">TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T_inv\">Quaternions.from_T_inv</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>from_T_inv</strong>(T_inv, w);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从逆变换矩阵 T_inv 和对应的角速度矢量 w 中返回一个\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a>&nbsp;R。\r\n"
"通常情况下，可以使用来自\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices\">TransformationMatrices</a>\r\n"
"包的函数来获取变换矩阵 T_inv，例如使用 T_inv = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation\">inverseRotation</a>(T)。\r\n"
"请注意，速度矢量&nbsp;w 必须相应计算。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T\">from_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv\">TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T_inv\">Quaternions.from_T_inv</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_Q"
msgid "Return orientation object R from quaternion orientation object Q"
msgstr "从四元数方向对象Q返回方向对象R"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_Q"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_Q"
msgid "Angular velocity from frame 2 with respect to frame 1, resolved in frame 2"
msgstr "坐标系2相对于坐标系1的角速度，在坐标系2下解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_Q"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_Q"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>from_Q</strong>(Q, w);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns an <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a>&nbsp;R\r\n"
"computed from a <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternion object</a>&nbsp;Q\r\n"
"and an angular velocity vector&nbsp;w.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_Q\">to_Q</a>.\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_Q\">TransformationMatrices.from_Q</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = Frames.<strong>from_Q</strong>(Q, w);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从四元数方向对象Q和角速度矢量w中返回一个\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">方向对象</a>R。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_Q\">to_Q</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_Q\">TransformationMatrices.from_Q</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T"
msgid "Return transformation matrix T from orientation object R"
msgstr "从方向对象R返回转换矩阵 T"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T"
msgid "Transformation matrix to transform vector from frame 1 to frame 2 (v2=T*v1)"
msgstr "将向量从坐标系1转换到坐标系2的转换矩阵(v2=T*v1)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = Frames.<strong>to_T</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a real matrix&nbsp;T\r\n"
"<!--<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T-->\r\n"
"computed from an\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a>&nbsp;R.\r\n"
"The matrix&nbsp;T is considered to be an object transformation matrix.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T\">from_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T_inv\">to_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T\">TransformationMatrices.to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T\">Quaternions.to_T</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = Frames.<strong>to_T</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从一个\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">方向对象</a>R\r\n"
"计算并得到一个实数矩阵T。矩阵T被视为一个对象转换矩阵。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T\">from_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T_inv\">to_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T\">TransformationMatrices.to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T\">Quaternions.to_T</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T_inv"
msgid "Return inverse transformation matrix T_inv from orientation object R"
msgstr "从方向对象R返回逆转换矩阵T_inv"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T_inv"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T_inv"
msgid "Inverse transformation matrix to transform vector from frame 2 into frame 1 (v1=T_inv*v2)"
msgstr "将向量从坐标系2转换到坐标系1的逆转换矩阵(v1=T_inv*v2)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T_inv"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T_inv = Frames.<strong>to_T_inv</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a real matrix T_inv\r\n"
"<!--<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T_inv-->\r\n"
"computed from an\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a>&nbsp;R.\r\n"
"The matrix T_inv is considered to be an inverse transformation matrix.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T_inv\">from_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T\">to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv\">TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T_inv\">Quaternions.to_T_inv</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T_inv = Frames.<strong>to_T_inv</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从一个\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">方向对象</a>&nbsp;R\r\n"
"计算并返回一个实数矩阵&nbsp;T_inv。\r\n"
"矩阵&nbsp;T_inv被视为一个逆转换矩阵。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>·\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T_inv\">from_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T\">to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv\">TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T_inv\">Quaternions.to_T_inv</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_Q"
msgid "Return quaternion orientation object Q from orientation object R"
msgstr "从方向对象R返回四元数方向对象Q"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_Q"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_Q"
msgid "Guess value for output Q (there are 2 solutions; the one closer to Q_guess is used)"
msgstr "输出Q的猜测值(有2个解决方案；选择离Q_guess更近的那个)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_Q"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_Q"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q = Frames.<strong>to_Q</strong>(R, Q_guess);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternion object</a>&nbsp;Q\r\n"
"computed from an <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a>&nbsp;R\r\n"
"and depending on the initial guess Q_guess.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_Q\">from_Q</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_Q\">TransformationMatrices.to_Q</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q = Frames.<strong>to_Q</strong>(R, Q_guess);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从一个\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">方向对象</a>R\r\n"
"计算并得到一个<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">四元数对象</a>Q，\r\n"
"取决于初始猜测值Q_guess。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_Q\">from_Q</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_Q\">TransformationMatrices.to_Q</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_vector"
msgid "Map rotation object into vector"
msgstr "将旋转对象映射为矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_vector"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_vector"
msgid "Elements of R in one vector"
msgstr "R中的元素组成的一个矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_vector"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"vec = Frames.<strong>to_vector</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a vector vec which contains elements of a transformation matrix&nbsp;T\r\n"
"computed from an\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a>&nbsp;R.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T\">to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_vector\">TransformationMatrices.to_vector</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"vec = Frames.<strong>to_vector</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回一个矢量 vec，其中包含从一个\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">方向对象</a>&nbsp;R\r\n"
"计算得到的变换矩阵&nbsp;T 的元素。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T\">to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_vector\">TransformationMatrices.to_vector</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_exy"
msgid "Map rotation object into e_x and e_y vectors of frame 2, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "将旋转对象映射为坐标系2的轴e_x和e_y矢量在坐标系1中的解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_exy"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_exy"
msgid "= [e_x, e_y] where e_x and e_y are axes unit vectors of frame 2, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "= [e_x, e_y]，其中e_x和e_y是表示坐标系2轴的单位矢量，在坐标系1中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_exy"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"exy = Frames.<strong>to_exy</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns unit vectors e_x and e_y which define axes of frame&nbsp;2 resolved in frame&nbsp;1,\r\n"
"provided&nbsp;R is an <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a>\r\n"
"to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxy\">from_nxy</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxz\">from_nxz</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_exy\">TransformationMatrices.to_exy</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"exy = Frames.<strong>to_exy</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回单位矢量e_x和e_y，它们定义了坐标系2的轴在坐标系1中解析的坐标列阵，\r\n"
"其中R是一个<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">方向对象</a>，\r\n"
"用于将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxy\">from_nxy</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxz\">from_nxz</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_exy\">TransformationMatrices.to_exy</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axis"
msgid "Return unit vector for x-, y-, or z-axis"
msgstr "返回x轴、y轴或z轴的单位矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axis"
msgid "Axis vector to be returned"
msgstr "要返回的轴矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axis"
msgid "Unit axis vector"
msgstr "单位轴矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axis"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"e = Frames.<strong>axis</strong>(axis);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A unit vector&nbsp;e is returned depending on whether x-, y-, or z-axis is required.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
" axis  |    e\r\n"
"-------+-----------\r\n"
"  1    |  {1,0,0}\r\n"
"  2    |  {1,0,0}\r\n"
"  3    |  {1,0,0}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"e = Frames.<strong>axis</strong>(axis);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"根据需要返回x轴、y轴或z轴的单位矢量&nbsp;e。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
" axis  |    e\r\n"
"-------+-----------\r\n"
"  1    |  {1,0,0}\r\n"
"  2    |  {0,1,0}\r\n"
"  3    |  {0,0,1}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions"
msgid "Functions to transform rotational frame quantities based on quaternions (also called Euler parameters)"
msgstr "基于四元数(也称为欧拉参数)转换旋转坐标系量的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Package <strong>Frames.Quaternions</strong> contains type definitions and\r\n"
"functions to transform rotational frame quantities with quaternions.\r\n"
"Functions of this package are currently only utilized in\r\n"
"MultiBody.Parts.Body components, when quaternions shall be used\r\n"
"as parts of the body states.\r\n"
"Some functions are also used in a new Modelica package for\r\n"
"B-Spline interpolation that is able to interpolate paths consisting of\r\n"
"position vectors and orientation objects.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Content</h4>\r\n"
"<p>In the table below an example is given for every function definition.\r\n"
"The used variables have the following declaration:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Quaternions.Orientation Q, Q1, Q2, Q_rel, Q_inv;\r\n"
"Real[3,3]   T, T_inv;\r\n"
"Real[3]     v1, v2, w1, w2, n_x, n_y, n_z, res_ori, phi;\r\n"
"Real[6]     res_equal;\r\n"
"Real        L, angle;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><th><strong><em>Function/type</em></strong></th><th><strong><em>Description</em></strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>Orientation Q;</strong></td>\r\n"
"      <td>New type defining a quaternion object that describes<br>\r\n"
"          the rotation of frame 1 into frame 2.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>der_Orientation</strong> der_Q;</td>\r\n"
"      <td>New type defining the first time derivative\r\n"
"         of Frames.Quaternions.Orientation.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>res_ori = <strong>orientationConstraint</strong>(Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return the constraints between the variables of a quaternion object<br>\r\n"
"      (shall be zero).</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>w1 = <strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(Q, der_Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return angular velocity resolved in frame 1 from\r\n"
"          quaternion object Q<br> and its derivative der_Q.\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>w2 = <strong>angularVelocity2</strong>(Q, der_Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return angular velocity resolved in frame 2 from\r\n"
"          quaternion object Q<br> and its derivative der_Q.\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>v1 = <strong>resolve1</strong>(Q,v2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Transform vector v2 from frame 2 to frame 1.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>v2 = <strong>resolve2</strong>(Q,v1);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Transform vector v1 from frame 1 to frame 2.\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>[v1,w1] = <strong>multipleResolve1</strong>(Q, [v2,w2]);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Transform several vectors from frame 2 to frame 1.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>[v2,w2] = <strong>multipleResolve2</strong>(Q, [v1,w1]);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Transform several vectors from frame 1 to frame 2.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q = <strong>nullRotation</strong>()</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return quaternion object R that does not rotate a frame.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q_inv = <strong>inverseRotation</strong>(Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return inverse quaternion object.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q_rel = <strong>relativeRotation</strong>(Q1,Q2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return relative quaternion object from two absolute\r\n"
"          quaternion objects.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q2 = <strong>absoluteRotation</strong>(Q1,Q_rel);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return absolute quaternion object from another\r\n"
"          absolute<br> and a relative quaternion object.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q = <strong>planarRotation</strong>(e, angle);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return quaternion object of a planar rotation.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>phi = <strong>smallRotation</strong>(Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return rotation angles phi valid for a small rotation.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q = <strong>from_T</strong>(T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return quaternion object Q from transformation matrix T.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q = <strong>from_T_inv</strong>(T_inv);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return quaternion object Q from inverse transformation matrix T_inv.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>to_T</strong>(Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return transformation matrix T from quaternion object Q.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T_inv = <strong>to_T_inv</strong>(Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return inverse transformation matrix T_inv from quaternion object Q.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Quaternions</strong>包中含有类型定义和函数，用于使用四元数转换旋转坐标系量。\r\n"
"此包中的函数目前仅在当需要将四元数用作构件状态的一部分时在MultiBody.Parts.Body 组件中使用。\r\n"
"一些函数也在用于新的 Modelica 包，用于 B-Spline 插值，能够插值由位置矢量和方向对象组成的路径。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>内容</h4>\r\n"
"<p>下表给出了每个函数定义的示例。使用的变量具有以下声明：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Quaternions.Orientation Q, Q1, Q2, Q_rel, Q_inv;\r\n"
"Real[3,3]   T, T_inv;\r\n"
"Real[3]     v1, v2, w1, w2, n_x, n_y, n_z, res_ori, phi;\r\n"
"Real[6]     res_equal;\r\n"
"Real        L, angle;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><th><strong><em>函数/类型</em></strong></th><th><strong><em>描述</em></strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>Orientation Q;</strong></td>\r\n"
"      <td>定义一个新类型，描述了将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的四元数对象。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>der_Orientation</strong> der_Q;</td>\r\n"
"      <td>定义了Frames.Quaternions.Orientation的一阶时间导数。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>res_ori = <strong>orientationConstraint</strong>(Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回四元数对象的变量之间的约束(应为零)。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>w1 = <strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(Q, der_Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从四元数对象Q及其导数der_Q解析出在坐标系1中的角速度。\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>w2 = <strong>angularVelocity2</strong>(Q, der_Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从四元数对象Q及其导数der_Q解析出在坐标系2中的角速度。\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>v1 = <strong>resolve1</strong>(Q,v2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>将矢量v2从坐标系2变换到坐标系1。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>v2 = <strong>resolve2</strong>(Q,v1);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>将矢量v1从坐标系1变换到坐标系2。\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>[v1,w1] = <strong>multipleResolve1</strong>(Q, [v2,w2]);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>将多个矢量从坐标系2变换到坐标系1。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>[v2,w2] = <strong>multipleResolve2</strong>(Q, [v1,w1]);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>将多个矢量从坐标系1变换到坐标系2。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q = <strong>nullRotation</strong>();</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回不旋转坐标系的四元数对象 R。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q_inv = <strong>inverseRotation</strong>(Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回逆四元数对象。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q_rel = <strong>relativeRotation</strong>(Q1,Q2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从两个绝对四元数对象返回相对四元数对象。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q2 = <strong>absoluteRotation</strong>(Q1,Q_rel);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从另一个绝对四元数对象和一个相对四元数对象返回绝对四元数对象。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q = <strong>planarRotation</strong>(e, angle);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回平面旋转的四元数对象。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>phi = <strong>smallRotation</strong>(Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回小旋转有效的旋转角度 phi。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q = <strong>from_T</strong>(T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从变换矩阵 T 返回四元数对象 Q。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q = <strong>from_T_inv</strong>(T_inv);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从逆变换矩阵 T_inv 返回四元数对象 Q。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>to_T</strong>(Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从四元数对象 Q 返回变换矩阵 T。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T_inv = <strong>to_T_inv</strong>(Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从四元数对象 Q 返回逆变换矩阵 T_inv。</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions"
msgid "First time derivative of Quaternions.Orientation"
msgstr "Quaternions.Orientation对时间的一阶导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation"
msgid "Orientation type defining rotation from a frame 1 into a frame 2 with quaternions {p1,p2,p3,p0}"
msgstr "定义使用四元数从坐标系21旋转到坐标系2的方向类型 {p1,p2,p3,p0}"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This type describes the <strong>rotation</strong> to rotate a frame 1 into\r\n"
"a frame 2 using quaternions (also called <strong>Euler parameters</strong>)\r\n"
"according to the following definition:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Quaternions.Orientation Q;\r\n"
"Real  n[3];\r\n"
"Real  phi(unit=\"rad\");\r\n"
"Q = [ n*sin(phi/2)\r\n"
"        cos(phi/2) ]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where \"n\" is the <strong>axis of rotation</strong> to rotate frame 1 into\r\n"
"frame 2 and \"phi\" is the <strong>rotation angle</strong> for this rotation.\r\n"
"Vector \"n\" is either resolved in frame 1 or in frame 2\r\n"
"(the result is the same since the coordinates of \"n\" with respect to\r\n"
"frame 1 are identical to its coordinates with respect to frame 2).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The term \"quaternions\" is preferred over the historically\r\n"
"more reasonable \"Euler parameters\" in order to not get\r\n"
"confused with Modelica \"parameters\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此类型描述了使用四元数(也称为<strong>Euler参数</strong>)将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的<strong>旋转</strong>，根据以下定义：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Quaternions.Orientation Q;\r\n"
"Real  n[3];\r\n"
"Real  phi(unit=\"rad\");\r\n"
"Q = [ n*sin(phi/2)\r\n"
"        cos(phi/2) ]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中“n”是将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的<strong>旋转轴</strong>，而“phi”是此旋转的<strong>旋转角度</strong>。\r\n"
"矢量“n”可以在坐标系1或坐标系2中解析\r\n"
"(结果相同，因为“n”相对于坐标系1的坐标与其相对于坐标系2的坐标相同)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"为了不与Modelica“参数”混淆，更倾向于使用术语“四元数”而不是历史上更合理的“Euler参数”。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation.equalityConstraint"
msgid "Return the constraint residues to express that two frames have the same quaternion orientation"
msgstr "返回约束残差，以表达两个坐标系具有相同的四元数方向"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation.equalityConstraint"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 1"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系1的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation.equalityConstraint"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation.equalityConstraint"
msgid "Zero vector if Q1 and Q2 are identical (the first three elements of the relative transformation (is {0,0,0} for the null rotation, guarded by atan2 to make the mirrored solution invalid"
msgstr "如果Q1和Q2相同(相对变换的前三个元素为{0,0,0}表示空旋转，由atan2保护，使镜像解无效"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation.equalityConstraint"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"residue = Orientation.<strong>equalityConstraint</strong>(Q1, Q2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns the Real residue vector with&nbsp;3 elements.\r\n"
"This vector has zero elements if quaternions objects Q1 and Q2 are identical,\r\n"
"i.e. they describe the same orientation.\r\n"
"The residue vector is determined by the relative quaternion object between\r\n"
"Q1 and Q2 to formulate the residue in such a way that only identical\r\n"
"orientation objects lead to a zero residue vector.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"residue = Orientation.<strong>equalityConstraint</strong>(Q1, Q2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回具有3个元素的Real残差矢量。\r\n"
"如果四元数对象Q1和Q2相同，则此矢量的元素为零，\r\n"
"即它们描述相同的方向。\r\n"
"残差矢量由Q1和Q2之间的相对四元数对象确定，\r\n"
"以便以仅相同的方向对象导致零残差矢量。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.orientationConstraint"
msgid "Return residues of orientation constraints (shall be zero)"
msgstr "返回方向约束的残差(应为零)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.orientationConstraint"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.orientationConstraint"
msgid "Residue constraint (shall be zero)"
msgstr "残差约束(应为零)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.orientationConstraint"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"residue = Quaternions.<strong>orientationConstraint</strong>(Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns the Real residue vector with&nbsp;1 element only that describes the constraints\r\n"
"between the&nbsp;4 elements of the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.orientationConstraint\">Frames.orientationConstraint</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.orientationConstraint\">TransformationMatrices.orientationConstraint</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"residue = Quaternions.<strong>orientationConstraint</strong>(Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回具有一个元素的Real残差矢量，描述了\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q的四个元素之间的约束。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.orientationConstraint\">Frames.orientationConstraint</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.orientationConstraint\">TransformationMatrices.orientationConstraint</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity1"
msgid "Compute angular velocity resolved in frame 1 from quaternions orientation object and its derivative"
msgstr "从四元数方向对象及其导数计算在坐标系1中解析的角速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity1"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity1"
msgid "Derivative of Q"
msgstr "Q的导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity1"
msgid "Angular velocity of frame 2 with respect to frame 1 resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "坐标系2相对于坐标系1的角速度在坐标系1中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity1"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = Quaternions.<strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(Q, der_Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns the angular velocity&nbsp;w of frame&nbsp;2 with\r\n"
"respect to frame&nbsp;1, <strong>resolved in frame&nbsp;1</strong>, from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2\r\n"
"and from its first time derivative der_Q.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity1\">Frames.angularVelocity1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity1\">TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = Quaternions.<strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(Q, der_Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从描述将frame&nbsp;1旋转到frame&nbsp;2的方向的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q及其第一时间导数der_Q，\r\n"
"返回frame&nbsp;2相对于frame&nbsp;1的角速度w，<strong>解析在frame&nbsp;1中</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity1\">Frames.angularVelocity1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity1\">TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity2"
msgid "Compute angular velocity resolved in frame 2 from quaternions orientation object and its derivative"
msgstr "从四元数方向对象及其导数计算在坐标系 2中解析的角速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity2"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity2"
msgid "Derivative of Q"
msgstr "Q的导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity2"
msgid "Angular velocity of frame 2 with respect to frame 1 resolved in frame 2"
msgstr "相对于坐标系1解析的坐标系2的角速度在坐标系2中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = Quaternions.<strong>angularVelocity2</strong>(Q, der_Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns the angular velocity&nbsp;w of frame&nbsp;2 with\r\n"
"respect to frame&nbsp;1, <strong>resolved in frame&nbsp;2</strong>, from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2\r\n"
"and from its first time derivative der_Q.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity2\">Frames.angularVelocity2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity2\">TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = Quaternions.<strong>angularVelocity2</strong>(Q, der_Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从描述将frame&nbsp;1旋转到frame&nbsp;2的方向的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternion orientation</a>&nbsp;Q及其第一时间导数der_Q，\r\n"
"返回坐标系2相对于坐标系1的角速度w，<strong>解析在坐标系2中</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity2\">Frames.angularVelocity2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity2\">TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve1"
msgid "Transform vector from frame 2 to frame 1"
msgstr "将矢量从坐标系2解析到坐标系1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve1"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve1"
msgid "Vector in frame 2"
msgstr "坐标系2中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve1"
msgid "Vector in frame 1"
msgstr "坐标系1中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve1"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v1 = Quaternions.<strong>resolve1</strong>(Q, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns vector&nbsp;v resolved in frame&nbsp;1 (=v1) from vector&nbsp;v\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;2 (=v2) using the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve2\">resolve2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve1\">Frames.resolve1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve1\">TransformationMatrices.resolve1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v1 = Quaternions.<strong>resolve1</strong>(Q, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从在坐标系 2中解析的矢量v(=v2)使用描述将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q，\r\n"
"返回在坐标系1中解析的矢量v(=v1)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve2\">resolve2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve1\">Frames.resolve1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve1\">TransformationMatrices.resolve1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve2"
msgid "Transform vector from frame 1 to frame 2"
msgstr "从坐标系1到坐标系2的变换矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve2"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系 1旋转到坐标系 2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve2"
msgid "Vector in frame 1"
msgstr "坐标系 1中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve2"
msgid "Vector in frame 2"
msgstr "坐标系 2中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = Quaternions.<strong>resolve2</strong>(Q, v1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns vector&nbsp;v resolved in frame&nbsp;2 (=v2) from vector&nbsp;v\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;1 (=v1) using the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve1\">resolve1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve2\">Frames.resolve2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve2\">TransformationMatrices.resolve2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = Quaternions.<strong>resolve2</strong>(Q, v1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从在坐标系1中解析的矢量v(=v1)使用将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q，\r\n"
"返回在坐标系2中解析的矢量v(=v2)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve1\">resolve1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve2\">Frames.resolve2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve2\">TransformationMatrices.resolve2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.multipleResolve1"
msgid "Transform several vectors from frame 2 to frame 1"
msgstr "将多个矢量从坐标系2转换到坐标系1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.multipleResolve1"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.multipleResolve1"
msgid "Vectors in frame 2"
msgstr "坐标系2中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.multipleResolve1"
msgid "Vectors in frame 1"
msgstr "坐标系1中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.multipleResolve1"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v1 = Quaternions.<strong>multipleResolve1</strong>(Q, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns vectors&nbsp;v resolved in frame&nbsp;1 (=v1) from vectors&nbsp;v\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;2 (=v2) using the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve1\">TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v1 = Quaternions.<strong>multipleResolve1</strong>(Q, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从在坐标系2中解析的多个矢量v(=v2)使用\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternion orientation</a>&nbsp;Q，将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2。\r\n"
"返回在坐标系1中解析的矢量v(=v1)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve1\">TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.multipleResolve2"
msgid "Transform several vectors from frame 1 to frame 2"
msgstr "将多个向量从坐标系1转换到坐标系2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.multipleResolve2"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.multipleResolve2"
msgid "Vectors in frame 1"
msgstr "坐标系1中的向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.multipleResolve2"
msgid "Vectors in frame 2"
msgstr "坐标系2中的向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.multipleResolve2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = Quaternions.<strong>multipleResolve2</strong>(Q, v1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns vectors&nbsp;v resolved in frame&nbsp;2 (=v2) from vectors&nbsp;v\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;1 (=v1) using the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve2\">TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = Quaternions.<strong>multipleResolve2</strong>(Q, v1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从在坐标系1中解析的多个向量v(=v1)使用<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternion orientation</a>&nbsp;Q将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2，返回在坐标系2中解析的向量v(=v2)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve2\">TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.nullRotation"
msgid "Return quaternion orientation object that does not rotate a frame"
msgstr "返回一个不旋转frame的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.nullRotation"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系 1旋转到坐标系 2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.nullRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q = Quaternions.<strong>nullRotation</strong>();\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q\r\n"
"describing the orientation object to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2, if frame&nbsp;1 and frame&nbsp;2 are identical.\r\n"
"(= transformation matrix is identity matrix and angular velocity is zero).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.nullRotation\">Frames.nullRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.nullRotation\">TransformationMatrices.nullRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q = Quaternions.<strong>nullRotation</strong>();\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果坐标系&nbsp;1和坐标系&nbsp;2是相同的则此函数返回一个将坐标系&nbsp;1旋转到坐标系&nbsp;2的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">四元数方向</a>&nbsp;Q。(= 变换矩阵是单位矩阵且角速度为零)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.nullRotation\">Frames.nullRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.nullRotation\">TransformationMatrices.nullRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.inverseRotation"
msgid "Return inverse quaternions orientation object"
msgstr "返回逆四元数方向的对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.inverseRotation"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系 1旋转到坐标系 2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.inverseRotation"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 2 into frame 1"
msgstr "将坐标系 2旋转到坐标系 1的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.inverseRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q_inv = Quaternions.<strong>inverseRotation</strong>(Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q_inv\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;2 to frame&nbsp;1\r\n"
"from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.inverseRotation\">Frames.inverseRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation\">TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation</a>.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q_inv = Quaternions.<strong>inverseRotation</strong>(Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回描述了从坐标系&nbsp;2旋转到坐标系&nbsp;1的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q_inv，\r\n"
"其描述了从坐标系&nbsp;1旋转到坐标系&nbsp;2的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.inverseRotation\">Frames.inverseRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation\">TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.relativeRotation"
msgid "Return relative quaternions orientation object"
msgstr "返回相对四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.relativeRotation"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 1"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系1的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.relativeRotation"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.relativeRotation"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.relativeRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q_rel = Quaternions.<strong>relativeRotation</strong>(Q1, Q2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q_rel\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 to frame&nbsp;2 from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q1\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;0 to frame&nbsp;1 and from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q2\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;0 to frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.relativeRotation\">Frames.relativeRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.relativeRotation\">TransformationMatrices.relativeRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q_rel = Quaternions.<strong>relativeRotation</strong>(Q1, Q2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q_rel，\r\n"
"描述了从将坐标系&nbsp;1旋转到坐标系&nbsp;2的方向，\r\n"
"其中<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q1\r\n"
"描述了从将坐标系&nbsp;0旋转到坐标系&nbsp;1的方向，\r\n"
"而<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q2\r\n"
"描述了从将坐标系&nbsp;0旋转到坐标系&nbsp;2的方向。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.relativeRotation\">Frames.relativeRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.relativeRotation\">TransformationMatrices.relativeRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.absoluteRotation"
msgid "Return absolute quaternions orientation object from another absolute and a relative quaternions orientation object"
msgstr "返回另一个绝对四元数方向对象的绝对四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.absoluteRotation"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 1"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系1的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.absoluteRotation"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的相对四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.absoluteRotation"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.absoluteRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q2 = Quaternions.<strong>absoluteRotation</strong>(Q1, Q_rel);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q2\r\n"
"that describes the orientation frame&nbsp;0 to frame&nbsp;2 from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q1\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;0 to frame&nbsp;1 and from the relative\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a> Q_rel\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;1 to frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.absoluteRotation\">Frames.absoluteRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.absoluteRotation\">TransformationMatrices.absoluteRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q2 = Quaternions.<strong>absoluteRotation</strong>(Q1, Q_rel);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q2，\r\n"
"描述了从将坐标系&nbsp;0旋转到坐标系&nbsp;2的方向，\r\n"
"其中<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q1\r\n"
"描述了从将坐标系&nbsp;0旋转到坐标系&nbsp;1的方向，\r\n"
"而相对的<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q_rel\r\n"
"描述了从将坐标系&nbsp;1旋转到坐标系&nbsp;2的方向。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.absoluteRotation\">Frames.absoluteRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.absoluteRotation\">TransformationMatrices.absoluteRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.planarRotation"
msgid "Return quaternion orientation object of a planar rotation"
msgstr "返回平面旋转的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.planarRotation"
msgid "Normalized axis of rotation (must have length=1)"
msgstr "旋转轴的标准化矢量（必须长度为1）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.planarRotation"
msgid "Rotation angle to rotate frame 1 into frame 2 along axis e"
msgstr "将坐标系1沿轴e旋转到坐标系2的旋转角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.planarRotation"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2 along axis e"
msgstr "将坐标系1沿轴e旋转到坐标系2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.planarRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q = Quaternions.<strong>planarRotation</strong>(e, angle);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate in the plane along unit\r\n"
"axis <strong>e</strong> from frame 1 into frame 2 with angle <strong>angle</strong>.\r\n"
"Note, \"e\" must be a unit vector. However, this is not checked in this function and the function will\r\n"
"return a wrong result, if length(e) is not one.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotation\">Frames.planarRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotation\">TransformationMatrices.planarRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q = Quaternions.<strong>planarRotation</strong>(e, angle);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q，\r\n"
"描述了沿单位轴<strong>e</strong>从坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向，\r\n"
"角度为<strong>angle</strong>。\r\n"
"注意，\"e\" 必须是单位矢量。但是，此函数不会检查此条件，如果e的长度不为1，则函数将返回错误的结果。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotation\">Frames.planarRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotation\">TransformationMatrices.planarRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.smallRotation"
msgid "Return rotation angles valid for a small rotation"
msgstr "返回适用于小旋转的旋转角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.smallRotation"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.smallRotation"
msgid "The rotation angles around x-, y-, and z-axis of frame 1 to rotate frame 1 into frame 2 for a small relative rotation"
msgstr "坐标系1围绕x轴、y轴和z轴的旋转角度，用于将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的小相对旋转"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.smallRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"phi = Quaternions.<strong>smallRotation</strong>(Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns rotation angles valid for a small rotation of x-y-z sequence (i.e. {1,2,3}).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.smallRotation\">Frames.smallRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.smallRotation\">TransformationMatrices.smallRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"phi = Quaternions.<strong>smallRotation</strong>(Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回适用于小旋转角度的旋转，采用x-y-z顺序(即{1,2,3})。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.smallRotation\">Frames.smallRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.smallRotation\">TransformationMatrices.smallRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T"
msgid "Return quaternion orientation object Q from transformation matrix T"
msgstr "从变换矩阵T返回四元数方向对象Q"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T"
msgid "Transformation matrix to transform vector from frame 1 to frame 2 (v2=T*v1)"
msgstr "将矢量从坐标系 1 转换到坐标系 2 的变换矩阵(v2=T*v1)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T"
msgid "Guess value for Q (there are 2 solutions; the one close to Q_guess is used"
msgstr "Q 的猜测值(有 2 个解；选择接近 Q_guess 的一个解)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2 (Q and -Q have same transformation matrix)"
msgstr "将坐标系 1 旋转到坐标系 2 的四元数方向对象(Q 和 -Q 具有相同的变换矩阵)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q = Quaternions.<strong>from_T</strong>(T, Q_guess);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q.\r\n"
"computed from a transformation matrix&nbsp;T\r\n"
"and depending on the initial guess Q_guess.\r\n"
"Generally, the transformation matrix&nbsp;T can be gained using a function from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices\">TransformationMatrices</a>\r\n"
"package.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T\">to_T</a>.\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T_inv\">from_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T\">Frames.from_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T\">TransformationMatrices.from_T</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q = Quaternions.<strong>from_T</strong>(T, Q_guess);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从变换矩阵&nbsp;T 计算得到一个\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q。\r\n"
"取决于初始猜测 Q_guess。\r\n"
"通常，变换矩阵&nbsp;T 可以通过\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices\">TransformationMatrices</a>\r\n"
"包中的函数获得。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T\">to_T</a>、\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T_inv\">from_T_inv</a>、\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T\">Frames.from_T</a>、\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T\">TransformationMatrices.from_T</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T_inv"
msgid "Return quaternion orientation object Q from inverse transformation matrix T_inv"
msgstr "从逆变换矩阵T_inv返回四元数方向对象Q"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T_inv"
msgid "Inverse transformation matrix to transform vector from frame 2 to frame 1 (v1=T_inv*v2)"
msgstr "将矢量从坐标系 2 转换到坐标系 1 的逆变换矩阵(v1=T_inv*v2)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T_inv"
msgid "Guess value for output Q (there are 2 solutions; the one closer to Q_guess is used"
msgstr "Q 的猜测值(有 2 个解；选择接近 Q_guess 的一个解)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T_inv"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2 (Q and -Q have same transformation matrix)"
msgstr "将坐标系 2 旋转到坐标系 1 的四元数方向对象(Q 和 -Q 具有相同的变换矩阵)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T_inv"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q = Quaternions.<strong>from_T_inv</strong>(T_inv, Q_guess);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q.\r\n"
"computed from an inverse transformation matrix T_inv\r\n"
"and depending on the initial guess Q_guess.\r\n"
"Generally, the transformation matrix T_inv can be gained using a function from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices\">TransformationMatrices</a>\r\n"
"package, e.g. using T_inv = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation\">inverseRotation</a>(T).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T\">from_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T_inv\">Frames.from_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv\">TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q = Quaternions.<strong>from_T_inv</strong>(T_inv, Q_guess);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从逆变换矩阵 T_inv 计算得到一个\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q。\r\n"
"取决于初始猜测 Q_guess。\r\n"
"通常，逆变换矩阵 T_inv 可以通过使用\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation\">inverseRotation</a>(T)等函数获得。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T\">from_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T_inv\">Frames.from_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv\">TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T"
msgid "Return transformation matrix T from quaternion orientation object Q"
msgstr "从四元数方向对象Q返回变换矩阵T"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系 1 旋转到坐标系 2 的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T"
msgid "Transformation matrix to transform vector from frame 1 to frame 2 (v2=T*v1)"
msgstr "用于将矢量从坐标系 1 转换到坐标系 2 的变换矩阵 (v2=T*v1)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = Quaternions.<strong>to_T</strong>(Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a real matrix&nbsp;T\r\n"
"<!--<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T-->\r\n"
"computed from a\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q.\r\n"
"The matrix&nbsp;T is considered to be an object transformation matrix.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T\">from_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T_inv\">to_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T\">Frames.to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T\">TransformationMatrices.to_T</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = Quaternions.<strong>to_T</strong>(Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从四元数方向对象&nbsp;Q 计算出一个实数矩阵&nbsp;T。\r\n"
"<!--<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T-->\r\n"
"从一个\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q 计算出矩阵&nbsp;T。\r\n"
"矩阵&nbsp;T 被认为是一个对象变换矩阵。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T\">from_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T_inv\">to_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T\">Frames.to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T\">TransformationMatrices.to_T</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T_inv"
msgid "Return inverse transformation matrix T_inv from quaternion orientation object Q"
msgstr "从四元数方向对象Q返回逆变换矩阵T_inv"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T_inv"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系 1 旋转到坐标系 2 的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T_inv"
msgid "Transformation matrix to transform vector from frame 2 to frame 1 (v1=T*v2)"
msgstr "用于将矢量从坐标系 2 转换到坐标系 1 的变换矩阵 (v1=T_inv*v2)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T_inv"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T_inv = Quaternions.<strong>to_T_inv</strong>(Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a real matrix&nbsp;T_inv\r\n"
"computed from a\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q.\r\n"
"The matrix&nbsp;T is considered to be an inverse transformation matrix.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T\">to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T_inv\">from_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T_inv\">Frames.to_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv\">TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T_inv = Quaternions.<strong>to_T_inv</strong>(Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从四元数方向对象&nbsp;Q 计算出一个实数矩阵&nbsp;T_inv。\r\n"
"<!--<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T_inv-->\r\n"
"从一个\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternions orientation</a>&nbsp;Q 计算出逆变换矩阵&nbsp;T_inv。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T\">to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.from_T_inv\">from_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T_inv\">Frames.to_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv\">TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices"
msgid "Functions for transformation matrices"
msgstr "变换矩阵的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Package <strong>Frames.TransformationMatrices</strong> contains type definitions and\r\n"
"functions to transform rotational frame quantities using\r\n"
"transformation matrices.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Content</h4>\r\n"
"<p>In the table below an example is given for every function definition.\r\n"
"The used variables have the following declaration:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Orientation T, T1, T2, T_rel, T_inv;\r\n"
"Real[3]     v1, v2, w1, w2, n_x, n_y, n_z, e, e_x, res_ori, phi;\r\n"
"Real[6]     res_equal;\r\n"
"Real        L, angle;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><th><strong><em>Function/type</em></strong></th><th><strong><em>Description</em></strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>Orientation T;</strong></td>\r\n"
"      <td>New type defining an orientation object that describes<br>\r\n"
"          the rotation of frame 1 into frame 2.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>der_Orientation</strong> der_T;</td>\r\n"
"      <td>New type defining the first time derivative\r\n"
"         of Frames.Orientation.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>res_ori = <strong>orientationConstraint</strong>(T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return the constraints between the variables of an orientation object<br>\r\n"
"      (shall be zero).</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>w1 = <strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(T, der_T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return angular velocity resolved in frame 1 from\r\n"
"          orientation object T<br> and its derivative der_T.\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>w2 = <strong>angularVelocity2</strong>(T, der_T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return angular velocity resolved in frame 2 from\r\n"
"          orientation object T<br> and its derivative der_T.\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>v1 = <strong>resolve1</strong>(T,v2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Transform vector v2 from frame 2 to frame 1.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>v2 = <strong>resolve2</strong>(T,v1);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Transform vector v1 from frame 1 to frame 2.\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>[v1,w1] = <strong>multipleResolve1</strong>(T, [v2,w2]);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Transform several vectors from frame 2 to frame 1.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>[v2,w2] = <strong>multipleResolve2</strong>(T, [v1,w1]);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Transform several vectors from frame 1 to frame 2.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>D1 = <strong>resolveDyade1</strong>(T,D2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Transform second order tensor D2 from frame 2 to frame 1.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>D2 = <strong>resolveDyade2</strong>(T,D1);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Transform second order tensor D1 from frame 1 to frame 2.\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T= <strong>nullRotation</strong>()</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object T that does not rotate a frame.\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T_inv = <strong>inverseRotation</strong>(T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return inverse orientation object.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T_rel = <strong>relativeRotation</strong>(T1,T2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return relative orientation object from two absolute\r\n"
"          orientation objects.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T2 = <strong>absoluteRotation</strong>(T1,T_rel);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return absolute orientation object from another\r\n"
"          absolute<br> and a relative orientation object.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>planarRotation</strong>(e, angle);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object of a planar rotation.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>angle = <strong>planarRotationAngle</strong>(e, v1, v2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return angle of a planar rotation, given the rotation axis<br>\r\n"
"        and the representations of a vector in frame 1 and frame 2.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>axisRotation</strong>(i, angle);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object T for rotation around axis i of frame 1.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>axesRotations</strong>(sequence, angles);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return rotation object to rotate in sequence around 3 axes. Example:<br>\r\n"
"          T = axesRotations({1,2,3},{90,45,-90});\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>angles = <strong>axesRotationsAngles</strong>(T, sequence);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return the 3 angles to rotate in sequence around 3 axes to<br>\r\n"
"          construct the given orientation object.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>phi = <strong>smallRotation</strong>(T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return rotation angles phi valid for a small rotation.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>from_nxy</strong>(n_x, n_y);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object from n_x and n_y vectors.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>from_nxz</strong>(n_x, n_z);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object from n_x and n_z vectors.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>from_T</strong>(T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object R from transformation matrix T.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>from_T_inv</strong>(T_inv);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object R from inverse transformation matrix T_inv.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>from_Q</strong>(Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return orientation object T from quaternion orientation object Q.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>to_T</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return transformation matrix T from orientation object R.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T_inv = <strong>to_T_inv</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return inverse transformation matrix T_inv from orientation object R.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q = <strong>to_Q</strong>(T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return quaternion orientation object Q from orientation object T.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>exy = <strong>to_exy</strong>(T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Return [e_x, e_y] matrix of an orientation object T,<br>\r\n"
"          with e_x and e_y vectors of frame 2, resolved in frame 1.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Frames.TransformationMatrices</strong>中包含类型定义和\r\n"
"使用变换矩阵来转换旋转坐标系量的函数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>目录</h4>\r\n"
"<p>在下表中给出了每个函数定义的示例。\r\n"
"使用的变量具有以下声明：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Orientation T, T1, T2, T_rel, T_inv;\r\n"
"Real[3]     v1, v2, w1, w2, n_x, n_y, n_z, e, e_x, res_ori, phi;\r\n"
"Real[6]     res_equal;\r\n"
"Real        L, angle;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><th><strong><em>函数/类型</em></strong></th><th><strong><em>描述</em></strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>Orientation T;</strong></td>\r\n"
"      <td>定义了一个新类型，用于描述坐标系1到坐标系2的旋转。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>der_Orientation</strong> der_T;</td>\r\n"
"      <td>定义了一个新类型，Frames.Orientation对时间的一阶导数。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>res_ori = <strong>orientationConstraint</strong>(T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回一个方向对象中变量之间的约束(应等于零)。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>w1 = <strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(T, der_T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从方向对象T和其导数der_T中返回在坐标系1中解析的角速度。\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>w2 = <strong>angularVelocity2</strong>(T, der_T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从方向对象T和其导数der_T中返回在坐标系2中解析的角速度。\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>v1 = <strong>resolve1</strong>(T,v2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>将矢量v2从坐标系2转换到坐标系1。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>v2 = <strong>resolve2</strong>(T,v1);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>将矢量v1从坐标系1转换到坐标系2。\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>[v1,w1] = <strong>multipleResolve1</strong>(T, [v2,w2]);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>将多个矢量从坐标系2转换到坐标系1。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>[v2,w2] = <strong>multipleResolve2</strong>(T, [v1,w1]);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>将多个矢量从坐标系1转换到坐标系2。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>D1 = <strong>resolveDyade1</strong>(T,D2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>将二阶张量D2从坐标系2转换到坐标系1。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>D2 = <strong>resolveDyade2</strong>(T,D1);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>将二阶张量D1从坐标系1转换到坐标系2。\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>nullRotation</strong>()</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回一个没有旋转坐标系的方向对象T。\r\n"
"     </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T_inv = <strong>inverseRotation</strong>(T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回逆方向对象。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T_rel = <strong>relativeRotation</strong>(T1,T2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从两个绝对方向对象返回相对方向对象。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T2 = <strong>absoluteRotation</strong>(T1,T_rel);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从另一个绝对方向对象和一个相对方向对象返回绝对方向对象。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>planarRotation</strong>(e, angle);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回平面旋转的方向对象。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>angle = <strong>planarRotationAngle</strong>(e, v1, v2);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>给定旋转轴和一个矢量在坐标系1和坐标系2中的表示，返回平面旋转的角度。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>axisRotation</strong>(i, angle);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回绕坐标系1中的轴i旋转的方向对象T。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>axesRotations</strong>(sequence, angles);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回绕三个轴按顺序旋转的旋转对象。示例：<br>\r\n"
"          T = axesRotations({1,2,3},{90,45,-90});\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>angles = <strong>axesRotationsAngles</strong>(T, sequence);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回绕三个轴按顺序旋转以构造给定方向对象的3个角度。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>phi = <strong>smallRotation</strong>(T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回用于小旋转的有效旋转角度phi。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>from_nxy</strong>(n_x, n_y);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从n_x和n_y矢量返回方向对象T。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>from_nxz</strong>(n_x, n_z);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从n_x和n_z矢量返回方向对象T。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>from_T</strong>(T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从变换矩阵T返回方向对象R。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>R = <strong>from_T_inv</strong>(T_inv);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从逆变换矩阵T_inv返回方向对象R。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>from_Q</strong>(Q);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从四元数方向对象Q返回方向对象T。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T = <strong>to_T</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从方向对象R返回变换矩阵T。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>T_inv = <strong>to_T_inv</strong>(R);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从方向对象R返回逆变换矩阵T_inv。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>Q = <strong>to_Q</strong>(T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从方向对象T返回四元数方向对象Q。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>exy = <strong>to_exy</strong>(T);</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回方向对象T的[e_x, e_y]矩阵，其中坐标系2的e_x和e_y矢量在坐标系1下解析。\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices"
msgid "New type defining the first time derivative of Orientation"
msgstr "描述Orientation的一阶时间导数的新类型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation"
msgid "Orientation type defining rotation from a frame 1 into a frame 2 with a transformation matrix"
msgstr "使用一个变换矩阵描述从一个坐标系1到另一个坐标系2的旋转的方向类型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This type describes the <strong>rotation</strong> from a <strong>frame 1</strong> into a <strong>frame 2</strong>.\r\n"
"An instance <strong>R</strong> of type <strong>Orientation</strong> has the following interpretation:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>T</strong> = [<strong>e</strong><sub>x</sub>, <strong>e</strong><sub>y</sub>, <strong>e</strong><sub>z</sub>];\r\n"
"    e.g., <strong>T</strong> = [1,0,0; 0,1,0; 0,0,1]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where <strong>e</strong><sub>x</sub>,<strong>e</strong><sub>y</sub>,<strong>e</strong><sub>z</sub>\r\n"
"are unit vectors in the direction of the x-axis, y-axis, and z-axis\r\n"
"of frame 1, resolved in frame 2, respectively. Therefore, if <strong>v</strong><sub>1</sub>\r\n"
"is vector <strong>v</strong> resolved in frame 1 and <strong>v</strong><sub>2</sub> is\r\n"
"vector <strong>v</strong> resolved in frame 2, the following relationship holds:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>v</strong><sub>2</sub> = <strong>T</strong> * <strong>v</strong><sub>1</sub>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The <strong>inverse</strong> orientation\r\n"
"<strong>T_inv</strong> = <strong>T</strong><sup>T</sup> describes the rotation\r\n"
"from frame 2 into frame 1.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Since the orientation is described by 9 variables, there are\r\n"
"6 constraints between these variables. These constraints\r\n"
"are defined in function <strong>TransformationMatrices.orientationConstraint</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, that in the MultiBody library the rotation object is\r\n"
"never directly accessed but only with the access functions provided\r\n"
"in package TransformationMatrices. As a consequence, other implementations of\r\n"
"Rotation can be defined by adapting this package correspondingly.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此类型描述了从<strong>坐标系1</strong>旋转到<strong>坐标系2</strong>的<strong>旋转</strong>。\r\n"
"类型<strong>Orientation</strong>的实例<strong>R</strong>的解释如下：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>T</strong> = [<strong>e</strong><sub>x</sub>, <strong>e</strong><sub>y</sub>, <strong>e</strong><sub>z</sub>];\r\n"
"    e.g., <strong>T</strong> = [1,0,0; 0,1,0; 0,0,1]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中<strong>e</strong><sub>x</sub>，<strong>e</strong><sub>y</sub>，<strong>e</strong><sub>z</sub>\r\n"
"是坐标系1中x轴、y轴和z轴的单位矢量，在坐标系2中分解。\r\n"
"因此，如果<strong>v</strong><sub>1</sub>是在坐标系1中解析的矢量<strong>v</strong>，<strong>v</strong><sub>2</sub>是在坐标系2中解析的矢量<strong>v</strong>，则以下关系成立：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>v</strong><sub>2</sub> = <strong>T</strong> * <strong>v</strong><sub>1</sub>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>逆</strong>方向\r\n"
"<strong>T_inv</strong> = <strong>T</strong><sup>T</sup>描述了从坐标系2到坐标系1的旋转。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"由于方向由9个变量描述，因此这些变量之间有6个约束。这些约束在函数 <strong>TransformationMatrices.orientationConstraint</strong>中定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请注意，在 MultiBody 库中，旋转对象从不直接访问，而是通过提供的访问函数在TransformationMatrices包中。\r\n"
"因此，其他实现通过相应地调整此包可以来定义Rotation。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation.equalityConstraint"
msgid "Return the constraint residues to express that two frames have the same orientation"
msgstr "返回表达两个坐标系具有相同方向的约束残差"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation.equalityConstraint"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 1"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系1的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation.equalityConstraint"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation.equalityConstraint"
msgid "The rotation angles around x-, y-, and z-axis of frame 1 to rotate frame 1 into frame 2 for a small rotation (should be zero)"
msgstr "坐标系1绕x轴、y轴和z轴旋转以将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的旋转角度(应为零)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation.equalityConstraint"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"residue = Orientation.<strong>equalityConstraint</strong>(T1, T2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns the Real residue vector with&nbsp;3 elements.\r\n"
"This vector has zero elements if transformation matrices T1 and T2 are identical,\r\n"
"i.e. they describe the same orientation. The residue vector is determined by computing the relative\r\n"
"transformation matrix between T1 and T2 and using the outer-diagonal elements of this matrix to\r\n"
"formulate the residue in such a way that only identical orientation objects lead to a zero residue vector.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"residue = Orientation.<strong>equalityConstraint</strong>(T1, T2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回具有3个元素的实数残差矢量。\r\n"
"如果变换矩阵T1和T2相同，即它们描述相同的方向，则此矢量具有零元素。\r\n"
"残差矢量是通过计算 T1 和 T2 之间的相对变换矩阵并使用该矩阵的外对角线元素来确定的，\r\n"
"以便只有相同的方向对象导致零残差矢量。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.orientationConstraint"
msgid "Return residues of orientation constraints (shall be zero)"
msgstr "返回方向约束的残差(应为零)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.orientationConstraint"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.orientationConstraint"
msgid "Residues of constraints between elements of orientation object (shall be zero)"
msgstr "方向对象元素之间约束的残差(应为零)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.orientationConstraint"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"residue = TransformationMatrices.<strong>orientationConstraint</strong>(T);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns the Real residue vector with&nbsp;6 elements that describes the constraints\r\n"
"between the&nbsp;9 elements of the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.orientationConstraint\">Frames.orientationConstraint</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.orientationConstraint\">Quaternions.orientationConstraint</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"residue = TransformationMatrices.<strong>orientationConstraint</strong>(T);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回具有6个元素的实数残差矢量，描述了\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>\r\n"
"T 的9个元素之间的约束。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.orientationConstraint\">Frames.orientationConstraint</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.orientationConstraint\">Quaternions.orientationConstraint</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity1"
msgid "Return angular velocity resolved in frame 1 from orientation object and its derivative"
msgstr "返回在坐标系1中解析的方向对象及其导数的角速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity1"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity1"
msgid "Derivative of T"
msgstr "T的导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity1"
msgid "Angular velocity of frame 2 with respect to frame 1 resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "相对于坐标系1解析的坐标系2的角速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity1"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = TransformationMatrices.<strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(T, der_T);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns the angular velocity&nbsp;w of frame&nbsp;2 with\r\n"
"respect to frame&nbsp;1, <strong>resolved in frame&nbsp;1</strong>, from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2\r\n"
"and from its first time derivative der_T:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = vec( der(transpose(T)) * T ).\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity1\">Frames.angularVelocity1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity1\">Quaternions.angularVelocity1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = TransformationMatrices.<strong>angularVelocity1</strong>(T, der_T);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从描述将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向的变换矩阵\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">T</a>\r\n"
"及其一阶导数<strong>der_T</strong>中返回在坐标系1中解析的坐标系2的角速度<strong>w</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = vec( der(transpose(T)) * T ).\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity1\">Frames.angularVelocity1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity1\">Quaternions.angularVelocity1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity2"
msgid "Return angular velocity resolved in frame 2 from orientation object and its derivative"
msgstr "返回方位对象在坐标系2中的角速度及其导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity2"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "用于将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity2"
msgid "Derivative of T"
msgstr "T的导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity2"
msgid "Angular velocity of frame 2 with respect to frame 1 resolved in frame 2"
msgstr "相对于坐标系1解析的坐标系2中的角速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.angularVelocity2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = TransformationMatrices.<strong>angularVelocity2</strong>(T, der_T);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns the angular velocity&nbsp;w of frame&nbsp;2 with\r\n"
"respect to frame&nbsp;1, <strong>resolved in frame&nbsp;2</strong>, from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2\r\n"
"and from its first time derivative der_T:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = vec( T * der(transpose(T)) ).\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity2\">Frames.angularVelocity2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity2\">Quaternions.angularVelocity2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = TransformationMatrices.<strong>angularVelocity2</strong>(T, der_T);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数根据描述将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向矩阵T及其一阶导数der_T，返回在坐标系2中解析的坐标系2相对于坐标系1的角速度w。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = vec( T * der(transpose(T)) ).\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity2\">Frames.angularVelocity2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.angularVelocity2\">Quaternions.angularVelocity2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve1"
msgid "Transform vector from frame 2 to frame 1"
msgstr "将矢量从坐标系2转换到坐标系1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve1"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "旋转坐标系1至坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve1"
msgid "Vector in frame 2"
msgstr "坐标系2中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve1"
msgid "Vector in frame 1"
msgstr "坐标系1中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve1"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v1 = TransformationMatrices.<strong>resolve1</strong>(T, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns vector&nbsp;v resolved in frame&nbsp;1 (=v1) from vector&nbsp;v\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;2 (=v2) using the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve2\">resolve2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve1\">Frames.resolve1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve1\">Quaternions.resolve1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v1 = TransformationMatrices.<strong>resolve1</strong>(T, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数将在坐标系2中解析的矢量&nbsp;v 转换为在坐标系1中解析的矢量&nbsp;v1，使用描述将坐标系1旋转至坐标系2的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve2\">resolve2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve1\">Frames.resolve1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve1\">Quaternions.resolve1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve2"
msgid "Transform vector from frame 1 to frame 2"
msgstr "将矢量从坐标系1转换到坐标系2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve2"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "旋转坐标系1至坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve2"
msgid "Vector in frame 1"
msgstr "坐标系1中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve2"
msgid "Vector in frame 2"
msgstr "坐标系2中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
