"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve1\">resolve1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve2\">Frames.resolve2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve2\">Quaternions.resolve2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = TransformationMatrices.<strong>resolve2</strong>(T, v1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数将在坐标系1中解析的矢量&nbsp;v 转换为在坐标系2中解析的矢量&nbsp;v2，使用描述将坐标系1旋转至坐标系2的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolve1\">resolve1</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolve2\">Frames.resolve2</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.resolve2\">Quaternions.resolve2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve1"
msgid "Transform several vectors from frame 2 to frame 1"
msgstr "将多个矢量从坐标系2转换到坐标系1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve1"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "旋转坐标系1至坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve1"
msgid "Vectors in frame 2"
msgstr "坐标系2中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve1"
msgid "Vectors in frame 1"
msgstr "坐标系1中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve1"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v1 = TransformationMatrices.<strong>multipleResolve1</strong>(T, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns vectors&nbsp;v resolved in frame&nbsp;1 (=v1) from vectors&nbsp;v\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;2 (=v2) using the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.multipleResolve1\">Quaternions.multipleResolve1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v1 = TransformationMatrices.<strong>multipleResolve1</strong>(T, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数将在坐标系2中解析的多个矢量&nbsp;v 转换为在坐标系1中解析的矢量&nbsp;v1，使用描述将坐标系1旋转至坐标系2的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.multipleResolve1\">Quaternions.multipleResolve1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve2"
msgid "Transform several vectors from frame 1 to frame 2"
msgstr "将多个矢量从坐标系1转换到坐标系2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve2"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "旋转坐标系1至坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve2"
msgid "Vectors in frame 1"
msgstr "坐标系1中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve2"
msgid "Vectors in frame 2"
msgstr "坐标系2中的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.multipleResolve2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = TransformationMatrices.<strong>multipleResolve2</strong>(T, v1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns vectors&nbsp;v resolved in frame&nbsp;2 (=v2) from vectors&nbsp;v\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;1 (=v1) using the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.multipleResolve2\">Quaternions.multipleResolve2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = TransformationMatrices.<strong>multipleResolve2</strong>(T, v1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数将在坐标系1中解析的多个矢量&nbsp;v 转换为在坐标系2中解析的矢量&nbsp;v2，使用描述将坐标系1旋转至坐标系2的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.multipleResolve2\">Quaternions.multipleResolve2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade1"
msgid "Transform second order tensor from frame 2 to frame 1"
msgstr "将二阶张量从坐标系2转换到坐标系1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade1"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "旋转坐标系1至坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade1"
msgid "Second order tensor resolved in frame 2"
msgstr "在坐标系2中解析的二阶张量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade1"
msgid "Second order tensor resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "在坐标系1中解析的二阶张量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade1"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"D1 = TransformationMatrices.<strong>resolveDyade1</strong>(T, D2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns the second order tensor&nbsp;D\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;1 (= D1) from its representation in frame&nbsp;2 (= D2) using the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveDyade1\">Frames.resolveDyade1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"D1 = TransformationMatrices.<strong>resolveDyade1</strong>(T, D2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从在坐标系2中的表示(即D2)返回在坐标系1中解析的二阶张量&nbsp;D(即D1)，使用描述将坐标系1旋转至坐标系2的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveDyade1\">Frames.resolveDyade1</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade2"
msgid "Transform second order tensor from frame 1 to frame 2"
msgstr "将二阶张量从坐标系1转换到坐标系2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade2"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "旋转坐标系1至坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade2"
msgid "Second order tensor resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "在坐标系1中解析的二阶张量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade2"
msgid "Second order tensor resolved in frame 2"
msgstr "在坐标系2中解析的二阶张量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.resolveDyade2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"D2 = TransformationMatrices.<strong>resolveDyade2</strong>(T, D1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns the second order tensor&nbsp;D\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;2 (= D2) from its representation in frame&nbsp;1 (= D1) using the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveDyade2\">Frames.resolveDyade2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"D2 = TransformationMatrices.<strong>resolveDyade2</strong>(T, D1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数从在坐标系1中的表示(即D1)返回在坐标系2中解析的二阶张量&nbsp;D(即D2)，使用描述将坐标系1旋转至坐标系2的<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.resolveDyade2\">Frames.resolveDyade2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.nullRotation"
msgid "Return orientation object that does not rotate a frame"
msgstr "返回不旋转坐标系的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.nullRotation"
msgid "Orientation object such that frame 1 and frame 2 are identical"
msgstr "方向对象，使得坐标系1和坐标系2相同"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.nullRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>nullRotation</strong>();\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"describing the orientation object to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2, if frame&nbsp;1 and frame&nbsp;2 are identical.\r\n"
"(= transformation matrix is identity matrix and angular velocity is zero).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.nullRotation\">Frames.nullRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.nullRotation\">Quaternions.nullRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>nullRotation</strong>();\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回一个描述将坐标系1旋转至坐标系2的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T，\r\n"
"如果坐标系1和坐标系2是相同的。(= 变换矩阵是单位矩阵且角速度为零)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.nullRotation\">Frames.nullRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.nullRotation\">Quaternions.nullRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation"
msgid "Return inverse orientation object"
msgstr "返回逆方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转至第2个坐标系的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 2 into frame 1"
msgstr "将第2个坐标系旋转至坐标系1的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.inverseRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T_inv = TransformationMatrices.<strong>inverseRotation</strong>(T);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a> T_inv\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;2 to frame&nbsp;1\r\n"
"from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;1 into frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.inverseRotation\">Frames.inverseRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.inverseRotation\">Quaternions.inverseRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T_inv = TransformationMatrices.<strong>inverseRotation</strong>(T);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回描述从第2个坐标系旋转至坐标系1的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a> T_inv，\r\n"
"其中T是描述从坐标系1旋转至第2个坐标系的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.inverseRotation\">Frames.inverseRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.inverseRotation\">Quaternions.inverseRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.relativeRotation"
msgid "Return relative orientation object"
msgstr "返回相对方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.relativeRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 1"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转至坐标系1的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.relativeRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转至坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.relativeRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转至坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.relativeRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T_rel = TransformationMatrices.<strong>relativeRotation</strong>(T1, T2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a> T_rel\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate frame&nbsp;1 to frame&nbsp;2 from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T1\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;0 to frame&nbsp;1 and from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T2\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;0 to frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.relativeRotation\">Frames.relativeRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.relativeRotation\">Quaternions.relativeRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T_rel = TransformationMatrices.<strong>relativeRotation</strong>(T1, T2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回描述从坐标系1旋转至坐标系2的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a> T_rel，\r\n"
"其中T1是描述从坐标系0旋转至坐标系1的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>，\r\n"
"T2是描述从坐标系0旋转至坐标系2的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.relativeRotation\">Frames.relativeRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.relativeRotation\">Quaternions.relativeRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.absoluteRotation"
msgid "Return absolute orientation object from another absolute and a relative orientation object"
msgstr "从另一个绝对方向对象和一个相对方向对象返回绝对方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.absoluteRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 1"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转至坐标系1的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.absoluteRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转至坐标系2的相对方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.absoluteRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 0 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系0旋转至坐标系2的绝对方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.absoluteRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T2 = TransformationMatrices.<strong>absoluteRotation</strong>(T1, T_rel);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T2\r\n"
"that describes the orientation frame&nbsp;0 to frame&nbsp;2 from the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T1\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;0 to frame&nbsp;1 and from the relative\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a> T2_rel\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate from frame&nbsp;1 to frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.absoluteRotation\">Frames.absoluteRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.absoluteRotation\">Quaternions.absoluteRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T2 = TransformationMatrices.<strong>absoluteRotation</strong>(T1, T_rel);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回描述从坐标系0旋转至坐标系2的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a> T2，\r\n"
"其中T1是描述从坐标系0旋转至坐标系1的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>，\r\n"
"T_rel是描述从坐标系1旋转至坐标系2的相对\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.absoluteRotation\">Frames.absoluteRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.absoluteRotation\">Quaternions.absoluteRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotation"
msgid "Return orientation object of a planar rotation"
msgstr "返回平面旋转的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotation"
msgid "Normalized axis of rotation (must have length=1)"
msgstr "旋转轴的归一化向量 (必须长度为1)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotation"
msgid "Rotation angle to rotate frame 1 into frame 2 along axis e"
msgstr "将坐标系1沿轴e旋转至坐标系2的旋转角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转至坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>planarRotation</strong>(e, angle);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate in the plane along unit\r\n"
"axis <strong>e</strong> from frame 1 into frame 2 with angle <strong>angle</strong>.\r\n"
"Note, \"e\" must be a unit vector. However, this is not checked in this function and the function will\r\n"
"return a wrong result, if length(e) is not one.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotationAngle\">planarRotationAngle</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotation\">Frames.planarRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.planarRotation\">Quaternions.planarRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>planarRotation</strong>(e, angle);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回描述沿单位轴<strong>e</strong>在平面内旋转将坐标系1旋转至坐标系2的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T，\r\n"
"其中角度为<strong>angle</strong>。\r\n"
"注意，\"e\"必须是单位向量。然而，此函数中未检查这一点，如果length(e)不为一，函数将返回错误的结果。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotationAngle\">planarRotationAngle</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotation\">Frames.planarRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.planarRotation\">Quaternions.planarRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotationAngle"
msgid "Return angle of a planar rotation, given the rotation axis and the representations of a vector in frame 1 and frame 2"
msgstr "给定旋转轴和矢量在坐标系1和坐标系2中的表示，返回平面旋转的角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotationAngle"
msgid "Normalized axis of rotation to rotate frame 1 around e into frame 2 (must have length=1)"
msgstr "使坐标系1绕e旋转到坐标系2的归一化旋转轴(长度必须为1)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotationAngle"
msgid "A vector v resolved in frame 1 (shall not be parallel to e)"
msgstr "在坐标系1中解析的矢量v(不得与e平行)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotationAngle"
msgid "Vector v resolved in frame 2, i.e., v2 = resolve2(planarRotation(e,angle),v1)"
msgstr "在坐标系2中解析的矢量v，即v2 = resolve2(planarRotation(e,angle),v1)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotationAngle"
msgid "Rotation angle to rotate frame 1 into frame 2 along axis e in the range: -pi <= angle <= pi"
msgstr "将坐标系1沿轴e旋转到坐标系2的旋转角度范围：-pi <= angle <= pi"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotationAngle"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"angle = TransformationMatrices.<strong>planarRotationAngle</strong>(e, v1, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A call to this function of the form\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Real[3]                e, v1, v2;\r\n"
"  SI.Angle angle;\r\n"
"<strong>equation</strong>\r\n"
"  angle = <strong>planarRotationAngle</strong>(e, v1, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"computes the rotation angle \"<strong>angle</strong>\" of a planar\r\n"
"rotation along unit vector <strong>e</strong>, rotating frame 1 into frame 2, given\r\n"
"the coordinate representations of a vector \"v\" in frame 1 (<strong>v1</strong>)\r\n"
"and in frame 2 (<strong>v2</strong>). Therefore, the result of this function\r\n"
"fulfills the following equation:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = <strong>resolve2</strong>(<strong>planarRotation</strong>(e,angle), v1)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The rotation angle is returned in the range\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"-&pi; &lt;= angle &lt;= &pi;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function makes the following assumptions on the input arguments\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> Vector <strong>e</strong> has length 1, i.e., length(e) = 1</li>\r\n"
"<li> Vector \"v\" is not parallel to <strong>e</strong>, i.e.,\r\n"
"     length(cross(e,v1)) &ne; 0</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function does not check the above assumptions. If these\r\n"
"assumptions are violated, a wrong result will be returned\r\n"
"and/or a division by zero will occur.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotation\">planarRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotationAngle\">Frames.planarRotationAngle</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"angle = TransformationMatrices.<strong>planarRotationAngle</strong>(e, v1, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用此函数的形式为\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Real[3]                e, v1, v2;\r\n"
"  SI.Angle angle;\r\n"
"<strong>equation</strong>\r\n"
"  angle = <strong>planarRotationAngle</strong>(e, v1, v2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"计算平面旋转沿单位矢量<strong>e</strong>旋转坐标系1到坐标系2的旋转角度，给定矢量在坐标系1(<strong>v1</strong>)\r\n"
"和坐标系2(<strong>v2</strong>)中的坐标表示。因此，此函数的结果满足以下等式：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v2 = <strong>resolve2</strong>(<strong>planarRotation</strong>(e,angle), v1)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"旋转角度返回在范围内\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"-&pi; &lt;= angle &lt;= &pi;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数对输入参数做出以下假设\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> 矢量<strong>e</strong>长度为1，即，length(e) =1</li>\r\n"
"<li> 矢量“v”不与<strong>e</strong>平行，即，\r\n"
"     length(cross(e,v1)) &ne; 0</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数不检查上述假设。如果违反这些假设，将返回错误结果\r\n"
"和/或将出现除零。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotation\">planarRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.planarRotationAngle\">Frames.planarRotationAngle</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axisRotation"
msgid "Return rotation object to rotate around one frame axis"
msgstr "返回绕一个坐标系轴旋转的旋转对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axisRotation"
msgid "Rotate around 'axis' of frame 1"
msgstr "绕坐标系1的'axis'旋转"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axisRotation"
msgid "Rotation angle to rotate frame 1 into frame 2 along 'axis' of frame 1"
msgstr "旋转角度，将坐标系1沿坐标系1的'axis'旋转到坐标系2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axisRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axisRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>axisRotation</strong>(axis, angle);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"that describes the orientation to rotate along unit axis <strong>axis</strong>\r\n"
"from frame 1 into frame 2 with angle <strong>angle</strong>.\r\n"
"For example, TransformationMatrices.axisRotation(2, phi) returns the same orientation object as with the call\r\n"
"TransformationMatrices.planarRotation({0,1,0}, phi)\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotation\">planarRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axisRotation\">Frames.axisRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>axisRotation</strong>(axis, angle);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回描述绕单位轴<strong>axis</strong>从坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T，旋转角度为<strong>angle</strong>。\r\n"
"例如，TransformationMatrices.axisRotation(2, phi) 返回与调用TransformationMatrices.planarRotation({0,1,0}, phi)相同的方向对象\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.planarRotation\">planarRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axisRotation\">Frames.axisRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotations"
msgid "Return rotation object to rotate in sequence around 3 axes"
msgstr "返回依次绕3个轴旋转的旋转对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotations"
msgid "Sequence of rotations from frame 1 to frame 2 along axis sequence[i]"
msgstr "从坐标系1到坐标系2沿axis sequence[i]的旋转顺序"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotations"
msgid "Rotation angles around the axes defined in 'sequence'"
msgstr "在'sequence'中定义的轴周围的旋转角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotations"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotations"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>axesRotations</strong>(sequence, angles);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"that describes the orientation defined by three elementary rotations in\r\n"
"a given <strong>sequence</strong>, each rotated by <strong>angles</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotations\">Frames.axesRotations</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>axesRotations</strong>(sequence, angles);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回由给定<strong>sequence</strong>中的三个基本旋转定义的方向的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T，\r\n"
"每个旋转角度为<strong>angles</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotations\">Frames.axesRotations</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Return the 3 angles to rotate in sequence around 3 axes to construct the given orientation object"
msgstr "返回依次绕3个轴旋转以构建给定方向对象的3个角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Sequence of rotations from frame 1 to frame 2 along axis sequence[i]"
msgstr "从坐标系1到坐标系2沿axis sequence[i]的旋转顺序"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Select angles[1] such that |angles[1] - guessAngle1| is a minimum"
msgstr "选择angles[1]，使|angles[1] - guessAngle1|最小"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Rotation angles around the axes defined in 'sequence' such that T=TransformationMatrices.axesRotation(sequence,angles); -pi < angles[i] <= pi"
msgstr "在'sequence'中定义的轴周围的旋转角度，使得T=TransformationMatrices.axesRotation(sequence,angles); -pi < angles[i] <= pi"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "First rotation axis, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "第一个旋转轴，在坐标系1中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Second rotation axis, resolved in frame 1a"
msgstr "第二个旋转轴，在坐标系1a中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Third rotation axis, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "第三个旋转轴，在坐标系1中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Third rotation axis, resolved in frame 2"
msgstr "第三个旋转轴，在坐标系2中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Coefficient A in the equation A*cos(angles[1])+B*sin(angles[1]) = 0"
msgstr "方程A*cos(angles[1])+B*sin(angles[1]) = 0中的系数A"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Coefficient B in the equation A*cos(angles[1])+B*sin(angles[1]) = 0"
msgstr "方程A*cos(angles[1])+B*sin(angles[1]) = 0中的系数B"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Solution 1 for angles[1]"
msgstr "angles[1]的解1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Solution 2 for angles[1]"
msgstr "angles[1]的解2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 1a"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系1a的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.axesRotationsAngles"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"angles = TransformationMatrices.<strong>axesRotationsAngles</strong>(T, sequence, guessAngle1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A call to this function of the form\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  TransformationMatrices.Orientation T;\r\n"
"  <strong>parameter</strong> Integer sequence[3] = {1,2,3};\r\n"
"  SI.Angle angles[3];\r\n"
"<strong>equation</strong>\r\n"
"  angle = <strong>axesRotationAngles</strong>(T, sequence);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"computes the rotation angles \"<strong>angles</strong>[1:3]\" to rotate frame 1\r\n"
"into frame 2 along axes <strong>sequence</strong>[1:3], given the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"from frame 1 to frame 2. Therefore, the result of\r\n"
"this function fulfills the following equation:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = <strong>axesRotation</strong>(sequence, angles)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The rotation angles are returned in the range\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"-&pi; &lt;= angles[i] &lt;= &pi;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"There are <strong>two solutions</strong> for \"angles[1]\" in this range.\r\n"
"Via the third argument <strong>guessAngle1</strong> (default = 0) the\r\n"
"returned solution is selected such that |angles[1] - guessAngle1| is\r\n"
"minimal. The orientation object T may be in a singular configuration, i.e.,\r\n"
"there is an infinite number of angle values leading to the same T. The returned solution is\r\n"
"selected by setting angles[1] = guessAngle1. Then angles[2]\r\n"
"and angles[3] can be uniquely determined in the above range.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, that input argument <strong>sequence</strong> has the restriction that\r\n"
"only values 1,2,3 can be used and that sequence[1] &ne; sequence[2]\r\n"
"and sequence[2] &ne; sequence[3]. Often used values are:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"sequence = <strong>{1,2,3}</strong>  // Cardan angle sequence\r\n"
"         = <strong>{3,1,3}</strong>  // Euler angle sequence\r\n"
"         = <strong>{3,2,1}</strong>  // Tait-Bryan angle sequence\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles\">Frames.axesRotationsAngles</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"angles = TransformationMatrices.<strong>axesRotationsAngles</strong>(T, sequence, guessAngle1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用这个函数的形式如下：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  TransformationMatrices.Orientation T;\r\n"
"  <strong>parameter</strong> Integer sequence[3] = {1,2,3};\r\n"
"  SI.Angle angles[3];\r\n"
"<strong>equation</strong>\r\n"
"  angle = <strong>axesRotationAngles</strong>(T, sequence);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"计算旋转角度 \"<strong>angles</strong>[1:3]\" 将坐标系 1 沿轴 <strong>sequence</strong>[1:3] 旋转到坐标系 2 中，给定从坐标系 1 到坐标系 2 的<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\"> transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T。\r\n"
"因此，该函数的结果满足以下方程式：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = <strong>axesRotation</strong>(sequence, angles)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"旋转角度返回在范围内：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"-&pi; &lt;= angles[i] &lt;= &pi;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在这个范围内对于 \"angles[1]\" 有<strong>两个解</strong>。\r\n"
"通过第三个参数 <strong>guessAngle1</strong>(默认 = 0)，选择返回的解使得 |angles[1] - guessAngle1| 最小。\r\n"
"方向对象 T 可能处于奇异配置，即存在无限多个角度值导致相同的 T。\r\n"
"通过设置 angles[1] = guessAngle1 来选择返回的解。\r\n"
"然后可以在上述范围内唯一确定 angles[2] 和 angles[3]。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意，输入参数 <strong>sequence</strong> 有限制，只能使用值 1、2、3，并且 sequence[1] ≠ sequence[2] 和 sequence[2] ≠ sequence[3]。常用的值包括：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"sequence = <strong>{1,2,3}</strong>  // Cardan angle sequence\r\n"
"         = <strong>{3,1,3}</strong>  // Euler angle sequence\r\n"
"         = <strong>{3,2,1}</strong>  // Tait-Bryan angle sequence\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.axesRotationsAngles\">Frames.axesRotationsAngles</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.smallRotation"
msgid "Return rotation angles valid for a small rotation and optionally residues that should be zero"
msgstr "返回对小幅旋转有效的旋转角度，并可选择返回应为零的残差"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.smallRotation"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.smallRotation"
msgid "= false/true, if 'angles'/'angles and residues' are returned in phi"
msgstr "= false/true，如果在phi中返回'angles'/'angles and residues'"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.smallRotation"
msgid "The rotation angles around x-, y-, and z-axis of frame 1 to rotate frame 1 into frame 2 for a small rotation + optionally 3 residues that should be zero"
msgstr "坐标系1绕x轴、y轴和z轴的旋转角度，以将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的小旋转 + 可选的3个应为零的残差"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.smallRotation"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"phi = TransformationMatrices.<strong>smallRotation</strong>(T, withResidues);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns rotation angles valid for a small rotation of x-y-z sequence (i.e. {1,2,3}).\r\n"
"Optionally, residues are returned as well if <code>withResidues=true</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.smallRotation\">Frames.smallRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.smallRotation\">Quaternions.smallRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"phi = TransformationMatrices.<strong>smallRotation</strong>(T, withResidues);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回x-y-z顺序的小旋转的旋转角度(即{1,2,3})。\r\n"
"如果<code>withResidues=true</code>，还可以返回残差。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.smallRotation\">Frames.smallRotation</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.smallRotation\">Quaternions.smallRotation</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxy"
msgid "Return orientation object from n_x and n_y vectors"
msgstr "从n_x和n_y向量返回方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxy"
msgid "Vector in direction of x-axis of frame 2, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "坐标系1中指向坐标系2 x轴方向的向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxy"
msgid "Vector in direction of y-axis of frame 2, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "坐标系1中指向坐标系2 y轴方向的向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxy"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxy"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>from_nxy</strong>(n_x, n_y);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"It is assumed that the two input vectors n_x and n_y are\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;1 and are directed along the&nbsp;x and y&nbsp;axis\r\n"
"of frame&nbsp;2 (i.e., n_x and n_y are orthogonal to each other).\r\n"
"The function returns the orientation object&nbsp;T to rotate from\r\n"
"frame&nbsp;1 to frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function is robust in the sense that it returns always\r\n"
"an orientation object&nbsp;T, even if n_y is not orthogonal to n_x.\r\n"
"This is performed in the following way:\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"If n_x and n_y are not orthogonal to each other, first a unit\r\n"
"vector e_y is determined that is orthogonal to n_x and is lying\r\n"
"in the plane spanned by n_x and n_y. If n_x and n_y are parallel\r\n"
"or nearly parallel to each other, a vector e_y is selected\r\n"
"arbitrarily such that e_x and e_y are orthogonal to each other.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxy\">Frames.from_nxy</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>from_nxy</strong>(n_x, n_y);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"假设两个输入向量n_x和n_y是在坐标系&nbsp;1中解析的，并且分别沿着坐标系&nbsp;2的x轴和y轴方向\r\n"
"(即，n_x和n_y彼此正交)。\r\n"
"该函数返回从坐标系&nbsp;1旋转到坐标系&nbsp;2的方向对象T。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数在以下意义上是有意义的：即使n_y不正交于n_x，它也始终返回一个方向对象T。\r\n"
"这是通过以下方式执行的：\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"如果n_x和n_y不彼此正交，则首先确定一个单位向量e_y，它正交于n_x并且位于n_x和n_y跨度的平面上。\r\n"
"如果n_x和n_y平行或几乎平行，则任意选择一个向量e_y，使得e_x和e_y彼此正交。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxy\">Frames.from_nxy</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxz"
msgid "Return orientation object from n_x and n_z vectors"
msgstr "从 n_x 和 n_z 矢量返回方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxz"
msgid "Vector in direction of x-axis of frame 2, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "在坐标系1中解析的指向 x 轴的矢量，解析为坐标系2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxz"
msgid "Vector in direction of z-axis of frame 2, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "在坐标系1中解析的指向 z 轴的矢量，解析为坐标系2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxz"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2 的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxz"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>from_nxz</strong>(n_x, n_z);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"It is assumed that the two input vectors n_x and n_z are\r\n"
"resolved in frame&nbsp;1 and are directed along the&nbsp;x and z&nbsp;axis\r\n"
"of frame&nbsp;2 (i.e., n_x and n_z are orthogonal to each other).\r\n"
"The function returns the orientation object&nbsp;T to rotate from\r\n"
"frame&nbsp;1 to frame&nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function is robust in the sense that it returns always\r\n"
"an orientation object&nbsp;T, even if n_z is not orthogonal to n_x.\r\n"
"This is performed in the following way:\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"If n_x and n_z are not orthogonal to each other, first a unit\r\n"
"vector e_z is determined that is orthogonal to n_x and is lying\r\n"
"in the plane spanned by n_x and n_z. If n_x and n_z are parallel\r\n"
"or nearly parallel to each other, a vector e_z is selected\r\n"
"arbitrarily such that n_x and e_z are orthogonal to each other.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxz\">Frames.from_nxz</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>from_nxz</strong>(n_x, n_z);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"假设两个输入矢量 n_x 和 n_z 解析为坐标系 1，并且指向坐标系2 的 x 轴和 z 轴(即，n_x 和 n_z 互相垂直)。\r\n"
"该函数返回方向对象 T，以将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数在某种程度上是健壮的，即使 n_z 不与 n_x 垂直，它也始终返回一个方向对象 T。\r\n"
"具体操作如下：\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"如果 n_x 和 n_z 不互相垂直，首先确定一个单位矢量 e_z，它与 n_x 垂直并位于由 n_x 和 n_z 张成的平面上。\r\n"
"如果 n_x 和 n_z 平行或几乎平行，将任意选择一个矢量 e_z，使得 n_x 和 e_z 互相垂直。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_nxz\">Frames.from_nxz</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T"
msgid "Return orientation object R from transformation matrix T"
msgstr "从变换矩阵 T 返回方向对象 R"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T"
msgid "Transformation matrix to transform vector from frame 1 to frame 2 (v2=T*v1)"
msgstr "将向量从坐标系1变换到坐标系2的变换矩阵 (v2=T*v1)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = TransformationMatrices.<strong>from_T</strong>(T);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;R\r\n"
"which is equal to a real input matrix&nbsp;T.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv\">from_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T\">to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T\">Frames.from_T</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = TransformationMatrices.<strong>from_T</strong>(T);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数返回一个与实际输入矩阵&nbsp;T&nbsp;相等的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\"> transformation matrix </a>&nbsp;R。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv\">from_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T\">to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T\">Frames.from_T</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv"
msgid "Return orientation object R from inverse transformation matrix T_inv"
msgstr "从逆变换矩阵T_inv返回方向对象 R"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv"
msgid "Inverse transformation matrix to transform vector from frame 2 to frame 1 (v1=T_inv*v2)"
msgstr "将矢量从坐标系2变换到坐标系1的逆变换矩阵(v1=T_inv*v2)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = TransformationMatrices.<strong>from_T_inv</strong>(T_inv);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;R\r\n"
"which is inverse to real input matrix T_inv.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv\">to_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T\">from_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T_inv\">Frames.from_T_inv</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"R = TransformationMatrices.<strong>from_T_inv</strong>(T_inv);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数返回一个与实际输入矩阵&nbsp;T_inv&nbsp;逆矩阵相等的\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\"> transformation matrix </a>&nbsp;R。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv\">to_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T\">from_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T_inv\">Frames.from_T_inv</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_Q"
msgid "Return orientation object T from quaternion orientation object Q"
msgstr "从四元数方向对象Q返回方向对象T"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_Q"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系2旋转到坐标系1的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_Q"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系2旋转到坐标系1的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_Q"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>from_Q</strong>(Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"computed from a <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternion object</a>&nbsp;Q\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_Q\">to_Q</a>.\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_Q\">Frames.from_Q</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>from_Q</strong>(Q);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数返回一个\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\"> transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T，\r\n"
"根据给定的<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\"> quaternion object</a>&nbsp;Q计算而得。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_Q\">to_Q</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_Q\">Frames.from_Q</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T"
msgid "Return transformation matrix T from orientation object R"
msgstr "从方向对象R返回变换矩阵T"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系 1 旋转到坐标系 2 的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T"
msgid "Transformation matrix to transform vector from frame 1 to frame 2 (v2=T*v1)"
msgstr "将矢量从坐标系 1 变换到坐标系 2 的变换矩阵 (v2=T*v1)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>to_T</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a real matrix&nbsp;T which is equal to a\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;R.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T\">from_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv\">to_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T\">Frames.to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T\">Quaternions.to_T</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T = TransformationMatrices.<strong>to_T</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数返回一个实矩阵&nbsp;T，等于一个\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\"> quaternion object</a>&nbsp;R。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T\">from_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv\">to_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T\">Frames.to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T\">Quaternions.to_T</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv"
msgid "Return inverse transformation matrix T_inv from orientation object R"
msgstr "从方向对象R返回逆变换矩阵T_inv"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "用于将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv"
msgid "Inverse transformation matrix to transform vector from frame 2 into frame 1 (v1=T_inv*v2)"
msgstr "逆变换矩阵，用于将向量从坐标系2转换到坐标系1 (v1=T_inv*v2)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T_inv"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T_inv = TransformationMatrices.<strong>to_T_inv</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a real matrix&nbsp;T_inv\r\n"
"which is inverse to a\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;R.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv\">from_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T\">to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T_inv\">Frames.to_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T_inv\">Quaternions.to_T_inv</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T_inv = TransformationMatrices.<strong>to_T_inv</strong>(R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回一个实数矩阵&nbsp;T_inv，\r\n"
"它是<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;R的逆。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv\">from_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T\">to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T_inv\">Frames.to_T_inv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T_inv\">Quaternions.to_T_inv</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_Q"
msgid "Return quaternion orientation object Q from orientation object T"
msgstr "从方向对象T返回四元数方向对象Q"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_Q"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "用于将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_Q"
msgid "Guess value for output Q (there are 2 solutions; the one closer to Q_guess is used"
msgstr "用于输出Q的初始猜测值(有2个解；选择离Q_guess更近的一个)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_Q"
msgid "Quaternions orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "用于将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的四元数方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_Q"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q = TransformationMatrices.<strong>to_Q</strong>(T, Q_guess);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns a <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternion object</a>&nbsp;Q\r\n"
"computed from a <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"and depending on the initial guess Q_guess.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_Q\">from_Q</a>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_Q\">Frames.to_Q</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Q = TransformationMatrices.<strong>to_Q</strong>(T, Q_guess);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回一个<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.Orientation\">quaternion object</a>&nbsp;Q，\r\n"
"根据一个<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T\r\n"
"和初始猜测值Q_guess计算得出。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_Q\">from_Q</a>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_Q\">Frames.to_Q</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_vector"
