"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"vec = TransformationMatrices.<strong>to_vector</strong>(T);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回一个矢量vec，其中包含<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\"> transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T的元素。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T\">to_T</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_vector\">Frames.to_vector</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_exy"
msgid "Map rotation object into e_x and e_y vectors of frame 2, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "将旋转对象映射为坐标系2的e_x和e_y矢量在坐标系1中进行解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_exy"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate frame 1 into frame 2"
msgstr "将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_exy"
msgid "= [e_x, e_y] where e_x and e_y are axes unit vectors of frame 2, resolved in frame 1"
msgstr "= [e_x, e_y]，其中e_x和e_y是表示坐标系2轴的单位矢量，在坐标系1中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_exy"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"exy = TransformationMatrices.<strong>to_exy</strong>(T);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns unit vectors e_x and e_y which define axes of frame&nbsp;2 resolved in frame&nbsp;1,\r\n"
"provided&nbsp;T is a <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>\r\n"
"to rotate frame&nbsp;1 into &nbsp;2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxy\">from_nxy</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxz\">from_nxz</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_exy\">Frames.to_exy</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"exy = TransformationMatrices.<strong>to_exy</strong>(T);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数返回单位矢量e_x和e_y，它们定义了坐标系2的轴在坐标系1中解析，\r\n"
"其中的T是一个<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">变换矩阵</a>，\r\n"
"用于将坐标系1旋转到坐标系2。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxy\">from_nxy</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_nxz\">from_nxz</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_exy\">Frames.to_exy</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

