msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.Frame"
msgid "Coordinate system fixed to the component with one cut-force and cut-torque (no icon)"
msgstr "固定于组件的坐标系，同时带有一个局部力和局部力矩(无图标)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.Frame"
msgid "Position vector from world frame to the connector frame origin, resolved in world frame"
msgstr "从全局坐标系原点到连接器局部坐标系原点的位置矢量，在全局坐标系中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.Frame"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate the world frame into the connector frame"
msgstr "将全局坐标系旋转到连接器局部坐标系的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.Frame"
msgid "Cut-force resolved in connector frame"
msgstr "在连接器局部坐标系中解析的力"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.Frame"
msgid "Cut-torque resolved in connector frame"
msgstr "在连接器局部坐标系中解析的力矩"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.Frame"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Basic definition of a coordinate system that is fixed to a mechanical\r\n"
"component. In the origin of the coordinate system the cut-force\r\n"
"and the cut-torque is acting. This component has no icon definition\r\n"
"and is only used by inheritance from frame connectors to define\r\n"
"different icons.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"固定在机械部件上的坐标系的基本定义。\r\n"
"在坐标系的原点，作用着局部力和局部力矩。该组件没有图标定义，只能通过继承坐标系连接器来定义不同的图标。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.Frame_a"
msgid "Coordinate system fixed to the component with one cut-force and cut-torque (filled rectangular icon)"
msgstr "固定于组件的坐标系，同时带有一个局部力和局部力矩(图标为填充矩形)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.Frame_a"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Basic definition of a coordinate system that is fixed to a mechanical\r\n"
"component. In the origin of the coordinate system the cut-force\r\n"
"and the cut-torque is acting.\r\n"
"This component has a filled rectangular icon.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
