msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"固定在机械部件上的坐标系的基本定义。\r\n"
"在坐标系的原点，作用着局部力和局部力矩。该组件有一个未填充的矩形图标。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.Frame_resolve"
msgid "Coordinate system fixed to the component used to express in which coordinate system a vector is resolved (non-filled rectangular icon)"
msgstr "固定于组件的坐标系，用于表示矢量在哪个坐标系中解析(图标为非填充矩形)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.Frame_resolve"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Basic definition of a coordinate system that is fixed to a mechanical\r\n"
"component. In the origin of the coordinate system the cut-force\r\n"
"and the cut-torque is acting. This coordinate system is used to\r\n"
"express in which coordinate system a vector is resolved.\r\n"
"A component that uses a Frame_resolve connector has to set the\r\n"
"cut-force and cut-torque of this frame to zero. When connecting\r\n"
"from a Frame_resolve connector to another frame connector,\r\n"
"by default the connecting line has line style \"dotted\".\r\n"
"This component has a non-filled rectangular icon.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"固定在机械部件上的坐标系的基本定义。\r\n"
"在坐标系的原点，作用着局部力和局部力矩。\r\n"
"该坐标系用于表示矢量在哪个坐标系中解析。\r\n"
"使用Frame_resolve连接器的组件必须将该坐标系的局部力和局部力矩设置为零。\r\n"
"当从一个Frame_resolve连接器连接到另一个坐标系连接器时，默认情况下连接线的线型为\"虚线\"。\r\n"
"该组件有一个未填充的矩形图标。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearing"
msgid "Connector consisting of 1-dim. rotational flange and its bearing frame"
msgstr "包含一维转动接口和轴承坐标系的连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearing"
msgid "= true, if bearing frame connector is present, otherwise not present"
msgstr "= true, 表示存在轴承坐标系连接器，否则表示不存在"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearing"
msgid "1-dim. rotational flange"
msgstr "一维转动接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearing"
msgid "3-dim. frame in which the 1-dim. shaft is mounted"
msgstr "三维坐标系，其中已安装一维轴"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearing"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This hierarchical connector models a 1-dim. rotational flange\r\n"
"connector and its optional bearing defined by a 3-dim. frame connector.\r\n"
"If a connection to the subconnectors should be clearly visible,\r\n"
"connect first an  instance of\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearingAdaptor\">FlangeWithBearingAdaptor</a>\r\n"
"to the FlangeWithBearing connector.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该分级连接器模拟了一个一维转动接口连接器和一个可选的由三维坐标系连接器定义的轴承。\r\n"
"如果需要将连接到子连接器的连接清晰可见，首先将一个\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearingAdaptor\">FlangeWithBearingAdaptor</a>\r\n"
"的实例连接到FlangeWithBearing连接器。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearingAdaptor"
msgid "Adaptor to allow direct connections to the sub-connectors of FlangeWithBearing"
msgstr "允许直接连接到FlangeWithBearing子连接器的适配器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearingAdaptor"
msgid "= true, if bearing frame connector is present, otherwise not present"
msgstr "= true, 表示存在轴承坐标系连接器，否则表示不存在"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearingAdaptor"
msgid "Compound connector consisting of 1-dim. rotational flange and 3-dim. frame mounting"
msgstr "由一维转动接口和三维坐标系安装组成的复合连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearingAdaptor"
msgid "1-dim. rotational flange"
msgstr "一维转动接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearingAdaptor"
msgid "3-dim. frame in which the 1-dim. shaft is mounted"
msgstr "三维坐标系，其中已安装一维轴"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearingAdaptor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearingAdaptor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Adaptor object to make a more visible connection to the flange and frame\r\n"
"subconnectors of a\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearing\">FlangeWithBearing</a>\r\n"
"connector.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"适配器对象，用于更直观地连接到\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.FlangeWithBearing\">FlangeWithBearing</a>\r\n"
"连接器的接口和坐标系子连接器。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialTwoFrames"
msgid "Base model for components providing two frame connectors + outer world + assert to guarantee that the component is connected"
msgstr "提供两个坐标系连接器+外部world+确保组件被连接的断言的组件基础模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialTwoFrames"
msgid "Coordinate system a fixed to the component with one cut-force and cut-torque"
msgstr "坐标系a，固定在具有一个局部力和局部力矩的组件上"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialTwoFrames"
msgid "Coordinate system b fixed to the component with one cut-force and cut-torque"
msgstr "坐标系b，固定在具有一个局部力和局部力矩的组件上"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialTwoFrames"
msgid "a"
msgstr "a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialTwoFrames"
msgid "b"
msgstr "b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialTwoFrames"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This partial model provides two frame connectors, access to the world\r\n"
"object and an assert to check that both frame connectors are connected.\r\n"
"Therefore, inherit from this partial model if the two frame connectors are\r\n"
"needed and if the two frame connectors should be connected for a correct model.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个部分模型提供两个坐标系连接器，world对象访问和一个断言来检查两个坐标系连接器是否被连接。\r\n"
"因此，如果需要两个坐标系连接器，并且两个坐标系连接器在正确的模型中应该被连接，请继承此部分模型。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialTwoFramesDoubleSize"
msgid "Base model for components providing two frame connectors + outer world + assert to guarantee that the component is connected (default icon size is factor 2 larger as usual)"
msgstr "提供两个坐标系连接器+外部world+确保组件被连接的断言的基础模型(默认图标大小为常规的两倍)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialTwoFramesDoubleSize"
msgid "Coordinate system fixed to the component with one cut-force and cut-torque"
msgstr "固定在组件上的坐标系，带有一个局部力和局部力矩"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialTwoFramesDoubleSize"
msgid "a"
msgstr "a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialTwoFramesDoubleSize"
msgid "b"
msgstr "b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialTwoFramesDoubleSize"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This partial model provides two frame connectors, access to the world\r\n"
"object and an assert to check that both frame connectors are connected.\r\n"
"Therefore, inherit from this partial model if the two frame connectors are\r\n"
"needed and if the two frame connectors should be connected for a correct model.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"When dragging \"PartialTwoFrames\", the default size is a factor of two\r\n"
"larger as usual. This partial model is used by the Joint.Assemblies\r\n"
"joint aggregation models.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个部分模型提供两个坐标系连接器，world对象访问和一个断言来检查两个坐标系连接器是否被连接。\r\n"
"因此，如果需要两个坐标系连接器，并且两个坐标系连接器应该连接以确保模型正确，则从该部分模型继承。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"当拖动 \"PartialTwoFrames\"时，其默认大小是通常大小的两倍。\r\n"
"该部分模型被关节装配体模型Joint.Assemblies所使用。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialOneFrame_a"
msgid "Base model for components providing one frame_a connector + outer world + assert to guarantee that the component is connected"
msgstr "提供一个frame_a连接器+外部world+确保组件被连接的断言的组件基础模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialOneFrame_a"
msgid "Coordinate system fixed to the component with one cut-force and cut-torque"
msgstr "固定在组件上的坐标系，带有一个局部力和局部力矩"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialOneFrame_a"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This partial model provides one frame_a connector, access to the world\r\n"
"object and an assert to check that the frame_a connector is connected.\r\n"
"Therefore, inherit from this partial model if the frame_a connector is\r\n"
"needed and if this connector should be connected for a correct model.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该部分模型提供了一个frame_a连接器，world对象访问和一个断言来检查frame_a连接器是否被连接。\r\n"
"因此，如果需要frame_a连接器，且该连接器在正确的模型中应被连接，则继承该部分模型。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialOneFrame_b"
msgid "Base model for components providing one frame_b connector + outer world + assert to guarantee that the component is connected"
msgstr "提供一个frame_b连接器+外部world+确保组件被连接的断言的组件基础模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialOneFrame_b"
msgid "Coordinate system fixed to the component with one cut-force and cut-torque"
msgstr "固定在组件上的坐标系，带有一个局部力和局部力矩"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialOneFrame_b"
msgid "b"
msgstr "b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialOneFrame_b"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This partial model provides one frame_b connector, access to the world\r\n"
"object and an assert to check that the frame_b connector is connected.\r\n"
"Therefore, inherit from this partial model if the frame_b connector is\r\n"
"needed and if this connector should be connected for a correct model.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该部分模型提供了一个frame_b连接器，world对象访问和一个断言来检查frame_b连接器是否被连接。\r\n"
"因此，如果需要frame_b连接器，且该连接器在正确的模型中应被连接，则继承该部分模型。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialElementaryJoint"
msgid "Base model for elementary joints (has two frames + outer world + assert to guarantee that the joint is connected)"
msgstr "用于运动副的基础模型(具有两个坐标系+外部world+确保运动副已被连接的断言)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialElementaryJoint"
msgid "Coordinate system fixed to the joint with one cut-force and cut-torque"
msgstr "固定在运动副上的坐标系，带有一个局部力和局部力矩"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialElementaryJoint"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"All <strong>elementary joints</strong> should inherit from this base model, i.e.,\r\n"
"joints that are directly defined by equations, provided they compute\r\n"
"either the rotation object of frame_b from the rotation object of frame_a\r\n"
"and from relative quantities (or vice versa), or there is a constraint\r\n"
"equation between the rotation objects of the two frames.\r\n"
"In other cases, a joint object should inherit from\r\n"
"<strong>Interfaces.PartialTwoFrames</strong> (e.g., joint Spherical, because there\r\n"
"is no constraint between the rotation objects of frame_a and frame_b\r\n"
"or joint Cylindrical because it is not an elementary joint).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This partial model provides two frame connectors, a \"Connections.branch\"\r\n"
"between frame_a and frame_b, access to the world\r\n"
"object and an assert to check that both frame connectors are connected.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"所有<strong>基本运动副</strong>都应该从这个基础模型继承，即直接由方程定义的运动副。\r\n"
"这个运动副成立的条件是它们可以从frame_a的旋转对象和相对量(或反之亦然)计算frame_b的旋转对象，或者在两个坐标系的旋转对象之间存在约束方程。\r\n"
"另一种情况，运动副对象应该继承自<strong>Interfaces.PartialTwoFrames</strong>(例如，球副Spherical，因为frame_a和frame_b的旋转对象之间没有约束，或圆柱副Cylindrical，因为它不是基本运动副)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个部分模型提供了两个坐标系连接器，用于frame_a和frame_b之间的\"Connections.branch\"，对world对象的访问，以及用于检查两个坐标系是否被连接的断言。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialForce"
msgid "Base model for force elements (provide frame_b.f and frame_b.t in subclasses)"
msgstr "用于力元件的基础模型(在子类中提供frame_b.f和frame_b.t)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialForce"
msgid "Position vector from origin of frame_a to origin of frame_b, resolved in frame_b"
msgstr "从frame_a原点到frame_b原点的位置矢量，在frame_b中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialForce"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"All <strong>3-dimensional force</strong> and <strong>torque elements</strong>\r\n"
"should be based on this superclass.\r\n"
"This model defines frame_a and frame_b, computes the relative\r\n"
"translation and rotation between the two frames and calculates\r\n"
"the cut-force and cut-torque at frame_a by a force and torque\r\n"
"balance from the cut-force and cut-torque at frame_b.\r\n"
"As a result, in a subclass, only the relationship between\r\n"
"the cut-force and cut-torque at frame_b has to be defined as\r\n"
"a function of the following relative quantities:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r_rel_b[3]: Position vector from origin of frame_a to origin\r\n"
"            of frame_b, resolved in frame_b\r\n"
"R_rel     : Relative orientation object to rotate from frame_a to frame_b\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Assume that force f = {100,0,0} should be applied on the body\r\n"
"to which this force element is attached at frame_b, then\r\n"
"the definition should be:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>model</strong> Constant_x_Force\r\n"
"   extends Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialForce;\r\n"
"<strong>equation</strong>\r\n"
"   frame_b.f = {-100, 0, 0};\r\n"
"   frame_b.t = zeros(3);\r\n"
"<strong>end</strong> Constant_x_Force;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, that frame_b.f and frame_b.t are flow variables and therefore\r\n"
"the negative value of frame_b.f and frame_b.t is acting at the part\r\n"
"to which this force element is connected.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"所有<strong>三维力</strong>和<strong>力矩元素</strong>都应该基于这个超类。\r\n"
"这个模型定义了frame_a和frame_b，计算了两个坐标系之间的相对平移和旋转，并根据frame_b上的局部力和局部力矩平衡公式计算出frame_a上的局部力和局部力矩。\r\n"
"因此，在子类中，只需要定义frame_b处的局部力和局部力矩与以下相对量的关系：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r_rel_b[3]: Position vector from origin of frame_a to origin\r\n"
"            of frame_b, resolved in frame_b\r\n"
"R_rel     : Relative orientation object to rotate from frame_a to frame_b\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"假设要在连接到frame_b的物体上施加力f = {100,0,0}，则定义应为：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>model</strong> Constant_x_Force\r\n"
"   extends Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialForce;\r\n"
"<strong>equation</strong>\r\n"
"   frame_b.f = {-100, 0, 0};\r\n"
"   frame_b.t = zeros(3);\r\n"
"<strong>end</strong> Constant_x_Force;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请注意，frame_b.f和frame_b.t是流变量，因此frame_b.f和frame_b.t的负值作用于与该力元件相连的部件上。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.LineForceBase"
msgid "Base model for line force elements"
msgstr "用于线性力元素的基础模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.LineForceBase"
msgid "Prevent zero-division if distance between frame_a and frame_b is zero"
msgstr "如果frame_a和frame_b之间的距离为零，则防止零除法"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.LineForceBase"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.LineForceBase"
msgid "= true, if rotation frame_a.R is fixed (to directly connect line forces)"
msgstr "= true，如果旋转frame_a.R固定(直接连接线性力)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.LineForceBase"
msgid "If enabled, can give wrong results, see MultiBody.UsersGuide.Tutorial.ConnectionOfLineForces"
msgstr "如果启用，可能会导致错误结果，请参阅MultiBody.UsersGuide.Tutorial.ConnectionOfLineForces"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.LineForceBase"
msgid "= true, if rotation frame_b.R is fixed (to directly connect line forces)"
msgstr "= true，如果旋转frame_b.R固定(直接连接线性力)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.LineForceBase"
msgid "Distance between the origin of frame_a and the origin of frame_b"
msgstr "frame_a的原点到frame_b的原点之间的距离"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.LineForceBase"
msgid "(Guarded) distance between the origin of frame_a and the origin of frame_b (>= s_small))"
msgstr "frame_a的原点到frame_b的原点之间的(受保护的)距离（>= s_small))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.LineForceBase"
msgid "Position vector from frame_a to frame_b resolved in world frame"
msgstr "从frame_a到frame_b的位置向量，在世界坐标系中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.LineForceBase"
msgid "Unit vector in direction from frame_a to frame_b, resolved in world frame"
msgstr "从frame_a指向frame_b的单位向量，在世界坐标系中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.LineForceBase"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"All <strong>line force</strong> elements should be based on this base model.\r\n"
"This model defines frame_a and frame_b and computes the (guarded) relative\r\n"
"distance <strong>s</strong>. An assertion is raised if the relative\r\n"
"distance <strong>length</strong> became smaller as parameter <strong>s_small</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"所有<strong>线性力</strong>元件都应基于此基本模型。\r\n"
"该模型定义了frame_a和frame_b，并计算相对距离<strong>s</strong>。\r\n"
"如果相对距离<strong>length</strong>变小到参数<strong>s_small</strong>，则会引发断言。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.LineForceBase"
msgid "R=0"
msgstr "R=0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialLineForce"
msgid "Base model for massless line force elements"
msgstr "无质量线性力元素的基础模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialLineForce"
msgid "Position vector from origin of frame_a to origin of frame_b, resolved in frame_a"
msgstr "从frame_a原点到frame_b原点的位置矢量，在frame_a中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialLineForce"
msgid "Unit vector on the line connecting the origin of frame_a with the origin of frame_b resolved in frame_a (directed from frame_a to frame_b)"
msgstr "沿着连接frame_a原点和frame_b原点的线，在frame_a中解析的单位向量(从frame_a指向frame_b)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialLineForce"
msgid "Line force acting on frame_a and on frame_b (positive, if acting on frame_b and directed from frame_a to frame_b)"
msgstr "作用在frame_a和frame_b上的线力(正值表示作用在frame_b上且方向从frame_a指向frame_b)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialLineForce"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"All massless <strong>line force</strong> elements should be based on this base model.\r\n"
"This model defines frame_a and frame_b, computes the (guarded) relative\r\n"
"distance <strong>s</strong> and provides the force and torque\r\n"
"balance of the cut-forces and cut-torques at frame_a and\r\n"
"frame_b, respectively. In sub-models, only the line force <strong>f</strong>,\r\n"
"acting at frame_b on the line from frame_a to frame_b, as a function\r\n"
"of the relative distance <strong>s</strong> and its derivative <strong>der</strong>(<strong>s</strong>)\r\n"
"has to be defined. Example:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>model</strong> Spring\r\n"
"   <strong>parameter</strong> Real c \"spring constant\",\r\n"
"   <strong>parameter</strong> Real s_unstretched \"unstretched spring length\";\r\n"
"   <strong>extends</strong> Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialLineForce;\r\n"
"<strong>equation</strong>\r\n"
"   f = c*(s-s_unstretched);\r\n"
"<strong>end</strong> Spring;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"所有无质量的<strong>线性力</strong>元素应该基于这个基础模型。\r\n"
"该模型定义了frame_a和frame_b，计算了相对距离<strong>s</strong>，\r\n"
"并提供了frame_a和frame_b上的局部力和局部力矩平衡。\r\n"
"在子模型中，只需要定义作用在frame_b上的线性力<strong>f</strong>，作为从frame_a指向frame_b直线的函数，其参数是相对距离<strong>s</strong>及其导数<strong>der</strong>(<strong>s</strong>)。\r\n"
"示例：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>model</strong> Spring\r\n"
"   <strong>parameter</strong> Real c \"spring constant\",\r\n"
"   <strong>parameter</strong> Real s_unstretched \"unstretched spring length\";\r\n"
"   <strong>extends</strong> Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialLineForce;\r\n"
"<strong>equation</strong>\r\n"
"   f = c*(s-s_unstretched);\r\n"
"<strong>end</strong> Spring;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialLineForce"
msgid "R=0"
msgstr "R=0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialAbsoluteSensor"
msgid "Base model to measure an absolute frame variable"
msgstr "用于测量绝对坐标系变量的基础模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialAbsoluteSensor"
msgid "Number of output signals"
msgstr "输出信号数量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialAbsoluteSensor"
msgid "Coordinate system from which absolute quantities are provided as output signals"
msgstr "用于提供绝对量作为输出信号的坐标系"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialAbsoluteSensor"
msgid "Measured data as signal vector"
msgstr "作为信号向量的测量数据"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialAbsoluteSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is the base class of a 3-dim. mechanics component with one frame and one\r\n"
"output port in order to measure an absolute quantity in the frame connector\r\n"
"and to provide the measured signal as output for further processing\r\n"
"with the blocks of package Modelica.Blocks.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个带有一个坐标系和一个输出端口的三维力学组件的基类，\r\n"
"用于在坐标系连接器中测量绝对量，并将测量信号作为输出，\r\n"
"以便与Modelica.Blocks包中的模块进一步处理。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialAbsoluteSensor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "Base model to measure a relative variable between two frames"
msgstr "用于测量两个坐标系之间相对变量的基础模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "Number of output signals"
msgstr "输出信号数量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "Coordinate system a"
msgstr "坐标系a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "Coordinate system b"
msgstr "坐标系b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "Measured data as signal vector"
msgstr "作为信号向量的测量数据"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a base class for 3-dim. mechanical components with two frames\r\n"
"and one output port in order to measure relative quantities\r\n"
"between the two frames or the cut-forces/torques in the frame and\r\n"
"to provide the measured signals as output for further processing\r\n"
"with the blocks of package Modelica.Blocks.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个具有两个坐标系和一个输出端口的三维力学组件的基类，\r\n"
"用于测量两个坐标系之间的相对量或坐标系中的局部力/力矩，\r\n"
"并将测量信号作为输出以便与Modelica.Blocks包中的模块进一步处理。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "a"
msgstr "a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "b"
msgstr "b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialVisualizer"
msgid "Base model for visualizers (has a frame_a on the left side + outer world + assert to guarantee that the component is connected)"
msgstr "用于可视化器的基础模型(包括左侧frame_a+外部world+确保组件已被连接的断言)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialVisualizer"
msgid "Coordinate system in which visualization data is resolved"
msgstr "解析可视化数据的坐标系"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.PartialVisualizer"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This partial model provides one frame_a connector, access to the world\r\n"
"object and an assert to check that the frame_a connector is connected.\r\n"
"It is used by inheritance from all visualizer objects.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此部分模型提供一个frame_a连接器，访问world对象，并使用断言检查frame_a连接器是否已被连接。\r\n"
"它被所有可视化对象继承使用。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.ZeroPosition"
msgid "Set absolute position vector of frame_resolve to a zero vector and the orientation object to a null rotation"
msgstr "将frame_resolve的绝对位置矢量设置为零矢量，并将方向对象设置为无旋转"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.ZeroPosition"
msgid "r = 0"
msgstr "r = 0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.ZeroPosition"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Element consisting of a frame (frame_resolve) that is fixed in the world\r\n"
"frame and has it's position and orientation identical with the world, i.e.\r\n"
"the position vector from origin of world frame to frame_resolve is zero vector\r\n"
"and the relative orientation between those two frames is identity matrix.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This component provides no visualization.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"由一个在全局坐标系中固定的坐标系(frame_resolve)组成，其位置和方向与全局坐标系相同，\r\n"
"即从全局坐标系原点到frame_resolve的位置矢量是零矢量，并且这两个坐标系之间的相对方向是单位矩阵。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该组件不提供可视化。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialGravityAcceleration"
msgid "Interface for the gravity function used in the World object"
msgstr "用于World对象中重力函数的接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialGravityAcceleration"
msgid "Position vector from world frame to actual point, resolved in world frame"
msgstr "从全局坐标系到实际点的位置矢量，在全局坐标系中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialGravityAcceleration"
msgid "Gravity acceleration at position r, resolved in world frame"
msgstr "在位置r处的重力加速度，在全局坐标系中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialGravityAcceleration"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This partial function defines the interface to the gravity function\r\n"
"used in the World object. All gravity field functions must inherit\r\n"
"from this function. The input to the function is the absolute position\r\n"
"vector of a point in the gravity field, whereas the output is the\r\n"
"gravity acceleration at this point, resolved in the world frame.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此部分函数定义了用于World对象中重力函数的接口。\r\n"
"所有重力场函数都必须继承自此函数。\r\n"
"函数的输入是重力场中某一点的绝对位置矢量，而输出是该点处的重力加速度，在全局坐标系中解析。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialSurfaceCharacteristic"
msgid "Interface for a function returning surface characteristics"
msgstr "返回表面特征的函数接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialSurfaceCharacteristic"
msgid "Number of points in u-Dimension"
msgstr "u方向上的点的个数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialSurfaceCharacteristic"
msgid "Number of points in v-Dimension"
msgstr "v方向上的点的个数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialSurfaceCharacteristic"
msgid "= true: Color is defined for each surface point"
msgstr "= true: 每个表面点都定义了颜色"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialSurfaceCharacteristic"
msgid "[nu,nv] positions of points in x-Direction resolved in surface frame"
msgstr "[nu,nv]，点的x方向上的位置，在表面坐标系中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialSurfaceCharacteristic"
msgid "[nu,nv] positions of points in y-Direction resolved in surface frame"
msgstr "[nu,nv]，点的y方向上的位置，在表面坐标系中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialSurfaceCharacteristic"
msgid "[nu,nv] positions of points in z-Direction resolved in surface frame"
msgstr "[nu,nv]，点的z方向上的位置，在表面坐标系中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialSurfaceCharacteristic"
msgid "[nu,nv,3] Color array, defining the color for each surface point"
msgstr "[nu,nv,3]，颜色数组，定义了每个表面点的颜色"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialSurfaceCharacteristic"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This partial function defines the interface of a function that returns\r\n"
"surface characteristics for an object visualization, see e.g.\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.torus\">Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.torus</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>此部分函数定义了返回对象可视化的表面特性的函数接口，参见\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.torus\">Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.torus</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialColorMap"
msgid "Interface for a function returning a color map"
msgstr "返回颜色映射的函数接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialColorMap"
msgid "Number of colors in the color map"
msgstr "颜色映射中的颜色个数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialColorMap"
msgid "Color map to map a scalar to a color"
msgstr "颜色映射，将标量映射到颜色"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Interfaces.partialColorMap"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This partial function defines the interface of a function that returns\r\n"
"a color map. Predefined color map functions are defined in package\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps\">Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此部分函数定义了返回颜色映射的函数接口。预定义的颜色映射函数在包\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps\">Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps</a>\r\n"
"中定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints"
msgid "Components that constrain the motion between two frames"
msgstr "用于约束两个接口坐标系之间运动的组件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains <strong>joint components</strong>,\r\n"
"that is, idealized, massless elements that constrain\r\n"
"the motion between frames. In subpackage <strong>Assemblies</strong>\r\n"
"aggregation joint components are provided to handle\r\n"
"kinematic loops analytically (this means that non-linear systems\r\n"
"of equations occurring in these joint aggregations are analytically\r\n"
"solved, i.e., robustly and efficiently).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Content</h4>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><th><strong><em>Model</em></strong></th><th><strong><em>Description</em></strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic\">Prismatic</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Prismatic joint and actuated prismatic joint\r\n"
"          (1 translational degree-of-freedom, 2 potential states)<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/Prismatic.png\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Revolute\">Revolute</a>\r\n"
" </td>\r\n"
"      <td>Revolute and actuated revolute joint\r\n"
"          (1 rotational degree-of-freedom, 2 potential states)<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/Revolute.png\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Cylindrical\">Cylindrical</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Cylindrical joint (2 degrees-of-freedom, 4 potential states)<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/Cylindrical.png\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Universal\">Universal</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Universal joint (2 degrees-of-freedom, 4 potential states)<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/Universal.png\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Planar\">Planar</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Planar joint (3 degrees-of-freedom, 6 potential states)<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/Planar.png\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Spherical\">Spherical</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Spherical joint (3 constraints and no potential states, or 3 degrees-of-freedom and 3 states)<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/Spherical.png\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.FreeMotion\">FreeMotion</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Free motion joint (6 degrees-of-freedom, 12 potential states)<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/FreeMotion.png\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.SphericalSpherical\">SphericalSpherical</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Spherical - spherical joint aggregation (1 constraint,\r\n"
"          no potential states) with an optional point mass in the middle<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/SphericalSpherical.png\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.UniversalSpherical\">UniversalSpherical</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Universal - spherical joint aggregation (1 constraint, no potential states)<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/UniversalSpherical.png\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.GearConstraint\">GearConstraint</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Ideal 3-dim. gearbox (arbitrary shaft directions)\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Assemblies\">MultiBody.Joints.Assemblies</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td><strong>Package</strong> of joint aggregations for analytic loop handling.\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Constraints\">MultiBody.Joints.Constraints</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td><strong>Package</strong> of components that define joints by constraints\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该库中提供<strong>运动副组件</strong>，即理想化的、无质量的元素，用于约束接口坐标系之间的运动。\r\n"
"在子包<strong>Assemblies</strong>中提供了组合运动副，用于解决运动学环路的分析问题(这意味着这些运动副组合中出现的非线性方程组被稳健高效的解析求解)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>内容</h4>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\"cellspacing=\"0\"cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong><em>模型</em></strong></th><th><strong><em>描述</em></strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic\">Prismatic</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>平动副和被驱动的平动副\r\n"
"(1个平移自由度，2个潜在状态变量)<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/Prismatic.png\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Revolute\">Revolute</a>\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"<td>转动副和被驱动的转动副\r\n"
"(1个转动自由度，2个潜在状态变量)<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/Revolute.png\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Cylindrical\">Cylindrical</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>圆柱副(2个自由度，4个潜在状态变量)<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/Cylindrical.png\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Universal\">Universal</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>万向节(2个自由度，4个潜在状态变量)<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/Universal.png\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Planar\">Planar</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>平面副(3个自由度，6个潜在状态变量)<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/Planar.png\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Spherical\">Spherical</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>球副(3个约束，没有潜在状态变量，或者3个自由度和3个状态变量)<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/Spherical.png\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.FreeMotion\">FreeMotion</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>自由运动副(6个自由度，12个潜在状态变量)<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/FreeMotion.png\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.SphericalSpherical\">SphericalSpherical</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>球-球组合副(1个约束，没有潜在状态变量)，在中间有可选的点质量<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/SphericalSpherical.png\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.UniversalSpherical\">UniversalSpherical</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>万向节-球组合副(1个约束，没有潜在状态变量)<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/UniversalSpherical.png\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.GearConstraint\">GearConstraint</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>理想的三维齿轮箱(任意轴方向)\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Assemblies\">MultiBody.Joints.Assemblies</a></td>\r\n"
"<td><strong>组合运动副</strong>的包，用于解析环路问题。\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Constraints\">MultiBody.Joints.Constraints</a></td>\r\n"
"<td><strong>约束</strong>的组件包，用于定义运动副\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "Prismatic joint (1 translational degree-of-freedom, 2 potential states, optional axis flange)"
msgstr "平移副(1个平移自由度，2个潜在状态变量，可选轴接口)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "1-dim. translational flange that drives the joint"
msgstr "驱动平移副的一维平动接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "1-dim. translational flange of the drive support (assumed to be fixed in the world frame, NOT in the joint)"
msgstr "驱动支撑的一维平动接口(假定在全局坐标系中固定，而不在运动副中)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "= true, if axis flange is enabled"
msgstr "=true，如果启用轴接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "= true, if animation shall be enabled"
msgstr "=true，如果启用动画（显示为长方体）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "Axis of translation resolved in frame_a (= same as in frame_b)"
msgstr "平移轴向量，在frame_a中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "Vector in width direction of box, resolved in frame_a"
msgstr "长方体宽度方向的矢量，在frame_a中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "Animation"
msgstr "动画"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "if animation = true"
msgstr "如果animation=true"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "Width of prismatic joint box"
msgstr "平移副的的宽度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "Height of prismatic joint box"
msgstr "平移副的高度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "Color of prismatic joint box"
msgstr "平移副的颜色"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "Reflection of ambient light (= 0: light is completely absorbed)"
msgstr "环境光的反射(=0：光完全被吸收)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "Priority to use distance s and v=der(s) as states"
msgstr "优先使用距离s和v=der(s)作为状态变量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "Unit vector in direction of prismatic axis n"
msgstr "平移轴的单位矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "Relative distance between frame_a and frame_b"
msgstr "frame_a和frame_b之间的相对距离"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "First derivative of s (relative velocity)"
msgstr "s的一阶导数(相对速度)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "Second derivative of s (relative acceleration)"
msgstr "s的二阶导数(相对加速度)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "Actuation force in direction of joint axis"
msgstr "沿平移轴方向的作用力"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "b"
msgstr "b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "a"
msgstr "a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "n=%n"
msgstr "n=%n"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Prismatic"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Joint where frame_b is translated along axis n which is fixed in frame_a.\r\n"
"The two frames coincide when the relative distance \"s = 0\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Optionally, two additional 1-dimensional mechanical flanges\r\n"
"(flange \"axis\" represents the driving flange and\r\n"
"flange \"support\" represents the bearing) can be enabled via\r\n"
"parameter <strong>useAxisFlange</strong>. The enabled axis flange can be\r\n"
"driven with elements of the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Translational\">Modelica.Mechanics.Translational</a>\r\n"
"library.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In the \"Advanced\" menu it can be defined via parameter <strong>stateSelect</strong>\r\n"
"that the relative distance \"s\" and its derivative shall be definitely\r\n"
"used as states by setting stateSelect=StateSelect.always.\r\n"
"Default is StateSelect.prefer to use the relative distance and its\r\n"
"derivative as preferred states. The states are usually selected automatically.\r\n"
"In certain situations, especially when closed kinematic loops are present,\r\n"
"it might be slightly more efficient, when using the StateSelect.always setting.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In the following figure the animation of a prismatic\r\n"
"joint is shown. The light blue coordinate system is\r\n"
"frame_a and the dark blue coordinate system is\r\n"
"frame_b of the joint. The black arrow is parameter\r\n"
"vector \"n\" defining the translation axis\r\n"
"(here: n = {1,1,0}).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/Prismatic.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在运动副中frame_b沿着在frame_a中固定的轴n进行平移。\r\n"
"当相对距离\"s = 0\"时，两个坐标系重合。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"可选择通过参数<strong>useAxisFlange</strong>启用两个额外的一维机械接口(接口\"axis\"表示驱动接口，接口\"support\"表示轴承)。\r\n"
"启用的轴接口可以使用<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Translational\">Modelica.Mechanics.Translational</a>库的元素驱动。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在\"高级\"菜单中，可以通过参数<strong>stateSelect</strong>定义相对距离\"s\"及其导数是否应该被明确地选为状态，通过设置stateSelect=StateSelect.always。\r\n"
"默认情况下，StateSelect.prefer首选将相对距离及其导数作为首选状态变量。\r\n"
"通常情况下，状态变量会自动选择。\r\n"
"在某些情况下，特别是在存在闭合运动学环路时，使用StateSelect.always设置可能会更有效。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在下图中，显示了一个平移副的动画。\r\n"
"浅蓝色坐标系是frame_a，深蓝色坐标系是连接件的frame_b。\r\n"
"黑色箭头是定义了平移轴的参数矢量\"n\"。\r\n"
"(这里：n={1,1,0})。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Joints/Prismatic.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Revolute"
msgid "Revolute joint (1 rotational degree-of-freedom, 2 potential states, optional axis flange)"
msgstr "转动副(1个转动自由度，2个潜在状态变量，可选轴接口)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Revolute"
msgid "1-dim. rotational flange that drives the joint"
msgstr "驱动转动副的一维旋转接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Revolute"
msgid "1-dim. rotational flange of the drive support (assumed to be fixed in the world frame, NOT in the joint)"
msgstr "驱动支撑的一维旋转接口(假定固定在全局坐标系中，而不是转动副中)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Revolute"
msgid "Coordinate system fixed to the joint with one cut-force and cut-torque"
