msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "Axis of rotation resolved in frame_a (= same as in frame_b)"
msgstr "在frame_a中解析的旋转轴(与frame_b中的相同)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "Length of cylinder representing the joint axis"
msgstr "转动副(圆柱体)的长度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "if animation = true"
msgstr "如果animation = true"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "Diameter of cylinder representing the joint axis"
msgstr "转动副(圆柱体)的直径"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "Color of cylinder representing the joint axis"
msgstr "转动副(圆柱体)的颜色"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "Reflection of ambient light (= 0: light is completely absorbed)"
msgstr "环境光的反射(=0：光被完全吸收)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "Unit vector in direction of rotation axis, resolved in frame_a (= same as in frame_b)"
msgstr "旋转轴方向的单位矢量，在frame_a中解析(与frame_b中的相同)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "Arbitrary vector that is not aligned with rotation axis n"
msgstr "与旋转轴n不对齐的任意矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "Unit vector orthogonal to axis n of revolute joint, resolved in frame_a"
msgstr "垂直于转动副轴n的单位矢量，在frame_a中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "Unit vector orthogonal to axis n of revolute joint and to ey_a, resolved in frame_a"
msgstr "垂直于转动副轴n和ey_a的单位矢量，在frame_a中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "ey_a, resolved in frame_b"
msgstr "在frame_b中解析的ey_a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "ex_a, resolved in frame_b"
msgstr "在frame_b中解析的ex_a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "Dummy or relative orientation object from frame_a to frame_b"
msgstr "从frame_a到frame_b的虚拟或相对方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "Position vector from origin of frame_a to origin of frame_b, resolved in frame_a"
msgstr "从frame_a原点到frame_b原点的位置矢量，在frame_a中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "Dummy or constraint forces in direction of ex_a, ey_a"
msgstr "ex_a和ey_a方向的虚拟或约束力"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "n=%n"
msgstr "n=%n"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "a"
msgstr "a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "b"
msgstr "b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopConstraint"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Joint where frame_b rotates around axis n which is fixed in frame_a and\r\n"
"where this joint is used in a planar loop providing 2 constraint equations\r\n"
"on position level.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If a <strong>planar loop</strong> is present, e.g., consisting of 4 revolute joints\r\n"
"where the joint axes are all parallel to each other, then there is no\r\n"
"unique mathematical solution if all revolute joints are modelled with\r\n"
"Joints.Revolute and the symbolic algorithms will\r\n"
"fail. The reason is that, e.g., the cut-forces in the revolute joints perpendicular\r\n"
"to the planar loop are not uniquely defined when 3-dim. descriptions of revolute\r\n"
"joints are used. Usually, an error message will be printed pointing out this\r\n"
"situation. In this case, <strong>one</strong> revolute joint in the loop has to be replaced by\r\n"
"model Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopCutJoint. The\r\n"
"effect is that from the 5 constraints of a 3-dim. revolute joint,\r\n"
"3 constraints are removed and replaced by appropriate known\r\n"
"variables (e.g., the force in the direction of the axis of rotation is\r\n"
"treated as known with value equal to zero; for standard revolute joints,\r\n"
"this force is an unknown quantity).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"frame_b绕固定在frame_a中的轴n旋转的运动副，该运动副在平面环路中使用，提供了两个位置的约束方程。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果存在<strong>平面环</strong>，例如，由4个转动副组成，其中转动副的轴都平行于彼此，如果所有转动副都使用Joints.Revolute进行建模则没有唯一的数学解，符号算法都将失败。\r\n"
"其失败的原因在于当使用三维的转动副进行描述时，垂直于平面环路的转动副中的局部力并不是唯一定义的。\r\n"
"通常，系统会打印出一条错误信息，指出这种情况。\r\n"
"在这种情况下，环路中的<strong>一个</strong>转动副必须替换为Joints.RevolutePlanarLoopCutJoint模型。\r\n"
"其效果是将三维转动副的5个约束中的3个约束移除，并替换为适当的已知变量\r\n"
"(例如，沿着旋转轴方向的力被视为已知值且等于0；对于标准的转动副，这个力是一个未知量)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Cylindrical"
msgid "Cylindrical joint (2 degrees-of-freedom, 4 potential states)"
msgstr "圆柱副(2个自由度，4个潜在状态变量)"

