msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Internal.RollingConstraintVerticalWheel"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Joint for a wheel rolling on the x-y plane of the world frame\r\n"
"intended for an idealized wheelset.\r\n"
"To meet this objective, the wheel always runs upright and enables no\r\n"
"slip in the longitudinal direction of the wheel/ground contact.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"On the contrary, the wheel can optionally slip in the lateral direction\r\n"
"which is reasonable for the wheelset where just one of the wheels\r\n"
"should be laterally constrained.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The frame frame_a is placed in the intersection of the wheel spin axis\r\n"
"with the wheel middle plane and rotates with the wheel itself.\r\n"
"A wheel body collecting the mass and inertia should be connected to\r\n"
"this frame.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Note</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"To work properly, the gravity acceleration vector g of the world must point in the negative z-axis, i.e.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<span style=\"font-family:'Courier New',courier; color:#0000ff;\">inner</span> <span style=\"font-family:'Courier New',courier; color:#ff0000;\">Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.World</span> world(n={0,0,-1});\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"用于滚轮在全局坐标系的x-y平面上滚动的连接旨在用于理想化的轮对。\r\n"
"为了实现这个目标，滚轮始终保持竖直，并且在滚轮/地面接触的纵向方向不允许滑动。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"相反，滚轮可以选择在横向方向滑动，这对于轮对来说是合理的，其中只有一个滚轮应该在横向上受到约束。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"坐标系frame_a被放置在滚轮旋转轴与滚轮中平面的交点处，并随滚轮自身一起旋转。\r\n"
"应该连接到该坐标系上的是一个收集质量和转动惯量的滚轮主体。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>注意</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"为了正常工作，世界的重力加速度矢量g必须指向负z轴，即</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<span style=\"font-family:'Courier New',courier; color:#0000ff;\">inner</span><span style=\"font-family:'Courier New',courier; color:#ff0000;\">Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.World</span>world(n={0,0,-1});\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Internal.InitPosition"
msgid "Internal model to initialize r_rel_a for Joints.FreeMotionScalarInit"
msgstr "内部模型，用于为Joints.FreeMotionScalarInit初始化r_rel_a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Internal.InitPosition"
msgid "r_rel_a"
msgstr "r_rel_a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Internal.InitPosition"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Compute relative position vector r_rel_a from a position vector r_a_0 to\r\n"
"a position vector r_b_0, resolved in frame given by an\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a> R_a.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"从位置矢量r_a_0到位置矢量r_b_0计算相对位置矢量r_rel_a，解析在由<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a>R_a给定的参考坐标系中。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Internal.InitAngle"
msgid "Internal model to initialize the angels for Joints.FreeMotionScalarInit"
msgstr "内部模型，用于为Joints.FreeMotionScalarInit初始化角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Internal.InitAngle"
msgid "Sequence of angle rotations"
msgstr "角度旋转的顺序"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Internal.InitAngle"
msgid "Relative orientation object to rotate from frame_a to frame_b"
msgstr "从frame_a到frame_b旋转的相对方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Internal.InitAngle"
msgid "Relative orientation object to rotate from frame_b to frame_a"
msgstr "从frame_b到frame_a旋转的相对方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Internal.InitAngle"
msgid "angle"
msgstr "angle"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Internal.InitAngle"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Compute three rotational angles <strong>angle</strong> for a given rotational sequence\r\n"
"<strong>sequence_start</strong> from a relative orientation from frame_a to frame_b.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"计算给定旋转序列<strong>sequence_start</strong>下从frame_a到frame_b的相对方向的三个旋转角度<strong>angle</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Internal.InitAngularVelocity"
msgid "Internal model to initialize w_rel_b for Joints.FreeMotionScalarInit"
msgstr "内部模型，用于为Joints.FreeMotionScalarInit初始化w_rel_b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Internal.InitAngularVelocity"
msgid "w_rel_b"
msgstr "w_rel_b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Internal.InitAngularVelocity"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Compute relative angular velocity w_rel_b of an\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a> R_b\r\n"
"relative to an\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a> R_a,\r\n"
"resolved in orientation object R_b, i.e.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w_b_b = w_a_b + w_rel_b,\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w_b_b ...... absolute angular velocity of frame_b resolved in frame_b,\r\n"
"w_a_b ...... absolute angular velocity of frame_a resolved in frame_b,\r\n"
"w_rel_b .... relative angular velocity resolved in frame_b.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"计算相对于方向对象R_a的方向对象R_b的相对角速度w_rel_b，在方向对象R_b中解析，即</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w_b_b=w_a_b+w_rel_b,\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w_b_b ...... absolute angular velocity of frame_b resolved in frame_b,\r\n"
"w_a_b ...... absolute angular velocity of frame_a resolved in frame_b,\r\n"
"w_rel_b .... relative angular velocity resolved in frame_b.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts"
msgid "Rigid components such as bodies with mass and inertia and massless rods"
msgstr "刚性组件，如具有质量和转动惯量的体和无质量杆"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Package <strong>Parts</strong> contains <strong>rigid components</strong> of a\r\n"
"multi-body system. These components may be used to build up\r\n"
"more complicated structures. For example, a part may be built up of\r\n"
"a \"Body\" and of several \"FixedTranslation\" components.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Content</h4>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><th><strong><em>Model</em></strong></th><th><strong><em>Description</em></strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed\">Fixed</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Frame fixed in world frame at a given position.\r\n"
"          It is visualized with a shape, see <strong>shapeType</strong> below\r\n"
"         (the frames on the two\r\n"
"          sides do not belong to the component):<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/Fixed.png\" alt=\"model Parts.Fixed\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.FixedTranslation\">FixedTranslation</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Fixed translation of frame_b with respect to frame_a.\r\n"
"          It is visualized with a shape, see <strong>shapeType</strong> below\r\n"
"          (the frames on the two sides do not belong to the component):<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/FixedTranslation.png\" alt=\"model Parts.FixedTranslation\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.FixedRotation\">FixedRotation</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Fixed translation and fixed rotation of frame_b with respect to frame_a\r\n"
"          It is visualized with a shape, see <strong>shapeType</strong>  below\r\n"
"          (the frames on the two sides do not belong to the component):<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/FixedRotation.png\" alt=\"model Parts.FixedRotation\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Body\">Body</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Rigid body with mass, inertia tensor and one frame connector.\r\n"
"          It is visualized with a cylinder and a sphere at the\r\n"
"          center of mass:<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/Body.png\" alt=\"model Parts.Body\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.BodyShape\">BodyShape</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Rigid body with mass, inertia tensor, different shapes\r\n"
"          (see <strong>shapeType</strong> below)\r\n"
"          for animation, and two frame connectors:<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/BodyShape.png\" alt=\"model Parts.BodyShape\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed\">Fixed BodyBox</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Rigid body with box shape (mass and animation properties are computed\r\n"
"          from box data and from density):<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/BodyBox.png\" alt=\"model Parts.BodyBox\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.BodyCylinder\">BodyCylinder</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Rigid body with cylinder shape (mass and animation properties\r\n"
"          are computed from cylinder data and from density):<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/BodyCylinder.png\" alt=\"model Parts.BodyCylinder\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.PointMass\">PointMass</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>Rigid body where inertia tensor and rotation is neglected:<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/PointMass.png\" alt=\"model Parts.PointMass\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Mounting1D\">Mounting1D</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td> Propagate 1-dim. support torque to 3-dim. system\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Rotor1D\">Rotor1D</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>1D inertia attachable on 3-dim. bodies (without neglecting dynamic effects)<br>\r\n"
"      <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/Rotor1D.png\" alt=\"model Parts.Rotor1D\">\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.BevelGear1D\">BevelGear1D</a></td>\r\n"
"      <td>1D gearbox with arbitrary shaft directions (3D bearing frame)\r\n"
"      </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Components <strong>Fixed</strong>, <strong>FixedTranslation</strong>, <strong>FixedRotation</strong>\r\n"
"and <strong>BodyShape</strong> are visualized according to parameter\r\n"
"<strong>shapeType</strong>, that may have the following values (e.g., shapeType = \"box\"):<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/FixedShape.png\" alt=\"model Visualizers.FixedShape\"></div>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"All the details of the visualization shape parameters are\r\n"
"given in\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.FixedShape\">Visualizers.FixedShape</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Colors in all animation parts are defined via parameter <strong>color</strong>.\r\n"
"This is an Integer vector with 3 elements, {r, g, b}, and specifies the\r\n"
"color of the shape. {r, g, b} are the \"red\", \"green\" and \"blue\" color parts,\r\n"
"given in the ranges 0&nbsp;&hellip;&nbsp;255, respectively. The predefined type\r\n"
"<strong>MultiBody.Types.Color</strong> contains a menu\r\n"
"definition of the colors used in the MultiBody library\r\n"
"(this will be replaced by a color editor).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Parts</strong>包包含多体系统的<strong>刚性组件</strong>。\r\n"
"这些组件可用于构建更复杂的结构。\r\n"
"例如，一个部件可能由一个\"Body\"和几个\"FixedTranslation\"组件构成。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>目录</h4>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\"cellspacing=\"0\"cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong><em>模型</em></strong></th><th><strong><em>描述</em></strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed\">Fixed</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>在给定位置固定于世界坐标系中的坐标系。\r\n"
"它用一个形状来可视化，见下面的<strong>shapeType</strong>(两侧的坐标系不属于组件)：<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/Fixed.png\"alt=\"model Parts.Fixed\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.FixedTranslation\">FixedTranslation</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>frame_b相对于frame_a的固定平动。\r\n"
"它用一个形状来可视化，见下面的<strong>shapeType</strong>(两侧的坐标系不属于组件)：<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/FixedTranslation.png\"alt=\"model Parts.FixedTranslation\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.FixedRotation\">FixedRotation</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>frame_b相对于frame_a的固定平动和固定旋转。\r\n"
"它用一个形状来可视化，见下面的<strong>shapeType</strong>(两侧的坐标系不属于组件)：<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/FixedRotation.png\"alt=\"model Parts.FixedRotation\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Body\">Body</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>带有质量、转动惯量张量和一个坐标系连接器的刚体。\r\n"
"它用一个圆柱体和一个位于质心的球来可视化：<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/Body.png\"alt=\"model Parts.Body\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.BodyShape\">BodyShape</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>带有质量、转动惯量张量、不同的形状(见下面的<strong>shapeType</strong>)可以用于动画，并且有两个坐标系连接器：<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/BodyShape.png\"alt=\"model Parts.BodyShape\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed\">FixedBodyBox</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>带有长方体形状的刚体(质量和动画属性根据长方体数据和密度计算)：<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/BodyBox.png\"alt=\"model Parts.BodyBox\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.BodyCylinder\">BodyCylinder</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>带有圆柱形状的刚体(质量和动画属性根据圆柱数据和密度计算)：<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/BodyCylinder.png\"alt=\"model Parts.BodyCylinder\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.PointMass\">PointMass</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>转动惯量张量和旋转被忽略的刚体：<br>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/PointMass.png\"alt=\"model Parts.PointMass\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Mounting1D\">Mounting1D</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>将一维支撑扭矩传递给三维系统\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Rotor1D\">Rotor1D</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>一维转动惯量连接在三维刚体上(不忽略动态效应)<br>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/Rotor1D.png\"alt=\"model Parts.Rotor1D\">\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.BevelGear1D\">BevelGear1D</a></td>\r\n"
"<td>带有任意轴方向的一维齿轮箱(三维轴承坐标系)\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"组件<strong>Fixed</strong>、<strong>FixedTranslation</strong>、<strong>FixedRotation</strong>和<strong>BodyShape</strong>根据参数<strong>shapeType</strong>进行可视化，该参数可以具有以下值(例如，shapeType = \"box\")：<br>&nbsp;<br></p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/FixedShape.png\"alt=\"model Visualizers.FixedShape\"></div>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"可视化形状参数的所有细节都在<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.FixedShape\">Visualizers.FixedShape</a>中给出。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"所有动画部件的颜色都通过参数<strong>color</strong>定义。\r\n"
"这是一个具有3个元素{r, g, b}的整数矢量，用于指定形状的颜色。\r\n"
"{r, g, b}分别在0&nbsp;&hellip;&nbsp;255范围中给出红色、绿色和蓝色部分。\r\n"
"预定义类型<strong>MultiBody.Types.Color</strong>包含MultiBody库中使用的颜色的菜单定义(这将被颜色编辑器替代)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "Frame fixed in the world frame at a given position"
msgstr "在给定位置固定在全局坐标系中的坐标系"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "Coordinate system fixed in the world frame"
msgstr "在全局坐标系中固定的坐标系"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "= true, if animation shall be enabled"
msgstr "= true，如果要启用动画"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "Position vector from world frame to frame_b, resolved in world frame"
msgstr "从全局坐标系到frame_b的位置矢量，在全局坐标系中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "Type of shape"
msgstr "形状类型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "Animation"
msgstr "动画"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "if animation = true"
msgstr "如果animation = true"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "Vector from world frame to shape origin, resolved in world frame"
msgstr "从全局坐标系到形状原点的矢量，在全局坐标系中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "Vector in length direction of shape, resolved in world frame"
msgstr "形状长度方向的矢量，在全局坐标系中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "Vector in width direction of shape, resolved in world frame"
msgstr "形状宽度方向的矢量，在全局坐标系中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "Length of shape"
msgstr "形状的长度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "Width of shape"
msgstr "形状的宽度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "Height of shape"
msgstr "形状的高度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "Additional parameter for cone, pipe etc. (see docu of Visualizers.Advanced.Shape)"
msgstr "锥体、管道等的附加参数(请参阅Visualizers.Advanced.Shape的文档)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "Color of shape"
msgstr "形状的颜色"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "Reflection of ambient light (= 0: light is completely absorbed)"
msgstr "环境光的反射(= 0：光完全吸收)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "r=%r"
msgstr "r=%r"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Fixed"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Element consisting of a frame (frame_b) that is fixed in the world\r\n"
"frame at a given position defined by parameter vector <strong>r</strong>\r\n"
"(vector from origin of world frame to frame_b, resolved in the\r\n"
"world frame).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"By default, this component is visualized by a cylinder connecting the\r\n"
"world frame and frame_b of this components, as shown in the figure below.\r\n"
"Note, that the visualized world frame on the left side and\r\n"
"Fixed.frame_b on the right side are not part of the\r\n"
"component animation and that the animation may be switched off via parameter\r\n"
"animation = <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Parts/Fixed.png\" alt=\"Parts.Fixed\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该元素由一个在全局坐标系中固定的坐标系(frame_b)组成，该坐标系的位置由参数矢量<strong>r</strong>定义(从全局坐标系原点到frame_b的矢量，在全局坐标系中解析)。</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
