msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.BodyBox"
msgid "Rigid body with box shape. Mass and animation properties are computed from box data and density (12 potential states)"
msgstr "具有长方体形状的刚体，质量和动画属性由长方体数据和密度计算得出(12个潜在状态变量)"

