msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.BevelGear1D"
msgid "1D gearbox with arbitrary shaft directions and 3-dim. bearing frame (3D dynamic effects are taken into account provided world.driveTrainMechanics3D=true)"
msgstr "带有任意轴向和三维轴承坐标系的一维变速箱(只要world.driveTrainMechanics3D = true，就会考虑到三维动态效应)"

