msgstr "将输出矢量r解析到的坐标系(world、frame_a或frame_resolve)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsolutePosition"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsolutePosition"
msgid "m"
msgstr "m"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsolutePosition"
msgid "resolve"
msgstr "resolve"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsolutePosition"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The absolute position vector of the origin of frame_a is\r\n"
"determined and provided at the output signal connector <strong>r</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Via parameter <strong>resolveInFrame</strong> it is defined, in which frame\r\n"
"the position vector is resolved:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame =<br>Types.ResolveInFrameA.</strong></th><th><strong>Meaning</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in world frame</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_a</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_resolve</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_resolve, the conditional connector\r\n"
"\"frame_resolve\" is enabled and r is resolved in the frame, to\r\n"
"which frame_resolve is connected. Note, if this connector is enabled, it must\r\n"
"be connected.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_a, the output vector is\r\n"
"computed as:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r = MultiBody.Frames.resolve2(frame_a.R, frame_b.r_0);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"坐标系frame_a原点的绝对位置矢量在输出信号连接器<strong>r</strong>上被确定和提供。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过参数<strong>resolveInFrame</strong>定义了位置矢量在哪个坐标系中解析：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\"cellspacing=\"0\"cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame=<br>Types.ResolveInFrameA.</strong></th><th><strong>含义</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"<td>在全局坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_a中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_resolve中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_resolve，则条件连接器“frame_resolve”被启用，并且r在frame_resolve所连接的坐标系中解析。\r\n"
"请注意，如果启用此连接器，则必须连接它。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_a，则输出矢量计算如下：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r=MultiBody.Frames.resolve2(frame_a.R,frame_b.r_0);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteVelocity"
msgid "Measure absolute velocity vector of origin of frame connector"
