msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteVelocity"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The absolute velocity vector of the origin of frame_a is\r\n"
"determined and provided at the output signal connector <strong>v</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Via parameter <strong>resolveInFrame</strong> it is defined, in which frame\r\n"
"the velocity vector is resolved:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame =<br>Types.ResolveInFrameA.</strong></th><th><strong>Meaning</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in world frame</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_a</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_resolve</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_resolve, the conditional connector\r\n"
"\"frame_resolve\" is enabled and v is resolved in the frame, to\r\n"
"which frame_resolve is connected. Note, if this connector is enabled, it must\r\n"
"be connected.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_a, the output vector is\r\n"
"computed as:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v0 = der(frame_a.r_0);\r\n"
"v  = MultiBody.Frames.resolve2(frame_a.R, v0);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"坐标系frame_a原点的绝对速度矢量在输出信号连接器<strong>v</strong>处确定并提供。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过参数<strong>resolveInFrame</strong>定义了速度矢量在哪个坐标系中解析：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\"cellspacing=\"0\"cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame=<br>Types.ResolveInFrameA.</strong></th><th><strong>含义</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"<td>在全局坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_a中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_resolve中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_resolve，则条件连接器“frame_resolve”被启用，并且v在连接到frame_resolve的坐标系中解析。\r\n"
"请注意，如果启用此连接器，则必须连接它。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_a，则输出矢量计算如下：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v0=der(frame_a.r_0);\r\n"
"v=MultiBody.Frames.resolve2(frame_a.R,v0);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteAngles"
msgid "Measure absolute angles between frame connector and the world frame"
msgstr "测量坐标系连接器与全局坐标系之间的绝对角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteAngles"
msgid "Angles to rotate world frame into frame_a via 'sequence'"
msgstr "将全局坐标系旋转到frame_a通过'sequence'的角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteAngles"
msgid "Angles are returned to rotate world frame around axes sequence[1], sequence[2] and finally sequence[3] into frame_a"
msgstr "角度返回以使全局坐标系绕轴sequence[1]、sequence[2]和最后sequence[3]旋转到frame_a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteAngles"
msgid "Select angles[1] such that abs(angles[1] - guessAngle1) is a minimum"
msgstr "选择angles[1]，使得abs(angles[1]-guessAngle1)最小"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteAngles"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteAngles"
msgid "rad"
msgstr "rad"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteAngles"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model determines the 3 angles to rotate the world frame\r\n"
"into frame_a along the axes defined by parameter <strong>sequence</strong>.\r\n"
"For example, if sequence = {3,1,2} then the world frame is\r\n"
"rotated around angles[1] along the z-axis, afterwards it is rotated\r\n"
"around angles[2] along the x-axis, and finally it is rotated around\r\n"
"angles[3] along the y-axis and is then identical to frame_a.\r\n"
"The 3 angles are returned in the range\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"-&pi; &lt;= angles[i] &lt;= &pi;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"There are <strong>two solutions</strong> for \"angles[1]\" in this range.\r\n"
"Via parameter <strong>guessAngle1</strong> (default = 0) the\r\n"
"returned solution is selected such that |angles[1] - guessAngle1| is\r\n"
"minimal. The transformation matrix between the world frame and\r\n"
"frame_a may be in a singular configuration with respect to \"sequence\", i.e.,\r\n"
"there is an infinite number of angle values leading to the same relative\r\n"
"transformation matrix. In this case, the returned solution is\r\n"
"selected by setting angles[1] = guessAngle1. Then angles[2]\r\n"
"and angles[3] can be uniquely determined in the above range.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The parameter <strong>sequence</strong> has the restriction that\r\n"
"only values 1,2,3 can be used and that sequence[1] &ne; sequence[2]\r\n"
"and sequence[2] &ne; sequence[3]. Often used values are:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"sequence = <strong>{1,2,3}</strong>  // Cardan or Tait-Bryan angle sequence\r\n"
"         = <strong>{3,1,3}</strong>  // Euler angle sequence\r\n"
"         = <strong>{3,2,1}</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个模型确定了将全局坐标系旋转到frame_a的三个角度，沿着由参数<strong>sequence</strong>定义的轴。\r\n"
"例如，如果sequence={3,1,2}，那么全局坐标系将围绕angles[1]沿z轴旋转，然后围绕angles[2]沿x轴旋转，最后围绕angles[3]沿y轴旋转，然后与frame_a相同。\r\n"
"这三个角度的范围为</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"-&pi;&lt;=angles[i]&lt;=&pi;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在这个范围内对于\"angles[1]\"有<strong>两个解</strong>。\r\n"
"通过参数<strong>guessAngle1</strong>(默认为0)，选择使得|angles[1]-guessAngle1|最小的解。\r\n"
"关于全局坐标系和frame_a之间的转换矩阵可能在相对于\"sequence\"的奇异配置中，即，存在无限多个角度值导致相同的相对转换矩阵。\r\n"
"在这种情况下，通过设置angles[1]=guessAngle1来选择返回的解。\r\n"
"然后angles[2]和angles[3]可以在上述范围内唯一确定。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"参数<strong>sequence</strong>有一个限制，只能使用值1、2、3，且sequence[1]&ne;sequence[2]以及sequence[2]&ne;sequence[3]。\r\n"
"通常使用的值有：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"sequence = <strong>{1,2,3}</strong>  // Cardan or Tait-Bryan angle sequence\r\n"
"         = <strong>{3,1,3}</strong>  // Euler angle sequence\r\n"
"         = <strong>{3,2,1}</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteAngularVelocity"
msgid "Measure absolute angular velocity of frame connector"
msgstr "测量坐标系连接器的绝对角速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteAngularVelocity"
msgid "Absolute angular velocity vector of frame_a with respect to world frame, resolved in frame defined by resolveInFrame"
msgstr "相对于全局坐标系，以resolveInFrame定义的坐标系解析的frame_a的绝对角速度矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteAngularVelocity"
msgid "Coordinate system in which w is optionally resolved"
msgstr "可选地将w解析到的坐标系"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteAngularVelocity"
msgid "Frame in which output vector w shall be resolved (world, frame_a, or frame_resolve)"
msgstr "w输出矢量应解析到的坐标系(世界，frame_a或frame_resolve)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteAngularVelocity"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteAngularVelocity"
msgid "rad/s"
msgstr "rad/s"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteAngularVelocity"
msgid "resolve"
msgstr "resolve"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.AbsoluteAngularVelocity"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The absolute angular velocity of frame_a with respect to the\r\n"
"world frame is\r\n"
"determined and provided at the output signal connector <strong>w</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Via parameter <strong>resolveInFrame</strong> it is defined, in which frame\r\n"
"the angular velocity is resolved:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame =<br>Types.ResolveInFrameA.</strong></th><th><strong>Meaning</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in world frame</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_a</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_resolve</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_resolve, the conditional connector\r\n"
"\"frame_resolve\" is enabled and w is resolved in the frame, to\r\n"
"which frame_resolve is connected. Note, if this connector is enabled, it must\r\n"
"be connected.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_a, the output vector is\r\n"
"computed as:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity2(frame_a.R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"相对于全局坐标系，坐标系frame_a的绝对角速度在输出信号连接器<strong>w</strong>处确定并提供。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过参数<strong>resolveInFrame</strong>定义了角速度在哪个坐标系中解析：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\"cellspacing=\"0\"cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame=<br>Types.ResolveInFrameA.</strong></th><th><strong>含义</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"<td>在全局坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_a中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_resolve中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_resolve，则条件连接器\"frame_resolve\"被启用，并且w在frame_resolve连接的坐标系中解析。\r\n"
"注意，如果启用此连接器，则必须连接它。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_a，则输出矢量计算为：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w=MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity2(frame_a.R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativePosition"
msgid "Measure relative position vector between the origins of two frame connectors"
msgstr "测量两个坐标系连接器原点之间的相对位置矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativePosition"
msgid "Relative position vector resolved in frame defined by resolveInFrame"
msgstr "相对位置矢量在resolveInFrame定义的坐标系中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativePosition"
msgid "Coordinate system in which r_rel is optionally resolved"
msgstr "可选地解析r_rel的坐标系"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativePosition"
msgid "Frame in which output vector r_rel shall be resolved (world, frame_a, frame_b, or frame_resolve)"
msgstr "输出矢量r_rel应在其中解析的坐标系(world、frame_a、frame_b或frame_resolve)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativePosition"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativePosition"
msgid "m"
msgstr "m"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativePosition"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The relative position vector between the origins of frame_a and frame_b are\r\n"
"determined and provided at the output signal connector <strong>r_rel</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Via parameter <strong>resolveInFrame</strong> it is defined, in which frame\r\n"
"the position vector is resolved:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame =<br>Types.ResolveInFrameAB.</strong></th><th><strong>Meaning</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in world frame</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_a</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_b</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_b</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_resolve</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_resolve, the conditional connector\r\n"
"\"frame_resolve\" is enabled and r_rel is resolved in the frame, to\r\n"
"which frame_resolve is connected. Note, if this connector is enabled, it must\r\n"
"be connected.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_a, the output vector is\r\n"
"computed as:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r_rel = MultiBody.Frames.resolve2(frame_a.R, frame_b.r_0 - frame_a.r_0);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"坐标系frame_a和frame_b原点之间的相对位置矢量在输出信号连接器<strong>r_rel</strong>处确定并提供。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过参数<strong>resolveInFrame</strong>定义了位置矢量在哪个坐标系中解析：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\"cellspacing=\"0\"cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame=<br>Types.ResolveInFrameAB.</strong></th><th><strong>含义</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"<td>在全局坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_a中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_b</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_b中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_resolve中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_resolve，则条件连接器\"frame_resolve\"被启用，并且r_rel在与frame_resolve连接的坐标系中解析。\r\n"
"注意，如果启用此连接器，则必须连接它。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_a，则输出矢量计算为：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r_rel=MultiBody.Frames.resolve2(frame_a.R,frame_b.r_0-frame_a.r_0);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeVelocity"
msgid "Measure relative velocity vector between the origins of two frame connectors"
msgstr "测量两个坐标系连接器原点之间的相对速度矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeVelocity"
msgid "Relative velocity vector resolved in frame defined by resolveInFrame"
msgstr "相对速度矢量在resolveInFrame定义的坐标系中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeVelocity"
msgid "Coordinate system in which v_rel is optionally resolved"
msgstr "可选解析v_rel的坐标系"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeVelocity"
msgid "Frame in which output vector v_rel shall be resolved (world, frame_a, frame_b, or frame_resolve)"
msgstr "输出矢量v_rel应解析在的坐标系(全局坐标系，frame_a，frame_b或frame_resolve)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeVelocity"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeVelocity"
msgid "m/s"
msgstr "m/s"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeVelocity"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The relative velocity vector between the origins of frame_a and of frame_b are\r\n"
"determined and provided at the output signal connector <strong>v_rel</strong>.\r\n"
"This vector is defined as:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r_rel = MultiBody.Frames.resolve2(frame_a.R, frame_b.r_0 - frame_a.r_0);\r\n"
"v_rel = <strong>der</strong>(r_rel);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Via parameter <strong>resolveInFrame</strong> it is defined, in which frame\r\n"
"the velocity vector is resolved:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame =<br>Types.ResolveInFrameAB.</strong></th><th><strong>Meaning</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in world frame</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_a</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_b</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_b</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_resolve</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_resolve, the conditional connector\r\n"
"\"frame_resolve\" is enabled and v_rel is resolved in the frame, to\r\n"
"which frame_resolve is connected. Note, if this connector is enabled, it must\r\n"
"be connected.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_b, the output vector is\r\n"
"computed as:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r_rel   = MultiBody.Frames.resolve2(frame_a.R, frame_b.r_0 - frame_a.r_0);\r\n"
"v_rel_a = <strong>der</strong>(r_rel);\r\n"
"v_rel   = MultiBody.Frames.resolveRelative(frame_a.R, frame_b.R, v_rel_a);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在frame_a的原点和frame_b的原点之间的相对速度矢量被确定并提供在输出信号连接器<strong>v_rel</strong>上。\r\n"
"该矢量定义为：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r_rel=MultiBody.Frames.resolve2(frame_a.R,frame_b.r_0-frame_a.r_0);\r\n"
"v_rel=<strong>der</strong>(r_rel);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过参数<strong>resolveInFrame</strong>定义了速度矢量在哪个坐标系中解析：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\"cellspacing=\"0\"cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame=<br>Types.ResolveInFrameAB.</strong></th><th><strong>意义</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"<td>在全局坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_a中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_b</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_b中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_resolve中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_resolve，则条件连接器“frame_resolve”被启用，并且v_rel被解析在frame_resolve连接的坐标系中。\r\n"
"注意，如果启用了此连接器，则必须连接它。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_b，则输出矢量计算为：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r_rel=MultiBody.Frames.resolve2(frame_a.R,frame_b.r_0-frame_a.r_0);\r\n"
"v_rel_a=<strong>der</strong>(r_rel);\r\n"
"v_rel=MultiBody.Frames.resolveRelative(frame_a.R,frame_b.R,v_rel_a);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngles"
msgid "Measure relative angles between two frame connectors"
msgstr "测量两个坐标系连接器之间的相对角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngles"
msgid "Angles to rotate frame_a into frame_b via 'sequence'"
msgstr "将frame_a旋转到frame_b的角度通过'sequence'进行"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngles"
msgid "Angles are returned to rotate frame_a around axes sequence[1], sequence[2] and finally sequence[3] into frame_b"
msgstr "返回将frame_a绕轴sequence[1]、sequence[2]和最终sequence[3]旋转到frame_b的角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngles"
msgid "Select angles[1] such that abs(angles[1] - guessAngle1) is a minimum"
msgstr "选择angles[1]使得abs(angles[1]-guessAngle1)最小"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngles"
msgid "Relative orientation object from frame_a to frame_b"
msgstr "从frame_a到frame_b的相对方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngles"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngles"
msgid "rad"
msgstr "rad"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngles"
msgid "a"
msgstr "a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngles"
msgid "b"
msgstr "b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngles"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model determines the 3 angles to rotate frame_a\r\n"
"into frame_b along the axes defined by parameter <strong>sequence</strong>.\r\n"
"For example, if sequence = {3,1,2} then frame_a is\r\n"
"rotated around angles[1] along the z-axis, afterwards it is rotated\r\n"
"around angles[2] along the x-axis, and finally it is rotated around\r\n"
"angles[3] along the y-axis and is then identical to frame_b.\r\n"
"The 3 angles are returned in the range\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"-&pi; &lt;= angles[i] &lt;= &pi;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"There are <strong>two solutions</strong> for \"angles[1]\" in this range.\r\n"
"Via parameter <strong>guessAngle1</strong> (default = 0) the\r\n"
"returned solution is selected such that |angles[1] - guessAngle1| is\r\n"
"minimal. The relative transformation matrix between frame_a and\r\n"
"frame_b may be in a singular configuration with respect to \"sequence\", i.e.,\r\n"
"there is an infinite number of angle values leading to the same relative\r\n"
"transformation matrix. In this case, the returned solution is\r\n"
"selected by setting angles[1] = guessAngle1. Then angles[2]\r\n"
"and angles[3] can be uniquely determined in the above range.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The parameter <strong>sequence</strong> has the restriction that\r\n"
"only values 1,2,3 can be used and that sequence[1] &ne; sequence[2]\r\n"
"and sequence[2] &ne; sequence[3]. Often used values are:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"sequence = <strong>{1,2,3}</strong>  // Cardan or Tait-Bryan angle sequence\r\n"
"         = <strong>{3,1,3}</strong>  // Euler angle sequence\r\n"
"         = <strong>{3,2,1}</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个模型确定了将frame_a旋转到frame_b的3个角度，沿着参数<strong>sequence</strong>定义的轴。\r\n"
"例如，如果sequence={3,1,2}，那么frame_a将沿着z轴绕angles[1]旋转，然后沿着x轴绕angles[2]旋转，最后沿着y轴绕angles[3]旋转，此时frame_a与frame_b相同。\r\n"
"这3个角度返回的范围为</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"-&pi;&lt;=angles[i]&lt;=&pi;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在这个范围内，“angles[1]”有<strong>两个解</strong>。\r\n"
"通过参数<strong>guessAngle1</strong>(默认值为0)选择返回的解，使得|angles[1]-guessAngle1|最小。\r\n"
"相对于\"sequence\"，frame_a和frame_b之间的相对变换矩阵可能处于奇异配置，即存在无限多个角度值导致相同的相对变换矩阵。\r\n"
"在这种情况下，通过设置angles[1]=guessAngle1来选择返回的解。\r\n"
"然后angles[2]和angles[3]可以在上述范围内唯一确定。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"参数<strong>sequence</strong>的限制是只能使用值1,2,3，并且sequence[1]&ne;sequence[2]以及sequence[2]&ne;sequence[3]。\r\n"
"常用的值有：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"sequence=<strong>{1,2,3}</strong>//Cardan或Tait-Bryan角序列\r\n"
"=<strong>{3,1,3}</strong>//欧拉角序列\r\n"
"=<strong>{3,2,1}</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngularVelocity"
msgid "Measure relative angular velocity between two frame connectors"
msgstr "测量两个连接器之间的相对角速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngularVelocity"
msgid "Relative angular velocity vector between frame_a and frame_b resolved in frame defined by resolveInFrame"
msgstr "frame_a和frame_b之间相对角速度矢量，解析在由resolveInFrame定义的坐标系中"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngularVelocity"
msgid "Coordinate system in which w_rel is optionally resolved"
msgstr "可选地解析w_rel的坐标系"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngularVelocity"
msgid "Frame in which output vector w_rel shall be resolved (world, frame_a, frame_b, or frame_resolve)"
msgstr "w_rel输出矢量应该解析在哪个坐标系中(world,frame_a,frame_b,或frame_resolve)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngularVelocity"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngularVelocity"
msgid "rad/s"
msgstr "rad/s"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.RelativeAngularVelocity"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The relative angular velocity between frame_a and frame_b is\r\n"
"determined and provided at the output signal connector <strong>w_rel</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Via parameter <strong>resolveInFrame</strong> it is defined, in which frame\r\n"
"the angular velocity is resolved:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame =<br>Types.ResolveInFrameAB.</strong></th><th><strong>Meaning</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in world frame</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_a</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_b</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_b</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_resolve</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In this basic sensor model, <strong>the connector frame_resolve\r\n"
"is always enabled</strong>.\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_resolve, the vector&nbsp;w_rel is\r\n"
"resolved in the frame to which frame_resolve is connected.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_a, the output vector is\r\n"
"computed as:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// Relative orientation object from frame_a to frame_b\r\n"
"R_rel = MultiBody.Frames.relativeRotation(frame_a.R, frame_b.R);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"// Angular velocity resolved in frame_a\r\n"
"w_rel = MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity1(R_rel);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"frame_a和frame_b之间的相对角速度通过输出信号连接器<strong>w_rel</strong>确定并提供。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过参数<strong>resolveInFrame</strong>定义了角速度解析在哪个坐标系中：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\"cellspacing=\"0\"cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame=<br>Types.ResolveInFrameAB.</strong></th><th><strong>含义</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"<td>在全局坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_a中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_b</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_b中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_resolve中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在这个基本传感器模型中，<strong>连接器frame_resolve总是被启用</strong>。\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_resolve，则矢量w_rel被解析到与frame_resolve连接的坐标系中。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>例子</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_a，则输出矢量计算为：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// Relative orientation object from frame_a to frame_b\r\n"
"R_rel = MultiBody.Frames.relativeRotation(frame_a.R, frame_b.R);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"// Angular velocity resolved in frame_a\r\n"
"w_rel = MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity1(R_rel);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

