msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.TransformAbsoluteVector"
msgid "resolve"
msgstr "resolve"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.TransformAbsoluteVector"
msgid "a"
msgstr "a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.TransformAbsoluteVector"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input vector \"Real r_in[3]\" is assumed to be an absolute kinematic quantity\r\n"
"of frame_a that is defined to be resolved in the frame defined\r\n"
"with parameter \"frame_r_in\". This model resolves vector r_in in the\r\n"
"coordinate system defined with parameter \"frame_r_out\" and returns the\r\n"
"transformed output vector as \"Real r_out[3]\";\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"假设输入矢量\"Real r_in[3]\"是frame_a的绝对运动量，定义为在参数\"frame_r_in\"定义的参考系中解析。\r\n"
"此模型将矢量r_in解析到由参数\"frame_r_out\"定义的坐标系中，并将转换后的输出矢量返回为\"Real r_out[3]\"；</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.TransformRelativeVector"
