msgid "Coordinate system a of which the absolute kinematic quantities are measured"
msgstr "测量绝对运动量的坐标系a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialAbsoluteSensor"
msgid "a"
msgstr "a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialAbsoluteSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a base class of a 3-dim. mechanical component with one frame\r\n"
"<strong>frame_a</strong> in order to measure an absolute quantity of this\r\n"
"connector.\r\n"
"This partial class can be used for sensors defined either by components or by equations.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个具有一个名为<strong>frame_a</strong>的三维机械组件的基类，用于测量该连接器的绝对量。\r\n"
"这个部分类可以用于由组件或方程式定义的传感器。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialAbsoluteBaseSensor"
msgid "Base class for absolute sensor models defined by equations (frame_resolve must be connected exactly once)"
msgstr "由方程式定义的绝对传感器模型的基类(frame_resolve必须连接一次)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialAbsoluteBaseSensor"
msgid "Coordinate system from which kinematic quantities are measured"
msgstr "测量运动量的坐标系"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialAbsoluteBaseSensor"
msgid "Coordinate system in which output vector(s) is optionally resolved"
msgstr "用于可选地解析输出矢量的坐标系"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialAbsoluteBaseSensor"
msgid "a"
msgstr "a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialAbsoluteBaseSensor"
msgid "resolve"
msgstr "resolve"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialAbsoluteBaseSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Partial base class for absolute sensor models defined by equations.\r\n"
"The connector frame_resolve is always enabled and must be connected exactly once.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"由方程式定义的绝对传感器模型的部分基类。\r\n"
"连接器frame_resolve始终启用，必须恰好连接一次。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "Base class for relative sensor models"
msgstr "相对传感器模型的基类"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "Coordinate system a"
msgstr "坐标系a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "Coordinate system b"
msgstr "坐标系b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "a"
msgstr "a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "b"
msgstr "b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a base class of a 3-dim. mechanical component with two frames\r\n"
"<strong>frame_a</strong> and <strong>frame_b</strong>\r\n"
"in order to measure a relative quantity between these two connectors.\r\n"
"This partial class can be used for sensors defined either by components or by equations.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个具有两个坐标系<strong>frame_a</strong>和<strong>frame_b</strong>的三维机械组件的基类，用于测量这两个连接器之间的相对量。\r\n"
"这个部分类可以用于由组件或方程式定义的传感器。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialRelativeBaseSensor"
msgid "Base class for relative sensor models defined by equations (frame_resolve must be connected exactly once)"
msgstr "由方程定义的相对传感器模型的基类(frame_resolve必须恰好连接一次)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialRelativeBaseSensor"
msgid "Coordinate system a (measurement is between frame_a and frame_b)"
msgstr "坐标系a(测量位于frame_a和frame_b之间)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialRelativeBaseSensor"
msgid "Coordinate system b (measurement is between frame_a and frame_b)"
msgstr "坐标系b(测量位于frame_a和frame_b之间)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialRelativeBaseSensor"
msgid "Coordinate system in which vector is optionally resolved"
msgstr "可选地解析矢量的坐标系"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialRelativeBaseSensor"
msgid "a"
msgstr "a"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialRelativeBaseSensor"
msgid "b"
msgstr "b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialRelativeBaseSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Partial base class for relative sensor models defined by equations.\r\n"
"The connector frame_resolve is always enabled and must be connected exactly once.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"由方程定义的相对传感器模型的部分基类。\r\n"
"连接器frame_resolve始终启用，必须恰好连接一次。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.BasicAbsolutePosition"
msgid "Basic sensor to measure absolute position vector"
msgstr "用于测量绝对位置矢量的基本传感器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.BasicAbsolutePosition"
msgid "Absolute position vector frame_a.r_0 resolved in frame defined by resolveInFrame"
msgstr "在由resolveInFrame定义的坐标系中解析的绝对位置矢量frame_a.r_0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.BasicAbsolutePosition"
msgid "Frame in which output vector r is resolved (world, frame_a, or frame_resolve)"
msgstr "解析输出矢量r所在的坐标系(world、frame_a或frame_resolve)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.BasicAbsolutePosition"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.BasicAbsolutePosition"
msgid "m"
msgstr "m"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.BasicAbsolutePosition"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This basic sensor is aimed to be used within advanced sensors where\r\n"
"the absolute position vector of the origin of frame_a should be determined.\r\n"
"This vector is provided at the output signal connector&nbsp;<strong>r</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Via parameter <strong>resolveInFrame</strong> it is defined in which frame\r\n"
"the position vector is resolved:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame =<br>Types.ResolveInFrameA.</strong></th><th><strong>Meaning</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in world frame</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_a</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_resolve</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In this basic sensor model, <strong>the connector frame_resolve\r\n"
"is always enabled and must be connected</strong>.\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_resolve, the vector&nbsp;r is\r\n"
"resolved in the frame to which frame_resolve is connected.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_a, the output vector is\r\n"
"computed as:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r = MultiBody.Frames.resolve2(frame_a.R, frame_b.r_0);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个基本传感器旨在在高级传感器中使用，应确定frame_a原点的绝对位置矢量。\r\n"
"该矢量在输出信号连接器<strong>r</strong>中提供。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过参数<strong>resolveInFrame</strong>定义了在哪个坐标系中解析位置矢量：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\"cellspacing=\"0\"cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame=<br>Types.ResolveInFrameA.</strong></th><th><strong>含义</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"<td>在全局坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_a坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_resolve坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在这个基本传感器模型中，<strong>连接器frame_resolve始终启用，必须连接</strong>。\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_resolve，则矢量&nbsp;r解析到连接到frame_resolve的坐标系中。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_a，则输出矢量计算为：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r=MultiBody.Frames.resolve2(frame_a.R,frame_b.r_0);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.BasicAbsoluteAngularVelocity"
msgid "Basic sensor to measure absolute angular velocity"
msgstr "用于测量绝对角速度的基本传感器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.BasicAbsoluteAngularVelocity"
msgid "Absolute angular velocity vector"
msgstr "绝对角速度矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.BasicAbsoluteAngularVelocity"
msgid "Frame in which output vector w is resolved (world, frame_a, or frame_resolve)"
msgstr "解析输出矢量w所在的坐标系(world、frame_a或frame_resolve)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.BasicAbsoluteAngularVelocity"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.BasicAbsoluteAngularVelocity"
msgid "rad/s"
msgstr "rad/s"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.BasicAbsoluteAngularVelocity"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This basic sensor is aimed to be used within advanced sensors where\r\n"
"the absolute angular velocity of frame_a should be determined.\r\n"
"This vector is provided at the output signal connector&nbsp;<strong>w</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Via parameter <strong>resolveInFrame</strong> it is defined, in which frame\r\n"
"the angular velocity is resolved:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame =<br>Types.ResolveInFrameA.</strong></th><th><strong>Meaning</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in world frame</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_a</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_resolve</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In this basic sensor model, <strong>the connector frame_resolve\r\n"
"is always enabled and must be connected</strong>.\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_resolve, the vector&nbsp;w is\r\n"
"resolved in the frame to which frame_resolve is connected.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_a, the output vector is\r\n"
"computed as:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity2(frame_a.R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个基本传感器旨在在高级传感器中使用，应确定frame_a的绝对角速度。\r\n"
"该矢量在输出信号连接器&nbsp;<strong>w</strong>中提供。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过参数<strong>resolveInFrame</strong>定义了在哪个坐标系中解析角速度：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\"cellspacing=\"0\"cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame=<br>Types.ResolveInFrameA.</strong></th><th><strong>含义</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"<td>在全局坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_a坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_resolve坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在这个基本传感器模型中，<strong>连接器frame_resolve始终启用，必须连接</strong>。\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_resolve，则矢量&nbsp;w解析到连接到frame_resolve的坐标系中。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameA.frame_a，则输出矢量计算为：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w=MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity2(frame_a.R);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

