msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.BasicRelativeAngularVelocity"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This basic sensor is aimed to be used within advanced sensors where\r\n"
"the relative angular velocity between frame_a and frame_b should be determined.\r\n"
"This vector is provided at the output signal connector&nbsp;<strong>w_rel</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Via parameter <strong>resolveInFrame</strong> it is defined, in which frame\r\n"
"the angular velocity is resolved:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame =<br>Types.ResolveInFrameAB.</strong></th><th><strong>Meaning</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in world frame</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_a</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_b</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_b</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_resolve</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In this basic sensor model, <strong>the connector frame_resolve\r\n"
"is always enabled and must be connected</strong>.\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_resolve, the vector&nbsp;w_rel is\r\n"
"resolved in the frame to which frame_resolve is connected.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If resolveInFrame = Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_a, the output vector is\r\n"
"computed as:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// Relative orientation object from frame_a to frame_b\r\n"
"R_rel = MultiBody.Frames.relativeRotation(frame_a.R, frame_b.R);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"// Angular velocity resolved in frame_a\r\n"
"w_rel = MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity1(R_rel);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个基本传感器旨在在高级传感器中使用，应确定frame_a和frame_b之间的相对角速度。\r\n"
"该矢量在输出信号连接器&nbsp;<strong>w_rel</strong>中提供。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过参数<strong>resolveInFrame</strong>定义了在哪个坐标系中解析角速度：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\"cellspacing=\"0\"cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>resolveInFrame=<br>Types.ResolveInFrameAB.</strong></th><th><strong>含义</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"<td>在全局坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_a坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_b</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_b坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_resolve坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在这个基本传感器模型中，<strong>连接器frame_resolve始终启用，必须连接</strong>。\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_resolve，则矢量&nbsp;w_rel解析到连接到frame_resolve的坐标系中。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果resolveInFrame=Types.ResolveInFrameAB.frame_a，则输出矢量计算为：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"//从frame_a到frame_b的相对方向对象\r\n"
"R_rel=MultiBody.Frames.relativeRotation(frame_a.R,frame_b.R);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"//在frame_a中解析的角速度\r\n"
"w_rel=MultiBody.Frames.angularVelocity1(R_rel);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

