msgstr "坐标系b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialCutForceSensor"
msgid "Output vectors are optionally resolved in this frame (cut-force/-torque are set to zero)"
msgstr "输出矢量可以选择在此坐标系中解析(局部力/力矩设置为零)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialCutForceSensor"
msgid "Frame in which output vector(s) is/are resolved (world, frame_a, or frame_resolve)"
msgstr "解析输出矢量的坐标系(world、frame_a或frame_resolve)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Sensors.Internal.PartialCutForceSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a base class for 3-dim. mechanical components with two frames\r\n"
"and one output port in order to measure the cut-force and/or\r\n"
"cut-torque acting between the two frames and\r\n"
"to provide the measured signals as output for further processing\r\n"
"with the blocks of package Modelica.Blocks.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个基类，用于具有两个坐标系和一个输出端口的三维机械组件，以测量两个坐标系之间作用的局部力和/或局部力矩，并将测量的信号作为输出提供，以供使用Modelica.Blocks包中的块进一步处理。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

