msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.PipeWithScalarField"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This replaceable function defines a particular color map.</p>\r\n"
"<!--a placeholder to fulfill minimum documentation length-->\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个可替换函数定义了特定的颜色映射。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<!--aplaceholdertofulfillminimumdocumentationlength-->\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.PipeWithScalarField"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.PipeWithScalarField"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Model <strong>PipeWithScalarField</strong> visualizes a pipe and a scalar\r\n"
"field along the pipe axis. The latter is shown by mapping scalar\r\n"
"field to color values with a color map and utilizing this color\r\n"
"at the perimeter associated with the corresponding axis location.\r\n"
"Typically the scalar field value is a temperature, but might\r\n"
"be also another quantity.\r\n"
"Predefined color maps are available from\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps\">MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps</a>\r\n"
"and can be selected via parameter \"colorMap\".\r\n"
"A color map with the corresponding scalar field values can be exported\r\n"
"as vector-graphics in svg-format with function\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg\">MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg</a>.\r\n"
"The position and orientation of the center of the\r\n"
"circle at the left end of the pipe is defined via parameters\r\n"
"\"r_0\" and \"R\", respectively. The pipe axis is oriented along\r\n"
"the x-axis of the local coordinate system described by \"R\",\r\n"
"see figure below:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/PipeWithScalarField.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The color coding is shown in the next figure. It was generated with\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg\">MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg</a>\r\n"
"using the following call:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"colorMapToSvg(Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps.jet(),\r\n"
"              height=50, nScalars=6, T_max=100, caption=\"Temperature in C\");\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/PipeWithScalarField-ColorMap.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"模型<strong>PipeWithScalarField</strong>可视化了管道和沿管道轴的标量场。\r\n"
"后者通过将标量场映射到颜色值并利用这种颜色在与相应轴位置相关联的周边显示。\r\n"
"通常，标量场值是温度，但也可能是其他数量。\r\n"
"预定义的颜色映射可从<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps\">MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps</a>获取，并可以通过参数\"colorMap\"选择。\r\n"
"带有相应标量场值的颜色映射可以通过函数<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg\">MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg</a>以svg格式导出为矢量图。\r\n"
"左端圆的位置和方向的定义通过参数\"r_0\"和\"R\"，分别指定。\r\n"
"管道轴沿着由\"R\"描述的局部坐标系的x轴方向，如下图所示：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/PipeWithScalarField.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"颜色编码显示在下图中。\r\n"
"它是使用以下调用生成的<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg\">MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg</a>：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"colorMapToSvg(Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps.jet(),\r\n"
"height=50,nScalars=6,T_max=100,caption=\"Temperature in C\");\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/PipeWithScalarField-ColorMap.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics"
msgid "Functions returning surface descriptions"
msgstr "返回曲面描述的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains functions that are used to define\r\n"
"parameterized surfaces for use with the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.Surface\">Surface</a>\r\n"
"model.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此包含有用于定义参数化表面的函数，可与<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.Surface\">Surface</a>模型一起使用。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.torus"
msgid "Function defining the surface characteristic of a torus"
msgstr "定义环面曲面特性的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.torus"
msgid "Major radius (distance from center of torus to center of tube)"
msgstr "主半径(从环面中心到管道中心的距离)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.torus"
msgid "Minor radius (radius of tube)"
msgstr "次半径(管道半径)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.torus"
msgid "Opening angle of torus"
msgstr "环面的开口角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.torus"
msgid "Start angle of torus slice"
msgstr "环面切片的起始角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.torus"
msgid "End angle of torus slice"
msgstr "环面切片的结束角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.torus"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>torus</strong> computes the X, Y and Z arrays to visualize a torus\r\n"
"with model <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Torus\">Torus</a>.\r\n"
"The left image below shows a torus with <var>R</var>&nbsp;=&nbsp;0.5&nbsp;m and\r\n"
"<var>r</var>&nbsp;=&nbsp;0.2&nbsp;m.\r\n"
"The right images below shows the torus with the additional parameter\r\n"
"settings:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"opening    =   45 degree\r\n"
"startAngle = -135 degree\r\n"
"stopAngle  =  135 degree\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/Torus.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>torus</strong>计算X、Y和Z数组，以可视化具有模型<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Torus\">Torus</a>的环面。\r\n"
"下图左侧显示了主半径为<var>R</var>&nbsp;=&nbsp;0.5&nbsp;m和次半径为<var>r</var>&nbsp;=&nbsp;0.2&nbsp;m的环面。\r\n"
"下图右侧显示了具有额外参数设置的环面：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"opening=45度\r\n"
"startAngle=-135度\r\n"
"stopAngle=135度\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/Torus.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.pipeWithScalarField"
msgid "Function defining the surface characteristic of a pipe where a scalar field value is displayed with color along the pipe axis"
msgstr "函数定义了管道曲面特性，其中标量场值沿着管道轴线以颜色显示"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.pipeWithScalarField"
msgid "Outer radius of cylinder"
msgstr "圆柱体的外半径"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.pipeWithScalarField"
msgid "Length of cylinder"
msgstr "圆柱体的长度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.pipeWithScalarField"
msgid "Relative position along the pipe with x[1] = 0, x[end] = 1"
msgstr "沿着管道的相对位置，其中x[1]=0，x[end]=1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.pipeWithScalarField"
msgid "Scalar field value at position xsi*length"
msgstr "位置xsi*length处的标量场值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.pipeWithScalarField"
msgid "T <= T_min is mapped to colorMap[1,:]"
msgstr "T<=T_min映射到colorMap[1,:]中"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.pipeWithScalarField"
msgid "T >= T_max is mapped to colorMap[end,:]"
msgstr "T>=T_max映射到colorMap[end,:]中"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.pipeWithScalarField"
msgid "Color map to map scalar T to a corresponding color"
msgstr "将标量T映射到相应颜色的颜色映射"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.pipeWithScalarField"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>pipeWithScalarField</strong> computes the X, Y, Z and C arrays in order to\r\n"
"visualize a pipe and a scalar field along the pipe axis with model\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.PipeWithScalarField\">PipeWithScalarField</a>.\r\n"
"The latter is shown by mapping scalar\r\n"
"field to color values with a color map and utilizing this color\r\n"
"at the perimeter associated with the corresponding axis location.\r\n"
"Typically the scalar field value is a temperature, but might\r\n"
"be also another quantity.\r\n"
"Predefined color maps are available from\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps\">MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps</a>\r\n"
"and can be selected via input argument \"colorMap\".\r\n"
"A color map with the corresponding scalar field values can be exported\r\n"
"as vector-graphics in svg-format with function\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg\">MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg</a>.\r\n"
"An example is shown in the next figure:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/PipeWithScalarField.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The color coding is shown in the next figure. It was generated with\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg\">Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg</a>\r\n"
"using the following call:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"colorMapToSvg(Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps.jet(),\r\n"
"              height=50, nScalars=6, T_max=100, heading=\"Temperature in C\");\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/PipeWithScalarField-ColorMap.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>pipeWithScalarField</strong>计算X、Y、Z和C数组，以便使用模型<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.PipeWithScalarField\">PipeWithScalarField</a>可视化管道和沿管道轴线的标量场。\r\n"
"通过将标量场映射到颜色值，并在与相应轴位置相关联的周边使用此颜色来显示后者。\r\n"
"通常，标量场值是温度，但也可能是其他数量。\r\n"
"预定义的颜色映射可通过输入参数\"colorMap\"从<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps\">MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps</a>中选择。\r\n"
"可以使用函数<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg\">MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg</a>将具有相应标量场值的颜色映射导出为矢量图形的svg格式。\r\n"
"示例如下图所示：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/PipeWithScalarField.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"颜色编码如下图所示。\r\n"
"它是使用<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg\">Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.colorMapToSvg</a>生成的，调用如下：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"colorMapToSvg(Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Colors.ColorMaps.jet(),\r\n"
"height=50,nScalars=6,T_max=100,heading=\"Temperature in C\");\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/PipeWithScalarField-ColorMap.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.rectangle"
msgid "Function defining the surface characteristic of a planar rectangle"
msgstr "定义平面矩形表面特性的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.rectangle"
msgid "Length in direction u"
msgstr "u方向的长度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.rectangle"
msgid "Length in direction v"
msgstr "v方向的长度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Advanced.SurfaceCharacteristics.rectangle"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>rectangle</strong> computes the X, Y and Z arrays to visualize a rectangle\r\n"
"with model <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Rectangle\">Rectangle</a>.\r\n"
"The image below shows two rectangles of\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"nu = 8,\r\n"
"nv = 3,\r\n"
"lu = 3,\r\n"
"lv = 2.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/Rectangle.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>rectangle</strong>计算X、Y和Z数组以可视化一个矩形，使用模型<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Rectangle\">Rectangle</a>。\r\n"
"下图显示了两个矩形，其中</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"nu=8,\r\n"
"nv=3,\r\n"
"lu=3,\r\n"
"lv=2.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/Rectangle.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal"
msgid "Makeshift visualizers for display of three-dimensional fonts using cylinders"
msgstr "使用圆柱体制作三维字体的临时可视化工具"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains components to construct 3-dim. fonts\r\n"
"with \"cylinder\" elements for the animation window.\r\n"
"This is a makeshift as long as the support of 3-dim. fonts is not specified in the\r\n"
"Modelica language. The components are used to construct the \"x\", \"y\",\r\n"
"\"z\" labels of coordinates systems in the animation.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此包含有用于在动画窗口中构建带有\"cylinder\"元素的三维字体的组件。\r\n"
"这是一个临时解决方案，只要Modelica语言中未指定对三维字体的支持。\r\n"
"这些组件用于构建动画中坐标系的\"x\"、\"y\"、\"z\"标签。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines"
msgid "Visualizing a set of lines as cylinders (e.g., used to display characters)"
msgstr "将一组线条视为圆柱体(例如，用于显示字符)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines"
msgid "= true, if animation shall be enabled"
msgstr "=如果要启用动画，则为true"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines"
msgid "The 'lines' are visualized 'scale' times bigger"
msgstr "通过'scale'倍放大可视化的'lines'"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines"
msgid "if animation = true"
msgstr "如果animation=true"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines"
msgid "List of start and end points of cylinders resolved along n_x and n_y"
msgstr "沿n_x和n_y分辨率解析的圆柱体的起始点和终点列表"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines"
msgid "Diameter of the cylinders defined by lines"
msgstr "由线条定义的圆柱体的直径"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines"
msgid "Position vector from origin of frame_a to the origin of the 'lines' frame, resolved in frame_a"
msgstr "从frame_a的原点到'lines'坐标系的原点的位置矢量，以frame_a为基准解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines"
msgid "Vector in direction of x-axis of 'lines' frame, resolved in frame_a."
msgstr "定义'lines'坐标系x轴方向的矢量，以frame_a为基准解析。\r\n"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines"
msgid "Vector in direction of y-axis of 'lines' frame, resolved in frame_a."
msgstr "定义'lines'坐标系y轴方向的矢量，以frame_a为基准解析。\r\n"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines"
msgid "Color of cylinders"
msgstr "圆柱体的颜色"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines"
msgid "Reflection of ambient light (= 0: light is completely absorbed)"
msgstr "环境光的反射(=0：光完全被吸收)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"With model <strong>FixedLines</strong> a set of lines is defined\r\n"
"that are located relatively to frame_a. Every line\r\n"
"is represented by a cylinder. This allows to define simple shaped\r\n"
"3-dimensional characters. An example is shown in the\r\n"
"following figure:<br>&nbsp;\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/Internal/FixedLines.png\" alt=\"model Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines\"></div>\r\n"
"<p>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"The two letters \"x\" and \"y\" are constructed with 4 lines\r\n"
"by providing the following data for parameter <strong>lines</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"lines = {[0, 0; 1, 1],[0, 1; 1, 0],[1.5, -0.5; 2.5, 1],[1.5, 1; 2, 0.25]}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Via parameter vectors <strong>n_x</strong> and <strong>n_y</strong> a two-dimensional\r\n"
"coordinate system is defined. The points defined with parameter\r\n"
"<strong>lines</strong> are with respect to this coordinate system. For example\r\n"
"\"[0, 0; 1, 1]\" defines a line that starts at {0,0} and ends at {1,1}.\r\n"
"The diameter and color of all line cylinders are identical.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"使用模型<strong>FixedLines</strong>定义了一组相对于frame_a的线条。\r\n"
"每条线由一个圆柱体表示。\r\n"
"这允许定义简单形状的三维字符。\r\n"
"下图显示了一个示例：<br>&nbsp;</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/Internal/FixedLines.png\"alt=\"model Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines\"></div>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"&nbsp;<br>通过提供以下参数数据给参数<strong>lines</strong>，使用4条线条构建了两个字母“x”和“y”</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"lines={[0,0;1,1],[0,1;1,0],[1.5,-0.5;2.5,1],[1.5,1;2,0.25]}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过参数矢量<strong>n_x</strong>和<strong>n_y</strong>定义了一个二维坐标系。\r\n"
"使用参数<strong>lines</strong>定义的点是相对于此坐标系的。\r\n"
"例如“[0,0;1,1]”定义了一条从{0,0}到{1,1}的线。\r\n"
"所有线圆柱体的直径和颜色都相同。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.Lines"
msgid "Visualizing a set of lines as cylinders with variable size, e.g., used to display characters (no Frame connector)"
msgstr "将一组线段可变大小显示为圆柱体，例如，用于显示字符(没有坐标系连接器)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.Lines"
msgid "Orientation object to rotate the world frame into the object frame"
msgstr "将全局坐标系旋转到对象坐标系的方向对象"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.Lines"
msgid "Position vector from origin of world frame to origin of object frame, resolved in world frame"
msgstr "从全局坐标系原点到对象坐标系原点的位置矢量，以全局坐标系解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.Lines"
msgid "Position vector from origin of object frame to the origin of 'lines' frame, resolved in object frame"
msgstr "从对象坐标系原点到'lines'坐标系原点的位置矢量，以对象坐标系解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.Lines"
msgid "Vector in direction of x-axis of 'lines' frame, resolved in object frame"
msgstr "在对象坐标系中沿着'lines'坐标系x轴方向的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.Lines"
msgid "Vector in direction of y-axis of 'lines' frame, resolved in object frame"
msgstr "在对象坐标系中沿着'lines'坐标系y轴方向的矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.Lines"
msgid "List of start and end points of cylinders resolved in an x-y frame defined by n_x, n_y, e.g., {[0,0;1,1], [0,1;1,0], [2,0; 3,1]}"
msgstr "以由n_x、n_y定义的x-y坐标系解析的圆柱体起点和终点列表，例如，{[0,0;1,1],[0,1;1,0],[2,0;3,1]}"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.Lines"
msgid "Diameter of the cylinders defined by lines"
msgstr "由线段定义的圆柱体直径"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.Lines"
msgid "Color of cylinders"
msgstr "圆柱体的颜色"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.Lines"
msgid "Reflection of ambient light (= 0: light is completely absorbed)"
msgstr "环境光的反射(=0：完全吸收光)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.Lines"
msgid "Number of cylinders"
msgstr "圆柱体的数量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.Lines"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.Internal.Lines"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"With model <strong>Lines</strong> a set of dynamic lines is defined\r\n"
"that are located relatively to frame_a. Every line\r\n"
"is represented by a cylinder. This allows, e.g., to define simple shaped\r\n"
"3-dimensional characters. Note, if the lines are fixed relatively to frame_a,\r\n"
"it is more convenient to use model <strong>Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines</strong>.\r\n"
"An example for dynamic lines is shown in the following figure:<br>&nbsp;\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/Internal/FixedLines.png\" alt=\"model Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines\"></div>\r\n"
"<p>&nbsp;<br>\r\n"
"The two letters \"x\" and \"y\" are constructed with 4 lines\r\n"
"by providing the following data for input variable <strong>lines</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"lines = {[0, 0; 1, 1],[0, 1; 1, 0],[1.5, -0.5; 2.5, 1],[1.5, 1; 2, 0.25]}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Via vectors <strong>n_x</strong> and <strong>n_y</strong> a two-dimensional\r\n"
"coordinate system is defined. The points defined with variable\r\n"
"<strong>lines</strong> are with respect to this coordinate system. For example\r\n"
"\"[0, 0; 1, 1]\" defines a line that starts at {0,0} and ends at {1,1}.\r\n"
"The        and color of all line cylinders are identical\r\n"
"and are defined by parameters.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"使用模型<strong>FixedLines</strong>定义了一组相对于frame_a的线段。\r\n"
"每条线段由一个圆柱体表示。\r\n"
"这允许定义简单形状的三维字符。\r\n"
"下图显示了一个示例：<br>&nbsp;</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/Internal/FixedLines.png\"alt=\"model Visualizers.Internal.FixedLines\"></div>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"&nbsp;<br>通过提供以下参数数据给参数<strong>lines</strong>，可以用4条线段构建两个字母\"x\"和\"y\"：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"lines={[0,0;1,1],[0,1;1,0],[1.5,-0.5;2.5,1],[1.5,1;2,0.25]}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过参数矢量<strong>n_x</strong>和<strong>n_y</strong>定义了一个二维坐标系。\r\n"
"参数<strong>lines</strong>中定义的点是相对于这个坐标系的。\r\n"
"例如，\"[0, 0; 1, 1]\"定义了一条从{0,0}开始到{1,1}结束的线段。\r\n"
"所有线圆柱体的直径和颜色都相同。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "Constants and types with choices, especially to build menus"
msgstr "常量和类型，特别是用于构建菜单"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In this package <strong>types</strong> and <strong>constants</strong> are defined that are used in the\r\n"
"MultiBody library. The types have additional annotation choices\r\n"
"definitions that define the menus to be built up in the graphical\r\n"
"user interface when the type is used as parameter in a declaration.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在这个包中定义了在MultiBody库中使用的<strong>类型</strong>和<strong>常量</strong>。\r\n"
"这些类型具有额外的注解选择定义，定义了在图形用户界面中构建菜单时在声明中将类型用作参数时要建立的菜单。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "Axis vector with choices"
msgstr "带有选择的轴矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Type definition of an axis vector with scroll down menu that provides\r\n"
"the most often used axes vectors along the coordinate axes of a frame.\r\n"
"For an example see parameter \"n\" in model\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Revolute\">Joints.Revolute</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"轴矢量的类型定义，带有下拉菜单，提供了沿坐标系坐标轴的最常用轴矢量。\r\n"
"例如，请参见模型中的参数“n”<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Revolute\">Joints.Revolute</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "Label of axis with choices"
msgstr "带有选择的轴标签"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "Sequence of planar frame rotations with choices"
msgstr "带有选择的平面框架旋转序列"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "RGB representation of color"
msgstr "颜色的RGB表示"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Type <strong>Color</strong> is an Integer vector with 3 elements,\r\n"
"{r, g, b}, and specifies the color of a shape.\r\n"
"{r, g, b} are the \"red\", \"green\" and \"blue\" color parts.\r\n"
"Note, r, g and b are given in the range 0&nbsp;&hellip;&nbsp;255.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"类型 <strong>Color</strong> 是一个具有3个元素的整数向量，{r, g, b}，指定了形状的颜色。\r\n"
"{r, g, b} 分别是 \"红色\"、\"绿色\" 和 \"蓝色\" 的颜色部分。\r\n"
"注意，r、g 和 b 的取值范围为 0&nbsp;&hellip;&nbsp;255。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "RGB representation of color as Real type"
msgstr "颜色的RGB表示，作为实数类型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Type <strong>RealColor</strong> is a Real vector with 3 elements,\r\n"
"{r, g, b}, and specifies the color of a shape.\r\n"
"{r,g,b} are the \"red\", \"green\" and \"blue\" color parts.\r\n"
"Note, r, g and b are given in the range 0&nbsp;&hellip;&nbsp;255.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"类型<strong>RealColor</strong>是一个具有3个实数元素的矢量，{r,g,b}，指定了形状的颜色。\r\n"
"{r,g,b}分别是\"红色\"、\"绿色\"和\"蓝色\"的颜色部分。\r\n"
"注意，r、g和b的取值范围为0&nbsp;&hellip;&nbsp;255。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "Reflection of ambient light (= 0: light is completely absorbed)"
msgstr "环境光的反射(=0：光完全被吸收)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Type <strong>SpecularCoefficient</strong> defines the reflection of\r\n"
"ambient light on shape surfaces. If value = 0, the light\r\n"
"is completely absorbed. Often, 0.7 is a reasonable value.\r\n"
"It might be that from some viewing directions, a body is no\r\n"
"longer visible, if the SpecularCoefficient value is too high.\r\n"
"In the following image, the different values of SpecularCoefficient\r\n"
"are shown for a cylinder:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Types/SpecularCoefficient.png\"/>\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"类型<strong>SpecularCoefficient</strong>定义了形状表面对环境光的反射。\r\n"
"如果值=0，则光完全被吸收。\r\n"
"通常情况下，0.7是一个合理的值。\r\n"
"如果SpecularCoefficient值过高，则从某些视角可能看不到物体。\r\n"
"在下面的图像中，展示了圆柱体的不同SpecularCoefficient值：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Types/SpecularCoefficient.png\"/>\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "Type of shape (box, sphere, cylinder, pipecylinder, cone, pipe, beam, gearwheel, spring, <external shape>)"
msgstr "形状类型(长方体、球体、圆柱体、管状圆柱体、锥体、管道、梁、齿轮、弹簧，<外部形状>)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Type <strong>ShapeType</strong> is used to define the shape of the\r\n"
"visual object as parameter String. Usually, \"shapeType\" is used\r\n"
"as instance name. The following\r\n"
"values for shapeType are possible, e.g., shapeType=\"box\":\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/Shape.png\" alt=\"model Visualizers.FixedShape\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The dark blue arrows in the figure above are directed along\r\n"
"variable <strong>lengthDirection</strong>. The light blue arrows are directed\r\n"
"along variable <strong>widthDirection</strong>. The <strong>coordinate systems</strong>\r\n"
"in the figure represent frame_a of the Shape component.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Additionally, external shapes can be specified as (not all options might be supported by all tools):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>\"1\", \"2\",&nbsp;&hellip;</strong><br>\r\n"
"     define external shapes specified in DXF format in files \"1.dxf\", \"2.dxf\",&nbsp;&hellip;\r\n"
"     The DXF-files must be found either in the current directory or in the directory where\r\n"
"     the Shape instance is stored that references the DXF file.\r\n"
"     This (very limited) option should not be used for new models. Example:<br>\r\n"
"    shapeType=\"1\".<br></li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> \"<strong>modelica:</strong>//&lt;Modelica-name&gt;/&lt;relative-path-file-name&gt;\"<br>\r\n"
"     characterizes the file that is stored under the location of the\r\n"
"     &lt;Modelica-name&gt; library path with the given relative file name.\r\n"
"     Example:<br> shapeType = \"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Data/Shapes/Engine/piston.dxf\".<br></li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> \"<strong>file:</strong>//&lt;absolute-file-name&gt;\"<br>\r\n"
"     characterizes an absolute file name in the file system. Example:<br>\r\n"
"     shapeType=\"file://C:/users/myname/shapes/piston.dxf\".</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The supported file formats are tool dependent. Most tools support\r\n"
"at least DXF-files (a tool might support 3-dim. Face of the DXF format only),\r\n"
"but may support other format as well (such as stl, obj, 3ds).\r\n"
"Since visualization files contain color and other data, the corresponding\r\n"
"information in the model is usually ignored.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"类型<strong>ShapeType</strong>用于以字符串参数定义可视对象的形状。\r\n"
"通常情况下，\"shapeType\"被用作实例名称。\r\n"
"下面是shapeType的可能取值，例如，shapeType=\"box\"：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Mechanics/MultiBody/Visualizers/Shape.png\"alt=\"model Visualizers.FixedShape\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"上图中的深蓝色箭头沿着变量<strong>lengthDirection</strong>指向。\r\n"
"浅蓝色箭头沿着变量<strong>widthDirection</strong>指向。\r\n"
"图中的<strong>坐标系</strong>表示形状组件的frame_a。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"另外，可以指定外部形状(不是所有选项都可能被所有工具支持)：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><strong>\"1\",\"2\",&nbsp;&hellip;</strong><br>\r\n"
"定义以DXF格式指定的外部形状，文件名为\"1.dxf\"、\"2.dxf\"、&nbsp;&hellip;DXF文件必须位于当前目录或引用DXF文件的形状实例所在的目录中。\r\n"
"这个(非常有限的)选项不应该用于新模型。\r\n"
"示例：<br>\r\n"
"shapeType=\"1\".<br></li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li>\"<strong>modelica:</strong>//&lt;Modelica-name&gt;/&lt;relative-path-file-name&gt;\"<br>\r\n"
"表示存储在&lt;Modelica-name&gt;库路径下具有给定相对文件名的文件。\r\n"
"示例：<br>shapeType=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Data/Shapes/Engine/piston.dxf\".<br></li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li>\"<strong>file:</strong>//&lt;absolute-file-name&gt;\"<br>\r\n"
"表示文件系统中的绝对文件名。\r\n"
"示例：<br>\r\n"
"shapeType=\"file://C:/users/myname/shapes/piston.dxf\"。\r\n"
"</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"支持的文件格式取决于工具。\r\n"
"大多数工具至少支持DXF文件(某些工具可能仅支持DXF格式的三维面)，但也可能支持其他格式(如stl、obj、3ds)。\r\n"
"由于可视化文件包含颜色和其他数据，因此模型中的相应信息通常被忽略。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "Type of the additional data that can be defined for an elementary ShapeType"
msgstr "用于定义可为基本ShapeType定义的额外数据的类型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This type is used in shapes of visual objects to define\r\n"
"extra data depending on the shape type. Usually, input\r\n"
"variable <strong>extra</strong> is used as instance name:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>shapeType</strong></th><th>Meaning of parameter <strong>extra</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"  <td>\"cylinder\"</td>\r\n"
"  <td>if extra&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;0, a black line is included in the\r\n"
"      cylinder to show the rotation of it.</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"  <td>\"cone\"</td>\r\n"
"  <td>extra = diameter-left-side / diameter-right-side, i.e.,<br>\r\n"
"      extra = 1: cylinder<br>\r\n"
"      extra = 0: \"real\" cone.</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"  <td>\"pipe\"</td>\r\n"
"  <td>extra = outer-diameter / inner-diameter, i.e,<br>\r\n"
"      extra = 1: cylinder that is completely hollow<br>\r\n"
"      extra = 0: cylinder without a hole.</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"  <td>\"gearwheel\"</td>\r\n"
"  <td>extra is the number of teeth of the (external) gear.\r\n"
"If extra&nbsp;&lt;&nbsp;0, an internal gear is visualized with |extra| teeth.\r\n"
"The axis of the gearwheel is along \"lengthDirection\", and usually:\r\n"
"width = height = 2*radiusOfGearWheel.</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"  <td>\"spring\"</td>\r\n"
"  <td>extra is the number of windings of the spring.\r\n"
"      Additionally, \"height\" is <strong>not</strong> the \"height\" but\r\n"
"      2*coil-width.</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"  <td>external shape</td>\r\n"
"  <td>extra = 0: Visualization from file is not scaled.<br>\r\n"
"                     extra = 1: Visualization from file is scaled with \"length\", \"width\" and \"height\"\r\n"
"                                of the shape</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该类型用于可视对象的形状中，根据形状类型定义额外数据。\r\n"
"通常，输入变量<strong>extra</strong>用作实例名称：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\"cellspacing=\"0\"cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>shapeType</strong></th><th>参数<strong>extra</strong>的含义</th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>\"cylinder\"</td>\r\n"
"<td>如果extra&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;0，则在圆柱体中包含一条黑线，用于显示其旋转。\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>\"cone\"</td>\r\n"
"<td>extra=左侧直径/右侧直径，即，<br>\r\n"
"extra=1:圆柱体<br>\r\n"
"extra=0:\"真实\"圆锥体。\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>\"pipe\"</td>\r\n"
"<td>extra=外直径/内直径，即，<br>\r\n"
"extra=1:完全中空的圆柱体<br>\r\n"
"extra=0:没有孔的圆柱体。\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>\"gearwheel\"</td>\r\n"
"<td>extra是(外部)齿轮的齿数。\r\n"
"如果extra&nbsp;&lt;&nbsp;0，则使用|extra|齿数可视化内齿轮。\r\n"
"齿轮轴沿\"lengthDirection\"，通常为：\r\n"
"宽度=高度=2*radiusOfGearWheel。\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>\"spring\"</td>\r\n"
"<td>extra是弹簧的匝数。\r\n"
"此外，“高度”不是指“高度”，而是2*coil-width。\r\n"
"</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>外部形状</td>\r\n"
"<td>extra=0:文件中的可视化未缩放。\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"extra=1：文件中的可视化按形状的\"length\"、\"width\"和\"height\"缩放</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "Resolve in world frame"
msgstr "在全局坐标系中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "Resolve in frame_a"
msgstr "在frame_a中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "Resolve in frame_resolve (frame_resolve must be connected)"
msgstr "在frame_resolve中解析(必须连接frame_resolve)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "Enumeration to define the frame in which an absolute vector is resolved (world, frame_a, frame_resolve)"
msgstr "用于定义绝对矢量在哪个坐标系中解析的枚举类型(全局坐标系、frame_a、frame_resolve)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>Types.ResolveInFrameA.</strong></th><th><strong>Meaning</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in world frame</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_a</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_resolve (frame_resolve must be connected)</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\"cellspacing=\"0\"cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>Types.ResolveInFrameA.</strong></th><th><strong>含义</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"<td>在全局坐标系中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_a</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_a中解析矢量</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"<td>在frame_resolve中解析矢量(必须连接frame_resolve)</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "Resolve in frame_b"
msgstr "在frame_b中解析"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "Enumeration to define the frame in which an absolute vector is resolved (world, frame_b, frame_resolve)"
msgstr "用于定义绝对矢量在哪个坐标系中解析的枚举类型(全局坐标系、frame_b、frame_resolve)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Types"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>Types.ResolveInFrameB.</strong></th><th><strong>Meaning</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in world frame</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_b</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_b</td></tr>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<tr><td>frame_resolve</td>\r\n"
"    <td>Resolve vector in frame_resolve (frame_resolve must be connected)</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\"cellspacing=\"0\"cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>Types.ResolveInFrameB.</strong></th><th><strong>含义</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>world</td>\r\n"
