msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples"
msgid "Demonstration examples of the components of this package"
msgstr "演示转动库组件的示例"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains example models to demonstrate the usage of the\r\n"
"Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational package. Open the models and\r\n"
"simulate them according to the provided description in the models.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该包包含示例模型，用于演示 Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational 包的使用方法。打开模型并根据模型中提供的描述进行仿真。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.First"
msgid "First example: simple drive train"
msgstr "第一个案例：简单的传动系统"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.First"
msgid "Amplitude of driving torque"
msgstr "驱动扭矩幅度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.First"
msgid "Frequency of driving torque"
msgstr "驱动扭矩频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.First"
msgid "Motor inertia"
msgstr "电机一维惯性转动组件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.First"
msgid "Load inertia"
msgstr "负载一维惯性转动组件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.First"
msgid "Gear ratio"
msgstr "齿轮比"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.First"
msgid "Damping in bearing of gear"
msgstr "齿轮轴承的阻尼"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.First"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The drive train consists of a motor inertia which is driven by\r\n"
"a sine-wave motor torque. Via a gearbox the rotational energy is\r\n"
"transmitted to a load inertia. Elasticity in the gearbox is modeled\r\n"
"by a spring element. A linear damper is used to model the\r\n"
"damping in the gearbox bearing.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Note, that a force component (like the damper of this example)\r\n"
"which is acting between a shaft and the housing has to be fixed\r\n"
"in the housing on one side via component Fixed.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Simulate for 1 second and plot the following variables:<br>\r\n"
"   angular velocities of inertias inertia2 and 3: inertia2.w, inertia3.w</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"传动系统由含转动惯量的电机组成， 该电机由正弦波电机扭矩驱动。 通过齿轮箱，转动能量传递给带一维惯性转动的负载。 齿轮箱的弹性通过弹簧元件进行建模。 线性阻尼器用于模拟齿轮箱的轴承中的阻尼。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请注意，作用在轴和壳体之间的力（如本示例中的阻尼器）必须通过组件Fixed在壳体上的一侧固定。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"模拟1秒并绘制以下变量：<br> 一维惯性转动组件(inertia2和inertia3)的角速度：inertia2.w，inertia3.w\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.FirstGrounded"
msgid "First example: simple drive train with grounded elements"
msgstr "第一个例子：包含与地面接触的部分的简单传动系统"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.FirstGrounded"
msgid "Amplitude of driving torque"
msgstr "驱动扭矩的幅度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.FirstGrounded"
msgid "Frequency of driving torque"
msgstr "驱动扭矩的频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.FirstGrounded"
msgid "Motor inertia"
msgstr "电机惯性"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.FirstGrounded"
msgid "Load inertia"
msgstr "负载惯性"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.FirstGrounded"
msgid "Gear ratio"
msgstr "齿轮比"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.FirstGrounded"
msgid "Damping in bearing of gear"
msgstr "齿轮轴承的阻尼"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.FirstGrounded"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>The drive train consists of a motor inertia which is driven by\r\n"
"a sine-wave motor torque. Via a gearbox the rotational energy is\r\n"
"transmitted to a load inertia. Elasticity in the gearbox is modeled\r\n"
"by a spring element. A linear damper is used to model the\r\n"
"damping in the gearbox bearing.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Note, that a force component (like the damper of this example)\r\n"
"which is acting between a shaft and the housing has to be fixed\r\n"
"in the housing on one side via component Fixed.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Simulate for 1 second and plot the following variables:<br>\r\n"
"   angular velocities of inertias inertia2 and 3: inertia2.w, inertia3.w</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"传动系统由带转动惯量的电机组成，电机的一维转动惯性组件受正弦波驱动扭矩来驱动。 通过齿轮箱，转动能量传递到负载的惯性组件上。 齿轮箱的弹性通过对弹簧元件建模。线性阻尼器用于模拟齿轮箱轴承中的阻尼。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请注意，作用在轴与壳体之间的力（例如本例中的阻尼器）必须通过组件 Fixed 在壳体上的一侧固定。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"模拟1秒，并绘制以下变量：<br> 惯性组件 inertia2 和 inertia3 的角速度：inertia2.w、inertia3.w\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.Friction"
msgid "Drive train with clutch and brake"
msgstr "带离合器和制动器的传动系统"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.Friction"
msgid "Start time of step"
msgstr "阶跃开始时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.Friction"
msgid "Driving torque of inertia3"
msgstr "惯性3的驱动扭矩"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.Friction"
msgid "Friction torque of clutch"
msgstr "离合器的摩擦扭矩"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.Friction"
msgid "Friction torque of brake"
msgstr "刹车的摩擦扭矩"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.Friction"
msgid "Spring torque"
msgstr "弹簧扭矩"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.Friction"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This drive train contains a frictional <strong>clutch</strong> and a <strong>brake</strong>.\r\n"
"Simulate the system for 1 second using the following initial\r\n"
"values (defined already in the model):</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"inertia1.w =  90 (or brake.w)\r\n"
"inertia2.w =  90\r\n"
"inertia3.w = 100\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>Plot the output signals</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"tMotor      Torque of motor\r\n"
"tClutch     Torque in clutch\r\n"
"tBrake      Torque in brake\r\n"
"tSpring     Torque in spring\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>as well as the absolute angular velocities of the three inertia components\r\n"
"(inertia1.w, inertia2.w, inertia3.w).</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该传动系统包含一个摩擦型<strong>离合器</strong>和一个<strong>刹车</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"使用以下初始值（在模型中已定义）模拟系统1秒：</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"inertia1.w =  90 (or brake.w)\r\n"
"inertia2.w =  90\r\n"
"inertia3.w = 100\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>绘制输出信号</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"tMotor      Torque of motor\r\n"
"tClutch     Torque in clutch\r\n"
"tBrake      Torque in brake\r\n"
"tSpring     Torque in spring\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>以及三个惯性组件的绝对角速度（inertia1.w，inertia2.w，inertia3.w）。</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.CoupledClutches"
msgid "Drive train with 3 dynamically coupled clutches"
msgstr "具有3个动态耦合离合器的传动系统"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.CoupledClutches"
msgid "Frequency of sine function to invoke clutch1"
msgstr "用于调用离合器1的正弦函数的频率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.CoupledClutches"
msgid "Time when clutch2 is invoked"
msgstr "调用离合器2的时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.CoupledClutches"
msgid "Time when clutch3 is invoked"
msgstr "调用离合器3的时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.CoupledClutches"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This example demonstrates how variable structure\r\n"
"drive trains are handled. The drive train consists\r\n"
"of 4 inertias and 3 clutches, where the clutches\r\n"
"are controlled by input signals. The system has\r\n"
"2^3=8 different configurations and 3^3 = 27\r\n"
"different states (every clutch may be in forward\r\n"
"sliding, backward sliding or locked mode when the\r\n"
"relative angular velocity is zero). By invoking the\r\n"
"clutches at different time instances, the switching\r\n"
"of the configurations can be studied.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Simulate the system for 1.2 seconds with the\r\n"
"following initial values:<br>\r\n"
"J1.w = 10.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Plot the following variables:<br>\r\n"
"angular velocities of inertias (J1.w, J2.w, J3.w,\r\n"
"J4.w), frictional torques of clutches (clutchX.tau),\r\n"
"frictional mode of clutches (clutchX.mode) where\r\n"
"mode = -1/0/+1 means backward sliding,\r\n"
"locked, forward sliding.</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>此示例演示了如何处理可变结构的传动系统。\r\n"
"传动系统由4个一维转动惯性组件和3个离合器组成，\r\n"
"其中离合器由输入信号控制。\r\n"
"该系统有2^3=8种不同的配置和3^3=27种不同的状态\r\n"
"（每个离合器在相对角速度为零时可能处于正向滑动、反向滑动或锁定模式）。\r\n"
"通过在不同的时间调用离合器，可以研究状态的切换。</p>\r\n"
"<p>将系统模拟1.2秒，初始值如下：<br>\r\n"
"J1.w = 10。</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"绘制以下变量：<br>\r\n"
"一维转动惯性组件的角速度（J1.w、J2.w、J3.w、J4.w）、\r\n"
"离合器的摩擦力矩（clutchX.tau）、\r\n"
"离合器的摩擦模式（clutchX.mode），\r\n"
"其中mode = -1/0/+1 表示反向滑动、锁定、正向滑动。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.LossyGearDemo1"
msgid "Example to show that gear efficiency may lead to stuck motion"
msgstr "演示高效率齿轮可能导致运动卡滞的示例"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.LossyGearDemo1"
msgid "Power lost in the gear"
msgstr "齿轮损失的功率"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.LossyGearDemo1"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model contains two inertias which are connected by an ideal\r\n"
"gear where the friction between the teeth of the gear is modeled in\r\n"
"a physical meaningful way (friction may lead to stuck mode which\r\n"
"locks the motion of the gear). The friction is defined by an\r\n"
"efficiency factor (= 0.5) for forward and backward driving condition leading\r\n"
"to a torque dependent friction loss. Simulate for about 0.5 seconds.\r\n"
"The friction in the gear will take all modes\r\n"
"(forward and backward rolling, as well as stuck).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"You may plot:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Inertia1.w,\r\n"
"Inertia2.w : angular velocities of inertias\r\n"
"powerLoss  : power lost in the gear\r\n"
"gear.mode  :  1 = forward rolling\r\n"
"              0 = stuck (w=0)\r\n"
"             -1 = backward rolling\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, <code>powerLoss</code> (= sum of the power flows of the connectors) and\r\n"
"<code>gear.powerLoss</code> (= <code>gear.tau_loss</code>*<code>gear.w_a</code>,\r\n"
"where <code>gear.tau_loss</code> is determined in a non-trivial way\r\n"
"from the stuck/sliding situation of the bearing and teeth friction;\r\n"
"= equation (16) in [<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.UsersGuide.References\">Pelchen2002</a>])\r\n"
"should be identical, or the difference should be close to zero, if model\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.LossyGear\">LossyGear</a>\r\n"
"is correctly implemented.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"此模型包含两个一维转动惯性组件，它们通过一个理想齿轮连接， 其中轮齿之间的摩擦以物理上有意义的方式建模（摩擦可能导致卡滞模式，锁定齿轮的运动）。摩擦由效率因子（= 0.5）定义，适用于正向和反向驱动条件，导致扭矩相关的摩擦损失。 模拟约0.5秒。 齿轮中的摩擦将采取所有模式（前进和后退滚动，以及卡滞）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"您可以绘制：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >Inertia1.w,\r\n"
"Inertia2.w : angular velocities of inertias\r\n"
"powerLoss  : power lost in the gear\r\n"
"gear.mode  :  1 = forward rolling\r\n"
"0 = stuck (w=0)\r\n"
"-1 = backward rolling\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"注意，如果<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.LossyGear\" target=\"\">LossyGear</a>模型被正确实现，那么<code>powerLoss</code>（=连接器的功率流之和）和 <code>gear.powerLoss</code>（= <code>gear.tau_loss</code>*<code>gear.w_a</code>， 其中<code>gear.tau_loss</code> 是通过轴承和齿轮摩擦的卡住/滑动状态以非常规的方式确定的；= [<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.UsersGuide.References\" target=\"\">Pelchen2002</a>]中的方程（16））应该是相同的，或者两者差异应该接近零。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.LossyGearDemo2"
msgid "Example to show combination of LossyGear and BearingFriction"
msgstr "演示LossyGear和BearingFriction组合的示例"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.LossyGearDemo2"
msgid "Power lost in the gear"
msgstr "齿轮中的功率损失"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.LossyGearDemo2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model contains bearing friction and gear friction (= efficiency).\r\n"
"If both friction models are stuck, there is no unique solution.\r\n"
"Still a reliable Modelica simulator should\r\n"
"be able to handle this situation.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Simulate for about 0.5 seconds. The friction elements are\r\n"
"in all modes (forward and backward rolling, as well as stuck).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"You may plot:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Inertia1.w,\r\n"
"Inertia2.w          : angular velocities of inertias\r\n"
"powerLoss           : power lost in the gear\r\n"
"bearingFriction.mode:  1 = forward rolling\r\n"
"                       0 = stuck (w=0)\r\n"
"                      -1 = backward rolling\r\n"
"gear.mode           :  1 = forward rolling\r\n"
"                       0 = stuck (w=0)\r\n"
"                      -1 = backward rolling\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, <code>powerLoss</code> (= sum of the power flows of the connectors) and\r\n"
"<code>gear.powerLoss</code> (= <code>gear.tau_loss</code>*<code>gear.w_a</code>,\r\n"
"where <code>gear.tau_loss</code> is determined in a non-trivial way\r\n"
"from the stuck/sliding situation of the bearing and teeth friction;\r\n"
"= equation (16) in [<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.UsersGuide.References\">Pelchen2002</a>])\r\n"
"should be identical, or the difference should be close to zero, if model\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.LossyGear\">LossyGear</a>\r\n"
"is correctly implemented.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note: This combination of LossyGear and BearingFriction is not recommended to use,\r\n"
"as component LossyGear includes the functionality of component BearingFriction\r\n"
"(only <em>peak</em> not supported).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"这个模型包含轴承摩擦和齿轮摩擦（=效率）。 如果两种摩擦模型都卡滞，那么就没有唯一的解决方案。 但是，一个可靠的Modelica求解器应该能够解决这种情况。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"模拟约0.5秒。摩擦元件处于所有模式（前进和后退滚动，以及卡滞）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"可绘制如下参数：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >Inertia1.w,\r\n"
"Inertia2.w          : angular velocities of inertias\r\n"
"powerLoss           : power lost in the gear\r\n"
"bearingFriction.mode:  1 = forward rolling\r\n"
"0 = stuck (w=0)\r\n"
"-1 = backward rolling\r\n"
"gear.mode           :  1 = forward rolling\r\n"
"0 = stuck (w=0)\r\n"
"-1 = backward rolling\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"注意，<code>powerLoss</code>（=连接器的功率流之和）和 <code>gear.powerLoss</code>（= <code>gear.tau_loss</code>*<code>gear.w_a</code>， 其中<code>gear.tau_loss</code>以非平凡的方式从轴承和齿摩擦的卡滑情况确定； = [<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.UsersGuide.References\" target=\"\">Pelchen2002</a>]中的方程（16）） 应该是相同的，或者差异应该接近零，如果模型 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.LossyGear\" target=\"\">LossyGear</a> 被正确实现。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意：不建议使用LossyGear和BearingFriction的这种组合， 因为组件LossyGear包含了组件BearingFriction的功能 （除了<em>peak</em>外）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.LossyGearDemo3"
msgid "Example that failed in the previous version of the LossyGear version"
msgstr "在上一个版本的LossyGear中失败的示例"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.LossyGearDemo3"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This example demonstrates a situation where the driving side of the\r\n"
"LossyGear model is not obvious.\r\n"
"The version of LossyGear up to version 3.1 of package Modelica failed in this case\r\n"
"(no convergence of the event iteration).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个示例演示了LossyGear模型的驱动端的驱动不明显的情形。\r\n"
"直到Modelica包的版本3.1，LossyGear的版本在这种情况下失效了\r\n"
"（事件的迭代没有收敛）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.ElasticBearing"
msgid "Example to show possible usage of support flange"
msgstr "支撑一维转动接口使用方法的案例"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.ElasticBearing"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model demonstrates the usage of the bearing flange.\r\n"
"The gearbox is not connected rigidly to the ground, but by\r\n"
"a spring-damper-system. This allows examination of the gearbox\r\n"
"housing dynamics.</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Simulate for about 10 seconds and plot the angular velocities of the inertias <code>housing.w</code>,\r\n"
"<code>shaft.w</code> and <code>load.w</code>.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个模型演示了轴承的一维转动接口的使用方法。\r\n"
"齿轮箱并非刚性连接到地面，而是通过弹簧-阻尼系统的形式连接。\r\n"
"这样可以研究齿轮箱的壳体动力学。</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"模拟约10秒，绘制惯性组件的角速度<code>housing.w</code>、<code>shaft.w</code>和<code>load.w</code>。</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.Backlash"
msgid "Example to demonstrate backlash"
msgstr "演示反弹(backlash)的案例"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.Backlash"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model demonstrates the effect of a backlash on eigenfrequency, and\r\n"
"also that the damping torque does not lead to unphysical pulling torques\r\n"
"(since the ElastoBacklash model takes care of it).\r\n"
"Furthermore, it shows the differences of the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.ElastoBacklash\">ElastoBacklash</a> and\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.ElastoBacklash2\">ElastoBacklash2</a> components\r\n"
"(the ElastoBacklash2 component generates events when contact occurs and the torque changes discontinuously).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个模型演示了反弹对特征频率的影响，以及阻尼扭矩不会导致非物理的扭矩\r\n"
"(因为ElastoBacklash模型会处理它)。此外，\r\n"
"它展示了<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.ElastoBacklash\" target=\"\">ElastoBacklash</a>和\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.ElastoBacklash2\" target=\"\">ElastoBacklash2</a>组件的差异(ElastoBacklash2组件在接触发生时生成事件，并且扭矩发生不连续的变化)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.RollingWheel"
msgid "Demonstrate coupling Rotational - Translational"
msgstr "演示旋转 - 平移耦合"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.RollingWheel"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model demonstrates the coupling between rotational and translational components:<br>\r\n"
"A torque (step) accelerates both the inertia (of the wheel) and the mass (of the vehicle).<br>\r\n"
"Du to a speed dependent force (like driving resistance), we find an equilibrium at 5 m/s after approx. 5 s.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个模型演示了旋转和平移组件之间的耦合：<br>\r\n"
"一个扭矩（阶跃）会加速滚轮的惯性和车辆的质量。<br>\r\n"
"由于速度相关的力（如行驶阻力），在约5秒后在5 m/s处达到了一个平衡点。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.HeatLosses"
msgid "Demonstrate the modeling of heat losses"
msgstr "对热损失模型进行建模的演示"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.HeatLosses"
msgid "Ambient temperature"
msgstr "Ambient temperature"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.HeatLosses"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model demonstrates how to model the dissipated power of a drive train,\r\n"
"by enabling the heatPort of all components and connecting these heatPorts via\r\n"
"a convection element to the environment. The total heat flow generated by the\r\n"
"elements of the drive train and transported to the environment\r\n"
"is present in variable convection.fluid.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个案例模型演示了如何通过启用所有组件的热端口，并通过流元素将这些热端口连接到环境，来对传动系统的耗散功率的建模。\r\n"
"传动系统各组件产生并输送到环境中的总热流存在于变量convection.fluid中。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.SimpleGearShift"
msgid "Simple Gearshift"
msgstr "简单换挡器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.SimpleGearShift"
msgid "Speed of engine"
msgstr "发动机转速"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.SimpleGearShift"
msgid "Speed of load"
msgstr "负载转速"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.SimpleGearShift"
msgid "Gear ratio load/engine"
msgstr "齿轮比（负载/发动机）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.SimpleGearShift"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This model shows how an automatic gear shift is built up from a planetary gear, a brake and a clutch.</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>In the beginning, the clutch is free and the brake fixes the ring of the planetary. Thus we obtain a gearRatio = 1/(1 + planetary.ratio).</li>\r\n"
"<li>At time = 2 s, the brake frees the ring of the planetary, whereas the clutch blocks the ring and the sun. Thus we obtain a gearRatio = 1.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"这个模型演示了如何从行星齿轮、刹车和离合器构建自动换挡器。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul><li>\r\n"
"在开始时，离合器处于自由状态，刹车固定行星的环。因此，我们得到一个传动比 = 1/(1 + 行星传动比)。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"在时间 = 2 秒时，刹车释放了行星的环，而离合器则阻止了环和太阳轮。因此，我们得到一个传动比 = 1。</li>\r\n"
"</ul></html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.EddyCurrentBrake"
msgid "Demonstrate the usage of the rotational eddy current brake"
msgstr "演示旋转涡流制动器的用法"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.EddyCurrentBrake"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"An eddy current brake reduces the speed of a rotating inertia. Kinetic energy is converted to thermal energy which leads to a temperature increase of the thermal capacitance of the brake, which can be assumed as adiabatic during the rather short time span of the braking.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"涡流制动器降低了转动惯量组件的速度。由于动能被转换为热能，导致制动器的热容增加温度，但可以在制动的相当短的时间内可以将其视为绝热过程\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs"
msgid "Example to demonstrate variants to generate FMUs (Functional Mock-up Units)"
msgstr "演示生成FMU(功能模拟单元)的变体的示例"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This example demonstrates how to generate an input/output block (e.g. in form of an\r\n"
"FMU - <a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>) from various Rotational components.\r\n"
"The goal is to export such an input/output block from Modelica and import\r\n"
"it in another modeling environment. The essential issue is that before\r\n"
"exporting it must be known in which way the component is utilized in the\r\n"
"target environment. Depending on the target usage, different flange variables\r\n"
"need to be in the interface with either input or output causality.\r\n"
"Note, this example model can be used to test the FMU export/import of a Modelica tool.\r\n"
"Just export the components marked in the icons as \"toFMU\" as FMUs and import\r\n"
"them back. The models should then still work and give the same results as a\r\n"
"pure Modelica model.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Connecting two inertias</strong><br>\r\n"
"The upper part (DirectInertia, InverseInertia)\r\n"
"demonstrates how to export two inertias and connect them\r\n"
"together in a target system. This requires that one of the inertias\r\n"
"(here: DirectInertia)\r\n"
"is defined to have states and the angle, angular velocity and\r\n"
"angular acceleration are provided in the interface.\r\n"
"The other mass (here: InverseInertia) is moved according\r\n"
"to the provided input angle, angular velocity and angular acceleration.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Connecting a force element that needs angles and angular velocities</strong><br>\r\n"
"The middle part (SpringDamper) demonstrates how to export a force element\r\n"
"that needs both angles and angular velocities for its force law and connect this\r\n"
"force law in a target system between two inertias.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Connecting a force element that needs only angles</strong><br>\r\n"
"The lower part (Spring) demonstrates how to export a force element\r\n"
"that needs only angles for its force law and connect this\r\n"
"force law in a target system between two inertias.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"  本示例演示如何从各种转动组件生成输入/输出块(例如，以FMU形式 - <a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\">Function Mock-up Unit</a>)。\r\n"
"  本案例的内容是从Modelica导出这样一个输入/输出块，并在另一个建模环境中导入它。\r\n"
"  解决这个问题的关键是问题是在导出之前必须知道组件在目标环境中的使用方式。\r\n"
"  根据目标使用情况，接口中需要具有不同输入或输出因果关系的不同变量。\r\n"
"  请注意，此示例模型可用于测试Modelica工具的FMU导出/导入。\r\n"
"  只需导出图标中标记为“toFMU”的组件作为FMU，然后重新导入它们。\r\n"
"  模型应该仍然可以工作，并且给出与纯Modelica模型相同的结果。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"  <strong>连接两个一维惯性转动组件</strong><br>\r\n"
"  上半部分(DirectInertia，InverseInertia)演示了如何导出两个一维惯性转动组件并将它们连接在一起导入到目标系统中。\r\n"
"  这要求其中一个一维惯性转动组件(这里是：DirectInertia)被定义为具有状态，并且在接口中提供角度、角速度和角加速度。\r\n"
"  另一个质量(这里是：InverseInertia)根据提供的输入角度、角速度和角加速度的值进行运动。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"  <strong>连接所需要角度和角速度的力元件</strong><br>\r\n"
"  中间部分(SpringDamper)演示了如何导出一个需要角度和角速度的力元件，用于其力学规律，并将此力学规律在目标系统中连接两个一维惯性转动组件之间。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"  <strong>连接只需要角度的力元件</strong><br>\r\n"
"  下半部分(Spring)演示了如何导出一个只需要角度的力元件，用于其力学规律，并将此力学规律在目标系统中连接两个一维惯性转动组件之间。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.OneWayClutch"
msgid "Drive train with actively engaged one-way clutch"
msgstr "带有主动控制单向离合器的传动系统"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.OneWayClutch"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The drive train consists of a one-way clutch and driving and driven inertias.\r\n"
"The one-way clutch is engaged periodically thus forcing both the inertias to\r\n"
"match their rotational velocity.\r\n"
"When disengaged, only the freewheel functionality of the one-way clutch is\r\n"
"available and is active as long as the relative angular velocity w_rel becomes zero.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Simulate for 2&nbsp;seconds and compare inertias&#39; velocities <code>inertiaIn.w</code>\r\n"
"and <code>inertiaOut.w</code> to each other.\r\n"
"Check also the engagement of the clutch <code>oneWayClutch.f_normalized</code>\r\n"
"and its lossy power <code>oneWayClutch.lossPower</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"传动系统由单向离合器、驱动一维惯性组件和被动一维惯性组件组成。 单向离合器周期性地参与，强制使两个一维惯性组件的旋转速度匹配。 当单向离合器解除连接时，只有单向离合器的自由轮功能可用，并且只要相对角速度 w_rel 变为零，该功能就会处于活动状态。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"模拟 2 秒并比较一维惯性组件之间的速度 <code>inertiaIn.w</code> 和 <code>inertiaOut.w</code>。 还要检查离合器的参与情况 <code>oneWayClutch.f_normalized</code> 和其损耗功率 <code>oneWayClutch.lossPower</code>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.OneWayClutchDisengaged"
msgid "Drive train with disengaged one-way clutch"
msgstr "带有控制连接的单向离合器的传动系统"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.OneWayClutchDisengaged"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The drive train consists of a one-way clutch and driving and driven inertias.\r\n"
"To demonstrate the behavior of the clutch&#39;s freewheel only, the clutch stays\r\n"
"disengaged for all the time.\r\n"
"The sine torque is applied on the driving inertia forcing inertia&#39;s speed change.\r\n"
"On the driven side there is applied constant load torque only.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Simulate for 2&nbsp;seconds and compare inertias&#39; velocities <code>inertiaIn.w</code>\r\n"
"and <code>inertiaOut.w</code> to each other.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"传动系统由单向离合器、驱动一维惯性组件和被动一维惯性组件组成。 为了演示单向离合器仅自由轮的行为，离合器始终保持解除连接状态。 在驱动一维惯性组件上施加正弦变化的扭矩，强制使一维惯性组件的速度发生变化。 在被动侧仅施加恒定的载荷扭矩。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"模拟 2 秒并比较一维惯性组件之间的速度 <code>inertiaIn.w</code> 和 <code>inertiaOut.w</code>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

