msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.Gearbox"
msgid "Realistic model of a gearbox (based on LossyGear)"
msgstr "齿轮箱的实际模型(基于LossyGear模型)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.Gearbox"
msgid "Transmission ratio (flange_a.phi/flange_b.phi)"
msgstr "传动比（flange_a.phi/flange_b.phi）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.Gearbox"
msgid "Array for mesh efficiencies and bearing friction depending on speed (see docu of LossyGear)"
msgstr "根据速度的齿轮网效率和轴承摩擦的数组（参见LossyGear的文档）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.Gearbox"
msgid "Gear elasticity (spring constant)"
msgstr "齿轮弹性（弹簧常数）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.Gearbox"
msgid "Gear damping (relative damping)"
msgstr "齿轮阻尼（相对阻尼）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.Gearbox"
msgid "Total backlash"
msgstr "总游隙"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.Gearbox"
msgid "Priority to use phi_rel and w_rel as states"
msgstr "优先使用phi_rel和w_rel作为状态"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.Gearbox"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.Gearbox"
msgid "Relative rotation angle over gear elasticity (= flange_b.phi - lossyGear.flange_b.phi)"
msgstr "齿轮弹性上的相对旋转角度（= flange_b.phi - lossyGear.flange_b.phi）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.Gearbox"
msgid "Relative angular velocity over gear elasticity (= der(phi_rel))"
msgstr "齿轮弹性上的相对角速度（= der(phi_rel)）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.Gearbox"
msgid "Relative angular acceleration over gear elasticity (= der(w_rel))"
msgstr "齿轮弹性上的相对角加速度（= der(w_rel)）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.Gearbox"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This component models the essential effects of a gearbox, in\r\n"
"particular</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"  <li>in component <strong>lossyGear</strong>\r\n"
"    <ul>\r\n"
"      <li>gear <strong>efficiency</strong> due to friction between the teeth</li>\r\n"
"      <li><strong>bearing friction</strong></li>\r\n"
"    </ul></li>\r\n"
"  <li>in component <strong>elastoBacklash</strong>\r\n"
"    <ul>\r\n"
"      <li>gear <strong>elasticity</strong></li>\r\n"
"      <li><strong>damping</strong></li>\r\n"
"      <li><strong>backlash</strong></li>\r\n"
"    </ul></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>The inertia of the gear wheels is not modeled. If necessary,\r\n"
"inertia has to be taken into account by connecting components of\r\n"
"model Inertia to the left and/or the right flange of component\r\n"
"Gearbox.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该组件模拟了齿轮箱的基本特性，特别是在如下组件中：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul><li>\r\n"
"组件<strong>lossyGear</strong> </li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"组件<strong>elastoBacklash</strong> </li>\r\n"
"</ul><p>\r\n"
"齿轮的惯性未被建模。如有必要，则惯性必须通过连接到齿轮箱组件的左侧和/或右侧接口的惯性模型组件来考虑。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.Gearbox"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.Gearbox"
msgid "ratio=%ratio, c=%c"
msgstr "ratio=%ratio, c=%c"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.IdealGearR2T"
msgid "Gearbox transforming rotational into translational motion"
msgstr "将旋转运动转换为平移运动的齿轮箱"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.IdealGearR2T"
msgid "Transmission ratio (flange_a.phi/flange_b.s)"
msgstr "传动比（flange_a.phi/flange_b.s）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.IdealGearR2T"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is an ideal mass- and inertialess gearbox which transforms a\r\n"
"1D-rotational into a 1D-translational motion. If elasticity, damping\r\n"
"or backlash has to be considered, this ideal gearbox has to be\r\n"
"connected with corresponding elements.\r\n"
"This component defines the kinematic constraint:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(flangeR.phi - internalSupportR.phi) = ratio*(flangeT.s - internalSupportT.s);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"这是一个理想的齿轮箱其质量和惯性为零，将一维旋转运动转换为一维平移运动。如果需要考虑弹性、阻尼或游隙，则必须将此理想齿轮箱连接到相应的元件。 此外此组件定义了如下的运动学约束：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >(flangeR.phi - internalSupportR.phi) = ratio*(flangeT.s - internalSupportT.s);\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.IdealGearR2T"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.IdealGearR2T"
