msgstr "ratio=%ratio"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.IdealRollingWheel"
msgid "Simple 1-dim. model of an ideal rolling wheel without inertia"
msgstr "理想情况下无惯性的简单一维滚轮模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.IdealRollingWheel"
msgid "Wheel radius"
msgstr "滚轮半径"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.IdealRollingWheel"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.IdealRollingWheel"
msgid "radius=%radius"
msgstr "radius=%radius"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.IdealRollingWheel"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A simple kinematic model of a rolling wheel which has no inertia and\r\n"
"no rolling resistance. This component defines the kinematic constraint:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(flangeR.phi - internalSupportR.phi) * radius = (flangeT.s - internalSupportT.s);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一个简单的滚轮的运动学模型，没有惯性和滚动阻力。该组件定义了如下的运动学约束：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(flangeR.phi - internalSupportR.phi) * radius = (flangeT.s - internalSupportT.s);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.InitializeFlange"
msgid "Initializes a flange with pre-defined angle, speed and angular acceleration (usually, this is reference data from a control bus)"
msgstr "使用预定义的角度、速度和角加速度初始化一个一维转动接口（通常，这是来自控制总线的参考数据）"

