msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.AngleToTorqueAdaptor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.AngleToTorqueAdaptor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Adaptor between a flange connector and a signal representation of the flange.\r\n"
"This component is used to provide a pure signal interface around a Rotational model\r\n"
"and export this model in form of an input/output block,\r\n"
"especially as FMU (<a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>).\r\n"
"Examples of the usage of this adaptor are provided in\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs\">Rotational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs</a>.\r\n"
"This adaptor has angle, angular velocity and angular acceleration as input signals and\r\n"
"torque as output signal. Note, the input signals must be consistent to each other\r\n"
"(w=der(phi), a=der(w)).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
" 一维转动接口连接器与一维转动接口信号表示之间的适配器。 \r\n"
" 此组件用于为模型Rotational提供纯信号接口，并将此模型以输入/输出块的形式导出，\r\n"
" 特别是作为FMU（<a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>）\r\n"
" 此适配器的使用示例可以在 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs\">Rotational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs</a>\r\n"
" 中找到。 此适配器将角度、角速度和角加速度作为输入信号，并将扭矩作为输出信号。\r\n"
" 请注意，输入信号之间必须保持一致性 （w=der(phi)，a=der(w)）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.AngleToTorqueAdaptor.Move_phi"
msgid "Forced movement of a flange according to an angle signal"
msgstr "根据角度信号强制移动一维转动接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.AngleToTorqueAdaptor.Move_phi"
msgid "Rotation angle of flange with respect to support"
msgstr "一维转动接口相对支撑的旋转角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.AngleToTorqueAdaptor.Move_phi"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Flange <strong>flange</strong> is <strong>forced</strong> to move relative to flange support with a predefined motion\r\n"
"according to the input signal u\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"u[1]: angle of flange\r\n"
"u[2]: angular velocity of flange\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The user has to guarantee that the input signals are consistent to each other,\r\n"
"i.e., that u[2] is the derivative of u[1].\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input signals can be provided from one of the signal generator\r\n"
"blocks of the block library Modelica.Blocks.Sources.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一维转动接口<strong>flange</strong>被强制相对一维转动接口支撑以预定义的运动方式移动， 根据输入信号u \r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
" u[1]: 一维转动接口的角度 \r\n"
" u[2]: 一维转动接口的角速度\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"用户必须确保输入信号之间是一致的， 即u[2]是u[1]的导数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
" 输入信号可以来自模型库 Modelica.Blocks.Sources 中的信号生成器块之一。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

