msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.TorqueToAngleAdaptor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Adaptor between a flange connector and a signal representation of the flange.\r\n"
"This component is used to provide a pure signal interface around a Rotational model\r\n"
"and export this model in form of an input/output block,\r\n"
"especially as FMU (<a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>).\r\n"
"Examples of the usage of this adaptor are provided in\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs\">Rotational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs</a>.\r\n"
"This adaptor has torque as input and angle, angular velocity and angular acceleration as output signals.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一维转动接口连接器与一维转动接口信号表示之间的适配器。\r\n"
"此组件用于为model Rotational提供纯信号接口，并将此模型以输入/输出块的形式导出，\r\n"
"尤其是作为FMU(<a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>).\r\n"
"此适配器的使用示例可以在\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs\">Rotational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs</a>中找到.\r\n"
"此适配器将扭矩作为输入信号，将角度、角速度和角加速度作为输出信号。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.GeneralAngleToTorqueAdaptor"
msgid "Signal adaptor for a rotational flange with torque as output and angle, speed and acceleration as input (especially useful for FMUs)"
msgstr "用于旋转一维转动接口的信号适配器，以扭矩为输出，角度、速度和加速度为输入（特别适用于FMU）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.GeneralAngleToTorqueAdaptor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Adaptor between a flange connector and a signal representation of the flange.\r\n"
"This component is used to provide a pure signal interface around a Rotational model\r\n"
"and export this model in form of an input/output block,\r\n"
"especially as FMU (<a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>).\r\n"
"This adaptor has angle, angular velocity and angular acceleration as input signals and\r\n"
"torque as output signal.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, the input signals must be consistent to each other\r\n"
"(w=der(phi), a=der(w)).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"用于一维转动接口连接器和一维转动接口信号表示之间的适配器。\r\n"
"此组件用于为旋转模型提供纯信号接口，并将此模型以输入/输出块的形式导出，\r\n"
"尤其是作为FMU (<a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>).\r\n"
"此适配器以角度、角速度和角加速度为输入信号，以扭矩为输出信号。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意，输入信号之间必须相互一致\r\n"
"（w=der(phi), a=der(w)）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.GeneralTorqueToAngleAdaptor"
msgid "Signal adaptor for a rotational flange with angle, speed, and acceleration as outputs and torque as input (especially useful for FMUs)"
msgstr "一个旋转一维转动接口的信号适配器，以角度、速度和加速度为输出，扭矩为输入（特别适用于FMU）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.GeneralTorqueToAngleAdaptor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Adaptor between a flange connector and a signal representation of the flange.\r\n"
"This component is used to provide a pure signal interface around a Rotational model\r\n"
"and export this model in form of an input/output block,\r\n"
"especially as FMU (<a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>).\r\n"
"This adaptor has torque as input and angle, angular velocity and angular acceleration as output signals.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"用于一维转动接口连接器和一维转动接口信号表示之间的适配器。\r\n"
"此组件用于为model Rotational提供纯信号接口，并将此model以输入/输出块的形式导出，\r\n"
