msgstr "用于测量一维转动机械部件中变量的传感器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sensors"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains ideal sensor components that provide\r\n"
"the connector variables as signals for further processing with the\r\n"
"Modelica.Blocks library.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"本包中包含理想的传感器组件，这些组件将连接器变量作为信号提供，以便使用Modelica.Blocks库进行进一步处理。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

