msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.Accelerate"
msgid "Forced movement of a flange according to an acceleration signal"
msgstr "根据加速度信号强制转动一维转动接口的模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.Accelerate"
msgid "Rotation angle of flange with respect to support"
msgstr "一维转动接口相对支撑组件的旋转角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.Accelerate"
msgid "Angular velocity of flange with respect to support"
msgstr "一维转动接口相对支撑组件的角速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.Accelerate"
msgid "Angular acceleration of flange with respect to support"
msgstr "一维转动接口相对支撑组件的角加速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.Accelerate"
msgid "Absolute angular acceleration of flange with respect to support as input signal"
msgstr "作为输入信号的一维转动接口相对支撑组件的绝对角加速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.Accelerate"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input signal <strong>a</strong> defines an <strong>angular acceleration</strong>\r\n"
"in [rad/s2]. Flange <strong>flange</strong> is <strong>forced</strong> to move relative to flange support with\r\n"
"this acceleration. The angular velocity <strong>w</strong> and the rotation angle\r\n"
"<strong>phi</strong> of the flange are automatically determined by integration of\r\n"
"the acceleration.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input signal can be provided from one of the signal generator\r\n"
"blocks of the block library Modelica.Blocks.Sources.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"输入信号<strong>a</strong>定义了一个<strong>角加速度</strong>，单位为[rad/s2]。一维转动接口<strong>flange</strong>以该加速度相对于一维转动接口支撑组件<strong>强制转动</strong>。\r\n"
"角速度<strong>w</strong>和旋转角度<strong>phi</strong>通过对加速度进行积分来确定。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"输入信号可以从Modelica.Blocks.Sources模块库中的信号发生器块中提供。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.Accelerate"
