msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.Torque"
msgid "Input signal acting as external torque on a flange"
msgstr "作用于一维转动接口的外部转矩输入信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.Torque"
msgid "Accelerating torque acting at flange (= -flange.tau)"
msgstr "作用于一维转动接口的加速转矩(= -flange.tau)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.Torque"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input signal <strong>tau</strong> defines an external\r\n"
"torque in [Nm] which acts (with negative sign) at\r\n"
"a flange connector, i.e., the component connected to this\r\n"
"flange is driven by torque <strong>tau</strong>.</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input signal can be provided from one of the signal generator\r\n"
"blocks of Modelica.Blocks.Sources.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"输入信号 <strong>tau</strong> 定义了一个外部转矩(单位为N.m)，它(带负号)作用于一个一维转动接口连接器，即连接到此 一维转动接口的组件由转矩 <strong>tau</strong> 驱动。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"输入信号可以从Modelica.Blocks.Sources块库中的信号发生器块之一提供\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.Torque"
