msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.Torque2"
msgid "Input signal acting as torque on two flanges"
msgstr "作用于两个一维转动接口的转矩输入信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.Torque2"
msgid "Torque driving the two flanges (a positive value accelerates the flange)"
msgstr "驱动两个一维转动接口的转矩（正值加速一维转动接口）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.Torque2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The input signal <strong>tau</strong> defines an external\r\n"
"torque in [Nm] which acts at both flange connectors,\r\n"
"i.e., the components connected to these flanges are driven by torque <strong>tau</strong>.</p>\r\n"
"<p>The input signal can be provided from one of the signal generator\r\n"
"blocks of Modelica.Blocks.Sources.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"输入信号 <strong>tau</strong> 定义了一个外部 转矩（单位为N.m），它作用于两个一维转动接口连接器， 即连接到这些一维转动接口的组件由转矩 <strong>tau</strong> 驱动。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"输入信号可以从Modelica.Blocks.Sources块库中的信号发生器块之一提供。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.Torque2"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.LinearSpeedDependentTorque"
msgid "Linear dependency of torque versus speed"
msgstr "转矩与转速之间的线性关系"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.LinearSpeedDependentTorque"
msgid "Nominal torque (if negative, torque is acting as load in positive direction of rotation)"
msgstr "额定转矩（如果为负值，则转矩在旋转正方向上作为负载）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.LinearSpeedDependentTorque"
msgid "Same direction of torque in both directions of rotation"
msgstr "转矩在两个旋转方向上的方向相同"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.LinearSpeedDependentTorque"
msgid "Nominal speed"
msgstr "额定转速"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.LinearSpeedDependentTorque"
msgid "Angular velocity of flange with respect to support (= der(phi))"
msgstr "一维转动接口相对于支撑组件的角速度（= der(phi)）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.LinearSpeedDependentTorque"
msgid "Accelerating torque acting at flange (= -flange.tau)"
msgstr "作用于一维转动接口的加速转矩（= -flange.tau）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.LinearSpeedDependentTorque"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Model of torque, linearly dependent on angular velocity of flange.<br>\r\n"
"Parameter TorqueDirection chooses whether direction of torque is the same in both directions of rotation or not.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一维转动接口角速度线性相关的转矩模型。<br>\r\n"
"参数 TorqueDirection 选择转矩在两个旋转方向上的方向是否相同。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.QuadraticSpeedDependentTorque"
msgid "Quadratic dependency of torque versus speed"
msgstr "转矩与转速之间的二次关系"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.QuadraticSpeedDependentTorque"
msgid "Nominal torque (if negative, torque is acting as load in positive direction of rotation)"
msgstr "额定转矩（如果为负值，则转矩在旋转正方向上作为负载）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.QuadraticSpeedDependentTorque"
msgid "Same direction of torque in both directions of rotation"
msgstr "转矩在两个旋转方向上的方向相同"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.QuadraticSpeedDependentTorque"
msgid "Nominal speed"
msgstr "额定转速"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.QuadraticSpeedDependentTorque"
msgid "Angular velocity of flange with respect to support (= der(phi))"
msgstr "一维转动接口相对于支撑组件的角速度（= der(phi)）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.QuadraticSpeedDependentTorque"
msgid "Accelerating torque acting at flange (= -flange.tau)"
msgstr "作用于一维转动接口的加速转矩（= -flange.tau）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.QuadraticSpeedDependentTorque"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Model of torque, quadratic dependent on angular velocity of flange.<br>\r\n"
"Parameter TorqueDirection chooses whether direction of torque is the same in both directions of rotation or not.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一维转动接口角速度二次相关的转矩模型。<br>\r\n"
"参数 TorqueDirection 选择转矩在两个旋转方向上的方向是否相同。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.ConstantTorque"
msgid "Constant torque, not dependent on speed"
msgstr "恒定转矩，不依赖于转速"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.ConstantTorque"
msgid "Constant torque (if negative, torque is acting as load in positive direction of rotation)"
msgstr "恒定转矩（如果为负值，则转矩在旋转正方向上作为负载）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.ConstantTorque"
msgid "Angular velocity of flange with respect to support (= der(phi))"
msgstr "一维转动接口相对于支撑组件的角速度（= der(phi)）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.ConstantTorque"
msgid "Accelerating torque acting at flange (= -flange.tau)"
msgstr "作用于一维转动接口的加速转矩（= -flange.tau）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.ConstantTorque"
msgid "%tau_constant"
msgstr "%tau_constant"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.ConstantTorque"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Model of constant torque, not dependent on angular velocity of flange.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Please note:<br>\r\n"
"Positive torque accelerates in positive direction of rotation, but brakes in reverse direction of rotation.<br>\r\n"
"Negative torque brakes in positive direction of rotation, but accelerates in reverse direction of rotation.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>不依赖于一维转动接口角速度的恒定转矩模型。</p>\r\n"
"<p>请注意:<br>\r\n"
"正转矩在旋转正方向上加速，但在反向旋转方向上制动。<br>\r\n"
"负转矩在旋转正方向上制动，但在反向旋转方向上加速。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.SignTorque"
msgid "Constant torque changing sign with speed"
msgstr "随速度改变符号的恒定转矩"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.SignTorque"
msgid "Nominal torque (if negative, torque is acting as load)"
msgstr "额定转矩（如果为负值，则转矩在旋转正方向上作为负载）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.SignTorque"
msgid "Type of regularization"
msgstr "正则化类型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.SignTorque"
msgid "Regularization below w0"
msgstr "在 w0 以下进行正则化"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.SignTorque"
msgid "Angular velocity of flange with respect to support (= der(phi))"
msgstr "一维转动接口相对于支撑的角速度（= der(phi)）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.SignTorque"
msgid "Accelerating torque acting at flange (= -flange.tau)"
msgstr "作用于一维转动接口的加速转矩（= -flange.tau）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.SignTorque"
msgid "%tau_nominal"
msgstr "%tau_nominal"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.SignTorque"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Model of constant torque which changes sign with direction of rotation.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Please note:<br>\r\n"
"Positive torque accelerates in both directions of rotation.<br>\r\n"
"Negative torque brakes in both directions of rotation.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Around zero speed regularization avoids numerical problems.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>根据旋转方向改变符号的恒定转矩模型。</p>\r\n"
"<p>请注意：<br>\r\n"
"正转矩在两个旋转方向上都会加速。<br>\r\n"
"负转矩在两个旋转方向上都会制动。</p>\r\n"
"<p>在零速度附近进行正则化可以避免数值问题。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.ConstantSpeed"
msgid "Constant speed, not dependent on torque"
msgstr "恒定转速，不依赖于扭矩"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.ConstantSpeed"
msgid "Angular velocity of flange with respect to support (= der(phi))"
msgstr "一维转动接口相对于支撑组件的角速度（= der(phi)）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.ConstantSpeed"
msgid "Fixed speed"
msgstr "固定转速"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.ConstantSpeed"
msgid "%w_fixed"
msgstr "%w_fixed"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.ConstantSpeed"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Model of <strong>fixed</strong> angular velocity of flange, not dependent on torque.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一维转动接口的<strong>固定</strong>角速度模型，不依赖于扭矩。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.TorqueStep"
msgid "Constant torque, not dependent on speed"
msgstr "阶跃扭矩，不依赖于速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.TorqueStep"
msgid "Height of torque step (if negative, torque is acting as load)"
msgstr "扭矩阶跃的高度(如果为负值，则扭矩作为负载作用)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.TorqueStep"
msgid "Offset of torque"
msgstr "扭矩的偏移量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.TorqueStep"
msgid "Torque = offset for time < startTime"
msgstr "当时间小于startTime时，Torque = offset"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.TorqueStep"
msgid "Accelerating torque acting at flange (= -flange.tau)"
msgstr "作用在一维转动接口上的加速扭矩(= -flange.tau)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.TorqueStep"
msgid "time"
msgstr "time"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.TorqueStep"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Model of a torque step at time startTime.\r\n"
"Positive torque accelerates in positive direction of <code>flange</code> rotation.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在 startTime 时刻的扭矩阶跃模型。\r\n"
"正扭矩在<code>flange</code>旋转的正方向上加速。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.EddyCurrentTorque"
msgid "Simple model of a rotational eddy current brake"
msgstr "旋转式涡流制动器的简单模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.EddyCurrentTorque"
msgid "Maximum torque (always braking)"
msgstr "最大转矩（始终为制动）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.EddyCurrentTorque"
msgid "Nominal speed (leads to maximum torque) at reference temperature"
msgstr "参考温度下的额定转速（产生最大转矩）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.EddyCurrentTorque"
msgid "Reference temperature"
msgstr "参考温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.EddyCurrentTorque"
msgid "Temperature coefficient of material"
msgstr "材料的温度系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.EddyCurrentTorque"
msgid "Accelerating torque acting at flange (= flange.tau)"
msgstr "作用在一维转动接口上的加速转矩（= flange.tau）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.EddyCurrentTorque"
msgid "Angular velocity of flange with respect to support (= der(phi))"
msgstr "一维转动接口相对于支撑组件的角速度（= der(phi)）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.EddyCurrentTorque"
msgid "Relative speed w/w_nominal"
msgstr "相对转速 w/w_nominal"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sources.EddyCurrentTorque"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This is a simple model of a rotational <strong>eddy current brake</strong>. The torque versus speed characteristic is defined by Kloss' equation.</p>\r\n"
"<p><strong>Thermal behaviour:</strong><br>\r\n"
"The resistance of the braking disc is influenced by the actual temperature Theatport, which in turn shifts the speed w_nominal at which the (unchanged) maximum torque occurs.<br>\r\n"
"If the heatPort is not used (useHeatPort = false), the operational temperature remains at the given temperature T.<br>\r\n"
"However, the speed w_nominal at which the maximum torque occurs is adapted from reference temperature TRef to the operational temperature.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>这是一个简单的<strong>旋转式涡流制动器</strong>模型。转矩与速度的特性由Kloss方程定义。</p>\r\n"
"<p><strong>热行为：</strong><br>\r\n"
"制动盘的电阻受到实际温度Theatport的影响，这反过来又改变了发生（未改变）最大转矩的转速w_nominal。<br>\r\n"
"如果未使用heatPort（useHeatPort = false），则工作温度保持在给定的温度T。但是，发生最大转矩的转速w_nominal会根据参考温度TRef调整至工作温度。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces"
msgid "Connectors and partial models for 1D rotational mechanical components"
msgstr "一维旋转机械组件的连接器和部分模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains connectors and partial models for 1-dim.\r\n"
"rotational mechanical components. The components of this package can\r\n"
"only be used as basic building elements for models.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"本包中包含一维旋转机械组件的连接器和部分模型。此包中的组件只能用作模型的基本构建元素。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Flange"
msgid "One-dimensional rotational flange"
msgstr "一维转动接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Flange"
msgid "Absolute rotation angle of flange"
msgstr "一维转动接口的绝对旋转角度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Flange"
msgid "Cut torque in the flange"
msgstr "一维转动接口上的局部扭矩"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Flange"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a connector for 1D rotational mechanical systems.\r\n"
"It has no icon definition and is only used by inheritance from\r\n"
"flange connectors to define different icons.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The following variables are defined in this connector:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"phi: Absolute rotation angle of the flange in [rad].\r\n"
"tau: Cut-torque in the flange in [Nm].\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个用于一维旋转机械系统的连接器。它没有图标定义，仅通过从一维转动接口连接器继承来定义不同的图标。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此连接器中定义了以下变量：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"phi: Absolute rotation angle of the flange in [rad].\r\n"
"tau: Cut-torque in the flange in [Nm].\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Flange_a"
msgid "One-dimensional rotational flange of a shaft (filled circle icon)"
msgstr "一维转动接口a（实心圆图标）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Flange_a"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a connector for 1-dim. rotational mechanical systems and models which represents\r\n"
"a mechanical flange of a shaft. The following variables are defined in this connector:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"phi: Absolute rotation angle of the shaft flange in [rad].\r\n"
"tau: Cut-torque in the shaft flange in [Nm].\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"There is a second connector for flanges:\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Flange_b\">Flange_b</a>.\r\n"
"The connectors\r\n"
"Flange_a and Flange_b are completely identical. There is only a difference\r\n"
"in the icons, in order to easier identify a flange variable in a diagram.\r\n"
"For a discussion on the actual direction of the cut-torque tau and\r\n"
"of the rotation angle, see section\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.UsersGuide.SignConventions\">Sign Conventions</a>\r\n"
"in the user's guide of Rotational.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If needed, the absolute angular velocity w and the\r\n"
"absolute angular acceleration a of the flange can be determined by\r\n"
"differentiation of the flange angle phi:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = der(phi);\r\n"
"a = der(w);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"这是一个用于一维旋转机械系统和模型的连接器，代表轴的机械一维转动接口。此连接器中定义了以下变量：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >phi: Absolute rotation angle of the shaft flange in [rad].\r\n"
"tau: Cut-torque in the shaft flange in [Nm].\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"还有另一个用于一维转动接口的连接器： <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Flange_b\" target=\"\">Flange_b</a>. 连接器 Flange_a 和 Flange_b 是完全相同的。唯一的区别是图标，以便在图中更容易识别一维转动接口变量。 关于局部力矩 tau 和旋转角度的实际方向的讨论，请参阅 Rotational 用户指南中的 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.UsersGuide.SignConventions\" target=\"\">Sign Conventions</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果需要，一维转动接口的绝对角速度w和绝对角加速度a可以通过对一维转动接口角度phi进行微分来确定：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >w = der(phi);\r\n"
"a = der(w);\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Flange_b"
msgid "One-dimensional rotational flange of a shaft (non-filled circle icon)"
msgstr "一维转动接口b（空心圆图标）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Flange_b"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a connector for 1-dim. rotational mechanical systems and models which represents\r\n"
"a mechanical flange of a shaft. The following variables are defined in this connector:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"phi: Absolute rotation angle of the shaft flange in [rad].\r\n"
"tau: Cut-torque in the shaft flange in [Nm].\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"There is a second connector for flanges:\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Flange_a\">Flange_a</a>.\r\n"
"The connectors\r\n"
"Flange_a and Flange_b are completely identical. There is only a difference\r\n"
"in the icons, in order to easier identify a flange variable in a diagram.\r\n"
"For a discussion on the actual direction of the cut-torque tau and\r\n"
"of the rotation angle, see section\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.UsersGuide.SignConventions\">Sign Conventions</a>\r\n"
"in the user's guide of Rotational.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If needed, the absolute angular velocity w and the\r\n"
"absolute angular acceleration a of the flange can be determined by\r\n"
"differentiation of the flange angle phi:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"w = der(phi);\r\n"
"a = der(w);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"这是一个用于一维旋转机械系统和模型的连接器，代表轴的机械一维转动接口。此连接器中定义了以下变量：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >phi: Absolute rotation angle of the shaft flange in [rad].\r\n"
"tau: Cut-torque in the shaft flange in [Nm].\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"还有另一个用于一维转动接口的连接器： <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Flange_a\" target=\"\">Flange_a</a>. 连接器 Flange_a 和 Flange_b 是完全相同的。唯一的区别是图标，以便在图中更容易识别一维转动接口变量。 关于局部力矩tau和旋转角度的实际方向的讨论，请参阅Rotational用户指南中的 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.UsersGuide.SignConventions\" target=\"\">Sign Conventions</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果需要，一维转动接口的绝对角速度w和绝对角加速度a可以通过对一维转动接口角度phi进行微分来确定：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >w = der(phi);\r\n"
"a = der(w);\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Support"
msgid "Support/housing flange of a one-dimensional rotational shaft"
msgstr "一维旋转轴的支撑组件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Support"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a connector for 1-dim. rotational mechanical systems and models which represents\r\n"
"a support or housing of a shaft. The following variables are defined in this connector:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"phi: Absolute rotation angle of the support/housing in [rad].\r\n"
"tau: Reaction torque in the support/housing in [Nm].\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The support connector is usually defined as conditional connector.\r\n"
"It is most convenient to utilize it\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> For models to be build graphically (i.e., the model is build up by drag-and-drop\r\n"
"     from elementary components):<br>\r\n"
"     <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialOneFlangeAndSupport\">PartialOneFlangeAndSupport</a>,<br>\r\n"
"     <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialTwoFlangesAndSupport\">PartialTwoFlangesAndSupport</a>.<br> &nbsp;</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> For models to be build textually (i.e., elementary models):<br>\r\n"
"     <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialElementaryOneFlangeAndSupport2\">PartialElementaryOneFlangeAndSupport</a>,<br>\r\n"
"     <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialElementaryTwoFlangesAndSupport2\">PartialElementaryTwoFlangesAndSupport</a>,<br>\r\n"
"     <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialElementaryRotationalToTranslational\">PartialElementaryRotationalToTranslational</a>.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是用于一维旋转机械系统和模型的连接器，表示轴的支撑或轴承座。在此连接器中定义了以下变量：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"phi: Absolute rotation angle of the support/housing in [rad].\r\n"
"tau: Reaction torque in the support/housing in [Nm].\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"支撑连接器通常被定义为条件连接器。\r\n"
"最方便的方法是利用它\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> 对于以图形方式构建的模型（模型是通过从基本组件中拖放来构建的）：<br>\r\n"
"     <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialOneFlangeAndSupport\">PartialOneFlangeAndSupport</a>,<br>\r\n"
"     <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialTwoFlangesAndSupport\">PartialTwoFlangesAndSupport</a>.<br> &nbsp;</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> 对于以文本方式构建的模型（基本模型）：<br>\r\n"
"     <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialElementaryOneFlangeAndSupport2\">PartialElementaryOneFlangeAndSupport</a>,<br>\r\n"
"     <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialElementaryTwoFlangesAndSupport2\">PartialElementaryTwoFlangesAndSupport</a>,<br>\r\n"
"     <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialElementaryRotationalToTranslational\">PartialElementaryRotationalToTranslational</a>.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.InternalSupport"
msgid "Adapter model to utilize conditional support connector"
msgstr "适配器模型，用于利用有条件的支撑连接器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.InternalSupport"
msgid "External support torque (must be computed via torque balance in model where InternalSupport is used; = flange.tau)"
msgstr "外部支撑力矩（必须通过在使用InternalSupport模型的模型中进行力矩平衡计算而得出；= flange.tau)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.InternalSupport"
msgid "External support angle (= flange.phi)"
msgstr "外部支撑角度（= flange.phi）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.InternalSupport"
msgid "Internal support flange (must be connected to the conditional support connector for useSupport=true and to conditional fixed model for useSupport=false)"
msgstr "内部支撑一维转动接口（必须连接到条件支撑连接器以使用useSupport=true，连接到条件固定模型以使用useSupport=false）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.InternalSupport"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.InternalSupport"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is an adapter model to utilize a&nbsp;conditional\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Support\">support connector</a>\r\n"
"in a&nbsp;component. It could be applied to both textually (equations based) and graphically\r\n"
"defined components:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> If <em>useSupport = true</em>, this flange has to be connected to the conditional\r\n"
"     support connector.</li>\r\n"
"<li> If <em>useSupport = false</em>, this flange has to be connected to the conditional\r\n"
"     fixed model.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Variable <strong>tau</strong> is defined as <strong>input</strong>. It must be\r\n"
"provided as a&nbsp;modifier and computed via a&nbsp;torque balance when using this\r\n"
"model in textually defined components.\r\n"
"This approach of internal support is utilized, e.g., via the following partial models:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialOneFlangeAndSupport\">PartialOneFlangeAndSupport</a>,</li>\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialTwoFlangesAndSupport\">PartialTwoFlangesAndSupport</a>,</li>\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialElementaryRotationalToTranslational\">PartialElementaryRotationalToTranslational</a>.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, the support angle can always be accessed as internalSupport.phi, and\r\n"
"the support torque can always be accessed as internalSupport.tau.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个适配器模型，用于在组件中利用一个条件\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Support\">support connector</a>。\r\n"
"它可以应用于文本定义的组件和图形定义的组件：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> 如果<em>useSupport = true</em>，则此一维转动接口必须连接到条件支撑连接器。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 如果<em>useSupport = false</em>，则此一维转动接口必须连接到条件固定模型。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"变量<strong>tau</strong>被定义为<strong>input</strong>。在文本定义的组件中使用此模型时，必须作为修饰符提供并通过力矩平衡计算而得。\r\n"
"这种内部支撑的方法通常通过以下部分模型来利用：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialOneFlangeAndSupport\">PartialOneFlangeAndSupport</a>,</li>\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialTwoFlangesAndSupport\">PartialTwoFlangesAndSupport</a>,</li>\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialElementaryRotationalToTranslational\">PartialElementaryRotationalToTranslational</a>。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意，支撑角度始终可以作为internalSupport.phi访问，支撑力矩始终可以作为internalSupport.tau访问。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

