msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliant"
msgid "Partial model for the compliant connection of two rotational 1-dim. shaft flanges"
msgstr "具有两个一维转动接口的弹性连接的部分模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliant"
msgid "Relative rotation angle (= flange_b.phi - flange_a.phi)"
msgstr "相对旋转角度（= flange_b.phi - flange_a.phi）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliant"
msgid "Torque between flanges (= flange_b.tau)"
msgstr "一维转动接口之间的扭矩（= flange_b.tau）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliant"
msgid "Left flange of compliant 1-dim. rotational component"
msgstr "具有弹性连接的一维旋转组件的左侧一维转动接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliant"
msgid "Right flange of compliant 1-dim. rotational component"
msgstr "具有弹性连接的一维旋转组件的右侧一维转动接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliant"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a 1-dim. rotational component with a compliant connection of two\r\n"
"rotational 1-dim. flanges where inertial effects between the two\r\n"
"flanges are neglected. The basic assumption is that the cut-torques\r\n"
"of the two flanges sum-up to zero, i.e., they have the same absolute value\r\n"
"but opposite sign: flange_a.tau + flange_b.tau = 0. This base class\r\n"
"is used to built up force elements such as springs, dampers, friction.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个具有弹性连接的一维旋转组件，其中有两个一维旋转轴的转动接口，忽略了两个一维转动接口之间的惯性影响。\r\n"
"基本假设是两个一维转动接口的局部力矩总和为零，即它们具有相同的绝对值但相反的符号：flange_a.tau + flange_b.tau = 0。\r\n"
"此基类用于构建诸如弹簧、减震器、摩擦等力元素。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliantWithRelativeStates"
msgid "Partial model for the compliant connection of two rotational 1-dim. shaft flanges where the relative angle and speed are used as preferred states"
msgstr "具有相对角度和角速度作为首选状态的两个一维转动接口的弹性连接的部分模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliantWithRelativeStates"
msgid "Relative rotation angle (= flange_b.phi - flange_a.phi)"
msgstr "相对转动角度（= flange_b.phi - flange_a.phi）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliantWithRelativeStates"
msgid "Relative angular velocity (= der(phi_rel))"
msgstr "相对角速度（= der(phi_rel))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliantWithRelativeStates"
msgid "Relative angular acceleration (= der(w_rel))"
msgstr "相对角加速度（= der(w_rel))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliantWithRelativeStates"
msgid "Torque between flanges (= flange_b.tau)"
msgstr "一维转动接口之间的扭矩（= flange_b.tau）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliantWithRelativeStates"
msgid "Left flange of compliant 1-dim. rotational component"
msgstr "具有弹性连接的一维转动组件的左侧一维转动接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliantWithRelativeStates"
msgid "Right flange of compliant 1-dim. rotational component"
msgstr "具有弹性连接的一维转动组件的右侧一维转动接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliantWithRelativeStates"
msgid "Nominal value of phi_rel (used for scaling)"
msgstr "phi_rel的标称值（用于缩放）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliantWithRelativeStates"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliantWithRelativeStates"
msgid "Priority to use phi_rel and w_rel as states"
msgstr "优先使用phi_rel和w_rel作为状态"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialCompliantWithRelativeStates"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a 1-dim. rotational component with a compliant connection of two\r\n"
"rotational 1-dim. flanges where inertial effects between the two\r\n"
"flanges are neglected. The basic assumption is that the cut-torques\r\n"
"of the two flanges sum-up to zero, i.e., they have the same absolute value\r\n"
"but opposite sign: flange_a.tau + flange_b.tau = 0. This base class\r\n"
"is used to built up force elements such as springs, dampers, friction.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The relative angle and the relative speed are defined as preferred states.\r\n"
"The reason is that for some drive trains, such as drive\r\n"
"trains in vehicles, the absolute angle is quickly increasing during operation.\r\n"
"Numerically, it is better to use relative angles between drive train components\r\n"
"because they remain in a limited size. For this reason, StateSelect.prefer\r\n"
"is set for the relative angle of this component.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In order to improve the numerics, a nominal value for the relative angle\r\n"
"can be provided via parameter <strong>phi_nominal</strong> in the Advanced menu.\r\n"
"The default is 1e-4 rad since relative angles are usually\r\n"
"in this order and the step size control of an integrator would be\r\n"
"practically switched off, if a default of 1 rad would be used.\r\n"
"This nominal value might also be computed from other values, such\r\n"
"as \"phi_nominal = tau_nominal / c\" for a rotational spring, if tau_nominal\r\n"
"and c are more meaningful for the user.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"See also the discussion\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.UsersGuide.StateSelection\">State Selection</a>\r\n"
"in the User's Guide of the Rotational library.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"这是一个具有弹性连接的一维转动组件，其中有两个一维转动接口，并忽略了两个一维转动接口之间的惯性影响。基本假设是两个一维转动接口的局部力矩总和为零，即它们具有相同的绝对值但相反的符号：flange_a.tau + flange_b.tau = 0。此基类用于构建诸如弹簧、减震器、摩擦等力元素。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"相对角度和相对速度被定义为首选状态的原因是对于某些传动系统，例如车辆中的传动系统，绝对角度在运行过程中会快速增加。从数值上讲，使用传动系统组件之间的相对角度作为状态变量更好，因为它们保持在有限的大小范围内。因此，对于该组件的相对角度，将StateSelect.prefer设置为优先。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"为了改善数值计算，可以通过高级菜单中的参数<strong>phi_nominal</strong>提供相对角度的标称值。默认值为1e-4 rad，因为相对角度通常在此数量级，如果使用默认值1 rad，则积分器的步长控制实际上将被关闭。此标称值也可以从其他值计算得出，例如“phi_nominal = tau_nominal / c”，如果tau_nominal和c对用户更有意义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"还请参阅Rotational库中用户指南的<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.UsersGuide.StateSelection\" target=\"\">State Selection</a>的讨论。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

