"<p>\r\n"
"如果<em>useSupport=true</em>，则支撑连接器被有条件地启用并需要连接。<br>\r\n"
"如果<em>useSupport=false</em>，则支撑连接器被有条件地禁用，而组件则内部固定到地面。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialElementaryRotationalToTranslational"
