msgstr "= true，如果启用旋转支撑一维转动接口，否则隐式接地"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialElementaryRotationalToTranslational"
msgid "= true, if translational support flange enabled, otherwise implicitly grounded"
msgstr "= true，如果启用平移支撑一维转动接口，否则隐式接地"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialElementaryRotationalToTranslational"
msgid "Flange of rotational shaft"
msgstr "旋转轴的一维转动接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialElementaryRotationalToTranslational"
msgid "Flange of translational rod"
msgstr "平移杆的一维转动接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialElementaryRotationalToTranslational"
msgid "Rotational support/housing of component"
msgstr "组件的旋转支撑/轴承座"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialElementaryRotationalToTranslational"
msgid "Translational support/housing of component"
msgstr "组件的平移支撑/轴承座"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.PartialElementaryRotationalToTranslational"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a 1-dim. rotational component with\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> one rotational flange,</li>\r\n"
"<li> one rotational support/housing,</li>\r\n"
"<li> one translational flange, and</li>\r\n"
"<li> one translational support/housing</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model is used to build up elementary components of a drive train\r\n"
"transforming rotational into translational motion with\r\n"
"equations in the text layer.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If <em>useSupportR=true</em>, the rotational support connector is conditionally enabled\r\n"
"and needs to be connected.<br>\r\n"
"If <em>useSupportR=false</em>, the rotational support connector is conditionally disabled\r\n"
"and instead the rotational part is internally fixed to ground.<br>\r\n"
"If <em>useSupportT=true</em>, the translational support connector is conditionally enabled\r\n"
"and needs to be connected.<br>\r\n"
"If <em>useSupportT=false</em>, the translational support connector is conditionally disabled\r\n"
"and instead the translational part is internally fixed to ground.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这是一个一维旋转组件，具有\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> 一个旋转一维转动接口，</li>\r\n"
"<li> 一个旋转支撑/轴承座，</li>\r\n"
"<li> 一个平移一维转动接口，和</li>\r\n"
"<li> 一个平移支撑/轴承座</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模型用于构建驱动传动系统的基本组件，将旋转运动转换为平移运动，并附有文本层中的方程。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果<em>useSupportR=true</em>，则旋转支撑连接器条件性启用，并且需要连接。<br>\r\n"
"如果<em>useSupportR=false</em>，则旋转支撑连接器条件性禁用，并且旋转部分将内部固定到地面。<br>\r\n"
"如果<em>useSupportT=true</em>，则平移支撑连接器条件性启用，并且需要连接。<br>\r\n"
"如果<em>useSupportT=false</em>，则平移支撑连接器条件性禁用，并且平移部分将内部固定到地面。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

