msgstr "一维平动机械传动系统的组件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Components"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains basic components 1D mechanical translational drive trains.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该包中含有关一维机械平动传动系统的基本组件。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Components.Fixed"
msgid "Fixed flange"
msgstr "固定一维平动接口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Components.Fixed"
msgid "Fixed offset position of housing"
msgstr "壳体的固定偏移位置"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Components.Fixed"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Components.Fixed"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The <em>flange</em> of a 1D translational mechanical system <em>fixed</em>\r\n"
"at an position s0 in the <em>housing</em>. May be used:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> to connect a compliant element, such as a spring or a damper,\r\n"
"     between a sliding mass and the housing.</li>\r\n"
"<li> to fix a rigid element, such as a sliding mass, at a specific\r\n"
"     position.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一维平动机械系统的<em>固定</em>在位置s0处的<em>一维平动接口</em>。可用于：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>连接一个弹性元件，例如弹簧或减震器，以夹在滑动质量块和壳体之间。</li>\r\n"
"<li>固定一个刚性元件，例如将滑动质量固定到特定位置。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

