msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Components.GeneralForceToPositionAdaptor"
msgid "Signal adaptor for a Translational flange with position, speed, and acceleration as outputs and force as input (especially useful for FMUs)"
msgstr "信号适配器，用于将位置、速度、加速度作为输出，力作为输入的一维平动接口(特别适用于FMUs)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Components.GeneralForceToPositionAdaptor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Adaptor between a flange connector and a signal representation of the flange.\r\n"
"This component is used to provide a pure signal interface around a Translational model\r\n"
"and export this model in form of an input/output block,\r\n"
"especially as FMU (<a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>).\r\n"
"Examples of the usage of this adaptor are provided in\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs\">Translational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs</a>.\r\n"
"This adaptor has force as input and position, velocity and acceleration as output signals.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一维平动接口 连接器与一维平动接口 信号表示之间的适配器。\r\n"
"此组件用于提供纯信号接口围绕平移模型并以输入/输出块的形式导出此模型，\r\n"
"特别是作为FMU (<a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>)。\r\n"
"在<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs\">Translational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs</a>中提供了此适配器的使用示例。\r\n"
"此适配器将力作为输入，并将位置、速度和加速度作为输出信号。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Components.GeneralPositionToForceAdaptor"
msgid "Signal adaptor for a Translational flange with force as output and position, speed and acceleration as input (especially useful for FMUs)"
msgstr "信号适配器，用于将力作为输出，位置、速度、加速度作为输入的一维平动接口(特别适用于FMUs)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Components.GeneralPositionToForceAdaptor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Adaptor between a flange connector and a signal representation of the flange.\r\n"
"This component is used to provide a pure signal interface around a Translational model\r\n"
"and export this model in form of an input/output block,\r\n"
"especially as FMU (<a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>).\r\n"
"Examples of the usage of this adaptor are provided in\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs\">Translational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs</a>.\r\n"
"This adaptor has position, velocity and acceleration as input signals and\r\n"
"force as output signal.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, the input signals must be consistent to each other\r\n"
"(v=der(s), a=der(v)).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"一维平动接口连接器与一维平动接口信号表示之间的适配器。\r\n"
"此组件用于提供纯信号接口围绕平移模型并以输入/输出块的形式导出此模型，\r\n"
"特别是作为FMU (<a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>)。\r\n"
"在<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs\">Translational.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs</a>中提供了此适配器的使用示例。\r\n"
"此适配器将位置、速度和加速度作为输入信号，并将力作为输出信号。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意，输入信号必须彼此一致（v=der(s)，a=der(v)）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Sensors"
msgid "Sensors for 1-dim. translational mechanical quantities"
msgstr "一维平移机械量的传感器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Sensors"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains ideal sensor components that provide\r\n"
"the connector variables as signals for further processing with the\r\n"
"Modelica.Blocks library.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该包含理想传感器组件，提供连接器变量作为信号，以便与Modelica.Blocks库进行进一步处理。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Sensors.PositionSensor"
msgid "Ideal sensor to measure the absolute position"
msgstr "理想传感器，用于测量绝对位置"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Sensors.PositionSensor"
msgid "Absolute position of flange as output signal"
msgstr "输出信号：一维平动接口的绝对位置"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Sensors.PositionSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Measures the <em>absolute position s</em> of a flange in an ideal way and provides the result as\r\n"
"output signals (to be further processed with blocks of the\r\n"
"Modelica.Blocks library).\r\n"
