"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"以理想方式测量一维平动接口的绝对位置<em>s</em>，并将结果提供为输出信号（以便与Modelica.Blocks库中的模块进一步处理）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Sensors.PositionSensor"
msgid "m"
msgstr "m"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Sensors.SpeedSensor"
msgid "Ideal sensor to measure the absolute velocity"
msgstr "理想传感器，用于测量绝对速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Sensors.SpeedSensor"
msgid "Absolute velocity of flange as output signal"
msgstr "输出信号：一维平动接口的绝对速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Sensors.SpeedSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Measures the <em>absolute velocity v</em> of a flange in an ideal way and provides the result as\r\n"
"output signals (to be further processed with blocks of the\r\n"
"Modelica.Blocks library).\r\n"
