"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"以理想方式测量一维平动接口的绝对速度<em>v</em>，并将结果提供为输出信号（以便与Modelica.Blocks库中的模块进一步处理）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Sensors.SpeedSensor"
msgid "m/s"
msgstr "m/s"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Sensors.AccSensor"
msgid "Ideal sensor to measure the absolute acceleration"
msgstr "理想传感器，用于测量绝对加速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Sensors.AccSensor"
msgid "Absolute velocity of flange"
msgstr "一维平动接口的绝对速度"

