msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Examples.ControlledTankSystem.ControlledTanks"
msgid "Demonstrating the controller of a tank filling/emptying system"
msgstr "演示水箱注水/排水系统的控制器功能"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Examples.ControlledTankSystem.ControlledTanks"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"With this example, the controller of a tank filling/emptying system\r\n"
"is demonstrated.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The basic operation is to fill and empty the two tanks:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> Valve 1 is opened and tank 1 is filled.</li>\r\n"
"<li> When tank 1 reaches its fill level limit,\r\n"
"     valve 1 is closed.</li>\r\n"
"<li> After a waiting time, valve 2 is\r\n"
"     opened and the fluid flows from tank 1 into tank 2.</li>\r\n"
"<li> When tank 1 reaches its minimum level, valve 2 is closed.</li>\r\n"
"<li> After a waiting time, valve 3 is opened and\r\n"
"     the fluid flows out of tank 2</li>\r\n"
"<li> When tank 2 reaches its minimum level, valve 3 is closed</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The above \"normal\" process can be influenced by three\r\n"
"buttons:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> Button <strong>start</strong> starts the above process.\r\n"
"     When this button is pressed after a \"stop\" or\r\n"
"     \"shut\" operation, the process operation continues.\r\n"
"     </li>\r\n"
"<li> Button <strong>stop</strong> stops the above process by\r\n"
"     closing all valves. Then, the controller waits for\r\n"
"     further input (either \"start\" or \"shut\" operation).</li>\r\n"
"<li> Button <strong>shut</strong> is used to shutdown the process,\r\n"
"     by emptying at once both tanks by opening valve 2 and\r\n"
"     valve 3. When this is achieved,\r\n"
"     the process goes back to its start configuration\r\n"
"     where all 3 valves are closed.\r\n"
"     Clicking on \"start\", restarts the process.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The demo-run uses the following button presses:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> Button <strong>start</strong> pressed at 20 s.</li>\r\n"
"<li> Button <strong>stop</strong> pressed at 220 s</li>\r\n"
"<li> Button <strong>start</strong> pressed at 280 s</li>\r\n"
"<li> Button <strong>stop</strong> pressed at 650 s</li>\r\n"
"<li> Button <strong>shut</strong> pressed at 700 s</li>\r\n"
"<li> Simulate for 900 s</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This example is based on\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<dl>\r\n"
"<dt>Dressler I. (2004):</dt>\r\n"
"<dd> <strong>Code Generation From JGrafchart to Modelica</strong>.\r\n"
"     Master thesis, supervisor: Karl-Erik &Aring;rz&eacute;n,\r\n"
"     Department of Automatic Control, Lund Institute of Technology,\r\n"
"     Lund, Sweden, March 30, 2004<br>&nbsp;</dd>\r\n"
"</dl>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Fluid/Examples/ControlledTankSystem/ControlledTanks.png\" border=\"1\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"ControlledTanks.png\">\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"水箱加注/清空系统的控制器。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"基本操作是装满和清空两个水箱：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ol><li>\r\n"
"阀门 1 打开，水箱 1 加满油。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"当水箱 1 达到其填充液位极限时，阀门 1 关闭。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"等待一段时间后，阀门 2 打开，流体从水箱 1 流入水箱 2。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"当水箱 1 达到最低液位时，阀门 2 关闭。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"等待一段时间后，阀门 3 打开，流体从水箱 2 流出</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"当水箱 2 达到最低液位时，阀门 3 关闭</li>\r\n"
"</ol><p>\r\n"
"上述过程可受三个按钮的影响：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul><li>\r\n"
"<strong>start</strong> 按钮选项启动上述过程。当 \"停止 \"或 \"关闭 \"操作后按下该按钮时，流程操作继续进行。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<strong>stop</strong> 按钮关闭所有阀门，停止上述过程。然后，控制器等待进一步的输入（\"启动 \"或 \"关闭 \"操作）。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<strong>shut</strong> 按钮用于关闭工艺，通过打开 2 号阀和 3 号阀一次性清空两个水箱。\r\n"
"关闭后，流程将回到起始配置，此时所有 3 个阀门均处于关闭状态。点击 \"start \"按钮，流程重新启动。</li>\r\n"
"</ul><p>\r\n"
"The demo-run uses the following button presses:演示运行使用以下按钮：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul><li>\r\n"
"20 秒时按下 <strong>start </strong>按钮。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"220 s时按下 <strong>stop </strong>按钮</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"280 s时按下 <strong>start </strong>按钮</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"650 s时按下 <strong>stop</strong> 按钮</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"700 s时按下 <strong>shut</strong> 按钮</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"仿真 900 秒</li>\r\n"
"</ul><p>\r\n"
"本示例基于\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Dressler I. (2004):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Code Generation From JGrafchart to Modelica</strong>.<br>Master thesis, \r\n"
"supervisor: Karl-Erik Årzén,<br>Department of Automatic Control, Lund Institute of Technology,\r\n"
"<br>Lund, Sweden, March 30, 2004\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Fluid/Examples/ControlledTankSystem/ControlledTanks.png\" border=\"1\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"ControlledTanks.png\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

