msgstr "根据给定的圆管标准值得出的长度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.FlowModels.NominalLaminarFlow"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model defines a simple linear pressure loss assuming laminar flow for\r\n"
"specified <code>dp_nominal</code> and <code>m_flow_nominal</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Select <code>show_Res = true</code> to analyze the actual flow and the lengths of a pipe that would fulfill the\r\n"
"specified nominal values for given geometry parameters <code>crossAreas</code>, <code>dimensions</code> and <code>roughnesses</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模型定义了在指定的 <code>dp_nominal</code> 和 <code>m_flow_nominal</code> 的层流条件下的简单的线性压力损失。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"选择 <code>show_Res = true</code> 可分析实际流动和管道长度，以满足给定几何参数横截面积 <code>crossAreas</code>、尺寸 <code>dimensions</code> 和粗糙度 <code>roughnesses</code> 的指定额定值。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.FlowModels.PartialGenericPipeFlow"
