msgstr "根据 v、rho、mu 和 D 计算雷诺数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber"
msgid "Mean velocity of fluid flow"
msgstr "流体流动的平均速度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber"
msgid "Fluid density"
msgstr "流体密度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber"
msgid "Dynamic (absolute) viscosity"
msgstr "动力（绝对）黏度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber"
msgid "Characteristic dimension (hydraulic diameter of pipes)"
msgstr "特征尺寸（管道水力直径）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber"
msgid "Reynolds number"
msgstr "雷诺数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Calculation of Reynolds Number\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Re = |v|&rho;D/&mu;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"a measure of the relationship between inertial forces (v&rho;) and viscous forces (D/&mu;).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The following table gives examples for the characteristic dimension D and the velocity v for different fluid flow devices:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>Device Type</strong></th><th><strong>Characteristic Dimension D</strong></th><th><strong>Velocity v</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>Circular Pipe</td><td>diameter</td>\r\n"
"    <td>m_flow/&rho;/crossArea</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>Rectangular Duct</td><td>4*crossArea/perimeter</td>\r\n"
"    <td>m_flow/&rho;/crossArea</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>Wide Duct</td><td>distance between narrow, parallel walls</td>\r\n"
"    <td>m_flow/&rho;/crossArea</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>Packed Bed</td><td>diameterOfSpericalParticles/(1-fluidFractionOfTotalVolume)</td>\r\n"
"    <td>m_flow/&rho;/crossArea (without particles)</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>Device with rotating agitator</td><td>diameterOfRotor</td>\r\n"
"    <td>RotationalSpeed*diameterOfRotor</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"雷诺数计算\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Re = |v|&rho;D/&mu;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"惯性力 (v&rho;) 和粘性力 (D/&mu;) 之间关系的量度。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"下表列出了不同流体流动设备的特征尺寸 D 和速度 v 的示例：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><th><strong>设备类型</strong></th><th><strong>特征尺寸 D</strong></th><th><strong>速度 v</strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>圆管</td><td>直径</td>\r\n"
"<td>m_flow/&rho;/横截面积</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>矩形风管</td><td>4*横截面积/周长</td>\r\n"
"<td>m_flow/&rho;/横截面积</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>宽风管</td><td>平行壁面间的窄距</td>\r\n"
"<td>m_flow/&rho;/横截面积</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>填充床式反应器</td><td>微粒直径/（1-总体积的流体分数）</td>\r\n"
"<td>m_flow/&rho;/横截面积（不含颗粒）</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>带旋转搅拌器的设备</td><td>转子直径</td>\r\n"
"<td>转速*转子直径</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber_m_flow"
msgid "Return Reynolds number from m_flow, mu, D, A"
msgstr "根据 m_flow、mu、D、A 计算雷诺数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber_m_flow"
msgid "Mass flow rate"
msgstr "质量流量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber_m_flow"
msgid "Dynamic viscosity"
msgstr "动力黏度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber_m_flow"
msgid "Characteristic dimension (hydraulic diameter of pipes or orifices)"
msgstr "特征尺寸（管道或孔口的水力直径）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber_m_flow"
msgid "Cross sectional area of fluid flow"
msgstr "流体的横截面积"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber_m_flow"
msgid "Reynolds number"
msgstr "雷诺数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber_m_flow"
msgid "<html>Simplified calculation of Reynolds Number for flow through pipes or orifices;\r\n"
"              using the mass flow rate <code>m_flow</code> instead of the velocity <code>v</code> to express inertial forces.\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Re = |m_flow|*diameter/A/&mu;\r\n"
"with\r\n"
"  m_flow = v*&rho;*A\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"See also <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber\">\r\n"
"          Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber</a>.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"简化计算流经管道或节流元件时的雷诺数；使用质量流量 <code>m_flow</code> 代替速度 <code>v</code> 来表示惯性力。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Re = |m_flow|*直径/A/&mu;\r\n"
"m_flow = v*&rho;*A\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"也可参考 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Fluid.Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber\">\r\n"
"Pipes.BaseClasses.CharacteristicNumbers.ReynoldsNumber</a>。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

