"改编自 ThermoPower 库。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveLinear"
msgid "Valve for water/steam flows with linear pressure drop"
msgstr "用于线性压降的水/蒸汽阀门"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveLinear"
msgid "Nominal pressure drop at full opening"
msgstr "全开时的额定压降"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveLinear"
msgid "Nominal operating point"
msgstr "额定工作点"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveLinear"
msgid "Nominal mass flowrate at full opening"
msgstr "全开时的额定质量流量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveLinear"
msgid "Hydraulic conductance at full opening"
msgstr "全开时的渗透系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveLinear"
msgid "=1: completely open, =0: completely closed"
msgstr "=1: 完全打开， =0:完全关闭"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveLinear"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This very simple model provides a pressure drop which is proportional to the flowrate and to the <code>opening</code> input, without computing any fluid property. It can be used for testing purposes, when\r\n"
"a simple model of a variable pressure loss is needed.</p>\r\n"
"<p>A medium model must be nevertheless be specified, so that the fluid ports can be connected to other components using the same medium model.</p>\r\n"
"<p>The model is adiabatic (no heat losses to the ambient) and neglects changes in kinetic energy from the inlet to the outlet.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模型非常简单，提供的压降与流速和 <code>opening</code> 输入成正比，无需计算任何流体特性。\r\n"
"当需要一个简单的可变压力损失模型时，它可用于测试目的。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>但必须指定介质模型，以便使用相同的介质模型将流体接口连接到其他组件。</p>\r\n"
"<p>该模型为绝热模型（不向环境散热），忽略了从入口到出口的动能变化。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveLinear"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>2 Nov 2005</em>\r\n"
"    by <a href=\"mailto:francesco.casella@polimi.it\">Francesco Casella</a>:<br>\r\n"
"       Adapted from the ThermoPower library.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>2 Nov 2005</em>\r\n"
"by <a href=\"mailto:francesco.casella@polimi.it\">Francesco Casella</a>:<br>\r\n"
"改编自 ThermoPower 库。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscrete"
msgid "Valve for water/steam flows with linear pressure drop"
msgstr "用于线性压降的水/蒸汽阀门"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscrete"
msgid "Nominal pressure drop at full opening=1"
msgstr "全开=1时的额定压降"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscrete"
msgid "Nominal operating point"
msgstr "额定工作点"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscrete"
msgid "Nominal mass flowrate at full opening=1"
msgstr "全开=1时的额定质量流量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscrete"
msgid "Hydraulic conductance at full opening=1"
msgstr "全开=1时的渗透系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscrete"
msgid "Remaining opening if closed, causing small leakage flow"
msgstr "如果关闭，阀门缝隙会造成少量泄漏流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscrete"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This very simple model provides a (small) pressure drop which is proportional to the flowrate if the Boolean open signal is <strong>true</strong>. Otherwise, the mass flow rate is zero. If opening_min > 0, a small leakage mass flow rate occurs when open = <strong>false</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>This model can be used for simplified modelling of on-off valves, when it is not important to accurately describe the pressure loss when the valve is open. Although the medium model is not used to determine the pressure loss, it must be nevertheless be specified, so that the fluid ports can be connected to other components using the same medium model.</p>\r\n"
"<p>The model is adiabatic (no heat losses to the ambient) and neglects changes in kinetic energy from the inlet to the outlet.</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In a diagram animation, the valve is shown in \"green\", when\r\n"
"it is open.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果 open = <strong>true</strong> ，这个非常简单的模型就会产生与流量成正比的（小）压降，否则，质量流量为零。如果 opening_min > 0，\r\n"
"则在 open = <strong>false</strong> 时会出现较小的泄漏质量流量。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模型可用于简化开闭阀的建模，当不需要准确描述阀门开启时的压力损失时特别有用。虽然介质模型不是用来确定压力损失的，但必须指定介质模型，\r\n"
"以便流体端口可以连接到使用相同介质模型的其他组件。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模型为绝热模型（不向环境散热），忽略了从入口到出口的动能变化。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在图示动画中，阀门打开时显示为 \"绿色\"。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscrete"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>Nov 2005</em>\r\n"
"    by Katja Poschlad (based on ValveLinear).</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>Nov 2005</em>\r\n"
"by Katja Poschlad (based on ValveLinear).</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscreteRamp"
msgid "Valve for water/steam flows with discrete opening signal and ramp opening"
msgstr "用于水/蒸汽的阀门，具有离散开启信号和斜坡开启功能"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscreteRamp"
msgid "Nominal pressure drop at full opening"
msgstr "全开时的额定压降"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscreteRamp"
msgid "Nominal operating point"
msgstr "额定工作点"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscreteRamp"
msgid "Nominal mass flowrate at full opening"
msgstr "全开时的额定质量流量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscreteRamp"
msgid "Remaining opening if closed, causing small leakage flow"
msgstr "如果关闭，阀门缝隙会造成少量泄漏流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscreteRamp"
msgid "Hydraulic conductance at full opening"
msgstr "全开时的渗透系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscreteRamp"
msgid "Time to fully open the valve"
msgstr "全开阀门的时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscreteRamp"
msgid "Time to fully close the valve"
msgstr "全关阀门的时间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscreteRamp"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model is similar to <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscrete\">ValveDiscrete</a>,\r\n"
"except that the valve opens gradually with an opening time <code>Topen</code> and closes gradually with\r\n"
"a closing time <code>Tclose</code> instead of doing so abruptly. This can help to avoid unrealistic phenomena such\r\n"
"as reversing flows when accurate fluid models with small compressiblity are employed.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模型与 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscrete\">ValveDiscrete</a> 相似，\r\n"
"不同之处在于阀门在打开时间 <code>Tclose</code> 内逐渐打开，在关闭时间 <code>Tclose</code> 内逐渐关闭，而不是突然关闭。\r\n"
"这有助于避免在使用具有小压缩性的精确流体模型时出现不现实的现象，例如反向流动。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.ValveDiscreteRamp"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>Mar 2020</em>\r\n"
"    by Francesco Casella (based on ValveLinear and ValveDiscrete).</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>Mar 2020</em>\r\n"
"by Francesco Casella (based on ValveLinear and ValveDiscrete).</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Valves.BaseClasses"
