msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Fittings.MultiPort"
msgid "Multiply a port; useful if multiple connections shall be made to a port exposing a state"
msgstr "多接口；用于对显示状态的接口进行多个连接"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Fittings.MultiPort"
msgid "Number of outlet ports (mass is distributed evenly between the outlet ports"
msgstr "出口数量 (质量在出气口之间均匀分布)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Fittings.MultiPort"
msgid "inStream mass fractions at ports_b"
msgstr "ports_b 的内流质量分数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Fittings.MultiPort"
msgid "inStream extra properties at ports_b"
msgstr "ports_b 的内流额外属性"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Fittings.MultiPort"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Fittings.MultiPort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model is useful if multiple connections shall be made to a port of a volume model exposing a state,\r\n"
"like a pipe with ModelStructure av_vb.\r\n"
"The mixing is shifted into the volume connected to port_a and the result is propagated back to each ports_b.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If multiple connections were directly made to the volume,\r\n"
"then ideal mixing would take place in the connection set, outside the volume. This is normally not intended.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"当需要将多个连接建立到暴露状态的容积模型（如具有ModelStructure av_vb的管道）的端口时，此模型非常有用。\r\n"
"混合过程被转移到连接到port_a 的容积中，然后结果再传播回每个port_b。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果多个连接直接建立到容积上，则理想混合会在连接集内、容积外部发生，这通常是不符合预期的。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Fittings.TeeJunctionIdeal"
msgid "Splitting/joining component with static balances for an infinitesimal control volume"
msgstr "用于无穷小控制体积的带静态平衡的分流/合流组件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Fittings.TeeJunctionIdeal"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"  This model is the simplest implementation for a splitting/joining component for\r\n"
"  three flows. Its use is not required. It just formulates the balance\r\n"
"  equations in the same way that the connect semantics would formulate them anyways.\r\n"
"  The main advantage of using this component is, that the user does not get\r\n"
"  confused when looking at the specific enthalpy at each port which might be confusing\r\n"
"  when not using a splitting/joining component. The reason for the confusion is that one examines the mixing\r\n"
"  enthalpy of the infinitesimal control volume introduced with the connect statement when\r\n"
"  looking at the specific enthalpy in the connector which\r\n"
"  might not be equal to the specific enthalpy at the port in the \"real world\".</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模型是三股分流/合流组件的最简单实现方式。无任何使用要求。\r\n"
"它用与连接语义相同的形式形成平衡方程。\r\n"
"使用该组件的主要优点是，当查看每个端口的具体焓值时，用户不会感到困惑——如果不使用分流/合流组件，这种查看方式可能会导致困惑，\r\n"
"造成这种困惑的的原因是，在查看连接器中的具体焓值时，实际上是在检查由连接语句引入的微小控制体积的混合焓，这可能与 \"真实世界 \"中端口处的具体焓值不相等。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Fittings.TeeJunctionVolume"
msgid "Splitting/joining component with static balances for a dynamic control volume"
msgstr "用于动态控制体积的带静态平衡的分流/合流组件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Fittings.TeeJunctionVolume"
msgid "Mixing volume inside junction"
msgstr "接头内的混合容积"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Fittings.TeeJunctionVolume"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"  This model introduces a mixing volume into a junction.\r\n"
"  This might be useful to examine the non-ideal mixing taking place in a real junction.</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该模型在接头处引入了混合体积。这有助于检查实际接头处发生的非理想混合。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Fittings.BaseClasses"
msgid "Base classes used in the Fittings package (only of interest to build new component models)"
msgstr "装配子库中的基类(只用于建立新的组件模型)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Fittings.BaseClasses.lossConstant_D_zeta"
