msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.RelativePressure"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The relative pressure \"port_a.p - port_b.p\" is determined between\r\n"
"the two ports of this component and is provided as output signal. The\r\n"
"sensor should be connected in parallel with other equipment, no flow\r\n"
"through the sensor is allowed.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该组件确定两个接口之间的相对压力 （\"port_a.p - port_b.p\"），并作为输出信号提供。\r\n"
"该传感器应与其他设备并联，不允许有水流通。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.RelativeTemperature"
msgid "Ideal relative temperature sensor"
msgstr "理想的相对温度传感器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.RelativeTemperature"
msgid "Relative temperature signal"
msgstr "相对温度信号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.RelativeTemperature"
msgid "T_rel"
msgstr "T_rel"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.RelativeTemperature"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The relative temperature \"T(port_a) - T(port_b)\" is determined between\r\n"
"the two ports of this component and is provided as output signal. The\r\n"
"sensor should be connected in parallel with other equipment, no flow\r\n"
"through the sensor is allowed.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该组件确定两个接口之间的相对温度 （\"T(port_a) - T(port_b)\"），并作为输出信号提供。\r\n"
"该传感器应与其他设备并联，不允许有水流通。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.BaseClasses"
msgid "Base classes used in the Sensors package (only of interest to build new component models)"
msgstr "传感器库中使用的基础类（只用于构建新组件模型）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.BaseClasses.PartialAbsoluteSensor"
msgid "Partial component to model a sensor that measures a potential variable"
msgstr "基类组件，用于对测量潜在变量的传感器进行建模"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.BaseClasses.PartialAbsoluteSensor"
msgid "Medium in the sensor"
msgstr "传感器中的介质"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.BaseClasses.PartialAbsoluteSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Partial component to model an <strong>absolute sensor</strong>. Can be used for pressure sensor models.\r\n"
"Use for other properties such as temperature or density is discouraged, because the enthalpy at the connector can have different meanings, depending on the connection topology. Use <code>PartialFlowSensor</code> instead.\r\n"
"as signal.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"用于建立<strong>绝对传感器</strong>模型的基类组件。可用于压力传感器模型。\r\n"
"不建议用于温度或密度等其他属性的传感器，因为根据连接拓扑结构的不同，连接器处的焓值可能有不同的含义，\r\n"
"如果需要请使用 <code>PartialFlowSensor</code> 。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.BaseClasses.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "Partial component to model a sensor that measures the difference between two potential variables"
msgstr "基类组件，用于对测量两个变量之间差值的传感器进行建模"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.BaseClasses.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "Medium in the sensor"
msgstr "传感器中的介质"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.BaseClasses.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.BaseClasses.PartialRelativeSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The relative pressure \"port_a.p - port_b.p\" is determined between\r\n"
"the two ports of this component and is provided as output signal. The\r\n"
"sensor should be connected in parallel with other equipment, no flow\r\n"
"through the sensor is allowed.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"确定该组件的两个接口之间的相对压力 \"port_a.p - port_b.p\"，并作为输出信号提供。\r\n"
"传感器应与其他设备并联，不允许有液体流过。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.BaseClasses.PartialFlowSensor"
msgid "Partial component to model sensors that measure flow properties"
msgstr "基类组件，用于对测量流量特性的传感器进行建模"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.BaseClasses.PartialFlowSensor"
msgid "Nominal value of m_flow = port_a.m_flow"
msgstr "m_flow 的额定值 = port_a.m_flow"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.BaseClasses.PartialFlowSensor"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.BaseClasses.PartialFlowSensor"
msgid "Regularization for bi-directional flow in the region |m_flow| < m_flow_small (m_flow_small > 0 required)"
msgstr "对 |m_flow| < m_flow_small 区域内的双向流进行正则化（要求 m_flow_small > 0）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Sensors.BaseClasses.PartialFlowSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Partial component to model a <strong>sensor</strong> that measures any intensive properties\r\n"
"of a flow, e.g., to get temperature or density in the flow\r\n"
"between fluid connectors.<br>\r\n"
"The model includes zero-volume balance equations. Sensor models inheriting from\r\n"
"this partial class should add a medium instance to calculate the measured property.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"基类组件，用于为<strong>传感器</strong>建模，该传感器可测量流动的任何强度性质，例如，获取流体连接器之间流动的温度或密度。 \r\n"
"该模型包括零体积平衡方程。继承该基类的传感器模型应添加一个介质模型，以计算所测量的属性。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

