msgid "Generic pressure loss | calculate M_FLOW (compressible) | nominal operation point | pressure loss law (exponent) | density and dynamic viscosity dependence"
msgstr "通用压力损失 | 计算质量流量(可压缩) | 额定工作点 | 压力损失律（指数） | 密度和动力黏度相关性"

