msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regRoot2.regRoot2_utility"
msgid "Interpolating with two 3-order polynomials with a prescribed derivative at x=0"
msgstr "使用两个三阶多项式进行插值，并在 x=0 处预设导数值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regRoot2.regRoot2_utility"
msgid "Approximation of function abs(x) < x1"
msgstr "函数 abs(x) < x1 的近似值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regRoot2.regRoot2_utility"
msgid "y = if x>=0 then sqrt(k1*x) else -sqrt(k2*|x|); k1 >= k2"
msgstr "y = if x>=0 then sqrt(k1*x) else -sqrt(k2*|x|); k1 >= k2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regRoot2.regRoot2_utility"
msgid "y = if x>=0 then sqrt(k1*x) else -sqrt(k2*|x|))"
msgstr "y = if x>=0 then sqrt(k1*x) else -sqrt(k2*|x|))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regRoot2.regRoot2_utility"
msgid "= true, if yd0 shall be used"
msgstr "true: 使用 yd0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regRoot2.regRoot2_utility"
msgid "Desired derivative at x=0: dy/dx = yd0"
msgstr "x=0 时的预期导数： dy/dx = yd0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regSquare2"
msgid "Anti-symmetric approximation of square with discontinuous factor so that the first derivative is non-zero and is continuous"
msgstr "带不连续因子的反对称近似平方，使一阶导数不为零且连续"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regSquare2"
msgid "Abscissa value"
msgstr "横坐标值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regSquare2"
msgid "Approximation of function for |x| <= x_small"
msgstr "|x| <= x_small 时的函数近似值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regSquare2"
msgid "y = (if x>=0 then k1 else k2)*x*|x|"
msgstr "y = (if x>=0 then k1 else k2)*x*|x|"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regSquare2"
msgid "= true, if yd0 shall be used"
msgstr "true：使用 yd0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regSquare2"
msgid "Desired derivative at x=0: dy/dx = yd0"
msgstr "x=0 时的预期导数： dy/dx = yd0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regSquare2"
msgid "Ordinate value"
msgstr "纵坐标值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regSquare2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Approximates the function\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = <strong>if</strong> x &ge; 0 <strong>then</strong> k1*x*x <strong>else</strong> -k2*x*x, with k1, k2 > 0\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"in such a way that within the region -x_small &le; x &le; x_small,\r\n"
"the function is described by two polynomials of third order\r\n"
"(one in the region -x_small .. 0 and one within the region 0 .. x_small)\r\n"
"such that\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> The derivative at x=0 is non-zero (in order that the\r\n"
"     inverse of the function does not have an infinite derivative).</li>\r\n"
"<li> The overall function is continuous with a\r\n"
"     continuous first derivative everywhere.</li>\r\n"
"<li> If parameter use_yd0 = <strong>false</strong>, the two polynomials\r\n"
"     are constructed such that the second derivatives at x=0\r\n"
"     are identical. If use_yd0 = <strong>true</strong>, the derivative\r\n"
"     at x=0 is explicitly provided via the additional argument\r\n"
"     yd0. If necessary, the derivative yd0 is automatically\r\n"
"     reduced in order that the polynomials are strict monotonically\r\n"
"     increasing <em>[Fritsch and Carlson, 1980]</em>.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"A typical screenshot for k1=1, k2=3 is shown in the next figure:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Fluid/Utilities/regSquare2_b.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"regSquare2_b.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The (smooth, non-zero) derivative of the function with\r\n"
"k1=1, k2=3 is shown in the next figure:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Fluid/Utilities/regSquare2_c.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"regSquare2_b.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Literature</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<dl>\r\n"
"<dt> Fritsch F.N. and Carlson R.E. (1980):</dt>\r\n"
"<dd> <strong>Monotone piecewise cubic interpolation</strong>.\r\n"
"     SIAM J. Numerc. Anal., Vol. 17, No. 2, April 1980, pp. 238-246</dd>\r\n"
"</dl>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
" &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 近似函数\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = if x ≥ 0 then k1*x*x else -k2*x*x, with k1, k2 &gt; 0\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
" &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 在区间-x_small ≤ x ≤ x_small内，该函数通过两个三阶多项式分段描述 (左区间 -x_small ≤ x ≤0 和右区间 0 ≤ x ≤x_small ）。使得：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"函数在x=0 处的导数非零（以确保其反函数的导数不会为无穷大）。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"整体函数处处连续且一阶导数连续。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"若参数 use_yd0 = <strong>false</strong>，则构造的两个多项式在 x=0 处的二阶导数相同；若 use_yd0 = <strong>true</strong>，则通过额外参数 yd0 显示指定 x=0 处的导数值。 必要时，系统会自动降低yd0 的取值以确保多项式严格单调递增 <em>[Fritsch and Carlson, 1980]</em>。</li>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
" &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;参数为k1=1, k2=3 时，典型效果截图如下图所示：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Fluid/Utilities/regSquare2_b.png\" alt=\"regSquare2_b.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
" &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;参数为k1=1, k2=3 时，函数的（平滑且非零的）导数如下图所示：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Fluid/Utilities/regSquare2_c.png\" alt=\"regSquare2_b.png\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>参考文献</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Fritsch F.N. and Carlson R.E. (1980):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Monotone piecewise cubic interpolation</strong>.<br>SIAM J. Numerc. Anal., Vol. 17, No. 2, April 1980, pp. 238-246\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

