msgstr "步长为-x_small <= x <= x_small时的近似值； 需要 x_small >= 0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regStep"
msgid "Ordinate value to approximate y = if x > 0 then y1 else y2"
msgstr "近似纵坐标值 y = if x > 0 then y1 else y2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regStep"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>April 29, 2008</em>\r\n"
"    by <a href=\"mailto:Martin.Otter@DLR.de\">Martin Otter</a>:<br>\r\n"
"    Designed and implemented.</li>\r\n"
"<li><em>August 12, 2008</em>\r\n"
"    by <a href=\"mailto:Michael.Sielemann@dlr.de\">Michael Sielemann</a>:<br>\r\n"
"    Minor modification to cover the limit case <code>x_small -> 0</code> without division by zero.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>April 29, 2008</em>\r\n"
"by <a href=\"mailto:Martin.Otter@DLR.de\">Martin Otter</a>:<br>\r\n"
"设计并实施。</li>\r\n"
"<li><em>August 12, 2008</em>\r\n"
"by <a href=\"mailto:Michael.Sielemann@dlr.de\">Michael Sielemann</a>:<br>\r\n"
"小修改以涵盖不除以零的极限情况 <code>x_small -> 0</code>。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Fluid.Utilities.regStep"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function is used to approximate the equation\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = <strong>if</strong> x &gt; 0 <strong>then</strong> y1 <strong>else</strong> y2;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"by a smooth characteristic, so that the expression is continuous and differentiable:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = <strong>smooth</strong>(1, <strong>if</strong> x &gt;  x_small <strong>then</strong> y1 <strong>else</strong>\r\n"
"              <strong>if</strong> x &lt; -x_small <strong>then</strong> y2 <strong>else</strong> f(y1, y2));\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In the region -x_small &lt; x &lt; x_small a 2nd order polynomial is used\r\n"
"for a smooth transition from y1 to y2.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
" &nbsp; &nbsp; 此函数用于对方程进行近似\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = if x &gt; 0 then y1 else y2;\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
" &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;通过光滑特性实现，使得表达式连续且可微：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >y = smooth(1, if x &gt;  x_small then y1 else\r\n"
"        if x &lt; -x_small then y2 else f(y1, y2));\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
" &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 在 区间-x_small &lt; x &lt; x_small内，使用二阶多项式实现从 y1 到 y2的平滑过渡。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

