msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air"
msgid "Medium models for air"
msgstr "空气介质模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"  <p>This package contains different medium models for air:</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><strong>SimpleAir</strong><br>\r\n"
"    Simple dry air medium in a limited temperature range.</li>\r\n"
"<li><strong>DryAirNasa</strong><br>\r\n"
"    Dry air as an ideal gas from Media.IdealGases.MixtureGases.Air.</li>\r\n"
"<li><strong>MoistAir</strong><br>\r\n"
"    Moist air as an ideal gas mixture of steam and dry air with fog below and above the triple point temperature.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"  <p>这个库包含不同的空气介质模型：</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><strong>SimpleAir</strong><br>\r\n"
"    在有限温度范围内的简单干空气介质。</li>\r\n"
"<li><strong>DryAirNasa</strong><br>\r\n"
"    来自Media.IdealGases.MixtureGases.Air的理想气体干空气。</li>\r\n"
"<li><strong>MoistAir</strong><br>\r\n"
"    在三相点温度以下和以上，蒸汽和干空气的理想气体混合物为湿空气。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.SimpleAir"
msgid "Air: Simple dry air model (0..100 degC)"
msgstr "Air:简单干空气模型 (0..100 摄氏度)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.SimpleAir"
msgid "Constant data for the fluid"
msgstr "流体的常量数据"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.SimpleAir"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"                            <h4>Simple Ideal gas air model for low temperatures</h4>\r\n"
"                            <p>This model demonstrates how to use the PartialSimpleIdealGas base class to build a\r\n"
"                            simple ideal gas model with a limited temperature validity range.</p>\r\n"
"                            </html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"                            <h4>用于低温的简单理想气体空气模型</h4>\r\n"
"                            <p>该模型演示了如何使用PartialSimpleIdealGas基类来构建具有有限温度有效范围的简单理想气体模型。</p>\r\n"
"                            </html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.DryAirNasa"
msgid "Air: Detailed dry air model as ideal gas (200..6000 K)"
msgstr "Air:详细干空气模型，作为理想气体 (200..6000 K)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.DryAirNasa"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"    <img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/Air/Air.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Ideal gas medium model for dry air based on the package <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.IdealGases\">IdealGases</a> with additional functions for dynamic viscosity and thermal conductivity in a limited temperature range.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/Air/Air.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"基于<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.IdealGases\" target=\"\">IdealGases</a>&nbsp;库的理想气体介质模型，用于描述干空气，并额外提供了在有限温度范围内计算动态粘度和热导率的函数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.DryAirNasa.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Return dynamic viscosity of dry air (simple polynomial, moisture influence small, valid from 123.15 K to 1273.15 K, outside of this range linear extrapolation is used)"
msgstr "计算干空气的动力黏度(简单多项式,湿度影响小,有效范围从123.15K到1273.15K,超出此范围使用线性外推)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.DryAirNasa.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Thermodynamic state record"
msgstr "热力状态记录类"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.DryAirNasa.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Dynamic viscosity"
msgstr "动力黏度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.DryAirNasa.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Dynamic viscosity is computed from temperature using a simple polynomial for dry air. Range of validity is from 123.15 K to 1273.15 K. The influence of pressure is neglected.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Source: VDI Waermeatlas, 8th edition.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"动力黏度通过温度使用简单多项式计算，适用于干空气。有效范围是 123.15 K 到 1273.15 K，忽略压力的影响。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"资料来源：VDI Waermeatlas，第 8 版。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.DryAirNasa.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Return thermal conductivity of dry air (simple polynomial, moisture influence small, valid from 123.15 K to 1273.15 K, outside of this range linear extrapolation is used)"
msgstr "计算干空气的热导率(简单多项式,湿度影响小,有效范围从123.15K到1273.15K,超出此范围使用线性外推)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.DryAirNasa.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Thermodynamic state record"
msgstr "热力状态记录类"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.DryAirNasa.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Dummy for compatibility reasons"
msgstr "为了兼容性原因的假值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.DryAirNasa.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Thermal conductivity"
msgstr "导热系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.DryAirNasa.thermalConductivity"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Thermal conductivity is computed from temperature using a simple polynomial for dry air. Range of validity is from 123.15 K to 1273.15 K. The influence of pressure is neglected.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Source: VDI Waermeatlas, 8th edition.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"导热系数通过温度使用简单多项式计算，适用于干空气。有效范围是 123.15 K 到 1273.15 K，忽略压力的影响。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"资料来源：VDI Waermeatlas，第 8 版。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.ReferenceAir"
msgid "ReferenceAir: Detailed dry air model with a large operating range (130 ... 2000 K, 0 ... 2000 MPa) based on Helmholtz equations of state"
msgstr "ReferenceAir:基于亥姆霍兹状态方程的详细干空气模型,工作范围(130... 2000K,0...2000MPa)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.ReferenceAir"
msgid "From N2"
msgstr "From N2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.ReferenceAir"
msgid "Type for molar heat capacity with medium specific attributes"
msgstr "具有介质特定属性的摩尔热容类型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.ReferenceAir"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Calculation of fluid properties of air in the fluid region of 130 Kelvin to 2000 Kelvin at pressures up to 2000 MPa. To use this package in your model, select <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.ReferenceAir.Air_dT\">\r\n"
"Air_dT</a>, <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.ReferenceAir.Air_pT\">\r\n"
"Air_pT</a> or <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.ReferenceAir.Air_ph\">Air_ph</a> according to which variables you choose to determine your state.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Restriction</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The functions provided by this package shall be used inside of the restricted limits according to the referenced literature.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<strong>p &le; 2000 MPa</strong>\r\n"
"</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<strong>130 K &le; T &le; 2000 K</strong>\r\n"
"</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>References</h4>\r\n"
"<dl>\r\n"
"<dt>Lemmon, E. W., Jacobsen, R. T., Penoncello, S. G., Friend, D. G.:</dt>\r\n"
"<dd><strong>Thermodynamic Properties of Air and Mixtures of Nitrogen, Argon,\r\n"
"and Oxygen From 60 to 2000 K at Pressures to 2000 MPa</strong>. J. Phys. Chem. Ref. Data, Vol. 29, No. 3, 2000.\r\n"
"</dd>\r\n"
"<dt>Lemmon, E. W., Jacobsen, R. T.:</dt>\r\n"
"<dd><strong>Viscosity and Thermal Conductivity Equations for\r\n"
"Nitrogen, Oxygen, Argon, and Air</strong>. International Journal of Thermophysics, Vol. 25, No. 1, January 2004\r\n"
"</dd>\r\n"
"</dl>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Verification</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The verification report for the development of this library is provided\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Documentation/Media/MoMoLib_VerificationResults_XRG.pdf\">here</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Acknowledgment</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This library was developed by XRG Simulation GmbH as part of the <a href=\"http://www.cleansky.eu/\">Clean Sky</a> JTI project (Project title: MoMoLib-Modelica Model Library Development for Media, Magnetic Systems and Wavelets; Project number: 296369; Theme: JTI-CS-2011-1-SGO-02-026: Modelica Model Library Development Part I). The partial financial support for the development of this library by the European Union is highly appreciated.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Some parts of this library refer to the ThermoFluid library developed at Lund University (<a href=\"http://thermofluid.sourceforge.net/\">http://thermofluid.sourceforge.net</a>).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Copyright &copy; 2013-2020, Modelica Association and contributors\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"在130K 到2000K 的流体区域内，以最高2000MPa 的压力计算空气的流体性质。要在您的模型中使用此库，请根据您选择确定状态的变量选择<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.ReferenceAir.Air_dT\" target=\"\">Air_dT</a>&nbsp;、<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.ReferenceAir.Air_pT\" target=\"\">Air_pT</a>&nbsp;或<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.ReferenceAir.Air_ph\" target=\"\">Air_ph</a>&nbsp;。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>限制</h4><p>\r\n"
"此库提供的函数应在所引用文献中规定的限制条件下使用。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<strong>p ≤ 2000 MPa</strong></li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"<strong>130 K ≤ T ≤ 2000 K</strong></li>\r\n"
"<h4>参考文献</h4><p>\r\n"
"Lemmon, E. W., Jacobsen, R. T., Penoncello, S. G., Friend, D. G.:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Thermodynamic Properties of Air and Mixtures of Nitrogen, Argon, and Oxygen From 60 to 2000 K at Pressures to 2000 MPa</strong>. J. Phys. Chem. Ref. Data, Vol. 29, No. 3, 2000.<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Lemmon, E. W., Jacobsen, R. T.:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Viscosity and Thermal Conductivity Equations for Nitrogen, Oxygen, Argon, and Air</strong>. International Journal of Thermophysics, Vol. 25, No. 1, January 2004<br>\r\n"
