"<p>Source: W Wagner, A Saul, A Pruss: &quot;International equations for the pressure along the melting and along the sublimation curve of ordinary water substance&quot;, equation 3.5</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>水在三相点温度以下的升华压力由温度计算得出。</p>\r\n"
"<p>资料来源: W Wagner, A Saul, A Pruss: &quot;普通水物质在熔化和升华曲线上的压力国际方程&quot;, 方程 3.5</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.sublimationPressureIce_der"
msgid "Derivative function for 'sublimationPressureIce'"
msgstr "'sublimationPressureIce'的导函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.sublimationPressureIce_der"
