msgstr "常见子表达式 1 的导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.sublimationPressureIce_der"
msgid "Coefficients a[:]"
msgstr "系数 a[:]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.sublimationPressureIce_der"
msgid "Coefficients n[:]"
msgstr "系数 n[:]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.sublimationPressureIce_der"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Sublimation pressure of water below the triple point temperature is computed from temperature.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Source: W Wagner, A Saul, A Pruss: &quot;International equations for the pressure along the melting and along the sublimation curve of ordinary water substance&quot;, equation 3.5</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>水在三相点温度以下的升华压力由温度计算得出。</p>\r\n"
"<p>资料来源: W Wagner, A Saul, A Pruss: &quot;普通水物质在熔化和升华曲线上的压力国际方程&quot;, 方程 3.5</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationPressure"
msgid "Return saturation pressure of water as a function of temperature T between 190 and 647.096 K"
msgstr "计算水的饱和压力，作为 190 到 647.096 K 温度范围内的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationPressure"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Saturation pressure of water in the liquid and the solid region is computed using correlations. Functions for the\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.sublimationPressureIce\">solid</a> and the <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationPressureLiquid\"> liquid</a> region, respectively, are combined using the first derivative continuous <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.Utilities.spliceFunction\">spliceFunction</a>. This functions range of validity is from 190 to 647.096 K. For more information on the type of correlation used, see the documentation of the linked functions.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"水在液体和固体区域的饱和压力使用关联函数计算。<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.sublimationPressureIce\">固体</a>和<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationPressureLiquid\">液体</a>区域的函数分别使用一阶导数连续的<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.Utilities.spliceFunction\">spliceFunction</a>结合。此函数的有效范围为 190 到 647.096 K。有关使用的关联函数类型的更多信息，请参阅链接函数的文档。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationPressure_der"
msgid "Derivative function for 'saturationPressure'"
msgstr "'saturationPressure' 的导函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationPressure_der"
msgid "Saturation temperature"
msgstr "饱和温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationPressure_der"
msgid "Time derivative of saturation temperature"
msgstr "饱和温度的时间导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationPressure_der"
msgid "Saturation pressure"
msgstr "饱和压力的导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationPressure_der"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Derivative function of <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationPressure\">saturationPressure</a>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"‘<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationPressure\">saturationPressure</a>’ 的导函数\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationTemperature"
msgid "Return saturation temperature of water as a function of (partial) pressure p"
msgstr "计算水的饱和温度作为压力 p 的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationTemperature"
msgid "Pressure"
msgstr "压力"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationTemperature"
msgid "Lower boundary of solution"
msgstr "解的下边界"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationTemperature"
msgid "Upper boundary of solution"
msgstr "解的上边界"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationTemperature"
msgid "Saturation temperature"
msgstr "饱和温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationTemperature"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Computes saturation temperature from (partial) pressure via numerical inversion of the function <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationPressure\">saturationPressure</a>. Therefore additional inputs are required (or the defaults are used) for upper and lower temperature bounds.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过数值反算 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationPressure\">saturationPressure</a> 函数从（部分）压力计算饱和温度。因此需要额外的输入（或使用默认值）作为上下温度边界。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationTemperature.f_nonlinear"
msgid "Solve p(T) for T with given p"
msgstr "通过给定的 p 求解 p(T) 得到 T"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationTemperature.f_nonlinear"
msgid "Pressure"
msgstr "压力"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "Return enthalpy of vaporization of water as a function of temperature T, 273.16 to 647.096 K"
msgstr "计算水的汽化焓作为温度 T 的函数，273.16 到 647.096 K"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "Critical temperature"
msgstr "临界温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "Critical density"
msgstr "临界密度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "Critical pressure"
msgstr "临界压力"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "Powers in equation (1)"
msgstr "方程 (1) 中的幂次"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "Coefficients in equation (1) of [1]"
msgstr "方程 (1) 中的系数 [1]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "Powers in equation (2)"
msgstr "方程 (2) 中的幂次"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "Coefficients in equation (2) of [1]"
msgstr "方程 (2) 中的系数 [1]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "Powers in equation (3)"
msgstr "方程 (3) 中的幂次"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "Coefficients in equation (3) of [1]"
msgstr "方程 (3) 中的系数 [1]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "Temperature expression"
msgstr "温度表达式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "Expression 1"
msgstr "表达式 1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "Expression 2"
msgstr "表达式 2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "Density of saturated liquid"
msgstr "饱和液体的密度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "Density of saturated vapor"
msgstr "饱和蒸汽的密度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfVaporization"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Enthalpy of vaporization of water is computed from temperature in the region of 273.16 to 647.096 K.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Source: W Wagner, A Pruss: \"International equations for the saturation properties of ordinary water substance. Revised according to the international temperature scale of 1990\" (1993).</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>水的汽化焓是通过在 273.16 到 647.096 K 区域的温度计算得出的。</p>\r\n"
"<p>来源：W Wagner, A Pruss: \"International equations for the saturation properties of ordinary water substance. Revised according to the international temperature scale of 1990\" (1993).</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.HeatCapacityOfWater"
msgid "Return specific heat capacity of water (liquid only) as a function of temperature T"
msgstr "计算水（仅液态）的比热容作为温度 T 的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.HeatCapacityOfWater"
msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.HeatCapacityOfWater"
msgid "Specific heat capacity of liquid"
msgstr "液态水的比热容"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.HeatCapacityOfWater"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"The specific heat capacity of water (liquid and solid) is calculated using a\r\n"
"                 polynomial approach and data from VDI-Waermeatlas 8. Edition (Db1)\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"水（液态和固态）的比热容是使用多项式方法和来自 VDI-Waermeatlas 8 版 (Db1) 的数据计算得出的。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfLiquid"
msgid "Return enthalpy of liquid water as a function of temperature T(use enthalpyOfWater instead)"
msgstr "计算液态水的焓作为温度 T 的函数（使用 'enthalpyOfWater' 代替）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfLiquid"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Specific enthalpy of liquid water is computed from temperature using a polynomial approach. Kept for compatibility reasons, better use <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfWater\">enthalpyOfWater</a> instead.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"液态水的比焓是通过使用多项式方法从温度计算得出的。为了兼容性保留，建议使用 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfWater\">enthalpyOfWater</a> 代替。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfGas"
msgid "Return specific enthalpy of gas (air and steam) as a function of temperature T and composition X"
msgstr "计算气体（空气和蒸汽）的比焓作为温度 T 和组分 X 的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfGas"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Specific enthalpy of moist air is computed from temperature, provided all water is in the gaseous state. The first entry in the composition vector X must be the mass fraction of steam. For a function that also covers the fog region please refer to <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX\">h_pTX</a>.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"湿空气的比焓是通过温度计算的，假定所有水都是气态。组分向量 X 中的第一个条目必须是蒸汽的质量分数。对于覆盖雾区的函数，请参考 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX\">h_pTX</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfCondensingGas"
msgid "Return specific enthalpy of steam as a function of temperature T"
msgstr "计算蒸汽的比焓作为温度 T 的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfCondensingGas"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Specific enthalpy of steam is computed from temperature.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"蒸汽的比焓是通过温度计算的。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfNonCondensingGas"
msgid "Return specific enthalpy of dry air as a function of temperature T"
msgstr "计算干空气的比焓作为温度 T 的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfNonCondensingGas"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Specific enthalpy of dry air is computed from temperature.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"干空气的比焓是通过温度计算的。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfWater"
msgid "Computes specific enthalpy of water (solid/liquid) near atmospheric pressure from temperature T"
msgstr "计算近似大气压下水（固态/液态）的比焓作为温度 T 的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfWater"
msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfWater"
msgid "Specific enthalpy of water"
msgstr "水的比焓"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfWater"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Specific enthalpy of water (liquid and solid) is computed from temperature using constant properties as follows:<br>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>heat capacity of liquid water:4200 J/kg</li>\r\n"
"<li>heat capacity of solid water: 2050 J/kg</li>\r\n"
"<li>enthalpy of fusion (liquid=>solid): 333000 J/kg</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"Pressure is assumed to be around 1 bar. This function is usually used to determine the specific enthalpy of the liquid or solid fraction of moist air.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"水（液态和固态）的比焓是通过使用如下常数属性从温度计算的：<br>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>液态水的比热容：4200 J/kg</li>\r\n"
"<li>固态水的比热容：2050 J/kg</li>\r\n"
"<li>熔融焓（液态=>固态）：333000 J/kg</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"假设压力约为 1 bar。该函数通常用于确定湿空气的液态或固态部分的比焓。\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfWater_der"
msgid "Derivative function of enthalpyOfWater"
msgstr "enthalpyOfWater 的导数函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfWater_der"
msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfWater_der"
msgid "Time derivative of temperature"
msgstr "温度的时间导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfWater_der"
msgid "Time derivative of specific enthalpy"
msgstr "比焓的时间导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfWater_der"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Derivative function for <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfWater\">enthalpyOfWater</a>.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.enthalpyOfWater\">enthalpyOfWater</a> 的导数函数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.pressure"
msgid "Returns pressure of ideal gas as a function of the thermodynamic state record"
msgstr "计算理想气体的压力作为热力状态的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.pressure"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Pressure is returned from the thermodynamic state record input as a simple assignment.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"压力根据作为简单赋值输入的热力学状态记录中计算。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.temperature"
msgid "Return temperature of ideal gas as a function of the thermodynamic state record"
msgstr "计算理想气体的温度作为热力状态的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.temperature"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Temperature is returned from the thermodynamic state record input as a simple assignment.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"温度根据作为简单赋值输入的热力学状态记录中计算。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.T_phX"
msgid "Return temperature as a function of pressure p, specific enthalpy h and composition X"
msgstr "根据压力 p、比焓 h 和组分 X 计算温度的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.T_phX"
msgid "Pressure"
msgstr "压力"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.T_phX"
msgid "Specific enthalpy"
msgstr "比焓"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.T_phX"
msgid "Mass fractions of composition"
msgstr "组分的质量分数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.T_phX"
msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.T_phX"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Temperature is computed from pressure, specific enthalpy and composition via numerical inversion of function <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX\">h_pTX</a>.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过数值反算函数 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX\">h_pTX</a>，根据压力、比焓和组分计算温度。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.T_phX.f_nonlinear"
msgid "Solve h_pTX(p,T,X) for T with given h"
msgstr "用给定的 h 解决 h_pTX(p,T,X)=T 的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.T_phX.f_nonlinear"
msgid "Pressure"
msgstr "压力"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.T_phX.f_nonlinear"
msgid "Specific enthalpy"
msgstr "比焓"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.T_phX.f_nonlinear"
msgid "Mass fractions of composition"
msgstr "组分的质量分数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.density"
msgid "Returns density of ideal gas as a function of the thermodynamic state record"
msgstr "基于热力状态计算理想气体的密度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.density"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Density is computed from pressure, temperature and composition in the thermodynamic state record applying the ideal gas law.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"应用理想气体定律，根据热力学状态记录中的压力、温度和组分计算密度。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.specificEnthalpy"
msgid "Return specific enthalpy of moist air as a function of the thermodynamic state record"
msgstr "基于热力状态计算湿空气的比焓"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.specificEnthalpy"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Specific enthalpy of moist air is computed from the thermodynamic state record. The fog region is included for both, ice and liquid fog.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"根据热力学状态记录计算湿空气的比焓。冰雾和液雾区域都包括在内。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX"
msgid "Return specific enthalpy of moist air as a function of pressure p, temperature T and composition X"
msgstr "基于压力 p、温度 T 和组分 X 计算湿空气的比焓"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX"
msgid "Pressure"
msgstr "压力"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX"
msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX"
msgid "Mass fractions of moist air"
msgstr "湿空气的质量分数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX"
msgid "Specific enthalpy at p, T, X"
msgstr "在 p、T、X 下的比焓"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX"
msgid "Partial saturation pressure of steam"
msgstr "蒸汽的部分饱和压力"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX"
msgid "Absolute humidity per unit mass of moist air"
msgstr "每单位质量湿空气的绝对湿度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX"
msgid "Mass fraction of liquid water"
msgstr "液态水的质量分数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX"
msgid "Mass fraction of steam water"
msgstr "水蒸气的质量分数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX"
msgid "Mass fraction of air"
msgstr "空气的质量分数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Specific enthalpy of moist air is computed from pressure, temperature and composition with X[1] as the total water mass fraction. The fog region is included for both, ice and liquid fog.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过压力、温度和组分计算湿空气的比焓，其中 X[1] 是总水质量分数。冰雾和液雾区域都包括在内。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX_der"
msgid "Derivative function of h_pTX"
msgstr "h_pTX 的导数函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.h_pTX_der"
