msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.specificEntropy"
msgid "Return specific entropy from thermodynamic state record, only valid for phi<1"
msgstr "根据热力学状态记录中计算比熵，仅对 phi<1 有效"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.specificEntropy"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Specific entropy is calculated from the thermodynamic state record, assuming ideal gas behavior and including entropy of mixing. Liquid or solid water is not taken into account, the entire water content X[1] is assumed to be in the vapor state (relative humidity below 1.0).\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"比熵是根据热力学状态记录计算得出的，假设理想气体行为并包括混合熵。不考虑液体或固体水，整个水含量 X[1] 假定处于汽态（相对湿度低于 1.0）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.specificGibbsEnergy"
msgid "Return specific Gibbs energy as a function of the thermodynamic state record, only valid for phi<1"
msgstr "根据热力状态计算比吉布斯能，仅对 phi<1 有效"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.specificGibbsEnergy"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"The Gibbs Energy is computed from the thermodynamic state record for moist air with a water content below saturation.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"比吉布斯能是根据湿空气的热力学状态记录计算得出的，其中水含量低于饱和。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.specificHelmholtzEnergy"
msgid "Return specific Helmholtz energy as a function of the thermodynamic state record, only valid for phi<1"
msgstr "根据热力状态计算比亥姆霍兹能，仅对 phi<1 有效"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.specificHelmholtzEnergy"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"The Specific Helmholtz Energy is computed from the thermodynamic state record for moist air with a water content below saturation.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"比赫姆霍兹能是根据热力学状态记录计算得出的，其中水含量低于饱和。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.specificHeatCapacityCp"
msgid "Return specific heat capacity at constant pressure as a function of the thermodynamic state record"
msgstr "根据热力状态计算定压比热容，仅对 phi<1 有效"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.specificHeatCapacityCp"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"The specific heat capacity at constant pressure <strong>cp</strong> is computed from temperature and composition for a mixture of steam (X[1]) and dry air. All water is assumed to be in the vapor state.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"定压比热容 <strong>cp</strong> 是根据温度和组分计算得出的，用于蒸汽（X[1]）和干空气的混合物。假定所有水都处于汽态。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.specificHeatCapacityCv"
msgid "Return specific heat capacity at constant volume as a function of the thermodynamic state record"
msgstr "根据热力状态计算定容比热容，仅对 phi<1 有效"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.specificHeatCapacityCv"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"The specific heat capacity at constant density <strong>cv</strong> is computed from temperature and composition for a mixture of steam (X[1]) and dry air. All water is assumed to be in the vapor state.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"定容比热容 <strong>cv</strong> 是根据温度和组分计算得出的，用于蒸汽（X[1]）和干空气的混合物。假定所有水都处于汽态。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Return dynamic viscosity as a function of the thermodynamic state record, valid from 123.15 K to 1273.15 K"
msgstr "根据热力状态计算动力黏度，有效范围从 123.15 K 到 1273.15 K"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Dynamic viscosity is computed from temperature using a simple polynomial for dry air. Range of validity is from 123.15 K to 1273.15 K. The influence of pressure and moisture is neglected.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Source: VDI Waermeatlas, 8th edition.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"动力黏度是根据干空气的温度使用简单多项式计算的，有效范围从 123.15 K 到 1273.15 K，忽略了压力和湿度的影响。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"资料来源：VDI Waermeatlas，第 8 版。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Return thermal conductivity as a function of the thermodynamic state record, valid from 123.15 K to 1273.15 K"
msgstr "根据热力状态计算导热系数，有效范围从 123.15 K 到 1273.15 K"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.thermalConductivity"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Thermal conductivity is computed from temperature using a simple polynomial for dry air. Range of validity is from 123.15 K to 1273.15 K. The influence of pressure and moisture is neglected.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Source: VDI Waermeatlas, 8th edition.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"导热系数是根据干空气的温度使用简单多项式计算的，有效范围从 123.15 K 到 1273.15 K，忽略了压力和湿度的影响。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"资料来源：VDI Waermeatlas，第 8 版。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

