"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Documentation/Media/MoMoLib_VerificationResults_XRG.pdf\">此处</a>提供了开发该库的核查报告。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Acknowledgment</h4>\r\n"
