"</p>\r\n"
"<h4> Restrictions</h4>\r\n"
"<p>It is only valid in the two-phase region (i.e., p<sub>triple</sub> &le; p &le; p<sub>crit</sub> ).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>此函数计算 R134a 的饱和温度相对于状态变量 p（绝对压力）的导数。非导数函数为 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.saturationTemperature\"> saturationTemperature</a>。\r\n"
