"<p>它仅在两相区域有效（即，p<sub>triple</sub> &le; p &le; p<sub>crit</sub> ）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.saturationPressure"
msgid "Saturation pressure w.r.t. temperature"
msgstr "饱和压力相对温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.saturationPressure"
msgid "Coefficients of cubic spline for psat(T)"
msgstr "用于 psat(T) 的三次样条插值系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.saturationPressure"
msgid "Grid points of reduced pressure"
msgstr "降低的压力的网格点"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.saturationPressure"
msgid "Reduced temperature"
msgstr "降低的温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.saturationPressure"
msgid "Interval number"
msgstr "区间编号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.saturationPressure"
msgid "Interval for spline interpolation not found"
msgstr "找不到用于样条插值的区间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.saturationPressure"
msgid "Reduced pressure"
msgstr "降低的压力"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.saturationPressure"
msgid "Abscissa of local spline"
msgstr "局部样条的横坐标"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.saturationPressure"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the saturation pressure of R134a from the state variable T (temperature). It is modelled by cubic splines which are fitted with non-equidistant grid points derived from the fundamental equation of state of Tillner-Roth and Baehr (1994) and the Maxwell criteria.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4> Restrictions</h4>\r\n"
"<p>It is only valid in the two-phase region (i.e., p<sub>triple</sub> &le; p &le; p<sub>crit</sub> ).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/R134a/log(p)Tsat-Diagram-R134a.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该函数从状态变量 T（温度）计算 R134a 的饱和压力。它由用于拟合非等距网格点的三次样条插值的基本 Tillner-Roth 和 Baehr（1994）状态方程建模。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4> 限制</h4>\r\n"
"<p>它仅在两相区域有效（即，p<sub>triple</sub> &le; p &le; p<sub>crit</sub> ）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/R134a/log(p)Tsat-Diagram-R134a.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.specificHeatCapacityCp"
msgid "Specific heat capacity at constant pressure | turns infinite in two-phase region! | use setState_phX function for input"
msgstr "定压比热容量 | 在两相区域中变为无穷大！ | 使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.specificHeatCapacityCp"
msgid "Helmholtz derivatives"
msgstr "亥姆霍兹导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.specificHeatCapacityCp"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the specific heat capacity of R134a at <strong>constant pressure</strong> from the state record (e.g., use setState_phX function for input). The specific heat capacity is modelled by the fundamental equation of state of Tillner-Roth and Baehr (1994).</p>\r\n"
"<h4> Restrictions</h4>\r\n"
"<p>This property is only defined in one-phase region.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/R134a/log(p)cp-Diagram-R134a.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该函数从状态记录（例如，使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入）计算 R134a 的 <strong>定压比热容量</strong>。定压比热容量由 Tillner-Roth 和 Baehr（1994）的基本状态方程建模。</p>\r\n"
"<h4> 限制</h4>\r\n"
"<p>该属性仅在单相区域中定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/R134a/log(p)cp-Diagram-R134a.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.specificHeatCapacityCv"
msgid "Specific heat capacity at constant volume | use setState_phX function for input"
msgstr "定容比热容量 | 使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.specificHeatCapacityCv"
msgid "Helmholtz derivatives"
msgstr "亥姆霍兹导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.specificHeatCapacityCv"
msgid "Properties on liquid phase boundary"
msgstr "液相边界上的属性"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.specificHeatCapacityCv"
msgid "Saturation temperature and pressure"
msgstr "饱和温度和压力"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.specificHeatCapacityCv"
msgid "Properties on vapor phase boundary"
msgstr "气相边界上的属性"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.specificHeatCapacityCv"
msgid "Vapor quality"
msgstr "蒸汽质量分数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.specificHeatCapacityCv"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the specific heat capacity of R134a at <strong>constant volume</strong> from the state record (e.g., use setState_phX function for input). The specific heat capacity is modelled by the fundamental equation of state of Tillner-Roth and Baehr (1994).</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Please note, that the function can also be called in the two-phase region, but the output is not continuous for a phase transition (see Tillner-Roth and Baehr, 1994). Values in two-phase region are considerably higher than in one-phase domain. The following figure just shows one-phase properties.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/R134a/log(p)cv-Diagram-R134a.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该函数从状态记录（例如，使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入）计算 R134a 的 <strong>定容比热容量</strong>。定容比热容量由 Tillner-Roth 和 Baehr（1994）的基本状态方程建模。</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请注意，该函数也可以在两相区域中调用，但在相变时输出不连续（请参阅 Tillner-Roth 和 Baehr，1994）。两相区域的值明显高于单相域中的值。下图仅显示单相性质。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/R134a/log(p)cv-Diagram-R134a.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Dynamic viscosity w.r.t. temperature and density | use setState_phX function for input"
msgstr "动力黏度（相对温度和密度） | 使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Log of collision integral"
msgstr "碰撞积分的对数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Collision integral"
msgstr "碰撞积分"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Constant for low density term eta_star"
msgstr "低密度项 eta_star 的常数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Hard-sphere diameter"
msgstr "硬球直径"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Empirical factor"
msgstr "经验因子"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Coefficients for term of collision integral"
msgstr "碰撞积分项的系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Coefficients for term of 2nd viscosity virial coefficient"
msgstr "第二黏度维里系数的系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Coefficients for term of residual viscosity"
msgstr "残余黏度项的系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Critical density in mol/l"
msgstr "摩尔密度的临界值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Reduced density"
msgstr "约简密度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "2nd viscosity virial coeff."
msgstr "第二黏度维里系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Temperature contribution to residual viscosity"
msgstr "残余黏度的温度贡献"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Residual part"
msgstr "残余部分"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "Dilute part"
msgstr "稀释部分"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dynamicViscosity"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the dynamic viscosity of R134a from the state record (e.g., use setState_phX function for input). The dynamic viscosity is modelled by the corresponding states method of Klein, McLinden and Laesecke (1997).</p>\r\n"
"<h4> Restrictions</h4>\r\n"
"<p>This property is only defined in one-phase region.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>References</h4>\r\n"
"<dl><dt>Klein, McLinden and Laesecke: </dt>\r\n"
"<dd><strong>An improved extended corresponding states method for estimation of viscosity of pure refrigerants and mixtures</strong>.\r\n"
"Int. J. Refrig., Vol. 20, No.3, pp. 208-217, 1997.</dd>\r\n"
"</dl>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/R134a/log(p)eta-Diagram-R134a.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该函数从状态记录（例如，使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入）计算 R134a 的动力黏度。动力黏度由 Klein、McLinden 和 Laesecke（1997）的对应态方法建模。</p>\r\n"
"<h4>限制</h4>\r\n"
"<p>该属性仅在单相区域中定义。</p>\r\n"
"<h4>参考文献</h4>\r\n"
"<dl><dt>Klein, McLinden and Laesecke: </dt>\r\n"
"<dd><strong>An improved extended corresponding states method for estimation of viscosity of pure refrigerants and mixtures</strong>.\r\n"
"Int. J. Refrig., Vol. 20, No.3, pp. 208-217, 1997.</dd>\r\n"
"</dl>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/R134a/log(p)eta-Diagram-R134a.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Thermal conductivity w.r.t. thermodynamic state | use setState_phX function for input"
msgstr "热力学状态下的导热系数 | 使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Helmholtz derivatives"
msgstr "亥姆霍兹导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Helmholtz derivatives for reference state"
msgstr "参考状态的亥姆霍兹导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Dilute gas contribution to lambda"
msgstr "稀释气体对 lambda 的贡献"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Coefficients of thermal conductivity model"
msgstr "导热系数模型的系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Reduced lambda"
msgstr "约简 lambda"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Enhancement of lambda in the critical region"
msgstr "临界区域内 lambda 的增强"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Correlation length"
msgstr "相关长度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Chi_star - chi_star_ref"
msgstr "Chi_star - chi_star_ref"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Molar density [mol/l]"
msgstr "摩尔密度 [mol/l]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Derivative of density w.r.t. pressure"
msgstr "密度相对于压力的导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Derivative of density w.r.t. pressure for reference state"
msgstr "参考状态下密度相对于压力的导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Specific heat capacity at constant pressure"
msgstr "定压比热容"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Specific heat capacity at constant volume"
msgstr "定容比热容"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Dynamic viscosity"
msgstr "动力黏度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "Crossover function"
msgstr "交叉函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.thermalConductivity"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the thermal conductivity of R134a from the state record (e.g., use setState_phX function for input). The thermal conductivity is modelled by the corresponding states model of McLinden, Klein. and Perkins (2000).</p>\r\n"
"<h4> Restrictions</h4>\r\n"
"<p>This property is only defined in one-phase region.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>References</h4>\r\n"
"<dl><dt>McLinden, Klein. and Perkins: </dt>\r\n"
"<dd><strong>An extended corresponding states model for the thermal conductivity\r\n"
"of refrigerants and refrigerant mixtures</strong>.\r\n"
"Int. J. Refrig., 23 (2000) 43-63.</dd>\r\n"
"</dl>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/R134a/log(p)lambda-Diagram-R134a.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该函数从状态记录（例如，使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入）计算 R134a 的导热系数。导热系数由 McLinden、Klein 和 Perkins（2000）的对应态模型建模。</p>\r\n"
"<h4> 限制</h4>\r\n"
"<p>此属性仅在单相区域中定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>参考文献</h4>\r\n"
"<dl><dt>McLinden, Klein. and Perkins: </dt>\r\n"
"<dd><strong>An extended corresponding states model for the thermal conductivity\r\n"
"of refrigerants and refrigerant mixtures</strong>.\r\n"
"Int. J. Refrig., 23 (2000) 43-63.</dd>\r\n"
"</dl>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/R134a/log(p)lambda-Diagram-R134a.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.surfaceTension"
msgid "Surface tension as a function of temperature (below critical point)"
msgstr "表面张力作为温度的函数（低于临界点）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.surfaceTension"
msgid "Reduced temperature"
msgstr "约简温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.surfaceTension"
msgid "Polynomial coefficients"
msgstr "多项式系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.surfaceTension"
msgid "Critical temperature"
msgstr "临界温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.surfaceTension"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the surface tension of R134a from the saturation record (e.g., use setSat_T function for input). The property is modelled by an approach of Okada and Higashi (1994).</p>\r\n"
"<h4> Restrictions</h4>\r\n"
"<p>This property is only defined in two-phase region.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>References</h4>\r\n"
"<dl><dt>Okada and Higashi: </dt>\r\n"
"<dd><strong>Surface tension correlation of HFC-134a and HCFC-123</strong>.\r\n"
"Proceedings of the Joint Meeting of IIR Commissions B1, B2, E1, and E2, Padua, Italy, pp. 541-548, 1994.</dd>\r\n"
"</dl>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/R134a/Tsigma-Diagram-R134a.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该函数从饱和记录（例如，使用 setSat_T 函数进行输入）计算 R134a 的表面张力。该属性由 Okada 和 Higashi（1994）的方法建模。</p>\r\n"
"<h4> 限制</h4>\r\n"
"<p>此属性仅在两相区域中定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>参考文献</h4>\r\n"
"<dl><dt>Okada and Higashi: </dt>\r\n"
"<dd><strong>Surface tension correlation of HFC-134a and HCFC-123</strong>.\r\n"
"Proceedings of the Joint Meeting of IIR Commissions B1, B2, E1, and E2, Padua, Italy, pp. 541-548, 1994.</dd>\r\n"
"</dl>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/R134a/Tsigma-Diagram-R134a.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.velocityOfSound"
msgid "Velocity of sound w.r.t. thermodynamic state (only valid for one-phase)"
msgstr "声速与热力学状态有关（仅适用于单相）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.velocityOfSound"
msgid "Helmholtz derivatives"
msgstr "亥姆霍兹导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.velocityOfSound"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the velocity of sound of R134a from the state record (e.g., use setState_phX function for input). The velocity of sound is modelled by the fundamental equation of state of Tillner-Roth and Baehr (1994).</p>\r\n"
"<h4> Restrictions</h4>\r\n"
"<p>This property is only defined in one-phase region.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/R134a/log(p)a-Diagram-R134a.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该函数从状态记录（例如，使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入）计算 R134a 的声速。声速由 Tillner-Roth 和 Baehr（1994）的基本状态方程建模。</p>\r\n"
"<h4> 限制</h4>\r\n"
"<p>此属性仅在单相区域中定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<div><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Media/R134a/log(p)a-Diagram-R134a.png\"/></div>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.isothermalCompressibility"
msgid "Isothermal compressibility w.r.t. thermodynamic state (only valid for one-phase)"
msgstr "等温压缩系数与热力学状态有关（仅适用于单相）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.isothermalCompressibility"
msgid "Helmholtz derivatives"
msgstr "亥姆霍兹导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.isothermalCompressibility"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the isothermal compressibility of R134a from the state record (e.g., use setState_phX function for input). The isothermal compressibility is modelled by the fundamental equation of state of Tillner-Roth and Baehr (1994).</p>\r\n"
"<h4> Restrictions</h4>\r\n"
"<p>This property is only defined in one-phase region.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该函数从状态记录（例如，使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入）计算 R134a 的等温压缩系数。等温压缩系数由 Tillner-Roth 和 Baehr（1994）的基本状态方程建模。</p>\r\n"
"<h4> 限制</h4>\r\n"
"<p>此属性仅在单相区域中定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.isobaricExpansionCoefficient"
msgid "Isobaric expansion coefficient w.r.t. thermodynamic state (only valid for one-phase)"
msgstr "等压膨胀系数与热力学状态有关（仅适用于单相）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.isobaricExpansionCoefficient"
msgid "Helmholtz derivatives"
msgstr "亥姆霍兹导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.isobaricExpansionCoefficient"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the isobaric expansion coefficient of R134a from the state record (e.g., use setState_phX function for input). The isobaric expansion coefficient is modelled by the fundamental equation of state of Tillner-Roth and Baehr (1994).</p>\r\n"
"<h4> Restrictions</h4>\r\n"
"<p>This property is only defined in one-phase region.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该函数从状态记录（例如，使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入）计算 R134a 的等压膨胀系数。等压膨胀系数由 Tillner-Roth 和 Baehr（1994）的基本状态方程建模。</p>\r\n"
"<h4> 限制</h4>\r\n"
"<p>此属性仅在单相区域中定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.isentropicExponent"
msgid "Isentropic exponent gamma w.r.t. thermodynamic state | not defined in two-phase region | use setState_phX function for input"
msgstr "等熵指数 gamma 与热力学状态有关 | 不适用于两相区 | 使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.isentropicExponent"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the isentropic exponent of R134a from the state record (e.g., use setState_phX function for input). The isentropic exponent is modelled by the fundamental equation of state of Tillner-Roth and Baehr (1994).</p>\r\n"
"<h4> Restrictions</h4>\r\n"
"<p>This property is only defined in one-phase region.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该函数从状态记录（例如，使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入）计算 R134a 的等熵指数。等熵指数由 Tillner-Roth 和 Baehr（1994）的基本状态方程建模。</p>\r\n"
"<h4> 限制</h4>\r\n"
"<p>此属性仅在单相区域中定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.specificGibbsEnergy"
msgid "Specific gibbs energy w.r.t. thermodynamic state"
msgstr "比吉布斯能与热力学状态有关"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.specificGibbsEnergy"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the specific Gibbs energy of R134a from the state record (e.g., use setState_phX function for input). The isentropic exponent is modelled by the fundamental equation of state of Tillner-Roth and Baehr (1994).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该函数从状态记录（例如，使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入）计算 R134a 的比吉布斯能。比吉布斯能由 Tillner-Roth 和 Baehr（1994）的基本状态方程建模。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.specificHelmholtzEnergy"
msgid "Helmholtz energy w.r.t. thermodynamic state"
msgstr "比亥姆霍兹能与热力学状态有关"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.specificHelmholtzEnergy"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the specific Helmholtz energy of R134a from the state record (e.g., use setState_phX function for input). The Helmholtz energy is modelled by the fundamental equation of state of Tillner-Roth and Baehr (1994).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该函数从状态记录（例如，使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入）计算 R134a 的比亥姆霍兹能。比亥姆霍兹能由 Tillner-Roth 和 Baehr（1994）的基本状态方程建模。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.density_derh_p"
msgid "Density derivative by specific enthalpy | use setState_phX function for input"
msgstr "比焓的密度导数 | 使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.density_derh_p"
msgid "Inverse derivatives for density and temperature"
msgstr "密度和温度的逆导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.density_derh_p"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the density derivative w.r.t. specific enthalpy at constant pressure of R134a (e.g., use setState_phX function for input). The derivative is modelled by the fundamental equation of state of Tillner-Roth and Baehr (1994). It can be used for manual state transformations (e.g. from density to specific enthalpy).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该函数计算 R134a 在恒压下的比焓密度导数（例如，使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入）。该导数由 Tillner-Roth 和 Baehr（1994）的基本状态方程建模。它可以用于手动状态转换（例如，从密度转换为比焓）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.density_derp_h"
msgid "Density derivative by pressure | use setState_phX function for input"
msgstr "压力的密度导数 | 使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.density_derp_h"
msgid "Inverse derivatives for density and temperature"
msgstr "密度和温度的逆导数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.density_derp_h"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the density derivative w.r.t. absolute pressure at constant specific enthalpy of R134a (e.g., use setState_phX function for input). The derivative is modelled by the fundamental equation of state of Tillner-Roth and Baehr (1994). It can be used for manual state transformations (e.g. from density to pressure).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该函数计算 R134a 在恒定比焓下相对于绝对压力的密度导数（例如，使用 setState_phX 函数进行输入）。该导数由 Tillner-Roth 和 Baehr（1994）的基本状态方程建模。它可以用于手动状态转换（例如，从密度转换为压力）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.isentropicEnthalpy"
msgid "Isentropic enthalpy of downstream pressure and upstream thermodynamic state (specific entropy)"
msgstr "下游压力和上游热力状态的等熵焓（比熵）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.isentropicEnthalpy"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function calculates the specific enthalpy of R134a for an isentropic pressure change\r\n"
"from refState.p to p_downstream (e.g., use setState_phX function for input of refState).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function can be used for instance to calculate an isentropic efficiency\r\n"
"of a compressor or calculate the power consumption (obtained from the isentropic enthalpy)\r\n"
"for a given efficiency.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Example:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Medium.AbsolutePressure p_downstream=10e5;\r\n"
"  Medium.SpecificEnthalpy h_downstream=4.1e5;\r\n"
"  Medium.AbsolutePressure p_upstream=3e5;\r\n"
"  Medium.SpecificEnthalpy h_upstream=4.0e5;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"  // Isentropic efficiency of a compressor:\r\n"
"  Real eta_is;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"equation\r\n"
"\r\n"
"  h_is = isentropicEnthalpy(p_downstream, Medium.setState_phX(p_upstream, h_upstream));\r\n"
"\r\n"
"  eta_is = (h_is-h_upstream)/(h_downstream - h_upstream);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Restrictions</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The isentropic efficiency function should not be applied in liquid region.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数计算 R134a 在等熵压降下的比焓从 refState.p 到 p_downstream（例如，使用 setState_phX 函数输入 refState）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数可用于计算压缩机的等熵效率或计算给定效率的功耗（从等熵焓中获得）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"示例:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Medium.AbsolutePressure p_downstream=10e5;\r\n"
"Medium.SpecificEnthalpy h_downstream=4.1e5;\r\n"
"Medium.AbsolutePressure p_upstream=3e5;\r\n"
"Medium.SpecificEnthalpy h_upstream=4.0e5;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"// 压缩机的等熵效率:\r\n"
"Real eta_is;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"equation\r\n"
"\r\n"
"h_is = isentropicEnthalpy(p_downstream, Medium.setState_phX(p_upstream, h_upstream));\r\n"
"\r\n"
"eta_is = (h_is-h_upstream)/(h_downstream - h_upstream);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>限制</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"等熵效率函数不应在液体区域应用。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

