msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dtofpsOnePhase"
msgid "Interval number"
msgstr "区间编号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dtofpsOnePhase"
msgid "Reduced pressure"
msgstr "减压力"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dtofpsOnePhase"
msgid "Abscissa of local spline"
msgstr "局部样条的横坐标"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dtofpsOnePhase"
msgid "Liquid entropy"
msgstr "液体熵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dtofpsOnePhase"
msgid "Vapor entropy"
msgstr "蒸汽熵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.dtofpsOnePhase"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the density and temperature of R134a from absolute pressure and specific entropy in one-phase region. The function calls the fundamental helmholtz equation of Tillner-Roth (1994) which is requiring density and temperature for input. Thus, a newton iteration is performed to determine density and temperature. The newton iteration stops if the inputs for pressure difference delp and specific entropy difference dels are larger than the actual differences derived from the newton iteration.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Restrictions</h4>\r\n"
"The function shall only be used for one-phase inputs since the fundamental equation is not valid for two-phase states. The iteration could fail for liquid states with high pressures.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"此函数根据绝对压力和比熵计算R134a的密度和温度（单相区域）。该函数调用Tillner-Roth（1994年）的基本亥姆霍兹方程，该方程需要密度和温度作为输入。因此，进行牛顿迭代以确定密度和温度。如果压力差异delp和比熵差异dels的输入大于由牛顿迭代得出的实际差异，则牛顿迭代将停止。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>限制</h4><p>\r\n"
"该函数应仅用于单相输入，因为基本方程对于两相状态无效。对于具有高压力的液态，迭代可能会失败。<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.f_R134a"
msgid "Calculation of helmholtz derivatives by density and temperature"
msgstr "按密度和温度计算亥姆霍兹导数"

