msgid "|tau|"
msgstr "|tau|"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.fid_R134a"
msgid "|delta|"
msgstr "|delta|"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.fid_R134a"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"This function computes the ideal gas helmholtz derivatives of the fundamental equation of Tillner-Roth and Baehr for R134a (1994) w.r.t. to reduced temperature (tau=T_crit/T) and reduced density (delta=rho/rho_crit).\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"此函数计算了相对于约简温度（tau=T_crit/T）和约简密度（delta=rho/rho_crit）的R134a Tillner-Roth和Baehr（1994）基本方程的理想气体亥姆霍兹导数。<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

