msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.hofpT"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This function calculates the specific enthalpy of R134a from absolute pressure and temperature. The function can only be executed in one-phase region. The safety margin to the phase boundary is 1[K] and 1000[Pa].\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>该函数根据绝对压力和温度计算 R134a 的比焓。该函数只能在单相区域执行。到相界的安全裕度为 1[K] 和 1000[Pa]。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.phaseBoundaryAssert"
msgid "Assert function for checking threshold to phase boundary"
msgstr "用于检查到相界的阈值的断言函数"

