msgid "Refrigerant pressure"
msgstr "制冷剂压力"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.phaseBoundaryAssert"
msgid "Refrigerant temperature"
msgstr "制冷剂温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.phaseBoundaryAssert"
msgid "Upper temperature limit"
msgstr "上限温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.phaseBoundaryAssert"
msgid "Lower temperature limit"
msgstr "下限温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.phaseBoundaryAssert"
msgid "Saturation temperature"
msgstr "饱和温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.phaseBoundaryAssert"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"This function is used as a guard for property functions using pTX as an input. Property functions for two-phase media using pressure and temperature as inputs shall not be used close to the phase boundary in order to avoid errors and high deviations for just small deviations in the input arguments. The refrigerant state can not be determined in the two-phase region using pressure and temperature.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该函数用作使用 pTX 作为输入的属性函数的保护条件。对于使用压力和温度作为输入的两相介质的属性函数，在相界附近不应使用，以避免由于输入参数的微小偏差而产生的错误和较大偏差。在两相区域内，无法使用压力和温度确定制冷剂状态。<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

