msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Water.IF97_Utilities.BaseIF97.ByRegion"
msgid "Simple explicit functions for one region only"
msgstr "仅适用于一个区域的简单显式函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Media.Water.IF97_Utilities.BaseIF97.ByRegion"
msgid "<html><h4>Package description</h4>\r\n"
"          <p>Package ByRegion provides fast forward calls for dynamic property calculation records for all\r\n"
"          one phase regions of IAPWS/IF97\r\n"
"          </p>\r\n"
"          <h4>Package contents</h4>\r\n"
"          <ul>\r\n"
"          <li>Function <strong>waterR1_pT</strong> computes dynamic properties for region 1 using  (p,T) as inputs</li>\r\n"
"          <li>Function <strong>waterR2_pT</strong> computes dynamic properties for region 2 using  (p,T) as inputs</li>\r\n"
"          <li>Function <strong>waterR3_dT</strong> computes dynamic properties for region 3 using  (d,T) as inputs</li>\r\n"
"          <li>Function <strong>waterR5_pT</strong> computes dynamic properties for region 5 using  (p,T) as inputs</li>\r\n"
"          </ul>\r\n"
"          <h4>Version Info and Revision history\r\n"
"          </h4>\r\n"
"          <ul>\r\n"
"          <li>First implemented: <em>July, 2000</em>\r\n"
"          by Hubertus Tummescheit\r\n"
"          </li>\r\n"
"          </ul>\r\n"
"          <address>Author: Hubertus Tummescheit,<br>\r\n"
"      Modelon AB<br>\r\n"
"      Ideon Science Park<br>\r\n"
"      SE-22370 Lund, Sweden<br>\r\n"
"      email: hubertus@modelon.se\r\n"
"          </address>\r\n"
"          <ul>\r\n"
"          <li>Initial version: July 2000</li>\r\n"
"          <li>Documented and re-organized: January 2003</li>\r\n"
"          </ul>\r\n"
"          </html>"
msgstr "<html><h4>包描述</h4><p>\r\n"
"ByRegion库提供了动态属性计算记录的快速调用，适用于IAPWS/IF97的所有单相区域\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>包内容</h4><ul><li>\r\n"
"函数 <strong>waterR1_pT</strong> 使用(p,T)作为输入计算区域1的动态属性</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"函数 <strong>waterR2_pT</strong> 使用(p,T)作为输入计算区域2的动态属性</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"函数 <strong>waterR3_dT</strong> 使用(d,T)作为输入计算区域3的动态属性</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"函数 <strong>waterR5_pT</strong> 使用(p,T)作为输入计算区域5的动态属性</li>\r\n"
"</ul><h4>版本信息和修订历史<br></h4><ul><li>\r\n"
"首次实施： <em>2000年7月</em>，作者：Hubertus Tummescheit</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"作者：Hubertus Tummescheit，<br><br>Modelon AB<br><br>Ideon Science Park<br><br>SE-22370 Lund, Sweden<br><br>电子邮件：hubertus@modelon.se<br></li>\r\n"
"</ul><ul><li>\r\n"
"初始版本：2000年7月</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"文档添加和重新组织：2003年1月</li>\r\n"
"</ul></html>"

