msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.Examples.SimpleCooling"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"1st test example: SimpleCooling\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"A prescribed heat source dissipates its heat through a thermal conductor to a coolant flow. The coolant flow is taken from an ambient and driven by a pump with prescribed mass flow.<br>\r\n"
"<strong>Results</strong>:<br>\r\n"
"<table>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td><strong>output</strong></td>\r\n"
"<td><strong>explanation</strong></td>\r\n"
"<td><strong>formula</strong></td>\r\n"
"<td><strong>actual steady-state value</strong></td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>dTSource</td>\r\n"
"<td>Source over Ambient</td>\r\n"
"<td>dtCoolant + dtToPipe</td>\r\n"
"<td>20 K</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>dTtoPipe</td>\r\n"
"<td>Source over Coolant</td>\r\n"
"<td>Losses / ThermalConductor.G</td>\r\n"
"<td>10 K</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>dTCoolant</td>\r\n"
"<td>Coolant's temperature increase</td>\r\n"
"<td>Losses * cp * massFlow</td>\r\n"
"<td>10 K</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"第一个测试案例: SimpleCooling<br>规定的热源通过热导体将其热量散发到冷却液流中。冷却液流来自环境，由具有规定质量流量的泵驱动。<br><strong>结果</strong>:<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<table style=\"width: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><strong>输出</strong></td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><strong>名称</strong></td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><strong>公式</strong></td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><strong>实际的稳态值</strong></td></tr><tr><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">dTSource</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">过热源</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">dtCoolant + dtToPipe</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">20 K</td></tr><tr><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">dTtoPipe</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">过冷源</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">Losses / ThermalConductor.G</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">10 K</td></tr><tr><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">dTCoolant</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">冷却剂温度升高</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">Losses * cp * massFlow</td><td colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\">10 K</td></tr></tbody></table><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

