msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.Sources.AbsolutePressure"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>AbsolutePressure to define pressure level of a closed cooling cycle.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Coolant's mass flow, temperature and enthalpy flow are not affected.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>绝对压力用于定义封闭式冷却循环的压力水平。</p>\r\n"
"<p>冷却剂的质量流量、温度和焓流量不受影响。</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.Sources.VolumeFlow"
msgid "Enforces constant volume flow"
msgstr "保持恒定体积流量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.Sources.VolumeFlow"
msgid "Enable / disable volume flow input"
msgstr "启用/禁用体积流量输入"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.Sources.VolumeFlow"
msgid "Volume flow rate"
msgstr "体积流量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.Sources.VolumeFlow"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Fan resp. pump with constant volume flow rate. Pressure increase is the response of the whole system.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Coolant's temperature and enthalpy flow are not affected.</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Setting parameter m (mass of medium within fan/pump) to zero\r\n"
"leads to neglect of temperature transient cv*m*der(T).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>Thermodynamic equations are defined by BaseClasses.TwoPort.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"风扇或泵具有恒定体积流量。压力增加是整个系统的响应。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"冷却剂的温度和焓流不受影响。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"将参数 m（风扇/泵内介质的质量）设为零，可忽略温度瞬态项 cv*m*der(T)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"热力学方程由 BaseClasses.TwoPort 定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

