msgstr "理想泵的模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.Sources.IdealPump"
msgid "Nominal speed"
msgstr "额定转速"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.Sources.IdealPump"
msgid "Pump characteristic"
msgstr "Pump characteristic"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.Sources.IdealPump"
msgid "Max. pressure increase @ V_flow=0"
msgstr "最大压力增幅 @ V_flow=0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.Sources.IdealPump"
msgid "Max. volume flow rate @ dp=0"
msgstr "最大体积流量 @ dp=0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.Sources.IdealPump"
msgid "Speed"
msgstr "流速"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.Sources.IdealPump"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Simple fan resp. pump where characteristic is dependent on shaft's speed, <br>\r\n"
"torque * speed = pressure increase * volume flow (without losses)<br>\r\n"
"Pressure increase versus volume flow is defined by a linear function,\r\n"
"from dp0(V_flow=0) to V_flow0(dp=0).<br>\r\n"
"The axis intersections vary with speed as follows:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>dp prop. speed^2</li>\r\n"
"<li>V_flow prop. speed</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Coolant's temperature and enthalpy flow are not affected.<br>\r\n"
"Setting parameter m (mass of medium within fan/pump) to zero\r\n"
"leads to negligence of temperature transient cv*m*der(T).<br>\r\n"
"Thermodynamic equations are defined by BaseClasses.TwoPort.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"简单的风扇或泵，其特性依赖于轴的转速。<br> torque * speed = pressure increase * volume flow (无损失)<br> 压力增加与体积流量的关系由线性函数定义， from dp0(V_flow=0) to V_flow0(dp=0)。<br>轴交点随转速变化如下：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"dp prop. speed^2</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"V_flow prop.speed</li>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"冷却剂的温度和焓流不受影响。<br> 将参数 m（风扇/泵内介质的质量）设为零，可忽略温度瞬态项 cv*m*der(T)。<br> 热力学方程由 BaseClasses.TwoPort 定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

