msgstr "连接器中的介质"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.Interfaces.FlowPort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"Basic definition of the connector.<br>\r\n"
"<strong>Variables:</strong>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>Pressure p</li>\r\n"
"<li>flow MassFlowRate m_flow</li>\r\n"
"<li>Specific Enthalpy h</li>\r\n"
"<li>flow EnthaplyFlowRate H_flow</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"If ports with different media are connected, the simulation is asserted due to the check of parameter.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"<br>连接器的基本定义。<br><strong>变量：</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"压力 p</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"流变量 质量流量 m_flow</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"比焓 h</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"流变量 焓流量 H_flow<br><br>如果连接了不同介质的端口，系统会通过参数检查来确认模拟有效性。<br></li>\r\n"
"</html>"

