msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.BaseClasses.TwoPort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>Partial model with two flowPorts.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Possible heat exchange with the ambient is defined by Q_flow; setting this = 0 means no energy exchange.</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Setting parameter m (mass of medium within pipe) to zero\r\n"
"leads to neglect of temperature transient cv*m*der(T).</p>\r\n"
"<p>Mixing rule is applied.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Parameter 0 &lt; tapT &lt; 1 defines temperature of heatPort between medium's inlet and outlet temperature.</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"有两个流体接口的基类模型。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"与周围环境进行热交换由 Q_flow 定义；设置 Q_flow = 0 表示没有能量交换。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"将参数 m（管道内介质的质量）设为零，可忽略温度瞬态项 cv*m*der(T).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"采用混合规则。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"参数 0 &lt; tapT &lt; 1 定义介质入口和出口温度之间的热接口温度。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.BaseClasses.SimpleFriction"
msgid "Simple friction model"
msgstr "简单摩擦模型"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.BaseClasses.SimpleFriction"
msgid "Laminar volume flow"
msgstr "层流体积流"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.BaseClasses.SimpleFriction"
msgid "Simple friction"
msgstr "Simple friction"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.BaseClasses.SimpleFriction"
msgid "Laminar pressure drop"
msgstr "层流压降"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.BaseClasses.SimpleFriction"
msgid "Nominal volume flow"
msgstr "额定流量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.BaseClasses.SimpleFriction"
msgid "Nominal pressure drop"
msgstr "额定压降"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.BaseClasses.SimpleFriction"
msgid "Part of friction losses fed to medium"
msgstr "输入介质的部分摩擦损耗"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.FluidHeatFlow.BaseClasses.SimpleFriction"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Definition of relationship between pressure drop and volume flow rate:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>-V_flowLaminar &lt; VolumeFlow &lt; +V_flowLaminar: laminar, i.e., linear dependency of pressure drop on volume flow.</li>\r\n"
"<li>-V_flowLaminar &gt; VolumeFlow or VolumeFlow &lt; +V_flowLaminar: turbulent, i.e., quadratic dependency of pressure drop on volume flow.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Thermal/FluidHeatFlow/BaseClasses/SimpleFriction.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"SimpleFriction.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Linear and quadratic dependency are coupled smoothly at V_flowLaminar / dpLaminar.\r\n"
"Quadratic dependency is defined by nominal volume flow and pressure drop (V_flowNominal / dpNominal).\r\n"
"See also sketch at diagram layer.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"压降与体积流量关系的定义:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>-V_flowLaminar &lt; VolumeFlow &lt; +V_flowLaminar: laminar, i.e., 压降与流量的线性关系。</li>\r\n"
"<li>-V_flowLaminar &gt; VolumeFlow or VolumeFlow &lt; +V_flowLaminar: turbulent, i.e., 压降与流量的二次方关系。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Thermal/FluidHeatFlow/BaseClasses/SimpleFriction.png\"\r\n"
"     alt=\"SimpleFriction.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"线性相关和二次相关在 V_flowLaminar / dpLaminar 处平滑耦合。\r\n"
"四次相关性由名义体积流量和压降（V_flowNominal / dpNominal）定义。\r\n"
"另请参见图层草图。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

