msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Components.ThermalCollectorMatrix"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is a model to collect the heat flows from <em>Ns</em> x <em>Np</em> heatports to one single heatport.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"<em>本Ns</em> x <em>Np</em>本模型实现Ns x Np个热接口的热流量向到单个热接口汇聚传输。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Components.GeneralHeatFlowToTemperatureAdaptor"
msgid "Signal adaptor for a HeatTransfer port with temperature and derivative of temperature as outputs and heat flow as input (especially useful for FMUs)"
msgstr "热接口的信号适配器，输出为温度及其时间导数，输入为热流量(尤其适用于FMUs)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Components.GeneralHeatFlowToTemperatureAdaptor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Adaptor between a heatport connector and a signal representation of the flange.\r\n"
"This component is used to provide a pure signal interface around a HeatTransfer model\r\n"
"and export this model in form of an input/output block,\r\n"
"especially as FMU (<a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>).\r\n"
"Examples of the usage of this adaptor are provided in\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs\">HeatTransfer.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs</a>.\r\n"
"This adaptor has heatflow as input and temperature and derivative of temperature as output signals.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"热接口与法兰信号之间的适配器。该组件用于为传热模型提供纯信号接口，并以输入/输出信号的形式输出该模型, 特别是 FMU (<a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\" target=\"\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;)。该适配器的使用示例见 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs\" target=\"\">HeatTransfer.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs</a>&nbsp;。该适配器的输入信号为热流，输出信号为温度及其时间多导数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Components.GeneralTemperatureToHeatFlowAdaptor"
msgid "Signal adaptor for a HeatTransfer port with heat flow as output and temperature and derivative of temperature as input (especially useful for FMUs)"
msgstr "热接口的信号适配器，输出为热流量，输入为温度及其时间导数(尤其适用于FMUs)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Components.GeneralTemperatureToHeatFlowAdaptor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Adaptor between a heatport connector and a signal representation of the flange.\r\n"
"This component is used to provide a pure signal interface around a HeatTransfer model\r\n"
"and export this model in form of an input/output block,\r\n"
"especially as FMU (<a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>).\r\n"
"Examples of the usage of this adaptor are provided in\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs\">HeatTransfer.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs</a>.\r\n"
"This adaptor has temperature and derivative of temperature as input signals and heatflow as output signal.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, the input signals must be consistent to each other\r\n"
"(derT=der(T)).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"热接口与法兰信号之间的适配器。 该组件用于为传热模型提供纯信号接口，并以输入/输出信号的形式输出该模型, 特别是 FMU (<a href=\"https://fmi-standard.org\" target=\"\">Functional Mock-up Unit</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;)。该适配器的使用示例见 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs\" target=\"\">HeatTransfer.Examples.GenerationOfFMUs</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;。该适配器将温度及其时间导数作为输入信号，将热流作为输出信号.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意，输入信号必须相互一致 (derT=der(T)).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors"
msgid "Thermal sensors"
msgstr "热传感器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.TemperatureSensor"
msgid "Absolute temperature sensor in Kelvin"
msgstr "绝对温度传感器(K)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.TemperatureSensor"
msgid "Absolute temperature as output signal"
msgstr "输出信号为绝对温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.TemperatureSensor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.TemperatureSensor"
msgid "K"
msgstr "K"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.TemperatureSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This is an ideal absolute temperature sensor which returns\r\n"
"the temperature of the connected port in Kelvin as an output\r\n"
"signal.  The sensor itself has no thermal interaction with\r\n"
"whatever it is connected to.  Furthermore, no\r\n"
"thermocouple-like lags are associated with this\r\n"
"sensor model.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该理想绝对温度传感器能够以开尔文（K）为单位输出所连接端口的温度信号。传感器本身与其连接对象之间不存在任何热交互作用，且该传感器模型不存在类似热电偶的响应延迟现象。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.RelTemperatureSensor"
msgid "Relative temperature sensor"
msgstr "相对温度传感器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.RelTemperatureSensor"
msgid "Relative temperature as output signal"
msgstr "输出信号为相对温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.RelTemperatureSensor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.RelTemperatureSensor"
msgid "K"
msgstr "K"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.RelTemperatureSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The relative temperature \"port_a.T - port_b.T\" is determined between\r\n"
"the two ports of this component and is provided as output signal in Kelvin.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该组件测定其两个端口之间的相对温度\"port_a.T - port_b.T\"，并以开尔文（K）为单位输出该温度信号。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.HeatFlowSensor"
msgid "Heat flow rate sensor"
msgstr "热流量传感器"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.HeatFlowSensor"
msgid "Heat flow from port_a to port_b as output signal"
msgstr "输出信号为从端口_a 到端口_b 的热流量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.HeatFlowSensor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.HeatFlowSensor"
msgid "W"
msgstr "W"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.HeatFlowSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model is capable of monitoring the heat flow rate flowing through\r\n"
"this component. The sensed value of heat flow rate is the amount that\r\n"
"passes through this sensor while keeping the temperature drop across the\r\n"
"sensor zero.  This is an ideal model so it does not absorb any energy\r\n"
"and it has no direct effect on the thermal response of a system it is included in.\r\n"
"The output signal is positive, if the heat flows from port_a to port_b.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模型能够监测流经组件的热流率（W）。在保持传感器两端温差为零的条件下，所测得的热流率即为通过传感器的实际热流量。作为理想模型，其本身不会吸收任何能量，且不会对所在系统的热响应产生直接影响。当热流从端口a流向端口b时，输出信号为正值。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.ConditionalFixedHeatFlowSensor"
msgid "HeatFlowSensor, conditional fixed temperature"
msgstr "热流传感器，条件固定温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.ConditionalFixedHeatFlowSensor"
msgid "Fixed temperature if true"
msgstr "如果为true，固定温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.ConditionalFixedHeatFlowSensor"
msgid "Heat flow from port_a to port_b as output signal"
msgstr "输出信号为从端口_a 到端口_b 的热流量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.ConditionalFixedHeatFlowSensor"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.ConditionalFixedHeatFlowSensor"
msgid "W"
msgstr "W"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.ConditionalFixedHeatFlowSensor"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If useFixedTemperature = false, this sensor acts just as a normal\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.HeatFlowSensor\">HeatFlowSensor</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If useFixedTemperature = true, it is assumed that the connections to both heatPorts of this sensor are conditionally removed;\r\n"
"in this case, the measured Q_flow is reported = 0 automatically.\r\n"
"To avoid a singular equation system, the temperature of the sensor is set to 293.15 K.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"如果 useFixedTemperature = false，则该传感器的作用与普通传感器<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.HeatFlowSensor\" target=\"\">HeatFlowSensor</a>&nbsp;相同。 \r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果 useFixedTemperature = true，则假设该传感器的两个热端口连接被有条件断开，此时测得的热流量Q_flow将自动归零。为避免出现奇异方程组，传感器温度将被设定为293.15 K。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources"
msgid "Thermal sources"
msgstr "热源"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.FixedTemperature"
msgid "Fixed temperature boundary condition in Kelvin"
msgstr "以开尔文为单位的固定温度边界条件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.FixedTemperature"
msgid "Fixed temperature at port"
msgstr "端口温度固定"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.FixedTemperature"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.FixedTemperature"
msgid "T=%T"
msgstr "T=%T"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.FixedTemperature"
msgid "K"
msgstr "K"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.FixedTemperature"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model defines a fixed temperature T at its port in Kelvin,\r\n"
"i.e., it defines a fixed temperature as a boundary condition.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模型在其端口处以开尔文（K）为单位定义了一个固定温度T，即，它将固定温度作为边界条件进行定义。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.PrescribedTemperature"
msgid "Variable temperature boundary condition in Kelvin"
msgstr "以开尔文为单位的可变温度边界条件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.PrescribedTemperature"
msgid "K"
msgstr "K"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.PrescribedTemperature"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.PrescribedTemperature"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model represents a variable temperature boundary condition.\r\n"
"The temperature in [K] is given as input signal <strong>T</strong>\r\n"
"to the model. The effect is that an instance of this model acts as\r\n"
"an infinite reservoir able to absorb or generate as much energy\r\n"
"as required to keep the temperature at the specified value.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模型代表一种可变温度边界条件。模型以开尔文（K）为单位的温度值作为输入信号T。其效果在于：该模型的实例将充当一个无限容体，能够吸收或释放维持指定温度所需的任意能量。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.FixedHeatFlow"
msgid "Fixed heat flow boundary condition"
msgstr "固定热流边界条件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.FixedHeatFlow"
msgid "Fixed heat flow rate at port"
msgstr "端口的固定热流量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.FixedHeatFlow"
msgid "Reference temperature"
msgstr "参考温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.FixedHeatFlow"
msgid "Temperature coefficient of heat flow rate"
msgstr "热流量温度系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.FixedHeatFlow"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.FixedHeatFlow"
msgid "Q_flow=%Q_flow"
msgstr "Q_flow=%Q_flow"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.FixedHeatFlow"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model allows a specified amount of heat flow rate to be \"injected\"\r\n"
"into a thermal system at a given port.  The constant amount of heat\r\n"
"flow rate Q_flow is given as a parameter. The heat flows into the\r\n"
"component to which the component FixedHeatFlow is connected,\r\n"
"if parameter Q_flow is positive.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If parameter alpha is &lt;&gt; 0, the heat flow is multiplied by (1 + alpha*(port.T - T_ref))\r\n"
"in order to simulate temperature dependent losses (which are given with respect to reference temperature T_ref).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p style=\"text-align: start;\">该模型允许在指定端口向热力系统\"注入\"设定的热流率。恒定热流率Q_flow作为参数给定。当参数Q_flow为正值时，热量将流入与FixedHeatFlow组件相连接的部件。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: start;\">若参数alpha≠0，热流将乘以(1 + alpha*(port.T - T_ref))，用以模拟与温度相关的损耗（该损耗基于参考温度T_ref计算）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.PrescribedHeatFlow"
msgid "Prescribed heat flow boundary condition"
msgstr "设定热流边界条件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.PrescribedHeatFlow"
msgid "Reference temperature"
msgstr "参考温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.PrescribedHeatFlow"
msgid "Temperature coefficient of heat flow rate"
msgstr "热流量温度系数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.PrescribedHeatFlow"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sources.PrescribedHeatFlow"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model allows a specified amount of heat flow rate to be \"injected\"\r\n"
"into a thermal system at a given port.  The amount of heat\r\n"
"is given by the input signal Q_flow into the model. The heat flows into the\r\n"
"component to which the component PrescribedHeatFlow is connected,\r\n"
"if the input signal is positive.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If parameter alpha is &lt;&gt; 0, the heat flow is multiplied by (1 + alpha*(port.T - T_ref))\r\n"
"in order to simulate temperature dependent losses (which are given with respect to reference temperature T_ref).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模型允许通过指定端口向热力系统\"注入\"设定的热流率。热流量值由输入至模型的信号Q_flow确定。当输入信号为正值时，热量将流入与PrescribedHeatFlow组件相连接的部件。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果参数 alpha 为 0，则热流乘以 (1 + alpha*（port.T - T_ref)) 以模拟与温度有关的损耗（损耗与参考温度 T_ref 有关）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Celsius"
msgid "Components with Celsius input and/or output"
msgstr "带有摄氏输入和/或输出的组件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Celsius"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The components of this package are provided for the convenience of\r\n"
"people working mostly with Celsius units, since all models\r\n"
"in package HeatTransfer are based on Kelvin units.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, that in package <code>Modelica.Units.Conversions</code>, functions are provided\r\n"
"to convert between the units Kelvin, degree Celsius, degree Fahrenheit,\r\n"
"and degree Rankine. These functions allow, e.g., a direct conversion\r\n"
"of units at all places where Kelvin is required as parameter.\r\n"
"Example:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>import</strong> Modelica.Units.Conversions.from_degC;\r\n"
"Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.HeatCapacitor C(T0 = from_degC(20));\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该库中的组件主要为习惯使用摄氏温标的用户提供便利，因为HeatTransfer库中的所有模型均基于开尔文温标。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请注意，在Modelica.Units.Conversions库中提供开尔文(K)、摄氏度(°C)、华氏度(°F)和兰氏度(°R)之间的单位转换函数。这些函数允许在需要以开尔文为参数的场景中直接进行单位转换。例如：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >import Modelica.Units.Conversions.from_degC;\r\n"
"Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.HeatCapacitor C(T0 = from_degC(20));\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

