msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Celsius.PrescribedTemperature"
msgid "Variable temperature boundary condition in degCelsius"
msgstr "以摄氏度为单位的可变温度边界条件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Celsius.PrescribedTemperature"
msgid "%name"
msgstr "%name"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Celsius.PrescribedTemperature"
msgid "degC"
msgstr "degC"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Celsius.PrescribedTemperature"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This model represents a variable temperature boundary condition\r\n"
"The temperature value in [degC] is given by the input signal\r\n"
"to the model. The effect is that an instance of this model acts as\r\n"
"an infinite reservoir able to absorb or generate as much energy\r\n"
"as required to keep the temperature at the specified value.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该模型代表一种可变温度边界条件，其温度值（以[°C]为单位）由输入信号给定。其效果是：该模型的实例将充当一个无限热源，能够吸收或产生维持设定温度所需的任意能量。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Celsius.TemperatureSensor"
msgid "Absolute temperature sensor in degCelsius"
msgstr "绝对温度传感器(摄氏度)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Celsius.TemperatureSensor"
