msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.HeatPort_a"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This connector is used for 1-dimensional heat flow between components.\r\n"
"The variables in the connector are:</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T       Temperature in [Kelvin].\r\n"
"Q_flow  Heat flow rate in [Watt].\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>According to the Modelica sign convention, a <strong>positive</strong> heat flow\r\n"
"rate <strong>Q_flow</strong> is considered to flow <strong>into</strong> a component. This\r\n"
"convention has to be used whenever this connector is used in a model\r\n"
"class.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Note, that the two connector classes <strong>HeatPort_a</strong> and\r\n"
"<strong>HeatPort_b</strong> are identical with the only exception of the different\r\n"
"<strong>icon layout</strong>.</p></html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该连接器用于组件之间的一维热流。连接器中的变量为:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >T       温度 [Kelvin].\r\n"
"Q_flow  热流量 [Watt].\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"根据Modelica符号约定，<strong>正</strong>热流率<strong>Q_flow</strong>被视为<strong>流入</strong>组件的方向。在模型类中使用该连接器时，必须遵循此约定。<br>注意：两个连接器<strong>HeatPort_a</strong>与<strong>HeatPort_b</strong>除<strong>图标布局</strong>不同外完全一致。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.HeatPort_b"
msgid "Thermal port for 1-dim. heat transfer (unfilled rectangular icon)"
msgstr "用于一维热传导的热接口(空心矩形图标)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.HeatPort_b"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This connector is used for 1-dimensional heat flow between components.\r\n"
"The variables in the connector are:</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"T       Temperature in [Kelvin].\r\n"
"Q_flow  Heat flow rate in [Watt].\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>According to the Modelica sign convention, a <strong>positive</strong> heat flow\r\n"
"rate <strong>Q_flow</strong> is considered to flow <strong>into</strong> a component. This\r\n"
"convention has to be used whenever this connector is used in a model\r\n"
"class.</p>\r\n"
"<p>Note, that the two connector classes <strong>HeatPort_a</strong> and\r\n"
"<strong>HeatPort_b</strong> are identical with the only exception of the different\r\n"
"<strong>icon layout</strong>.</p></html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该连接器用于组件之间的一维热流。连接器中的变量为:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >T       温度 [Kelvin].\r\n"
"Q_flow  热流 [Watt].\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"根据Modelica符号约定，负热流率<strong>Q_flow</strong>被视为<strong>流出</strong>组件的方向。在模型类中使用该连接器时，必须遵循此约定。<br>注意：两个连接器<strong>HeatPort_a</strong>与<strong>HeatPort_b</strong>除<strong>图标布局</strong>不同外完全一致。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.Element1D"
msgid "Partial heat transfer element with two HeatPort connectors that does not store energy"
msgstr "传热元件基类(带两个HeatPort连接器且不存储能量)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.Element1D"
msgid "Heat flow rate from port_a -> port_b"
msgstr "从端口a -> 端口b的热流量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.Element1D"
msgid "port_a.T - port_b.T"
msgstr "port_a.T - port_b.T"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.Element1D"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This partial model contains the basic connectors and variables to\r\n"
"allow heat transfer models to be created that <strong>do not store energy</strong>,\r\n"
"This model defines and includes equations for the temperature\r\n"
"drop across the element, <strong>dT</strong>, and the heat flow rate\r\n"
"through the element from port_a to port_b, <strong>Q_flow</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"By extending this model, it is possible to write simple\r\n"
"constitutive equations for many types of heat transfer components.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p style=\"text-align: start;\">该局部模型包含用于构建<strong>不存储能量</strong>的传热模型的基础连接器与变量。该模型定义并包含了流经该元件的温度降<strong>dT</strong>，以及从port.a到port.b流经该元件的热流率<strong>Q_flow</strong>的方程。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p style=\"text-align: start;\">通过扩展此模型，可为多种类型的热传递组件编写简单的本构方程。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPort"
msgid "Partial model to include a conditional HeatPort in order to dissipate losses, used for textual modeling, i.e., for elementary models"
msgstr "基类模型(包含条件式HeatPort以耗散损耗，适用于文本建模，即基础模型)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPort"
msgid "= true, if heatPort is enabled"
msgstr "= true，如果启用了 heatPort"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPort"
msgid "Fixed device temperature if useHeatPort = false"
msgstr "如果useHeatPort = false，固定设备温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPort"
msgid "Optional port to which dissipated losses are transported in form of heat"
msgstr "以热量形式输送损耗的可选端口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPort"
msgid "Loss power leaving component via heatPort (> 0, if heat is flowing out of component)"
msgstr "通过热端口离开组件的损耗功率（> 0，如果热量流出组件）"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPort"
msgid "Temperature of heatPort"
msgstr "热端口温度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This partial model provides a conditional heat port for dissipating losses.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>If <strong>useHeatPort</strong> is set to <strong>false</strong> (default), no heat port is available, and the thermal loss power is dissipated internally.\r\n"
"In this case, the parameter <strong>T</strong> specifies the fixed device temperature (the default for T = 20&deg;C)</li>\r\n"
"<li>If <strong>useHeatPort</strong> is set to <strong>true</strong>, the heat port is available.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If this model is used, the loss power has to be provided by an equation in the model which inherits from PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPort model\r\n"
"(<strong>lossPower = ...</strong>). The device temperature <strong>TheatPort</strong> can be used to describe the influence of the device temperature on the model behaviour.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该基类模型提供了一个有条件的热接口，用于耗散损耗。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"如果<strong>useHeatPort</strong>设置为<strong>false</strong>(默认)，无可用热接口，热损耗功率将在内部耗散。此时，<strong>参数T</strong>指定器件的固定温度（默认值T = 20°C）。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"当<strong>useHeatPort</strong>设置为<strong>true</strong>时，表示该热接口可用。</li>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果使用此模型，需在继承自PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPort的模型中通过方程提供损耗功率 (<strong>lossPower =…</strong>)。器件温度<strong>TheatPort</strong>可用于描述器件温度对模型行为的影响。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPortWithoutT"
msgid "Partial model to include a conditional HeatPort in order to dissipate losses, used for textual modeling, i.e., for elementary models"
msgstr "基类模型(包含条件式HeatPort以耗散损耗，适用于文本建模，即基础模型)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPortWithoutT"
msgid "= true, if heatPort is enabled"
msgstr "= true，如果启用了热端口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPortWithoutT"
msgid "Optional port to which dissipated losses are transported in form of heat"
msgstr "以热量形式输送损耗的可选端口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPortWithoutT"
msgid "Loss power leaving component via heatPort (> 0, if heat is flowing out of component)"
msgstr "通过热端口离开组件的损耗功率(> 0，如果热量流出组件)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPortWithoutT"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This partial model provides a conditional heat port for dissipating losses.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>If <strong>useHeatPort</strong> is set to <strong>false</strong> (default), no heat port is available, and the thermal loss power is dissipated internally.</li>\r\n"
"<li>If <strong>useHeatPort</strong> is set to <strong>true</strong>, the heat port is available and must be connected from the outside.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If this model is used, the loss power has to be provided by an equation in the model which inherits from the PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPortWithoutT model\r\n"
"(<strong>lossPower = ...</strong>).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, this partial model is used in cases, where heatPort.T (that is the device temperature) is not utilized in the model. If this is desired, inherit instead from partial model\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPort\">PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPort</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该基类模型提供了一个有条件的热接口，用于耗散损耗。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"当<strong>useHeatPort</strong>设置为<strong>false</strong>(默认)，则无可用热接口，热损耗功率将在内部耗散。</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"当<strong>useHeatPort</strong>设置为<strong>true</strong>时，热接口可用且必须进行外部连接。</li>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果使用此模型，需在继承自PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPortWithoutT的模型中通过方程提供损耗功率 (<strong>lossPower =…</strong>)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意：此基类模型适用于未使用heatPort.T（即器件温度）的场景。若需使用温度参数，请改为继承基类模型<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPort\" target=\"\">PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPort</a>&nbsp;。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialConditionalHeatPort"
msgid "Partial model to include a conditional HeatPort in order to dissipate losses, used for graphical modeling, i.e., for building models by drag-and-drop"
msgstr "基类模型(包含条件式HeatPort以耗散损耗，适用于图形建模，即拖拽式建模)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialConditionalHeatPort"
msgid "= true, if HeatPort is enabled"
msgstr "= true，如果启用了热端口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialConditionalHeatPort"
msgid "Fixed device temperature if useHeatPort = false"
msgstr "如果useHeatPort = false，设备温度固定不变"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialConditionalHeatPort"
msgid "Optional port to which dissipated losses are transported in form of heat"
msgstr "以热量形式输送损耗的可选端口"

msgctxt "Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Interfaces.PartialConditionalHeatPort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This partial model provides a conditional heat port for dissipating losses.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li>If <strong>useHeatPort</strong> is set to <strong>false</strong> (default), no heat port is available, and the thermal loss power is dissipated internally.\r\n"
"In this case, the parameter <strong>T</strong> specifies the fixed device temperature (the default for T = 20&deg;C)</li>\r\n"
"<li>If <strong>useHeatPort</strong> is set to <strong>true</strong>, the heat port is available.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If this model is used, the <strong>internalHeatPort</strong> has to be connected in the model which inherits from PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPort model.\r\n"
"The device temperature <strong>internalHeatPort.T</strong> can be used to describe the influence of the device temperature on the model behaviour.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><p>\r\n"
"该基类模型提供了一个有条件的热接口，用于耗散损耗。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"如果<strong>useHeatPort</strong>设置为<strong>false</strong>(默认)，无可用热接口，热损耗功率将在内部耗散。。在这种情况下，参数<strong>T</strong>指定固定的设备温度(默认为T = 20&℃)</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"当<strong>useHeatPort</strong>设置为<strong>true</strong>时，表示该热接口可用。</li>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"使用此模型时，继承自PartialElementaryConditionalHeatPort的模型中必须对<strong>internalHeatPort</strong>进行连接。 器件温度<strong>internalHeatPort.T</strong>可以用来描述器件温度对模型行为的影响。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

