"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Nonlinear\">nonlinear functions</a>, and\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.BooleanVectors\">Boolean vectors</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Main Authors</h4>\r\n"
