msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors"
msgid "Library of functions operating on vectors"
msgstr "向量运算函数库"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Library content</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This library provides functions operating on vectors:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.toString\">toString</a>(v)\r\n"
"     - returns the string representation of vector v.</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.isEqual\">isEqual</a>(v1, v2)\r\n"
"     - returns true if vectors v1 and v2 have the same size and the same elements.</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.norm\">norm</a>(v,p)\r\n"
"     - returns the p-norm of vector v.</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.length\">length</a>(v)\r\n"
"     - returns the length of vector v (= norm(v,2), but inlined and therefore usable in\r\n"
"       symbolic manipulations)</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.normalize\">normalize</a>(v)\r\n"
"     - returns vector in direction of v with length = 1 and prevents\r\n"
"       zero-division for zero vector.</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.reverse\">reverse</a>(v)\r\n"
"     - reverses the vector elements of v.</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.sort\">sort</a>(v)\r\n"
"     - sorts the elements of vector v in ascending or descending order.</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.find\">find</a>(e, v)\r\n"
"     - returns the index of the first occurrence of scalar e in vector v.</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.interpolate\">interpolate</a>(x, y, xi)\r\n"
"     - returns the interpolated value in (x,y) that corresponds to xi.</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.relNodePositions\">relNodePositions</a>(nNodes)\r\n"
"     - returns a vector of relative node positions (0..1).</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices\">Matrices</a>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>库目录</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该库提供了对向量进行操作的函数：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.toString\">toString</a>(v)\r\n"
"     - 返回向量v的字符串表示。</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.isEqual\">isEqual</a>(v1, v2)\r\n"
"     - 如果向量v1和v2具有相同的大小和相同的元素，则返回true。</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.norm\">norm</a>(v,p)\r\n"
"     - 返回向量v的p-范数。</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.length\">length</a>(v)\r\n"
"     - 返回向量v的长度(即norm(v, 2)，但已内联，因此可用于符号操作)。</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.normalize\">normalize</a>(v)\r\n"
"     - 返回与v方向相同、长度为1的向量，并防止零向量出现除零错误。</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.reverse\">reverse</a>(v)\r\n"
"     - 反转向量v的元素顺序。</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.sort\">sort</a>(v)\r\n"
"     - 将向量v的元素按升序或降序排序。</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.find\">find</a>(e, v)\r\n"
"     - 返回标量e在向量v中首次出现的索引。</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.interpolate\">interpolate</a>(x, y, xi)\r\n"
"     - 返回在(x, y)中与xi对应插值的值。</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.relNodePositions\">relNodePositions</a>(nNodes)\r\n"
"     - 返回相对节点位置的向量(0..1)。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices\">Matrices</a>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.toString"
msgid "Convert a real vector in to a string representation"
msgstr "将实型向量转换为字符串表示形式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.toString"
msgid "Real vector"
msgstr "实型向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.toString"
msgid "Independent variable name used for printing"
msgstr "用于打印的独立变量名"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.toString"
msgid "Number of significant digits that are shown"
msgstr "显示的有效位数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.toString"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>toString</strong>(v);\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>toString</strong>(v,name=\"\",significantDigits=6);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Vectors.<strong>toString</strong>(v)</code>\" returns the string representation of vector <strong>v</strong>.\r\n"
"With the optional arguments \"name\" and \"significantDigits\" a name and the number of the digits are defined.\r\n"
"The default values of \"name\" and \"significantDigits\" are \"\" and 6 respectively. If name==\"\" (empty string) then the prefix \"&lt;name&gt; =\" is left out at the output-string.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v = {2.12, -4.34, -2.56, -1.67};\r\n"
"<strong>toString</strong>(v);\r\n"
"                       // = \"\r\n"
"                       //           2.12\r\n"
"                       //          -4.34\r\n"
"                       //          -2.56\r\n"
"                       //          -1.67\"\r\n"
"<strong>toString</strong>(v,\"vv\",1);\r\n"
"                       // = \"vv =\r\n"
"                       //           2\r\n"
"                       //          -4\r\n"
"                       //          -3\r\n"
"                       //          -2\"\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.toString\">Matrices.toString</a>,\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><h4>语法</h4><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >Vectors.toString(v);\r\n"
"Vectors.toString(v,name=\"\",significantDigits=6);\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4><p>\r\n"
"调用函数\"<code><strong>Vectors.toString(v)</strong></code>\"返回向量<strong>v</strong>的字符串表示形式。\r\n"
"通过可选参数\"name\"和\"significantDigits\"，定义了一个名称和有效位数。 \"name\"和\"significantDigits\"的默认值分别为\" \"和\"6\"。\r\n"
"如果name==\" \"(空字符串)，则前缀\"&lt;name&gt;=\"在输出字符串中被省略.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code>v = {2.12, -4.34, -2.56, -1.67};\r\n"
"toString(v);\r\n"
"// = \"\r\n"
"//           2.12\r\n"
"//          -4.34\r\n"
"//          -2.56\r\n"
"//          -1.67\"\r\n"
"toString(v,\"vv\",1);\r\n"
"// = \"vv =\r\n"
"//           2\r\n"
"//          -4\r\n"
"//          -3\r\n"
"//          -2\"\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4><p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.toString\" target=\"\">Matrices.toString</a>,\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.toString"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.isEqual"
msgid "Determine if two Real vectors are numerically identical"
msgstr "确定两个实型向量在数值上是否相同"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.isEqual"
msgid "First vector"
msgstr "第一个向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.isEqual"
msgid "Second vector (may have different length as v1)"
msgstr "第二个向量(长度可能与v1不同)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.isEqual"
msgid "Two elements e1 and e2 of the two vectors are identical if abs(e1-e2) <= eps"
msgstr "如果abs(e1-e2) <= eps，则两个向量中的两个元素e1和e2相同"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.isEqual"
msgid "= true, if vectors have the same length and the same elements"
msgstr "= true，如果两个向量具有相同的长度和元素"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.isEqual"
msgid "Dimension of vector v1"
msgstr "向量v1的维数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.isEqual"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>isEqual</strong>(v1, v2);\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>isEqual</strong>(v1, v2, eps=0);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Vectors.isEqual(v1, v2)</code>\" returns <strong>true</strong>,\r\n"
"if the two Real vectors v1 and v2 have the same dimensions and\r\n"
"the same elements. Otherwise the function\r\n"
"returns <strong>false</strong>. Two elements e1 and e2 of the two vectors\r\n"
"are checked on equality by the test \"abs(e1-e2) &le; eps\", where \"eps\"\r\n"
"can be provided as third argument of the function. Default is \"eps = 0\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Real v1[3] = {1, 2, 3};\r\n"
"  Real v2[4] = {1, 2, 3, 4};\r\n"
"  Real v3[3] = {1, 2, 3.0001};\r\n"
"  Boolean result;\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"  result := Vectors.isEqual(v1,v2);     // = <strong>false</strong>\r\n"
"  result := Vectors.isEqual(v1,v3);     // = <strong>false</strong>\r\n"
"  result := Vectors.isEqual(v1,v1);     // = <strong>true</strong>\r\n"
"  result := Vectors.isEqual(v1,v3,0.1); // = <strong>true</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.find\">Vectors.find</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.isEqual\">Matrices.isEqual</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.isEqual\">Strings.isEqual</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><h4>语法</h4><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >Vectors.isEqual(v1, v2);\r\n"
"Vectors.isEqual(v1, v2, eps=0);\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>说明</h4><p>\r\n"
"调用函数\"<code>Vectors.isEqual(v1, v2)</code>\"如果两个实型向量v1和v2有相同的维数和相同的元素，返回<strong>true</strong> ，否则函数返回<strong>false</strong>。 两个向量的两个元素e1和e2通过检查\"abs(e1-e2) ≤eps\"，其中\"eps\" 可以作为函数的第三个参数提供。默认值为\"eps = 0\"。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >Real v1[3] = {1, 2, 3};\r\n"
"Real v2[4] = {1, 2, 3, 4};\r\n"
"Real v3[3] = {1, 2, 3.0001};\r\n"
"Boolean result;\r\n"
"algorithm\r\n"
"result := Vectors.isEqual(v1,v2);     // = false\r\n"
"result := Vectors.isEqual(v1,v3);     // = false\r\n"
"result := Vectors.isEqual(v1,v1);     // = true\r\n"
"result := Vectors.isEqual(v1,v3,0.1); // = true\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4><p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.find\" target=\"\">Vectors.find</a>&nbsp;, <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.isEqual\" target=\"\">Matrices.isEqual</a>&nbsp;, <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.isEqual\" target=\"\">Strings.isEqual</a>&nbsp;\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.norm"
msgid "Return the p-norm of a vector"
msgstr "返回向量的p-范数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.norm"
msgid "Real vector"
msgstr "实型向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.norm"
msgid "Type of p-norm (often used: 1, 2, or Modelica.Constants.inf)"
msgstr "p-范数类型(常用：1、2或Modelica.Constants.inf)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.norm"
msgid "p-norm of vector v"
msgstr "向量v的p-范数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.norm"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(v);\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(v,p=2);   // 1 &le; p &le; &#8734;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(v)</code>\" returns the\r\n"
"<strong>Euclidean norm</strong> \"<code>sqrt(v*v)</code>\" of vector v.\r\n"
"With the optional\r\n"
"second argument \"p\", any other p-norm can be computed:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<center>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Vectors/vectorNorm.png\" alt=\"function Vectors.norm\">\r\n"
"</center>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Besides the Euclidean norm (p=2), also the 1-norm and the\r\n"
"infinity-norm are sometimes used:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>1-norm</strong></td>\r\n"
"      <td>= sum(abs(v))</td>\r\n"
"      <td><strong>norm</strong>(v,1)</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>2-norm</strong></td>\r\n"
"      <td>= sqrt(v*v)</td>\r\n"
"      <td><strong>norm</strong>(v) or <strong>norm</strong>(v,2)</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>infinity-norm</strong></td>\r\n"
"      <td>= max(abs(v))</td>\r\n"
"      <td><strong>norm</strong>(v,Modelica.Constants.<strong>inf</strong>)</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, for any vector norm the following inequality holds:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v1+v2,p) &le; <strong>norm</strong>(v1,p) + <strong>norm</strong>(v2,p)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v = {2, -4, -2, -1};\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,1);    // = 9\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,2);    // = 5\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v);      // = 5\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,10.5); // = 4.00052597412635\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,Modelica.Constants.inf);  // = 4\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.norm\">Matrices.norm</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(v);\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(v,p=2);   // 1 &le; p &le; &#8734;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用函数\"<code>Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(v)</code>\"返回向量v的<strong>欧几里得范数</strong>\"sqrt(v*v)\"。\r\n"
"第二个参数p作为可选参数，任何其他p-范数都可以计算:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<center>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Vectors/vectorNorm.png\" alt=\"function Vectors.norm\">\r\n"
"</center>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"除了欧几里得范数(p=2)，有时还会使用1-范数和无穷范数：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><td><strong>1-norm</strong></td>\r\n"
"    <td>= sum(abs(v))</td>\r\n"
"    <td><strong>norm</strong>(v,1)</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><strong>2-norm</strong></td>\r\n"
"    <td>= sqrt(v*v)</td>\r\n"
"    <td><strong>norm</strong>(v) or <strong>norm</strong>(v,2)</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td><strong>infinity-norm</strong></td>\r\n"
"    <td>= max(abs(v))</td>\r\n"
"    <td><strong>norm</strong>(v,Modelica.Constants.<strong>inf</strong>)</td>\r\n"
"</tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意，对于任何向量范数，以下不等式成立：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v1+v2,p) &le; <strong>norm</strong>(v1,p) + <strong>norm</strong>(v2,p)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v = {2, -4, -2, -1};\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,1);    // = 9\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,2);    // = 5\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v);      // = 5\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,10.5); // = 4.00052597412635\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,Modelica.Constants.inf);  // = 4\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.norm\">Matrices.norm</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.length"
msgid "Return length of a vector (better as norm(), if further symbolic processing is performed)"
msgstr "返回向量的长度(如果执行进一步的符号处理，比使用norm()好)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.length"
msgid "Real vector"
msgstr "实型向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.length"
msgid "Length of vector v"
msgstr "向量v的长度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.length"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>length</strong>(v);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Vectors.<strong>length</strong>(v)</code>\" returns the\r\n"
"<strong>Euclidean length</strong> \"<code>sqrt(v*v)</code>\" of vector v.\r\n"
"The function call is equivalent to Vectors.norm(v). The advantage of\r\n"
"length(v) over norm(v) is that function length(..) is implemented\r\n"
"in one statement and therefore the function is usually automatically\r\n"
"inlined. Further symbolic processing is therefore possible, which is\r\n"
"not the case with function norm(..).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v = {2, -4, -2, -1};\r\n"
"<strong>length</strong>(v);  // = 5\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.norm\">Vectors.norm</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>length</strong>(v);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用函数\"<code>Vectors.<strong>length</strong>(v)</code>\"返回向量v的<strong>欧几里得长度</strong> \"<code>sqrt(v*v)</code>\"。\r\n"
"该函数调用等价于Vectors.norm(v)。\r\n"
"与norm(v)相比，length(v)的优势在于函数length(..)是通过一个语句实现的，因此该函数通常会被自动内联。\r\n"
"进一步的符号处理是可能的，而在函数norm(..)中则不行。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v = {2, -4, -2, -1};\r\n"
"<strong>length</strong>(v);  // = 5\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.norm\">Vectors.norm</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.normalize"
msgid "Return normalized vector such that length = 1 and prevent zero-division for zero vector"
msgstr "返回归一化的向量，使得其长度为 1，并且防止零向量出现除零错误"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.normalize"
msgid "Real vector"
msgstr "实型向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.normalize"
msgid "if |v| < eps then result = v/eps"
msgstr "如果|v| < eps则result = v/eps"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.normalize"
msgid "Input vector v normalized to length=1"
msgstr "输入向量v归一化为length = 1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.normalize"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>normalize</strong>(v);\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>normalize</strong>(v,eps=100*Modelica.Constants.eps);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Vectors.<strong>normalize</strong>(v)</code>\" returns the\r\n"
"<strong>unit vector</strong> \"<code>v/length(v)</code>\" of vector v.\r\n"
"If length(v) is close to zero (more precisely, if length(v) &lt; eps),\r\n"
"v/eps is returned in order to avoid\r\n"
"a division by zero. For many applications this is useful, because\r\n"
"often the unit vector <strong>e</strong> = <strong>v</strong>/length(<strong>v</strong>) is used to compute\r\n"
"a vector x*<strong>e</strong>, where the scalar x is in the order of length(<strong>v</strong>),\r\n"
"i.e., x*<strong>e</strong> is small, when length(<strong>v</strong>) is small and then\r\n"
"it is fine to replace <strong>e</strong> by <strong>v</strong> to avoid a division by zero.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Since the function has the \"Inline\" annotation, it\r\n"
"is usually inlined and symbolic processing is applied.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>normalize</strong>({1,2,3});  // = {0.267, 0.534, 0.802}\r\n"
"<strong>normalize</strong>({0,0,0});  // = {0,0,0}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.length\">Vectors.length</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.normalize\">Vectors.normalizeWithAssert</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>normalize</strong>(v);\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>normalize</strong>(v,eps=100*Modelica.Constants.eps);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用函数\"<code>Vectors.<strong>normalize</strong>(v)</code>\"返回向量v的<strong>单位向量</strong> \"<code>v/length(v)</code>\"。\r\n"
"如果length(v)接近于零(更准确地说，如果length(v) < eps),返回v是为了避免出现除零错误。\r\n"
"对于许多应用来说，这是很有用的，因为通常使用单位向量<strong>e</strong> = <strong>v</strong>/length(<strong>v</strong>)来计算一个向量x * <strong>e</strong>，其中标量 x 的大小与 length(v) 的数量级相当，\r\n"
"也就是说，当length(<strong>v</strong>)较小时，x * <strong>e</strong>很小，此时可以用<strong>v</strong>替代<strong>e</strong>来避免除零错误。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"由于该函数是通过一个语句实现的，因此通常会被内联处理，因此可以进行符号处理。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>normalize</strong>({1,2,3});  // = {0.267, 0.534, 0.802}\r\n"
"<strong>normalize</strong>({0,0,0});  // = {0,0,0}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>另外</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.length\">Vectors.length</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.normalize\">Vectors.normalizeWithAssert</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.normalizeWithAssert"
msgid "Return normalized vector such that length = 1 (trigger an assert for zero vector)"
msgstr "返回归一化的向量，使长度为1(触发零向量断言)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.normalizeWithAssert"
msgid "Real vector"
msgstr "实型向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.normalizeWithAssert"
msgid "Input vector v normalized to length=1"
msgstr "输入向量v归一化为length = 1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.normalizeWithAssert"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>normalizeWithAssert</strong>(v);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Vectors.<strong>normalizeWithAssert</strong>(v)</code>\" returns the\r\n"
"<strong>unit vector</strong> \"<code>v/sqrt(v*v)</code>\" of vector v.\r\n"
"If vector v is a zero vector, an assert is triggered.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Since the function has the \"Inline\" annotation, it\r\n"
"is usually inlined and symbolic processing is applied.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>normalizeWithAssert</strong>({1,2,3});  // = {0.267, 0.534, 0.802}\r\n"
"<strong>normalizeWithAssert</strong>({0,0,0});  // error (an assert is triggered)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.length\">Vectors.length</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.normalize\">Vectors.normalize</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>normalizeWithAssert</strong>(v);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用函数\"<code>Vectors.<strong>normalizeWithAssert</strong>(v)</code>\"返回<strong>单位向量</strong> \"<code>v/sqrt(v*v)</code>\"。\r\n"
"如果向量v是零向量，则触发断言。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"由于该函数具有\"Inline\"注释，因此它通常是内联的，可以进行符号处理。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>normalizeWithAssert</strong>({1,2,3});  // = {0.267, 0.534, 0.802}\r\n"
"<strong>normalizeWithAssert</strong>({0,0,0});  // error (an assert is triggered)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.length\">Vectors.length</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.normalize\">Vectors.normalize</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.reverse"
msgid "Reverse vector elements (e.g., v[1] becomes last element)"
msgstr "反转向量元素(例如，v[1]成为最后一个元素)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.reverse"
msgid "Real vector"
msgstr "实型向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.reverse"
msgid "Elements of vector v in reversed order"
msgstr "向量v的元素按相反顺序排列"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.reverse"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>reverse</strong>(v);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Vectors.<strong>reverse</strong>(v)</code>\" returns the\r\n"
"vector elements in reverse order.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>reverse</strong>({1,2,3,4});  // = {4,3,2,1}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>reverse</strong>(v);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>说明</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用函数\"<code>Vectors.<strong>reverse</strong>(v)</code>\"返回相反顺序的向量元素.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>reverse</strong>({1,2,3,4});  // = {4,3,2,1}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.sort"
msgid "Sort elements of vector in ascending or descending order"
msgstr "按升序或降序对向量元素排序"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.sort"
msgid "Real vector to be sorted"
msgstr "要排序的实型向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.sort"
msgid "= true, if ascending order, otherwise descending order"
msgstr "= true，如果升序，否则降序"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.sort"
msgid "Sorted vector"
msgstr "排序后的向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.sort"
msgid "sorted_v = v[indices]"
msgstr "sorted_v = v[indices]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.sort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"           sorted_v = Vectors.<strong>sort</strong>(v);\r\n"
"(sorted_v, indices) = Vectors.<strong>sort</strong>(v, ascending=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>sort</strong>(..) sorts a Real vector v\r\n"
"in ascending order and returns the result in sorted_v.\r\n"
"If the optional argument \"ascending\" is <strong>false</strong>, the vector\r\n"
"is sorted in descending order. In the optional second\r\n"
"output argument the indices of the sorted vector with respect\r\n"
"to the original vector are given, such that sorted_v = v[indices].\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(v2, i2) := Vectors.sort({-1, 8, 3, 6, 2});\r\n"
"     -> v2 = {-1, 2, 3, 6, 8}\r\n"
"        i2 = {1, 5, 3, 4, 2}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"         sorted_v = Vectors.<strong>sort</strong>(v);\r\n"
"(sorted_v, indices) = Vectors.<strong>sort</strong>(v, ascending=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>sort</strong>(..)对实型向量v进行升序排序，并将结果返回在sorted_v中。\r\n"
"如果可选参数\"ascending\"为<strong>false</strong>，则向量按降序排序。\r\n"
"在可选的第二个输出参数中，给出排序后的向量相对于原始向量的索引，使得sorted_v = v[indices]。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(v2, i2) := Vectors.sort({-1, 8, 3, 6, 2});\r\n"
"   -> v2 = {-1, 2, 3, 6, 8}\r\n"
"      i2 = {1, 5, 3, 4, 2}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.find"
msgid "Find element in a vector"
msgstr "查找矢量中的元素"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.find"
msgid "Search for e"
msgstr "搜索 e"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.find"
msgid "Real vector"
msgstr "真实矢量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.find"
msgid "Element e is equal to a element v[i] of vector v if abs(e-v[i]) <= eps"
msgstr "如果 abs(e-v[i]) <= eps，元素 e 等于向量 v 的元素 v[i]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.find"
msgid "v[result] = e (first occurrence of e); result=0, if not found"
msgstr "v[result] = e（e 的首次出现）；如果未找到，则 result=0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.find"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>find</strong>(e, v);\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>find</strong>(e, v, eps=0);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Vectors.find(e, v)</code>\" returns the index of the first occurrence of input e in vector <strong>v</strong>.\r\n"
"The test of equality is performed by \"abs(e-v[i]) &le; eps\", where \"eps\"\r\n"
"can be provided as third argument of the function. Default is \"eps = 0\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Real v[3] = {1, 2, 3};\r\n"
"  Real e1 = 2;\r\n"
"  Real e2 = 3.01;\r\n"
"  Boolean result;\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"  result := Vectors.find(e1,v);          // = <strong>2</strong>\r\n"
"  result := Vectors.find(e2,v);          // = <strong>0</strong>\r\n"
"  result := Vectors.find(e2,v,eps=0.1);  // = <strong>3</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.isEqual\">Vectors.isEqual</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>find</strong>(e, v);\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>find</strong>(e, v, eps=0);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用函数\"<code>Vectors.find(e, v)</code>\"返回输入e在向量<strong>v</strong>中第一次出现的索引。\r\n"
"等式检验由\"abs(e - v[i]) &le;eps\"，其中\"eps\"可以作为函数的第三个参数提供。默认值为 \"eps = 0\"。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Real v[3] = {1, 2, 3};\r\n"
"Real e1 = 2;\r\n"
"Real e2 = 3.01;\r\n"
"Boolean result;\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"result := Vectors.find(e1,v);          // = <strong>2</strong>\r\n"
"result := Vectors.find(e2,v);          // = <strong>0</strong>\r\n"
"result := Vectors.find(e2,v,eps=0.1);  // = <strong>3</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.isEqual\">Vectors.isEqual</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.interpolate"
msgid "Interpolate linearly in a vector"
msgstr "对向量进行线性插值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.interpolate"
msgid "Abscissa table vector (strict monotonically increasing values required)"
msgstr "横坐标表向量(要求严格单调递增的值)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.interpolate"
msgid "Ordinate table vector"
msgstr "纵坐标表向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.interpolate"
msgid "Desired abscissa value"
msgstr "期望的横坐标值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.interpolate"
msgid "Index used in last search"
msgstr "上次搜索时使用的索引"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.interpolate"
msgid "Ordinate value corresponding to xi"
msgstr "与xi对应的纵坐标值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.interpolate"
msgid "xi is in the interval x[iNew] <= xi < x[iNew+1]"
msgstr "xi位于区间x[iNew] <= xi < x[iNew+1]中"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.interpolate"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// Real    x[:], y[:], xi, yi;\r\n"
"// Integer iLast, iNew;\r\n"
"        yi = Vectors.<strong>interpolate</strong>(x,y,xi);\r\n"
"(yi, iNew) = Vectors.<strong>interpolate</strong>(x,y,xi,iLast=1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Vectors.interpolate(x,y,xi)</code>\" interpolates\r\n"
"<strong>linearly</strong> in vectors\r\n"
"(x,y) and returns the value yi that corresponds to xi. Vector x[:] must consist\r\n"
"of monotonically increasing values. If xi &lt; x[1] or &gt; x[end], then\r\n"
"extrapolation takes places through the first or last two x[:] values, respectively.\r\n"
"If the x and y vectors have length 1, then always y[1] is returned.\r\n"
"The search for the interval x[iNew] &le; xi &lt; x[iNew+1] starts at the optional\r\n"
"input argument \"iLast\". The index \"iNew\" is returned as output argument.\r\n"
"The usage of \"iLast\" and \"iNew\" is useful to increase the efficiency of the call,\r\n"
"if many interpolations take place.\r\n"
"If x has two or more identical values then interpolation utilizes the x-value\r\n"
"with the largest index.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Real x1[:] = { 0,  2,  4,  6,  8, 10};\r\n"
"  Real x2[:] = { 1,  2,  3,  3,  4,  5};\r\n"
"  Real y[:]  = {10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60};\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"  (yi, iNew) := Vectors.interpolate(x1,y,5);  // yi = 35, iNew=3\r\n"
"  (yi, iNew) := Vectors.interpolate(x2,y,4);  // yi = 50, iNew=5\r\n"
"  (yi, iNew) := Vectors.interpolate(x2,y,3);  // yi = 40, iNew=4\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// Real    x[:], y[:], xi, yi;\r\n"
"// Integer iLast, iNew;\r\n"
"    yi = Vectors.<strong>interpolate</strong>(x,y,xi);\r\n"
"(yi, iNew) = Vectors.<strong>interpolate</strong>(x,y,xi,iLast=1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用函数\"<code>Vectors.interpolate(x,y,xi)</code>\"在向量(, y)中进行线性插值，并返回与xi对应的值yi。\r\n"
"向量x[:]必须由单调递增的值构成。如果xi < x[1]或xi > x[end]，则分别通过x[:]中的第一个或最后两个值进行外推。\r\n"
"如果x和y向量的长度为1，则始终返回y[1]。搜索区间x[iNew] ≤ xi < x[iNew+1]从可选输入参数 \"iLast\"开始。\r\n"
"索引\"iNew\"将作为输出参数返回。如果进行多次插值，使用\"iLast\"和\"iNew\"可以提高调用效率。\r\n"
"如果x中有两个或更多相同的值，则插值使用具有最大索引的x值。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Real x1[:] = { 0,  2,  4,  6,  8, 10};\r\n"
"Real x2[:] = { 1,  2,  3,  3,  4,  5};\r\n"
"Real y[:]  = {10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60};\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"(yi, iNew) := Vectors.interpolate(x1,y,5);  // yi = 35, iNew=3\r\n"
"(yi, iNew) := Vectors.interpolate(x2,y,4);  // yi = 50, iNew=5\r\n"
"(yi, iNew) := Vectors.interpolate(x2,y,3);  // yi = 40, iNew=4\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.relNodePositions"
msgid "Return vector of relative node positions (0..1)"
msgstr "返回节点相对位置向量(0...1)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.relNodePositions"
msgid "Number of nodes (including node at left and right position)"
msgstr "节点数(包括位于左和右位置的节点)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.relNodePositions"
msgid "Relative node positions"
msgstr "节点的相对位置"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.relNodePositions"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>relNodePositions</strong>(nNodes);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>relNodePositions(nNodes)</code>\" returns a vector\r\n"
"with the relative positions of the nodes of a discretized pipe with nNodes nodes (including the node\r\n"
"at the left and at the right side of the pipe), see next figure:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Vectors/relNodePositions.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Real xsi[7];\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"  xsi = relNodePositions(7);  // xsi = {0, 0.1, 0.3, 0.5, 0.7, 0.9, 1}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.PipeWithScalarField\">MultiBody.Visualizers.PipeWithScalarField</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>relNodePositions</strong>(nNodes);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用函数\"<code>relNodePositions(nNodes)</code>\"返回一个向量，\r\n"
"包含具有nNodes个节点(包括管道左侧和右侧节点)的离散化管道节点的相对位置，参见下图：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<div>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Vectors/relNodePositions.png\">\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Real xsi[7];\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"xsi = relNodePositions(7);  // xsi = {0, 0.1, 0.3, 0.5, 0.7, 0.9, 1}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Visualizers.PipeWithScalarField\">MultiBody.Visualizers.PipeWithScalarField</a>\r\n"
