msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Vectors.Utilities"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains utility functions that are utilized by higher level vector\r\n"
"and matrix functions. These functions are usually not useful for an end-user.\r\n"
