"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.BooleanVectors.firstTrueIndex"
msgid "Returns the index of the first true element of a Boolean vector"
msgstr "返回布尔向量的第一个真元素的索引"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.BooleanVectors.firstTrueIndex"
msgid "Boolean vector"
msgstr "布尔向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.BooleanVectors.firstTrueIndex"
msgid "Index of the first true element of b"
msgstr "b的第一个真元素的索引"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.BooleanVectors.firstTrueIndex"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>firstTrueIndex</strong>(b);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Returns the index of the first <strong>true</strong> element of the Boolean vector b.\r\n"
"If no element is <strong>true</strong> or b is an empty vector (i.e., size(b,1)=0) the\r\n"
"function returns 0.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Boolean b1[3] = {false, false, false};\r\n"
"  Boolean b2[3] = {false, true, false};\r\n"
"  Boolean b3[4] = {false, true, false, true};\r\n"
"  Integer r1, r2, r3;\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"  r1 = firstTrueIndex(b1);  // r1 = 0\r\n"
"  r2 = firstTrueIndex(b2);  // r2 = 2\r\n"
"  r3 = firstTrueIndex(b3);  // r3 = 2\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
