msgid "Solve linear equation A*X = B (exactly if possible, or otherwise in a least square sense; A may be non-square and may be rank deficient)"
msgstr "解线性方程A * X = B(如果可能则精确解，否则以最小二乘法解；A可能是非方阵并且可能是秩亏的)"

