msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.leastSquares2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"X = Matrices.<strong>leastSquares2</strong>(A,B);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Returns a solution of equation A*X = B in a least\r\n"
"square sense (A may be rank deficient):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"minimize | A*X - B |\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Several different cases can be distinguished (note, <strong>rank</strong> is an\r\n"
"output argument of this function):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>size(A,1) = size(A,2)</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p> A solution is returned for a regular, as well as a singular matrix A:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>rank</strong> = size(A,1):<br>\r\n"
"     A is <strong>regular</strong> and the returned solution X fulfills the equation\r\n"
"     A*X = B uniquely.</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <strong>rank</strong> &lt; size(A,1):<br>\r\n"
"     A is <strong>singular</strong> and no unique solution for equation A*X = B exists.\r\n"
"     <ul>\r\n"
"     <li>  If an infinite number of solutions exists, the one is selected that fulfills\r\n"
"           the equation and at the same time has the minimum norm |x| for all solution\r\n"
"           vectors that fulfill the equation.</li>\r\n"
"     <li>  If no solution exists, X is selected such that |A*X - B| is as small as\r\n"
"           possible (but A*X - B is not zero).</li>\r\n"
"     </ul></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>size(A,1) &gt; size(A,2):</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The equation A*X = B has no unique solution. The solution X is selected such that\r\n"
"|A*X - B| is as small as possible. If rank = size(A,2), this minimum norm solution is\r\n"
"unique. If rank &lt; size(A,2), there are an infinite number of solutions leading to the\r\n"
"same minimum value of |A*X - B|. From these infinite number of solutions, the one with the\r\n"
"minimum norm |X| is selected. This gives a unique solution that minimizes both\r\n"
"|A*X - B| and |X|.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>size(A,1) &lt; size(A,2):</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>rank</strong> = size(A,1):<br>\r\n"
"     There are an infinite number of solutions that fulfill the equation A*X = B.\r\n"
"     From this infinite number, the unique solution is selected that minimizes |X|.\r\n"
"     </li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <strong>rank</strong> &lt; size(A,1):<br>\r\n"
"     There is either no solution of equation A*X = B, or there are again an infinite\r\n"
"     number of solutions. The unique solution X is returned that minimizes\r\n"
"      both |A*X - B| and |X|.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, the solution is computed with the LAPACK function \"dgelsy\",\r\n"
"i.e., QR or LQ factorization of A with column pivoting.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Algorithmic details</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function first computes a QR factorization with column pivoting:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A * P = Q * [ R11 R12 ]\r\n"
"            [  0  R22 ]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"with R11 defined as the largest leading submatrix whose estimated\r\n"
"condition number is less than 1/rcond.  The order of R11, <strong>rank</strong>,\r\n"
"is the effective rank of A.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Then, R22 is considered to be negligible, and R12 is annihilated\r\n"
"by orthogonal transformations from the right, arriving at the\r\n"
"complete orthogonal factorization:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A * P = Q * [ T11 0 ] * Z\r\n"
"            [  0  0 ]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The minimum-norm solution is then\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"X = P * Z' [ inv(T11)*Q1'*B ]\r\n"
"           [        0       ]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where Q1 consists of the first \"rank\" columns of Q.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.leastSquares\">Matrices.leastSquares</a>\r\n"
"(same as leastSquares2, but with a right hand side vector),<br>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve2\">Matrices.solve2</a>\r\n"
"(for square, regular matrices A)\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"X = Matrices.<strong>leastSquares2</strong>(A,B);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"返回方程A * X = B的最小二乘解(A可能是秩亏的)：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"minimize | A*X - B |\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"可以区分几种不同的情况(请注意，<strong>rank</strong>是该函数的输出参数)：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>size(A,1) = size(A,2)</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p> 对于常规矩阵和奇异矩阵A都返回解：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>rank</strong> = size(A,1):<br>\r\n"
"A是<strong>常规矩阵</strong>，返回的解X唯一地满足方程A * X = B。\r\n"
"</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <strong>rank</strong> &lt; size(A,1):<br>\r\n"
"A是<strong>奇异矩阵</strong>，方程A * X = B没有唯一解。\r\n"
" <ul>\r\n"
" <li>如果有无穷多个解，则选择满足方程的解，并且这个解在所有满足方程的解中具有最小的范数|X|。</li>\r\n"
" <li>如果没有解，选择使|A * X - B|尽可能小的X(但A * X - B不为零)。</li>\r\n"
" </ul></li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>size(A,1) &gt; size(A,2):</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"方程A * X = B没有唯一解。选择使|A * X - B|尽可能小的解X。\r\n"
"如果rank = size(A,2)，则这个最小范数解是唯一的。\r\n"
"如果rank < size(A,2)，则存在无穷多个解，它们导致相同的|A * X - B|的最小值。\r\n"
"在这些无穷多个解中，选择具有最小范数|X|的解。这会得到一个唯一解，同时最小化|A * X - B|和|X|。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>size(A,1) &lt; size(A,2):</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>rank</strong> = size(A,1):<br>\r\n"
"存在无穷多个解可以满足方程A * X = B。从这些解中，选择唯一的解，该解最小化|X|。\r\n"
" </li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> <strong>rank</strong> &lt; size(A,1):<br>\r\n"
"方程A * X = B要么没有解，要么存在无穷多个解。返回唯一的解X，该解最小化|A * X - B|和|X|。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意，解是通过LAPACK函数\"dgelsy\"计算的，即通过对A进行列主元的QR或LQ分解。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>算法细节</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数首先计算带列主元的QR分解：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A * P = Q * [ R11 R12 ]\r\n"
"        [  0  R22 ]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中，R11被定义为最大的领先子矩阵，其估计条件数小于1/rcond。R11的阶数，<strong>rank</strong>，就是A的有效秩。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"然后，认为R22可忽略不计，通过右侧的正交变换将R12消除，得到完整的正交分解：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A * P = Q * [ T11 0 ] * Z\r\n"
"        [  0  0 ]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"然后，最小范数解为：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"X = P * Z' [ inv(T11)*Q1'*B ]\r\n"
"       [        0       ]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中，Q1是Q的前rank列。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另外</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.leastSquares\">Matrices.leastSquares</a>\r\n"
"(same as leastSquares2, but with a right hand side vector),<br>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve2\">Matrices.solve2</a>\r\n"
"(for square, regular matrices A)\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.equalityLeastSquares"
msgid "Solve a linear equality constrained least squares problem"
msgstr "解线性等式约束最小二乘问题"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.equalityLeastSquares"
msgid "Minimize |A*x - a|^2"
msgstr "最小化|A*x - A |^2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.equalityLeastSquares"
msgid "Subject to B*x=b"
msgstr "受制于B*x= B"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.equalityLeastSquares"
msgid "Solution vector"
msgstr "解向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.equalityLeastSquares"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"x = Matrices.<strong>equalityLeastSquares</strong>(A,a,B,b);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns the\r\n"
"solution <strong>x</strong> of the linear equality-constrained least squares problem:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"min|<strong>A</strong>*<strong>x</strong> - <strong>a</strong>|^2 over <strong>x</strong>, subject to <strong>B</strong>*<strong>x</strong> = <strong>b</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"It is required that the dimensions of A and B fulfill the following\r\n"
"relationship:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"size(B,1) &le; size(A,2) &le; size(A,1) + size(B,1)\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, the solution is computed with the LAPACK function \"dgglse\"\r\n"
"using the generalized RQ factorization under the assumptions that\r\n"
"B has full row rank (= size(B,1)) and the matrix [A;B] has\r\n"
"full column rank (= size(A,2)). In this case, the problem\r\n"
"has a unique solution.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"x = Matrices.<strong>equalityLeastSquares</strong>(A,a,B,b);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数返回线性等式约束最小二乘问题的解<strong>x</strong>：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"min|<strong>A</strong>*<strong>x</strong> - <strong>A</strong> |^2 作用在<strong>x</strong>，使得<strong>B</strong>*<strong>x</strong> = <strong>B</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"要求矩阵A和B的维度满足以下关系：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"size(B,1) &le; size(A,2) &le; size(A,1) + size(B,1)\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"请注意，解是通过LAPACK函数\"dgglse\"计算的，该函数使用广义RQ分解，并假设B是满行秩(= size(B,1))，\r\n"
"且矩阵 [A;B]是满列秩(= size(A,2))。在这种情况下，问题具有唯一解。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU"
msgid "LU decomposition of square or rectangular matrix"
msgstr "方形或矩形矩阵的LU分解"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU"
msgid "Square or rectangular matrix"
msgstr "方形或矩形矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU"
msgid "L,U factors (used with LU_solve(..))"
msgstr "L,U因子(与LU_solve(..)一起使用)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU"
msgid "Pivot indices (used with LU_solve(..))"
msgstr "枢轴索引(与LU_solve(..)一起使用)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU"
msgid "Information"
msgstr "信息"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(LU, pivots)       = Matrices.<strong>LU</strong>(A);\r\n"
"(LU, pivots, info) = Matrices.<strong>LU</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function call returns the\r\n"
"LU decomposition of a \"Real[m,n]\" matrix A, i.e.,\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>P</strong>*<strong>L</strong>*<strong>U</strong> = <strong>A</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where <strong>P</strong> is a permutation matrix (implicitly\r\n"
"defined by vector <code>pivots</code>),\r\n"
"<strong>L</strong> is a lower triangular matrix with unit\r\n"
"diagonal elements (lower trapezoidal if m &gt; n), and\r\n"
"<strong>U</strong> is an upper triangular matrix (upper trapezoidal if m &lt; n).\r\n"
"Matrices <strong>L</strong> and <strong>U</strong> are stored in the returned\r\n"
"matrix <code>LU</code> (the diagonal of <strong>L</strong> is not stored).\r\n"
"With the companion function\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve\">Matrices.LU_solve</a>,\r\n"
"this decomposition can be used to solve\r\n"
"linear systems (<strong>P</strong>*<strong>L</strong>*<strong>U</strong>)*<strong>x</strong> = <strong>b</strong> with different right\r\n"
"hand side vectors <strong>b</strong>. If a linear system of equations with\r\n"
"just one right hand side vector <strong>b</strong> shall be solved, it is\r\n"
"more convenient to just use the function\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The optional third (Integer) output argument has the following meaning:</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><td>info = 0:</td>\r\n"
"      <td>successful exit</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>info &gt; 0:</td>\r\n"
"      <td>if info = i, U[i,i] is exactly zero. The factorization\r\n"
"          has been completed,<br>\r\n"
"          but the factor U is exactly\r\n"
"          singular, and division by zero will occur<br> if it is used\r\n"
"          to solve a system of equations.</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The LU factorization is computed\r\n"
"with the LAPACK function \"dgetrf\",\r\n"
"i.e., by Gaussian elimination using partial pivoting\r\n"
"with row interchanges. Vector \"pivots\" are the\r\n"
"pivot indices, i.e., for 1 &le; i &le; min(m,n), row i of\r\n"
"matrix A was interchanged with row pivots[i].\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Real A[3,3] = [1,2,3;\r\n"
"                 3,4,5;\r\n"
"                 2,1,4];\r\n"
"  Real b1[3] = {10,22,12};\r\n"
"  Real b2[3] = { 7,13,10};\r\n"
"  Real    LU[3,3];\r\n"
"  Integer pivots[3];\r\n"
"  Real    x1[3];\r\n"
"  Real    x2[3];\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"  (LU, pivots) := Matrices.LU(A);\r\n"
"  x1 := Matrices.LU_solve(LU, pivots, b1);  // x1 = {3,2,1}\r\n"
"  x2 := Matrices.LU_solve(LU, pivots, b2);  // x2 = {1,0,2}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve\">Matrices.LU_solve</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>,\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(LU, pivots)       = Matrices.<strong>LU</strong>(A);\r\n"
"(LU, pivots, info) = Matrices.<strong>LU</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数调用返回一个\"Real[m,n]\"矩阵A的LU分解，即：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>P</strong>*<strong>L</strong>*<strong>U</strong> = <strong>A</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中，<strong>P</strong>是一个置换矩阵(由向量pivots隐式定义)，<strong>L</strong>是一个下三角矩阵，具有单位对角元素(当m > n时为下梯形矩阵)，\r\n"
"<strong>U</strong>是一个上三角矩阵(当m < n时为上梯形矩阵)。\r\n"
"矩阵<strong>L</strong>和<strong>U</strong>存储在返回的矩阵<code>LU</code>中(<strong>L</strong>的对角线元素不存储)。\r\n"
"结合函数<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve\">Matrices.LU_solve</a>，\r\n"
"此分解可以用来求解线性系统(<strong>P</strong>*<strong>L</strong>*<strong>U</strong>)*<strong>x</strong> = <strong>b</strong>，其中右侧向量<strong>b</strong>可以不同。\r\n"
"如果只是求解一个右侧向量<strong>b</strong>的线性方程组，更方便的做法是直接使用<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>函数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"可选的第三个(整数)输出参数含义如下：</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><td>info = 0:</td>\r\n"
"  <td>成功退出</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>info &gt; 0:</td>\r\n"
"  <td>如果info = i, 则U[i,i]恰好为零。分解已完成，\r\n"
"但因子U恰好是奇异的，若用于求解方程组，将发生除以零的情况。</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"LU分解是通过LAPACK函数\"dgetrf\"计算的，即通过高斯消元法使用部分主元法进行行交换。\r\n"
"向量\"pivots\"是主元索引，即对于1≤i≤min(m,n)，矩阵A的第i行与第pivots[i]行进行了交换。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Real A[3,3] = [1,2,3;\r\n"
"             3,4,5;\r\n"
"             2,1,4];\r\n"
"Real b1[3] = {10,22,12};\r\n"
"Real b2[3] = { 7,13,10};\r\n"
"Real    LU[3,3];\r\n"
"Integer pivots[3];\r\n"
"Real    x1[3];\r\n"
"Real    x2[3];\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"(LU, pivots) := Matrices.LU(A);\r\n"
"x1 := Matrices.LU_solve(LU, pivots, b1);  // x1 = {3,2,1}\r\n"
"x2 := Matrices.LU_solve(LU, pivots, b2);  // x2 = {1,0,2}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve\">Matrices.LU_solve</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>,\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve"
msgid "Solve real system of linear equations P*L*U*x=b with a b vector and an LU decomposition (from LU(..))"
msgstr "解带有右侧向量b和LU分解(使用LU(..))的实系数线性方程组P*L*U*x=b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve"
msgid "L,U factors of Matrices.LU(..) for a square matrix"
msgstr "L,U矩阵的因子。lu(…)对于一个方阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve"
msgid "Pivots indices of Matrices.LU(..)"
msgstr "矩阵的轴心指数。lu (..)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve"
msgid "Right hand side vector of P*L*U*x=b"
msgstr "右边向量P*L*U*x=b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve"
msgid "Solution vector such that P*L*U*x = b"
msgstr "解向量使得P*L*U*x = b"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Matrices.<strong>LU_solve</strong>(LU, pivots, b);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function call returns the\r\n"
"solution <strong>x</strong> of the linear systems of equations\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>P</strong>*<strong>L</strong>*<strong>U</strong>*<strong>x</strong> = <strong>b</strong>;\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where <strong>P</strong> is a permutation matrix (implicitly\r\n"
"defined by vector <code>pivots</code>),\r\n"
"<strong>L</strong> is a lower triangular matrix with unit\r\n"
"diagonal elements (lower trapezoidal if m &gt; n), and\r\n"
"<strong>U</strong> is an upper triangular matrix (upper trapezoidal if m &lt; n).\r\n"
"The matrices of this decomposition are computed with function\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU\">Matrices.LU</a> that\r\n"
"returns arguments <code>LU</code> and <code>pivots</code>\r\n"
"used as input arguments of <code>Matrices.LU_solve</code>.\r\n"
"With <code>Matrices.LU</code> and <code>Matrices.LU_solve</code>\r\n"
"it is possible to efficiently solve linear systems\r\n"
"with different right hand side vectors. If a linear system of equations with\r\n"
"just one right hand side vector shall be solved, it is\r\n"
"more convenient to just use the function\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If a unique solution <strong>x</strong> does not exist (since the\r\n"
"LU decomposition is singular), an exception is raised.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The LU factorization is computed\r\n"
"with the LAPACK function \"dgetrf\",\r\n"
"i.e., by Gaussian elimination using partial pivoting\r\n"
"with row interchanges. Vector \"pivots\" are the\r\n"
"pivot indices, i.e., for 1 &le; i &le; min(m,n), row i of\r\n"
"matrix A was interchanged with row pivots[i].\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Real A[3,3] = [1,2,3;\r\n"
"                 3,4,5;\r\n"
"                 2,1,4];\r\n"
"  Real b1[3] = {10,22,12};\r\n"
"  Real b2[3] = { 7,13,10};\r\n"
"  Real    LU[3,3];\r\n"
"  Integer pivots[3];\r\n"
"  Real    x1[3];\r\n"
"  Real    x2[3];\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"  (LU, pivots) := Matrices.LU(A);\r\n"
"  x1 := Matrices.LU_solve(LU, pivots, b1);  // x1 = {3,2,1}\r\n"
"  x2 := Matrices.LU_solve(LU, pivots, b2);  // x2 = {1,0,2}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU\">Matrices.LU</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>,\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Matrices.<strong>LU_solve</strong>(LU, pivots, b);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用返回线性方程组的解<strong>x</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>P</strong>*<strong>L</strong>*<strong>U</strong>*<strong>x</strong> = <strong>b</strong>;\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中，<strong>P</strong>是一个置换矩阵(由向量<code>pivots</code>隐式定义)，<strong>L</strong>是一个下三角矩阵，具有单位对角元素(当m > n时为下梯形矩阵)，\r\n"
"<strong>U</strong>是一个上三角矩阵(当m < n时为上梯形矩阵)。\r\n"
"这个分解的矩阵是通过函数<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU\">Matrices.LU</a>计算的，该函数返回<code>LU</code>和<code>pivots</code>作为<code>Matrices.LU_solve</code>的输入参数。\r\n"
"通过<code>Matrices.LU</code>和<code>Matrices.LU_solve</code>，可以高效地求解具有不同右侧向量的线性方程组。\r\n"
"如果只需求解一个带有单一右侧向量的线性方程组，更方便的做法是直接使用<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>函数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果唯一解<strong>x</strong>不存在(因为LU分解是奇异的)，则会引发异常。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"LU分解是通过LAPACK函数\"dgetrf\"计算的，即通过高斯消元法使用部分主元法进行行交换。\r\n"
"向量\"pivots\"是主元索引，即对于1≤i≤min(m,n)，矩阵A的第i行与第pivots[i]行进行了交换。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Real A[3,3] = [1,2,3;\r\n"
"             3,4,5;\r\n"
"             2,1,4];\r\n"
"Real b1[3] = {10,22,12};\r\n"
"Real b2[3] = { 7,13,10};\r\n"
"Real    LU[3,3];\r\n"
"Integer pivots[3];\r\n"
"Real    x1[3];\r\n"
"Real    x2[3];\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"(LU, pivots) := Matrices.LU(A);\r\n"
"x1 := Matrices.LU_solve(LU, pivots, b1);  // x1 = {3,2,1}\r\n"
"x2 := Matrices.LU_solve(LU, pivots, b2);  // x2 = {1,0,2}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU\">Matrices.LU</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>,\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve2"
msgid "Solve real system of linear equations P*L*U*X=B with a B matrix and an LU decomposition (from LU(..))"
msgstr "解带有右侧矩阵B和LU分解(使用LU(..))的实系数线性方程组P*L*U*X=B"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve2"
msgid "L,U factors of Matrices.LU(..) for a square matrix"
msgstr "L,U矩阵的因子。lu(…)对于一个方阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve2"
msgid "Pivots indices of Matrices.LU(..)"
msgstr "矩阵的轴心指数。lu (..)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve2"
msgid "Right hand side matrix of P*L*U*X=B"
msgstr "右边的矩阵P*L*U*X=B"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve2"
msgid "Solution matrix such that P*L*U*X = B"
msgstr "解矩阵使P*L*U*X = B"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU_solve2"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Matrices.<strong>LU_solve2</strong>(LU, pivots, B);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function call returns the\r\n"
"solution <strong>X</strong> of the linear systems of equations\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>P</strong>*<strong>L</strong>*<strong>U</strong>*<strong>X</strong> = <strong>B</strong>;\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where <strong>P</strong> is a permutation matrix (implicitly\r\n"
"defined by vector <code>pivots</code>),\r\n"
"<strong>L</strong> is a lower triangular matrix with unit\r\n"
"diagonal elements (lower trapezoidal if m &gt; n), and\r\n"
"<strong>U</strong> is an upper triangular matrix (upper trapezoidal if m &lt; n).\r\n"
"The matrices of this decomposition are computed with function\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU\">Matrices.LU</a> that\r\n"
"returns arguments <code>LU</code> and <code>pivots</code>\r\n"
"used as input arguments of <code>Matrices.LU_solve2</code>.\r\n"
"With <code>Matrices.LU</code> and <code>Matrices.LU_solve2</code>\r\n"
"it is possible to efficiently solve linear systems\r\n"
"with different right hand side <strong>matrices</strong>. If a linear system of equations with\r\n"
"just one right hand side matrix shall be solved, it is\r\n"
"more convenient to just use the function\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve2\">Matrices.solve2</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If a unique solution <strong>X</strong> does not exist (since the\r\n"
"LU decomposition is singular), an exception is raised.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The LU factorization is computed\r\n"
"with the LAPACK function \"dgetrf\",\r\n"
"i.e., by Gaussian elimination using partial pivoting\r\n"
"with row interchanges. Vector \"pivots\" are the\r\n"
"pivot indices, i.e., for 1 &le; i &le; min(m,n), row i of\r\n"
"matrix A was interchanged with row pivots[i].\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Real A[3,3] = [1,2,3;\r\n"
"                 3,4,5;\r\n"
"                 2,1,4];\r\n"
"  Real B1[3] = [10, 20;\r\n"
"                22, 44;\r\n"
"                12, 24];\r\n"
"  Real B2[3] = [ 7, 14;\r\n"
"                13, 26;\r\n"
"                10, 20];\r\n"
"  Real    LU[3,3];\r\n"
"  Integer pivots[3];\r\n"
"  Real    X1[3,2];\r\n"
"  Real    X2[3,2];\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"  (LU, pivots) := Matrices.LU(A);\r\n"
"  X1 := Matrices.LU_solve2(LU, pivots, B1);  /* X1 = [3, 6;\r\n"
"                                                      2, 4;\r\n"
"                                                      1, 2] */\r\n"
"  X2 := Matrices.LU_solve2(LU, pivots, B2);  /* X2 = [1, 2;\r\n"
"                                                      0, 0;\r\n"
"                                                      2, 4] */\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU\">Matrices.LU</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve2\">Matrices.solve2</a>,\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Matrices.<strong>LU_solve2</strong>(LU, pivots, B);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数调用返回线性方程组的解<strong>X</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>P</strong>*<strong>L</strong>*<strong>U</strong>*<strong>X</strong> = <strong>B</strong>;\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中，<strong>P</strong>是一个置换矩阵(由向量<code>pivots</code>隐式定义)，<strong>L</strong>是一个下三角矩阵，\r\n"
"具有单位对角元素(当m > n时为下梯形矩阵)，<strong>U</strong>是一个上三角矩阵(当m < n时为上梯形矩阵)。\r\n"
"这个分解的矩阵是通过函数<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU\">Matrices.LU</a>计算的，\r\n"
"该函数返回<code>LU</code>和<code>pivots</code>作为<code>Matrices.LU_solve2</code>的输入参数。\r\n"
"通过<code>Matrices.LU</code>和<code>Matrices.LU_solve2</code>，可以高效地求解带有不同右侧矩阵的线性方程组。\r\n"
"如果只需求解一个带有单一右侧矩阵的线性方程组，更方便的做法是直接使用<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve2\">Matrices.solve2</a>函数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果不存在唯一解<strong>X</strong>(因为LU分解是奇异的)，则会引发异常。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"LU分解是通过LAPACK函数\"dgetrf\"计算的，即通过高斯消元法使用部分主元法进行行交换。\r\n"
"向量\"pivots\"是主元索引，即对于1 ≤ i ≤ min(m,n)，矩阵A的第i行与第pivots[i]行进行了交换。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Real A[3,3] = [1,2,3;\r\n"
"             3,4,5;\r\n"
"             2,1,4];\r\n"
"Real B1[3] = [10, 20;\r\n"
"            22, 44;\r\n"
"            12, 24];\r\n"
"Real B2[3] = [ 7, 14;\r\n"
"            13, 26;\r\n"
"            10, 20];\r\n"
"Real    LU[3,3];\r\n"
"Integer pivots[3];\r\n"
"Real    X1[3,2];\r\n"
"Real    X2[3,2];\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"(LU, pivots) := Matrices.LU(A);\r\n"
"X1 := Matrices.LU_solve2(LU, pivots, B1);  /* X1 = [3, 6;\r\n"
"                                                  2, 4;\r\n"
"                                                  1, 2] */\r\n"
"X2 := Matrices.LU_solve2(LU, pivots, B2);  /* X2 = [1, 2;\r\n"
"                                                  0, 0;\r\n"
"                                                  2, 4] */\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LU\">Matrices.LU</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve2\">Matrices.solve2</a>,\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValues"
msgid "Return eigenvalues and eigenvectors for a real, nonsymmetric matrix in a Real representation"
msgstr "返回实数表示的实数非对称矩阵的特征值和特征向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValues"
msgid "Matrix"
msgstr "矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValues"
msgid "Eigenvalues of matrix A (Re: first column, Im: second column)"
msgstr "矩阵A的特征值(Re:第一列，Im:第二列)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValues"
msgid "Real-valued eigenvector matrix"
msgstr "实值特征向量矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValues"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                eigenvalues = Matrices.<strong>eigenValues</strong>(A);\r\n"
"(eigenvalues, eigenvectors) = Matrices.<strong>eigenValues</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function call returns the eigenvalues and\r\n"
"optionally the (right) eigenvectors of a square matrix\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong>. The first column of \"eigenvalues\" contains the real and the\r\n"
"second column contains the imaginary part of the eigenvalues.\r\n"
"If the i-th eigenvalue has no imaginary part, then eigenvectors[:,i] is\r\n"
"the corresponding real eigenvector. If the i-th eigenvalue\r\n"
"has an imaginary part, then eigenvalues[i+1,:] is the conjugate complex\r\n"
"eigenvalue and eigenvectors[:,i] is the real and eigenvectors[:,i+1] is the\r\n"
"imaginary part of the eigenvector of the i-th eigenvalue.\r\n"
"With function\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValueMatrix\">Matrices.eigenValueMatrix</a>,\r\n"
"a real block diagonal matrix is constructed from the eigenvalues\r\n"
"such that\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = eigenvectors * eigenValueMatrix(eigenvalues) * inv(eigenvectors)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"provided the eigenvector matrix \"eigenvectors\" can be inverted\r\n"
"(an inversion is possible, if all eigenvalues are different;\r\n"
"in some cases, an inversion is also possible if some eigenvalues are\r\n"
"the same).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Real A[3,3] = [1,2,3;\r\n"
"                 3,4,5;\r\n"
"                 2,1,4];\r\n"
"  Real eval[3,2];\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"  eval := Matrices.eigenValues(A);  // eval = [-0.618, 0;\r\n"
"                                    //          8.0  , 0;\r\n"
"                                    //          1.618, 0];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"i.e., matrix A has the 3 real eigenvalues -0.618, 8, 1.618.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValueMatrix\">Matrices.eigenValueMatrix</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.singularValues\">Matrices.singularValues</a>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"            eigenvalues = Matrices.<strong>eigenValues</strong>(A);\r\n"
"(eigenvalues, eigenvectors) = Matrices.<strong>eigenValues</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数调用返回方阵<strong>A</strong>的特征值，并可选地返回其(右)特征向量。\r\n"
"返回的\"eigenvalues\"矩阵的第一列包含特征值的实部，第二列包含特征值的虚部。\r\n"
"如果第i个特征值没有虚部，则eigenvectors[:,i]是对应的实特征向量。\r\n"
"如果第i个特征值有虚部，则eigenvalues[i+1,:]是共轭复特征值，\r\n"
"eigenvectors[:,i]是实特征向量，eigenvectors[:,i+1]是该特征值对应的特征向量的虚部。\r\n"
"通过函数<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValueMatrix\">Matrices.eigenValueMatrix</a>，\r\n"
"可以根据特征值构造一个实数块对角矩阵，使得：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = eigenvectors * eigenValueMatrix(eigenvalues) * inv(eigenvectors)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"前提是特征向量矩阵\"eigenvectors\"可以求逆(当所有特征值不同时，逆矩阵总是存在；\r\n"
"在某些情况下，当部分特征值相同时，也可以求逆)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Real A[3,3] = [1,2,3;\r\n"
"             3,4,5;\r\n"
"             2,1,4];\r\n"
"Real eval[3,2];\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"eval := Matrices.eigenValues(A);  // eval = [-0.618, 0;\r\n"
"                                //          8.0  , 0;\r\n"
"                                //          1.618, 0];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"即，矩阵A有3个实特征值-0.618、8、1.618。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValueMatrix\">Matrices.eigenValueMatrix</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.singularValues\">Matrices.singularValues</a>\r\n"
"</p></html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValueMatrix"
msgid "Return real valued block diagonal matrix J of eigenvalues of matrix A (A=V*J*Vinv)"
msgstr "返回矩阵A的特征值的实值块对角矩阵J(A=V*J*Vinv)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValueMatrix"
msgid "Eigen values from function eigenValues(..) (Re: first column, Im: second column)"
msgstr "特征值从函数特征值(..)(Re:第一列，Im:第二列)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValueMatrix"
msgid "Real valued block diagonal matrix with eigen values (Re: 1x1 block, Im: 2x2 block)"
msgstr "具有特征值的实值块对角矩阵(Re: 1x1块，Im: 2x2块)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValueMatrix"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Matrices.<strong>eigenValueMatrix</strong>(eigenvalues);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call returns a block diagonal matrix <strong>J</strong>\r\n"
"from the two-column matrix <code>eigenvalues</code>\r\n"
"(computed by function\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValues\">Matrices.eigenValues</a>).\r\n"
"Matrix <code>eigenvalues</code> must have the real part of the\r\n"
"eigenvalues in the first column and the imaginary part in the\r\n"
"second column. If an eigenvalue i has a vanishing imaginary\r\n"
"part, then <strong>J</strong>[i,i] = eigenvalues[i,1], i.e., the diagonal\r\n"
"element of <strong>J</strong> is the real eigenvalue.\r\n"
"Otherwise, eigenvalue i and conjugate complex eigenvalue i+1\r\n"
"are used to construct a 2 by 2 diagonal block of <strong>J</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"J[i  , i]   := eigenvalues[i,1];\r\n"
"J[i  , i+1] := eigenvalues[i,2];\r\n"
"J[i+1, i]   := eigenvalues[i+1,2];\r\n"
"J[i+1, i+1] := eigenvalues[i+1,1];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValues\">Matrices.eigenValues</a>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Matrices.<strong>eigenValueMatrix</strong>(eigenvalues);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数调用返回一个块对角矩阵<strong>J</strong>，该矩阵由两列矩阵<code>eigenvalues</code>构造\r\n"
"(该矩阵由函数<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValues\">Matrices.eigenValues</a>)计算得到)。\r\n"
"矩阵<code>eigenvalues</code>必须将特征值的实部放在第一列，将虚部放在第二列。如果特征值i的虚部为零，\r\n"
"则<strong>J</strong>[i,i] = eigenvalues[i,1]，即<strong>J</strong>的对角元素是实特征值。\r\n"
"如果特征值i具有虚部，则特征值i和共轭复特征值i+1会一起用于构造<strong>J</strong>的一个2×2对角块：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"J[i  , i]   := eigenvalues[i,1];\r\n"
"J[i  , i+1] := eigenvalues[i,2];\r\n"
"J[i+1, i]   := eigenvalues[i+1,2];\r\n"
"J[i+1, i+1] := eigenvalues[i+1,1];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValues\">Matrices.eigenValues</a>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.singularValues"
msgid "Return singular values and left and right singular vectors"
msgstr "返回奇异值和左、右奇异向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.singularValues"
msgid "Matrix"
msgstr "矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.singularValues"
msgid "Singular values"
msgstr "奇异值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.singularValues"
msgid "Left orthogonal matrix"
msgstr "左正交矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.singularValues"
msgid "Transposed right orthogonal matrix"
msgstr "转置的右正交矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.singularValues"
msgid "Number of singular values"
msgstr "奇异值数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.singularValues"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"         sigma = Matrices.<strong>singularValues</strong>(A);\r\n"
"(sigma, U, VT) = Matrices.<strong>singularValues</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function computes the singular values and optionally the\r\n"
"singular vectors of matrix A. Basically the singular\r\n"
"value decomposition of A is computed, i.e.,\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong> = <strong>U</strong> <strong>&Sigma;</strong> <strong>V</strong><sup>T</sup>\r\n"
"  = U*Sigma*VT\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where <strong>U</strong> and <strong>V</strong> are orthogonal matrices (<strong>UU</strong><sup>T</sup>=<strong>I,\r\n"
"</strong><strong>VV</strong><sup>T</sup>=<strong>I</strong>).\r\n"
"<strong>&Sigma;</strong> = [diagonal(&sigma;<sub>i</sub>), zeros(n,m-n)], if n=size(A,1) &le;\r\n"
"m=size(A,2)) or [diagonal(&sigma;<sub>i</sub>); zeros(n-m,m)], if n &gt;\r\n"
"m=size(A,2)). <strong>&Sigma;</strong> has the same size as matrix A with\r\n"
"nonnegative diagonal elements in decreasing order and with all other elements zero\r\n"
"(&sigma;<sub>1</sub> is the largest element). The function\r\n"
"returns the singular values &sigma;<sub>i</sub>\r\n"
"in vector <code>sigma</code> and the orthogonal matrices in\r\n"
"matrices <code>U</code> and <code>VT</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 2,  3,  4;\r\n"
"     3, 4,  5, -2;\r\n"
"    -1, 2, -3,  5];\r\n"
"(sigma, U, VT) = singularValues(A);\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"   sigma = {8.33, 6.94, 2.31};\r\n"
"i.e.\r\n"
"   Sigma = [8.33,    0,    0, 0;\r\n"
"               0, 6.94,    0, 0;\r\n"
"               0,    0, 2.31, 0]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValues\">Matrices.eigenValues</a>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"     sigma = Matrices.<strong>singularValues</strong>(A);\r\n"
"(sigma, U, VT) = Matrices.<strong>singularValues</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数计算矩阵A的奇异值，并可选地计算其奇异向量。基本上，函数计算的是矩阵A的奇异值分解(SVD)，即：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong> = <strong>U</strong> <strong>&Sigma;</strong> <strong>V</strong><sup>T</sup>\r\n"
"= U*Sigma*VT\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中<strong>U</strong>和<strong>V</strong>是正交矩阵(<strong>UU</strong><sup>T</sup>=<strong>I，\r\n"
"</strong><strong>VV</strong><sup>T</sup>=<strong>I</strong>)。\r\n"
"矩阵 为一个对角矩阵，形式为：\r\n"
"如果n = size(A,1) ≤ m = size(A,2)，则<strong>Σ</strong> = [diagonal(σ<sub>i</sub>), zeros(n,m-n)]；\r\n"
"如果n > m =   size(A,2)，则[diagonal(σ<sub>i</sub>);  zeros(n-m,m)]。\r\n"
"矩阵<strong>&Sigma;</strong>与矩阵A具有相同的大小，且其对角元素为非负的奇异值，\r\n"
"按降序排列，其他元素为零(其中&sigma;<sub>1</sub>是最大的奇异值)。\r\n"
"该函数返回奇异值&sigma;<sub>i</sub>的向量<code>sigma</code>，\r\n"
"并返回正交矩阵<code>U</code>和<code>VT</code>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 2,  3,  4;\r\n"
" 3, 4,  5, -2;\r\n"
"-1, 2, -3,  5];\r\n"
"(sigma, U, VT) = singularValues(A);\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"sigma = {8.33, 6.94, 2.31};\r\n"
"i.e.\r\n"
"Sigma = [8.33,    0,    0, 0;\r\n"
"           0, 6.94,    0, 0;\r\n"
"           0,    0, 2.31, 0]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.eigenValues\">Matrices.eigenValues</a>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.QR"
msgid "Return the QR decomposition of a square matrix with optional column pivoting (A(:,p) = Q*R)"
msgstr "返回带有可选列主元素的方阵的QR分解(A(:,p) = Q*R)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.QR"
msgid "Rectangular matrix with size(A,1) >= size(A,2)"
msgstr "大小为(A,1) >=大小为(A,2)的矩形矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.QR"
msgid "= true, if column pivoting is performed. True is default"
msgstr "= true，如果执行列透视。True为默认值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.QR"
msgid "Rectangular matrix with orthonormal columns such that Q*R=A[:,p]"
msgstr "具有使Q*R=A的正交列的矩形矩阵[:，p]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.QR"
msgid "Square upper triangular matrix"
msgstr "平方上三角矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.QR"
msgid "Column permutation vector"
msgstr "列排列向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.QR"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(Q,R,p) = Matrices.<strong>QR</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns the QR decomposition of\r\n"
"a rectangular matrix <strong>A</strong> (the number of columns of <strong>A</strong>\r\n"
"must be less than or equal to the number of rows):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Q</strong>*<strong>R</strong> = <strong>A</strong>[:,<strong>p</strong>]\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where <strong>Q</strong> is a rectangular matrix that has orthonormal columns and\r\n"
"has the same size as A (<strong>Q</strong><sup>T</sup><strong>Q</strong>=<strong>I</strong>),\r\n"
"<strong>R</strong> is a square, upper triangular matrix and <strong>p</strong> is a permutation\r\n"
"vector. Matrix <strong>R</strong> has the following important properties:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> The absolute value of a diagonal element of <strong>R</strong> is the largest\r\n"
"     value in this row, i.e.,\r\n"
"     abs(R[i,i]) &ge; abs(R[i,j]).</li>\r\n"
"<li> The diagonal elements of <strong>R</strong> are sorted according to size, such that\r\n"
"     the largest absolute value is abs(R[1,1]) and\r\n"
"     abs(R[i,i]) &ge; abs(R[j,j]) with i &lt; j.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This means that if abs(R[i,i]) &le; &epsilon; then abs(R[j,k]) &le; &epsilon;\r\n"
"for j &ge; i, i.e., the i-th row up to the last row of <strong>R</strong> have\r\n"
"small elements and can be treated as being zero.\r\n"
"This allows to, e.g., estimate the row-rank\r\n"
"of <strong>R</strong> (which is the same row-rank as <strong>A</strong>). Furthermore,\r\n"
"<strong>R</strong> can be partitioned in two parts\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong>[:,<strong>p</strong>] = <strong>Q</strong> * [<strong>R</strong><sub>1</sub>, <strong>R</strong><sub>2</sub>;\r\n"
"              <strong>0</strong>,  <strong>0</strong>]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where <strong>R</strong><sub>1</sub> is a regular, upper triangular matrix.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, the solution is computed with the LAPACK functions \"dgeqp3\"\r\n"
"and \"dorgqr\", i.e., by Householder transformations with\r\n"
"column pivoting. If <strong>Q</strong> is not needed, the function may be\r\n"
"called as: <code>(,R,p) = QR(A)</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"  Real A[3,3] = [1,2,3;\r\n"
"                 3,4,5;\r\n"
"                 2,1,4];\r\n"
"  Real R[3,3];\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"  (,R) := Matrices.QR(A);  // R = [-7.07.., -4.24.., -3.67..;\r\n"
"                                    0     , -1.73.., -0.23..;\r\n"
"                                    0     ,  0     ,  0.65..];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(Q,R,p) = Matrices.<strong>QR</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回矩阵A的QR分解(矩阵A的列数必须小于或等于行数)：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Q</strong>*<strong>R</strong> = <strong>A</strong>[:,<strong>p</strong>]\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中，<strong>Q</strong>是一个矩形矩阵，具有正交归一化的列，\r\n"
"并且与矩阵A具有相同的大小(<strong>Q</strong><sup>T</sup><strong>Q</strong>=<strong>I</strong>)；\r\n"
"<strong>R</strong>是一个方阵，且为上三角矩阵；<strong>p</strong>是一个置换向量。矩阵<strong>R</strong>具有以下重要特性：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>R</strong>的对角线元素的绝对值是该行中的最大值，即：\r\n"
"abs(R[i,i]) &ge; abs(R[i,j]).</li>\r\n"
"<li> <strong>R</strong>的对角线元素按大小排序，其中最大绝对值是abs(R[1,1])，\r\n"
"并且abs(R[i,i]) &ge; abs(R[j,j])，其中i &lt; j。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这意味着如果abs(R[i,i]) &le; &epsilon;，则对于j &ge; i，有abs(R[j,k]) &le; &epsilon;，\r\n"
"即矩阵<strong>R</strong>的第i行到最后一行的元素非常小，可以视为零。\r\n"
"这样可以估计<strong>R</strong>的行秩(它与<strong>A</strong>的行秩相同)。\r\n"
"此外，矩阵<strong>R</strong>可以被分成两部分：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong>[:,<strong>p</strong>] = <strong>Q</strong> * [<strong>R</strong><sub>1</sub>, <strong>R</strong><sub>2</sub>;\r\n"
"          <strong>0</strong>,  <strong>0</strong>]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中<strong>R</strong><sub>1</sub>是一个常规的上三角矩阵。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意，解是通过使用LAPACK函数\"dgeqp3\"和\"dorgqr\"计算的，即通过带列主元素的Householder变换。\r\n"
"如果不需要<strong>Q</strong>，则可以仅调用：<code>(,R,p) = QR(A)</code>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Real A[3,3] = [1,2,3;\r\n"
"             3,4,5;\r\n"
"             2,1,4];\r\n"
"Real R[3,3];\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"(,R) := Matrices.QR(A);  // R = [-7.07.., -4.24.., -3.67..;\r\n"
"                                0     , -1.73.., -0.23..;\r\n"
"                                0     ,  0     ,  0.65..];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.hessenberg"
msgid "Return upper Hessenberg form of a matrix"
msgstr "返回矩阵的上Hessenberg形式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.hessenberg"
msgid "Square matrix A"
msgstr "方阵A"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.hessenberg"
msgid "Hessenberg form of A"
msgstr "A的海森伯格形式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.hessenberg"
msgid "Transformation matrix"
msgstr "变换矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.hessenberg"
msgid "V=[v1,v2,..vn-1,0] with vi are vectors which define the elementary reflectors"
msgstr "V = [v1、v2 . .vn-1,0]和vi是定义初等反射镜的向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.hessenberg"
msgid "Scalar factors of the elementary reflectors"
msgstr "初等反射器的标量因子"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.hessenberg"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"     H = Matrices.<strong>hessenberg</strong>(A);\r\n"
"(H, U) = Matrices.<strong>hessenberg</strong>(A);\r\n"
" </pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>hessenberg</strong> computes the Hessenberg matrix <strong>H</strong> of matrix <strong>A</strong> as well as the orthogonal transformation matrix <strong>U</strong> that holds <strong>H</strong> = <strong>U</strong>'*<strong>A</strong>*<strong>U</strong>.\r\n"
"The Hessenberg form of a matrix is computed by repeated Householder similarity transformation. The elementary reflectors and the corresponding scalar factors are provided\r\n"
"by function \"Utilities.toUpperHessenberg()\". The transformation matrix <strong>U</strong> is then computed by\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LAPACK.dorghr\">LAPACK.dorghr</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A  = [1, 2,  3;\r\n"
"      6, 5,  4;\r\n"
"      1, 0,  0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"(H, U) = hessenberg(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"H = [1.0,  -2.466,  2.630;\r\n"
"    -6.083, 5.514, -3.081;\r\n"
"     0.0,   0.919, -0.514]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"U = [1.0,    0.0,      0.0;\r\n"
"     0.0,   -0.9864,  -0.1644;\r\n"
"     0.0,   -0.1644,   0.9864]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"and therefore,\r\n"
"\r\n"
"U*H*transpose(U) = [1.0, 2.0, 3.0;\r\n"
"                    6.0, 5.0, 4.0;\r\n"
"                    1.0, 0.0, 0.0]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.toUpperHessenberg\">Matrices.Utilities.toUpperHessenberg</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
" H = Matrices.<strong>hessenberg</strong>(A);\r\n"
"(H, U) = Matrices.<strong>hessenberg</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>hessenberg</strong>计算矩阵<strong>A</strong>的Hessenberg矩阵<strong>H</strong>，\r\n"
"以及满足<strong>H</strong> = <strong>U</strong> A</strong>*<strong>U</strong>的正交变换矩阵<strong>U</strong>。\r\n"
"矩阵的Hessenberg形式是通过反复应用Householder相似变换来计算的。\r\n"
"基本反射器和相应的标量因子由函数\"Utilities.toUpperHessenberg()\"提供。\r\n"
"然后，通过<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LAPACK.dorghr\">LAPACK.dorghr</a>函数计算变换矩阵<strong>U</strong>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A  = [1, 2,  3;\r\n"
"  6, 5,  4;\r\n"
"  1, 0,  0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"(H, U) = hessenberg(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"H = [1.0,  -2.466,  2.630;\r\n"
"-6.083, 5.514, -3.081;\r\n"
" 0.0,   0.919, -0.514]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"U = [1.0,    0.0,      0.0;\r\n"
" 0.0,   -0.9864,  -0.1644;\r\n"
" 0.0,   -0.1644,   0.9864]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"and therefore,\r\n"
"\r\n"
"U*H*transpose(U) = [1.0, 2.0, 3.0;\r\n"
"                6.0, 5.0, 4.0;\r\n"
"                1.0, 0.0, 0.0]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.toUpperHessenberg\">Matrices.Utilities.toUpperHessenberg</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.hessenberg"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>2010/05/31 </em>\r\n"
"       by Marcus Baur, DLR-RM</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>2010/05/31 </em>\r\n"
"   by Marcus Baur, DLR-RM</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.realSchur"
msgid "Return the real Schur form (rsf) S of a square matrix A, A=QZ*S*QZ'"
msgstr "返回方阵A的实Schur形式(rsf)S，其中A =QZ*S*QZ'"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.realSchur"
msgid "Square matrix"
msgstr "方阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.realSchur"
msgid "Real Schur form of A"
msgstr "A的实舒尔形式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.realSchur"
msgid "Schur vector Matrix"
msgstr "舒尔向量矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.realSchur"
msgid "Real part of eigenvalue=alphaReal+i*alphaImag"
msgstr "eigenvalue=alphaReal+i*alphaImag的实部"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.realSchur"
msgid "Imaginary part of eigenvalue=alphaReal+i*alphaImag"
msgstr "eigenvalue=alphaReal+i*alphaImag的虚部"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.realSchur"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                            S = Matrices.<strong>realSchur</strong>(A);\r\n"
"(S, QZ, alphaReal, alphaImag) = Matrices.<strong>realSchur</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>realSchur</strong> calculates the real Schur form of a real square matrix <strong>A</strong>, i.e.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong> = <strong>QZ</strong>*<strong>S</strong>*transpose(<strong>QZ</strong>)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"with the real nxn matrices <strong>S</strong> and <strong>QZ</strong>. <strong>S</strong> is a block upper triangular matrix with 1x1 and 2x2 blocks in the diagonal. <strong>QZ</strong> is an orthogonal matrix.\r\n"
"The 1x1 blocks contains the real eigenvalues of <strong>A</strong>. The 2x2 blocks [s11, s12; s21, s11] represents the conjugated complex pairs of eigenvalues, whereas the real parts of the eigenvalues\r\n"
"are the elements of the diagonal (s11). The imaginary parts are the positive and negative square roots of the product of the two elements s12 and s21 (imag = +-sqrt(s12*s21)).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The calculation in lapack.dgees is performed stepwise, i.e., using the internal methods of balancing and scaling of dgees.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"   Real A[3,3] = [1, 2, 3; 4, 5, 6; 7, 8, 9];\r\n"
"   Real T[3,3];\r\n"
"   Real Z[3,3];\r\n"
"   Real alphaReal[3];\r\n"
"   Real alphaImag[3];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"  (T, Z, alphaReal, alphaImag):=Modelica.Math.Matrices.realSchur(A);\r\n"
"//   T = [16.12, 4.9,   1.59E-015;\r\n"
"//        0,    -1.12, -1.12E-015;\r\n"
"//        0,     0,    -1.30E-015]\r\n"
"//   Z = [-0.23,  -0.88,   0.41;\r\n"
"//        -0.52,  -0.24,  -0.82;\r\n"
"//        -0.82,   0.4,    0.41]\r\n"
"//alphaReal = {16.12, -1.12, -1.32E-015}\r\n"
"//alphaImag = {0, 0, 0}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.reorderRSF\">Math.Matrices.Utilities.reorderRSF</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                        S = Matrices.<strong>realSchur</strong>(A);\r\n"
"(S, QZ, alphaReal, alphaImag) = Matrices.<strong>realSchur</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>realSchur</strong>计算实方阵<strong>A</strong>的实Schur形式，即\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong> = <strong>QZ</strong>*<strong>S</strong>*transpose(<strong>QZ</strong>)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中，<strong>S</strong>和<strong>QZ</strong>是实n × n矩阵。\r\n"
"<strong>S</strong>是一个块上三角矩阵，主对角线上包含1 × 1和2 × 2的块。\r\n"
"<strong>QZ</strong>是一个正交矩阵。\r\n"
"1 × 1块包含A的实特征值。\r\n"
"2 × 2块形式为[s11,s12;s21,s11]，表示特征值的共轭复数对，其中特征值的实部是对角线元素s11，\r\n"
"而虚部则是s12和s21两个元素的乘积的正负平方根(imag = +-sqrt(s12*s21))。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"lapack.dgees计算是逐步执行的，即使用dgees的内部平衡和缩放方法。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Real A[3,3] = [1, 2, 3; 4, 5, 6; 7, 8, 9];\r\n"
"Real T[3,3];\r\n"
"Real Z[3,3];\r\n"
"Real alphaReal[3];\r\n"
"Real alphaImag[3];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<strong>algorithm</strong>\r\n"
"(T, Z, alphaReal, alphaImag):=Modelica.Math.Matrices.realSchur(A);\r\n"
"//   T = [16.12, 4.9,   1.59E-015;\r\n"
"//        0,    -1.12, -1.12E-015;\r\n"
"//        0,     0,    -1.30E-015]\r\n"
"//   Z = [-0.23,  -0.88,   0.41;\r\n"
"//        -0.52,  -0.24,  -0.82;\r\n"
"//        -0.82,   0.4,    0.41]\r\n"
"//alphaReal = {16.12, -1.12, -1.32E-015}\r\n"
"//alphaImag = {0, 0, 0}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.reorderRSF\">Math.Matrices.Utilities.reorderRSF</a>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

