msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.trace"
msgid "Return the trace of matrix A, i.e., the sum of the diagonal elements"
msgstr "返回矩阵A的迹，即对角线元素的和"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.trace"
msgid "Square matrix A"
msgstr "方阵A"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.trace"
msgid "Trace of A"
msgstr "A 的轨迹"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.trace"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r = Matrices.<strong>trace</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function computes the trace, i.e., the sum of the elements in the diagonal of matrix <strong>A</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 3;\r\n"
"     2, 1];\r\n"
"r = trace(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"r = 2.0\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r = Matrices.<strong>trace</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数计算迹，即矩阵<strong>A</strong>对角线上元素的总和。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 3;\r\n"
"   2, 1];\r\n"
"r = trace(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"r = 2.0\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.trace"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>2010/05/31 </em>\r\n"
"       by Marcus Baur, DLR-RM</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>2010/05/31 </em>\r\n"
"     by Marcus Baur, DLR-RM</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.det"
msgid "Return determinant of a matrix (computed by LU decomposition; try to avoid det(..))"
msgstr "返回矩阵的行列式(通过LU分解计算；尽量避免使用det(..))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.det"
msgid "Determinant of matrix A"
msgstr "矩阵A的行列式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.det"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"result = Matrices.<strong>det</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns the determinant \"result\" of matrix A\r\n"
"computed by a LU decomposition with row pivoting. For details about determinants, see\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Determinant\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Determinant</a>.\r\n"
"Usually, this function should never be used, because\r\n"
"there are nearly always better numerical algorithms\r\n"
"as by computing the determinant. Examples:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> Use <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.rank\">Matrices.rank</a>\r\n"
"     to compute whether det(A) = 0 (i.e., Matrices.rank(A) &lt; size(A,1)).</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> Use <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>\r\n"
"     to solve the linear equation A*x = b, instead of using determinants to\r\n"
"     compute the solution.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.rank\">Matrices.rank</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"result = Matrices.<strong>det</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>说明</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此函数返回通过带行主元素交换的LU分解计算得到的矩阵 A 的行列式\"结果\"。\r\n"
"有关行列式的详细信息，请参见\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Determinant\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Determinant</a>.。\r\n"
"通常，应该避免使用此函数，因为通常有更好的数值算法来代替直接计算行列式。例如：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> 使用<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.rank\">Matrices.rank</a>\r\n"
"来判断det(A) = 0(即：Matrices.rank(A) <  size(A,1))。</li>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<li> 使用<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>\r\n"
"来解线性方程A*x = b，而不是用行列式来求解。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.rank\">Matrices.rank</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.inv"
msgid "Return inverse of a matrix (try to avoid inv(..))"
msgstr "返回矩阵的逆(尽量避免使用inv(..))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.inv"
msgid "Inverse of matrix A"
msgstr "矩阵A的逆"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.inv"
msgid "Pivot vector"
msgstr "主向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.inv"
msgid "LU factors of A"
msgstr "A的LU因子"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.inv"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"invA = Matrices.<strong>inv</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns the inverse of matrix A, i.e., A*inv(A) = identity(size(A,1))\r\n"
"computed by a LU decomposition with row pivoting.\r\n"
"Usually, this function should not be used, because\r\n"
"there are nearly always better numerical algorithms\r\n"
"as by computing directly the inverse. Example:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"Use x = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>(A,b)\r\n"
"to solve the linear equation A*x = b, instead of computing the solution by\r\n"
"x = inv(A)*b, because this is much more efficient and much more reliable.\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve2\">Matrices.solve2</a>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"invA = Matrices.<strong>inv</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个函数返回矩阵A的逆，即A*inv(A) = identity(size(A,1))\r\n"
"由具有行旋转的LU分解计算。\r\n"
"通常，不应该使用这个函数，因为\r\n"
"几乎总是有更好的数值算法\r\n"
"就像直接计算逆函数一样。例子:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"使用x = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>(a,b)\r\n"
"来解线性方程A*x = b，而不是用\r\n"
"x = inv(A)*b，因为这样更有效更可靠。\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve\">Matrices.solve</a>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.solve2\">Matrices.solve2</a>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.rank"
msgid "Return rank of a rectangular matrix (computed with singular values)"
msgstr "返回矩形矩阵的秩(用奇异值计算)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.rank"
msgid "Matrix"
msgstr "矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.rank"
msgid "If eps > 0, the singular values are checked against eps; otherwise eps=max(size(A))*norm(A)*Modelica.Constants.eps is used"
msgstr "如果eps > 0，则根据eps检查奇异值;否则eps=max(size(A))*norm(A)*Modelica.Constants. eps"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.rank"
msgid "Rank of matrix A"
msgstr "矩阵A的秩"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.rank"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"result = Matrices.<strong>rank</strong>(A);\r\n"
"result = Matrices.<strong>rank</strong>(A,eps=0);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns the rank of a square or rectangular matrix A computed by singular value decomposition.\r\n"
"For details about the rank of a matrix, see\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matrix_rank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matrix_rank</a>.\r\n"
"To be more precise:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> rank(A) returns the number of singular values of A that are larger than\r\n"
"     max(size(A))*norm(A)*Modelica.Constants.eps.</li>\r\n"
"<li> rank(A, eps) returns the number of singular values of A that are larger than \"eps\".</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.rcond\">Matrices.rcond</a>.\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"result = Matrices.<strong>rank</strong>(A);\r\n"
"result = Matrices.<strong>rank</strong>(A,eps=0);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个函数返回由奇异值分解计算的正方形或矩形矩阵a的秩。\r\n"
"有关矩阵秩的详细信息，请参见\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matrix_rank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matrix_rank</a>。\r\n"
"更准确地说：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> rank(A) 返回大于的A的奇异值的个数\r\n"
"   max(size(A))*norm(A)*Modelica.Constants.eps.</li>\r\n"
"<li> rank(A, eps) 返回大于的A的奇异值的个数 \"eps\"。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.rcond\">Matrices.rcond</a>.\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.conditionNumber"
msgid "Return the condition number norm(A)*norm(inv(A)) of a matrix A"
msgstr "返回矩阵A的条件数norm(A)*norm(inv(A))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.conditionNumber"
msgid "Input matrix"
msgstr "输入矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.conditionNumber"
msgid "Type of p-norm (only allowed: 1, 2 or Modelica.Constants.inf)"
msgstr "p-范数类型(只允许: 1, 2 or Modelica.Constants.inf)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.conditionNumber"
msgid "Condition number of matrix A"
msgstr "矩阵A的条件数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.conditionNumber"
msgid "Singular values"
msgstr "奇异值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.conditionNumber"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r = Matrices.<strong>conditionNumber</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function calculates the condition number (norm(A) * norm(inv(A))) of a general real matrix <strong>A</strong>, in either the 1-norm, 2-norm or the infinity-norm.\r\n"
"In the case of 2-norm the result is the ratio of the largest to the smallest singular value of <strong>A</strong>.\r\n"
"For more details, see <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Condition_number\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Condition_number</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 2;\r\n"
"     2, 1];\r\n"
"r = conditionNumber(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"r = 3.0\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.rcond\">Matrices.rcond</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r = Matrices.<strong>conditionNumber</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个函数计算一般实矩阵<strong>A</strong>的条件数(norm(A) * norm(inv(A)))，在1-范数，2-范数或无穷范数中。\r\n"
"在2范数的情况下，结果是<strong>A</strong>的最大奇异值与最小奇异值之比。\r\n"
"有关详细信息，请参见 <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Condition_number\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Condition_number</a>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 2;\r\n"
"   2, 1];\r\n"
"r = conditionNumber(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"r = 3.0\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.rcond\">Matrices.rcond</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.conditionNumber"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>2010/05/31 </em>\r\n"
"       by Marcus Baur, DLR-RM</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>2010/05/31 </em>\r\n"
"     by Marcus Baur, DLR-RM</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.rcond"
msgid "Return the reciprocal condition number of a matrix"
msgstr "返回矩阵的倒数条件数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.rcond"
msgid "Square real matrix"
msgstr "平方实矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.rcond"
msgid "Is true if infinity norm is used and false for 1-norm"
msgstr "如果使用无穷范数为真，如果使用1范数为假"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.rcond"
msgid "Reciprocal condition number of A"
msgstr "A的倒数条件数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.rcond"
msgid "Information"
msgstr "信息"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.rcond"
msgid "LU factorization of matrix A, returned by dgetrf"
msgstr "矩阵A的LU分解，由gettrf返回"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.rcond"
msgid "Norm of matrix A"
msgstr "矩阵A范数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.rcond"
msgid "Specifies the norm 1 or inf"
msgstr "指定norm 1或inf"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.rcond"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r = Matrices.<strong>rcond</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function estimates the reciprocal of the condition number (norm(A) * norm(inv(A))) of a general real matrix <strong>A</strong>, in either the 1-norm or\r\n"
"the infinity-norm, using the LAPACK function <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LAPACK.dgecon\">DGECON</a>.\r\n"
"If rcond(A) is near 1.0, <strong>A</strong> is well conditioned and <strong>A</strong> is ill conditioned if rcond(A) is near zero.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 2;\r\n"
"     2, 1];\r\n"
"r = rcond(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"r = 0.3333\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.conditionNumber\">Matrices.conditionNumber</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r = Matrices.<strong>rcond</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数估计一般实矩阵<strong>A</strong>的条件数(norm(A) * norm(inv(A)))的倒数，在1-范数或\r\n"
"无限模，使用LAPACK函数<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LAPACK.dgecon\">DGECON</a>。\r\n"
"若rcond(A)接近1.0，则<strong>A</strong>是条件良好的;若rcond(A)接近零，则<strong>A</strong>是条件不良的.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 2;\r\n"
"   2, 1];\r\n"
"r = rcond(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"r = 0.3333\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.conditionNumber\">Matrices.conditionNumber</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.rcond"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>2010/05/31 </em>\r\n"
"       by Marcus Baur, DLR-RM</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
