msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.norm"
msgid "Return the p-norm of a matrix"
msgstr "返回矩阵的p-范数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.norm"
msgid "Input matrix"
msgstr "输入矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.norm"
msgid "Type of p-norm (only allowed: 1, 2 or Modelica.Constants.inf)"
msgstr "p-范数类型(只允许: 1, 2 or Modelica.Constants.inf)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.norm"
msgid "p-norm of matrix A"
msgstr "矩阵A的p-norm"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.norm"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Matrices.<strong>norm</strong>(A);\r\n"
"Matrices.<strong>norm</strong>(A, p=2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Matrices.norm(A)</code>\" returns the\r\n"
"2-norm of matrix A, i.e., the largest singular value of A.<br>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Matrices.norm(A, p)</code>\" returns the\r\n"
"p-norm of matrix A. The only allowed values for p are\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> \"p=1\": the largest column sum of A</li>\r\n"
"<li> \"p=2\": the largest singular value of A</li>\r\n"
"<li> \"p=Modelica.Constants.inf\": the largest row sum of A</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, for any matrices A1, A2 the following inequality holds:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Matrices.<strong>norm</strong>(A1+A2,p) &le; Matrices.<strong>norm</strong>(A1,p) + Matrices.<strong>norm</strong>(A2,p)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, for any matrix A and vector v the following inequality holds:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(A*v,p) &le; Matrices.<strong>norm</strong>(A,p)*Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(A,p)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.frobeniusNorm\">Matrices.frobeniusNorm</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Matrices.<strong>norm</strong>(A);\r\n"
"Matrices.<strong>norm</strong>(A, p=2);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用\"<code>Matrices.norm(A)</code>\"返回\r\n"
"矩阵A的2范数，即A的最大奇异值<br>\r\n"
"函数调用\"<code>Matrices。norm(A, p)</code>\"返回\r\n"
"矩阵a的p范数，p唯一允许的值是\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> \"p=1\": A的最大列和</li>\r\n"
"<li> \"p=2\": A的最大奇异值</li>\r\n"
"<li> \"p=Modelica.Constants.inf\": A的最大行和</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意，对于任何矩阵A1, A2，下面的不等式成立:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Matrices.<strong>norm</strong>(A1+A2,p) &le; Matrices.<strong>norm</strong>(A1,p) + Matrices.<strong>norm</strong>(A2,p)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意，对于任何矩阵A和向量v，下面的不等式成立:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(A*v,p) &le; Matrices.<strong>norm</strong>(A,p)*Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(A,p)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另外</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.frobeniusNorm\">Matrices.frobeniusNorm</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.frobeniusNorm"
msgid "Return the Frobenius norm of a matrix"
msgstr "返回矩阵的Frobenius范数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.frobeniusNorm"
msgid "Input matrix"
msgstr "输入矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.frobeniusNorm"
msgid "Frobenius norm of matrix A"
msgstr "矩阵A的Frobenius范数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.frobeniusNorm"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r = Matrices.<strong>frobeniusNorm</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function computes the Frobenius norm of a general real matrix <strong>A</strong>, i.e., the square root of the sum of the squares of all elements.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 2;\r\n"
"     2, 1];\r\n"
"r = frobeniusNorm(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"r = 3.162;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.norm\">Matrices.norm</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"r = Matrices.<strong>frobeniusNorm</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个函数计算一般实矩阵<strong> a </strong>的Frobenius范数，即所有元素的平方和的平方根。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 2;\r\n"
" 2, 1];\r\n"
"r = frobeniusNorm(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"r = 3.162;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.norm\">Matrices.norm</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.frobeniusNorm"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>2010/05/31 </em>\r\n"
"       by Marcus Baur, DLR-RM</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>2010/05/31 </em>\r\n"
"   by Marcus Baur, DLR-RM</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.nullSpace"
msgid "Return the orthonormal nullspace of a matrix"
msgstr "返回矩阵的标准正交零空间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.nullSpace"
msgid "Input matrix"
msgstr "输入矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.nullSpace"
msgid "Orthonormal nullspace of matrix A"
msgstr "矩阵A的标准正交零空间"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.nullSpace"
msgid "Nullity, i.e., the dimension of the nullspace"
msgstr "零，即零空间的维数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.nullSpace"
msgid "Right orthogonal matrix"
msgstr "右正交矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.nullSpace"
msgid "Singular values"
msgstr "奇异值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.nullSpace"
msgid "Rank of matrix A"
msgstr "矩阵A的秩"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.nullSpace"
msgid "Tolerance for rank determination"
msgstr "等级决定容忍度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.nullSpace"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"           Z = Matrices.<strong>nullspace</strong>(A);\r\n"
"(Z, nullity) = Matrices.<strong>nullspace</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function calculates an orthonormal basis <strong>Z</strong>=[<strong>z</strong>_1, <strong>z</strong>_2, ...] of the nullspace of a matrix <strong>A</strong>, i.e., <strong>A</strong>*<strong>z</strong>_i=<strong>0</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The nullspace is obtained by SVD method. That is, matrix <strong>A</strong> is decomposed into the matrices <strong>S</strong>, <strong>U</strong>, <strong>V</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong> = <strong>U</strong>*<strong>S</strong>*transpose(<strong>V</strong>)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"with the orthonormal matrices <strong>U</strong> and <strong>V</strong> and the matrix <strong>S</strong> with\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>S</strong> = [<strong>S</strong>1, <strong>0</strong>]\r\n"
"<strong>S</strong>1 = [diag(s); <strong>0</strong>]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"and the singular values <strong>s</strong>={s1, s2, ..., sr} of <strong>A</strong> and r=rank(<strong>A</strong>). Note, that <strong>S</strong> has the same size as <strong>A</strong>. Since <strong>U</strong> and <strong>V</strong> are orthonormal we may write\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"transpose(<strong>U</strong>)*<strong>A</strong>*<strong>V</strong> = [<strong>S</strong>1, <strong>0</strong>].\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Matrix <strong>S</strong>1 obviously has full column rank and therefore, the left n-r rows (n is the number of columns of <strong>A</strong> or <strong>S</strong>) of matrix <strong>V</strong> span a nullspace of <strong>A</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The nullity of matrix <strong>A</strong> is the dimension of the nullspace of <strong>A</strong>. In view of the above, it becomes clear that nullity holds\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"nullity = n - r\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"with\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"n = number of columns of matrix <strong>A</strong>\r\n"
"r = rank(<strong>A</strong>)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 2,  3, 1;\r\n"
"     3, 4,  5, 2;\r\n"
"    -1, 2, -3, 3];\r\n"
"(Z, nullity) = nullspace(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Z=[0.1715;\r\n"
"  -0.686;\r\n"
"   0.1715;\r\n"
"   0.686]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"nullity = 1\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.singularValues\">Matrices.singularValues</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><h4>语法</h4><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >         Z = Matrices.nullspace(A);\r\n"
"(Z, nullity) = Matrices.nullspace(A);\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4><p>\r\n"
"这个函数计算一个标准正交基<strong>Z</strong>=[<strong> Z</strong> _1， <strong>Z</strong> _2，…]]矩阵<strong> a </strong>的零空间，即<strong> a </strong>*<strong>z</strong>_i=<strong>0</strong>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"用奇异值分解法得到零空间。即矩阵<strong>A</strong>分解为矩阵<strong>S</strong>、<strong>U</strong>、<strong>V</strong>:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >A = U*S*transpose(V)\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"与标准正交矩阵<strong>U</strong>和<strong>V</strong>和矩阵<strong>S</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >S = [S1, 0]\r\n"
"S1 = [diag(s); 0]\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"奇异值<strong>s</strong>={s1, s2，…， sr}的<strong>A</strong>和r=rank(<strong>A</strong>)。注意，<strong>S</strong>与<strong>A</strong>具有相同的大小。由于<strong>U</strong>和<strong>V</strong>是正交的，我们可以写\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >transpose(U)*A*V = [S1, 0].\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"矩阵<strong>S</strong>1显然具有满列秩，因此，矩阵<strong>V</strong>的左n-r行(n为<strong>A</strong>或<strong>S</strong>的列数)张成<strong>A</strong>的零空间。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"矩阵<strong>A</strong>的零度是矩阵<strong>A</strong>的零空间的维数。综上所述，零度得以保持。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >nullity = n - r\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"和\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >n = number of columns of matrix A\r\n"
"r = rank(A)\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >A = [1, 2,  3, 1;\r\n"
"   3, 4,  5, 2;\r\n"
"  -1, 2, -3, 3];\r\n"
"(Z, nullity) = nullspace(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Z=[0.1715;\r\n"
"-0.686;\r\n"
" 0.1715;\r\n"
" 0.686]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"nullity = 1\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4><p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.singularValues\" target=\"\">Matrices.singularValues</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.nullSpace"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>2010/05/31 </em>\r\n"
"       by Marcus Baur, DLR-RM</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li><em>2010/05/31 </em>\r\n"
"     by Marcus Baur, DLR-RM</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.exp"
msgid "Return the exponential of a matrix by adaptive Taylor series expansion with scaling and balancing"
msgstr "通过带缩放和平衡的自适应泰勒级数展开，返回矩阵的指数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.exp"
msgid "= exp(A*T)"
msgstr "= exp(A*T)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.exp"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"phi = Matrices.<strong>exp</strong>(A);\r\n"
"phi = Matrices.<strong>exp</strong>(A,T=1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function computes the exponential e<sup><strong>A</strong>T</sup> of matrix <strong>A</strong>, i.e.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                       (<strong>A</strong>T)^2   (<strong>A</strong>T)^3\r\n"
"<font size=\"4\"> <strong>&Phi;</strong></font> = e^(<strong>A</strong>T) = <strong>I</strong> + <strong>A</strong>T + ------ + ------ + ....\r\n"
"                         2!       3!\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>where e=2.71828..., <strong>A</strong> is an n x n matrix with real elements and T is a real number,\r\n"
"e.g., the sampling time.\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong> may be singular. With the exponential of a matrix it is, e.g., possible\r\n"
"to compute the solution of a linear system of differential equations</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"der(<strong>x</strong>) = <strong>A</strong>*<strong>x</strong>   ->   <strong>x</strong>(t0 + T) = e^(<strong>A</strong>T)*x(t0)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Algorithmic details</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>The algorithm is taken from</p>\r\n"
"<dl>\r\n"
"<dt>H. D. Joos, G. Gr&uuml;bel:</dt>\r\n"
"<dd><strong>RASP'91 Regulator Analysis and Synthesis Programs</strong><br>\r\n"
"    DLR - Control Systems Group 1991</dd>\r\n"
"</dl>\r\n"
"<p>The following steps are performed to calculate the exponential of A:</p>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"  <li>Matrix <strong>A</strong> is balanced<br>\r\n"
"  (= is transformed with a diagonal matrix <strong>D</strong>, such that inv(<strong>D</strong>)*<strong>A</strong>*<strong>D</strong>\r\n"
"  has a smaller condition as <strong>A</strong>).</li>\r\n"
"  <li>The scalar T is divided by a multiple of 2 such that norm(\r\n"
"       inv(<strong>D</strong>)*<strong>A</strong>*<strong>D</strong>*T/2^k ) &lt; 0.5. Note, that (1) and (2) are implemented such that no round-off errors\r\n"
"  are introduced.</li>\r\n"
"  <li>The matrix from (2) is approximated by explicitly performing the Taylor\r\n"
"  series expansion with a variable number of terms.\r\n"
"  Truncation occurs if a new term does no longer contribute to the value of <strong>&Phi;</strong>\r\n"
"  from the previous iteration.</li>\r\n"
"  <li>The resulting matrix is transformed back, by reverting the steps of (2)\r\n"
"  and (1).</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"<p>In several sources it is not recommended to use Taylor series expansion to\r\n"
"calculate the exponential of a matrix, such as in 'C.B. Moler and C.F. Van Loan:\r\n"
"Nineteen dubious ways to compute the exponential of a matrix. SIAM Review 20,\r\n"
"pp. 801-836, 1979' or in the documentation of m-file expm2 in MATLAB version 6\r\n"
"(<a href=\"http://www.mathworks.com\">http://www.mathworks.com</a>) where it is\r\n"
"stated that 'As a practical numerical method, this is often slow and inaccurate'.\r\n"
"These statements are valid for a direct implementation of the Taylor series\r\n"
"expansion, but <em>not</em> for the implementation variant used in this function.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><h4>语法</h4><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >phi = Matrices.exp(A);\r\n"
"phi = Matrices.exp(A,T=1);\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4><p>\r\n"
"该函数计算矩阵<strong>A</strong>的指数e<sup><strong>AT</strong></sup>。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >                   (AT)^2   (AT)^3\r\n"
" Φ = e^(AT) = I + AT + ------ + ------ + ....\r\n"
"                     2!       3!\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在e = 2.71828……， <strong>A</strong>是一个n × n的实数矩阵，T是实数， 例如，采样时间。 <strong>A</strong>可以是单数。对于矩阵的指数，它是，例如，可能的 计算一个线性微分方程组的解\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >der(x) = A*x   -&gt;   x(t0 + T) = e^(AT)*x(t0)\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>算法细节</h4><p>\r\n"
"算法取自\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"H. D. Joos, G. Grübel:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>RASP\\'91 Regulator Analysis and Synthesis Programs<br></strong><br>DLR - Control Systems Group 1991\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"执行以下步骤来计算A的指数:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ol><li>\r\n"
"矩阵<strong>A</strong>是平衡的<br> (=用对角矩阵<strong>D</strong>变换，使得inv(<strong>D</strong>)*<strong> a </strong>*<strong>D</strong> 条件<strong> a </strong>).</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"标量T除以2的倍数，使得norm( inv(<strong>D</strong>)*<strong>A</strong>*<strong>D</strong>*T/2^k ) &lt; 0.5. 注意，(1)和(2)的实现使得没有舍入错误 介绍了.</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"由式(2)得到的矩阵通过显式地执行泰勒近似 项数可变的级数展开。 如果新项不再对<strong>Φ</strong>的值有贡献，则发生截断。 从之前的迭代中.</li>\r\n"
"<li>\r\n"
"通过还原(2)的步骤，将得到的矩阵变换回来。 (1).</li>\r\n"
"</ol><p>\r\n"
"在一些资料中，不建议使用泰勒级数展开计算矩阵的指数，如C.B. Moler和C.F. Van Loan: 19种计算矩阵指数的可疑方法。SIAM评论20， 第801- 836,1979 \\'或在m-文件expm2在MATLAB版本6的文档 (<a href=\"http://www.mathworks.com\" target=\"\">http://www.mathworks.com</a> 他说:“作为一种实用的数值方法，这种方法通常是缓慢和不准确的。” 这些表述对于泰勒级数的直接实现是有效的扩展，但不是用于此函数中使用的实现变体。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

