msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.continuousRiccati"
msgid "Return solution X of the continuous-time algebraic Riccati equation A'*X + X*A - X*B*inv(R)*B'*X + Q = 0 (care)"
msgstr "返回连续时间代数Riccati方程A'*X + X*A - X*B*inv(R)*B'*X + Q = 0的解X"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.continuousRiccati"
msgid "Square matrix A in CARE"
msgstr "CARE中的方阵A"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.continuousRiccati"
msgid "Matrix B in CARE"
msgstr "CARE中的矩阵B"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.continuousRiccati"
msgid "Matrix R in CARE"
msgstr "CARE中的矩阵R"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.continuousRiccati"
msgid "Matrix Q in CARE"
msgstr "CARE中的矩阵Q"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.continuousRiccati"
msgid "True for subsequent refinement"
msgstr "为后续细化"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.continuousRiccati"
msgid "Stabilizing solution of CARE"
msgstr "CARE的稳定解"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.continuousRiccati"
msgid "Real parts of eigenvalue=alphaReal+i*alphaImag"
msgstr "eigenvalue=alphaReal+i*alphaImag的实部"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.continuousRiccati"
msgid "Imaginary parts of eigenvalue=alphaReal+i*alphaImag"
msgstr "eigenvalue=alphaReal+i*alphaImag的虚部"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.continuousRiccati"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                        X = Matrices.<strong>continuousRiccati</strong>(A, B, R, Q);\r\n"
"(X, alphaReal, alphaImag) = Matrices.<strong>continuousRiccati</strong>(A, B, R, Q, true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>continuousRiccati</strong> computes the solution <strong>X</strong> of the continuous-time algebraic Riccati equation\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong>'*<strong>X</strong> + <strong>X</strong>*<strong>A</strong> - <strong>X</strong>*<strong>G</strong>*<strong>X</strong> + <strong>Q</strong> = <strong>0</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"with <code><strong>G</strong> = <strong>B</strong>*inv(<strong>R</strong>)*<strong>B</strong>'</code>\r\n"
"using the Schur vector approach proposed by Laub [1].\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"It is assumed that <strong>Q</strong> is symmetric and positive semidefinite and <strong>R</strong> is symmetric, nonsingular and positive definite,\r\n"
"(<strong>A</strong>,<strong>B</strong>) is stabilizable and (<strong>A</strong>,<strong>Q</strong>) is detectable.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p><strong>\r\n"
"These assumptions are not checked in this function !!\r\n"
"</strong><br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The assumptions guarantee that the Hamiltonian matrix\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>H</strong> = [<strong>A</strong>, -<strong>G</strong>; -<strong>Q</strong>, -<strong>A</strong>']\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"has no pure imaginary eigenvalue and can be put\r\n"
"to an ordered real Schur form\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>U</strong>'*<strong>H</strong>*<strong>U</strong> = <strong>S</strong> = [<strong>S</strong>11, <strong>S</strong>12; <strong>0</strong>, <strong>S</strong>22]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"with orthogonal similarity transformation <strong>U</strong>. <strong>S</strong> is ordered in such a way,\r\n"
"that <strong>S</strong>11 contains the n stable eigenvalues of the closed loop system with system matrix\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong> - <strong>B</strong>*inv(<strong>R</strong>)*<strong>B</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>.\r\n"
"If <strong>U</strong> is partitioned to\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>U</strong> = [<strong>U</strong>11, <strong>U</strong>12; <strong>U</strong>21, <strong>U</strong>22]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"with dimensions according to <strong>S</strong>, the solution <strong>X</strong> is calculated by\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>X</strong>*<strong>U</strong>11 = <strong>U</strong>21.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"With optional input <code>refinement=true</code> a subsequent iterative refinement based on Newton's method with exact line search is applied.\r\n"
"See <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.continuousRiccatiIterative\">continuousRiccatiIterative</a>\r\n"
"for more information.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>References</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"[1] Laub, A.J.\r\n"
"    A Schur Method for Solving Algebraic Riccati equations.\r\n"
"    IEEE Trans. Auto. Contr., AC-24, pp. 913-921, 1979.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [0.0, 1.0;\r\n"
"     0.0, 0.0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"B = [0.0;\r\n"
"     1.0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"R = [1];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Q = [1.0, 0.0;\r\n"
"     0.0, 2.0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"X = continuousRiccati(A, B, R, Q);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"X = [2.0, 1.0;\r\n"
"     1.0, 2.0];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.continuousRiccatiIterative\">Matrices.Utilities.continuousRiccatiIterative</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteRiccati\">Matrices.discreteRiccati</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                    X = Matrices.<strong>continuousRiccati</strong>(A, B, R, Q);\r\n"
"(X, alphaReal, alphaImag) = Matrices.<strong>continuousRiccati</strong>(A, B, R, Q, true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>continuousRiccati</strong>计算连续时间代数Riccati方程的解<strong>X</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong>'*<strong>X</strong> + <strong>X</strong>*<strong>A</strong> - <strong>X</strong>*<strong>G</strong>*<strong>X</strong> + <strong>Q</strong> = <strong>0</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<code><strong>G</strong> = <strong>B</strong>*inv(<strong>R</strong>)*<strong>B</strong>'</code>使用Laub提出的Schur向量方法[1]。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"假设<strong>Q</strong>是对称的正半定的，<strong>R</strong>是对称的非奇异的正定的，\r\n"
"(<strong>A</strong>，<strong>B</strong>)是稳定的，(<strong>A</strong>，<strong>Q</strong>)是可检测的。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p><strong>\r\n"
"在这个函数中没有检查这些假设!!\r\n"
"</strong><br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个假设保证了Hamiltonian矩阵\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>H</strong> = [<strong>A</strong>, -<strong>G</strong>; -<strong>Q</strong>, -<strong>A</strong>']\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"没有纯虚特征值，并且可以转换为有序的实Schur形式\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>U</strong>'*<strong>H</strong>*<strong>U</strong> = <strong>S</strong> = [<strong>S</strong>11, <strong>S</strong>12; <strong>0</strong>, <strong>S</strong>22]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"正交相似变换<strong>U</strong>.<strong>S</strong>排序如下:\r\n"
"<strong>S</strong>11包含有闭环系统矩阵的系统矩阵\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong> - <strong>B</strong>*inv(<strong>R</strong>)*<strong>B</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>的n个稳定特征值。\r\n"
"如果<strong>U</strong>被分区为\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>U</strong> = [<strong>U</strong>11, <strong>U</strong>12; <strong>U</strong>21, <strong>U</strong>22]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"根据<strong>S</strong>的维度，解<strong>X</strong>被计算为\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>X</strong>*<strong>U</strong>11 = <strong>U</strong>21.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"对于可选输入<code>refinement=true</code>，应用基于牛顿方法的精确行搜索的后续迭代细化。\r\n"
"参见<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.continuousRiccatiIterative\">continuousRiccatiIterative</a>\r\n"
"了解更多信息。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参考文献</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"[1] Laub, A.J.\r\n"
"A Schur Method for Solving Algebraic Riccati equations.\r\n"
"IEEE Trans. Auto. Contr., AC-24, pp. 913-921, 1979.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [0.0, 1.0;\r\n"
" 0.0, 0.0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"B = [0.0;\r\n"
" 1.0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"R = [1];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Q = [1.0, 0.0;\r\n"
" 0.0, 2.0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"X = continuousRiccati(A, B, R, Q);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"X = [2.0, 1.0;\r\n"
" 1.0, 2.0];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.continuousRiccatiIterative\">Matrices.Utilities.continuousRiccatiIterative</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteRiccati\">Matrices.discreteRiccati</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

