msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteLyapunov"
msgid "Return solution X of the discrete-time Lyapunov equation A'*X*A + sgn*X = C"
msgstr "返回离散时间Lyapunov方程A'*X*A + sgn*X = C的解X"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteLyapunov"
msgid "Square matrix A in A'*X*A + sgn*X = C"
msgstr "方阵A (A'*X) *A + sgn*X = C"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteLyapunov"
msgid "Square matrix C in A'*X*A + sgn*X = C"
msgstr "方阵C (A'*X) *A + sgn*X = C"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteLyapunov"
msgid "= true, if transpose(A) has already real Schur form"
msgstr "= true，如果转置(A)已经是实舒尔形式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteLyapunov"
msgid "Specifies the sign in A'*X*A + sgn*X = C"
msgstr "指定A'*X*A + sgn*X = C中的符号"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteLyapunov"
msgid "Tolerance eps"
msgstr "容忍度 eps"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteLyapunov"
msgid "RSF of A', i.e., R=U'A'U"
msgstr "RSF of A', i.e., R=U'A'U"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteLyapunov"
msgid "Transformation matrix U for R=U'A'U"
msgstr "变换矩阵 U 用于 R=U'A'U"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteLyapunov"
msgid "Matrix D=U'*C*U"
msgstr "矩阵 D=U'*C*U"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteLyapunov"
msgid "Solution X of the Lyapunov equation A'*X*A + sgn*X = C"
msgstr "李雅普诺夫方程 A'*X*A + sgn*X = C 的解 X"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteLyapunov"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"X = Matrices.<strong>discreteLyapunov</strong>(A, C);\r\n"
"X = Matrices.<strong>discreteLyapunov</strong>(A, C, ATisSchur, sgn, eps);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function computes the solution <strong>X</strong> of the discrete-time Lyapunov equation\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>A</strong> + sgn*<strong>X</strong> = <strong>C</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"where sgn=1 or sgn =-1. For sgn = -1, the discrete Lyapunov equation is a special case of the Stein equation:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong>*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>B</strong> - <strong>X</strong> + <strong>Q</strong> = <strong>0</strong>.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The algorithm uses the Schur method for Lyapunov equations proposed by Bartels and Stewart [1].\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In a nutshell, the problem is reduced to the corresponding problem\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>R</strong>*<strong>Y</strong>*<strong>R</strong>' + sgn*<strong>Y</strong> = <strong>D</strong>.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"with <strong>R</strong>=<strong>U</strong>'*<strong>A'</strong>*<strong>U</strong> is the real Schur form of <strong>A</strong>' and <strong>D</strong>=<strong>U</strong>'*<strong>C</strong>*<strong>U</strong> and <strong>Y</strong>=<strong>U</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>U</strong>\r\n"
"are the corresponding transformations of <strong>C</strong> and <strong>X</strong>. This problem is solved sequentially by exploiting the block triangular form of <strong>R</strong>.\r\n"
"Finally the solution of the original problem is recovered as <strong>X</strong>=<strong>U</strong>*<strong>Y</strong>*<strong>U</strong>'.<br>\r\n"
"The Boolean input \"ATisSchur\" indicates to omit the transformation to Schur in the case that <strong>A</strong>' has already Schur form.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>References</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"[1] Bartels, R.H. and Stewart G.W.\r\n"
"    Algorithm 432: Solution of the matrix equation AX + XB = C.\r\n"
"    Comm. ACM., Vol. 15, pp. 820-826, 1972.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 2,  3,  4;\r\n"
"     3, 4,  5, -2;\r\n"
"    -1, 2, -3, -5;\r\n"
"     0, 2,  0,  6];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"C =  [-2,  3, 1, 0;\r\n"
"      -6,  8, 0, 1;\r\n"
"       2,  3, 4, 5;\r\n"
"       0, -2, 0, 0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"X = discreteLyapunov(A, C, sgn=-1);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"X  = [7.5735,   -3.1426,  2.7205, -2.5958;\r\n"
"     -2.6105,    1.2384, -0.9232,  0.9632;\r\n"
"      6.6090,   -2.6775,  2.6415, -2.6928;\r\n"
"     -0.3572,    0.2298,  0.0533, -0.27410];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteSylvester\">Matrices.discreteSylvester</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.continuousLyapunov\">Matrices.continuousLyapunov</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"X = Matrices.<strong>discreteLyapunov</strong>(A, C);\r\n"
"X = Matrices.<strong>discreteLyapunov</strong>(A, C, ATisSchur, sgn, eps);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数计算离散时间Lyapunov方程的解<strong>X</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>A</strong> + sgn*<strong>X</strong> = <strong>C</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中sgn=1或sgn =-1。当sgn = -1时，离散Lyapunov方程是Stein方程的特例：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong>*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>B</strong> - <strong>X</strong> + <strong>Q</strong> = <strong>0</strong>.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该算法采用Bartels和Stewart提出的Lyapunov方程的Schur法[1]。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"简而言之，这个问题可以简化为相应的问题\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>R</strong>*<strong>Y</strong>*<strong>R</strong>' + sgn*<strong>Y</strong> = <strong>D</strong>.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"其中<strong>R</strong>=<strong>U</strong>'*<strong>A'</strong>*<strong>U</strong>是<strong>A</strong>'的实Schur形式，\r\n"
"<strong>D</strong>=<strong>U</strong>'*<strong>C</strong>*<strong>U</strong>和<strong>Y</strong>=<strong>U</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>U</strong>\r\n"
"为<strong>C</strong>和<strong>X</strong>的相应变换。这个问题通过利用<strong>R</strong>的块三角形形式逐步解决。\r\n"
"最后原问题的解通过<strong>X</strong>=<strong>U</strong>*<strong>Y</strong>*<strong>U</strong>'恢复。\r\n"
"布尔输入\"ATisSchur\"表示在<strong>A</strong>'已经是Schur形式的情况下，跳过转换为Schur形式的步骤。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参考文献</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"[1] Bartels, R.H. and Stewart G.W.\r\n"
"  Algorithm 432: Solution of the matrix equation AX + XB = C.\r\n"
"  Comm. ACM., Vol. 15, pp. 820-826, 1972.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 2,  3,  4;\r\n"
"   3, 4,  5, -2;\r\n"
"  -1, 2, -3, -5;\r\n"
"   0, 2,  0,  6];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"C =  [-2,  3, 1, 0;\r\n"
"    -6,  8, 0, 1;\r\n"
"     2,  3, 4, 5;\r\n"
"     0, -2, 0, 0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"X = discreteLyapunov(A, C, sgn=-1);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"X  = [7.5735,   -3.1426,  2.7205, -2.5958;\r\n"
"   -2.6105,    1.2384, -0.9232,  0.9632;\r\n"
"    6.6090,   -2.6775,  2.6415, -2.6928;\r\n"
"   -0.3572,    0.2298,  0.0533, -0.27410];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteSylvester\">Matrices.discreteSylvester</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.continuousLyapunov\">Matrices.continuousLyapunov</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

