msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteRiccati"
msgid "Return solution of discrete-time algebraic Riccati equation A'*X*A - X - A'*X*B*inv(R + B'*X*B)*B'*X*A + Q = 0 (dare)"
msgstr "返回离散时间代数Riccati方程A'*X*A - X - A'*X*B*inv(R + B'*X*B)*B'*X*A + Q = 0的解"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteRiccati"
msgid "Square matrix A in DARE"
msgstr "DARE中的方阵A"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteRiccati"
msgid "Matrix B in DARE"
msgstr "DARE中的矩阵B"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteRiccati"
msgid "Matrix R in DARE"
msgstr "DARE中的矩阵R"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteRiccati"
msgid "Matrix Q in DARE"
msgstr "DARE中的矩阵Q"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteRiccati"
msgid "True for subsequent refinement"
msgstr "为后续细化"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteRiccati"
msgid "orthogonal matrix of the Schur vectors associated to ordered rsf"
msgstr "与有序rsf相关的舒尔向量的正交矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteRiccati"
msgid "Real part of eigenvalue=alphaReal+i*alphaImag"
msgstr "eigenvalue=alphaReal+i*alphaImag的实部"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteRiccati"
msgid "Imaginary part of eigenvalue=alphaReal+i*alphaImag"
msgstr "eigenvalue=alphaReal+i*alphaImag的虚部"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.discreteRiccati"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                        X = Matrices.<strong>discreteRiccati</strong>(A, B, R, Q);\r\n"
"(X, alphaReal, alphaImag) = Matrices.<strong>discreteRiccati</strong>(A, B, R, Q, true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>discreteRiccati</strong> computes the solution <strong>X</strong> of the discrete-time algebraic Riccati equation\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>A</strong> - <strong>X</strong> - <strong>A</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>B</strong>*inv(<strong>R</strong> + <strong>B</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>B</strong>)*<strong>B</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>A</strong> + <strong>Q</strong> = <strong>0</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"using the Schur vector approach proposed by Laub [1].\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"It is assumed that <strong>Q</strong> is symmetric and positive semidefinite and <strong>R</strong> is symmetric, nonsingular and positive definite,\r\n"
"(<strong>A</strong>,<strong>B</strong>) is stabilizable and (<strong>A</strong>,<strong>Q</strong>) is detectable. Using this method, <strong>A</strong> has also to be invertible.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>These assumptions are not checked in this function !!!</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The assumptions guarantee that the Hamiltonian matrix.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>H</strong> = [<strong>A</strong> + <strong>G</strong>*<strong>T</strong>*<strong>Q</strong>, -<strong>G</strong>*<strong>T</strong>; -<strong>T</strong>*<strong>Q</strong>, <strong>T</strong>]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"with\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"     -T\r\n"
"<strong>T</strong> = <strong>A</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"and\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"       -1\r\n"
"<strong>G</strong> = <strong>B</strong>*<strong>R</strong> *<strong>B</strong>'\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"has no eigenvalue on the unit circle and can be put\r\n"
"to an ordered real Schur form\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>U</strong>'*<strong>H</strong>*<strong>U</strong> = <strong>S</strong> = [<strong>S11</strong>, <strong>S12</strong>; <strong>0</strong>, <strong>S22</strong>]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"with orthogonal similarity transformation <strong>U</strong>. <strong>S</strong> is ordered in such a way,\r\n"
"that <strong>S11</strong> contains the n stable eigenvalues of the closed loop system with system matrix\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                  -1\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong> - <strong>B</strong>*(<strong>R</strong> + <strong>B</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>B</strong>)  *<strong>B</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>A</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If <strong>U</strong> is partitioned to\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>U</strong> = [<strong>U11</strong>, <strong>U12</strong>; <strong>U21</strong>, <strong>U22</strong>]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"according to <strong>S</strong>, the solution <strong>X</strong> can be calculated by\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>X</strong>*<strong>U11</strong> = <strong>U21</strong>.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>References</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"[1] Laub, A.J.\r\n"
"    A Schur Method for Solving Algebraic Riccati equations.\r\n"
"    IEEE Trans. Auto. Contr., AC-24, pp. 913-921, 1979.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A  = [4.0    3.0]\r\n"
"     -4.5,  -3.5];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"B  = [ 1.0;\r\n"
"      -1.0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"R = [1.0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Q = [9.0, 6.0;\r\n"
"     6.0, 4.0]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"X = discreteRiccati(A, B, R, Q);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"  results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"X = [14.5623, 9.7082;\r\n"
"      9.7082, 6.4721];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.continuousRiccati\">Matrices.continuousRiccati</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                      X = Matrices.<strong>discreteRiccati</strong>(A, B, R, Q);\r\n"
"(X, alphaReal, alphaImag) = Matrices.<strong>discreteRiccati</strong>(A, B, R, Q, true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>discreteRiccati</strong>计算离散时间代数Riccati方程的解<strong>X</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>A</strong> - <strong>X</strong> - <strong>A</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>B</strong>*inv(<strong>R</strong> + <strong>B</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>B</strong>)*<strong>B</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>A</strong> + <strong>Q</strong> = <strong>0</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"使用Laub提出的Schur向量方法[1]。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"假设<strong>Q</strong>是对称的正半定的，<strong>R</strong>是对称的非奇异的正定的，\r\n"
"(<strong>A</strong>，<strong>B</strong>)是稳定的，(<strong>A</strong>，<strong>Q</strong>)是可检测的。使用这种方法，<strong>A</strong>也必须是可逆的.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>在这个函数中没有检查这些假设!!!</strong>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个假设保证了哈密顿矩阵。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>H</strong> = [<strong>A</strong> + <strong>G</strong>*<strong>T</strong>*<strong>Q</strong>, -<strong>G</strong>*<strong>T</strong>; -<strong>T</strong>*<strong>Q</strong>, <strong>T</strong>]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"和\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"   -T\r\n"
"<strong>T</strong> = <strong>A</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"和\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"     -1\r\n"
"<strong>G</strong> = <strong>B</strong>*<strong>R</strong> *<strong>B</strong>'\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"没有特征值位于单位圆上，并且可以转换为有序的实Schur形式\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>U</strong>'*<strong>H</strong>*<strong>U</strong> = <strong>S</strong> = [<strong>S11</strong>, <strong>S12</strong>; <strong>0</strong>, <strong>S22</strong>]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"正交相似变换<strong>U</strong>.<strong>S</strong>排序如下:\r\n"
"<strong>S11</strong>包含有系统矩阵的闭环系统的n个稳定特征值\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                -1\r\n"
"<strong>A</strong> - <strong>B</strong>*(<strong>R</strong> + <strong>B</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>B</strong>)  *<strong>B</strong>'*<strong>X</strong>*<strong>A</strong>\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果<strong>U</strong>被分区为\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>U</strong> = [<strong>U11</strong>, <strong>U12</strong>; <strong>U21</strong>, <strong>U22</strong>]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"根据<strong>S</strong>，解<strong>X</strong>可计算为\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>X</strong>*<strong>U11</strong> = <strong>U21</strong>.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>参考文献</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"[1] Laub, A.J.\r\n"
"  A Schur Method for Solving Algebraic Riccati equations.\r\n"
"  IEEE Trans. Auto. Contr., AC-24, pp. 913-921, 1979.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A  = [4.0    3.0]\r\n"
"   -4.5,  -3.5];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"B  = [ 1.0;\r\n"
"    -1.0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"R = [1.0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Q = [9.0, 6.0;\r\n"
"   6.0, 4.0]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"X = discreteRiccati(A, B, R, Q);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"X = [14.5623, 9.7082;\r\n"
"    9.7082, 6.4721];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.continuousRiccati\">Matrices.continuousRiccati</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

