msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.sort"
msgid "Sort the rows or columns of a matrix in ascending or descending order"
msgstr "按升序或降序对矩阵的行或列进行排序"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.sort"
msgid "Matrix to be sorted"
msgstr "待排序矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.sort"
msgid "= true, if rows are sorted, otherwise columns"
msgstr "= true，如果行被排序，否则为列"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.sort"
msgid "= true, if ascending order, otherwise descending order"
msgstr "= true，如果是升序，否则是降序"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.sort"
msgid "Sorted matrix"
msgstr "排序矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.sort"
msgid "sorted_M = if sortRows then M[indices,:] else M[:,indices]"
msgstr "sorted_M = if sortRows then M[indices,:] else M[:,indices]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.sort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"           sorted_M = Matrices.<strong>sort</strong>(M);\r\n"
"(sorted_M, indices) = Matrices.<strong>sort</strong>(M, sortRows=true, ascending=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>sort</strong>(..) sorts the rows of a Real matrix M\r\n"
"in ascending order and returns the result in sorted_M.\r\n"
"If the optional argument \"sortRows\" is <strong>false</strong>, the columns\r\n"
"of the matrix are sorted.\r\n"
"If the optional argument \"ascending\" is <strong>false</strong>, the rows or\r\n"
"columns are sorted in descending order. In the optional second\r\n"
"output argument, the indices of the sorted rows or columns with respect\r\n"
"to the original matrix are given, such that\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"sorted_M = <strong>if</strong> sortedRow <strong>then</strong> M[indices,:] <strong>else</strong> M[:,indices];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(M2, i2) := Matrices.sort([2, 1,  0;\r\n"
"                           2, 0, -1]);\r\n"
"     -> M2 = [2, 0, -1;\r\n"
"              2, 1, 0 ];\r\n"
"        i2 = {2,1};\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"         sorted_M = Matrices.<strong>sort</strong>(M);\r\n"
"(sorted_M, indices) = Matrices.<strong>sort</strong>(M, sortRows=true, ascending=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>sort</strong>(…)对实矩阵M的行进行升序排序，并将结果返回为sorted_M。\r\n"
"如果可选参数\"sortRows\"为<strong>false</strong>，则矩阵的列会被排序。\r\n"
"如果可选参数\"ascending\"为<strong>false</strong>，则行或列将按降序排序。\r\n"
"在可选的第二个输出参数中，给出与原始矩阵对应的排序行或列的索引，使得\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"sorted_M = <strong>if</strong> sortedRow <strong>then</strong> M[indices,:] <strong>else</strong> M[:,indices];\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(M2, i2) := Matrices.sort([2, 1,  0;\r\n"
"                         2, 0, -1]);\r\n"
"   -> M2 = [2, 0, -1;\r\n"
"            2, 1, 0 ];\r\n"
"      i2 = {2,1};\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.sort.greater"
msgid "Compare whether vector v1 > v2"
msgstr "比较向量v1是否大于v2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.sort.less"
msgid "Compare whether vector v1 < v2"
msgstr "比较向量v1是否小于v2"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.flipLeftRight"
msgid "Flip the columns of a matrix in left/right direction"
msgstr "在左/右方向翻转矩阵的列"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.flipLeftRight"
msgid "Matrix to be flipped"
msgstr "要翻转的矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.flipLeftRight"
msgid "Flipped matrix"
msgstr "翻转矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.flipLeftRight"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
" <h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A_flr = Matrices.<strong>flipLeftRight</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>flipLeftRight</strong> computes from matrix <strong>A</strong> a matrix <strong>A_flr</strong> with flipped columns, i.e., <strong>A_flr</strong>[:,i]=<strong>A</strong>[:,n-i+1], i=1,..., n.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 2,  3;\r\n"
"     3, 4,  5;\r\n"
"    -1, 2, -3];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"A_flr = flipLeftRight(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"A_flr = [3, 2,  1;\r\n"
"         5, 4,  3;\r\n"
"        -3, 2, -1]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.flipUpDown\">Matrices.flipUpDown</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A_flr = Matrices.<strong>flipLeftRight</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>flipLeftRight</strong>从矩阵<strong>A</strong>计算出一个翻转列的矩阵<strong>A_flr</strong>，即<strong>A_flr</strong>[:，i]=<strong>A</strong>[:，n-i+1], i=1，…n。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 2,  3;\r\n"
"   3, 4,  5;\r\n"
"  -1, 2, -3];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"A_flr = flipLeftRight(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"A_flr = [3, 2,  1;\r\n"
"       5, 4,  3;\r\n"
"      -3, 2, -1]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.flipUpDown\">Matrices.flipUpDown</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

