msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.flipUpDown"
msgid "Flip the rows of a matrix in up/down direction"
msgstr "在上/下方向翻转矩阵的行"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.flipUpDown"
msgid "Matrix to be flipped"
msgstr "要翻转的矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.flipUpDown"
msgid "Flipped matrix"
msgstr "翻转矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.flipUpDown"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A_fud = Matrices.<strong>flipUpDown</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>flipUpDown</strong> computes from matrix <strong>A</strong> a matrix <strong>A_fud</strong> with flipped rows, i.e., <strong>A_fud</strong>[i,:]=<strong>A</strong>[n-i+1,:], i=1,..., n.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 2,  3;\r\n"
"     3, 4,  5;\r\n"
"    -1, 2, -3];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"A_fud = flipUpDown(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"A_fud  = [-1, 2, -3;\r\n"
"           3, 4,  5;\r\n"
"           1, 2,  3]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.flipLeftRight\">Matrices.flipLeftRight</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A_fud = Matrices.<strong>flipUpDown</strong>(A);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>flipUpDown</strong>从矩阵<strong>A</strong>计算出具有翻转行的矩阵<strong>A_fud</strong>，即<strong>A_fud</strong>[i,:]=<strong>A</strong>[n-i+1,:], i=1,..., n。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A = [1, 2,  3;\r\n"
"   3, 4,  5;\r\n"
"  -1, 2, -3];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"A_fud = flipUpDown(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"A_fud  = [-1, 2, -3;\r\n"
"         3, 4,  5;\r\n"
"         1, 2,  3]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
