"\r\n"
"LDA     (输入) INTEGER\r\n"
"      数组 A 的前向维度.  LDA >= max(1,M).\r\n"
"\r\n"
"S       (输出) DOUBLE PRECISION array, dimension (min(M,N))\r\n"
