msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.toUpperHessenberg"
msgid "Transform a real square matrix A to upper Hessenberg form H by orthogonal similarity transformation:  Q' * A * Q = H"
msgstr "通过正交相似变换将实方阵A转换为上Hessenberg矩阵H：Q' * A * Q = H"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.toUpperHessenberg"
msgid "Square matrix A"
msgstr "方阵A"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.toUpperHessenberg"
msgid "Lowest index where the original matrix is not in upper triangular form"
msgstr "原始矩阵不是上三角形式的最低指标"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.toUpperHessenberg"
msgid "Highest index where the original matrix is not in upper triangular form"
msgstr "原始矩阵不是上三角形式的最高指标"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.toUpperHessenberg"
msgid "Upper Hessenberg form"
msgstr "上海森伯格形式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.toUpperHessenberg"
msgid "V=[v1,v2,..vn-1,0] with vi are vectors which define the elementary reflectors"
msgstr "V=[v1,v2,..vn-1,0] vi是定义初等反射器的向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.toUpperHessenberg"
msgid "Scalar factors of the elementary reflectors"
msgstr "初等反射器的标量因子"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.toUpperHessenberg"
msgid "Information of successful function call"
msgstr "函数调用成功的信息"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.toUpperHessenberg"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"   <h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"                H = Matrices.Utilities.<strong>toUpperHessenberg</strong>(A);\r\n"
"(H, V, tau, info) = Matrices.Utilities.<strong>toUpperHessenberg</strong>(A,ilo, ihi);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>toUpperHessenberg</strong> computes a upper Hessenberg form <strong>H</strong> of a matrix <strong>A</strong> by orthogonal similarity transformation:  <strong>Q</strong>' * <strong>A</strong> * <strong>Q</strong> = <strong>H</strong>.\r\n"
"The optional inputs <strong>ilo</strong> and <strong>ihi</strong> improve efficiency if the matrix is already partially converted to Hessenberg form; it is assumed\r\n"
"that matrix <strong>A</strong> is already upper Hessenberg for rows and columns <strong>1:(ilo-1)</strong> and <strong>(ihi+1):size(A, 1)</strong>.\r\n"
"The function calls <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LAPACK.dgehrd\">LAPACK.dgehrd</a>.\r\n"
"See <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LAPACK.dgehrd\">Matrices.LAPACK.dgehrd</a> for more information about the additional outputs V, tau, info and inputs ilo, ihi.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A  = [1, 2, 3;\r\n"
"      6, 5, 4;\r\n"
"      1, 0, 0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"H = toUpperHessenberg(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"results in:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"H = [1.0,  -2.466,  2.630;\r\n"
"    -6.083, 5.514, -3.081;\r\n"
"     0.0,   0.919, -0.514]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.hessenberg\">Matrices.hessenberg</a>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"      H = Matrices.Utilities.<strong>toUpperHessenberg</strong>(A);\r\n"
"(H, V, tau, info) = Matrices.Utilities.<strong>toUpperHessenberg</strong>(A,ilo, ihi);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>toUpperHessenberg</strong>通过正交相似变换计算矩阵<strong> a </strong>的上Hessenberg形式<strong>H</strong>: <strong>Q</strong>' * <strong> a </strong> * <strong>Q</strong> = <strong>H</strong>。\r\n"
"可选输入<strong>ilo</strong>和<strong>ihi</strong>如果矩阵已经部分转换为海森伯格形式，则可以提高效率;假设\r\n"
"矩阵<strong>A</strong>对于行和列<strong>1:(ihi -1)</strong>和<strong>(ihi+1):size(A, 1)</strong>已经是上Hessenberg。\r\n"
"该函数调用<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LAPACK.dgehrd\">LAPACK.dgehrd</a>。\r\n"
"参见<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.LAPACK.dgehrd\">Matrices.LAPACK. dgehrd</a>。有关附加输出V, tau, info和输入ilo, ihi的更多信息.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>例子</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"A  = [1, 2, 3;\r\n"
"6, 5, 4;\r\n"
"1, 0, 0];\r\n"
"\r\n"
"H = toUpperHessenberg(A);\r\n"
"\r\n"
"结果:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"H = [1.0,  -2.466,  2.630;\r\n"
"-6.083, 5.514, -3.081;\r\n"
"0.0,   0.919, -0.514]\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.hessenberg\">Matrices.hessenberg</a>\r\n"
"</html>"

