msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.findLocal_tk"
msgid "Find a local minimizer tk to define the length of the step tk*Nk in continuousRiccatiIterative and discreteRiccatiIterative"
msgstr "找到一个局部极小器tk来定义连续迭代和离散迭代中步骤tk*Nk的长度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.findLocal_tk"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"tk = Matrices.Utilities.<strong>findLocal_tk</strong>(Rk, Vk);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <code>findLocal_tk()</code> is an auxiliary function called in iterative solver for algebraic Riccati equation based on Newton's method with\r\n"
"exact line search like <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.continuousRiccatiIterative\">continuousRiccatiIterative</a><br>\r\n"
"and <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.discreteRiccatiIterative\">discreteRiccatiIterative</a>.<br>\r\n"
"The function computes the local minimum of the function f_k(t_k)\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"f_k(t_k) = alpha_k*(1-t_k)^2 + 2*beta_k*(1-t)*t^2 + gamma_k*t^4\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"by calculating the zeros of the derivation d f_k/d t_k. It is known that the function f_k(t_k) has a local minimum at some value t_k_min in [0, 2].<br>\r\n"
"With t_k_min the norm of the next residual of the algorithm will be minimized.<br>\r\n"
"See [1] for more information\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>References</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"[1] Benner, P., Byers, R.\r\n"
"    An Exact Line Search Method for Solving Generalized Continuous-Time Algebraic Riccati Equations\r\n"
"    IEEE Transactions On Automatic Control, Vol. 43, No. 1, pp. 101-107, 1998.\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.continuousRiccatiIterative\">Matrices.Utilities.continuousRiccatiIterative</a><br>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.discreteRiccatiIterative\">Matrices.Utilities.discreteRiccatiIterative</a><br>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html><h4>语法</h4><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >tk = Matrices.Utilities.findLocal_tk(Rk, Vk);\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4><p>\r\n"
"函数<code>findLocal_tk()</code>是基于牛顿法的代数Riccati方程迭代求解器中调用的辅助函数精确行搜索，如<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.continuousRiccatiIterative\" target=\"\">continuousRiccatiIterative</a><br> 和 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.discreteRiccatiIterative\" target=\"\">discreteRiccatiIterative</a>.<br> 函数计算函数f_k(t_k)的局部最小值\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >f_k(t_k) = alpha_k*(1-t_k)^2 + 2*beta_k*(1-t)*t^2 + gamma_k*t^4\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"通过计算导数d f_k/d t_k的零点。已知函数f_k(t_k)在[0,2]中的某个值t_k_min处有一个局部最小值。<br> 使用t_k_min，算法的下一个残差的范数将被最小化。<br>参见[1]了解更多信息\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>参考文献</h4><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<pre><code >[1] Benner, P., Byers, R.\r\n"
"An Exact Line Search Method for Solving Generalized Continuous-Time Algebraic Riccati Equations\r\n"
"IEEE Transactions On Automatic Control, Vol. 43, No. 1, pp. 101-107, 1998.\r\n"
"</code></pre><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>另请参阅<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.continuousRiccatiIterative\" target=\"\">Matrices.Utilities.continuousRiccatiIterative</a><br><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.Utilities.discreteRiccatiIterative\" target=\"\">Matrices.Utilities.discreteRiccatiIterative</a><br></h4><p>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

