msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Nonlinear.quadratureLobatto"
msgid "Return the integral of an integrand function using an adaptive Lobatto rule"
msgstr "使用自适应Lobatto规则返回被积函数的积分"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Nonlinear.quadratureLobatto"
msgid "Integrand function"
msgstr "被积函数的函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Nonlinear.quadratureLobatto"
msgid "Lower limit of integration interval"
msgstr "积分区间的下限"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Nonlinear.quadratureLobatto"
msgid "Upper limit of integration interval"
msgstr "积分区间的上限"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Nonlinear.quadratureLobatto"
msgid "Relative tolerance for integral value"
msgstr "整数值的相对容差"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Nonlinear.quadratureLobatto"
msgid "Integral value"
msgstr "积分值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Nonlinear.quadratureLobatto"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>quadratureLobatto</strong>(function f(), a, b);\r\n"
"<strong>quadratureLobatto</strong>(function f(), a, b, tolerance=100*Modelica.Constants.eps);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Compute definite integral over function f(u,...) from u=a up to u=b\r\n"
"using the adaptive Lobatto rule according to:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<dl>\r\n"
"<dt>Walter Gander:</dt>\r\n"
"<dd> <strong>Adaptive Quadrature - Revisited</strong>. 1998.\r\n"
"     <a href=\"ftp://ftp.inf.ethz.ch/pub/publications/tech-reports/3xx/306.ps\">ftp://ftp.inf.ethz.ch/pub/publications/tech-reports/3xx/306.ps</a>\r\n"
"     </dd>\r\n"
"</dl>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"See the examples in <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Nonlinear.Examples\">Modelica.Math.Nonlinear.Examples</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>quadratureLobatto</strong>(function f(), a, b);\r\n"
"<strong>quadratureLobatto</strong>(function f(), a, b, tolerance=100*Modelica.Constants.eps);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"计算函数f(u，…)从u=a到u=b的定积分\r\n"
"根据自适应Lobatto规则:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<dl>\r\n"
"<dt>Walter Gander:</dt>\r\n"
"<dd> <strong>Adaptive Quadrature - Revisited</strong>. 1998.\r\n"
"   <a href=\"ftp://ftp.inf.ethz.ch/pub/publications/tech-reports/3xx/306.ps\">ftp://ftp.inf.ethz.ch/pub/publications/tech-reports/3xx/306.ps</a>\r\n"
"   </dd>\r\n"
"</dl>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"参见<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Nonlinear.Examples\">Modelica.Math.Nonlinear.Examples</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

