msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.cumulative"
msgid "Cumulative distribution function of uniform distribution"
msgstr "均匀分布的累积分布函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.cumulative"
msgid "Lower limit of u"
msgstr "u的下限"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.cumulative"
msgid "Upper limit of u"
msgstr "u的上限"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.cumulative"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Uniform.<strong>cumulative</strong>(u, u_min=0, u_max=1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function computes the cumulative distribution function\r\n"
"according to a <strong>uniform</strong> distribution in a band.\r\n"
"The returned value y is in the range:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"0 &le; y &le; 1\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Plot of the function:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Distributions/Uniform.cumulative.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For more details, see\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uniform_distribution_(continuous)\">Wikipedia</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"cumulative(0.5)    // = 0.5\r\n"
"cumulative(0,-1,1) // = 0.5\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.density\">Uniform.density</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.quantile\">Uniform.quantile</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Uniform.<strong>cumulative</strong>(u, u_min=0, u_max=1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个函数计算累积分布函数\r\n"
"根据<strong>在一个波段内的均匀</strong>分布。\r\n"
"返回值y的取值范围为:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"0 &le; y &le; 1\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数图:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Distributions/Uniform.cumulative.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"有关详细信息，请参见\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uniform_distribution_(continuous)\">Wikipedia</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"cumulative(0.5)    // = 0.5\r\n"
"cumulative(0,-1,1) // = 0.5\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.density\">Uniform.density</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.quantile\">Uniform.quantile</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

