msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.quantile"
msgid "Quantile of uniform distribution"
msgstr "均匀分布的分位数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.quantile"
msgid "Lower limit of y"
msgstr "y的下限"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.quantile"
msgid "Upper limit of y"
msgstr "y的上限"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.quantile"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Uniform.<strong>quantile</strong>(u, y_min=0, y_max=1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function computes the inverse cumulative distribution function (= quantile) according to a <strong>uniform</strong>\r\n"
"distribution in a band. Input argument u must be in the range:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"0 &le; u &le; 1\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The returned number y is in the range:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"y_min &le; y &le; y_max\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Plot of the function:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Distributions/Uniform.quantile.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For more details, see\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uniform_distribution_(continuous)\">Wikipedia</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"quantile(0.5)      // = 0.5\r\n"
"quantile(0.5,-1,1) // = 0\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.density\">Uniform.density</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.cumulative\">Uniform.cumulative</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Uniform.<strong>quantile</strong>(u, y_min=0, y_max=1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数根据<strong>均匀</strong>计算逆累积分布函数(=分位数)。\r\n"
"带状分布。输入参数u必须在以下范围内:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"0 &le; u &le; 1\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"返回的数字y在以下范围内:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"y_min &le; y &le; y_max\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数图:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Distributions/Uniform.quantile.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"有关详细信息，请参见\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uniform_distribution_(continuous)\">Wikipedia</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"quantile(0.5)      // = 0.5\r\n"
"quantile(0.5,-1,1) // = 0\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.density\">Uniform.density</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Uniform.cumulative\">Uniform.cumulative</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

