msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.density"
msgid "Density of Weibull distribution"
msgstr "威布尔分布的密度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.density"
msgid "Scale parameter of the Weibull distribution"
msgstr "威布尔分布的标度参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.density"
msgid "Shape parameter of the Weibull distribution"
msgstr "威布尔分布的形状参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.density"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Weibull.<strong>density</strong>(u, lambda=1, k=1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function computes the probability density function according to a <strong>Weibull</strong> distribution\r\n"
"with scale parameter <strong>lambda</strong> and shape parameter <strong>k</strong>. Equation:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = if u >= 0 then (k/lambda)*(u/lambda)^(k - 1)*exp(-(u/lambda)^k) else 0.0;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Plot of the function:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Distributions/Weibull.density.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For more details, see\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weibull_distribution\">Wikipedia</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"density(0.5)     // = 0.36787944117144233\r\n"
"density(1,0.5,2) // = 0.14652511110987343\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.cumulative\">Weibull.cumulative</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.quantile\">Weibull.quantile</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Weibull.<strong>density</strong>(u, lambda=1, k=1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>说明</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数根据<strong>Weibull</strong>分布计算概率密度函数\r\n"
"尺度参数<strong>lambda</strong>，形状参数<strong>k</strong>。方程:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y = if u >= 0 then (k/lambda)*(u/lambda)^(k - 1)*exp(-(u/lambda)^k) else 0.0;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"绘制函数图：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Distributions/Weibull.density.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"更多详情，请参阅\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weibull_distribution\">Wikipedia</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"density(0.5)     // = 0.36787944117144233\r\n"
"density(1,0.5,2) // = 0.14652511110987343\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.cumulative\">Weibull.cumulative</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.quantile\">Weibull.quantile</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

