msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.cumulative"
msgid "Cumulative distribution function of Weibull distribution"
msgstr "威布尔分布的累积分布函数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.cumulative"
msgid "Scale parameter of the Weibull distribution"
msgstr "威布尔分布的标度参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.cumulative"
msgid "Shape parameter of the Weibull distribution"
msgstr "威布尔分布的形状参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.cumulative"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Weibull.<strong>cumulative</strong>(u, lambda=1, k=1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function computes the cumulative distribution function\r\n"
"according to a <strong>Weibull</strong> distribution\r\n"
"with scale parameter <strong>lambda</strong> and shape parameter <strong>k</strong>. Equation:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y := if u >= 0 then 1 - exp(-(u/lambda)^k) else 0.0;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The returned value y is in the range:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"0 &le; y &le; 1\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Plot of the function:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Distributions/Weibull.cumulative.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For more details, see\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weibull_distribution\">Wikipedia</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"cumulative(0.5)       // = 0.3934693402873666\r\n"
"cumulative(0.5,0.5,1) // = 0.6321205588285577\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.density\">Weibull.density</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.quantile\">Weibull.quantile</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Weibull.<strong>cumulative</strong>(u, lambda=1, k=1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>说明</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个函数计算累积分布函数\r\n"
"符合<strong>Weibull</strong>分布\r\n"
"尺度参数<strong>lambda</strong>，形状参数<strong>k</strong>。方程:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y := if u >= 0 then 1 - exp(-(u/lambda)^k) else 0.0;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"返回值y的取值范围为:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"0 &le; y &le; 1\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数图:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Distributions/Weibull.cumulative.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"有关详细信息，请参见\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weibull_distribution\">Wikipedia</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>例子</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"cumulative(0.5)       // = 0.3934693402873666\r\n"
"cumulative(0.5,0.5,1) // = 0.6321205588285577\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.density\">Weibull.density</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.quantile\">Weibull.quantile</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

