msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.quantile"
msgid "Quantile of Weibull distribution"
msgstr "威布尔分布的量值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.quantile"
msgid "Scale parameter of the Weibull distribution"
msgstr "威布尔分布的标度参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.quantile"
msgid "Shape parameter of the Weibull distribution"
msgstr "威布尔分布的形状参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.quantile"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Weibull.<strong>quantile</strong>(u, lambda=1, k=1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function computes the inverse cumulative distribution function (= quantile) according to a <strong>Weibull</strong> distribution\r\n"
"with scale parameter <strong>lambda</strong> and shape parameter <strong>k</strong>. Equation:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y := lambda * (-log( 1-u)) ^(1/k);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Input argument u must be in the range:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"0 &le; u &lt; 1\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Plot of the function:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Distributions/Weibull.quantile.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For more details, see\r\n"
"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weibull_distribution\">Wikipedia</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"quantile(0)         // = 0\r\n"
"quantile(0.5,1,0.5) // = 0.41627730557884884\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.density\">Weibull.density</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.cumulative\">Weibull.cumulative</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Weibull.<strong>quantile</strong>(u, lambda=1, k=1);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>说明</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数根据<strong>Weibull</strong>分布计算逆累积分布函数(=分位数)\r\n"
"尺度参数<strong>lambda</strong>，形状参数<strong>k</strong>。方程:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"y := lambda * (-log( 1-u)) ^(1/k);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"输入参数u必须在以下范围内:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"0 &le; u &lt; 1\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数图:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Distributions/Weibull.quantile.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
