msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Special.erf"
msgid "Error function erf(u) = 2/sqrt(pi)*Integral_0_u exp(-t^2)*d"
msgstr "误差函数 erf(u) = 2/sqrt(pi)*Integral_0_u exp(-t^2)*d"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Special.erf"
msgid "Input argument"
msgstr "输入参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Special.erf"
msgid "= 2/sqrt(pi)*Integral_0_u exp(-t^2)*dt"
msgstr "= 2/sqrt(pi)*Integral_0_u exp(-t^2)*dt"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Special.erf"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Special.<strong>erf</strong>(u);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function computes the error function erf(u) = 2/sqrt(pi)*Integral_0_u exp(-t^2)*dt numerically with a relative precision of about 1e-15. The implementation utilizes the formulation of the Boost library\r\n"
"(53-bit implementation of <a href=\"http://www.boost.org/doc/libs/1_57_0/boost/math/special_functions/erf.hpp\">erf.hpp</a>,\r\n"
"developed by John Maddock). Plot\r\n"
"of the function:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Special/erf.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For more details, see <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Error_function\">Wikipedia</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"erf(0)    // = 0\r\n"
"erf(10)   // = 1\r\n"
"erf(0.5)  // = 0.520499877813047\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Special.erfc\">erfc</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Special.erfInv\">erfInv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Special.erfcInv\">erfcInv</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Special.<strong>erf</strong>(u);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数以数值方式计算误差函数erf(u) = 2/sqrt(pi)*Integral_0_u exp(-t^2)*dt，相对精度约为1e-15。该实现利用Boost库的公式\r\n"
"(53位实现<a href=\"http://www.boost.org/doc/libs/1_57_0/boost/math/special_functions/erf.hpp\">erf.hpp</a>，\r\n"
"由John Maddock开发)。函数图像:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Special/erf.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"有关详细信息，请参见 <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Error_function\">Wikipedia</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"erf(0)    // = 0\r\n"
"erf(10)   // = 1\r\n"
"erf(0.5)  // = 0.520499877813047\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Special.erfc\">erfc</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Special.erfInv\">erfInv</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Special.erfcInv\">erfcInv</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

