msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Special.erfcInv"
msgid "Inverse complementary error function: u = erfc(erfcInv(u))"
msgstr "逆互补误差函数: u = erfc(erfcInv(u))"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Special.erfcInv"
msgid "Input argument"
msgstr "输入参数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Special.erfcInv"
msgid "erfcInv(u)"
msgstr "erfcInv(u)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.Special.erfcInv"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Special.<strong>erfInv</strong>(u);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function computes the inverse of the complementary error function\r\n"
"erfc(u) = 1 - erf(u) with a relative precision of about 1e-15.\r\n"
"Therefore, u = erfc(erfcInv(u)) and erfcInv(u) = erfInv(1 - u). Input argument u must be in the range\r\n"
"(otherwise an assertion is raised):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"0 &le; u &le; 2\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If u = 2, the function returns -Modelica.Constants.inf.<br>\r\n"
"If u = 0, the function returns Modelica.Constants.inf<br>\r\n"
"The implementation utilizes the formulation of the Boost library (<a href=\"http://www.boost.org/doc/libs/1_57_0/boost/math/special_functions/detail/erf_inv.hpp\">erf_inv.hpp</a>,\r\n"
"developed by John Maddock).<br>\r\n"
"Plot of the function:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Special/erfcInv.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"For more details, see <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Error_function\">Wikipedia</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"erfcInv(1)         // = 0\r\n"
"erfcInv(0.5)       // = 0.4769362762044699\r\n"
"erfInv(1.999999)   // = -3.4589107372909473\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Special.erf\">erf</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Special.erfc\">erfc</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Special.erfInv\">erfInv</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Special.<strong>erfInv</strong>(u);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个函数计算互补误差函数的逆\r\n"
"Erfc (u) = 1 - erf(u)，相对精度约为1e-15。\r\n"
"因此，u = erfc(erfcInv(u))和erfcInv(u) = erfInv(1 - u)。输入参数u必须在该范围内\r\n"
"(否则会引发断言):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"0 &le; u &le; 2\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果u = 2，函数返回-Modelica.Constants.inf。<br>\r\n"
"如果u = 0，函数返回Modelica.Constants.inf<br>\r\n"
"该实现利用Boost库的公式(<a href=\"http://www.boost.org/doc/libs/1_57_0/boost/math/special_functions/detail/erf_inv.hpp\">erf_inv.hpp</a>，\r\n"
"由John Maddock开发)。<br>\r\n"
"函数图:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<blockquote>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Special/erfcInv.png\">\r\n"
"</blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"有关详细信息，请参见 <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Error_function\">Wikipedia</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"erfcInv(1)         // = 0\r\n"
"erfcInv(0.5)       // = 0.4769362762044699\r\n"
"erfInv(1.999999)   // = -3.4589107372909473\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Special.erf\">erf</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Special.erfc\">erfc</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Special.erfInv\">erfInv</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

