msgid "Signal for which FFT shall be computed (size(nu,1) MUST be EVEN and should be an integer multiple of 2,3,5, that is size(nu,1) = 2^a*3^b*5^c, with a,b,c Integer >= 0)"
msgstr "需要计算FFT的信号(size(nu,1)必须是偶数，并且应该是2,3,5的整数倍，即size(nu,1) = 2^a*3^b*5^c，其中a,b,c integer >= 0)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Math.FastFourierTransform.Internal.rawRealFFT"
