msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.norm"
msgid "Returns the p-norm of a complex vector"
msgstr "返回复数向量的p-范数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.norm"
msgid "Vector"
msgstr "向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.norm"
msgid "Type of p-norm (often used: 1, 2, or Modelica.Constants.inf)"
msgstr "p-范数类型(常用：1、2或Modelica.Constants.inf)"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.norm"
msgid "p-norm of vector v"
msgstr "向量v的p-范数"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.norm"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(v);\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(v,p=2);   // 1 &le; p &le; &#8734;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(v)</code>\" returns the\r\n"
"<strong>Euclidean norm</strong> \"<code>sqrt(v*v)</code>\" of vector v.\r\n"
"With the optional\r\n"
"second argument \"p\", any other p-norm can be computed:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<center>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Vectors/vectorNorm.png\" alt=\"function Vectors.norm\">\r\n"
"</center>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Besides the Euclidean norm (p=2), also the 1-norm and the\r\n"
"infinity-norm are sometimes used:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>1-norm</strong></td>\r\n"
"      <td>= sum(abs(v))</td>\r\n"
"      <td><strong>norm</strong>(v,1)</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>2-norm</strong></td>\r\n"
"      <td>= sqrt(v*v)</td>\r\n"
"      <td><strong>norm</strong>(v) or <strong>norm</strong>(v,2)</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>infinity-norm</strong></td>\r\n"
"      <td>= max(abs(v))</td>\r\n"
"      <td><strong>norm</strong>(v,Modelica.Constants.<strong>inf</strong>)</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, for any vector norm the following inequality holds:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v1+v2,p) &le; <strong>norm</strong>(v1,p) + <strong>norm</strong>(v2,p)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v = {2, -4, -2, -1};\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,1);    // = 9\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,2);    // = 5\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v);      // = 5\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,10.5); // = 4.00052597412635\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,Modelica.Constants.inf);  // = 4\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.norm\">Matrices.norm</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(v);\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(v,p=2);   // 1 &le; p &le; &#8734;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用函数\"<code>Vectors.<strong>norm</strong>(v)</code>\"返回向量v的<strong>欧几里得范数</strong>\"sqrt(v*v)\"。\r\n"
"第二个参数p作为可选参数，任何其他p-范数都可以计算:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<center>\r\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/Vectors/vectorNorm.png\" alt=\"function Vectors.norm\">\r\n"
"</center>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"除了欧几里得范数(p=2)，有时还会使用1-范数和无穷范数：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>1-norm</strong></td>\r\n"
"      <td>= sum(abs(v))</td>\r\n"
"      <td><strong>norm</strong>(v,1)</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>2-norm</strong></td>\r\n"
"      <td>= sqrt(v*v)</td>\r\n"
"      <td><strong>norm</strong>(v) or <strong>norm</strong>(v,2)</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><strong>infinity-norm</strong></td>\r\n"
"      <td>= max(abs(v))</td>\r\n"
"      <td><strong>norm</strong>(v,Modelica.Constants.<strong>inf</strong>)</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意，对于任何向量范数，以下不等式成立：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v1+v2,p) &le; <strong>norm</strong>(v1,p) + <strong>norm</strong>(v2,p)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v = {2, -4, -2, -1};\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,1);    // = 9\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,2);    // = 5\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v);      // = 5\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,10.5); // = 4.00052597412635\r\n"
"<strong>norm</strong>(v,Modelica.Constants.inf);  // = 4\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Matrices.norm\">Matrices.norm</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.length"
msgid "Return length of a complex vector"
msgstr "返回复数向量的长度"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.length"
msgid "Vector"
msgstr "向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.length"
msgid "Length of vector v"
msgstr "向量v的长度"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.length"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>length</strong>(v);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Vectors.<strong>length</strong>(v)</code>\" returns the\r\n"
"<strong>Euclidean length</strong> \"<code>sqrt(v*v)</code>\" of vector v.\r\n"
"The function call is equivalent to Vectors.norm(v). The advantage of\r\n"
"length(v) over norm(v)\"is that function length(..) is implemented\r\n"
"in one statement and therefore the function is usually automatically\r\n"
"inlined. Further symbolic processing is therefore possible, which is\r\n"
"not the case with function norm(..).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v = {2, -4, -2, -1};\r\n"
"<strong>length</strong>(v);  // = 5\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.norm\">Vectors.norm</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>length</strong>(v);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>说明</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用函数\"<code>Vectors.<strong>length</strong>(v)</code>\"返回向量v的<strong>欧几里得长度</strong> \"<code>sqrt(v*v)</code>\"。\r\n"
"该函数调用等价于Vectors.norm(v)。\r\n"
"与norm(v)相比，length(v)的优势在于函数length(..)是通过一个语句实现的，因此该函数通常会被自动内联。\r\n"
"进一步的符号处理是可能的，而在函数norm(..)中则不行。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"v = {2, -4, -2, -1};\r\n"
"<strong>length</strong>(v);  // = 5\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.norm\">Vectors.norm</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.normalize"
msgid "Return normalized complex vector such that length = 1 and prevent zero-division for zero vector"
msgstr "返回归一化的复数向量，使得其长度为 1，并且防止零向量出现除零错误"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.normalize"
msgid "Vector"
msgstr "向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.normalize"
msgid "if |v| < eps then result = v"
msgstr "如果|v| < eps，则result = v"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.normalize"
msgid "Input vector v normalized to length=1"
msgstr "将输入向量v标准化为length = 1"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.normalize"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>normalize</strong>(v);\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>normalize</strong>(v,eps=100*Modelica.Constants.eps);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Vectors.<strong>normalize</strong>(v)</code>\" returns the\r\n"
"<strong>unit vector</strong> \"<code>v/length(v)</code>\" of vector v.\r\n"
"If length(v) is close to zero (more precisely, if length(v) &lt; eps),\r\n"
"v is returned in order to avoid\r\n"
"a division by zero. For many applications this is useful, because\r\n"
"often the unit vector <strong>e</strong> = <strong>v</strong>/length(<strong>v</strong>) is used to compute\r\n"
"a vector x*<strong>e</strong>, where the scalar x is in the order of length(<strong>v</strong>),\r\n"
"i.e., x*<strong>e</strong> is small, when length(<strong>v</strong>) is small and then\r\n"
"it is fine to replace <strong>e</strong> by <strong>v</strong> to avoid a division by zero.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Since the function is implemented in one statement,\r\n"
"it is usually inlined and therefore symbolic processing is\r\n"
"possible.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>normalize</strong>({1,2,3});  // = {0.267, 0.534, 0.802}\r\n"
"<strong>normalize</strong>({0,0,0});  // = {0,0,0}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.length\">Vectors.length</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>normalize</strong>(v);\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>normalize</strong>(v,eps=100*Modelica.Constants.eps);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用函数\"<code>Vectors.<strong>normalize</strong>(v)</code>\"返回向量v的<strong>单位向量</strong> \"<code>v/length(v)</code>\"。\r\n"
"如果length(v)接近于零(更准确地说，如果length(v) < eps),返回v是为了避免出现除零错误。\r\n"
"对于许多应用来说，这是很有用的，因为通常使用单位向量<strong>e</strong> = <strong>v</strong>/length(<strong>v</strong>)来计算一个向量x * <strong>e</strong>，其中标量 x 的大小与 length(v) 的数量级相当，\r\n"
"也就是说，当length(<strong>v</strong>)较小时，x * <strong>e</strong>很小，此时可以用<strong>v</strong>替代<strong>e</strong>来避免除零错误。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"由于该函数是通过一个语句实现的，因此通常会被内联处理，因此可以进行符号处理。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>normalize</strong>({1,2,3});  // = {0.267, 0.534, 0.802}\r\n"
"<strong>normalize</strong>({0,0,0});  // = {0,0,0}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Vectors.length\">Vectors.length</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.reverse"
