msgstr "反转向量元素(例如，v[1]变为最后一个元素)"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.reverse"
msgid "Vector"
msgstr "向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.reverse"
msgid "Elements of vector v in reversed order"
msgstr "向量v的元素按相反顺序排列"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.reverse"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>reverse</strong>(v);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"The function call &quot;<code>Vectors.<strong>reverse</strong>(v)</code>&quot; returns the complex vector elements in reverse order.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>reverse</strong>({1,2,3,4});  // = {4,3,2,1}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Vectors.<strong>reverse</strong>(v);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用函数\"<code>Vectors.<strong>reverse</strong>(v)</code>\"返回复数向量元素的逆序。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>reverse</strong>({1,2,3,4});  // = {4,3,2,1}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.sort"
msgid "Sort elements of complex vector"
msgstr "对复数向量的元素进行排序"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.sort"
msgid "Vector to be sorted"
msgstr "待排序向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.sort"
msgid "= true if ascending order, otherwise descending order"
msgstr "如果等于true则按升序排列，否则按降序排列"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.sort"
msgid "= true, if sorting is first for imaginary then for real value; = false, if sorting is for absolute value"
msgstr "= true，则先对虚值排序，再对实值排序；= false，则对绝对值排序"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.sort"
msgid "Sorted vector"
msgstr "排序后的向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.sort"
msgid "sorted_v = v[indices]"
msgstr "sorted_v = v[indices]"

msgctxt "Modelica.ComplexMath.Vectors.sort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"           sorted_v = Vectors.<strong>sort</strong>(v);\r\n"
"(sorted_v, indices) = Vectors.<strong>sort</strong>(v, ascending=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>sort</strong>(..) sorts a Real vector v\r\n"
"in ascending order and returns the result in sorted_v.\r\n"
"If the optional argument \"ascending\" is <strong>false</strong>, the vector\r\n"
"is sorted in descending order. In the optional second\r\n"
"output argument the indices of the sorted vector with respect\r\n"
"to the original vector are given, such that sorted_v = v[indices].\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(v2, i2) := Vectors.sort({-1, 8, 3, 6, 2});\r\n"
"    -> v2 = {-1, 2, 3, 6, 8}\r\n"
"       i2 = {1, 5, 3, 4, 2}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"           sorted_v = Vectors.<strong>sort</strong>(v);\r\n"
"(sorted_v, indices) = Vectors.<strong>sort</strong>(v, ascending=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>sort</strong>(..)对复数向量v进行升序排序，并将结果返回在sorted_v中。\r\n"
"如果可选参数\"ascending\"为<strong>false</strong>，则向量按降序排序。\r\n"
"在可选的第二个输出参数中，给出排序后的向量相对于原始向量的索引，使得sorted_v = v[indices]。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(v2, i2) := Vectors.sort({-1, 8, 3, 6, 2});\r\n"
"    -> v2 = {-1, 2, 3, 6, 8}\r\n"
"       i2 = {1, 5, 3, 4, 2}\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

