msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples"
msgid "Examples to demonstrate the usage of package Modelica.Utilities"
msgstr "示例演示如何使用Modelica.Utilities"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package contains quite involved examples that demonstrate how to\r\n"
"use the functions of package Modelica.Utilities. In particular\r\n"
"the following examples are present.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> Function <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.calculator\">calculator</a>\r\n"
"     is an interpreter to evaluate\r\n"
"     expressions consisting of +,-,*,/,(),sin(), cos(), tan(), sqrt(), pi.\r\n"
"     For example: calculator(\"1.5*sin(pi/6)\");<br>&nbsp;</li>\r\n"
"<li> Function <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.expression\">expression</a>\r\n"
"     is the basic function used in \"calculator\" to evaluate an expression.\r\n"
"     It is useful if the expression interpreter is used in a larger\r\n"
"     scan operation (such as readRealParameter below).<br>&nbsp;</li>\r\n"
"<li> Function <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.readRealParameter\">readRealParameter</a>\r\n"
"     reads the value of a parameter\r\n"
"     from file, given the file and the parameter name. The value\r\n"
"     on file is interpreted with the Examples.expression function\r\n"
"     and can therefore be an expression.<br>&nbsp;</li>\r\n"
"<li> Model <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.readRealParameterModel\">readRealParameterModel</a>\r\n"
"     is a test model to demonstrate the usage of \"readRealParameter\". The model\r\n"
"     contains 3 parameters that are read from file <a href=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Data/Utilities/Examples_readRealParameters.txt\">Examples_readRealParameters.txt</a>.<br>&nbsp;\r\n"
"     </li>\r\n"
"<li> Model <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.WriteRealMatrixToFile\">WriteRealMatrixToFile</a>\r\n"
"     demonstrates the usage of function \"Streams.writeReaMatrix\" to store a matrix in various MATLAB MAT formats on file.<br>&nbsp;\r\n"
"     </li>\r\n"
"<li> Model <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.ReadRealMatrixFromFile\">ReadRealMatrixFromFile</a>\r\n"
"     demonstrates the usage of functions \"Streams.readMatrixSize\" and \"Streams.readRealMatrix\"\r\n"
"     to read a matrix in various MATLAB MAT formats from file.\r\n"
"     </li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"本软件包包含相当多的示例，演示如何使用\r\n"
"如何使用 Modelica.Utilities 包的功能。特别是\r\n"
"包含以下示例。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> 函数<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.calculator\">calculator</a>。\r\n"
"     是一个解释器，用于评估\r\n"
"     表达式的解释器 +,-,*,/,(),sin(), cos(), tan(), sqrt(), pi.\r\n"
"     For example: calculator(\"1.5*sin(pi/6)\");<br>&nbsp;</li>\r\n"
"<li> 函数<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.expression\">expression</a>\r\n"
"     是用于评估表达式的基本函数。\r\n"
"     如果表达式解释器用于较大的\r\n"
"     扫描操作（如下面的 readRealParameter）中使用时非常有用。<br>&nbsp;</li>\r\n"
"<li> 函数 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.readRealParameter\">readRealParameter</a> 读取参数值。\r\n"
"     读取一个参数的值\r\n"
"     从文件中读取参数值。文件中的值\r\n"
"     用 Examples.expression 函数解释，因此可以是一个表达式。\r\n"
"     解释，因此可以是一个表达式。<br>&nbsp;</li>\r\n"
"<li> Model<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.readRealParameterModel\">readRealParameterModel</a>\r\n"
"是一个测试模型，用于演示\"readRealParameter\"的用法。该模型\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Data/Utilities/Examples_readRealParameters.txt\">Examples_readRealParameters.txt</a>.<br>&nbsp;\r\n"
"     </li>\r\n"
"<li> Model <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.WriteRealMatrixToFile\">WriteRealMatrixToFile</a>\r\n"
"演示了函数\"Streams.writeReaMatrix\"的用法。将矩阵以各种MATLAB MAT格式存储在文件中.<br>&nbsp;\r\n"
"     </li>\r\n"
"<li> Model <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.ReadRealMatrixFromFile\">ReadRealMatrixFromFile</a>\r\n"
"演示了函数\"Streams. readMatrixSize\"和 \"Streams.readRealMatrix\"\r\n"
"从文件中读取各种MATLAB MAT格式的矩阵。\r\n"
"     </li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.calculator"
msgid "Interpreter to evaluate simple expressions consisting of +, -, *, /, (), sin(), cos(), tan(), sqrt(), asin(), acos(), atan(), exp(), log(), pi"
msgstr "计算器，用于计算包含+、-、*、/、()、sin()、cos()、tan()、sqrt()、asin()、acos()、atan()、exp()、log()、pi的简单表达式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.calculator"
msgid "Expression that is evaluated"
msgstr "被评估的表达式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.calculator"
msgid "Value of expression"
msgstr "表达式的值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.calculator"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"result = <strong>calculator</strong>(expression);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function demonstrates how a simple expression calculator\r\n"
"can be implemented in form of a recursive decent parser\r\n"
"using basically the Strings.scanToken(..) and Strings.scanDelimiter(..)\r\n"
"function.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The following operations are supported (pi=3.14.. is a predefined constant):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"+, -\r\n"
"*, /\r\n"
"(expression)\r\n"
"sin(expression)\r\n"
"cos(expression)\r\n"
"tan(expression)\r\n"
"sqrt(expression)\r\n"
"asin(expression)\r\n"
"acos(expression)\r\n"
"atan(expression)\r\n"
"exp(expression)\r\n"
"log(expression)\r\n"
"pi\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"calculator(\"2+3*(4-1)\");  // returns 11\r\n"
"calculator(\"sin(pi/6)\");  // returns 0.5\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"result = <strong>calculator</strong>(expression);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数演示了如何使用Strings.scanToken(..)和Strings.scanDelimiter(..)函数，\r\n"
"以递归下降解析器的形式实现一个简单的表达式计算器。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"支持以下操作(pi=3.14... 是预定义常数):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"+, -\r\n"
"*, /\r\n"
"(expression)\r\n"
"sin(expression)\r\n"
"cos(expression)\r\n"
"tan(expression)\r\n"
"sqrt(expression)\r\n"
"asin(expression)\r\n"
"acos(expression)\r\n"
"atan(expression)\r\n"
"exp(expression)\r\n"
"log(expression)\r\n"
"pi\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"calculator(\"2+3*(4-1)\");  // returns 11\r\n"
"calculator(\"sin(pi/6)\");  // returns 0.5\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.expression"
msgid "Expression interpreter that returns with the position after the expression (expression may consist of +, -, *, /, (), sin(), cos(), tan(), sqrt(), asin(), acos(), atan(), exp(), log(), pi)"
msgstr "表达式解释器，返回表达式后的当前位置(表达式可以包含 +、-、*、/、()、sin()、cos()、tan()、sqrt()、asin()、acos()、atan()、exp()、log()、pi)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.expression"
msgid "Expression that is evaluated"
msgstr "被评估的表达式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.expression"
msgid "Start scanning of expression at character startIndex"
msgstr "从字符 startIndex 开始扫描表达式"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.expression"
msgid "Message used in error message if scan is not successful"
msgstr "如果扫描不成功，错误信息中使用的信息"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.expression"
msgid "Value of expression"
msgstr "表达的价值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.expression"
msgid "Index after the scanned expression"
msgstr "扫描表达式后的索引"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.expression"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"             result = <strong>expression</strong>(string);\r\n"
"(result, nextIndex) = <strong>expression</strong>(string, startIndex=1, message=\"\");\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function is nearly the same as Examples.<strong>calculator</strong>.\r\n"
"The essential difference is that function \"expression\" might be\r\n"
"used in other parsing operations: After the expression is\r\n"
"parsed and evaluated, the function returns with the value\r\n"
"of the expression as well as the position of the character\r\n"
"directly after the expression.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function demonstrates how a simple expression calculator\r\n"
"can be implemented in form of a recursive decent parser\r\n"
"using basically the Strings.scanToken(..) and scanDelimiters(..)\r\n"
"function. There are 2 local functions (term, primary) that\r\n"
"implement the corresponding part of the grammar.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The following operations are supported (pi=3.14.. is a predefined constant):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"+, -\r\n"
"*, /\r\n"
"(expression)\r\n"
"sin(expression)\r\n"
"cos(expression)\r\n"
"tan(expression)\r\n"
"sqrt(expression)\r\n"
"asin(expression)\r\n"
"acos(expression)\r\n"
"atan(expression)\r\n"
"exp(expression)\r\n"
"log(expression)\r\n"
"pi\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The optional argument \"startIndex\" defines at which position\r\n"
"scanning of the expression starts.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In case of error,\r\n"
"the optional argument \"message\" is appended to the error\r\n"
"message, in order to give additional information where\r\n"
"the error occurred.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function parses the following grammar\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"expression: [ add_op ] term { add_op term }\r\n"
"add_op    : \"+\" | \"-\"\r\n"
"term      : primary { mul_op primary }\r\n"
"mul_op    : \"*\" | \"/\"\r\n"
"primary   : UNSIGNED_NUMBER\r\n"
"            | pi\r\n"
"            | ( expression )\r\n"
"            | functionName( expression )\r\n"
"function  :   sin\r\n"
"            | cos\r\n"
"            | tan\r\n"
"            | sqrt\r\n"
"            | asin\r\n"
"            | acos\r\n"
"            | atan\r\n"
"            | exp\r\n"
"            | log\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Note, in Examples.readRealParameter it is shown, how the expression\r\n"
"function can be used as part of another scan operation.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"expression(\"2+3*(4-1)\");  // returns 11\r\n"
"expression(\"sin(pi/6)\");  // returns 0.5\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"           result = <strong>expression</strong>(string);\r\n"
"(result, nextIndex) = <strong>expression</strong>(string, startIndex=1, message=\"\");\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>说明</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数几乎与Examples.<strong>calculator</strong>相同。\r\n"
"其主要区别在于函数\"expression\"可以用于其他解析操作：\r\n"
"在表达式被解析和计算后，函数返回表达式的值以及紧跟在表达式之后的字符位置。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数演示了如何使用递归下降解析器的形式实现一个简单的表达式计算器，\r\n"
"基本上是通过Strings.scanToken(..)和scanDelimiters(..)函数。\r\n"
"此函数包含两个局部函数(term和primary)，它们实现了语法中的相应部分。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"支持如下操作(pi=3.14...是一个预定义的常量):\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"+, -\r\n"
"*, /\r\n"
"(expression)\r\n"
"sin(expression)\r\n"
"cos(expression)\r\n"
"tan(expression)\r\n"
"sqrt(expression)\r\n"
"asin(expression)\r\n"
"acos(expression)\r\n"
"atan(expression)\r\n"
"exp(expression)\r\n"
"log(expression)\r\n"
"pi\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"可选参数\"startIndex\"定义了从哪个位置开始扫描表达式。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果发生错误，可选参数\"message\"会被附加到错误信息中，以便提供关于错误发生位置的更多信息。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数解析以下语法：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"expression: [ add_op ] term { add_op term }\r\n"
"add_op    : \"+\" | \"-\"\r\n"
"term      : primary { mul_op primary }\r\n"
"mul_op    : \"*\" | \"/\"\r\n"
"primary   : UNSIGNED_NUMBER\r\n"
"          | pi\r\n"
"          | ( expression )\r\n"
"          | functionName( expression )\r\n"
"function  :   sin\r\n"
"          | cos\r\n"
"          | tan\r\n"
"          | sqrt\r\n"
"          | asin\r\n"
"          | acos\r\n"
"          | atan\r\n"
"          | exp\r\n"
"          | log\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"注意，在Examples.readRealParameter中展示了如何将expression函数作为另一个扫描操作的一部分使用。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"expression(\"2+3*(4-1)\");  // returns 11\r\n"
"expression(\"sin(pi/6)\");  // returns 0.5\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.expression.term"
msgid "Evaluate term of an expression"
msgstr "评估表达式的项"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.expression.primary"
msgid "Evaluate primary of an expression"
msgstr "评估表达式的主项"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.readRealParameter"
msgid "Read the value of a Real parameter from file"
msgstr "从文件中读取实型参数的值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.readRealParameter"
msgid "Name of file"
msgstr "文件名称"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.readRealParameter"
msgid "Text files (*.txt)"
msgstr "Text files (*.txt)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.readRealParameter"
msgid "Open file in which Real parameters are present"
msgstr "Open file in which Real parameters are present"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.readRealParameter"
msgid "Name of parameter"
msgstr "参数名称"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.readRealParameter"
msgid "Actual value of parameter on file"
msgstr "文件中参数的实际值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.readRealParameter"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"result = <strong>readRealParameter</strong>(fileName, name);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function demonstrates how a function can be implemented\r\n"
"that reads the value of a parameter from file. The function\r\n"
"performs the following actions:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> It opens file \"fileName\" and reads the lines of the file.</li>\r\n"
"<li> In every line, Modelica line comments (\"// ... end-of-line\")\r\n"
"     are skipped</li>\r\n"
"<li> If a line consists of \"name = expression\" and the \"name\"\r\n"
"     in this line is identical to the second argument \"name\"\r\n"
"     of the function call, the expression calculator Examples.expression\r\n"
"     is used to evaluate the expression after the \"=\" character.\r\n"
"     The expression can optionally be terminated with a \";\".</li>\r\n"
"<li> The result of the expression evaluation is returned as\r\n"
"     the value of the parameter \"name\".</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"On file \"test.txt\" the following lines might be present:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// Motor data\r\n"
"J        = 2.3     // inertia\r\n"
"w_rel0   = 1.5*2;  // relative angular velocity\r\n"
"phi_rel0 = pi/3\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function returns the value \"3.0\" when called as:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"readRealParameter(\"test.txt\", \"w_rel0\")\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"result = <strong>readRealParameter</strong>(fileName, name);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"该函数演示了如何实现一个从文件中读取参数值的函数。该函数执行以下操作：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li> 打开文件\"fileName\"并读取文件中的每一行。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 在每一行中，跳过 Modelica 行注释(\"// ... end-of-line\")。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 如果某一行的格式为\"name = expression\"，且该行中的\"name\"与函数调用的第二个参数\"name\"相同，\r\n"
"则使用表达式计算器Examples.expression来计算\"=\"后面的表达式。表达式可以选择性地以\";\"结尾。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 表达式计算的结果将作为参数\"name\"的值返回。</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在文件\"test.txt\"中可能会出现以下几行:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"// Motor data\r\n"
"J        = 2.3     // inertia\r\n"
"w_rel0   = 1.5*2;  // relative angular velocity\r\n"
"phi_rel0 = pi/3\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"当函数被调用时，它返回值\"3.0\"：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"readRealParameter(\"test.txt\", \"w_rel0\")\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Examples.readRealParameterModel"
msgid "Demonstrate usage of Examples.readRealParameter/.expression"
msgstr "演示Examples.readRealParameter/.expression的用法"

