msgid "Move a file or a directory to another place"
msgstr "将文件或目录移动到其他位置"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.move"
msgid "Name of file or directory to be moved"
msgstr "要移动的文件或目录的名称"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.move"
msgid "New name of the moved file or directory"
msgstr "被移动文件或目录的新名称"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.move"
msgid "= true, if an existing file or directory may be replaced"
msgstr "= true，如果可以替换现有文件或目录"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.move"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Files.<strong>move</strong>(oldName, newName);\r\n"
"Files.<strong>move</strong>(oldName, newName, replace = true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>move</strong>(..) moves a file or a directory\r\n"
"to a new location. Via the optional argument <strong>replace</strong>\r\n"
"it can be defined whether an already existing file may\r\n"
"be replaced.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If oldName/newName are directories, then the newName\r\n"
"directory may exist. In such a case the content of oldName\r\n"
"is moved into directory newName. If replace = <strong>false</strong>\r\n"
"it is required that the existing files\r\n"
"in newName are different from the existing files in\r\n"
"oldName.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"move(\"C:/test1/directory1\", \"C:/test2/directory2\");\r\n"
"   -> the content of directory1 is moved into directory2.\r\n"
"      Afterwards directory1 is deleted.\r\n"
"      if \"C:/test2/directory2\" does not exist, it is newly\r\n"
"      created. If \"replace=true\", files in directory2\r\n"
"      may be overwritten\r\n"
"move(\"test1.txt\", \"test2.txt\")\r\n"
"  -> rename file \"test1.txt\" into \"test2.txt\"\r\n"
"     within the current directory\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Files.<strong>move</strong>(oldName, newName);\r\n"
"Files.<strong>move</strong>(oldName, newName, replace = true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>说明</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"命令功能<strong>move</strong>(..)移动文件或目录\r\n"
"去一个新的地方。通过可选参数<strong>replace</strong>\r\n"
"可以定义一个已经存在的文件是否可以\r\n"
"被取代。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果oldName/newName是目录，那么newName\r\n"
"目录可能存在。在这种情况下，oldName的内容\r\n"
"移动到目录newName。如果replace = <strong>false</strong>\r\n"
"它要求现有的文件\r\n"
"newName中的文件不同于\r\n"
"oldName。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>例子</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"move(\"C:/test1/directory1\", \"C:/test2/directory2\");\r\n"
"   -> the content of directory1 is moved into directory2.\r\n"
"      Afterwards directory1 is deleted.\r\n"
"      if \"C:/test2/directory2\" does not exist, it is newly\r\n"
"      created. If \"replace=true\", files in directory2\r\n"
"      may be overwritten\r\n"
"move(\"test1.txt\", \"test2.txt\")\r\n"
"  -> rename file \"test1.txt\" into \"test2.txt\"\r\n"
"     within the current directory\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.remove"
msgid "Remove file or directory (ignore call, if it does not exist)"
msgstr "删除文件或目录(忽略调用，如果它不存在)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.remove"
msgid "Name of file or directory to be removed"
msgstr "要删除的文件或目录的名称"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.remove"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Files.<strong>remove</strong>(name);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Removes the file or directory \"name\". If \"name\" does not exist,\r\n"
"the function call is ignored. If \"name\" is a directory, first\r\n"
"the content of the directory is removed and afterwards\r\n"
"the directory itself.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function is silent, i.e., it does not print a message.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Files.<strong>remove</strong>(name);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"删除文件或目录\"name\"。如果\"name\"不存在，\r\n"
"函数调用被忽略。如果\"name\"是目录，首先\r\n"
"目录的内容被删除，然后\r\n"
"目录本身。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个函数是静默的，也就是说，它不打印消息。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.remove.removeDirectory"
msgid "Remove a directory, even if it is not empty"
msgstr "删除目录，即使它不是空的"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.removeFile"
msgid "Remove file (ignore call, if it does not exist)"
msgstr "删除文件(忽略调用，如果它不存在)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.removeFile"
msgid "Name of file that should be removed"
msgstr "应该删除的文件名"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.removeFile"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Files.<strong>removeFile</strong>(fileName);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Removes the file \"fileName\". If \"fileName\" does not exist,\r\n"
"the function call is ignored. If \"fileName\" exists but is\r\n"
"no regular file (e.g., directory, pipe, device, etc.) an\r\n"
"error is triggered.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function is silent, i.e., it does not print a message.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Files.<strong>removeFile</strong>(fileName);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"删除文件\"fileName\"。如果\"fileName\"不存在，\r\n"
"函数调用被忽略。如果\"fileName\"存在，但为\r\n"
"没有常规文件(例如，目录，管道，设备等)和\r\n"
"触发错误。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个函数是静默的，也就是说，它不打印消息。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.createDirectory"
msgid "Create directory (if directory already exists, ignore call)"
msgstr "创建目录(如果目录已经存在，忽略调用)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.createDirectory"
msgid "Name of directory to be created (if present, ignore call)"
msgstr "要创建的目录名(如果存在，忽略调用)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.createDirectory"
msgid "Number of directories that need to be generated"
msgstr "需要生成的目录数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.createDirectory"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Files.<strong>createDirectory</strong>(directoryName);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Creates directory \"directoryName\". If this directory already exists,\r\n"
"the function call is ignored. If several directories in \"directoryName\"\r\n"
"do not exist, all of them are created. For example, assume\r\n"
"that directory \"E:/test1\" exists and that directory\r\n"
"\"E:/test1/test2/test3\" shall be created. In this case\r\n"
"the directories \"test2\" in \"test1\" and \"test3\" in \"test2\"\r\n"
"are created.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function is silent, i.e., it does not print a message.\r\n"
"In case of error (e.g., \"directoryName\" is an existing regular\r\n"
"file), an assert is triggered.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Files.<strong>createDirectory</strong>(directoryName);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"创建目录\"directoryName\"。如果这个目录已经存在，\r\n"
"函数调用被忽略。如果\"directoryName\"中的多个目录\r\n"
"不存在，它们都是创建的。例如，假设\r\n"
"该目录\"E:/test1\"存在并且该目录\r\n"
"\"E:/test1/test2/test3\"。在这种情况下\r\n"
"目录\"test1\"中的\"test2\"和\"test2\"中的\"test3\"\r\n"
"创建。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个函数是静默的，也就是说，它不打印消息。\r\n"
"如果出现错误(例如，\"directoryName\"是一个已存在的正则\r\n"
"文件)，则触发一个断言。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.createDirectory.existDirectory"
msgid "Inquire whether directory exists; if present and not a directory, trigger an error"
msgstr "查询目录是否存在；如果不是目录，则触发错误"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.createDirectory.existDirectory"
msgid "= true, if directory exists"
msgstr "= 如果目录存在，则为true"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.createDirectory.assertCorrectIndex"
msgid "Print error, if index to last essential character in directory is wrong"
msgstr "如果目录中最后一个重要字符的索引错误，则打印错误"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.createDirectory.assertCorrectIndex"
msgid "Index must be > 0"
msgstr "索引必须是 > 0"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.createDirectory.assertCorrectIndex"
msgid "Directory name for error message"
msgstr "错误消息的目录名"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.exist"
msgid "Inquire whether file or directory exists"
msgstr "查询文件或目录是否存在"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.exist"
msgid "Name of file or directory"
msgstr "文件或目录的名称"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.exist"
msgid "= true, if file or directory exists"
msgstr "= 如果文件或目录存在，则为True"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.exist"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"result = Files.<strong>exist</strong>(name);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Returns true, if \"name\" is an existing file or directory.\r\n"
"If this is not the case, the function returns false.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"result = Files.<strong>exist</strong>(name);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果\"name\"是一个已存在的文件或目录，则返回true。\r\n"
"如果不是这种情况，则函数返回false。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.assertNew"
msgid "Trigger an assert, if a file or directory exists"
msgstr "如果存在文件或目录，则触发一个断言"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.assertNew"
msgid "Name of file or directory"
msgstr "文件或目录的名称"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.assertNew"
msgid "Message that should be printed after the default message in a new line"
msgstr "消息，该消息应打印在默认消息之后的新行中"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.assertNew"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Files.<strong>assertNew</strong>(name);\r\n"
"Files.<strong>assertNew</strong>(name, message=\"This is not allowed\");\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Triggers an assert, if \"name\" is an existing file or\r\n"
"directory. The error message has the following structure:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"File \"&lt;name&gt;\" already exists.\r\n"
"&lt;message&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Files.<strong>assertNew</strong>(name);\r\n"
"Files.<strong>assertNew</strong>(name, message=\"This is not allowed\");\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果\"name\"是一个已存在的文件或目录，则触发断言。错误信息的结构如下:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"File \"&lt;name&gt;\" already exists.\r\n"
"&lt;message&gt;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.fullPathName"
msgid "Get full path name of file or directory name"
msgstr "获取文件的完整路径名或目录名"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.fullPathName"
msgid "Absolute or relative file or directory name"
msgstr "绝对或相对文件或目录名"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.fullPathName"
msgid "Full path of 'name'"
msgstr "name的完整路径"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.fullPathName"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"fullName = Files.<strong>fullPathName</strong>(name);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Returns the full path name of a file or directory \"name\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"fullName = Files.<strong>fullPathName</strong>(name);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"返回文件或目录的完整路径名 \"name\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.splitPathName"
msgid "Split path name in directory, file name kernel, file name extension"
msgstr "在目录中拆分路径名称，文件名内核，文件扩展名"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.splitPathName"
msgid "Absolute or relative file or directory name"
msgstr "绝对或相对文件或目录名"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.splitPathName"
msgid "Name of the directory including a trailing '/'"
msgstr "包含尾符的目录名 '/'"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.splitPathName"
msgid "Name of the file without the extension"
msgstr "不带扩展名的文件名"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.splitPathName"
msgid "Extension of the file name. Starts with '.'"
msgstr "文件名的扩展名。开始于 '.'"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.splitPathName"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(directory, name, extension) = Files.<strong>splitPathName</strong>(pathName);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>splitPathName</strong>(..) splits a path name into its parts.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(directory, name, extension) = Files.splitPathName(\"C:/user/test/input.txt\")\r\n"
"\r\n"
"-> directory = \"C:/user/test/\"\r\n"
"   name      = \"input\"\r\n"
"   extension = \".txt\"\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(directory, name, extension) = Files.<strong>splitPathName</strong>(pathName);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"命令功能<strong>splitPathName</strong>(..)将路径名拆分为多个部分。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(directory, name, extension) = Files.splitPathName(\"C:/user/test/input.txt\")\r\n"
"\r\n"
"-> directory = \"C:/user/test/\"\r\n"
"   name      = \"input\"\r\n"
"   extension = \".txt\"\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.temporaryFileName"
msgid "Return arbitrary name of a file that does not exist and is in a directory where access rights allow to write to this file (useful for temporary output of files)"
msgstr "返回不存在的文件的任意名称，该文件位于访问权限允许写入该文件的目录中(用于文件的临时输出)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.temporaryFileName"
msgid "Full path name of temporary file"
msgstr "临时文件的完整路径名"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.temporaryFileName"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"fileName = Files.<strong>temporaryFileName</strong>();\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Return arbitrary name of a file that does not exist\r\n"
"and is in a directory where access rights allow to\r\n"
"write to this file (useful for temporary output of files).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The created temporary file is not automatically deleted when closed, but needs to be explicitly deleted, e.g. by <strong><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Files.removeFile\">removeFile</a></strong>(fileName).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>Warning:</strong>\r\n"
"The underlying C implementation of <strong>ModelicaInternal_temporaryFileName</strong> calls the standard C function <strong>tmpnam</strong>, which has a race condition security problem in the case another process creates a file with the same fileName just after <strong>tmpnam</strong> generated the full path name.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"fileName = Files.temporaryFileName();\r\n"
"   -> fileName is the absolute path name of the temporary file\r\n"
"Streams.print(String(System.getPid()), fileName);\r\n"
"   -> Create the temporary file\r\n"
"      Warning: Possible race condition on file access\r\n"
"Files.removeFile(fileName);\r\n"
"   -> Explicitly delete the temporary file (after use)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"fileName = Files.<strong>temporaryFileName</strong>();\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"返回不存在的文件的任意名称\r\n"
"并且位于访问权限允许的目录中\r\n"
"写入此文件(用于文件的临时输出)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"创建的临时文件在关闭时不会自动删除，但需要显式删除，例如通过<strong> <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Files.removeFile\">removeFile</a></strong>(fileName)。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<strong>警告:</strong>\r\n"
"<strong>ModelicaInternal_temporaryFileName</strong>的底层C实现调用标准C函数<strong>tmpnam</strong>，如果另一个进程在<strong>tmpnam</strong>生成完整路径名之后创建了一个具有相同fileName的文件，则存在竞争条件安全问题。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"fileName = Files.temporaryFileName();\r\n"
"   -> fileName is the absolute path name of the temporary file\r\n"
"Streams.print(String(System.getPid()), fileName);\r\n"
"   -> Create the temporary file\r\n"
"      Warning: Possible race condition on file access\r\n"
"Files.removeFile(fileName);\r\n"
"   -> Explicitly delete the temporary file (after use)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.loadResource"
msgid "Return the absolute path name of a URI or local file name"
msgstr "返回URI的绝对路径名或本地文件名"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Files.loadResource"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"fileReference = Files.<strong>loadResource</strong>(uri);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Files.<strong>loadResource</strong>(uri)</code>\" returns the\r\n"
"<strong>absolute path name</strong> of the file that is either defined by an URI or by a local\r\n"
"path name. With the returned file name it is possible to\r\n"
"access the file with function calls of the C standard library.\r\n"
"If the data or file is stored in a data-base,\r\n"
"this might require copying the resource to a temporary folder and referencing that.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The implementation of this function is tool specific. However, at least Modelica URIs\r\n"
"(see \"chapter 13.2.3 External Resources\" of the Modelica Specification),\r\n"
"as well as absolute local file path names are supported.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"file1 = loadResource(\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Data/Utilities/Examples_readRealParameters.txt\")\r\n"
"        // file1 is the absolute path name of the file\r\n"
"file2 = loadResource(\"C:\\\\data\\\\readParameters.txt\")\r\n"
"        file2 = \"C:/data/readParameters.txt\"\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"fileReference = Files.<strong>loadResource</strong>(uri);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数调用\"<code>Files.<strong>loadResource</strong>(uri)</code>\"返回文件的<strong>绝对路径名</strong>，\r\n"
"由URI或本地定义路径名。使用返回的文件名，可以使用C标准库的函数调用访问该文件。\r\n"
"如果数据或文件存储在数据库中，这可能需要将资源复制到临时文件夹并引用该文件夹。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"此功能的实现是特定于工具的。然而，至少Modelica URIs(参见Modelica规范“第13.2.3章外部资源”)，也支持绝对本地文件路径名。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"file1 = loadResource(\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Data/Utilities/Examples_readRealParameters.txt\")\r\n"
"      // file1 is the absolute path name of the file\r\n"
"file2 = loadResource(\"C:\\\\data\\\\readParameters.txt\")\r\n"
"      file2 = \"C:/data/readParameters.txt\"\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams"
msgid "Read from files and write to files"
msgstr "读取文件和写入文件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Library content</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Package <strong>Streams</strong> contains functions to input and output strings\r\n"
"to a message window or on files, as well as reading matrices from file\r\n"
"and writing matrices to file. Note that a string is interpreted\r\n"
"and displayed as html text (e.g., with print(..) or error(..))\r\n"
"if it is enclosed with the Modelica html quotation, e.g.,\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><p>\r\n"
"string = \"&lt;html&gt; first line &lt;br&gt; second line &lt;/html&gt;\".\r\n"
"</p></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"It is a quality of implementation, whether (a) all tags of html are supported\r\n"
"or only a subset, (b) how html tags are interpreted if the output device\r\n"
"does not allow to display formatted text.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In the table below an example call to every function is given:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><th><strong><em>Function/type</em></strong></th><th><strong><em>Description</em></strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.print\">print</a>(string)<br>\r\n"
"          <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.print\">print</a>(string,fileName)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> Print string \"string\" or vector of strings to message window or on\r\n"
"           file \"fileName\".</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>stringVector =\r\n"
"         <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readFile\">readFile</a>(fileName)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> Read complete text file and return it as a vector of strings.</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(string, endOfFile) =\r\n"
"         <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readLine\">readLine</a>(fileName, lineNumber)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Returns from the file the content of line lineNumber.</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>lines =\r\n"
"         <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.countLines\">countLines</a>(fileName)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Returns the number of lines in a file.</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.error\">error</a>(string)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> Print error message \"string\" to message window\r\n"
"           and cancel all actions</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.close\">close</a>(fileName)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> Close file if it is still open. Ignore call if\r\n"
"           file is already closed or does not exist. </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readMatrixSize\">readMatrixSize</a>(fileName, matrixName)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> Read dimensions of a Real matrix from a MATLAB MAT file. </td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix\">readRealMatrix</a>(fileName, matrixName, nrow, ncol)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> Read a Real matrix from a MATLAB MAT file. </td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix\">writeRealMatrix</a>(fileName, matrixName, matrix, append, format)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> Write Real matrix to a MATLAB MAT file. </td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Use functions <strong>scanXXX</strong> from package\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings\">Strings</a>\r\n"
"to parse a string.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If Real, Integer or Boolean values shall be printed\r\n"
"or used in an error message, they have to be first converted\r\n"
"to strings with the builtin operator\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://ModelicaReference.Operators.'String()'\">ModelicaReference.Operators.'String()'</a>(...).\r\n"
"Example:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>if</strong> x &lt; 0 <strong>or</strong> x &gt; 1 <strong>then</strong>\r\n"
"   Streams.error(\"x (= \" + String(x) + \") has to be in the range 0 .. 1\");\r\n"
"<strong>end if</strong>;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>库的内容</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"包<strong>Streams</strong>包含输入和输出字符串的函数\r\n"
"到消息窗口或文件上，以及从文件中读取矩阵\r\n"
"将矩阵写入文件。注意，字符串是被解释的\r\n"
"并显示为HTML文本(例如，带有print(..)或error(..))\r\n"
"如果包含Modelica html引号，例如:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><p>\r\n"
"string = \"&lt;html&gt; first line &lt;br&gt; second line &lt;/html&gt;\".\r\n"
"</p></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"是否支持html的所有标签是实现的质量问题\r\n"
"或者只是一个子集，(b)如果输出设备\r\n"
"不允许显示格式化的文本。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在下表中给出了对每个函数的调用示例:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><th><strong><em>Function/type</em></strong></th><th><strong><em>Description</em></strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.print\">print</a>(string)<br>\r\n"
"          <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.print\">print</a>(string,fileName)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> 打印字符串\"string\"或字符串向量到消息窗口或上\r\n"
"文件 \"fileName\".</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>stringVector =\r\n"
"         <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readFile\">readFile</a>(fileName)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> 读取完整的文本文件并将其作为字符串向量返回.</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(string, endOfFile) =\r\n"
"         <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readLine\">readLine</a>(fileName, lineNumber)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>从文件中返回行lineNumber的内容.</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>lines =\r\n"
"         <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.countLines\">countLines</a>(fileName)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>返回文件中的行数.</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.error\">error</a>(string)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> 将错误消息\"string\"打印到消息窗口\r\n"
"然后取消所有动作</td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.close\">close</a>(fileName)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> 关闭文件，如果它仍然是打开的。忽略，调用if\r\n"
"文件已关闭或不存在. </td>\r\n"
"  </tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readMatrixSize\">readMatrixSize</a>(fileName, matrixName)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> 从MATLAB MAT文件中读取实矩阵的维度. </td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix\">readRealMatrix</a>(fileName, matrixName, nrow, ncol)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> 从MATLAB MAT文件中读取实矩阵. </td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix\">writeRealMatrix</a>(fileName, matrixName, matrix, append, format)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> 将实矩阵写入MATLAB MAT文件. </td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"使用函数<strong>scanXXX</strong> from package\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings\">Strings</a>\r\n"
"解析字符串。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果要打印实数、整数或布尔值\r\n"
"或者在错误消息中使用时，必须首先转换它们\r\n"
"到带有内置操作符的字符串\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://ModelicaReference.Operators.'String()'\">ModelicaReference.Operators.'String()'</a>(...).\r\n"
"例子:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>if</strong> x &lt; 0 <strong>or</strong> x &gt; 1 <strong>then</strong>\r\n"
"   Streams.error(\"x (= \" + String(x) + \") has to be in the range 0 .. 1\");\r\n"
"<strong>end if</strong>;\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.print"
msgid "Print string to terminal or file"
msgstr "打印字符串到终端或文件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.print"
msgid "String to be printed"
msgstr "要打印的字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.print"
msgid "File where to print (empty string is the terminal)"
msgstr "要打印的文件(空字符串是终端)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.print"
msgid "Text files (*.txt)"
msgstr "Text files (*.txt)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.print"
msgid "Text file to store the output of print(..)"
msgstr "Text file to store the output of print(..)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.print"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Streams.<strong>print</strong>(string);\r\n"
"Streams.<strong>print</strong>(string,fileName);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>print</strong>(..) opens automatically the given file, if\r\n"
"it is not yet open. If the file does not exist, it is created.\r\n"
"If the file does exist, the given string is appended to the file.\r\n"
"If this is not desired, call \"Files.remove(fileName)\" before calling print\r\n"
"(\"remove(..)\" is silent, if the file does not exist).\r\n"
"The Modelica environment may close the file whenever appropriate.\r\n"
"This can be enforced by calling <strong>Streams.close</strong>(fileName).\r\n"
"After every call of \"print(..)\" a \"new line\" is printed automatically.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Streams.print(\"x = \" + String(x));\r\n"
"Streams.print(\"y = \" + String(y));\r\n"
"Streams.print(\"x = \" + String(y), \"mytestfile.txt\");\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams\">Streams</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.error\">Streams.error</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://ModelicaReference.Operators.'String()'\">ModelicaReference.Operators.'String()'</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Streams.<strong>print</strong>(string);\r\n"
"Streams.<strong>print</strong>(string,fileName);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>print</strong>(..)自动打开给定的文件，如果\r\n"
"它还没有开放。如果文件不存在，则创建该文件。\r\n"
"如果该文件确实存在，则将给定的字符串追加到该文件。\r\n"
"如果不希望这样做，请在调用print之前调用\"Files.remove(fileName)\"\r\n"
"(\"remove(..)\"是沉默的，如果文件不存在)。\r\n"
"Modelica环境可以在适当的时候关闭文件。\r\n"
"这可以通过调用<strong>Streams.close</strong>(fileName)来实现。\r\n"
"每次调用“print(..)”后，都会自动打印“new line”。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>例子</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Streams.print(\"x = \" + String(x));\r\n"
"Streams.print(\"y = \" + String(y));\r\n"
"Streams.print(\"x = \" + String(y), \"mytestfile.txt\");\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams\">Streams</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.error\">Streams.error</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://ModelicaReference.Operators.'String()'\">ModelicaReference.Operators.'String()'</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readFile"
msgid "Read content of a file and return it in a vector of strings"
msgstr "读取文件的内容并以字符串向量的形式返回"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readFile"
msgid "Name of the file that shall be read"
msgstr "要读取的文件的名称"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readFile"
msgid "Text files (*.txt)"
msgstr "Text files (*.txt)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readFile"
msgid "Open text file for reading"
msgstr "Open text file for reading"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readFile"
msgid "Content of file"
msgstr "文件内容"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readFile"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"stringVector = Streams.<strong>readFile</strong>(fileName)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>readFile</strong>(..) opens the given file, reads the complete\r\n"
"content, closes the file and returns the content as a vector of strings. Lines are separated by LF or CR-LF; the returned strings do not contain the line separators.\r\n"
"Note, a fileName can be defined as URI by using the helper function\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Files.loadResource\">loadResource</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"stringVector = Streams.<strong>readFile</strong>(fileName)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>readFile</strong>(..)打开给定文件，读取完整的\r\n"
"内容，关闭文件并以字符串向量的形式返回内容。行之间用LF或CR-LF分隔;返回的字符串不包含行分隔符。\r\n"
"注意，可以使用helper函数将fileName定义为URI\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Files.loadResource\">loadResource</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readLine"
msgid "Read a line of text from a file and return it in a string"
msgstr "从文件中读取一行文本并以字符串形式返回"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readLine"
msgid "Name of the file that shall be read"
msgstr "要读取的文件的名称"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readLine"
msgid "Text files (*.txt)"
msgstr "Text files (*.txt)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readLine"
msgid "Open text file for reading"
msgstr "Open text file for reading"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readLine"
msgid "Number of line to read"
msgstr "要读取的行数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readLine"
msgid "Line of text"
msgstr "文本行"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readLine"
msgid "If true, end-of-file was reached when trying to read line"
msgstr "如果为true，则在尝试读取行时到达文件结束"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readLine"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(string, endOfFile) = Streams.<strong>readLine</strong>(fileName, lineNumber)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>readLine</strong>(..) opens the given file, reads enough of the\r\n"
"content to get the requested line, and returns the line as a string.\r\n"
"Lines are separated by LF or CR-LF; the returned string does not\r\n"
"contain the line separator. The file might remain open after\r\n"
"the call.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If lineNumber > countLines(fileName), an empty string is returned\r\n"
"and endOfFile=true. Otherwise endOfFile=false.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"(string, endOfFile) = Streams.<strong>readLine</strong>(fileName, lineNumber)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>readLine</strong>(..)打开给定文件，读取足够的\r\n"
"内容来获取所请求的行，并将该行作为字符串返回。\r\n"
"行之间用LF或CR-LF分隔;返回的字符串不会\r\n"
"包含行分隔符。之后文件可能保持打开状态\r\n"
"调用。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果 lineNumber > countLines(fileName)，则返回空字符串，endOfFile=true。\r\n"
"则返回空字符串，endOfFile=true。否则，endOfFile=false。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.countLines"
msgid "Return the number of lines in a file"
msgstr "返回文件中的行数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.countLines"
msgid "Name of the file that shall be read"
msgstr "要读取的文件的名称"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.countLines"
msgid "Text files (*.txt)"
msgstr "Text files (*.txt)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.countLines"
msgid "Open text file for counting lines"
msgstr "Open text file for counting lines"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.countLines"
msgid "Number of lines in file"
msgstr "文件中的行数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.countLines"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"numberOfLines = Streams.<strong>countLines</strong>(fileName)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>countLines</strong>(..) opens the given file, reads the complete\r\n"
"content, closes the file and returns the number of lines. Lines are\r\n"
"separated by LF or CR-LF.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"numberOfLines = Streams.<strong>countLines</strong>(fileName)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>说明</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>countLines</strong>(...)打开给定文件，读取完整的\r\n"
"内容，关闭文件并返回行数。行以\r\n"
"以 LF 或 CR-LF 分隔。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.error"
msgid "Print error message and cancel all actions - in case of an unrecoverable error"
msgstr "打印错误信息并取消所有操作-以防出现不可恢复的错误"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.error"
msgid "String to be printed to error message window"
msgstr "要打印到错误消息窗口的字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.error"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Streams.<strong>error</strong>(string);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In case of an unrecoverable error (i.e., if the solver is unable to recover from the error),\r\n"
"print the string \"string\" as error message and cancel all actions.\r\n"
"This function is semantically equivalent with the built-in function <strong>assert</strong> if called with the (default) <strong>AssertionLevel.error</strong>.\r\n"
"Line breaks are characterized by \"\\n\" in the string.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Streams.error(\"x (= \" + String(x) + \")\\nhas to be in the range 0 .. 1\");\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams\">Streams</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.print\">Streams.print</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://ModelicaReference.Operators.'assert()'\">ModelicaReference.Operators.'assert()'</a>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://ModelicaReference.Operators.'String()'\">ModelicaReference.Operators.'String()'</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Streams.<strong>error</strong>(string);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>说明</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果出现不可恢复的错误(即，如果求解器无法从错误中恢复)，\r\n"
"打印字符串\"string\"作为错误消息并取消所有操作。\r\n"
"如果用(默认)<strong>AssertionLevel.error</strong>调用，该函数在语义上等同于内置函数<strong>assert</strong>。\r\n"
"换行符的特征是字符串中的\"\\n\"。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>例子</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Streams.error(\"x (= \" + String(x) + \")\\nhas to be in the range 0 .. 1\");\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams\">Streams</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.print\">Streams.print</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://ModelicaReference.Operators.'assert()'\">ModelicaReference.Operators.'assert()'</a>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://ModelicaReference.Operators.'String()'\">ModelicaReference.Operators.'String()'</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.close"
msgid "Close file"
msgstr "关闭文件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.close"
msgid "Name of the file that shall be closed"
msgstr "要关闭的文件名"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.close"
msgid "Text files (*.txt)"
msgstr "Text files (*.txt)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.close"
msgid "Close text file"
msgstr "Close text file"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.close"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Streams.<strong>close</strong>(fileName)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Close file if it is open. Ignore call if\r\n"
"file is already closed or does not exist.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Streams.<strong>close</strong>(fileName)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"关闭文件，如果它是打开的。忽略，调用if\r\n"
"文件已关闭或不存在。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readMatrixSize"
msgid "Read dimensions of a Real matrix from a MATLAB MAT file"
msgstr "从MATLAB MAT文件中读取实矩阵的维度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readMatrixSize"
msgid "File where external data is stored"
msgstr "存储外部数据的文件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readMatrixSize"
msgid "MATLAB MAT files (*.mat)"
msgstr "MATLAB MAT files (*.mat)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readMatrixSize"
msgid "Open MATLAB MAT file"
msgstr "Open MATLAB MAT file"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readMatrixSize"
msgid "Name / identifier of the 2D Real array on the file"
msgstr "文件中2D Real数组的名称/标识符"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readMatrixSize"
msgid "Number of rows and columns of the 2D Real array"
msgstr "2D Real数组的行数和列数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readMatrixSize"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"dim = Streams.<strong>readMatrixSize</strong>(fileName, matrixName)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>readMatrixSize</strong>(..) opens the given MATLAB MAT file\r\n"
"(in format v4, v6, v7, and if HDF is supported in the Modelica tool, also v7.3),\r\n"
"and reads the dimensions of the given Real matrix.\r\n"
"These dimensions are returned in the Integer vector dim.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"See <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.ReadRealMatrixFromFile\">Examples.ReadRealMatrixFromFile</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix\">readRealMatrix</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix\">writeRealMatrix</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"dim = Streams.<strong>readMatrixSize</strong>(fileName, matrixName)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>readMatrixSize</strong>(..)打开给定的MATLAB MAT文件\r\n"
"(格式为v4、v6、v7，如果Modelica工具也支持HDF，格式为v7.3)，\r\n"
"并读取给定实数矩阵的维数。\r\n"
"这些维度在整数向量dim中返回。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>例子</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"见 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.ReadRealMatrixFromFile\">Examples.ReadRealMatrixFromFile</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix\">readRealMatrix</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix\">writeRealMatrix</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix"
msgid "Read Real matrix from MATLAB MAT file"
msgstr "从MATLAB MAT文件中读取实矩阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix"
msgid "File where external data is stored"
msgstr "存储外部数据的文件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix"
msgid "MATLAB MAT files (*.mat)"
msgstr "MATLAB MAT files (*.mat)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix"
msgid "Open MATLAB MAT file"
msgstr "Open MATLAB MAT file"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix"
msgid "Name / identifier of the 2D Real array on the file"
msgstr "文件中2D Real数组的名称/标识符"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix"
msgid "Number of rows of the 2D Real array"
msgstr "2D Real数组的行数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix"
msgid "Number of columns of the 2D Real array"
msgstr "2D Real数组的列数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix"
msgid "= true: Print info message; = false: No info message"
msgstr "= true:打印信息消息;= false:无提示信息"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix"
msgid "2D Real array"
msgstr "二维实阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"matrix = Streams.<strong>readRealMatrix</strong>(fileName, matrixName, nrow, ncol, verboseRead)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>readRealMatrix</strong>(..) opens the given MATLAB MAT file\r\n"
"(in format v4, v6, v7, and if HDF is supported in the Modelica tool, also v7.3),\r\n"
"and reads the given matrix from this file. The dimensions of this matrix must first\r\n"
"be inquired with function\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readMatrixSize\">readMatrixSize</a>\r\n"
"and passed via arguments nrow and ncol to this function.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"See <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.ReadRealMatrixFromFile\">Examples.ReadRealMatrixFromFile</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readMatrixSize\">readMatrixSize</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix\">writeRealMatrix</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"matrix = Streams.<strong>readRealMatrix</strong>(fileName, matrixName, nrow, ncol, verboseRead)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>readRealMatrix</strong>(..)打开给定的MATLAB MAT文件\r\n"
"(格式为v4、v6、v7，如果Modelica工具也支持HDF，格式为v7.3)，\r\n"
"并从这个文件中读取给定的矩阵。这个矩阵的维数必须先\r\n"
"询问功能\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readMatrixSize\">readMatrixSize</a>\r\n"
"并通过参数nrow和ncol传递给这个函数.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>例子</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"见 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.ReadRealMatrixFromFile\">Examples.ReadRealMatrixFromFile</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readMatrixSize\">readMatrixSize</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix\">writeRealMatrix</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix"
msgid "Write Real matrix to a MATLAB MAT file"
msgstr "将实矩阵写入MATLAB MAT文件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix"
msgid "File where external data is to be stored"
msgstr "存储外部数据的文件"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix"
msgid "MATLAB MAT files (*.mat)"
msgstr "MATLAB MAT files (*.mat)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix"
msgid "Save MATLAB MAT file"
msgstr "Save MATLAB MAT file"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix"
msgid "Name / identifier of the 2D Real array on the file"
msgstr "文件中2D Real数组的名称/标识符"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix"
msgid "2D Real array"
msgstr "二维实阵"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix"
msgid "Append values to file"
msgstr "向文件追加值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix"
msgid "MATLAB MAT file version: \"4\" -> v4, \"6\" -> v6, \"7\" -> v7"
msgstr "MATLAB MAT文件版本: \"4\" -> v4, \"6\" -> v6, \"7\" -> v7"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix"
msgid "true if successful"
msgstr "成功则为真"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Streams.writeRealMatrix"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"success = Streams.<strong>writeRealMatrix</strong>(fileName, matrixName, matrix, append, format)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>writeRealMatrix</strong>(..) writes the given matrix to a new or an existing MATLAB MAT file\r\n"
"(in format v4, v6, v7, and if HDF is supported in the Modelica tool, also v7.3).\r\n"
"If <code>append = false</code> (= default), the file is newly created\r\n"
"(or an existing file is deleted and re-created).\r\n"
"If <code>append = true</code>, the matrix is included in an existing file or if the\r\n"
"file does not yet exists this flag is ignored. If the file exists and\r\n"
"<code>append = true</code>, argument format is ignored.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Parameter <strong>format</strong> defines the format in which the values are stored on file.\r\n"
"The following formats are supported:<br>&nbsp;\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><td>format = </td><td>Type of format</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>\"4\"  </td><td>MATLAB MAT version v4</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>\"6\"  </td><td>MATLAB MAT version v6</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>\"7\"  </td><td>MATLAB MAT version v7</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>\"7.3\"</td><td>MATLAB MAT version v7.3<br>\r\n"
"                      (requires HDF support in the Modelica tool)</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function returns <code>success = true</code> if the matrix was successfully written\r\n"
"to file. Otherwise, an error message is printed and the function returns with\r\n"
"<code>success = false</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"See <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.WriteRealMatrixToFile\">Examples.WriteRealMatrixToFile</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readMatrixSize\">readMatrixSize</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix\">readRealMatrix</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"success = Streams.<strong>writeRealMatrix</strong>(fileName, matrixName, matrix, append, format)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>writeRealMatrix</strong>(..)将给定的矩阵写入新的或现有的MATLAB MAT文件\r\n"
"(格式为v4、v6、v7，如果Modelica工具支持HDF，也支持v7.3)。\r\n"
"如果<code>append = false</code> (= default)，则该文件是新创建的\r\n"
"(或者删除现有文件并重新创建)。\r\n"
"如果<code>append = true</code>，则矩阵包含在现有文件中\r\n"
"文件尚不存在，此标志被忽略。如果文件存在，则\r\n"
"<code>append = true</code>，参数格式被忽略。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"参数<strong>format</strong>定义值在文件中存储的格式。\r\n"
"支持以下格式:<br>&nbsp;\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"<tr><td>format = </td><td>Type of format</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>\"4\"  </td><td>MATLAB MAT version v4</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>\"6\"  </td><td>MATLAB MAT version v6</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>\"7\"  </td><td>MATLAB MAT version v7</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr><td>\"7.3\"</td><td>MATLAB MAT version v7.3<br>\r\n"
"                    (需要Modelica工具支持HDF)</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果矩阵写入成功，函数返回<code>success = true</code>\r\n"
"文件。否则，打印一条错误消息，函数返回\r\n"
"<code>success = false</code>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>例子</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"见 <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Examples.WriteRealMatrixToFile\">Examples.WriteRealMatrixToFile</a>.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>另见</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readMatrixSize\">readMatrixSize</a>,\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Streams.readRealMatrix\">readRealMatrix</a>\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings"
msgid "Operations on strings"
msgstr "字符串操作"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Library content</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Package <strong>Strings</strong> contains functions to manipulate strings.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"In the table below an example\r\n"
"call to every function is given using the <strong>default</strong> options.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><th><strong><em>Function</em></strong></th><th><strong><em>Description</em></strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>len = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.length\">length</a>(string)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Returns length of string</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>string2 = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.substring\">substring</a>(string1,startIndex,endIndex)\r\n"
"       </td>\r\n"
"      <td>Returns a substring defined by start and end index</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>result = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.repeat\">repeat</a>(n)<br>\r\n"
" result = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.repeat\">repeat</a>(n,string)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Repeat a blank or a string n times.</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>result = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.compare\">compare</a>(string1, string2)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Compares two substrings with regards to alphabetical order</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>identical =\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.isEqual\">isEqual</a>(string1,string2)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Determine whether two strings are identical</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>result = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.count\">count</a>(string,searchString)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Count the number of occurrences of a string</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"<td>index = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.find\">find</a>(string,searchString)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Find first occurrence of a string in another string</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>index = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.findLast\">findLast</a>(string,searchString)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Find last occurrence of a string in another string</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>string2 = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.replace\">replace</a>(string,searchString,replaceString)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Replace one or all occurrences of a string</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>stringVector2 = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.sort\">sort</a>(stringVector1)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Sort vector of strings in alphabetic order</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>hash = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.hashString\">hashString</a>(string)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Create a hash value of a string</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(token, index) = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanToken\">scanToken</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Scan for a token (Real/Integer/Boolean/String/Identifier/Delimiter/NoToken)</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(number, index) = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanReal\">scanReal</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Scan for a Real constant</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(number, index) = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanInteger\">scanInteger</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Scan for an Integer constant</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(boolean, index) = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanBoolean\">scanBoolean</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Scan for a Boolean constant</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(string2, index) = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanString\">scanString</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Scan for a String constant</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(identifier, index) = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanIdentifier\">scanIdentifier</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Scan for an identifier</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(delimiter, index) = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanDelimiter\">scanDelimiter</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Scan for delimiters</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanNoToken\">scanNoToken</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Check that remaining part of string consists solely of<br>\r\n"
"          white space or line comments (\"// ...\\n\").</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.syntaxError\">syntaxError</a>(string,index,message)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> Print a \"syntax error message\" as well as a string and the<br>\r\n"
"           index at which scanning detected an error</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The functions \"compare\", \"isEqual\", \"count\", \"find\", \"findLast\", \"replace\", \"sort\"\r\n"
"have the optional\r\n"
"input argument <strong>caseSensitive</strong> with default <strong>true</strong>.\r\n"
"If <strong>false</strong>, the operation is carried out without taking\r\n"
"into account whether a character is upper or lower case.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>库内容</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"包 <strong>Strings</strong> 包含用于操作字符串的函数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"下表中给出了使用默认选项调用每个函数的示例。.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n"
"  <tr><th><strong><em>Function</em></strong></th><th><strong><em>Description</em></strong></th></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>len = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.length\">length</a>(string)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Returns length of string</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>string2 = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.substring\">substring</a>(string1,startIndex,endIndex)\r\n"
"       </td>\r\n"
"      <td>Returns a substring defined by start and end index</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>result = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.repeat\">repeat</a>(n)<br>\r\n"
" result = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.repeat\">repeat</a>(n,string)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Repeat a blank or a string n times.</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>result = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.compare\">compare</a>(string1, string2)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Compares two substrings with regards to alphabetical order</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>identical =\r\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.isEqual\">isEqual</a>(string1,string2)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Determine whether two strings are identical</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>result = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.count\">count</a>(string,searchString)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Count the number of occurrences of a string</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr>\r\n"
"<td>index = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.find\">find</a>(string,searchString)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Find first occurrence of a string in another string</td></tr>\r\n"
"<tr>\r\n"
"<td>index = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.findLast\">findLast</a>(string,searchString)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Find last occurrence of a string in another string</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>string2 = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.replace\">replace</a>(string,searchString,replaceString)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Replace one or all occurrences of a string</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>stringVector2 = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.sort\">sort</a>(stringVector1)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Sort vector of strings in alphabetic order</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>hash = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.hashString\">hashString</a>(string)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Create a hash value of a string</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(token, index) = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanToken\">scanToken</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Scan for a token (Real/Integer/Boolean/String/Identifier/Delimiter/NoToken)</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(number, index) = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanReal\">scanReal</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Scan for a Real constant</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(number, index) = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanInteger\">scanInteger</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Scan for an Integer constant</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(boolean, index) = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanBoolean\">scanBoolean</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Scan for a Boolean constant</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(string2, index) = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanString\">scanString</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Scan for a String constant</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(identifier, index) = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanIdentifier\">scanIdentifier</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Scan for an identifier</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td>(delimiter, index) = <a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanDelimiter\">scanDelimiter</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Scan for delimiters</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.scanNoToken\">scanNoToken</a>(string,startIndex)</td>\r\n"
"      <td>Check that remaining part of string consists solely of<br>\r\n"
"          white space or line comments (\"// ...\\n\").</td></tr>\r\n"
"  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Utilities.Strings.syntaxError\">syntaxError</a>(string,index,message)</td>\r\n"
"      <td> Print a \"syntax error message\" as well as a string and the<br>\r\n"
"           index at which scanning detected an error</td></tr>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The functions \"compare\", \"isEqual\", \"count\", \"find\", \"findLast\", \"replace\", \"sort\"\r\n"
"have the optional\r\n"
"input argument <strong>caseSensitive</strong> with default <strong>true</strong>.\r\n"
"If <strong>false</strong>, the operation is carried out without taking\r\n"
"into account whether a character is upper or lower case.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.length"
msgid "Return length of string"
msgstr "返回字符串长度"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.length"
msgid "Number of characters of string"
msgstr "字符串的字符数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.length"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>length</strong>(string);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Returns the number of characters of \"string\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>length</strong>(string);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"返回\"string\"的字符数。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.substring"
msgid "Return a substring defined by start and end index"
msgstr "返回由开始和结束索引定义的子字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.substring"
msgid "String from which a substring is inquired"
msgstr "从其中查询子字符串的字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.substring"
msgid "Character position of substring begin (index=1 is first character in string)"
msgstr "子字符串的字符位置begin (index=1是字符串中的第一个字符)"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.substring"
msgid "Character position of substring end"
msgstr "子字符串结束的字符位置"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.substring"
msgid "String containing substring string[startIndex:endIndex]"
msgstr "包含子字符串的字符串[startIndex:endIndex]"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.substring"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"string2 = Strings.<strong>substring</strong>(string, startIndex, endIndex);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This function returns\r\n"
"the substring from position startIndex\r\n"
"up to and including position endIndex of \"string\" .\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"If index, startIndex, or endIndex are not correct, e.g.,\r\n"
"if endIndex &gt; length(string), an assert is triggered.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"string1 := \"This is line 111\";\r\n"
"string2 := Strings.substring(string1,9,12); // string2 = \"line\"\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"string2 = Strings.<strong>substring</strong>(string, startIndex, endIndex);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个函数返回\r\n"
"从位置startIndex的子字符串\r\n"
"到并包括位置endIndex \"string\" .\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果index、startIndex或endIndex不正确，例如:\r\n"
"if endIndex &gt;长度(字符串)，触发一个断言。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>例子</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"string1 := \"This is line 111\";\r\n"
"string2 := Strings.substring(string1,9,12); // string2 = \"line\"\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.repeat"
msgid "Repeat a string n times"
msgstr "重复一个字符串n次"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.repeat"
msgid "Number of occurrences"
msgstr "出现次数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.repeat"
msgid "String that is repeated"
msgstr "重复的字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.repeat"
msgid "String containing n concatenated strings"
msgstr "包含n个连接字符串的字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.repeat"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"string2 = Strings.<strong>repeat</strong>(n);\r\n"
"string2 = Strings.<strong>repeat</strong>(n, string=\" \");\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The first form returns a string consisting of n blanks.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The second form returns a string consisting of n substrings\r\n"
"defined by the optional argument \"string\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"string2 = Strings.<strong>repeat</strong>(n);\r\n"
"string2 = Strings.<strong>repeat</strong>(n, string=\" \");\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"第一种形式返回一个由n个空格组成的字符串。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"第二种形式返回一个由n个子字符串组成的字符串\r\n"
"由可选参数\"string\"定义.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.compare"
msgid "Compare two strings lexicographically"
msgstr "按字典顺序比较两个字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.compare"
msgid "= false, if case of letters is ignored"
msgstr "= False，如果忽略字母大小写"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.compare"
msgid "Result of comparison"
msgstr "比较结果"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.compare"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"result = Strings.<strong>compare</strong>(string1, string2);\r\n"
"result = Strings.<strong>compare</strong>(string1, string2, caseSensitive=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Compares two strings. If the optional argument caseSensitive=false,\r\n"
"upper case letters are treated as if they would be lower case letters.\r\n"
"The result of the comparison is returned as:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"result = Modelica.Utilities.Types.Compare.Less     // string1 &lt; string2\r\n"
"       = Modelica.Utilities.Types.Compare.Equal    // string1 = string2\r\n"
"       = Modelica.Utilities.Types.Compare.Greater  // string1 &gt; string2\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Comparison is with regards to lexicographical order,\r\n"
"e.g., \"a\" &lt; \"b\";\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"result = Strings.<strong>compare</strong>(string1, string2);\r\n"
"result = Strings.<strong>compare</strong>(string1, string2, caseSensitive=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"比较两个字符串。如果可选参数casessensitive =false，\r\n"
"大写字母将被视为小写字母。\r\n"
"比较的结果返回为:\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"result = Modelica.Utilities.Types.Compare.Less     // string1 &lt; string2\r\n"
"     = Modelica.Utilities.Types.Compare.Equal    // string1 = string2\r\n"
"     = Modelica.Utilities.Types.Compare.Greater  // string1 &gt; string2\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"比较是关于字典顺序的,\r\n"
"e.g., \"a\" &lt; \"b\";\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.isEqual"
msgid "Determine whether two strings are identical"
msgstr "确定两个字符串是否相同"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.isEqual"
msgid "= false, if lower and upper case are ignored for the comparison"
msgstr "= 如果在比较中忽略小写和大写，则为False"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.isEqual"
msgid "True, if string1 is identical to string2"
msgstr "如果string1与string2相同，则为True"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.isEqual"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>isEqual</strong>(string1, string2);\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>isEqual</strong>(string1, string2, caseSensitive=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Compare whether two strings are identical,\r\n"
"optionally ignoring case.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>isEqual</strong>(string1, string2);\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>isEqual</strong>(string1, string2, caseSensitive=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"比较两个字符串是否相同，\r\n"
"可选忽略大小写.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.isEmpty"
msgid "Return true if a string is empty (has only white space characters)"
msgstr "如果字符串为空(只有空白字符)则返回true"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.isEmpty"
msgid "True, if string is empty"
msgstr "True，如果字符串为空"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.isEmpty"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>isEmpty</strong>(string);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Returns true if the string has no characters or if the string consists\r\n"
"only of white space characters. Otherwise, false is returned.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"isEmpty(\"\");       // returns true\r\n"
"isEmpty(\"   \");    // returns true\r\n"
"isEmpty(\"  abc\");  // returns false\r\n"
"isEmpty(\"a\");      // returns false\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>isEmpty</strong>(string);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果字符串没有字符，或者字符串包含字符，则返回true\r\n"
"只有空白字符。否则，返回false。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>例子</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"isEmpty(\"\");       // returns true\r\n"
"isEmpty(\"   \");    // returns true\r\n"
"isEmpty(\"  abc\");  // returns false\r\n"
"isEmpty(\"a\");      // returns false\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.count"
msgid "Count the number of non-overlapping occurrences of a string"
msgstr "计算字符串不重叠出现的次数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.count"
msgid "String that is analyzed"
msgstr "被分析的字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.count"
msgid "String that is searched for in string"
msgstr "在String中搜索的字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.count"
msgid "Start search at index startIndex"
msgstr "从索引startIndex开始搜索"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.count"
msgid "= false, if lower and upper case are ignored for count"
msgstr "= False，如果计数忽略小写和大写"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.count"
msgid "Number of occurrences of 'searchString' in 'string'"
msgstr "'searchString'在'string'中出现的次数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.count"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>count</strong>(string, searchString)\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>count</strong>(string, searchString, startIndex=1,\r\n"
"                     caseSensitive=true)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Returns the number of non-overlapping occurrences of string \"searchString\"\r\n"
"in \"string\". The search is started at index \"startIndex\" (default = 1).\r\n"
"If the optional argument \"caseSensitive\" is false,\r\n"
"for the counting it does not matter whether a letter is upper\r\n"
"or lower case.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>count</strong>(string, searchString)\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>count</strong>(string, searchString, startIndex=1,\r\n"
"                   caseSensitive=true)\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"返回字符串\"searchString\"不重叠出现的次数。\r\n"
"在\"string\"。搜索从索引\"startIndex\"(默认值= 1)开始。\r\n"
"如果可选参数\"caseSensitive\"为false，\r\n"
"对于计数来说，字母是否在上方并不重要\r\n"
"或者小写。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.find"
msgid "Find first occurrence of a string within another string"
msgstr "查找一个字符串在另一个字符串中的第一次出现"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.find"
msgid "String that is analyzed"
msgstr "被分析的字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.find"
msgid "String that is searched for in string"
msgstr "在String中搜索的字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.find"
msgid "Start search at index startIndex"
msgstr "从索引startIndex开始搜索"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.find"
msgid "= false, if lower and upper case are ignored for the search"
msgstr "= False，如果在搜索中忽略小写和大写"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.find"
msgid "Index of the beginning of the first occurrence of 'searchString' within 'string', or zero if not present"
msgstr "'searchString'在'string'中第一次出现的开头的索引，如果不存在则为零"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.find"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"index = Strings.<strong>find</strong>(string, searchString);\r\n"
"index = Strings.<strong>find</strong>(string, searchString, startIndex=1,\r\n"
"                     caseSensitive=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Finds first occurrence of \"searchString\" within \"string\"\r\n"
"and return the corresponding index.\r\n"
"Start search at index \"startIndex\" (default = 1).\r\n"
"If the optional argument \"caseSensitive\" is false, lower\r\n"
"and upper case are ignored for the search.\r\n"
"If \"searchString\" is not found, a value of \"0\" is returned.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"index = Strings.<strong>find</strong>(string, searchString);\r\n"
"index = Strings.<strong>find</strong>(string, searchString, startIndex=1,\r\n"
"                   caseSensitive=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"查找\"string\"中第一个出现的\"searchString\"\r\n"
"并返回相应的索引。\r\n"
"从索引\"startIndex\"开始搜索(默认值= 1)。\r\n"
"如果可选参数\"caseSensitive\"为false，则降低\r\n"
"和大写字母在搜索中被忽略。\r\n"
"如果没有找到\"searchString\"，则返回值\"0\"。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.findLast"
msgid "Find last occurrence of a string within another string"
msgstr "查找一个字符串在另一个字符串中的最后一次出现"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.findLast"
msgid "String that is analyzed"
msgstr "被分析的字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.findLast"
msgid "String that is searched for in string"
msgstr "在String中搜索的字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.findLast"
msgid "Start search at index startIndex. If startIndex = 0, start at length(string)"
msgstr "从索引startIndex开始搜索。如果startIndex = 0，从长度(字符串)开始"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.findLast"
msgid "= false, if lower and upper case are ignored for the search"
msgstr "= False，如果在搜索中忽略小写和大写"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.findLast"
msgid "Index of the beginning of the last occurrence of 'searchString' within 'string', or zero if not present"
msgstr "'searchString'最后一次出现在'string'中的开头的索引，如果不存在则为零"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.findLast"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"index = Strings.<strong>findLast</strong>(string, searchString);\r\n"
"index = Strings.<strong>findLast</strong>(string, searchString,\r\n"
"                         startIndex=length(string), caseSensitive=true,\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Finds first occurrence of \"searchString\" within \"string\"\r\n"
"when searching from the last character of \"string\"\r\n"
"backwards, and return the corresponding index.\r\n"
"Start search at index \"startIndex\" (default = 0;\r\n"
"if startIndex = 0, search starts at length(string)).\r\n"
"If the optional argument \"caseSensitive\" is false, lower\r\n"
"and upper case are ignored for the search.\r\n"
"If \"searchString\" is not found, a value of \"0\" is returned.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"index = Strings.<strong>findLast</strong>(string, searchString);\r\n"
"index = Strings.<strong>findLast</strong>(string, searchString,\r\n"
"                       startIndex=length(string), caseSensitive=true,\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"查找\"string\"中第一个出现的\"searchString\"\r\n"
"当从\"string\"的最后一个字符开始搜索时\r\n"
"向后，并返回相应的索引。\r\n"
"开始搜索索引\"startIndex\"(默认= 0;\r\n"
"如果startIndex = 0，则从长度(字符串)开始搜索。\r\n"
"如果可选参数\"caseSensitive\"为false，则降低\r\n"
"和大写字母在搜索中被忽略。\r\n"
"如果没有找到\"searchString\"，则返回值\"0\"。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.replace"
msgid "Replace non-overlapping occurrences of a string from left to right"
msgstr "从左到右替换不重叠的字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.replace"
msgid "String to be modified"
msgstr "要修改的字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.replace"
msgid "Replace non-overlapping occurrences of 'searchString' in 'string' with 'replaceString'"
msgstr "用'replaceString'替换'string'中不重叠的'searchString'"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.replace"
msgid "String that replaces 'searchString' in 'string'"
msgstr "替换' String'中的'searchString'的字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.replace"
msgid "Start search at index startIndex"
msgstr "Start search at index startIndex"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.replace"
msgid "= false, if only the first occurrence is replaced, otherwise all occurrences"
msgstr "= False，如果只替换第一个出现项，否则替换所有出现项"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.replace"
msgid "= false, if lower and upper case are ignored when searching for searchString"
msgstr "= false，如果在搜索searchString时忽略小写和大写"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.replace"
msgid "Resultant string of replacement operation"
msgstr "替换操作的结果字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.replace"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>replace</strong>(string, searchString, replaceString);\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>replace</strong>(string, searchString, replaceString,\r\n"
"                startIndex=1, replaceAll=true, caseSensitive=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Search in \"string\" for \"searchString\" and replace the found\r\n"
"substring by \"replaceString\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> The search starts at the first character of \"string\",\r\n"
"     or at character position \"startIndex\",\r\n"
"     if this optional argument is provided.</li>\r\n"
"<li> If the optional argument \"replaceAll\" is <strong>true</strong> (default),\r\n"
"     all occurrences of \"searchString\" are replaced.\r\n"
"     If the argument is <strong>false</strong>, only the first occurrence\r\n"
"     is replaced.</li>\r\n"
"<li> The search for \"searchString\" distinguishes upper and lower\r\n"
"     case letters. If the optional argument \"caseSensitive\" is\r\n"
"     <strong>false</strong>,\r\n"
"     the search ignores whether letters are upper\r\n"
"     or lower case.</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function returns the \"string\" with the\r\n"
"performed replacements.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>replace</strong>(string, searchString, replaceString);\r\n"
"Strings.<strong>replace</strong>(string, searchString, replaceString,\r\n"
"              startIndex=1, replaceAll=true, caseSensitive=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"在\"string\"中搜索\"searchString\"并替换找到的\r\n"
"子字符串由\"replaceString\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<ul>\r\n"
"<li> 搜索从\"string\"的第一个字符开始，\r\n"
"或在字符位置\"startIndex\"，\r\n"
"如果提供了此可选参数。</li>\r\n"
"<li> I如果可选参数\"replaceAll\"为<strong>true</strong>(默认值)，\r\n"
"所有出现的\"searchString\"都会被替换。\r\n"
"如果参数为<strong>false</strong>，只出现第一次\r\n"
"被替换。</li>\r\n"
"<li> 搜索\"searchString\"区分大小写\r\n"
"信件。如果可选参数\"caseSensitive\"为\r\n"
"<strong>false</strong>,\r\n"
"搜索忽略字母是否大写\r\n"
"或者小写。</li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数返回\"string\"和\r\n"
"进行更换。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.sort"
msgid "Sort vector of strings in alphabetic order"
msgstr "按字母顺序排序字符串向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.sort"
msgid "Vector of strings"
msgstr "字符串向量"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.sort"
msgid "= false, if lower and upper case are ignored when comparing elements of stringVector1"
msgstr "= false，如果在比较stringVector1的元素时忽略小写和大写"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.sort"
msgid "stringVector1 sorted in alphabetical order"
msgstr "按字母顺序排序的stringVector1"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.sort"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"stringVector2 = Streams.<strong>sort</strong>(stringVector1);\r\n"
"stringVector2 = Streams.<strong>sort</strong>(stringVector1, caseSensitive=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Function <strong>sort</strong>(..) sorts a string vector stringVector1\r\n"
"in lexicographical order and returns the result in stringVector2.\r\n"
"If the optional argument \"caseSensitive\" is <strong>false</strong>, lower\r\n"
"and upper case letters are not distinguished.\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"s1 = {\"force\", \"angle\", \"pressure\"};\r\n"
"s2 = Strings.sort(s1);\r\n"
"     -> s2 = {\"angle\", \"force\", \"pressure\"};\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"stringVector2 = Streams.<strong>sort</strong>(stringVector1);\r\n"
"stringVector2 = Streams.<strong>sort</strong>(stringVector1, caseSensitive=true);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"函数<strong>sort</strong>(…)对字符串向量stringVector1进行排序\r\n"
"按字典顺序排列，并以stringVector2的形式返回结果。\r\n"
"如果可选参数\"caseSensitive\"为<strong>false</strong>，则降低\r\n"
"大写字母不区分。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>例子</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"s1 = {\"force\", \"angle\", \"pressure\"};\r\n"
"s2 = Strings.sort(s1);\r\n"
"   -> s2 = {\"angle\", \"force\", \"pressure\"};\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.hashString"
msgid "Create a hash value of a string"
msgstr "创建字符串的散列值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.hashString"
msgid "The string to create a hash from"
msgstr "要从中创建散列的字符串"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.hashString"
msgid "The hash value of string"
msgstr "字符串的哈希值"

msgctxt "Modelica.Utilities.Strings.hashString"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"hash = Strings.<strong>hashString</strong>(string);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"Returns an Integer hash value of the provided string\r\n"
"(the hash can be any Integer, including zero or a negative number).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"hashString(\"this is a test\")     // =  1827717433\r\n"
"hashString(\"Controller.noise1\")  // = -1025762750\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"hash = Strings.<strong>hashString</strong>(string);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"返回所提供字符串的整数散列值\r\n"
"(哈希可以是任何整数，包括零或负数).\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>例子</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"hashString(\"this is a test\")     // =  1827717433\r\n"
"hashString(\"Controller.noise1\")  // = -1025762750\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

