msgctxt "Modelica.Units.NonSI"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"This package provides predefined types, such as <strong>Angle_deg</strong> (angle in\r\n"
"degree), <strong>AngularVelocity_rpm</strong> (angular velocity in revolutions per\r\n"
"minute) or <strong>Temperature_degF</strong> (temperature in degree Fahrenheit),\r\n"
"which are in common use but are not part of the international standard on\r\n"
"units according to ISO 31-1992 \"General principles concerning quantities,\r\n"
"units and symbols\" and ISO 1000-1992 \"SI units and recommendations for\r\n"
"the use of their multiples and of certain other units\".</p>\r\n"
"<p>If possible, the types in this package should not be used. Use instead\r\n"
"types of package <code>Modelica.Units.SI</code>. For more information on units, see also\r\n"
"the book of Francois Cardarelli <strong>Scientific Unit Conversion - A\r\n"
"Practical Guide to Metrication</strong> (Springer 1997).</p>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个软件包提供了预定义的类型，比如 <strong>Angle_deg</strong>（角度，单位为度）、\r\n"
"<strong>AngularVelocity_rpm</strong>（角速度，单位为每分钟转数）或 \r\n"
"<strong>Temperature_degF</strong>（温度，单位为华氏度），\r\n"
"这些类型在日常使用中很常见，但它们并不属于国际标准 ISO 31-1992\"有关数量、单位和符号的一般原则\"\r\n"
"和 \"ISO 1000-1992《国际单位制及其倍数使用的建议》中规定的单位\"。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"如果可能的话，不应该使用这个软件包中的类型。\r\n"
"相反，应该使用 <code>Modelica.Units.SI</code> 软件包中的类型。\r\n"
"关于单位的更多信息，可以参考 Francois Cardarelli 的著作\r\n"
"<strong>Scientific Unit Conversion - A\r\n"
"Practical Guide to Metrication</strong>（Springer, 1997年版）。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Units.Conversions"
msgid "Conversion functions to/from non SI units and type definitions of non SI units"
msgstr "非SI单位的转换函数及非SI单位的类型定义"

msgctxt "Modelica.Units.Conversions"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<p>This package provides conversion functions from the non SI Units\r\n"
"defined in package <code>Modelica.Units.NonSI</code> to the\r\n"
"corresponding SI Units defined in package <code>Modelica.Units.SI</code> and vice\r\n"
"versa. It is recommended to use these functions in the following\r\n"
"way (note, that all functions have one Real input and one Real output\r\n"
"argument):</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>import</strong> Modelica.Units.SI;\r\n"
"<strong>import</strong> Modelica.Units.Conversions.{from_degC, from_deg, from_rpm};\r\n"
"   ...\r\n"
"<strong>parameter</strong> SI.Temperature     T   = from_degC(25);   // convert 25 degree Celsius to kelvin\r\n"
"<strong>parameter</strong> SI.Angle           phi = from_deg(180);   // convert 180 degree to radian\r\n"
"<strong>parameter</strong> SI.AngularVelocity w   = from_rpm(3600);  // convert 3600 revolutions per minutes\r\n"
"                                                   // to radian per seconds\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"这个包提供了从定义在<code>Modelica.Units.NonSI</code>中的非SI单位转换到定义在<code>Modelica.Units.SI</code>中相应的SI单位，\r\n"
"以及反向转换的函数。建议以以下方式使用这些函数(注意，所有函数都有一个实数输入和一个实数输出参数)：\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"<strong>import</strong> Modelica.Units.SI;\r\n"
"<strong>import</strong> Modelica.Units.Conversions.{from_degC, from_deg, from_rpm};\r\n"
" ...\r\n"
"<strong>parameter</strong> SI.Temperature     T   = from_degC(25);   // convert 25 degree Celsius to kelvin\r\n"
"<strong>parameter</strong> SI.Angle           phi = from_deg(180);   // convert 180 degree to radian\r\n"
"<strong>parameter</strong> SI.AngularVelocity w   = from_rpm(3600);  // convert 3600 revolutions per minutes\r\n"
"                                                    // to radian per seconds\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"</html>"

msgctxt "Modelica.Units.Conversions.to_unit1"
msgid "Change the unit of a Real number to unit=\"1\""
msgstr "将实数的单位改为unit = \"1\""

msgctxt "Modelica.Units.Conversions.to_unit1"
msgid "Real number"
msgstr "实数"

msgctxt "Modelica.Units.Conversions.to_unit1"
msgid "Real number r with unit=\"1\""
msgstr "单位为\"1\"的实数r"

msgctxt "Modelica.Units.Conversions.to_unit1"
msgid "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>Syntax</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Modelica.Units.Conversions.<strong>to_unit1</strong>(r);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"The function call \"<code>Conversions.<strong>to_unit1</strong>(r)</code>\" returns r with unit=\"1\".\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Modelica.Units.SI.Velocity v = {3,2,1};\r\n"
"Real direction[3](unit=\"1\") = to_unit1(v);   // Automatically vectorized call of to_unit1\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"
msgstr "<html>\r\n"
"<h4>语法</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Modelica.Units.Conversions.<strong>to_unit1</strong>(r);\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"<h4>描述</h4>\r\n"
"<p>\r\n"
"调用函数\"<code>Conversions.<strong>to_unit1</strong>(r)</code>\"返回单位为\"1\"的r。\r\n"
"</p>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\r\n"
"Modelica.Units.SI.Velocity v = {3,2,1};\r\n"
"Real direction[3](unit=\"1\") = to_unit1(v);   // Automatically vectorized call of to_unit1\r\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\r\n"
"</html>"

